ITEM_DILUTED_POTION_OF_BEAR_S_ENDURANCE_DESC|Ein duenner erdiger Trank. Gewaehert +2 Konstitution fuer ca. 240 Runden.
ITEM_POTION_OF_FOX_S_CUNNING_NAME|Fuchsschlauheitstrank
ITEM_POTION_OF_FOX_S_CUNNING_DESC|Ein strahlend kupferner Trank. Gewaehrt +4 Intelligenz fuer ca. 60 Runden.
