ITEM_DILUTED_POTION_OF_FOX_S_CUNNING_DESC|Ein duenner kupferner Trank. Gewaehrt +2 Intelligenz fuer ca. 240 Runden.
ITEM_POTION_OF_OWL_S_WISDOM_NAME|Eulensinnstrank
ITEM_POTION_OF_OWL_S_WISDOM_DESC|Ein kuehler violetter Trank. Gewaehert +4 Weisheit fuer ca. 60 Runden.
ITEM_CONCENTRATED_POTION_OF_OWL_S_WISDOM_NAME|Konzentrierter Eulensinnstrank
ITEM_CONCENTRATED_POTION_OF_OWL_S_WISDOM_DESC|Ein dichter violetter Trank. Gewaehert +6 Weisheit fuer ca. 20 Runden.
