CLASS_FEATURE_APPRENTICE_WIZARD_NAME|Zauberlehrling
CLASS_FEATURE_APPRENTICE_WIZARD_SUMMARY|MP regeneriert schneller. Generalisten erhalten +1 Zaubertrick und +1 Startzauber; Spezialisten erhalten School Mastery 1.
CLASS_FEATURE_APPRENTICE_WIZARD_SHORT_SUMMARY|Schnellere MP-Regeneration; Generalist Extrazauber; Spezialist School Mastery 1.
CLASS_FEATURE_APPRENTICE_WIZARD_GENERALIST_SUMMARY|MP regeneriert schneller. Erhalte +1 Zaubertrick-Auswahl und +1 Startzauber.
CLASS_FEATURE_APPRENTICE_WIZARD_GENERALIST_SHORT_SUMMARY|Schnellere MP-Regeneration; +1 Zaubertrick-Auswahl; +1 Startzauber.
CLASS_FEATURE_APPRENTICE_WIZARD_SPECIALIST_SUMMARY|MP regeneriert schneller. Erhalte School Mastery 1 in deiner gewählten Schule.
CLASS_FEATURE_APPRENTICE_WIZARD_SPECIALIST_SHORT_SUMMARY|Schnellere MP-Regeneration; School Mastery 1.
CLASS_FEATURE_ADEPT_WIZARD_NAME|Adeptenmagier
CLASS_FEATURE_ADEPT_WIZARD_SUMMARY|Generalisten senken arkane Zauberkosten um 1 MP. Spezialisten erhalten School Mastery 2 und Schule -1 MP.
CLASS_FEATURE_ADEPT_WIZARD_SHORT_SUMMARY|Generalist arkane -1 MP; Spezialist School Mastery 2.
CLASS_FEATURE_ADEPT_WIZARD_GENERALIST_SUMMARY|Arkane Zauber kosten 1 MP weniger.
CLASS_FEATURE_ADEPT_WIZARD_GENERALIST_SHORT_SUMMARY|Arkane -1 MP.
CLASS_FEATURE_ADEPT_WIZARD_SPECIALIST_SUMMARY|Erhalte School Mastery 2. Zauber der gewählten Schule kosten 1 MP weniger.
CLASS_FEATURE_ADEPT_WIZARD_SPECIALIST_SHORT_SUMMARY|School Mastery 2; Schule -1 MP.
CLASS_FEATURE_GRAND_WIZARD_PATH_NAME|Großmagier
CLASS_FEATURE_GRAND_WIZARD_PATH_SUMMARY|MP-Regeneration verbessert sich erneut. Generalisten erhalten +1 arcane attack/DC; Spezialisten erhalten School Mastery 3 und Schule -2 MP.
CLASS_FEATURE_GRAND_WIZARD_PATH_SHORT_SUMMARY|Zweiter MP-Regenerationsschub; Generalist +1 attack/DC; Spezialist School Mastery 3.
CLASS_FEATURE_GRAND_WIZARD_PATH_GENERALIST_SUMMARY|MP-Regeneration verbessert sich erneut. Arkane Zauberangriffe und save DCs erhalten +1.
CLASS_FEATURE_GRAND_WIZARD_PATH_GENERALIST_SHORT_SUMMARY|MP-Regenerationsschub; arkane +1 attack/DC.
CLASS_FEATURE_GRAND_WIZARD_PATH_SPECIALIST_SUMMARY|MP-Regeneration verbessert sich erneut. Erhalte School Mastery 3. Zauber der gewählten Schule kosten 2 MP weniger.
CLASS_FEATURE_GRAND_WIZARD_PATH_SPECIALIST_SHORT_SUMMARY|MP-Regenerationsschub; School Mastery 3; Schule -2 MP.
CLASS_FEATURE_WIZARD_ARCHMAGE_NAME|Erzmagier
CLASS_FEATURE_WIZARD_ARCHMAGE_SUMMARY|Generalisten erreichen arkane -2 MP und +2 attack/DC. Spezialisten erhalten School Mastery 4 und Schule -3 MP.
CLASS_FEATURE_WIZARD_ARCHMAGE_SHORT_SUMMARY|Generalist arkane -2 MP und +2 attack/DC; Spezialist School Mastery 4.
CLASS_FEATURE_WIZARD_ARCHMAGE_GENERALIST_SUMMARY|Arkane Zauber kosten 2 MP weniger und erhalten +2 attack/DC.
CLASS_FEATURE_WIZARD_ARCHMAGE_GENERALIST_SHORT_SUMMARY|Arkane -2 MP; +2 attack/DC.
CLASS_FEATURE_WIZARD_ARCHMAGE_SPECIALIST_SUMMARY|Erhalte School Mastery 4. Zauber der gewählten Schule kosten 3 MP weniger.
CLASS_FEATURE_WIZARD_ARCHMAGE_SPECIALIST_SHORT_SUMMARY|School Mastery 4; Schule -3 MP.
UI_STATUS_LOCATION_HAVENFORD_MINES|[HM{0:%d}]
CATALOG_LOCATION_HAVENFORD_MINES_SUMMARY|Havenford Mines is a small worked mine in the mountains east of Havenford.
CATALOG_LOCATION_HAVENFORD_MINES_DETAIL|Its timbered rooms and stone corridors are blocked by boulders and occupied by kobolds, rats, and cave vermin.
CATALOG_LOCATION_HAVENFORD_MINES_ENEMIES|kobolds, giant rats, cave spiders
STORY_MSG_QUEST_UPDATE_RETURN_BRANNOC|Quest updated: return to Brannoc in Havenford.
DIALOGUE_BRANNOC_HAVENFORD_START|The Havenford mine is in the eastern mountains. Break the huge boulders on the lower levels so ore can move again. Kobolds are in there, so bring a weapon.
DIALOGUE_BRANNOC_HAVENFORD_REMINDER|Havenford Mines, east of town. Break the huge boulders around the lower stairs so ore can move again.
DIALOGUE_BRANNOC_HAVENFORD_TURNIN|That is Havenford stone, all right. Good work. The way is open again.
DIALOGUE_BRANNOC_HAVENFORD_REWARD|Thanks. Here, take this for your trouble.
DIALOGUE_BRANNOC_HAVENFORD_DONE|Forge is open. If you need gear, say so.
QUEST_LOG_HAVENFORD_MINES_RETURN_TITLE|Havenford Mines
QUEST_LOG_HAVENFORD_MINES_RETURN_OBJECTIVE|Return to Brannoc in Havenford.
QUEST_LOG_HAVENFORD_MINES_RETURN_DETAIL|The huge boulders are broken. Brannoc can reopen the ore route and improve his forge stock.
QUEST_LOG_HAVENFORD_MINES_TITLE|Havenford Mines
QUEST_LOG_HAVENFORD_MINES_OBJECTIVE|Break the huge boulders in Havenford Mines.
QUEST_LOG_HAVENFORD_MINES_DETAIL|Brannoc needs the lower mine stairs opened so ore carts can move again. Havenford Mines lies in the mountains east of Havenford.
ZONE_HAVENFORD_MINES_NAME|Havenford Mines
WORLD_POI_HAVENFORD_MINES_NAME|Havenford Mines
