CLASS_ACTION_COMPANION_CALL_NAME|Companion Call
CLASS_ACTION_COMPANION_CALL_SUMMARY|Summon or dismiss your bonded animal companion. Dismissal takes 1 minute to recover from; defeat takes 20 minutes.
CLASS_ACTION_COMPANION_CALL_SHORT_SUMMARY|Summon or dismiss your bonded animal companion.
