ABILITY_SUMMON_INSECTS_NAME|Summon Insects
ABILITY_SUMMON_INSECTS_SUMMARY|Summons a stinging insect swarm around one target for 4 rounds. The swarm deals 1 + half WIS damage each round and gives the target -1 ATK and -1 DEF while it lasts. There is no saving throw.
ABILITY_SUMMON_INSECTS_SHORT_SUMMARY|4 rounds; no save.
CLASS_FEATURE_BLOOD_SEAL_NAME|Blood Seal
CLASS_FEATURE_BLOOD_SEAL_SUMMARY|Lethal damage leaves you at 1 HP. Each HP prevented costs 2 MP, a 3:1 total resource loss. Arcane MP spent restores 1 HP per 10 MP.
CLASS_FEATURE_BLOOD_SEAL_SHORT_SUMMARY|Each lethal HP prevented costs 2 MP (3:1 total loss); arcane MP spent restores HP.
CLASS_FEATURE_SEAL_WARD_NAME|Seal Ward
CLASS_FEATURE_SEAL_WARD_SUMMARY|Gain +1 ARM per 3 current MP.
CLASS_FEATURE_SEAL_WARD_SHORT_SUMMARY|Gain +1 ARM per 3 current MP.
CLASS_FEATURE_MANA_RECLAMATION_NAME|Mana Reclamation
CLASS_FEATURE_MANA_RECLAMATION_SUMMARY|Kills have a 50% chance to restore MP based on enemy level.
CLASS_FEATURE_MANA_RECLAMATION_SHORT_SUMMARY|Kills can restore MP based on enemy level.
CLASS_FEATURE_ARCANE_PRESSURE_NAME|Arcane Pressure
CLASS_FEATURE_ARCANE_PRESSURE_SUMMARY|Every 25 current MP gives arcane spells +1 attack, +1 DC, and +1 damage per die.
CLASS_FEATURE_ARCANE_PRESSURE_SHORT_SUMMARY|High MP makes arcane spells stronger.
CLASS_FEATURE_THAUMIC_ABSORPTION_NAME|Thaumic Absorption
CLASS_FEATURE_THAUMIC_ABSORPTION_SUMMARY|Absorb 20% of incoming magic or elemental damage as MP.
CLASS_FEATURE_THAUMIC_ABSORPTION_SHORT_SUMMARY|Convert part of incoming magic or elemental damage into MP.
CLASS_FEATURE_OVERFLOWING_TOUCH_NAME|Overflowing Touch
CLASS_FEATURE_OVERFLOWING_TOUCH_SUMMARY|Picking up gear can make it magical or improve it, draining MP.
CLASS_FEATURE_OVERFLOWING_TOUCH_SHORT_SUMMARY|Picked-up gear can become magical or improve by draining MP.
CLASS_FEATURE_DEEP_SEAL_NAME|Deep Seal
CLASS_FEATURE_DEEP_SEAL_SUMMARY|Gain more maximum MP and faster MP regeneration.
CLASS_FEATURE_DEEP_SEAL_SHORT_SUMMARY|Gain max MP and faster MP regeneration.
CLASS_FEATURE_SEAL_BACKLASH_NAME|Seal Backlash
CLASS_FEATURE_SEAL_BACKLASH_SUMMARY|Melee damage taken reflects half as pure magic damage.
CLASS_FEATURE_SEAL_BACKLASH_SHORT_SUMMARY|Reflect half of melee damage taken as pure magic damage.
CLASS_FEATURE_ELDER_RESONANCE_NAME|Elder Resonance
CLASS_FEATURE_ELDER_RESONANCE_SUMMARY|Ancient, magical, extraplanar, and dragonlike foes take extra pure magic damage.
CLASS_FEATURE_ELDER_RESONANCE_SHORT_SUMMARY|Resonant foes take extra pure magic damage.
CLASS_FEATURE_PURIFIED_BLOOD_SEAL_NAME|Purified Blood Seal
CLASS_FEATURE_PURIFIED_BLOOD_SEAL_SUMMARY|Blood Seal improves to 1 MP per HP prevented, a 2:1 total resource loss.
CLASS_FEATURE_PURIFIED_BLOOD_SEAL_SHORT_SUMMARY|Blood Seal costs 1 MP per HP prevented (2:1 total loss).
CLASS_ACTION_PRIMORDIAL_BEAM_NAME|Primordial Beam
CLASS_ACTION_UNSEAL_NAME|Unseal
CLASS_ACTION_UNSEAL_SUMMARY|For 5 + LV turns, burn MP each turn for stronger arcane spells.
CLASS_ACTION_UNSEAL_SHORT_SUMMARY|Burn MP each turn to strengthen arcane spells.
CLASS_ACTION_OPEN_SEAL_NAME|Open Seal
CLASS_ACTION_OPEN_SEAL_SUMMARY|For 20 turns, arcane power and attributes rise each turn, then hunger and exhaustion strike.
CLASS_ACTION_OPEN_SEAL_SHORT_SUMMARY|Ramp attributes and spell power for 20 turns, then suffer recoil.
CLASS_ACTION_FULL_UNSEALING_NAME|Full Unsealing
CLASS_ACTION_FULL_UNSEALING_SUMMARY|For a short time, spells are free and nearby enemies take pure magic damage each turn, then severe recoil follows.
CLASS_ACTION_FULL_UNSEALING_SHORT_SUMMARY|Cast free spells while nearby foes burn, then suffer severe recoil.
