ITEM_BOW_OF_SHAKING_HANDS_UNIDENTIFIED_DESC|A compact hunting bow for arrows.
ITEM_MACE_OF_EXHAUSTION_NAME|mace of exhaustion
ITEM_MACE_OF_EXHAUSTION_DESC|A cursed mace that drags strength from the body. It gives -2 ATK, -2 damage, -3 CON, and -8 max HP.
ITEM_MACE_OF_EXHAUSTION_UNIDENTIFIED_NAME|mace
ITEM_MACE_OF_EXHAUSTION_UNIDENTIFIED_DESC|A flanged iron mace with a short grip.
ITEM_AXE_OF_RECKLESSNESS_NAME|axe of recklessness
