UI_LOC_REPORT_EMPTY_QUERY|Cherchez dans la langue actuelle.
NPC_LINE_KESTREL_SMITH_1|Cracked buckles, loose rivets, bent blades. Set le piece down et garde votre fingers clear.
NPC_LINE_KESTREL_SMITH_2|Je avez spearheads cooling et three shields split at le rim. If vous besoin de travail, say it quick.
NPC_LINE_KESTREL_SMITH_3|Rockmaw gear comes back dented deep. Ogres put dents through shields et arm straps alike.
NPC_LINE_KESTREL_SMITH_4|Field forge est ouvre. Je sell blades, patch mail, et replace straps if le quartermaster a any left.
NPC_LINE_KESTREL_ORDERLY_1|We sont down a torn linen et boiled eau. If vous avez bandages, hand them here.
NPC_LINE_KESTREL_ORDERLY_2|Garde votre voix low. Two lancers finally slept, et Je will pas wake them for camp gossip.
NPC_LINE_KESTREL_ORDERLY_3|Cots sont for bleeding, fever, ou orders de Vaust. If vous besoin de rest, paie et lie calme.
NPC_LINE_KESTREL_ORDERLY_4|Ghostwood returns come dans froid et shaking. Je check for bites avant Je give them a blanket.
DIALOGUE_HIGHMARK_PRIEST_PILGRIMAGE_START_CHARM|Voyageur, wait a moment. Ce blank charm will pas hold le White Sceau yet. It a besoin de le route marques premier. Prends it.
DIALOGUE_HIGHMARK_PRIEST_PILGRIMAGE_START_ROUTE|Touch it a Havenford's autel, le Roadside Sanctuaire, et Reedmire Sanctuaire. When all three marques show, apporte it back a ce cloth.
DIALOGUE_HIGHMARK_PRIEST_PILGRIMAGE_REPLACE_CHARM|Lost le charm? Je can cut one more blank. Carry it a whichever premier altars sont calme unmarked, then apporte it back.
DIALOGUE_HIGHMARK_PRIEST_PILGRIMAGE_BLESS_HANDIN|The marks are set. The charm is blessed for Oldroot. Take it to the altar there.
DIALOGUE_HIGHMARK_PRIEST_PILGRIMAGE_OLDROOT_REMINDER|Oldroot Temple est le prochain marque. Touch le dormant charm a its autel, then retourne if le charm wakes.
DIALOGUE_HIGHMARK_PRIEST_PILGRIMAGE_FINAL_HANDIN|Oldroot took le dernier marque. Set le charm down; Je will close le rite avant le wax cools.
DIALOGUE_HIGHMARK_PRIEST_PILGRIMAGE_FINAL_BLESSING|The finished charm is yours now. Its blessing should hold better on the road.
DIALOGUE_HIGHMARK_PRIEST_PILGRIMAGE_COMPLETE_IDLE|Votre charm est filed et scelle. Je cannot run le same pilgrimage twice for one name.
UI_CHARACTER_EFFECT_ENLARGE|Enlarge: +4 STR, -4 DEF.
UI_CHARACTER_EFFECT_REDUCE|Reduce: -4 STR, +4 DEF.
ITEM_COATING_LESSER_CONSECRATION_NAME|Huile faible de consecration
