ITEM_USE_EFFECT_POTION_OF_REDUCE|octroie -4 Force et +4 DEF pendant 1 minute.
ITEM_USE_EFFECT_OIL_LESSER_CONSECRATION|ajoute 1d3 degats sacres aux touches d'arme pendant 10 minutes.
ITEM_USE_EFFECT_OIL_STRONG_CONSECRATION|ajoute 1d12 degats sacres aux touches d'arme pendant 10 minutes.
ITEM_USE_EFFECT_HARM_LIGHT|breuvage nocif; inflige 10-15 degats.
ITEM_USE_EFFECT_HARM_MODERATE|breuvage nocif; inflige 25-40 degats.
ITEM_USE_EFFECT_HARM_STRONG|breuvage nocif; inflige 60-90 degats.
ITEM_USE_EFFECT_POTION_OF_ACID|breuvage nocif; inflige 8-14 degats d'acide.
ITEM_USE_EFFECT_POTION_OF_BURNING|breuvage nocif; inflige 8-14 degats de feu.
ITEM_USE_EFFECT_POTION_OF_WEAKNESS|breuvage nocif; reduit la Force de 4 pendant 120 tours.
ITEM_USE_EFFECT_POTION_OF_SLOWNESS|breuvage nocif; ralentit le mouvement pendant 5 tours.
ITEM_USE_EFFECT_POTION_OF_SILENCE|breuvage nocif; cause le silence pendant 6 tours.
ITEM_USE_EFFECT_POTION_OF_FEAR|breuvage nocif; cause la peur pendant 3 tours.
ITEM_USE_EFFECT_POTION_OF_SLEEP|breuvage nocif; cause le sommeil pendant 3 tours.
ITEM_USE_EFFECT_POTION_OF_PARALYSIS|breuvage nocif; cause la paralysie pendant 3 tours.
DEATH_POTION_HARM|tue par une potion de mal
DEATH_POTION_ACID|dissous par une potion d'acide
DEATH_POTION_BURNING|brule par une potion de brulure
DIALOGUE_ALDREN_POST_WATCHTOWER_IDLE|Les chariots roulent de nouveau, et pour le moment cela semble sur. Mais nous nous preparons.
DIALOGUE_ALDREN_CAVE_CHIEF_TURNIN|You did it. With the chieftain dead, the goblins lose their nerve and our militia can drive off the stragglers. The farms can mend fences instead of burying stock, and perhaps carts will dare the road to Traveller's Rest again. Take your reward with my thanks, friend.
DIALOGUE_ALDREN_CAVE_CHIEF_TURNIN_HALF_ORC|You did the work, and Havenford is safer for it. Some here will still watch your tusks before your deeds; let them watch this deed too. Take the pay. Garrick may have harder work if you want it.
DIALOGUE_ALDREN_CAVE_CHIEF_REMINDER|La Grotte Gobline est a l'est, non loin d'ici. Tuez leur chef.
DIALOGUE_ALDREN_CAVE_CHIEF_START|Bienvenue a Havenford, voyageur. Les temps sont durs pour nous tous. Nos chariots sont attaques a l'est, et d'etranges mouvements agitent l'ouest. Les raids viennent de gobelins dans la grotte orientale. Vous pensez pouvoir nous aider? Tenez, prenez un peu de monnaie et de provisions, puis tuez le chef gobelin. Je vous donnerai davantage quand vous reviendrez, le travail fait.
DIALOGUE_ALDREN_CAVE_CHIEF_START_HALF_ORC|Salut a vous, ceci est Havenford. Nous cherchons de l'aide mercenaire, si vous pouvez nous aider. Tenez, prenez un peu de monnaie et de provisions, puis tuez le chef gobelin. Je vous donnerai davantage quand vous reviendrez, le travail fait.
DIALOGUE_VETHRIN_REEDMIRE_COMPLETE_IDLE|Je suis occupe. Allez donc boire une ale avec un nain ou quelque chose du genre, je vous prie.
DIALOGUE_VETHRIN_REEDMIRE_TURNIN|Ainsi l'autel etait maudit par une vieille magie. Merci. Je dois chercher comment cela a pu arriver. Tenez, quelque chose pour votre aide.
DIALOGUE_VETHRIN_REEDMIRE_REMINDER|Mene le travail de Reedmire jusqu'au bout. Porte ma note a Reth, place les pierres du sanctuaire et rapporte-moi la reponse quand la creature sera morte.
DIALOGUE_VETHRIN_NOTE_REPLACEMENT|Vous avez perdu la note? Bien sur. Je garde des copies exactement pour cela. Portez celle-ci a Reth Oskel aux Reedwater Docks.
DIALOGUE_VETHRIN_TOO_GREEN|Laissez-moi, je vous prie, je dois preparer certaines choses.
DIALOGUE_VETHRIN_COTTAGE_TOO_GREEN|Please leave me to my research for now.
DIALOGUE_VETHRIN_COTTAGE_START|I need someone steady to look over the burned cottage. The fire was not ordinary; the ash still carries a magical trace, and the wolves around the ruin are not acting normal. Check the place carefully, then bring me whatever you find.
DIALOGUE_VETHRIN_COTTAGE_REMINDER|The burned cottage still needs eyes on it. Search the ruin carefully, then bring me whatever explains that fire. Watch the wolves; they are not acting normal.
DIALOGUE_VETHRIN_COTTAGE_TURNIN|Water glyphs under a burned house. Peculiar. This reminds me of a tale I overheard from Reth Oskel, one of the fishermen at Reedwater. I thought ale was doing most of the talking, but perhaps not. Take this spellbook; practical payment is harder to misread than theory.
DIALOGUE_VETHRIN_COTTAGE_REEDMIRE_WAIT|I need to do more research on this. Come see me again later.
DIALOGUE_VETHRIN_REEDMIRE_START|Reth Oskel is the fisherman. He spoke of stone piles around Reedmire Shrine and water moving against the wind. Take this sealed note to him at Reedwater Docks and get his account directly. If his story matches the cottage markings, the shrine may be worse than an old flooded altar.
DIALOGUE_HAVENFORD_WATCH_DONE|No ouvre board today. Havenford Watch a paid every signed marque Je avez.
DIALOGUE_HAVENFORD_WATCH_SKRIT_TURNIN|Skrit est mort. Beau travail. Voici la derniere paie de la garde, et cette piece des reserves. La Garde de Havenford n'a plus de travail pour le moment, mon ami.
DIALOGUE_HAVENFORD_WATCH_SKRIT_REMINDER|Hail Adventurer. Skrit still needs ending.
DIALOGUE_HAVENFORD_WATCH_BONES_TURNIN|Bon travail. Les os de tombe sont de sombres jetons de paie, mais ils prouvent que les morts restent a terre. Nous avons suivi le probleme kobold au nord de la tour en ruine, vers les vieux travaux de montagne. Leur chef de meute, Skrit, s'y cache. Trouve-le et termine cela proprement.
DIALOGUE_HAVENFORD_WATCH_BONES_REMINDER|Je besoin de twenty grave bones, pas a story. Skeletons et zombies count. Apporte le bones back a mon board.
DIALOGUE_HAVENFORD_WATCH_SCALPS_TURNIN|Vingt scalps. Bien. Le compte des kobolds quitte le tableau. Voici la premiere bourse de la garde. Le prochain travail est plus laid: vingt os de tombe pris sur des squelettes ou des zombies.
DIALOGUE_HAVENFORD_WATCH_SCALPS_REMINDER|Les kobolds inquietent encore les routes. Rapporte des scalps quand tu en auras.
DIALOGUE_HAVENFORD_WATCH_START|Salut, aventurier. Havenford a besoin que des routes soient degagees, et vous semblez pouvoir aider. Tuez vingt kobolds et rapportez-moi leurs scalps, et vous serez paye sur la bourse de la garde.
DIALOGUE_HAVENFORD_WATCH_START_HALF_ORC|Bonjour. Havenford a besoin que des routes soient degagees, et vous semblez capable. Tuez vingt kobolds et rapportez-moi leurs scalps, et vous serez paye.
DIALOGUE_KINGS_BARROW_DONE|Garde Kingsmark. Je avez Theryn's reading, votre barrow report, et enough ink a finish le account.
DIALOGUE_KINGS_BARROW_RING_TURNIN|Kingsmark came out of le royal sarcophagus, then. Theryn's phrase worked, Roi Halric etait named, et le tomb held le anneau.\nKeep it. Je came for le account, pas a mort roi's jewelry.
DIALOGUE_KINGS_BARROW_SARCOPHAGUS_REMINDER|Roi Halric est down. Ouvre le royal sarcophagus avant vous leave; Kingsmark should be dans le roi's hand.
DIALOGUE_KINGS_BARROW_EXPEDITION_REMINDER|Theryn gave vous le phrase. Roi's Barrow est sud of Highmark dans le vieux Havenford March. Enter le tomb, defeat Roi Halric, et ouvre le royal sarcophagus for Kingsmark.
DIALOGUE_KINGS_BARROW_PHRASE_CONFIRMED|Theryn read it, then. Bien. Le phrase opens le barrow door, but it will pas clear le tomb for vous.\nKing's Barrow est sud of Highmark dans le vieux Havenford March. Va dans, defeat Roi Halric, then ouvre le royal sarcophagus et prends Kingsmark. Apporte le account back a moi dans Highmark apres Kingsmark est out.
DIALOGUE_KINGS_BARROW_MANUSCRIPT_REPLACEMENT|Le manuscript est gone de votre meute. Je garde a second rubbing because couriers perdez bags. Prends ce copy a Old Theryn Rusk dans Havenford.
DIALOGUE_KINGS_BARROW_MANUSCRIPT_REMINDER|Prends Edran's manuscript a Old Theryn Rusk dans Havenford's sud house. Do pas try le Roi's Barrow phrase until Theryn a read le copy.
DIALOGUE_KINGS_BARROW_TOO_GREEN|No commission from me today. The work I need is hard road work, not a first Highmark errand.
DIALOGUE_KINGS_BARROW_START|Je am Edran Vale. Every sanctuaire clerk dans Highmark wants a test ce phrase at le tomb door, so Je besoin de a courier avec sense.\nI copied le words de Roi's Barrow, sud of Highmark. Le hand est vieux March script, et Old Theryn Rusk dans Havenford knew cela script avant Je etait born.\nTake ce manuscript a Theryn's sud house et avez him read le phrase. If he confirms it, apporte le answer back a moi dans Highmark. Je besoin de le account; if Kingsmark est truly inside, Je am pas asking for le anneau.
DIALOGUE_RETH_REEDMIRE_DONE|Vethrin a his report. Reedmire Sanctuaire est quiet again. Bien. Je will garde a mon nets. Let Vethrin study le pierres.
DIALOGUE_RETH_NHALOR_SLAIN|Nhalor est mort? Bien. Prends le news a Vethrin dans Havenford. Je am fait avec Reedmire et his questions.
DIALOGUE_RETH_REEDMIRE_REMINDER|Le travail du sanctuaire n'est pas fini. Pose une pierre lisse sur chaque pile, et si Nhalor se releve, tue-le avant de partir.
DIALOGUE_RETH_NOTE_HANDIN|Cela est Vethrin's sceau. Fine. Je left Reedmire avant Je could finish le count. I made four pierre stacks by le autel. Le fourth woke Nhalor dans le sanctuaire pool. Take these lisse pierres. Va a Reedmire Sanctuaire, set one pierre sur each stack, et tue Nhalor if it rises. Then carry le answer back a Vethrin.
DIALOGUE_RETH_NO_QUEST_IDLE|Vethrin wants Reedmire numbers? He can send his sceau premier. Until then, Je avez nets a mend.
DIALOGUE_THAULD_CORPSE_REPORT|Pel Marr. Je told him a stop fishing le cistern mouths, but he liked full nets more than warnings. You brought word back. Prends ce de mon spare locker avant Je put his name sur le quai slate.
DIALOGUE_THAULD_ARRIVAL_HANDOFF|Sale tempête. Content que vous soyez arrivés entiers. Mais ce bateau ne repartira pas avant un moment. Garran m'a parlé de ta situation; de sombres jours, à coup sûr. Écoute, prends la route intérieure vers l'est jusqu'à Havenford. Reste sur la route, c'est plus sûr. Et si tu dois te reposer ou prendre des vivres, fais-le avant de partir.
DIALOGUE_THAULD_DOCK_REMINDER|Je n'ai rien d'autre pour t'aider, gamin. Va à Havenford.
DIALOGUE_RAT_CELLAR_DONE|Le cellar est quiet. Grain sacks sont staying shut. If vous ouvre cela hatch again, apporte votre own boots.
DIALOGUE_RAT_CELLAR_TURNIN|Le gros est mort? Bien. Cela brise le nid. Prends la paie avant que je la depense en grain neuf.
DIALOGUE_RAT_CELLAR_REMINDER|Back room hatch, straight down. Tue le big cellar rat et clear le rats off le grain sacks, then come back a moi.
DIALOGUE_RAT_CELLAR_START|You there, looking for work? I have rats in the cellar, and one of them is the size of a fuckin' calf. They chewed through two grain sacks this morning, and the dockmaster is blaming me. The hatch is in the back room. Kill the big one, clear what rats you can, and I will scrape up enough coin to make it worth your time.
DIALOGUE_BRAN_DELIVERY_DONE|Orrick sent word. Le parcel reached Traveller's Rest, et he paid vous? Bien. Je owe vous a beer once Je get these nets tied.
DIALOGUE_BRAN_PARCEL_REMINDER|Ce paquet est pour Orrick a Traveller's Rest. Prends la route de l'interieur et garde-le au sec.
DIALOGUE_BRAN_PARCEL_REPLACEMENT|Lost it? Gods. Hold calme, Je can tie another. Prends ce parcel a Orrick Fen at Traveller's Rest.
DIALOGUE_BRAN_BEER_REMINDER|Je suis encore a sec ici. La taverne est assez proche pour sentir le tonneau.
DIALOGUE_BRAN_BEER_START|Ma chope est vide et mes deux mains sont prises dans un filet dechire. Apporte-moi une biere, et je me souviendrai bien de ton visage.
DIALOGUE_BRAN_BEER_HANDIN_PARCEL|Ca fait du bien. Maintenant gagne une meilleure course: un paquet pour Orrick a Traveller's Rest. Route de l'interieur, au sec si tu peux.
DIALOGUE_STONECLEFT_GATEHALL_LAMP_DONE|Sellan's load est packed et gone upstairs. Bien. Gatehall shelves avez nourriture et huile again; say what vous besoin de.
DIALOGUE_STONECLEFT_GATEHALL_SHOP|Gatehall supplies: huile, corde, nourriture, bandages, et repair tackle. Buy avant vous leave Stonecleft's doors.
DIALOGUE_STONECLEFT_SUPPLY_LAMP_DONE|Harl sent his marque. Le gatehall a nourriture et huile, et mon count est clean again.
DIALOGUE_STONECLEFT_SUPPLY_SHOP|Lamp huile, corde, bandages, dry nourriture, et spare tackle. Count votre meute avant le bas stairs.
DIALOGUE_ORRICK_PARCEL_TURNIN|Cela est Bran's parcel? Dry, tied, et calme dans one piece. Bien enough. Take ce lucky spear for le carry. Je can spare it de le rack.
DIALOGUE_ORRICK_OLD_CAVE_DONE|Votre Old Grotte report est already useful. Je avez corde et huile by le door now, et travelers demande questions avant taking le est route.
DIALOGUE_ORRICK_MIXED_GOODS|Route goods here: nourriture, eau, torches, huile, corde, bandages, lockpicks, et a little steel. Tell moi what votre meute est missing.
DIALOGUE_ORRICK_OLD_CAVE_TURNIN|Tu as atteint les salles basses? Alors la vieille grotte est inspectee, et mon inquietude a enfin un fond. Voici la paie.
DIALOGUE_ORRICK_OLD_CAVE_REMINDER|Old Grotte est est of Traveller's Rest. Je besoin de a report de le bottom floor, pas le premier room. Apporte moi what vous saw et come back dans one piece.
DIALOGUE_ORRICK_TOO_GREEN|Not that errand today. Buy food, oil, and rope if you need them; smaller work is wiser for now.
DIALOGUE_ORRICK_OLD_CAVE_START|La vieille grotte toute proche avale les rumeurs et n'en rend aucune. Atteins les salles basses, regarde ce qui y attend, et je paierai pour la reponse.
DIALOGUE_CALDUS_DOCKS_DONE|Krosh est mort, et la peninsule au nord-est est plus calme pour cela. Traveller's Rest peut y envoyer de nouveau des cavaliers armes. Si vous y retournez, surveillez les sous-sols.
DIALOGUE_CALDUS_DOCKS_DONE_HALF_ORC|Krosh est mort. Bon travail, quoi que dise la cour. Les cavaliers armes peuvent utiliser de nouveau la peninsule au nord-est. Surveillez les sous-sols si vous y retournez.
DIALOGUE_CALDUS_DOCKS_TURNIN|Krosh est mort? Then le Desolate Docks avez one less orc giving orders. Stand easy. Vous did le travail Je could pas finish.
DIALOGUE_CALDUS_DOCKS_TURNIN_HALF_ORC|Krosh est mort by votre hand? Then vous did le travail. Stand easy. Je will say it plainly if anyone asks.
DIALOGUE_CALDUS_DOCKS_PAY|Les docks sont degages. Prends la paie; l'argent gagne se depense plus proprement que l'argent promis.
DIALOGUE_CALDUS_DOCKS_PAY_HALF_ORC|Les docks sont degages. Prends ta paie. Tu l'as gagnee, meme si la salle n'aime pas le dire.
DIALOGUE_CALDUS_DOCKS_REMINDER|Desolate Docks, sur la peninsule au nord-est de Traveller's Rest. Trouve Krosh dans les sous-sols occupes et tue-le. Ne reviens pas avec des histoires de recuperation.
DIALOGUE_CALDUS_DOCKS_REMINDER_HALF_ORC|Trouve Krosh dans les sous-sols des Desolate Docks, sur la peninsule au nord-est de Traveller's Rest, et tue-le. C'est le travail.
DIALOGUE_CALDUS_DOCKS_TOO_GREEN|Not yet. The docks are bad ground today. Take smaller work first.
DIALOGUE_CALDUS_DOCKS_TOO_GREEN_HALF_ORC|Not yet. Same answer I would give anyone: the docks are bad ground today.
DIALOGUE_CALDUS_DOCKS_START|Stranger. Ser Caldus Renn. I have a Desolate Docks notice under my cup and not enough blades to answer it. Krosh and his orc salvage crew hold the ruined dock settlement on the peninsula northeast of Traveller's Rest, and the basements below it. Go there, find Krosh, kill him, and return to Traveller's Rest. I will pay from my own purse.
DIALOGUE_CALDUS_DOCKS_START_HALF_ORC|Les orcs tiennent les Desolate Docks. Je ne demanderai pas quel cote de ce sang vous a appris la guerre. Tuez Krosh, nettoyez-les, et je paie.
DIALOGUE_VELRA_ASH_DONE|Le Ashen Ring est yours. Do pas let every hedge mage handle it; Rhazvek's scale did le hard travail, et Je did le expensive travail.
DIALOGUE_VELRA_ARCANE_CASE|Scrolls, wands, mana draughts, charms, et rings. Look avec votre yeux premier; le case stays latched until Je ouvre it.
DIALOGUE_VELRA_ASH_TURNIN|There it est, Rhazvek's scale. Warm, whole, et mine for le moment. Set it sur le cloth; Je can finish le Ashen Ring.
DIALOGUE_VELRA_ASH_REMINDER|Ash Tower lies east-southeast of Traveller's Rest. Rhazvek, one drake scale. You have the fire potions and cold wand; bring me the scale.
DIALOGUE_VELRA_ASH_TOO_GREEN|Not that commission. Not yet. Buy a small scroll and keep to smaller trouble for now.
DIALOGUE_VELRA_ASH_START|Ah, a customer with eyes on the locked case. Good taste, dangerous taste. I am Velra Senn. I have an Ashen Ring half finished, and Rhazvek's scale is the piece it needs. Rhazvek lairs in Ash Tower, east-southeast of Traveller's Rest. Take these two fire resistance potions and this wand of cone of cold. Kill Rhazvek, bring me one drake scale, and the finished ring is yours.
DIALOGUE_DORRAN_CORE_HANDIN|Cela est mon runeforge core. Soaked wrap, cracked rim, rune cuts calme clean. Duergar dragged it a Floodgate Cistern. Le eau drake killed them avant they moved it again. Je will set le core back now; give le forge thirty-six hours avant Je trust le marked racks.
DIALOGUE_DORRAN_DUERGAR_DONE_REWARD|Here est votre monnaie et a marked piece de le rack. If le duergar come nord again, Stonecleft will be pret.
DIALOGUE_DORRAN_OLD_MINEWORKS_START|Le core est back, but Vargrom calme runs le duergar relay dans Old Mineworks. Kill him avant he sends another crew for mon forge. Come back when he est mort; le marked racks ouvre once le heat steadies.
DIALOGUE_DORRAN_VARGROM_TURNIN|Vargrom est mort? Bien. Cela leaves his relay sans a foreman.
DIALOGUE_DORRAN_REPAIRED_STOCK|Runeforge est holding steady. Marked stock est back sur le counter.
DIALOGUE_DORRAN_REPAIRED_VARGROM_REMINDER|The runeforge is lit, but Vargrom still holds the works.
DIALOGUE_DORRAN_REPAIR_WAITING|Le core est set. Le heat est pas steady yet, et Je do pas sell marked steel sur a weak burn.
DIALOGUE_DORRAN_CORE_LOCATION_FOUND|Dead duergar by le bas stairs, crude tools beside them? Bien. Go back a Floodgate Cistern et apporte moi le runeforge core. Wet est fine. Broken through est pas.
DIALOGUE_DORRAN_VALVE_REMINDER|Still avez le runed valve handle? Prends it a Floodgate Cistern. Open le bas sluices, fouille by le bas stairs, et apporte moi le core if le duergar left it there.
DIALOGUE_DORRAN_RUNEFORGE_START|Stonecleft has another problem. The Runeforge Core is missing, and Floodgate Cistern is the best lead. Take this runed valve handle, open the lower sluice, and bring the core back.
DIALOGUE_DORRAN_ARMORY_CLOSED|Magic armory est shut. Le runeforge est froid. Je can mend simple gear, but marked steel stays off le counter.
DIALOGUE_MAVETH_APOTHECARY_OLDROOT_DONE|Le oldroot batch held. Stronger soignant et resistance bottles sont sur le shelf. Point avant vous unstopper anything green.
DIALOGUE_MAVETH_APOTHECARY_OLDROOT_TURNIN|Six leaves, whole and dark. Good. The bitter edge is still there.\nTake this pay and this restoration potion. Once I grind the rest, stronger bottles go on the shelf.
DIALOGUE_MAVETH_APOTHECARY_OLDROOT_REMINDER|Oldroot Temple. Six usable leaves. Cut dark leaves de living oldroot; loose floor growth est trash.
DIALOGUE_MAVETH_APOTHECARY_OLDROOT_START|Careful. Those bottles are sealed tight. Highmark caravans bought through my strong stock, and my Oldroot gatherer came back fevered.\nI need six whole oldroot leaves from Oldroot Temple. Cut dark leaves from living oldroot, not floor growth. Bring them back and I will pay coin and a restoration potion.
DIALOGUE_MAVETH_APOTHECARY_CASE|Sealed draughts, dated salves, clean corks. Le glowing bottles stay behind le counter. Say what hurts ou browse like vous mean a buy.
DIALOGUE_NERRIK_DRAUGHT_DONE|The perfect draught is finished. If you have blackglass fragments, the worktable can make more elixirs. Do not touch the brown bottle.
DIALOGUE_NERRIK_TABLE_WARNING|Stop there. Left tray est tincture, right tray est acide wash, et le brown bottle est mine. Demande avant votre sleeve touches anything.
DIALOGUE_NERRIK_DRAUGHT_START|You. Good, careful hands. I am working toward a perfect draught, but I need preserved monster samples first.\nTake these jars of preservation ointment. Use one on a fresh corpse, or throw one at the creature before you kill it.\nBring me the samples and I can make them into elixirs. With these samples I can slowly perfect the recipe.
DIALOGUE_NERRIK_DRAUGHT_SAMPLE|A preserved {0} corpse. Good. Still tight, still useful. I can cut a clean sample from this.
DIALOGUE_NERRIK_DRAUGHT_BATCH|This sample settles the {0} mixture. Take the elixir; I only need a shaving for the next draft.
DIALOGUE_NERRIK_DRAUGHT_FINAL|Good. The perfect draught holds together. Drink it here while the blackglass is still quiet.
DIALOGUE_NERRIK_DRAUGHT_NEED_OINTMENT|You need preservation ointment before hunting the next sample. Maveth sometimes sells jars, and curio shelves may have them.
DIALOGUE_NERRIK_DRAUGHT_USE_OINTMENT|Use the ointment before rot starts. Rub it into the fresh corpse I named, or throw the jar at that creature before the kill.
DIALOGUE_NERRIK_DRAUGHT_TARGET|Next sample: preserve a {0} corpse and bring it back to me.
DIALOGUE_NERRIK_DRAUGHT_FINAL_TARGET|For the last draught, bring me a preserved adult dragon corpse and one blackglass shard. Young dragons will not do.
DIALOGUE_NERRIK_DRAUGHT_FINAL_SAMPLE|An adult dragon sample and a blackglass shard. Good. That is enough body and enough bite for the final mix.
DIALOGUE_NERRIK_DRAUGHT_FINAL_NEED_SHARD|The dragon sample is usable. Now bring one blackglass shard; the final draught needs something hard enough to hold the change.
DIALOGUE_NERRIK_DRAUGHT_FINAL_NEED_SAMPLE|The last sample must come from an adult dragon or older. Preserve the corpse and bring it here with one blackglass shard.
DIALOGUE_AELRION_THREAD_DONE|Le moonwell strings sont holding. Le upgraded rack est stocked. Garde finished bows dry, ou buy another string.
DIALOGUE_AELRION_THREAD_TURNIN|Six brins, aucun effiloche. Bien. Ceux-la tiendront un arc de guerre.\nPrends cette paie et cet arc. Je torsaderai le reste pour le ratelier ameliore.
DIALOGUE_AELRION_THREAD_REMINDER|Moonwell Observatory calme a what Je besoin de. Apporte six strands de cult mort, specter rooms, ou caught thread near le vieux frame.
DIALOGUE_AELRION_THREAD_START|Tu regardes le bon ratelier? Alors je vais te dire pourquoi il n'est pas assez bon. Mes meilleures cordes sont du boyau ordinaire, et la route de l'ouest s'ouvre.\nLe fil de Moonwell garde un arc sous l'humidite, le froid et les mauvais traitements. Rapporte-moi six brins de l'Observatoire Moonwell; les morts du culte et les salles de spectres les gardent. Je paierai en pieces et te ferai un arc.
DIALOGUE_AELRION_BOWYER_RACK|Dry yew, waxed strings, counted arrowheads. Garde wet gloves off le finished bows.
DIALOGUE_LANCER_ORDERS_DONE|Vaust heard the message? Good. Kestrel can post scouts with current routes instead of last week's guesswork.
DIALOGUE_LANCER_ORDERS_REMINDER|Captain Vaust Thane at Camp Kestrel needs the Highmark message. Put it in his hand, not on a camp table.
DIALOGUE_LANCER_HARPIES_TURNIN|Twelve harpies confirmed. Good work. North road scouts can look at tracks again instead of the sky. I have your pay; next board is ogres.
DIALOGUE_LANCER_OGRES_TURNIN|Eight ogres confirmed. Hill road carts can move without a double guard. I have your pay; next board is hill giants.
DIALOGUE_LANCER_GIANTS_TURNIN|Deux geants des collines confirmes. Highmark peut renvoyer bannieres et chariots de ravitaillement sur les routes des collines. Prends ta paie; l'armurerie a ajoute une piece d'armure.
DIALOGUE_LANCER_NORTHERN_REMINDER|Northern ground still needs clearing. Keep the count.
DIALOGUE_LANCER_NORTHERN_START|Greycliff Quarry is west of Highmark, and harpies are dragging scouts off the quarry road and the cliff routes toward Telwynd. Clear the harpies, then report back. I pay in coin.
DIALOGUE_THERYN_HIGHWIND_CATACOMBS_FOUND|Vous found le Highwind Catacombs avant Je finished le map. Bien. Le answer etait sous le monastery apres all.
DIALOGUE_THERYN_HIGHWIND_CATACOMBS_LEAD|Highwind Monastery est only le haut site. Le vieux burial halls sit sous it.\nSearch le monastery for le catacomb entrance et step inside. Then retourne a Telwynd avec proof le bas way est real.
DIALOGUE_THERYN_BARROW_PHRASE|Give moi le page. Hm. Old March hand, royal names, et a burial line about Halric's route.\nKing Halric et Kingsmark share le line. At Roi's Barrow, say: Halric holds le route.
DIALOGUE_THERYN_BARROW_PHRASE_REMINDER|Vous avez le phrase. At Roi's Barrow, say: Halric holds le route.
DIALOGUE_THERYN_OPENING_WORDS_LEARNED|Yes, Je know ce hand. Le missing part est spoken words, pas another eclat.\nTake le Lightglass star back a le final sang sceau. Speak le vieux line there, then contact le pierre.
DIALOGUE_THERYN_OPENING_WORDS_REMINDER|Lightglass star, final sang sceau, spoken words, hand sur pierre. Do it dans cela order.
DIALOGUE_THROKK_BLACKGLASS_FORGE_COLD|Le White Sceau named votre sang? Fine. My runeforge est froid, et Je will pas set blackglass over weak heat. Dorran a besoin de le Stonecleft core repaired premier. Finish cela travail, then apporte eclats a mon bench.
DIALOGUE_THROKK_BLACKGLASS_FORGE_WITH_SHARD|Cela est a true eclat. Put it sur le bench et choose a arme ou lourd armure piece. One fragment, one fitting. Je can set blackglass into battle gear; Je do pas shave it into trinkets.
DIALOGUE_THROKK_STONEWARD_OPEN|La Stoneward Gate est ouverte. Mon briseur a fait son travail.
DIALOGUE_THROKK_UNDERWAY_TURNIN|By the forge, you made it back alive. With The Underway open, Stonecleft can breathe and Highmark is no longer a story on the far side of stone. If you mean to go there, go now.
DIALOGUE_THROKK_BLACKGLASS_FORGE_NO_SHARD|Le White Sceau named votre sang for le vieux travail. Apporte true eclats when vous avez them. One fragment makes one martial fitting.
DIALOGUE_THROKK_UNDERWAY_CLEAR|The Underway is clear at last. Took a stranger to shame the old gate open, but open is open.
DIALOGUE_THROKK_UNDERWAY_REMINDER|The drake is still holding North Gate. Kill it, and you can get through to Highmark.
DIALOGUE_THROKK_UNDERWAY_START|Highmark, is it? Then you need The Underway. North Gate is blocked by a drake; while it breathes, nothing gets through.
DIALOGUE_THROKK_UNDERWAY_START_OBJECTIVE|No one here is eager to feed it another helm. I will have the gate warden let you through. Kill the drake at North Gate, then you can get through to Highmark. Once you are out, keep north to the city.
QUEST_LOG_MOONWELL_ALIGNMENT_REPLACE_OBJECTIVE|Retourne a Canon-Artificer Veydras Vale dans Highmark for another moonwell lens.
QUEST_LOG_MOONWELL_ALIGNMENT_REPLACE_DETAIL|Veydras a Highmark peut remplacer la lentille moonwell mal alignee manquante des reserves du sceau.
QUEST_LOG_MOONWELL_ALIGNMENT_RECOVER_ATTUNED_OBJECTIVE|Recupere le attuned moonwell lens.
QUEST_LOG_MOONWELL_ALIGNMENT_RECOVER_ATTUNED_DETAIL|La lentille moonwell accordee manque. Eivyss a Telwynd peut la restaurer.
DIALOGUE_VEYDRAS_TOVAN_DONE|Tovan est back at White Sceau Antiquities. Limping, sorting charms, arguing prices. Bien. Cela est healthy enough for Tovan.
DIALOGUE_VEYDRAS_TOVAN_RESCUED|Tovan reached le White Sceau building. Wrapped leg, case key, bad temper. Speak avec him avant vous leave. He owes vous monnaie et le shop discount.
DIALOGUE_VEYDRAS_TOVAN_REMINDER|Highmark Aqueduct, northwest of le cite. Trouve Tovan Mere ou proof of his death. Watch le bas eau; leeches, slime, et eau weirds sont common there.
DIALOGUE_VEYDRAS_TOVAN_START|Vous avez handled White Sceau travail. Bien. Je avez another problem, et Je am pas sending a copyist into an aqueduct. Tovan Mere went into Highmark Aqueduct northwest of le cite a inspect vieux sealwork et did pas come back. Find him, ou apporte proof if he est mort. Le aqueduct a service walks, flooded pockets, leeches, slime, et eau weirds, so garde out of le bas eau when vous can.
DIALOGUE_VEYDRAS_LIGHTGLASS_LOCKED|Cela basin stays covered. Tharec a pas opened Lightglass travail a vous. Apporte eclat proof ou le amulet a le High Canon premier.
DIALOGUE_VEYDRAS_LIGHTGLASS_OPEN|Tharec opened le basin a vous. Je can cut true blackglass into Lightglass here, but Je count every fragment avant le heat starts. Two true fragments make one Lightglass piece. Choose de le list avant Je uncover le basin.
DIALOGUE_VEYDRAS_MOONWELL_START|Moonwell Observatory est drifting again. My readings et le vieux frame disagree by le same count every time. Le lens est wrong.\nTake ce misaligned lens a Eivyss Glass-Singer dans Telwynd. He can tune it; then seat it dans le Moonwell Observatory frame et report back a moi.
DIALOGUE_VEYDRAS_MOONWELL_TO_TELWYND|Take the lens to Eivyss Glass-Singer in Telwynd. Highmark can cut glass; Telwynd knows how to tune it.
DIALOGUE_VEYDRAS_MOONWELL_TO_OBSERVATORY|Eivyss tuned le lens. Seat it dans le Moonwell Observatory frame, then come back avec le reading.
DIALOGUE_VEYDRAS_MOONWELL_COMPLETE|Well done. The observatory frame is steady, and Telwynd's tuning agrees with my numbers.\nTake this purse and this Lightglass fragment. That saves me a climb and an argument at Telwynd's gate.
DIALOGUE_TOVAN_AQUEDUCT_RESCUE|Careful. Le bas channel a a eau weird, et ce leg will pas carry moi past it twice. If Veydras sent vous, tell him Je am vivant. Je can reach le haut duct de here. Meet moi at White Sceau Antiquities by le reliquary rooms.
DIALOGUE_TOVAN_AQUEDUCT_UNAVAILABLE|My case stays locked until Je am back behind it. If Veydras wants vieux Sceau stock, he can send someone below Highmark Aqueduct.
DIALOGUE_TOVAN_REWARD|Vous got moi out avec mon leg calme attached et most of mon stock dry. Fair travail. Here est votre monnaie. My case est ouvre a vous at le bas price: clean bottles, vieux Sceau pieces, field gear.
DIALOGUE_TOVAN_SHOP_IDLE|Case est ouvre. Clean bottles, vieux Sceau pieces, field gear. Votre discount calme stands.
DIALOGUE_ORYN_VAULT_SEALED|The White Vault is sealed again, and this time it feels like a seal rather than a prayer.
DIALOGUE_ORYN_VAULT_RITE_DONE|The star is Lightglass, but something still stirs below. I will not call the vault safe while it breathes.
DIALOGUE_ORYN_VAULT_DRAKE_SLAIN|The vault beast is slain. The chamber is quiet enough that I can hear my own hands shake.
DIALOGUE_ORYN_VAULT_REMINDER|The lower ward is open. I can feel the vault breathing through the stair. End what waits below before the old pattern spends itself holding the door.
DIALOGUE_ORYN_VAULT_NOT_READY|The vault stair remains locked. Until the Beacon Prism is set, opening it would be courage without discipline.
DIALOGUE_ORYN_VAULT_START|The Beacon Prism is set, and the star is Lightglass. I can open the lower ward, but listen before you descend: the White Vault has held something draconic in the dark for too long. If it wakes fully, the stones will not keep the sound small. Return when it is dead.
DIALOGUE_KESTREL_SCOUT_GHOSTWOOD_DONE|West patrols are finding the road again. We keep a double watch, but the names match the roster now.
DIALOGUE_KESTREL_SCOUT_GHOSTWOOD_REWARD|Veyr is dead? Then the smoke lifting makes sense. We lost patrols to that tower.\nTake the scout purse. I will send west patrols that way again.
DIALOGUE_KESTREL_SCOUT_ASK_EIRADHA|Before vous va ouest, demande Envoy Eiradha dans Highmark. Ce smoke a vieux ward travail dans it, et elves know more of cela than eclaireurs.
DIALOGUE_KESTREL_SCOUT_GHOSTWOOD_REMINDER|Eiradha gave her answer. Ghostwood est prochain. Follow le ouest route a le vieux tour, tue Veyr, et retourne when le smoke clears.
DIALOGUE_KESTREL_SCOUT_TOO_GREEN|Not for you yet. The smoke reports are taking trained patrols, and I am not sending another name into that list today.
DIALOGUE_KESTREL_SCOUT_GHOSTWOOD_START|You there, traveler. If you can keep west on a bad road, I need you. Two patrols vanished near Ghostwood after dusk. We found cold ash, dropped packs, no bodies.\nGo to Highmark and ask Envoy Eiradha about the smoke before you enter it. Kestrel pays when patrols can use the west road again.
DIALOGUE_WATCH_SERGEANT_ROCKMAW_OUTPOST_OPEN|Rockmaw's outer yard est ours. Beds, crates, field forge, barricaded bas escalier.\nGo see it. Le supplier sells field stock, le smith patches gear, et le orderly may avez a cot.
DIALOGUE_WATCH_SERGEANT_ROCKMAW_HOLDING|Rockmaw est holding. Two gardes sur le bas escalier, crates sous canvas, forge calme hot. Better than yesterday's report.
DIALOGUE_WATCH_SERGEANT_ROCKMAW_TURNIN|Maug et Brond sont morts? Bien. Des tetes raccourcissent mon rapport; ces morts ouvrent la route.\nKestrel bouge maintenant. Nous prenons la cour exterieure de Rockmaw, bloquons l'escalier inferieur et installons lits, caisses et forge de campagne. Prends la paie de Rockmaw.
DIALOGUE_WATCH_SERGEANT_ROCKMAW_REMINDER|Rockmaw Garde, ouest route. Tue Maug et Brond. Apporte their heads if vous can carry them.
DIALOGUE_WATCH_SERGEANT_TOO_GREEN|Pas encore. La prochaine cour brise des sentinelles entrainees. Apprenez la route de l'ouest avant que j'y mette votre nom.
DIALOGUE_WATCH_SERGEANT_ROCKMAW_START|Vous came a Kestrel sans a post assignment. Bien. Je besoin de blades sur route travail.\nRockmaw Garde blocks le ouest route. Maug, an ettin, gives orders; Brond, an ogre champion, holds le yard.\nKill both. Apporte their heads if vous can carry them. When they sont down, Kestrel takes le outer yard.
DIALOGUE_WATCH_SERGEANT_VARROTH_REWARD|Varroth est mort? Bien. Un roi loup-garou pres de Rockmaw est trop proche de mes sentinelles.\nPrends la bourse et cette hache. Nous l'avons tiree des reserves de Rockmaw.
DIALOGUE_WATCH_SERGEANT_VARROTH_REMINDER|Inconspicuous Grotte, hills southwest of Highmark. Varroth holds le bas pierre rooms. Tue him avant his meute tests le Rockmaw sentries.
DIALOGUE_WATCH_SERGEANT_VARROTH_START|Encore un travail maintenant que Rockmaw tient. Une meute sous Inconspicuous Cave est assez proche pour atteindre nos sentinelles.\nLa grotte est dans les collines au sud-ouest de Highmark. Varroth, le Roi Loup-Garou, tient les salles de pierre inferieures. Tue-le et reviens faire rapport; j'ai des pieces et une hache des reserves de Rockmaw.
DIALOGUE_VAUST_ORDERS_HANDIN|Good. West scouts need current routes, not guesses.\nTell the Lancers I heard the message. Take the carry pay.
DIALOGUE_VAUST_NEEDS_WHITE_SEAL|Camp Kestrel est pas a shelter for unfinished relic travail. Finish le White Sceau's amulet business avec Tharec, then come back.
DIALOGUE_EIRADHA_GHOSTWOOD_CONSULT|The ghostwood trouble belongs with the Kestrel scout. Follow the smoke if it still rises; return to the scout when it is quiet.
DIALOGUE_EIRADHA_TELWYND_OPEN|Sairveth has opened Telwynd to you. From Glassroot Hollow, take the forest road northwest to the town and wait for a warden at the gate.
DIALOGUE_EIRADHA_GLASSROOT_TURNIN|The drake is dead? Good. Then Glassroot can breathe again.\nI will send word ahead. From the hollow, take the forest road northwest to Telwynd; Warden Sairveth Ilyr will receive you. Consider this a narrow measure of trust, not a welcome.
DIALOGUE_EIRADHA_GLASSROOT_REMINDER|Glassroot Hollow first. Leave Highmark, take the east road from the crossroads, and follow it southeast into the Veiled Wood. Kill the blackglass drake feeding there. Until the hollow is clear, Telwynd keeps its gates shut.
DIALOGUE_EIRADHA_GLASSROOT_START|Highmark does not usually send armed strangers to my door. Since you are here, I will be plain.\nTelwynd is closed to you for now. Glassroot Hollow lies east from the crossroads outside Highmark; follow the road as it bends southeast into the Veiled Wood. A blackglass drake is feeding there.\nClear the hollow and return to me. Do that, and I may have room for a narrow measure of trust.
DIALOGUE_SAIRVETH_GLASSROOT_TURNIN|Glassroot Hollow is clear? Then Telwynd can receive you properly. The town owes you passage.\nUse the forest road back toward Glassroot when you leave, and do not test side trails. I can help with ordinary wardwork while you are here.
DIALOGUE_SAIRVETH_TELWYND_CLOSED|Telwynd is closed to guests while Glassroot Hollow is held by the drake. Kill it, then return by the same forest road. Do not test side trails.
DIALOGUE_SAIRVETH_MOONWELL_TURNIN|You reached the far exit? Good. The Moonwell Tunnels can carry wardens again.\nTake the ward pay and this ring. Highmark will have fewer excuses to close the tunnel route.
DIALOGUE_SAIRVETH_MOONWELL_REMINDER|Moonwell Tunnels still need both moonstone dials set. Reach the far exit, then return. Until then, I keep it off our patrol map.
DIALOGUE_SAIRVETH_MOONWELL_START|The Moonwell Tunnels run below the high route, from the Moonwell site toward the southwest exit. Highmark leaves them closed; Telwynd needs another way through.\nSet both moonstone dials, reach the far exit, and return to me. If you can walk it end to end, I can send wardens after you.
DIALOGUE_SAIRVETH_HIGHWIND_FOUND_CATACOMBS|You found the Highwind Catacombs? Then the lower door still opens.\nTelwynd needed proof, and you brought it. Good work.
DIALOGUE_SAIRVETH_HIGHWIND_ASK_THERYN|The chapel wardwork is still sound, and it points below the monastery.\nOld Theryn Rusk knows the Highwind grounds. Ask him where the lower entrance opens.
DIALOGUE_SAIRVETH_HIGHWIND_MONASTERY_REMINDER|Highwind Monastery first. Inspect the old chapel and return to me before you chase a lower door.
DIALOGUE_SAIRVETH_ELDERWYRM_TURNIN|Caerwyn est mort? Then Elderwyrm Grove can be held again.\nI will ouvre le Telwynd porte et send wardworkers through. They va a hold le grove, pas loot it.
DIALOGUE_SAIRVETH_VEILED_PATHS_OPEN|The sealed passage by the Ancient Dwarven Gate should answer now. Glassroot gave you enough standing with Telwynd.\nReturn below the gate and touch the elven wardwork. If it opens, stay on the main grove path.
DIALOGUE_SAIRVETH_HIGHWIND_START|Highwind Monastery has Telwynd wardwork under White Seal repairs, and there may be a lower door beneath the chapel.\nGo there, inspect the old chapel, then return. If the work is still sound, I will send you to the man who knows the lower entrance.
DIALOGUE_SAIRVETH_IDLE|Telwynd paths are not open to travelers. Bring me sealed doors, true shards, or broken wards before you test them.\nFor ordinary wardwork, speak plainly and I will see what can be done.
DIALOGUE_EIVYSS_BLACKGLASS_TABLE_LOCKED|No. Not yet. Sairveth has not vouched for your White Seal blood. Settle that with him first, then I will look at your shard.
DIALOGUE_EIVYSS_BLACKGLASS_TABLE_OPEN|Sairveth vouched for you. Put true blackglass shards on the copper tray; I can set one into wards, staves, circlets, and Telwynd work.
DIALOGUE_EIVYSS_BLACKGLASS_TABLE_LIMITS|One shard, one finished piece. Stronger work waits until Sairveth opens more of the table.
DIALOGUE_EIVYSS_MOONWELL_ATTUNE_DONE|The lens is attuned. Install it at the moonwell.
DIALOGUE_EIVYSS_MOONWELL_INSTALL|Le lens est tuned. Prends it a Moonwell Observatory et seat it dans le frame. My table est fait avec it.
DIALOGUE_EIVYSS_MOONWELL_RETURN_VEYDRAS|Le lens est seated? Then Veydras a besoin de le reading. Retourne a him dans le White Sceau building.
DIALOGUE_EIVYSS_ELDERWYRM_START|The elderwyrm grove is troubled.\nReclaim it for the grove.
DIALOGUE_AELTHIR_GROVE_TABLE_CLOSED|Le grove table stays packed until Sairveth opens le porte. If Caerwyn calme holds Elderwyrm Grove, va back a Telwynd et settle cela premier.
DIALOGUE_AELTHIR_GROVE_MAGIC_OPEN|Gate open, crates tied down, ward line steady. Browse if you need grove work; step back if the old well flares.
DIALOGUE_SMUGGLER_LOCKBOX_DONE|Le bas cove est finished. If le guet asks, vous saw wet crates et mort bandits. Leave mon name out of it.
DIALOGUE_SMUGGLER_LOCKBOX_HANDIN|Put it sur le ground by le wall. Do pas ouvre it. Le sceau est calme shut. Je paie for shut boxes.
DIALOGUE_SMUGGLER_LOCKBOX_PAY|Bien. Old Snapjaw est mort, la boite est revenue, et je peux partir avant que les acheteurs viennent poser des questions. Prends la paie de la boite.
DIALOGUE_SMUGGLER_LOCKBOX_ROUTE|Bring the lockbox from the grotto.
DIALOGUE_SMUGGLER_SEAL_HANDIN|That is my seal. You did the job clean, so I will pay what I promised.
DIALOGUE_SMUGGLER_LOCKBOX_AFTER_SEAL|There is one more thing in that grotto: an iron lockbox in the lower cove. Bring it back shut and I will pay better coin.
DIALOGUE_SMUGGLER_LOCKBOX_OFFER_AFTER_SEAL|You brought the seal back clean. If you want the better pay, go back to the same grotto and find my iron lockbox in the lower cove. Bring it back shut.
DIALOGUE_SMUGGLER_SEAL_ROUTE|Prends la route est de Havenford vers Roi's Barrow, puis tourne au sud depuis la route du tertre vers Smuggler Grotto. Apporte back mon lead sceau.
DIALOGUE_SMUGGLER_SEAL_START_PRESSURE|Garde votre voix down. Vous sont pas Havenford guet, et le grotto crew will pas know votre face. Bien.
DIALOGUE_SMUGGLER_SEAL_START_ROUTE|Take the east road from Havenford toward King's Barrow, then turn south to Smuggler Grotto. Bring back my lead seal whole, and I pay.
DIALOGUE_MERRIT_REPAIRED_SHOP_OPEN|Havenford Corner est ouvre. Rings dans le tray, charms dans le case, et small bottles behind mon hand. What can Je show vous, if votre monnaie est honest?
DIALOGUE_MERRIT_TRAVEL_CASE_DAMAGE|Kobolds broke mon door et left smoke dans le shutters. Until Havenford Corner est mended, ce travel case est mon shop.
DIALOGUE_MERRIT_TRAVEL_CASE_STOCK|Rings et charms premier. Small bottles if vous avez monnaie. Demande avant touching le wrapped row.
DIALOGUE_THRUNNA_ORC_FORTRESS_DONE|No new raids from the Orc Fortress. Stonecleft still keeps shields on the wagons, but Gorvuk's warband is broken.
DIALOGUE_THRUNNA_ORC_FORTRESS_TURNIN|Gorvuk is dead? Good. A palisade can still hold raiders, but it has lost command.
DIALOGUE_THRUNNA_ORC_FORTRESS_REWARD|Take this hammer and the road pay. Stonecleft pays for road work. I will put shields back on the wagon line.
DIALOGUE_THRUNNA_ORC_FORTRESS_REMINDER_ROUTE|Take the west road out of Stonecleft, then follow the rough track southwest to the Orc Fortress.
DIALOGUE_THRUNNA_NEEDS_FORTRESS_SKETCH|Stonecleft keeps its gates with patience and hard boots. If you are heading west, keep your shield hand free and do not trust quiet hills.
DIALOGUE_THRUNNA_HALF_ORC_REFUSAL|Garde le sketch. Je will pas write a half-orc into Stonecleft orders against an orc palisade. Cela est mon answer.
DIALOGUE_THRUNNA_ORC_FORTRESS_TOO_GREEN|Not yet. That sketch shows trouble bigger than a road scrape. Keep it safe while I weigh the road risk.
DIALOGUE_THRUNNA_ORC_FORTRESS_MAP_HANDIN_READ|Outer wall, dug rooms, watch posts, and Gorvuk's sign. That is an orc fortress, not a camp.
DIALOGUE_THRUNNA_ORC_FORTRESS_MAP_HANDIN_ASK|I am keeping the sketch. Go up there, break the warband, kill Gorvuk, and return. Hammer and coin if you come back alive.
DIALOGUE_BOREK_ORC_FORTRESS_DONE|No fresh orc cuts sur le ouest track. Gorvuk's crew a stopped dragging logs across our route.
DIALOGUE_BOREK_SKETCH_TO_THRUNNA|The western track is quiet for now. Thrunna decides the rest.
DIALOGUE_BOREK_TOO_GREEN|Not yet. That fort is Stonecleft road business now, not trail gossip.
DIALOGUE_BOREK_SKETCH_DELIVERY|A trader left this after hearing you came back from Old Cave. It shows an orc palisade west of Stonecleft. Take it to the gate warden; she will know if it matches scout reports.
DIALOGUE_BORRI_RESCUED_REPEAT|Safe at the gatehall, thanks to you. The orcs won't take me again.
DIALOGUE_BORRI_RESCUE|By the forge, I thought those orcs had me. I can make the gatehall if the route is clear. You have my thanks.
DIALOGUE_BORRI_HELM_REWARD|I made it back. This helm is yours now, and better in your hands than locked in a dwarf chest.
DIALOGUE_MAVETH_FARMER_THOM_HOME|Thom est home. Bruised et thin, but home. Le nord fence can wait; Je am keeping him by le hearth today.
DIALOGUE_MAVETH_FARMER_THOM_RETURNED|Thom est revenu. Secoue jusqu'aux os, mais revenu. Merci. Je commencais a compter quels voisins pourraient m'aider a creuser.
DIALOGUE_MAVETH_FARMER_REMINDER_SHRINE|As-tu trouve le moindre signe de Thom? Chaque heure rend plus dur de pretendre qu'il a seulement perdu le chemin.
DIALOGUE_MAVETH_FARMER_REMINDER_GOBLIN|As-tu trouve le moindre signe de Thom? Chaque heure rend plus dur de pretendre qu'il a seulement perdu le chemin.
DIALOGUE_MAVETH_FARMER_START_PRESSURE|Voyageur, stop. Thom left by le nord fence ce morning, et le hands sont already walking over his tracks.
DIALOGUE_MAVETH_FARMER_START_SHRINE|Thom a suivi des traces au-dela de la cloture nord et n'est jamais rentre. Je ne sais pas ou la piste l'a mene. Trouve-le, s'il est vivant, ou rapporte-moi la verite s'il ne l'est pas.
DIALOGUE_MAVETH_FARMER_START_GOBLIN|Thom a suivi des traces au-dela de la cloture nord et n'est jamais rentre. Je ne sais pas ou la piste l'a mene. Trouve-le, s'il est vivant, ou rapporte-moi la verite s'il ne l'est pas.
DIALOGUE_THOM_LOST_REPEAT|Je am coming. Give moi one breath, then point moi toward Maveth's field.
DIALOGUE_THOM_LOST_RESCUE|Havenford? Maveth sent vous? Garde le way clear. Je can walk if Je do pas look back.
DIALOGUE_THOM_WOLD_REWARD|Maveth says Je owe vous. She est right. Prends ce lucky charm. It kept moi steady long enough a get home.
DIALOGUE_THOM_WOLD_HOME_IDLE|Maveth a moi inside le nord fence et off le route. Je am pas arguing today.
DIALOGUE_NOTHAS_THOM_FOUND|Vous found Thom near Havenford? Thank vous. Je avez porter paie et little else, but his name can stay sur le family slate.
DIALOGUE_NOTHAS_THOM_MISSING_HINT|My brother Thom farms by Havenford's nord fence. If vous travel ouest, demande Maveth Wold about him. Le dernier Havenford cart brought no word.
DIALOGUE_HARREN_TUTORIAL_START|Tu es enfin réveillé. Ton père m'avait dit que le jour viendrait où l'amulette commencerait à s'agiter - et je prie pour qu'il ait exagéré ce qui vient. Je retourne au temple; à partir d'ici tu es seul. Prends la route de l'est sans tarder. Trouve le maître du quai à Brindle Quay et donne-lui ce billet. Il te fera passer jusqu'à Valoria. Il reste des provisions dans la caisse, prends-les et file vers l'est. La route sera dure, petit; suis l'amulette et tâche de rester en vie.
DIALOGUE_HARREN_TUTORIAL_REMINDER|Allez, bouge. Le quai est à l'est d'ici.
DIALOGUE_GARRAN_NO_NOTE|On travaille ici. Si tu n'es pas là pour aider, pousse-toi.
DIALOGUE_GARRAN_NOTE_HANDIN|Harren a écrit ça? Hm. Je vois. Inquiétant. On dirait qu'il y a pire à craindre que la mer démontée. Bon, la coque a encore besoin de réparations; l'arrivée d'hier soir a tourné au désastre et nous a ouvert un trou sur la moitié du bordé.
DIALOGUE_GARRAN_SLEEP_AT_INN|Ce sera prêt demain matin. Va dormir et reviens aux premières lueurs. Il devrait rester une chambre à l'auberge.
DIALOGUE_GARRAN_SLEEP_REMINDER|Je travaillais encore sur le bateau avant que tu m'interrompes. Va prendre une chambre à l'auberge et reviens demain matin, à moins que tu veuilles nager jusqu'à Valoria.
DIALOGUE_GARRAN_READY_TO_SAIL|Rested? Good. Captain Thauld is ready for Reedwater Docks. The water has grown mean and the inland roads are worse, so once you are ashore, follow the north road toward Havenford.
DIALOGUE_BRECK_START_CHECK|Vous la. Si vous quittez Brindle Quay, montrez-moi une action de classe sur le mannequin d'entrainement. Je veux la voir avant votre depart.
DIALOGUE_BRECK_START_INPUT|Utilisez {class_actions} sur le mannequin d'entrainement. Je veux voir une action de classe propre avant votre rapport.
DIALOGUE_BRECK_ACTION_USED|Bien. Garde it pret sur le route. In a real fight, utilise it avant vous start bleeding.
DIALOGUE_BRECK_FIGHT_DONE|Vous made it back. Bien. Garde votre class action pret for Reedwater.
DIALOGUE_ORRIN_ROOM_NOT_READY|No bed yet, voyageur. Garran a pas sent word, et Je am keeping le spare room closed.
DIALOGUE_ORRIN_ROOM_READY|Garran sent vous? Then le spare room est yours. Key est sur le peg; sommeil now if vous want Thauld's bateau at premier light.
DIALOGUE_TUTORIAL_INN_REST_MORNING|Morning, voyageur. Thauld's crew est already sur le pier. Eat if vous besoin de a, then va see Garran.
DIALOGUE_TUTORIAL_INN_REST_CAMP_KIT|Prends ce rough camping kit de le storeroom. Utilise it outside town when vous besoin de sommeil et there est no auberge nearby.
UI_OPTIONS_LANGUAGE_SYSTEM|Systeme
UI_OPTIONS_LANGUAGE_SYSTEM_VALUE|Systeme ({0})
SPELL_SELF_ENLARGE|Vous lancez Agrandissement et votre corps gonfle de force.
SPELL_SELF_REDUCE|Vous lancez Réduction. Votre corps se contracte vers l'interieur.
SPELL_CAST_CAUSE_LIGHT_WOUNDS|Vous imposez Infliger blessures legeres a {0}
SPELL_CAST_CAUSE_MODERATE_WOUNDS|Vous imposez Infliger blessures moderees a {0}
SPELL_CAST_CAUSE_SERIOUS_WOUNDS|Vous imposez Infliger blessures graves a {0}
SPELL_CAST_CAUSE_CRITICAL_WOUNDS|Vous imposez Infliger blessures critiques a {0}
STATUS_ENLARGE_FADES|Votre corps agrandi redevient normal.
STATUS_REDUCE_FADES|Your reduced body returns to normal.
ITEM_TARGET_OIL_LESSER_CONSECRATION|Choisissez une arme a anoint avec weak huile of consecration.
ITEM_TARGET_OIL_STRONG_CONSECRATION|Choisissez une arme a anoint avec strong huile of consecration.
ITEM_COATING_APPLY_OIL_LESSER_CONSECRATION|Vous oignez {0} avec weak huile of consecration.
ITEM_COATING_APPLY_OIL_STRONG_CONSECRATION|Vous oignez {0} avec strong huile of consecration.
ITEM_USE_POTION_ENLARGE|Vous buvez le {0}. Votre corps swells avec force.
ITEM_USE_POTION_REDUCE|Vous buvez le {0}. Votre corps contracts inward.
ITEM_USE_POTION_NO_EFFECT|Vous drink le {0}, but it a no effect.
ITEM_USE_POTION_HARM|Vous buvez le {0}. Pain tears through vous for {1:%d} degats.
ITEM_USE_POTION_ACID|Vous buvez le {0}. Acid burns through vous for {1:%d} degats.
ITEM_USE_POTION_BURNING|Vous buvez le {0}. Fire tears through vous for {1:%d} degats.
ITEM_USE_POTION_WEAKNESS|Vous buvez le {0}. Force drains de votre limbs.
ITEM_USE_POTION_SLOWNESS|Vous buvez le {0}. Votre corps tours lourd et slow.
ITEM_USE_POTION_SILENCE|Vous buvez le {0}. Votre voix vanishes dans votre throat.
ITEM_USE_POTION_FEAR|Vous buvez le {0}. Terror clamps down inside vous.
ITEM_USE_POTION_SLEEP|Vous buvez le {0}. Sleep drags at votre yeux.
ITEM_USE_POTION_PARALYSIS|Vous buvez le {0}. Votre muscles lock dans place.
ITEM_THROW_POTION_WEAKEN|Vous lancez {0} sur {1} et sap its strength{2}.
ITEM_THROW_POTION_SLOW|Vous lancez {0} sur {1}; it slows{2}.
ITEM_THROW_POTION_SILENCE|Vous lancez {0} sur {1}; its voix dies{2}.
ITEM_THROW_POTION_FEAR|Vous lancez {0} sur {1}; terror locks it dans place{2}.
ITEM_THROW_POTION_SLEEP|Vous lancez {0} sur {1}; it slumps into sommeil{2}.
ITEM_THROW_POTION_PARALYZE|Vous lancez {0} sur {1}; it freezes dans place{2}.
ITEM_THROW_POTION_SELF|Vous lancez {0} sur vous-meme.
ITEM_THROW_POTION_HEAL|Vous lancez {0} sur {1}, soignant {2:%d} HP.
ITEM_THROW_POTION_RESTORE_MP|Vous lancez {0} sur {1}, restaurant {2:%d} MP.
ITEM_THROW_POTION_RESTORE_PP|Vous lancez {0} sur {1}, restaurant {2:%d} PP.
ITEM_THROW_POTION_CURE|Vous lancez {0} sur {1}, purifiant an ailment.
