CLASS_FEATURE_APPRENTICE_WIZARD_NAME|Mage apprenti
CLASS_FEATURE_APPRENTICE_WIZARD_SUMMARY|MP se régénère plus vite. Les généralistes gagnent +1 tour de magie et +1 sort de départ; les spécialistes gagnent School Mastery 1.
CLASS_FEATURE_APPRENTICE_WIZARD_SHORT_SUMMARY|MP plus rapide; généraliste sorts bonus; spécialiste School Mastery 1.
CLASS_FEATURE_APPRENTICE_WIZARD_GENERALIST_SUMMARY|MP se régénère plus vite. Gagne +1 choix de tour de magie et +1 sort de départ.
CLASS_FEATURE_APPRENTICE_WIZARD_GENERALIST_SHORT_SUMMARY|MP plus rapide; +1 choix de tour de magie; +1 sort de départ.
CLASS_FEATURE_APPRENTICE_WIZARD_SPECIALIST_SUMMARY|MP se régénère plus vite. Gagne School Mastery 1 dans votre école choisie.
CLASS_FEATURE_APPRENTICE_WIZARD_SPECIALIST_SHORT_SUMMARY|MP plus rapide; School Mastery 1.
CLASS_FEATURE_ADEPT_WIZARD_NAME|Mage adepte
CLASS_FEATURE_ADEPT_WIZARD_SUMMARY|Les généralistes réduisent les coûts des sorts arcaniques de 1 MP. Les spécialistes gagnent School Mastery 2 et école -1 MP.
CLASS_FEATURE_ADEPT_WIZARD_SHORT_SUMMARY|Généraliste arcanique -1 MP; spécialiste School Mastery 2.
CLASS_FEATURE_ADEPT_WIZARD_GENERALIST_SUMMARY|Les sorts arcaniques coûtent 1 MP de moins.
CLASS_FEATURE_ADEPT_WIZARD_GENERALIST_SHORT_SUMMARY|Arcanique -1 MP.
CLASS_FEATURE_ADEPT_WIZARD_SPECIALIST_SUMMARY|Gagne School Mastery 2. Les sorts de l'école choisie coûtent 1 MP de moins.
CLASS_FEATURE_ADEPT_WIZARD_SPECIALIST_SHORT_SUMMARY|School Mastery 2; école -1 MP.
CLASS_FEATURE_GRAND_WIZARD_PATH_NAME|Grand mage
CLASS_FEATURE_GRAND_WIZARD_PATH_SUMMARY|La régénération de MP s'améliore encore. Les généralistes gagnent +1 arcane attack/DC; les spécialistes gagnent School Mastery 3 et école -2 MP.
CLASS_FEATURE_GRAND_WIZARD_PATH_SHORT_SUMMARY|Second gain de MP; généraliste +1 attack/DC; spécialiste School Mastery 3.
CLASS_FEATURE_GRAND_WIZARD_PATH_GENERALIST_SUMMARY|La régénération de MP s'améliore encore. Les attaques de sorts arcaniques et les save DCs gagnent +1.
CLASS_FEATURE_GRAND_WIZARD_PATH_GENERALIST_SHORT_SUMMARY|Gain de MP; arcanique +1 attack/DC.
CLASS_FEATURE_GRAND_WIZARD_PATH_SPECIALIST_SUMMARY|La régénération de MP s'améliore encore. Gagne School Mastery 3. Les sorts de l'école choisie coûtent 2 MP de moins.
CLASS_FEATURE_GRAND_WIZARD_PATH_SPECIALIST_SHORT_SUMMARY|Gain de MP; School Mastery 3; école -2 MP.
CLASS_FEATURE_WIZARD_ARCHMAGE_NAME|Archimage
CLASS_FEATURE_WIZARD_ARCHMAGE_SUMMARY|Les généralistes atteignent arcane -2 MP et +2 attack/DC. Les spécialistes gagnent School Mastery 4 et école -3 MP.
CLASS_FEATURE_WIZARD_ARCHMAGE_SHORT_SUMMARY|Généraliste arcanique -2 MP et +2 attack/DC; spécialiste School Mastery 4.
CLASS_FEATURE_WIZARD_ARCHMAGE_GENERALIST_SUMMARY|Les sorts arcaniques coûtent 2 MP de moins et gagnent +2 attack/DC.
CLASS_FEATURE_WIZARD_ARCHMAGE_GENERALIST_SHORT_SUMMARY|Arcanique -2 MP; +2 attack/DC.
CLASS_FEATURE_WIZARD_ARCHMAGE_SPECIALIST_SUMMARY|Gagne School Mastery 4. Les sorts de l'école choisie coûtent 3 MP de moins.
CLASS_FEATURE_WIZARD_ARCHMAGE_SPECIALIST_SHORT_SUMMARY|School Mastery 4; école -3 MP.
UI_STATUS_LOCATION_HAVENFORD_MINES|[HM{0:%d}]
CATALOG_LOCATION_HAVENFORD_MINES_SUMMARY|Havenford Mines is a small worked mine in the mountains east of Havenford.
CATALOG_LOCATION_HAVENFORD_MINES_DETAIL|Its timbered rooms and stone corridors are blocked by boulders and occupied by kobolds, rats, and cave vermin.
CATALOG_LOCATION_HAVENFORD_MINES_ENEMIES|kobolds, giant rats, cave spiders
STORY_MSG_QUEST_UPDATE_RETURN_BRANNOC|Quest updated: return to Brannoc in Havenford.
DIALOGUE_BRANNOC_HAVENFORD_START|The Havenford mine is in the eastern mountains. Break the huge boulders on the lower levels so ore can move again. Kobolds are in there, so bring a weapon.
DIALOGUE_BRANNOC_HAVENFORD_REMINDER|Havenford Mines, east of town. Break the huge boulders around the lower stairs so ore can move again.
DIALOGUE_BRANNOC_HAVENFORD_TURNIN|That is Havenford stone, all right. Good work. The way is open again.
DIALOGUE_BRANNOC_HAVENFORD_REWARD|Thanks. Here, take this for your trouble.
DIALOGUE_BRANNOC_HAVENFORD_DONE|Forge is open. If you need gear, say so.
QUEST_LOG_HAVENFORD_MINES_RETURN_TITLE|Havenford Mines
QUEST_LOG_HAVENFORD_MINES_RETURN_OBJECTIVE|Return to Brannoc in Havenford.
QUEST_LOG_HAVENFORD_MINES_RETURN_DETAIL|The huge boulders are broken. Brannoc can reopen the ore route and improve his forge stock.
QUEST_LOG_HAVENFORD_MINES_TITLE|Havenford Mines
QUEST_LOG_HAVENFORD_MINES_OBJECTIVE|Break the huge boulders in Havenford Mines.
QUEST_LOG_HAVENFORD_MINES_DETAIL|Brannoc needs the lower mine stairs opened so ore carts can move again. Havenford Mines lies in the mountains east of Havenford.
