CLASS_FEATURE_BATTLE_HARDENED_SHORT_SUMMARY|Recuperi HP piu in fretta e ottieni +1 ATK e +1 DEF.
CLASS_FEATURE_WEAPON_SPECIALIZATION_NAME|Specializzazione Arma
