CLASS_FEATURE_HOLD_THE_LINE_SUMMARY|Ottieni +1 DEF e +3 ARM.
CLASS_FEATURE_HOLD_THE_LINE_SHORT_SUMMARY|Ottieni +1 DEF e +3 ARM.
