CLASS_FEATURE_VETERAN_DRILL_SHORT_SUMMARY|Ottieni +1 ATK e +1 DEF.
CLASS_FEATURE_HEROIC_RESOLVE_NAME|Fermezza Eroica
CLASS_FEATURE_HEROIC_RESOLVE_SUMMARY|A meta HP o meno, ottieni +1 ATK, +1 DEF, +3 ARM e +1 DMG.
CLASS_FEATURE_HEROIC_RESOLVE_SHORT_SUMMARY|A meta HP o meno, ottieni +1 ATK, +1 DEF, +3 ARM e +1 DMG.
