ITEM_SILVER_RUNED_BLACKGLASS_STAFF_HIGH_ENCHANTER_DESC|A polished blackglass staff with silver inlays from grip to crown. It grants +2 DEF, +4 ARM, +1 arcane spell attack, +1 arcane spell DC, and arcane spells cost 2 less MP.
ITEM_STAR_SEWN_BLACK_ROBE_STARVEIN_NAME|toglia nera cucita con stelle "Starvein"
ITEM_STAR_SEWN_BLACK_ROBE_STARVEIN_DESC|A black robe woven with pale starvein thread and small blackglass ward plates. It grants +5 DEF, +16 ARM, +2 arcane spell damage, and improves MP regeneration.
