ITEM_LIGHTGLASS_RELIQUARY_MACE_DESC|Una mazza pallida di lightglass con una piccola reliquia sigillata dietro la testa. Gli incantesimi divini costano 1 PP in meno, e i colpi infliggono +3 danni a draci e Scar-spawn.
ITEM_LIGHTGLASS_LONGSWORD_NAME|spada lunga in lightglass
ITEM_LIGHTGLASS_LONGSWORD_DESC|A swift lightglass longsword with a pale core running through the blade. Hits deal +4 damage to drakes and Scar-spawn.
