DIALOGUE_STONECLEFT_GATEHALL_LAMP_TURNIN|Set the oil and rations here. Harl counts them into the gatehall shelves and pays you now.
DIALOGUE_STONECLEFT_GATEHALL_LAMP_MISSING|The gatehall shelves are still short. Harl needs ten rations and ten oil flasks before he can sign off the run.
DIALOGUE_STONECLEFT_GATEHALL_LAMP_COUNT|Right now you carry {0} rations and {1} oil flasks.
DIALOGUE_STONECLEFT_SUPPLY_LAMP_REMINDER|Lamp run is still yours. Harl Brack at the gatehall needs ten rations and ten oil flasks; buy what you are short before you report in.
DIALOGUE_STONECLEFT_SUPPLY_LAMP_START|Paid lamp run, if you want it. Gatehall's lower posts are short: ten rations and ten oil flasks to Harl Brack upstairs. Bring them yourself, and he pays when they reach his shelves.
QUEST_LOG_STONECLEFT_LAMP_RUN_OBJECTIVE|Bring 10 rations and 10 oil flasks to Harl Brack in Stonecleft Gatehall.
QUEST_LOG_STONECLEFT_LAMP_RUN_DETAIL_LOAD|Sellan asked me to supply the gatehall lower lamp posts. I have {0} rations and {1} oil flasks; Harl Brack needs ten of each.
STORY_NPC_DETAIL_BRETHRA|She keeps field kits near the counter and oil flasks sealed under waxed cloth.
