NPC_LINE_LABORER_2|近くの人物が街道の状況を話す。
NPC_LINE_LABORER_3|Eastern-road loads leave before the count is full. Better late crates than lost backs.
NPC_LINE_PILGRIM_1|近くの人物が街道の状況を話す。
NPC_LINE_PILGRIM_2|Three altar marks wake the plain charm. The first is hope. The second is blisters.
NPC_LINE_PILGRIM_3|近くの人物が街道の状況を話す。
