STORY_MSG_WATCHTOWER_PRISM_RESONATES|The fractured prism pulses in your hand. Your amulet answers with a hard, low vibration.
ITEM_FRACTURED_BLACKGLASS_PRISM_NAME|Fractured Blackglass Prism
ITEM_FRACTURED_BLACKGLASS_PRISM_DESC|芯にひびが入り、内側でかすかに脈打つ光を宿した、小さく歪んだ黒玻璃のプリズム。
STORY_MSG_QUEST_UPDATE_COLLECT_BLACKGLASS_SHARD|Quest updated: collect the blackglass shard.
STORY_MSG_QUEST_UPDATE_RETURN_STARFALL_SCHOLAR|Quest updated: take the blackglass shard back to Scholar Cael.
DIALOGUE_ALDREN_WATCHTOWER_START|There is one more matter, and I do not like speaking of it. The ruined watchtower west of town has stood empty for years, but strange lights now show from its sealed upper room. That is old stone, older than our little worries. I am giving you the old key for the upper stair door. Go carefully, see what woke there, and bring back whatever you find.
DIALOGUE_ALDREN_WATCHTOWER_REMINDER|The ruined watchtower still shows lights from the sealed upper room. Use the old key I gave you for the upper stair door, find the cause, and bring it back.
DIALOGUE_ALDREN_WATCHTOWER_REPORT|封じられた床から割れたプリズムだと？ いや、それは村の仕事を超えている。お前の護符がその脈動に応えているし、私にはそんな物を扱う知識がない。
DIALOGUE_ALDREN_WATCHTOWER_TO_SCHOLAR|Take it to Scholar Cael at Traveller's Rest. He studies old stone, star glass, and other matters I would rather not misname. Follow the north road from town, turn east at the fork, and keep on until you see the inn.
DIALOGUE_TRAVELLERS_REST_SCHOLAR_WATCHTOWER_COMPLETE|Aldrenの使いだな？ よし。プリズムを慎重に置け。私がガラスに触れる前からお前の護符が反応している。つまりこれは村の見張り塔より古く、ずっと容赦がない。見せてくれ。
DIALOGUE_TRAVELLERS_REST_SCHOLAR_ROOT_START|この裂け目にはまだStarfallの力が残っている。多くはないが、見張り塔の先にある古い巣穴を指すには十分だ。Starfall Burrowは長く静かすぎた。そこでプリズムが目覚めたなら、下の何かもお前の護符に応えるかもしれない。降りて、何が守っているか確かめ、旅に耐えて残った真実を持ち帰れ。
DIALOGUE_TRAVELLERS_REST_SCHOLAR_ROOT_REMINDER|Starfall Burrow is straight north from Ruined Watchtower. Go north from the tower and you cannot miss the broken ridge mouth. Search it, then come back if your amulet reacts or you find what woke the prism.
DIALOGUE_TRAVELLERS_REST_SCHOLAR_ROOT_COMPLETE|The drake fell in the burrow.
DIALOGUE_TRAVELLERS_REST_SCHOLAR_ROOT_HIGHMARK_LEAD|Take the fragment to Highmark and speak with the White Seal. The road north starts at South Gate, runs through Stonecleft, and climbs The Underway to North Gate. Show the dwarves what you carry and make for the capital.
DIALOGUE_TRAVELLERS_REST_SCHOLAR_ROOT_REWARD|Take this for the road. The Underway is no safe country, but it is the only road to Highmark.
DIALOGUE_TRAVELLERS_REST_SCHOLAR_ROOT_DONE|Do not linger on my account. Highmark and the White Seal need to see that fragment before rumor outruns you.
QUEST_LOG_WATCHTOWER_START_OBJECTIVE|尾根の先にある廃監視塔を調査する。
QUEST_LOG_WATCHTOWER_START_DETAIL|Aldren said lights show at the ruined watchtower past the ridge, and he gave me the old key for the sealed upper stair door. I should investigate the upper room and bring back whatever stirs there.
QUEST_LOG_WATCHTOWER_SEARCH_OBJECTIVE|Search the top room of Ruined Watchtower.
QUEST_LOG_WATCHTOWER_SEARCH_DETAIL|Aldren gave me the old key for the sealed upper stair door. I should search the Ruined Watchtower, find the prism, and bring it back before the stirring grows worse.
QUEST_LOG_WATCHTOWER_RETURN_CHIEF_OBJECTIVE|割れたプリズムをAldrenへ返す。
QUEST_LOG_WATCHTOWER_RETURN_CHIEF_DETAIL|割れたプリズムは監視塔から出た。護符がその脈動に応じている。HavenfordのAldrenに見せるべきだ。
QUEST_LOG_WATCHTOWER_TO_SCHOLAR_OBJECTIVE|Take the fractured prism to Cael Orven at Traveller's Rest.
QUEST_LOG_WATCHTOWER_TO_SCHOLAR_DETAIL|The fractured prism came from the watchtower, and Aldren says Scholar Cael at Traveller's Rest must see it. I should take the north road from Havenford, turn east at the fork, and keep on until I see the inn.
QUEST_WATCHTOWER_PRISM_NAME|The Road to Highmark II: The Ruined Watchtower
QUEST_WATCHTOWER_PRISM_ACHIEVEMENT|has recovered the Watchtower prism!
