UI_CHARACTER_SECTION_ATTRIBUTES_DETAIL|Core scores. Details show which systems use each modifier.
UI_CHARACTER_ATTRIBUTE_STRENGTH_MELEE|Combat: modifier adds to melee ATK and melee damage. Two-handed melee damage uses double modifier.
UI_CHARACTER_ATTRIBUTE_STRENGTH_CARRY|Load: STR controls carry capacity and armor-burden thresholds; also used for STR saves and Athletics checks.
UI_CHARACTER_ATTRIBUTE_DEXTERITY_DEFENSE|Combat: modifier adds to DEF and ranged ATK.
UI_CHARACTER_ATTRIBUTE_DEXTERITY_SKILLS|Checks: DEX saves, Stealth, Thievery, Handiwork, trap avoidance, and backstab damage.
UI_CHARACTER_ATTRIBUTE_CONSTITUTION_HP|Durability: modifier adds to max HP per level and CON saves.
UI_CHARACTER_ATTRIBUTE_CONSTITUTION_REGEN|Recovery: each modifier point changes HP regen by 2.5 minutes; positive faster, negative slower.
UI_CHARACTER_ATTRIBUTE_INTELLIGENCE_MP|Resources: positive modifier adds to max MP per level.
UI_CHARACTER_ATTRIBUTE_INTELLIGENCE_ARCANE|Arcane: INT sets arcane spell attacks and save DCs; also used by Lore, Arcana, Appraisal, and unknown-scroll checks.
UI_CHARACTER_ATTRIBUTE_WISDOM_PP|Resources: positive modifier adds to max PP per level.
UI_CHARACTER_ATTRIBUTE_WISDOM_DIVINE|Divine: WIS sets divine spell attacks and save DCs; also used by Awareness, Survival, First Aid, WIS saves, and Regenerate healing.
UI_CHARACTER_ATTRIBUTE_CHARISMA_SOCIAL|Social: CHA affects merchant prices, monster hesitation, and paladin powers. Presence skill is separate.
UI_CHARACTER_ATTRIBUTE_CHARISMA_DEVOTION|Aura: positive modifier adds to Devotion Aura DEF; ARM gets double that amount.
UI_CHARACTER_DETAIL_MODIFIER_SCALE|Modifier scale:\n1-2 = -4\n3-4 = -3\n5-6 = -2\n7-8 = -1\n9-12 = +0\n13-14 = +1\n15-16 = +2\n17-18 = +3\n+1 per 2 points after that.
