STORY_MSG_QUEST_UPDATE_KINGS_BARROW_OPEN|Zadanie zaktualizowane: wejdź do King's Barrow i pokonaj króla Halrica.
STORY_MSG_QUEST_UPDATE_RETURN_TOVAN_HIGHMARK|Zadanie: wróć do Tovana Mere'a w White Seal Antiquities, Highmark.
STORY_MSG_QUEST_UPDATE_RETURN_KESTREL_SCOUT|Zadanie zaktualizowane: wróć do zwiadowcy Kestrel w Camp Kestrel.
STORY_MSG_QUEST_UPDATE_INVESTIGATE_GHOSTWOOD|Zadanie: idź za dymem Ghostwood do wieży i zabij Veyra.
STORY_MSG_QUEST_UPDATE_ASK_THERYN|Zadanie zaktualizowane: zapytaj Starego Theryna Ruska w Havenford.
STORY_MSG_QUEST_UPDATE_RETURN_THOM_HAVENFORD|Zadanie zaktualizowane: wróć do Havenford i porozmawiaj z Thomem Woldem.
STORY_MSG_QUEST_UPDATE_RETURN_EDRAN_HIGHMARK|Zadanie zaktualizowane: wróć do Edrana Vale'a w Highmark.
STORY_MSG_QUEST_UPDATE_RETURN_HIGH_CANON|Quest updated: return to Sacristan Oryn in Highmark.
STORY_MSG_QUEST_UPDATE_RETURN_VEYDRAS|Zadanie zaktualizowane: wróć do Kanonika-Artefaktora Veydrasa Vale'a w Highmark.
STORY_MSG_QUEST_UPDATE_RETURN_ORRICK|Zadanie zaktualizowane: wróć do Orricka Fena w Traveller's Rest.
STORY_MSG_QUEST_UPDATE_RETURN_SAIRVETH|Zadanie zaktualizowane: wróć do Strażniczki Sairveth Ilyr w Telwynd.
STORY_MSG_QUEST_UPDATE_RETURN_KESTREL_WATCH|Zadanie zaktualizowane: wróć do sierżanta straży w Camp Kestrel.
STORY_MSG_QUEST_UPDATE_RETURN_TELWYND_WARDEN|Zadanie zaktualizowane: wróć do Strażniczki Sairveth Ilyr w Telwynd.
STORY_MSG_QUEST_UPDATE_RETURN_RUNEFORGE_CORE|Zadanie zaktualizowane: zwróć rdzeń runicznej kuźni Dorranowi Keenedge'owi.
STORY_MSG_QUEST_UPDATE_RECOVER_RUNEFORGE_CORE|Zadanie zaktualizowane: odzyskaj rdzeń runicznej kuźni z ciał duergarów.
STORY_MSG_QUEST_UPDATE_RETURN_GARRICK|Zadanie zaktualizowane: wróć do Garricka w Havenford.
STORY_MSG_QUEST_UPDATE_RETURN_MAVETH|Zadanie zaktualizowane: wróć do Mavetha Vella w Highmark.
STORY_MSG_QUEST_UPDATE_RETURN_AELRION|Zadanie zaktualizowane: wróć do Aelriona Yewhanda w Telwynd.
STORY_MSG_QUEST_UPDATE_RETURN_HIGHMARK_LANCER|Zadanie zaktualizowane: wróć do Srebrnego Lansjera w Highmark.
STORY_MSG_QUEST_UPDATE_KILL_BROND|Zadanie zaktualizowane: zabij Bronda, czempiona ogrów, w Rockmaw Keep.
STORY_MSG_QUEST_UPDATE_KILL_MAUG|Zadanie zaktualizowane: zabij Mauga, ettina, w Rockmaw Keep.
STORY_MSG_QUEST_UPDATE_OPEN_ROYAL_SARCOPHAGUS|Zadanie zaktualizowane: otwórz królewski sarkofag w King's Barrow.
STORY_MSG_QUEST_UPDATE_RECOVER_LOCKBOX|Zadanie zaktualizowane: odzyskaj kasetkę z dolnej zatoki Smuggler Grotto.
STORY_MSG_QUEST_UPDATE_RETURN_VETHRIN|Zadanie zaktualizowane: wróć do Vethrina Quilla.
STORY_MSG_QUEST_UPDATE_RETURN_VETHRIN_COTTAGE|Quest updated: return to Wizard Vethrin with the Burned Cottage markings.
STORY_MSG_QUEST_UPDATE_SEARCH_DEAD_DUERGAR|Zadanie: przeszukaj martwych duergarów w Floodgate Cistern po rdzeń runeforge.
STORY_MSG_QUEST_UPDATE_RETURN_DORRAN|Zadanie zaktualizowane: wróć do Dorrana Keenedge'a w Stonecleft.
STORY_MSG_QUEST_UPDATE_RETURN_CALDUS|Zadanie zaktualizowane: wróć do Sera Caldusa Renna w Traveller's Rest.
STORY_MSG_QUEST_UPDATE_BRING_DRAKE_SCALE|Zadanie zaktualizowane: przynieś łuskę drake'a Velrze Senn.
STORY_MSG_QUEST_UPDATE_RETURN_BRESS|Zadanie zaktualizowane: wróć do Bressa Daska.
STORY_MSG_QUEST_UPDATE_RETURN_THRUNNA|Quest updated: return to the Stonecleft gate warden.
STORY_MSG_QUEST_UPDATE_RETURN_THAVOSS|Zadanie zaktualizowane: wróć do Starszego Thavossa Cairna w Havenford.
STORY_MSG_QUEST_UPDATE_RETURN_THERYN|Zadanie zaktualizowane: wróć do Starego Theryna Ruska w Havenford.
STORY_MSG_QUEST_DROP_KOBOLD_SCALP|Bierzesz skalp kobolda dla Garricka.
STORY_MSG_QUEST_DROP_GRAVE_BONE|Bierzesz kość grobową dla Garricka.
STORY_MSG_QUEST_DROP_OLDROOT_LEAF|Odcinasz zdatny do użycia liść oldroot.
STORY_MSG_QUEST_DROP_MOONWELL_THREAD|Zbierasz pasmo nici moonwell.
STORY_MSG_QUEST_NOTE_RUNEFORGE_DUERGAR|Notatka zadania: zbrojmistrz Dorran w Stonecleft powinien o tym usłyszeć.
NPC_LINE_EDRIN_1|Do not touch the inkstones. I have them sorted by riverbank, not color.
NPC_LINE_EDRIN_2|Trace the carving first. The stone lies less when it has not been dragged across a table.
NPC_LINE_EDRIN_3|Blackglass chips go in cloth, not bare fingers. I want the edges intact.
NPC_LINE_EDRIN_CAVE_COMPLETE_1|The goblin chief is dead, but the cave still needs a proper look. Goblins do not carve old door marks.
NPC_LINE_EDRIN_CAVE_COMPLETE_2|Old door marks, stamped brick, blackglass dust: wrap it and bring it here before a trader sees it.
NPC_LINE_EDRIN_CAVE_COMPLETE_3|Bring me map scraps, stamped brick, or blackglass before Merrit prices the lot.
NPC_LINE_THERYN_1|Mind the loose pages. I had them in order before the wind and the children found me.
NPC_LINE_THERYN_2|If a shrine scrap names Istaris, bring it here before a merchant sees it.
NPC_LINE_THERYN_3|I read old hands. I do not read wet maps, burned corners, or tavern poems.
NPC_LINE_FARMER_1|The goats kicked through the west rail again. If you pass Bran's place, tell him I need his spare hammer.
NPC_LINE_FARMER_2|Old mill's jammed again. We got three sacks through before the wheel stuck.
NPC_LINE_FARMER_3|Seed cost double this spring, and the fort tax man still wants his share.
NPC_LINE_FARMER_4|Raiders took two sacks from my shed last week. We are boiling oats thin until market day.
NPC_LINE_FARMER_CAVE_STARTED_1|Elder Thavoss says the east cave needs clearing. Good. My pen gate has claw marks all along the hinge.
NPC_LINE_FARMER_CAVE_STARTED_2|We latch the shutters before dusk now. The goblins learned where the goat yard opens.
NPC_LINE_FARMER_CAVE_STARTED_3|If you are working for Thavoss, bring a sharp blade. Those goblins come back fast when they smell grain.
NPC_LINE_FARMER_CAVE_COMPLETE_1|No goblin tracks by the pens this morning. I let the goats out before breakfast.
NPC_LINE_FARMER_CAVE_COMPLETE_2|Slept till sunup for once. Woke up angry at the rooster instead of scared of the ditch.
NPC_LINE_FARMER_CAVE_COMPLETE_3|The raids stopped, but I still latch the pen twice. No tracks this week; my hands do it anyway.
NPC_LINE_BEGGAR_1|Got a heel of bread to spare? Copper's fine too. Hot soup costs two at Nell's.
NPC_LINE_BEGGAR_2|Nell sets yesterday's crusts by the side door. Best not let the dogs see you first.
NPC_LINE_BEGGAR_3|They say blackglass sells south. I say bread sells better when your hands shake.
NPC_LINE_BEGGAR_4|Leave spare food by the commons wall. The little ones check there before dark.
NPC_LINE_BEGGAR_CAVE_COMPLETE_1|Nell put out a full basket this morning. Road must be open enough for flour again.
NPC_LINE_BEGGAR_CAVE_COMPLETE_2|The guards quit snapping at cart wheels. They still watch every stranger.
NPC_LINE_BEGGAR_CAVE_COMPLETE_3|Dogs slept quiet last night. I did too, until the hens started up.
NPC_LINE_DRIFTER_1|East-road ditches turn up buckles, arrows, and lies every dawn.
NPC_LINE_DRIFTER_2|Blackglass cuts through cheap cloth. Wrap it twice before a buyer starts turning it over.
NPC_LINE_DRIFTER_3|Highmark wants cart hands. Havenford is short three, and nobody wants their son on the road.
NPC_LINE_DRIFTER_4|Wagon drivers keep one hand on the reins and one on a knife these days.
NPC_LINE_DRIFTER_5|If Nell closes the side door early, I move to the commons wall. Less shouting there.
NPC_LINE_DRIFTER_CAVE_COMPLETE_1|Fewer goblin prints east of town. I still saw fresh boots by the north milestone.
NPC_LINE_DRIFTER_CAVE_COMPLETE_2|Two carts reached town before noon. Last week we would have heard the shouting from the gate.
NPC_LINE_DRIFTER_CAVE_COMPLETE_3|Folks laughed outside Nell's today. They still barred their shutters before full dark.
NPC_LINE_PEDDLER_1|Come close. Blades, twine, charm knots, and a little ruin salvage in the side roll. Names cost extra.
NPC_LINE_PEDDLER_2|Spare straps, dry tinder, cheap charms. If yours snapped already, the price just went up.
NPC_LINE_PEDDLER_3|Warm blackglass? Old script rings? Show me first. Scholars pay slow unless I press them.
NPC_LINE_HALF_ORC_HUMAN_1|You there. State your business and keep moving.
NPC_LINE_HALF_ORC_HUMAN_2|Coin on the counter first. I do not run tabs for strangers.
NPC_LINE_HALF_ORC_HUMAN_3|Easy now. Keep your hands where I can see them.
NPC_LINE_HALF_ORC_HUMAN_4|No lingering by the houses. The watch has enough complaints today.
NPC_LINE_HALF_ORC_HUMAN_5|Off my doorstep. My children are inside.
NPC_LINE_HALF_ORC_HUMAN_RELIGIOUS_1|Use the lower steps. Chapel doors are crowded enough.
NPC_LINE_HALF_ORC_HUMAN_RELIGIOUS_2|Do not crowd the altar. Say your prayer and make room.
NPC_LINE_HALF_ORC_HUMAN_RELIGIOUS_3|State your need quietly. The sick are sleeping behind the screen.
NPC_LINE_HALF_ORC_PRAGMATIC_1|Coin first, same as everyone.
NPC_LINE_HALF_ORC_PRAGMATIC_2|Your coin spends here. Put it where I can count it.
NPC_LINE_HALF_ORC_PRAGMATIC_3|No trouble by my stall. I just swept that corner.
NPC_LINE_HALF_ORC_PRAGMATIC_4|Buying or browsing? Choose quick; the bread is cooling.
NPC_LINE_HALF_ORC_CHILD_1|Ma said not to stare at tusks.
NPC_LINE_HALF_ORC_CHILD_2|Can you lift a grown man with one hand?
NPC_LINE_HALF_ORC_DWARF_1|Orc blood in my hall? Keep walking.
NPC_LINE_HALF_ORC_DWARF_2|Mind your hands near the clan rail.
NPC_LINE_HALF_ORC_DWARF_3|Buy your meal, drink quiet, and leave.
NPC_LINE_HALF_ORC_DWARF_4|No forge business for you unless Thrunna says so.
NPC_LINE_HALF_ORC_DWARF_5|If you want a room, ask the keeper. If you want clan talk, forget it.
NPC_LINE_HALF_ORC_ELF_1|You may pass. Keep your hands away from the ward lines.
NPC_LINE_HALF_ORC_ELF_2|Wardens know you are here, traveler.
NPC_LINE_HALF_ORC_ELF_3|Old boundaries were written after old griefs. Your step reads loudly against them.
NPC_LINE_HALF_ORC_ELF_4|This grove is not for wandering.
NPC_LINE_HALF_ORC_SOLDIER_1|Clear the line. Shields need room.
NPC_LINE_HALF_ORC_SOLDIER_2|Hands off the stores. Counted crates stay counted.
NPC_LINE_HALF_ORC_SOLDIER_3|Horn sounds, move where I point.
NPC_LINE_HALF_ORC_SOLDIER_4|Got orders? Show them. No orders, move on.
NPC_LINE_STONECLEFT_FILLER_1|The mess line starts after shift change. If you smell barley, you are heading the right way.
NPC_LINE_STONECLEFT_FILLER_2|Commons crew is short two haulers. Watch for carts cutting across the road.
NPC_LINE_STONECLEFT_FILLER_3|Soup's by the hearth. Bread's in the left basket if the miners left any.
NPC_LINE_STONECLEFT_FILLER_4|Hood your lamp near the lower stair. Gate watch hates glare.
NPC_LINE_STONECLEFT_FILLER_5|Mind the east door. Someone spilled ale again.
NPC_LINE_STONECLEFT_FILLER_6|Put borrowed tools back on the hooks. Missing picks start fights.
NPC_LINE_STONECLEFT_FILLER_7|Shake road dust outside. Grit ruins hinges.
NPC_LINE_STONECLEFT_FILLER_8|Underway carts are backed up below. Every crate has a mark and every mark has a clerk.
NPC_LINE_STONECLEFT_FILLER_9|I braced that wall this morning. Hands off until the dust settles.
NPC_LINE_STONECLEFT_FILLER_10|A quarry cart came back with tooth marks in the axle. Thrunna doubled the road watch.
NPC_LINE_STONECLEFT_MASON_1|I chalked that crack this morning. Keep your shoulder off it.
NPC_LINE_STONECLEFT_MASON_2|Need Throkk? Lower stair. Need a wider door? Bring wedges and six strong backs.
NPC_LINE_STONECLEFT_MASON_3|East hall is sound. New stair is not. Walk by the lamps.
NPC_LINE_STONECLEFT_MINER_1|Lift crew is late again. Ask the lower gate guard, not me.
NPC_LINE_STONECLEFT_MINER_2|Black grit in that seam. Tools down, lamps up.
NPC_LINE_STONECLEFT_MINER_3|Old cuts sound hollow in places. Tap before you lean.
NPC_LINE_STONECLEFT_MINER_4|Duergar leave square tool marks. When I see those, I count helmets before ore.
NPC_LINE_STONECLEFT_GUARD_FLAVOR_1|Keep to the main hall. The side doors are work rooms, not shortcuts.
NPC_LINE_STONECLEFT_GUARD_FLAVOR_2|Keep moving near the lower gate. Staring makes the watch nervous.
NPC_LINE_STONECLEFT_GUARD_FLAVOR_3|No loose packs by the stair. If it is yours, carry it; if it is not, leave it.
NPC_LINE_STONECLEFT_GUARD_FLAVOR_4|If the cart crew shouts twice, clear the middle track.
NPC_LINE_TELWYND_WARDWORK_1|Ward glass chips easily. Ask before you touch the bright lenses.
NPC_LINE_TELWYND_WARDWORK_2|Do not step over silver twine. It is not decoration, and it dislikes apology.
NPC_LINE_TELWYND_WARDWORK_3|Old wards wake for old names. New feet must wait until the grove decides how much to hear.
NPC_LINE_TELWYND_WARDWORK_4|The old grove ward is touchy. Scouts clear the path before we carry tools there.
NPC_LINE_TELWYND_PATH_1|The path through the Veiled Wood is quiet. Quiet is not peace; it is the wood listening before it answers.
NPC_LINE_TELWYND_PATH_2|The forest path rewards patience. Hurry, and you find the wrong clearing.
NPC_LINE_TELWYND_PATH_3|Guest paths end at the elder stones. Past them, no guide comes looking.
NPC_LINE_TELWYND_PATH_4|Straight lines through these trees usually mean someone is lost. Telwynd owes strangers no rescue.
NPC_LINE_TELWYND_WORKER_1|Leaf fall hides the old footway. We clear only enough for guests who are expected.
NPC_LINE_TELWYND_WORKER_2|Small tools vanish under moss. Mine stay tied to my belt.
NPC_LINE_TELWYND_WORKER_3|Green shoots cross every line they can. Growth is not innocence; we prune it all the same.
NPC_LINE_TELWYND_WORKER_4|Ghostwood smoke clings to cloth. Wash twice before you sit inside.
NPC_LINE_TELWYND_CHILD_1|The gate wardens know where visitors may walk. I know because I tried every shortcut.
NPC_LINE_TELWYND_CHILD_2|Scouts say guests get lost staring up. Watch the white stones instead.
NPC_LINE_STONECLEFT_LOWER_PASSAGE_1|The lower pass is open, but not friendly. Keep lamps fed and hands clear of side cuts.
NPC_LINE_STONECLEFT_LOWER_PASSAGE_2|No stalls past this post. Count your food, oil, and bandages now.
NPC_LINE_STONECLEFT_LOWER_PASSAGE_3|If you are bound for Highmark, keep north through the Underway and ignore the old cart ruts.
NPC_LINE_KESTREL_FIELD_SUPPLIER_1|Rations, lamp oil, bolts, patched mail. Field packs only; wagon space is for orders.
NPC_LINE_KESTREL_FIELD_SUPPLIER_2|Breach kit is on this table. Pay here, count it here, pack it before you block my line.
NPC_LINE_KESTREL_FIELD_SUPPLIER_3|Tie bottles inside your pack. I am not explaining loose oil to the surgeon again.
NPC_LINE_KESTREL_GUARD_1|North watch holds the road. South watch holds the breach. Horn call means clear a lane.
NPC_LINE_KESTREL_GUARD_2|Blackglass flaking off the Scar wall? Step back and call a sapper.
NPC_LINE_KESTREL_GUARD_3|See those iron pins? Leave them alone. They keep the tents standing.
NPC_LINE_KESTREL_GUARD_4|Rockmaw's west towers burn pitch at dusk. Maug and Brond still hold the keep.
NPC_LINE_KESTREL_GUARD_5|Fill your waterskin before you cross the stake line.
NPC_LINE_KESTREL_SCOUT_1|The west patrol line shifts after the Scar breathes. Watch which way the grass refuses.
NPC_LINE_KESTREL_SCOUT_2|Old tracks lead into the Scar. Mark them and call a sapper; do not wander after them.
NPC_LINE_KESTREL_SCOUT_3|Tracks vanish near the black grit. That does not mean the patrol flew away.
NPC_LINE_KESTREL_SCOUT_4|Ghostwood patrols keep missing the posts. They leave at dusk and come back short a man.
NPC_LINE_KESTREL_SCOUT_5|Map shows no stream in Ghostwood. Three scouts heard water near the tower path anyway.
NPC_LINE_KESTREL_SCOUT_6|The wood keeps old campfire smoke under its bark. If you smell it, turn back.
NPC_LINE_KESTREL_SAPPER_1|Wedges, powder, rope. Then everyone behind the stake before I touch the fuse.
NPC_LINE_KESTREL_SAPPER_2|After a blast, I check side cracks before anyone walks under the roof.
NPC_LINE_KESTREL_SAPPER_3|If I tell you to move, run to the marked stake. Questions wait.
NPC_LINE_KESTREL_SAPPER_4|I drilled a clean hole this morning. By dusk, the chalk line had split two feet.
NPC_LINE_KESTREL_SAPPER_5|White Seal marks, Telwynd glass, blackglass veins: I do not drill them without Vaust's order.
NPC_LINE_KESTREL_WORKER_1|Stew's thin today. Bandages are in the orderly tent, not under my ladle.
NPC_LINE_KESTREL_WORKER_2|Smith's line is for buckles, rivets, and field blades. Trinkets wait.
NPC_LINE_KESTREL_WORKER_3|Returns come back short of hands. The loads still need carrying.
NPC_LINE_KESTREL_WORKER_4|Rockmaw road opens, half this camp moves west before breakfast.
NPC_LINE_KESTREL_SMITH_1|Cracked buckles, loose rivets, bent blades. Set the piece down and keep your fingers clear.
NPC_LINE_KESTREL_SMITH_2|I have spearheads cooling and three shields split at the rim. If you need work, say it quick.
NPC_LINE_KESTREL_SMITH_3|Rockmaw gear comes back dented deep. Ogres put dents through shields and arm straps alike.
NPC_LINE_KESTREL_SMITH_4|Field forge is open. I sell blades, patch mail, and replace straps if the quartermaster has any left.
NPC_LINE_KESTREL_MEDICAL_1|Stretchers come in after quiet calls. Loud calls give people warning.
NPC_LINE_KESTREL_MEDICAL_2|Keep your voice down near the wounded. Falling blackglass kept them awake.
NPC_LINE_KESTREL_MEDICAL_3|A lancer with one good leg still asked for wall duty. Crutches are by the tent pole.
NPC_LINE_KESTREL_MEDICAL_4|Ghostwood gear comes back smoke-stained. I keep clean blankets on the upper cot.
NPC_LINE_KESTREL_ORDERLY_1|We are down to torn linen and boiled water. If you have bandages, hand them here.
NPC_LINE_KESTREL_ORDERLY_2|Keep your voice low. Two lancers finally slept, and I will not wake them for camp gossip.
NPC_LINE_KESTREL_ORDERLY_3|Cots are for bleeding, fever, or orders from Vaust. If you need rest, pay and lie still.
NPC_LINE_KESTREL_ORDERLY_4|Ghostwood returns come in cold and shaking. I check for bites before I give them a blanket.
NPC_LINE_GENERIC_NPC_1|Busy day. If you need directions, ask at the gate or market.
NPC_LINE_GENERIC_NPC_2|I have work to finish. Someone by the road can point you along.
NPC_LINE_CHILD_1|Tress dared me to touch a goblin skull. I said no. I am brave, not stupid.
NPC_LINE_CHILD_2|I saw blue light past the old stones. Da said lanterns, but it did not move like a lantern.
NPC_LINE_CHILD_3|My cousin says a dead king sleeps in the old mound. If he has boots, they are probably too big.
NPC_LINE_CHILD_CAVE_STARTED_1|Thavoss said no cave games till the goblins are gone. He always knows the fun rules.
NPC_LINE_CHILD_CAVE_STARTED_2|If you see the goblin chief, tell him Jory can throw a stone over the mill roof. Almost.
NPC_LINE_CHILD_CAVE_COMPLETE_1|Ma says there are fewer goblin tracks now. She still said no caves. I asked twice.
NPC_LINE_CHILD_CAVE_COMPLETE_2|The dogs slept last night. I stayed awake in case they needed help.
NPC_LINE_DOG_1|The dog sniffs your boots, sneezes once, and plants itself by the gate.
NPC_LINE_DOG_2|The dog watches the east road with its ears high.
NPC_LINE_GOAT_1|The goat chews the fence rope and stares at you like you brought it.
NPC_LINE_GOAT_2|The goat climbs onto a feed sack and refuses to move.
NPC_LINE_CHICKEN_1|The chicken darts under the bench and scratches at the spilled barley.
NPC_LINE_CHICKEN_2|The chicken pecks your bootlace, decides against it, and struts away.
NPC_LINE_MULE_1|The mule shifts under a patched pannier and flicks flies from its ears.
NPC_LINE_MULE_2|The mule snorts toward the open path, then remembers it dislikes paths too.
NPC_LINE_DOCK_RUMOR_1|Catch has been poor all week. Reedwater shallows smell of oil.
NPC_LINE_DOCK_RUMOR_2|Use the plank road through the marsh. Step off it and leeches find you fast.
NPC_LINE_DOCK_RUMOR_3|Pulled blackglass grit from the nets again. Stuff chews rope and skin.
NPC_LINE_DOCK_RUMOR_4|The cellar moves crates after last watch. Anyone who hears it suddenly remembers chores.
NPC_LINE_DOCK_RUMOR_5|South water carries pale salt some mornings. Tidehook says it comes from cliff cracks.
NPC_LINE_DOCK_RUMOR_6|A sailor swore he saw lanterns under cliff water. If you see lights there, call the harbor watch.
NPC_LINE_PEASANT_STORE_1|Buy a ration before you leave. Root chewing gets old before noon.
NPC_LINE_PEASANT_STORE_2|Food and lamp oil first. The shiny bits can wait till supper is packed.
NPC_LINE_PEASANT_STORE_3|Valoria markets have roofs, so they say. Here we sell whatever the rain spared.
NPC_LINE_PEASANT_ROAD_1|South road is simple by daylight. Make camp before dark if your legs are done.
NPC_LINE_PEASANT_ROAD_2|A camp kit is not an inn bed, but it keeps mud off your face.
NPC_LINE_PEASANT_ROAD_3|Stay on the road with a loaded pack. Hills slow you more than you think.
NPC_LINE_PEASANT_ROAD_4|Smoke on the south road could be a campfire or a wreck. Look before you walk in.
NPC_LINE_PEASANT_DOCK_1|Garran keeps the boats. Ask him for passage; shouting at the water never helped.
NPC_LINE_PEASANT_DOCK_2|Never seen Valoria. Folks say even the poor can find bread there.
NPC_LINE_PEASANT_DOCK_3|Armor is heavy, aye. Still better than a blade through your shirt.
NPC_LINE_PEASANT_FIGHT_1|Use your best trick early. If you wait until you're surrounded, it is too late.
NPC_LINE_PEASANT_FIGHT_2|When two come at you, back up. Make one stand in the other's way.
NPC_LINE_PEASANT_FIGHT_3|Got a cut? Use a bandage. Blood on your boots just slows you down.
NPC_LINE_PEASANT_TRAVEL_1|Eat when your belly starts growling. Hungry hands miss.
NPC_LINE_PEASANT_TRAVEL_2|Keep a torch dry. Broken boards disappear after dusk.
NPC_LINE_PEASANT_TRAVEL_3|If you know a spell or fighting trick, use it early. Goblins do not wait their turn.
NPC_LINE_HIGHMARK_PEASANT_1|Silver Lances pass at dawn. Sweepers know the order by spur marks alone.
NPC_LINE_HIGHMARK_PEASANT_2|White Seal? North temple, lower steps. Start there.
NPC_LINE_HIGHMARK_PEASANT_3|Stonecleft carts came in late again. One had a split axle.
NPC_LINE_HIGHMARK_PEASANT_4|Keep clear when the Lancers move in pairs. They are not on parade.
NPC_LINE_HIGHMARK_PEASANT_5|Lyss keeps a clean inn. Costs plenty, but the sheets are clean.
NPC_LINE_HIGHMARK_PEASANT_6|Mountain pass takes nailed boots. Snow covers loose shale.
NPC_LINE_HIGHMARK_PEASANT_7|Kestrel runners came in without spare packs. Camp must be short on rations or bandages.
NPC_LINE_TRAVELLERS_REST_TRAVELLER_1|I stop here because the next roof is past the bridge track. My boots are done for the day.
NPC_LINE_TRAVELLERS_REST_TRAVELLER_2|The shop buys road leftovers. I sold a cracked helm there and bought a better knife.
NPC_LINE_TRAVELLERS_REST_TRAVELLER_3|Branna sets cups outside when the weather holds. Sit quick; the good bench fills.
NPC_LINE_TRAVELLERS_REST_TRAVELLER_4|Fill your waterskin and check your straps before you leave. Everyone forgets one of the two.
NPC_LINE_TRAVELLERS_REST_TRAVELLER_5|South quay is empty now. Empty docks still have rotten boards, so watch your step.
NPC_LINE_TRAVELLERS_REST_TRAVELLER_6|West wood fog cuts a lantern down to arm's length. Carry extra oil.
NPC_LINE_TRAVELLERS_REST_TRAVELLER_7|Man at the next table says Rockmaw is abandoned. His brother came back without a pack.
NPC_LINE_TRAVELLERS_REST_TRAVELLER_8|Saltmere fish taste bitter this season. Cook blames grit from the cliff caves.
NPC_LINE_TRAVELLERS_REST_RESEARCHER_1|These road stones are older than the inn. The cuts do not match any Valorian measure I know.
NPC_LINE_TRAVELLERS_REST_RESEARCHER_2|The well has three repairs in three stones. Someone kept this stop alive for a long time.
NPC_LINE_TRAVELLERS_REST_RESEARCHER_3|Marked stone or sealed glass? Bring it to me before you scrape it clean.
NPC_LINE_TRAVELLERS_REST_RESEARCHER_4|Stonecleft Pass has two carved dates on one arch. The masons reused the first arch.
NPC_LINE_TRAVELLERS_REST_RESEARCHER_5|Ghostwood chips smell of ash, but the bark is not burned. I would like a cleaner sample.
NPC_LINE_TRAVELLERS_REST_SHADY_1|Waiting on a wagon. Drink your ale and let me drink mine.
NPC_LINE_TRAVELLERS_REST_SHADY_2|Second ale loosens wagon tongues. Buyers, routes, guard names. Useful noise.
NPC_LINE_TRAVELLERS_REST_SHADY_3|Bandits do not wear colors in here. Neither do smugglers.
NPC_LINE_TIDEHOOK_NETMENDER_1|Net's torn again. East rocks shred twine faster than we sell fish.
NPC_LINE_TIDEHOOK_NETMENDER_2|Keep your boots clear of the east rocks. One bad step puts you in deep water.
NPC_LINE_TIDEHOOK_NETMENDER_3|Kethra's spears cost coin. Cave fishers snapped two cheap shafts this week.
NPC_LINE_TIDEHOOK_NETMENDER_4|Saltmere went flat under a north wind. We kept the small boats tied all morning.
NPC_LINE_TIDEHOOK_NETMENDER_5|White shapes under the cliff are stone unless they move. If they move, shout.
NPC_LINE_PORTER_1|Lamp oil goes to the White Seal first today. Flour waits until I get the seal mark.
NPC_LINE_PORTER_2|Highmark loads changed this month: more grain, less iron, more lamp oil.
NPC_LINE_PORTER_3|Scar camps call for rope every hour. Rope, then hands, then more rope.
NPC_LINE_LABORER_1|Gate clerk sent these crates east, then west. Same seal, same boxes, my back twice.
NPC_LINE_LABORER_2|Stonecleft carts came in with split wheel rims. If you need north road, watch for loose iron by the ruts.
NPC_LINE_LABORER_3|Eastern-road loads leave before the count is full. Better late crates than lost backs.
NPC_LINE_PILGRIM_1|Priests take names on the left stair before dawn. Wounds by the basin, charms at the table.
NPC_LINE_PILGRIM_2|Three altar marks wake the plain charm. The first is hope. The second is blisters.
NPC_LINE_PILGRIM_3|I saw fresh wheel ruts by the Roadside Shrine and one broken cart. Step wide where the mud turns black.
NPC_LINE_STABLEHAND_1|The mules care about oats, clean tack, and whether you know not to stand behind them.
NPC_LINE_STABLEHAND_2|Cart teams get oats before saddle horses today. Bought stall space? Check the chalk mark on the gate.
NPC_LINE_STABLEHAND_3|Two horses came in lathered from the south road before noon. Water any mount slow, or it founders.
NPC_LINE_HIGHMARK_PRIEST_1|Charm blanks come to this cloth. Relic claims go to Tovan Mere or the High Canon.
NPC_LINE_HIGHMARK_PRIEST_2|Pilgrims line the lower steps before dawn. Most forget oil, breakfast, or a room with a lock.
NPC_LINE_HIGHMARK_PRIEST_3|The square clears at dusk because the old seal still listens. We try not to waste its attention.
DIALOGUE_HIGHMARK_PRIEST_PILGRIMAGE_START_CHARM|Traveler, wait a moment. This blank charm will not hold the White Seal yet. It needs the road marks first. Take it.
DIALOGUE_HIGHMARK_PRIEST_PILGRIMAGE_START_ROUTE|Touch it to Havenford's altar, the Roadside Shrine, and Reedmire Shrine. When all three marks show, bring it back to this cloth.
DIALOGUE_HIGHMARK_PRIEST_PILGRIMAGE_REPLACE_CHARM|Lost the charm? I can cut one more blank. Carry it to whichever first altars are still unmarked, then bring it back.
DIALOGUE_HIGHMARK_PRIEST_PILGRIMAGE_BLESS_HANDIN|Znaki drogi sa czyste. Wlozylem blogoslawienstwo Oldroot w amulet; zanies go na oltarz w Oldroot Temple.
DIALOGUE_HIGHMARK_PRIEST_PILGRIMAGE_OLDROOT_REMINDER|Oldroot Temple is the next mark. Touch the dormant charm to its altar, then return if the charm wakes.
DIALOGUE_HIGHMARK_PRIEST_PILGRIMAGE_FINAL_HANDIN|Oldroot przyjął ostatni znak. Połóż amulet; zamknę obrzęd, zanim wosk ostygnie.
DIALOGUE_HIGHMARK_PRIEST_PILGRIMAGE_FINAL_BLESSING|The finished charm is yours now. Its blessing should hold better on the road.
DIALOGUE_HIGHMARK_PRIEST_PILGRIMAGE_COMPLETE_IDLE|Twój amulet jest zapisany i zapieczętowany. Nie mogę odprawić tej samej pielgrzymki dwa razy dla jednego imienia.
NPC_LINE_HIGHMARK_LANCER_1|North gate reports come by horn and runner. Smoke on the cliff road goes on my board first.
NPC_LINE_HIGHMARK_LANCER_2|White Seal steps stay clear until someone brings in a cursed relic. Then I need two lancers and no crowd.
NPC_LINE_HIGHMARK_LANCER_3|West doors close at horn call. Buy before dusk or find a wall outside.
NPC_LINE_HIGHMARK_LANCER_4|North pass is rough this week. Scouts lose time there, and carts come back with split rims.
NPC_LINE_HIGHMARK_RESEARCHER_1|Canon marked shelf three study only. If you pull vellum, put the red weight back on it.
NPC_LINE_HIGHMARK_RESEARCHER_2|White Seal genealogy, ritual, and confession often share one page. The margins are usually the dangerous part.
NPC_LINE_HIGHMARK_RESEARCHER_3|Clean spellbooks are on the upper shelf. Cheap copies have blue corrections.
NPC_LINE_HIGHMARK_RESEARCHER_4|Scar maps go on the north lectern. Do not mix them with shrine copies.
NPC_LINE_HIGHMARK_RESEARCHER_5|Telwynd grove notes marked 'sealed for safety' need ward maps beside them.
UI_CHARACTER_EFFECT_ENLARGE|Enlarge: +4 STR, -4 DEF.
UI_CHARACTER_EFFECT_REDUCE|Reduce: -4 STR, +4 DEF.
ITEM_COATING_LESSER_CONSECRATION_NAME|Weak Oil of Consecration
ITEM_COATING_LESSER_CONSECRATION_SHORT|holy+d3
ITEM_COATING_STRONG_CONSECRATION_NAME|Strong Oil of Consecration
ITEM_COATING_STRONG_CONSECRATION_SHORT|holy+d12
UI_INSPECT_EFFECT_HP_REGEN|passive HP regeneration +{0:%d}
UI_INSPECT_EFFECT_COATING_LESSER_CONSECRATION|Current coating: hits add 1d3 holy damage.
UI_INSPECT_EFFECT_COATING_STRONG_CONSECRATION|Current coating: hits add 1d12 holy damage.
UI_INSPECT_DETAIL_STATUS|Status: {0}
ITEM_USE_EFFECT_POTION_OF_ENLARGE|daje +4 Siły i -4 DEF na 1 minutę.
ITEM_USE_EFFECT_POTION_OF_REDUCE|daje -4 Siły i +4 DEF na 1 minutę.
ITEM_USE_EFFECT_OIL_LESSER_CONSECRATION|dodaje 1d3 świętych obrażeń przy trafieniach bronią przez 10 minut.
ITEM_USE_EFFECT_OIL_STRONG_CONSECRATION|dodaje 1d12 świętych obrażeń przy trafieniach bronią przez 10 minut.
ITEM_USE_EFFECT_HARM_LIGHT|szkodliwy wywar; zadaje 1d6+9 obrażeń.
ITEM_USE_EFFECT_HARM_MODERATE|szkodliwy wywar; zadaje 3d6+22 obrażeń.
ITEM_USE_EFFECT_HARM_STRONG|szkodliwy wywar; zadaje 6d6+54 obrażeń.
ITEM_USE_EFFECT_POTION_OF_ACID|szkodliwy wywar; zadaje 8-14 obrażeń od kwasu.
ITEM_USE_EFFECT_POTION_OF_BURNING|szkodliwy wywar; zadaje 8-14 obrażeń od ognia.
ITEM_USE_EFFECT_POTION_OF_WEAKNESS|szkodliwy wywar; obniża Siłę o 4 na 120 tur.
ITEM_USE_EFFECT_POTION_OF_SLOWNESS|szkodliwy wywar; spowalnia ruch na 5 tur.
ITEM_USE_EFFECT_POTION_OF_SILENCE|szkodliwy wywar; powoduje ciszę na 6 tur.
ITEM_USE_EFFECT_POTION_OF_FEAR|szkodliwy wywar; wywołuje strach na 3 tury.
ITEM_USE_EFFECT_POTION_OF_SLEEP|szkodliwy wywar; usypia na 3 tury.
ITEM_USE_EFFECT_POTION_OF_PARALYSIS|szkodliwy wywar; powoduje paraliż na 3 tury.
DEATH_POTION_HARM|killed by a potion of harm
DEATH_POTION_ACID|dissolved by a potion of acid
DEATH_POTION_BURNING|burned by a potion of burning
DIALOGUE_ALDREN_POST_WATCHTOWER_IDLE|Wozy znowu jezdza i na razie wyglada to bezpiecznie. Ale szykujemy sie.
DIALOGUE_ALDREN_CAVE_CHIEF_TURNIN|You did it. With the chieftain dead, the goblins lose their nerve and our militia can drive off the stragglers. The farms can mend fences instead of burying stock, and perhaps carts will dare the road to Traveller's Rest again. Take your reward with my thanks, friend.
DIALOGUE_ALDREN_CAVE_CHIEF_TURNIN_HALF_ORC|You did the work, and Havenford is safer for it. Some here will still watch your tusks before your deeds; let them watch this deed too. Take the pay. Garrick may have harder work if you want it.
DIALOGUE_ALDREN_CAVE_CHIEF_REMINDER|Goblin Cave lezy na wschod, niedaleko stad. Zabij ich wodza.
DIALOGUE_ALDREN_CAVE_CHIEF_START|Witaj, wedrowcze. Trafiles do Havenford w chudych czasach. Gobliny z jaskini na wschodnim grzbiecie napadaja na farmy, rwa ploty i uprowadzaja bydlo. Sa zbyt zorganizowane jak na zwykle jaskiniowe szkodniki; ktos nimi kieruje. Jesli zabijesz tego wodza, zaplacimy tyle, ile wies zdola zebrac. Wez teraz to zloto i miksture, i wroc zywy, jesli dasz rade.
DIALOGUE_ALDREN_CAVE_CHIEF_START_HALF_ORC|Wedrowcze. Nie bede udawal, ze tutejsi latwo znosza twoj lud, ale praca to praca, a niebezpieczenstwo to niebezpieczenstwo. Gobliny ze wschodniej jaskini napadaja na nasze farmy pod wodza herszta. Zabij go, a Havenford uczciwie ci zaplaci.
DIALOGUE_MAELIN_SHRINE_SUPPLIES_AFTER_CAVE_CHIEF|Goblin Cave is quiet, and the chapel line is smaller today. I have bandages, holy symbols, potions, and scrolls. What do you need?
DIALOGUE_MAELIN_SHRINE_SUPPLIES_BEFORE_CAVE_CHIEF|The chapel cupboards are thin, but I still keep bandages, blessings, and potions for travelers. What aid do you need before the road?
DIALOGUE_VETHRIN_REEDMIRE_COMPLETE_IDLE|Jestem zajety. Idz prosze wypic ale z krasnoludem albo cos w tym rodzaju.
DIALOGUE_VETHRIN_REEDMIRE_TURNIN|Czyli oltarz byl przeklety stara magia. Dzieki. Musze zbadac, jak do tego doszlo. Masz, cos za twoja pomoc.
DIALOGUE_VETHRIN_REEDMIRE_REMINDER|Doprowadź sprawę Reedmire do końca. Zanieś moją notę Rethowi, ustaw kamienie przy kapliczkach i przynieś mi odpowiedź, gdy stwór zginie.
DIALOGUE_VETHRIN_NOTE_REPLACEMENT|Zgubiles notatke? Oczywiscie. Trzymam kopie wlasnie na takie okazje. Zanies te do Retha Oskela w Reedwater Docks.
DIALOGUE_VETHRIN_TOO_GREEN|Prosze, zostaw mnie. Musze przygotowac kilka rzeczy.
DIALOGUE_VETHRIN_COTTAGE_TOO_GREEN|Please leave me to my research for now.
DIALOGUE_VETHRIN_COTTAGE_START|I need someone steady to look over the burned cottage. The fire was not ordinary; the ash still carries a magical trace, and the wolves around the ruin are not acting normal. Check the place carefully, then bring me whatever you find.
DIALOGUE_VETHRIN_COTTAGE_REMINDER|The burned cottage still needs eyes on it. Search the ruin carefully, then bring me whatever explains that fire. Watch the wolves; they are not acting normal.
DIALOGUE_VETHRIN_COTTAGE_TURNIN|Water glyphs under a burned house. Peculiar. This reminds me of a tale I overheard from Reth Oskel, one of the fishermen at Reedwater. I thought ale was doing most of the talking, but perhaps not. Take this spellbook; practical payment is harder to misread than theory.
DIALOGUE_VETHRIN_COTTAGE_REEDMIRE_WAIT|I need to do more research on this. Come see me again later.
DIALOGUE_VETHRIN_REEDMIRE_START|Reth Oskel is the fisherman. He spoke of stone piles around Reedmire Shrine and water moving against the wind. Take this sealed note to him at Reedwater Docks and get his account directly. If his story matches the cottage markings, the shrine may be worse than an old flooded altar.
DIALOGUE_TESSA_TRAIL_GEAR_AFTER_CAVE_CHIEF|Odkad najazdy goblinow slabna, mam znacznie wiecej sprzetu na wierzchu. Plecaki, lina, olej do lamp, pulapki. Czego ci brakuje?
DIALOGUE_TESSA_TRAIL_GEAR_BEFORE_CAVE_CHIEF|Ruszacie na wschód? Racje, lina, oliwa do lamp, sidła i plecaki są na stojaku. Czego wam brakuje?
DIALOGUE_BRANNOC_FORGE_STOCK|Forge is open for business. Leather and steel, get what you need.
DIALOGUE_HAVENFORD_WATCH_DONE|No open board today. Havenford Watch has paid every signed mark I have.
DIALOGUE_HAVENFORD_WATCH_SKRIT_TURNIN|Skrit nie zyje? Dobrze. Bez przywodcy stada koboldy rozprosza sie i beda gryzly slabszymi zebami. Havenford znowu jest ci dluzne.
DIALOGUE_HAVENFORD_WATCH_SKRIT_REMINDER|Hail Adventurer. Skrit still needs ending.
DIALOGUE_HAVENFORD_WATCH_BONES_TURNIN|Dobra robota. Grobowe kosci to ponura zaplata, ale dowodza, ze martwi zostaja w ziemi. Wytropilismy koboldzi problem na polnoc od zrujnowanej wiezy, ku starym gorskim robotom. Ich przywodca, Skrit, ukrywa sie tam. Znajdz go i zakoncz to porzadnie.
DIALOGUE_HAVENFORD_WATCH_BONES_REMINDER|I need twenty grave bones, not a story. Skeletons and zombies count. Bring the bones back to my board.
DIALOGUE_HAVENFORD_WATCH_SCALPS_TURNIN|Dobra robota. Kazdy skalp kobolda to jeden noz mniej przy kole wozu. Ziemia sie zmienia, i nie tylko przez gobliny. Umarli wstaja teraz ze starej ziemi. Rozbij kazdego, ktorego znajdziesz, przynies grobowe kosci jako dowod, a dopilnuje, bys znow dostal zaplate.
DIALOGUE_HAVENFORD_WATCH_SCALPS_REMINDER|Dwadzieścia koboldów, dwadzieścia skalpów. Przynieś je z powrotem, a podpiszę wypłatę.
DIALOGUE_HAVENFORD_WATCH_START|Witaj, awanturniku. Havenford potrzebuje oczyszczonych drog, a wygladasz, jakbys mogl pomoc. Zabij dwadziescia koboldow i przynies mi ich skalpy, a dostaniesz zaplate z kasy strazy.
DIALOGUE_HAVENFORD_WATCH_START_HALF_ORC|Dzien dobry. Havenford potrzebuje oczyszczonych drog, a wygladasz na zdolnego. Zabij dwadziescia koboldow i przynies mi ich skalpy, a dostaniesz zaplate.
DIALOGUE_KINGS_BARROW_DONE|Zatrzymaj Kingsmark. Mam odczyt Theryna, twój raport z kurhanu i dość atramentu, by dokończyć zapis.
DIALOGUE_KINGS_BARROW_RING_TURNIN|Kingsmark wyszedł więc z królewskiego sarkofagu. Formuła Theryna zadziałała, król Halric został nazwany, a grobowiec trzymał pierścień.\nZatrzymaj go. Przybyłem po zapis, nie po biżuterię martwego króla.
DIALOGUE_KINGS_BARROW_SARCOPHAGUS_REMINDER|Król Halric leży. Otwórz królewski sarkofag, zanim odejdziesz; Kingsmark powinien być w dłoni króla.
DIALOGUE_KINGS_BARROW_EXPEDITION_REMINDER|Theryn dał ci formułę. King's Barrow leży na południe od Highmark, w starej Marchii Havenford. Wejdź do grobowca, pokonaj króla Halrica i otwórz królewski sarkofag po Kingsmark.
DIALOGUE_KINGS_BARROW_PHRASE_CONFIRMED|Theryn to odczytal. Dobrze. Fraza otwiera drzwi kurhanu, ale nie oczysci grobowca za ciebie.\nKing's Barrow lezy na poludnie od Highmark, w starej Marchii Havenford. Wejdz, pokonaj King Halric, potem otworz krolewski sarkofag i wez Kingsmark. Wroc z relacja do mnie w Highmark, gdy Kingsmark bedzie juz wyniesiony.
DIALOGUE_KINGS_BARROW_MANUSCRIPT_REPLACEMENT|Rękopis zniknął z twojego plecaka. Trzymam drugi odrys, bo kurierzy gubią torby. Zanieś tę kopię Staremu Therynowi Ruskowi w Havenford.
DIALOGUE_KINGS_BARROW_MANUSCRIPT_REMINDER|Zanieś rękopis Edrana Staremu Therynowi Ruskowi w południowym domu Havenford. Nie próbuj formuły King's Barrow, dopóki Theryn nie przeczyta kopii.
DIALOGUE_KINGS_BARROW_TOO_GREEN|No commission from me today. The work I need is hard road work, not a first Highmark errand.
DIALOGUE_KINGS_BARROW_START|Jestem Edran Vale. Kazdy pisarz swiatynny w Highmark chce sprawdzic te fraze przy drzwiach grobowca, wiec potrzebuje rozsadnego kuriera.\nSkopiowalem slowa z King's Barrow, na poludnie od Highmark. Pismo jest ze starej Marchii, a Old Theryn Rusk w Havenford znal je, zanim sie urodzilem.\nZanies ten rekopis do poludniowego domu Theryna i niech odczyta fraze. Jesli potwierdzi, przynies odpowiedz do mnie w Highmark. Potrzebuje relacji; jesli Kingsmark naprawde jest w srodku, nie prosze o pierscien.
DIALOGUE_RETH_REEDMIRE_DONE|Vethrin has his report. Reedmire Shrine is quiet again. Good. I will keep to my nets. Let Vethrin study the stones.
DIALOGUE_RETH_NHALOR_SLAIN|Nhalor is dead? Good. Take the news to Vethrin in Havenford. I am done with Reedmire and his questions.
DIALOGUE_RETH_REEDMIRE_REMINDER|Praca przy kapliczkach nie jest skończona. Połóż gładki kamień na każdym stosie, a jeśli Nhalor powstanie, zabij go przed odejściem.
DIALOGUE_RETH_NOTE_HANDIN|Notatka Vethrina. Kamienie sa twoje. Jeden na kazdy stos.
DIALOGUE_RETH_NO_QUEST_IDLE|Vethrin wants Reedmire numbers? He can send his seal first. Until then, I have nets to mend.
DIALOGUE_THAULD_CORPSE_REPORT|Martwy rybak w cysternie? Cholerny zbytek. Jemu juz sie to nie przyda. Wez i zrob z tego lepszy uzytek niz mrok.
DIALOGUE_THAULD_ARRIVAL_HANDOFF|Ciężka burza. Dobrze, że dotarliście cali. Ta łódź jednak długo stąd nie ruszy. Garran opowiedział mi o twojej sprawie; paskudne czasy idą, nie ma co. Słuchaj, weź drogę w głąb lądu na wschód do Havenford. Trzymaj się drogi, tak bezpieczniej. A jeśli musisz odpocząć albo kupić zapasy, zrób to przed wyjściem.
DIALOGUE_THAULD_DOCK_REMINDER|Nie mam ci już jak pomóc, dzieciaku. Idź do Havenford.
DIALOGUE_RAT_CELLAR_DONE|The cellar is quiet. Grain sacks are staying shut. If you open that hatch again, bring your own boots.
DIALOGUE_RAT_CELLAR_TURNIN|Zabiłeś tego dużego? Dobrze. Drapanie pod szopami ucichło. Oto monety, zanim zarządca doku policzy je jako portowe.
DIALOGUE_RAT_CELLAR_REMINDER|Back room hatch, straight down. Kill the big cellar rat and clear the rats off the grain sacks, then come back to me.
DIALOGUE_RAT_CELLAR_START|Szczury zajely piwnice, a jeden wielki drab na dole rozzuchwalil reszte. Zabij tego duzego, a zaplace.
DIALOGUE_MIRA_DOCKSIDE_STOCK|Need road kit? Bread, lamp oil, first aid, cheap knives, and cudgels. Dock prices, no long haggling.
DIALOGUE_MARN_BUNK_AVAILABLE|Come in if you need a dry bunk. Stew is hot, blankets are clean enough, and the Havenford road is still rough after the storm.
DIALOGUE_MARN_HALF_ORC|Stable cot is open. Same price, paid now. Keep quiet and I will keep the room clear.
DIALOGUE_VOSK_ROUTE_CLOSED|Pracuję tu, chyba że chcesz pomóc mi z tą liną.
DIALOGUE_VOSK_WAITING_MARK|Kapitan Veysha z Tidehook mówi, że znajdzie bezpieczną trasę. Ja bym na to zbytnio nie liczył.
DIALOGUE_VOSK_TIDEHOOK_ROUTE_OPEN|Droga do Tidehook wygląda znowu na czystą. Mogę wsadzić cię na następny skif, jeśli chcesz.
DIALOGUE_VEYSHA_SKIFF_READY|Hold there, traveler. No skiff leaves Tidehook until I check the knots and tide marks.
DIALOGUE_VEYSHA_CHANNEL_WARNING|Bound for Reedwater? Quade takes fare by the skiff. Pay him, sit still, and do not crowd the rail.
DIALOGUE_QUADE_REEDWATER_ROUTE_OPEN|Reedwater? Sto sztuk złota. Płać tutaj, wsiadaj do skifu i módl się, żebyśmy nie skończyli na dnie morza.
DIALOGUE_KETHRA_RACK_OPEN|Looking for reach? Spears on the rack, halberds in the corner, nets by the coil. Try the weight before you pay.
DIALOGUE_NESKA_TAVERN_FOOD|Come in, if you can find a dry stool. Beer by the mug, rations by the bundle, camp kits under the counter. What will it be?
DIALOGUE_BRAN_DELIVERY_DONE|Orrick sent word. The parcel reached Traveller's Rest, and he paid you? Good. I owe you a beer once I get these nets tied.
DIALOGUE_BRAN_PARCEL_REMINDER|Ta paczka jest dla Orricka w Traveller's Rest. Idz droga w glab ladu i nie zamocz jej.
DIALOGUE_BRAN_PARCEL_REPLACEMENT|Lost it? Gods. Hold still, I can tie another. Take this parcel to Orrick Fen at Traveller's Rest.
DIALOGUE_BRAN_BEER_REMINDER|Dalej mam tu sucho. Tawerna jest tak blisko, ze czuje beczke.
DIALOGUE_BRAN_BEER_START|Moj kubek jest pusty, a obie rece mam zajete podarta siecia. Przynies jedno piwo, a dobrze zapamietam twoja twarz.
DIALOGUE_BRAN_BEER_HANDIN_PARCEL|Tak jest dobrze. Teraz zarob na lepsza sprawe: paczka dla Orricka w Traveller's Rest. Droga w glab ladu, sucho, jesli dasz rade.
DIALOGUE_NELL_ROOM_AVAILABLE|Come in, dear. Kettle is on, two rooms are taken, and I still have clean blankets in the back room. Need a bed or just supper?
DIALOGUE_LYSS_ROOM_AVAILABLE|Private rooms by night. Pay up front and rest quiet.
DIALOGUE_STONECLEFT_INNKEEPER_BED_AVAILABLE|In with you, then. Beds are made, bread is hot, and the ale is strong enough for miners coming off shift. Need a bed under Stonecleft roof?
DIALOGUE_NELL_HALF_ORC|For you, I have the back cot by the kitchen door. Same coin, paid now. Keep quiet there, and I will keep the taproom off your back.
DIALOGUE_LYSS_HALF_ORC|Room for coin. Pay the house and keep quiet.
DIALOGUE_STONECLEFT_INNKEEPER_HALF_ORC|Coin first, half-orc. The outer room is open, bread is hot, and no one touches a paid room under my roof. Need it?
DIALOGUE_STONECLEFT_GATEHALL_LAMP_DONE|Sellan's load is packed and gone upstairs. Good. Gatehall shelves have food and oil again; say what you need.
DIALOGUE_STONECLEFT_GATEHALL_SHOP|Gatehall supplies: oil, rope, food, bandages, and repair tackle. Buy before you leave Stonecleft's doors.
DIALOGUE_STONECLEFT_SUPPLY_LAMP_DONE|Dostawa lamp zakonczona. Tunele wygladaja mniej glodno, gdy ciemnosc jest przypieta.
DIALOGUE_STONECLEFT_SUPPLY_SHOP|Lamp oil, rope, bandages, dry food, and spare tackle. Count your pack before the lower stairs.
DIALOGUE_BRANNA_BED_AVAILABLE|Come in and close the door. Rooms are clean, cups are mostly clean, and I have keys if your coin is good. Need a bed?
DIALOGUE_BRANNA_HALF_ORC|Back room is open. Coin first. Keep your pack by the wall and I will keep the regulars out of your face.
DIALOGUE_ORRICK_PARCEL_TURNIN|Paczka Brana, nareszcie. Dobrze. Moge zamknac ten rachunek, zanim atrament wyschnie dwa razy.
DIALOGUE_ORRICK_OLD_CAVE_DONE|Your Old Cave report is already useful. I have rope and oil by the door now, and travelers ask questions before taking the east road.
DIALOGUE_ORRICK_MIXED_GOODS|Towary na drogę: jedzenie, woda, pochodnie, oliwa, lina, bandaże, wytrychy i trochę stali. Powiedz, czego brakuje w twoim plecaku.
DIALOGUE_ORRICK_OLD_CAVE_TURNIN|Dotarles do nizszych sal? Zatem stara jaskinia jest sprawdzona, a moje zmartwienie ma dno. Oto zaplata.
DIALOGUE_ORRICK_OLD_CAVE_REMINDER|Old Cave is east of Traveller's Rest. I need a report from the bottom floor, not the first room. Bring me what you saw and come back in one piece.
DIALOGUE_ORRICK_TOO_GREEN|Not that errand today. Buy food, oil, and rope if you need them; smaller work is wiser for now.
DIALOGUE_ORRICK_OLD_CAVE_START|Stara jaskinia niedaleko pochlania plotki i nic nie oddaje. Dotrz do nizszych sal, zobacz, co tam czeka, a zaplace za odpowiedz.
DIALOGUE_CALDUS_DOCKS_DONE|Krosh is dead, and the northeast peninsula is quieter for it. Traveller's Rest can send armed riders that way again. If you go back, watch the basements.
DIALOGUE_CALDUS_DOCKS_DONE_HALF_ORC|Krosh is dead. Good work, whatever the yard says. Armed riders can use the northeast peninsula again. Watch the basements if you go back.
DIALOGUE_CALDUS_DOCKS_TURNIN|Krosh is dead? Then the Desolate Docks have one less orc giving orders. Stand easy. You did the work I could not finish.
DIALOGUE_CALDUS_DOCKS_TURNIN_HALF_ORC|Krosh is dead by your hand? Then you did the work. Stand easy. I will say it plainly if anyone asks.
DIALOGUE_CALDUS_DOCKS_PAY|Doki sa czyste. Wez zaplate; zarobiona moneta wydaje sie czysciej niz obiecana.
DIALOGUE_CALDUS_DOCKS_PAY_HALF_ORC|Weź zapłatę. Ten sam raport: Krosh nie żyje.
DIALOGUE_CALDUS_DOCKS_REMINDER|Desolate Docks, on the peninsula northeast of Traveller's Rest. Find Krosh in the occupied basements and kill him. Do not come back with salvage stories.
DIALOGUE_CALDUS_DOCKS_REMINDER_HALF_ORC|Find Krosh in the Desolate Docks basements, on the peninsula northeast of Traveller's Rest, and kill him. That is the work.
DIALOGUE_CALDUS_DOCKS_TOO_GREEN|Not yet. The docks are bad ground today. Take smaller work first.
DIALOGUE_CALDUS_DOCKS_TOO_GREEN_HALF_ORC|Not yet. Same answer I would give anyone: the docks are bad ground today.
DIALOGUE_CALDUS_DOCKS_START|Orkowie trzymaja Desolate Docks, a Krosh dodaje im smialosci. Oczysc teren, zabij ich wodza, a zaplata bedzie twoja.
DIALOGUE_CALDUS_DOCKS_START_HALF_ORC|Orkowie trzymają Desolate Docks. Nie zapytam, która strona tej krwi nauczyła cię wojny. Zabij Krosha, oczyść ich, a zapłacę.
DIALOGUE_VELRA_ASH_DONE|The Ashen Ring is yours. Do not let every hedge mage handle it; Rhazvek's scale did the hard work, and I did the expensive work.
DIALOGUE_VELRA_ARCANE_CASE|Scrolls, wands, mana draughts, charms, and rings. Look with your eyes first; the case stays latched until I open it.
DIALOGUE_VELRA_ASH_TURNIN|There it is, Rhazvek's scale. Warm, whole, and mine for the moment. Set it on the cloth; I can finish the Ashen Ring.
DIALOGUE_VELRA_ASH_REMINDER|Ash Tower lies east-southeast of Traveller's Rest. Rhazvek, one drake scale. You have the fire potions and cold wand; bring me the scale.
DIALOGUE_VELRA_ASH_TOO_GREEN|Not that commission. Not yet. Buy a small scroll and keep to smaller trouble for now.
DIALOGUE_VELRA_ASH_START|Rhazvek, mlody czerwony smokowiec, zrobil sobie z Ash Tower legowisko. Przynies mi jedna jego luske, a wymienie ja na Ashen Ring.
DIALOGUE_DORRAN_CORE_HANDIN|To jest rdzen. Na wszystkie dobre mloty, myslalem, ze duergarowie zakopali go ze zlosci. Runeforge moze teraz wrocic do pracy, ale potrzebuje czasu i zaru.
DIALOGUE_DORRAN_DUERGAR_DONE_REWARD|Here is your coin and a marked piece from the rack. If the duergar come north again, Stonecleft will be ready.
DIALOGUE_DORRAN_OLD_MINEWORKS_START|Vargrom nadal trzyma Old Mineworks. Runeforge z duergarska straza dyszaca w jego stare gardlo to zadne zwyciestwo. Zakoncz go.
DIALOGUE_DORRAN_VARGROM_TURNIN|Vargrom is dead? Good. That leaves his relay without a foreman.
DIALOGUE_DORRAN_REPAIRED_STOCK|Runeforge is holding steady. Marked stock is back on the counter.
DIALOGUE_DORRAN_REPAIRED_VARGROM_REMINDER|The runeforge is lit, but Vargrom still holds the works.
DIALOGUE_DORRAN_REPAIR_WAITING|Runeforge sie naprawia. Nie przyspieszysz starego kamienia samym patrzeniem.
DIALOGUE_DORRAN_CORE_LOCATION_FOUND|Martwy duergar mial rdzen. Wynies go, zanim jakies zalane paskudztwo zaciagnie go glebiej.
DIALOGUE_DORRAN_VALVE_REMINDER|Uzyj runicznej rekojesci w Floodgate Cistern. Otwiera dolna sluze; rdzen powinien byc za nia.
DIALOGUE_DORRAN_RUNEFORGE_START|Stonecleft has another problem. The Runeforge Core is missing, and Floodgate Cistern is the best lead. Take this runed valve handle, open the lower sluice, and bring the core back.
DIALOGUE_DORRAN_ARMORY_CLOSED|Runeforge jest zimna. Bez kuzni nie ma magicznej zbrojowni.
DIALOGUE_STONECLEFT_SURFACE_GUARD_STAIR_OPENED|Door is open. Follow the chalked stairs down to the Commons; the side doors are work rooms.
DIALOGUE_STONECLEFT_SURFACE_GUARD_STAIR_ALREADY_OPEN|Stair door is open. Down to the Commons; leave the work-room doors alone.
DIALOGUE_STONECLEFT_SURFACE_GUARD_STAIR_UNAUTHORIZED|Need the stair door? Say so. I do not leave iron unlatched for curious merchants.
DIALOGUE_STONECLEFT_SURFACE_GUARD_TURN_BACK|State your business at the gatehall. If you have none, stay on the surface level.
DIALOGUE_STONECLEFT_DEEP_GUARD_DWARF_UNAUTHORIZED|Lower gate is sealed. Clan blood does not move it; Thrunna does.
DIALOGUE_STONECLEFT_DEEP_GUARD_DWARF_WAIT_WARDENS|Take it to his forge in the commons. Until then, buy, sleep, or stand clear of my chain.
DIALOGUE_STONECLEFT_DEEP_GUARD_OUTSIDER_UNAUTHORIZED|Lower gate is sealed. Stonecleft has not opened the pass to guests.
DIALOGUE_STONECLEFT_DEEP_GUARD_OUTSIDER_WAIT_WARDENS|Take your Highmark business to his forge in the commons. Until then, buy, sleep, or stand clear of my chain.
DIALOGUE_STONECLEFT_DEEP_GUARD_DWARF_GATE_OPENED|North gate is opening, cousin. Keep north through the Underway and keep your lamp trimmed.
DIALOGUE_STONECLEFT_DEEP_GUARD_OUTSIDER_GATE_OPENED|North gate is opening, traveler. Keep north through the Underway and stay out of the work cuts.
DIALOGUE_STONECLEFT_DEEP_GUARD_GATE_ALREADY_OPEN|Lower gate is clear. The Underway runs north.
DIALOGUE_STONECLEFT_DEEP_GUARD_POST_OPEN|This post is not for gawking. State your business at the gate or keep walking.
DIALOGUE_NAERYS_GUEST_MAT_AVAILABLE|Guest mats wait. Pay the warden and rest within the veil.
DIALOGUE_NAERYS_HALF_ORC|Bed for coin. Pay and rest. The veil keeps its own.
DIALOGUE_SARN_MARKET_STALL|Road kit, dry straps, cart cloth, and no temple prices. Tell me what broke before you ask what is cheap.
DIALOGUE_BRETHRA_PROVISION_STALL|Oil is sealed, rope is measured, kits are packed for travel. Buy what you can carry and do not unstack my coils.
DIALOGUE_MAVETH_APOTHECARY_OLDROOT_DONE|The oldroot batch held. Stronger healing and resistance bottles are on the shelf. Point before you unstopper anything green.
DIALOGUE_MAVETH_APOTHECARY_OLDROOT_TURNIN|Szesc lisci, calych i ciemnych. Dobrze. Gorzka krawedz wciaz tam jest.\nWez te zaplate i miksture odnowienia. Gdy zmiele reszte, mocniejsze butelki trafia na polke.
DIALOGUE_MAVETH_APOTHECARY_OLDROOT_REMINDER|Świątynia Oldroot. Sześć użytecznych liści. Tnij ciemne liście z żywego oldrootu; luźny porost z podłogi to śmieć.
DIALOGUE_MAVETH_APOTHECARY_OLDROOT_START|Careful. Those bottles are sealed tight. Highmark caravans bought through my strong stock, and my Oldroot gatherer came back fevered.\nI need six whole oldroot leaves from Oldroot Temple. Cut dark leaves from living oldroot, not floor growth. Bring them back and I will pay coin and a restoration potion.
DIALOGUE_MAVETH_APOTHECARY_CASE|Zapieczetowane wywary, datowane masci, czyste korki. Swiecace butelki zostaja za lada. Powiedz, co boli, albo ogladaj tak, jakbys chcial kupic.
DIALOGUE_JAETH_BOWYER_RACK|Need arrows? Straight shafts on the left, bolts by the case, bowstrings waxed this morning. Crossbow cranks are under the counter; ask before you put a hand on one.
DIALOGUE_NERRIK_DRAUGHT_DONE|The perfect draught is finished. If you have blackglass fragments, the worktable can make more elixirs. Do not touch the brown bottle.
DIALOGUE_NERRIK_TABLE_WARNING|Stop there. Left tray is tincture, right tray is acid wash, and the brown bottle is mine. Ask before your sleeve touches anything.
DIALOGUE_NERRIK_DRAUGHT_START|You. Good, careful hands. I am working toward a perfect draught, but I need preserved monster samples first.\nTake these jars of preservation ointment. Use one on a fresh corpse, or throw one at the creature before you kill it.\nBring me the samples and I can make them into elixirs. With these samples I can slowly perfect the recipe.
DIALOGUE_NERRIK_DRAUGHT_SAMPLE|A preserved {0} corpse. Good. Still tight, still useful. I can cut a clean sample from this.
DIALOGUE_NERRIK_DRAUGHT_BATCH|This sample settles the {0} mixture. Take the elixir; I only need a shaving for the next draft.
DIALOGUE_NERRIK_DRAUGHT_FINAL|Good. The perfect draught holds together. Drink it here while the blackglass is still quiet.
DIALOGUE_NERRIK_DRAUGHT_NEED_OINTMENT|You need preservation ointment before hunting the next sample. Maveth sometimes sells jars, and curio shelves may have them.
DIALOGUE_NERRIK_DRAUGHT_USE_OINTMENT|Use the ointment before rot starts. Rub it into the fresh corpse I named, or throw the jar at that creature before the kill.
DIALOGUE_NERRIK_DRAUGHT_TARGET|Next sample: preserve a {0} corpse and bring it back to me.
DIALOGUE_NERRIK_DRAUGHT_FINAL_TARGET|For the last draught, bring me a preserved adult dragon corpse and one blackglass shard. Young dragons will not do.
DIALOGUE_NERRIK_DRAUGHT_FINAL_SAMPLE|An adult dragon sample and a blackglass shard. Good. That is enough body and enough bite for the final mix.
DIALOGUE_NERRIK_DRAUGHT_FINAL_NEED_SHARD|The dragon sample is usable. Now bring one blackglass shard; the final draught needs something hard enough to hold the change.
DIALOGUE_NERRIK_DRAUGHT_FINAL_NEED_SAMPLE|The last sample must come from an adult dragon or older. Preserve the corpse and bring it here with one blackglass shard.
DIALOGUE_AELRION_THREAD_DONE|Nici moonwell trzymaja. Ulepszony stojak jest zaopatrzony. Trzymaj gotowe luki suche albo kup nowa cieciwe.
DIALOGUE_AELRION_THREAD_TURNIN|Sześć pasm, żadne niestrzępione. Dobrze. Utrzymają łuk wojenny.\nWeź tę zapłatę i ten łuk. Resztę skręcę do ulepszonego stojaka.
DIALOGUE_AELRION_THREAD_REMINDER|Moonwell Observatory wciąż ma to, czego potrzebuję. Przynieś sześć pasm z martwych kultystów, sal widm albo uwięzionej nici przy starej ramie.
DIALOGUE_AELRION_THREAD_START|Patrzysz na dobry stojak? To powiem ci, czemu nie jest dość dobry. Moje najlepsze cięciwy to zwykłe jelito, a zachodnia droga się otwiera.\nNić Moonwell utrzymuje łuk w wilgoci, zimnie i przy złym obchodzeniu. Przynieś mi sześć pasm z Moonwell Observatory; martwi kultyści i sale widm je łapią. Zapłacę monetą i zrobię ci łuk.
DIALOGUE_AELRION_BOWYER_RACK|Suchy cis, woskowane cięciwy, policzone groty. Trzymaj mokre rękawice z dala od gotowych łuków.
DIALOGUE_LANCER_ORDERS_DONE|Vaust heard the message? Good. Kestrel can post scouts with current routes instead of last week's guesswork.
DIALOGUE_LANCER_ORDERS_REMINDER|Captain Vaust Thane at Camp Kestrel needs the Highmark message. Put it in his hand, not on a camp table.
DIALOGUE_LANCER_HARPIES_TURNIN|Twelve harpies confirmed. Good work. North road scouts can look at tracks again instead of the sky. I have your pay; next board is ogres.
DIALOGUE_LANCER_OGRES_TURNIN|Eight ogres confirmed. Hill road carts can move without a double guard. I have your pay; next board is hill giants.
DIALOGUE_LANCER_GIANTS_TURNIN|Dwóch wzgórzowych olbrzymów potwierdzonych. Highmark może znów wysłać chorągwie i wozy z zaopatrzeniem na wzgórzowe drogi. Weź zapłatę; zbrojownia dodała część pancerza.
DIALOGUE_LANCER_NORTHERN_REMINDER|Northern ground still needs clearing. Keep the count.
DIALOGUE_LANCER_NORTHERN_START|Greycliff Quarry is west of Highmark, and harpies are dragging scouts off the quarry road and the cliff routes toward Telwynd. Clear the harpies, then report back. I pay in coin.
DIALOGUE_OSKARN_CURIO_CASE|Looking for luck or display? Rings in the velvet tray, road tokens in the brass case, ward beads by the door. I show one piece at a time; Highmark hands wander.
DIALOGUE_BRANN_GOODS_OPEN|Aye, iron goods. Nails, hinges, shields, axes, blades, and mail. Pick it up if you mean to buy; do not drum on the bars.
DIALOGUE_BRANN_LOWER_PASS_CLOSED|Underway gate is still shut. If you are waiting on the road below, buy gear here. No stall follows you past the gate.
DIALOGUE_DARRON_LANCE_ARMORY|Lancer mail hangs on the upper hooks; traveller pieces are below. Shields on the wall, blades on the bench. Pay first if you want a fitting.
DIALOGUE_YRVETH_WHITE_SEAL_RELIQUARY|Oil vials stay sealed until the street; the wax is part of the ward. Relic picks are in the left drawer, pilgrim charms in the blue tray, ward steel wrapped behind me.
DIALOGUE_QUESSA_SCRIPTORIUM|Mind the ink, please. Cheap copies are in the lower tray, lecture leaves tied in green cord, spellbooks on the high shelf. Tell me what school you read before you touch the bindings.
DIALOGUE_THERYN_HIGHWIND_CATACOMBS_FOUND|Znalazles Highwind Catacombs, zanim skonczylem mape. Dobrze. Odpowiedz byla jednak pod klasztorem.
DIALOGUE_THERYN_HIGHWIND_CATACOMBS_LEAD|Highwind Monastery to tylko gorne miejsce. Stare sale grobowe leza pod nim.\nPrzeszukaj klasztor, znajdz wejscie do katakumb i wejdz do srodka. Potem wroc do Telwynd z dowodem, ze dolna droga jest prawdziwa.
DIALOGUE_THERYN_BARROW_PHRASE|Daj mi stronę. Hm. Stara ręka Marchii, królewskie imiona i linia pogrzebowa o drodze Halrica.\nKról Halric i Kingsmark dzielą tę linię. Przy King's Barrow powiedz: Halric trzyma drogę.
DIALOGUE_THERYN_BARROW_PHRASE_REMINDER|Masz formułę. Przy King's Barrow powiedz: Halric trzyma drogę.
DIALOGUE_THERYN_OPENING_WORDS_LEARNED|Tak, znam to pismo. Brakujaca czesc to wypowiedziane slowa, nie kolejny odlam.\nZanies gwiazde Lightglass z powrotem do ostatniej pieczeci krwi. Wypowiedz tam stara formule, potem dotknij kamienia.
DIALOGUE_THERYN_OPENING_WORDS_REMINDER|Gwiazda lightglass, ostatnia krwawa pieczęć, wypowiedziane słowa, dłoń na kamieniu. W tej kolejności.
DIALOGUE_THROKK_BLACKGLASS_FORGE_COLD|Twoja krew moze byc brakujaca sztuczka, ale zimny runeforge niczego nie zdziala. Rozpal kuznie, zanim poprosisz mnie, bym obudzil blackglass.
DIALOGUE_THROKK_BLACKGLASS_FORGE_WITH_SHARD|Ten odlam brzmi prawdziwie. Krew, zar, mlot i bez marudzenia. Kuznia blackglass jest otwarta.
DIALOGUE_THROKK_STONEWARD_OPEN|Stoneward Gate jest otwarta. Moj breaker zrobil swoje.
DIALOGUE_THROKK_UNDERWAY_TURNIN|By the forge, you made it back alive. With The Underway open, Stonecleft can breathe and Highmark is no longer a story on the far side of stone. If you mean to go there, go now.
DIALOGUE_THROKK_BLACKGLASS_FORGE_NO_SHARD|The White Seal named your blood for the old work. Bring true shards when you have them. One fragment makes one martial fitting.
DIALOGUE_THROKK_UNDERWAY_CLEAR|The Underway is clear at last. Took a stranger to shame the old gate open, but open is open.
DIALOGUE_THROKK_UNDERWAY_REMINDER|The drake is still holding North Gate. Kill it, and you can get through to Highmark.
DIALOGUE_THROKK_UNDERWAY_START|Highmark, is it? Then you need The Underway. North Gate is blocked by a drake; while it breathes, nothing gets through.
DIALOGUE_THROKK_UNDERWAY_START_OBJECTIVE|No one here is eager to feed it another helm. I will have the gate warden let you through. Kill the drake at North Gate, then you can get through to Highmark. Once you are out, keep north to the city.
QUEST_LOG_TUTORIAL_NOTE_OBJECTIVE|Take Harren's note to Dockmaster Garran in Brindle Quay.
QUEST_LOG_TUTORIAL_NOTE_DETAIL|Harren dał mi notatkę dla dokmistrza Garrana w porcie.
QUEST_LOG_TUTORIAL_CLASS_ACTION_OBJECTIVE|Uzyj jednej akcji klasy na manekinie treningowym.
QUEST_LOG_TUTORIAL_CLASS_ACTION_DETAIL|Straznik Breck chce zobaczyc jedna akcje klasy, zanim opuszcze Brindle Quay.\nOtworz akcje klasy przez {class_actions}, potem uzyj jednej na manekinie treningowym.
QUEST_LOG_TUTORIAL_FIRST_AID_OBJECTIVE|Use a first aid kit.
QUEST_LOG_TUTORIAL_FIRST_AID_DETAIL|Uzyj opatrunku polowego, aby obwiazac rany po walce.
QUEST_LOG_TUTORIAL_SLEEP_OBJECTIVE|Sleep in Orrin's spare room.
QUEST_LOG_TUTORIAL_SLEEP_DETAIL|Dokmistrz powiedział, żebym odpoczął w gospodzie Orrina, zanim łódź odpłynie.
QUEST_LOG_TUTORIAL_CAMP_OBJECTIVE|Use a camping kit outside town.
QUEST_LOG_TUTORIAL_CAMP_DETAIL|Orrin dal mi zestaw obozowy po odpoczynku w gospodzie. Uzyj go, aby odpoczac w drodze.
QUEST_LOG_TUTORIAL_FEED_OBJECTIVE|Eat food from your inventory.
QUEST_LOG_TUTORIAL_FEED_DETAIL|Glod zaczyna doskwierac. Zjedz racje albo strawę z tawerny, aby dojsc do siebie.
QUEST_LOG_THANK_HARL_TITLE|Thank Captain Thauld
QUEST_LOG_THANK_HARL_OBJECTIVE|Speak with Captain Thauld at Reedwater Docks before heading inland.
QUEST_LOG_THANK_HARL_DETAIL|Kapitan Thauld przeprowadził łódź przez burzę. Podziękuj mu w Reedwater Docks.
QUEST_LOG_HEAD_TO_HAVENFORD_OBJECTIVE|Head inland to Havenford.
QUEST_LOG_HEAD_TO_HAVENFORD_DETAIL|Kapitan Thauld powiedział, że północna droga z Reedwater prowadzi do Havenford.
QUEST_LOG_CAVE_CHIEF_RETURN_OBJECTIVE|Return to Elder Thavoss Cairn in Havenford.
QUEST_LOG_CAVE_CHIEF_RETURN_DETAIL|Wódz z jaskini padł w jaskini przy grani. Aldren w Havenford powinien się o tym dowiedzieć.
QUEST_LOG_CAVE_CHIEF_OBJECTIVE|Kill the goblin chief in Goblin Cave.
QUEST_LOG_CAVE_CHIEF_DETAIL|Aldren says the goblin raids come from the eastern ridge cave and are too organized for ordinary vermin. I should find the chieftain driving them, kill him, and return to Havenford.
QUEST_LOG_ROOT_BREACH_LEAD_OBJECTIVE|Speak with Cael Orven at Traveller's Rest.
QUEST_LOG_ROOT_BREACH_LEAD_DETAIL|Scholar Cael says the prism points north from the Ruined Watchtower to Starfall Burrow. A drake holds the root below; I should search the burrow and learn what woke the prism.
QUEST_LOG_ROOT_BREACH_RETURN_OBJECTIVE|Take the blackglass shard to Scholar Cael.
QUEST_LOG_ROOT_BREACH_RETURN_DETAIL|I have the blackglass shard from Starfall Burrow. Scholar Cael at Traveller's Rest should see it.
QUEST_LOG_ROOT_BREACH_COLLECT_SHARD_OBJECTIVE|Collect the blackglass shard in the Starfall Burrow.
QUEST_LOG_ROOT_BREACH_COLLECT_SHARD_DETAIL|Vrask fell in the Starfall Burrow, and a blackglass shard remains where he died. I should pick it up before returning to Scholar Cael.
QUEST_LOG_ROOT_BREACH_OBJECTIVE|Search Starfall Burrow and return to Cael Orven.
QUEST_LOG_ROOT_BREACH_DETAIL|Scholar Cael says Starfall Burrow lies straight north of the Ruined Watchtower. The prism points there, and a drake holds the root below; I need to slay it and collect whatever truth survives.
QUEST_LOG_UNDERWAY_REACH_STONECLEFT_OBJECTIVE|Reach Stonecleft.
QUEST_LOG_UNDERWAY_REACH_STONECLEFT_DETAIL|South Gate opens into the South Gate Tunnels. I should continue through the tunnels to Stonecleft and ask the dwarves how to reach Highmark.
QUEST_LOG_UNDERWAY_REACH_SOUTH_GATE_OBJECTIVE|Travel northwest from Traveller's Rest to South Gate.
QUEST_LOG_UNDERWAY_REACH_SOUTH_GATE_DETAIL|Scholar Cael says Highmark lies beyond the mountains. The dwarven road begins at South Gate; I should take the northern road from Traveller's Rest to the mountain gate.
QUEST_LOG_UNDERWAY_ASK_THROKK_OBJECTIVE|Clear the drake at North Gate.
QUEST_LOG_UNDERWAY_ASK_THROKK_DETAIL|Stonecleft's north road is blocked, and Throkk says a drake holds North Gate. I should clear the gate before the dwarves can trust The Underway again.
QUEST_LOG_UNDERWAY_RETURN_OBJECTIVE|Continue north to Highmark.
QUEST_LOG_UNDERWAY_RETURN_DETAIL|The drake fell at North Gate, and the road through the mountains is open. I can continue north to Highmark.
QUEST_LOG_UNDERWAY_OBJECTIVE|Clear the drake at North Gate.
QUEST_LOG_UNDERWAY_DETAIL|Throkk says The Underway is the road to Highmark, but a drake blocks North Gate. I should kill it and continue north once the road opens.
QUEST_LOG_WHITE_SEAL_I_OBJECTIVE|Reach Highmark beyond the cleared north gate.
QUEST_LOG_WHITE_SEAL_I_DETAIL|The Underway is open. I should follow the dwarven road through the mountains and continue to Highmark, where the White Seal can examine the fragment.
QUEST_LOG_BEACON_PRISM_TALK_THAREC_OBJECTIVE|Speak with High Canon Tharec Merrow in Highmark.
QUEST_LOG_FINAL_DESCENT_II_OBJECTIVE|Defeat the primordial dragon in the Starfall Core.
QUEST_LOG_FINAL_DESCENT_I_OBJECTIVE|Take the stair opened beside the final blood seal.
QUEST_LOG_BLOOD_OF_THE_ANCIENTS_III_OBJECTIVE|Return to the final blood seal in the Sundering Depths.
QUEST_LOG_BLOOD_OF_THE_ANCIENTS_II_OBJECTIVE|Ask Old Theryn Rusk for the final blood seal words.
QUEST_LOG_BLOOD_OF_THE_ANCIENTS_I_OBJECTIVE|Push beyond the Stoneward Gate and find the inner seal.
QUEST_LOG_DEPTHS_OF_STARFALL_III_OBJECTIVE|Return to Throkk Flintvein in Stonecleft.
QUEST_LOG_DEPTHS_OF_STARFALL_II_OBJECTIVE|Enter the breach below Camp Kestrel and find the next threshold.
QUEST_LOG_DEPTHS_OF_STARFALL_I_DETAIL|Gwiazda jest oczyszczona. Scar kryje ścieżkę do Camp Kestrel.
QUEST_LOG_GLASSROOT_HOLLOW_RETURN_TITLE|Glassroot Hollow
QUEST_LOG_GLASSROOT_HOLLOW_RETURN_OBJECTIVE|Return to Envoy Eiradha in Highmark.
QUEST_LOG_GLASSROOT_HOLLOW_RETURN_DETAIL|Drake z czarnego szkła padł w kotlinie. Eiradha w Highmark powinna się o tym dowiedzieć.
QUEST_LOG_GLASSROOT_HOLLOW_TITLE|Glassroot Hollow
QUEST_LOG_GLASSROOT_HOLLOW_OBJECTIVE|Find Glassroot Hollow and kill the blackglass drake.
QUEST_LOG_GLASSROOT_HOLLOW_DETAIL|Eiradha says Glassroot Hollow lies east from the crossroads outside Highmark, along the road that bends southeast into the Veiled Wood. A blackglass drake there keeps Telwynd closed to outsiders. I should kill the drake and return to Highmark.
QUEST_LOG_GHOSTWOOD_SMOKE_RETURN_OBJECTIVE|Wróć do zwiadowcy Kestrel w Camp Kestrel.
QUEST_LOG_GHOSTWOOD_SMOKE_RETURN_DETAIL|Veyr został zabity. Dym z Ghostwood opadł. Batedor powinien się o tym dowiedzieć.
QUEST_LOG_GHOSTWOOD_SMOKE_ASK_EIRADHA_OBJECTIVE|Ask Envoy Eiradha in Highmark about the missing patrols.
QUEST_LOG_GHOSTWOOD_SMOKE_ASK_EIRADHA_DETAIL|Batedor Kestrel z Camp Kestrel powiedział, że Eiradha może mieć trop dotyczący dymu z Ghostwood.
QUEST_LOG_GHOSTWOOD_SMOKE_OBJECTIVE|Find what is taking patrols in Ghostwood.
QUEST_LOG_GHOSTWOOD_SMOKE_DETAIL|Eiradha wyśledziła problem. Veyr trzyma wieżę w Ghostwood. Zakończ dym. Follow the smoke west.
QUEST_LOG_BREAK_ROCKMAW_KEEP_I_RETURN_OBJECTIVE|Wróć do sierżanta straży w Camp Kestrel.
QUEST_LOG_BREAK_ROCKMAW_KEEP_I_RETURN_DETAIL|Maug i Brond zostali zabici. Rockmaw Keep jest złamane. Sierżant powinien się o tym dowiedzieć.
QUEST_LOG_BREAK_ROCKMAW_KEEP_I_BROND_OBJECTIVE|Zabij Bronda, czempiona ogrów, w Rockmaw Keep.
QUEST_LOG_BREAK_ROCKMAW_KEEP_I_BROND_DETAIL|Maug został zabity. W twierdzy został tylko Brond. Dokończ to.
QUEST_LOG_BREAK_ROCKMAW_KEEP_I_MAUG_OBJECTIVE|Zabij Mauga, ettina, w Rockmaw Keep.
QUEST_LOG_BREAK_ROCKMAW_KEEP_I_MAUG_DETAIL|Brond został zabity. Został tylko Maug. Skończ to.
QUEST_LOG_BREAK_ROCKMAW_KEEP_I_OBJECTIVE|Kill Maug and Brond in Rockmaw Keep.
QUEST_LOG_BREAK_ROCKMAW_KEEP_I_DETAIL|Rockmaw Keep jest zagrożeniem. Złam jego przywódców dla sierżanta straży w Camp Kestrel. Rockmaw Keep is near the coastal mountains.
QUEST_LOG_BREAK_ROCKMAW_KEEP_II_OBJECTIVE|Return to Rockmaw Keep and check the Kestrel outpost.
QUEST_LOG_BREAK_ROCKMAW_KEEP_II_DETAIL|Maug i Brond zostali zabici. Kestrel trzyma zewnętrzny dziedziniec. Posterunek jest gotowy do inspekcji.
QUEST_LOG_MOON_BITTEN_CAVE_OBJECTIVE|Kill Varroth, the Werewolf King in Inconspicuous Cave.
QUEST_LOG_MOON_BITTEN_CAVE_DETAIL|Varroth trzyma moon bitten cave. Upoluj go dla sierżanta straży w Camp Kestrel. Search the nearby hills.
QUEST_LOG_MOON_BITTEN_CAVE_RETURN_OBJECTIVE|Return to the Kestrel watch sergeant.
QUEST_LOG_MOON_BITTEN_CAVE_RETURN_DETAIL|Varroth został zabity. Ukryta wataha jest rozbita. Sierżant powinien się o tym dowiedzieć.
QUEST_LOG_CLEAR_MOONWELL_ROAD_RETURN_OBJECTIVE|Return to Warden Sairveth Ilyr in Telwynd.
QUEST_LOG_CLEAR_MOONWELL_ROAD_RETURN_DETAIL|The Moonwell Tunnels are clear. Warden Sairveth in Telwynd should know.
QUEST_LOG_CLEAR_MOONWELL_ROAD_OBJECTIVE|Clear the Moonwell Tunnels.
QUEST_LOG_CLEAR_MOONWELL_ROAD_DETAIL|Warden Sairveth says the Moonwell Tunnels are blocked and Telwynd's workers cannot safely pass. I should set the tunnel dials and reach the far exit so the grove can reach the old site again. The Moonwell Tunnels are south of Telwynd.
QUEST_LOG_ELDERWYRM_GROVE_RETURN_OBJECTIVE|Return to Warden Sairveth Ilyr in Telwynd.
QUEST_LOG_ELDERWYRM_GROVE_RETURN_DETAIL|Elderwyrm został zabity. Gaj został odzyskany. Strażnik Sairveth w Telwynd powinien się o tym dowiedzieć.
QUEST_LOG_ELDERWYRM_GROVE_OBJECTIVE|Clear Elderwyrm Grove for Telwynd.
QUEST_LOG_ELDERWYRM_GROVE_DETAIL|Sairveth and Eivyss say Elderwyrm Grove is failing under old ward trouble, and Caerwyn has bent the green magic around himself. I should reclaim the grove before Telwynd sends workers through. Elderwyrm Grove is in the furthest northern mountains.
QUEST_LOG_BURIED_HIGHWIND_REPORT_CATACOMBS_OBJECTIVE|Tell Warden Sairveth Ilyr about the Highwind Catacombs.
QUEST_LOG_BURIED_HIGHWIND_REPORT_CATACOMBS_DETAIL|Znalazłeś katakumby. Pogrzebany highwind jest tam.
QUEST_LOG_BURIED_HIGHWIND_FIND_CATACOMBS_OBJECTIVE|Search Highwind Monastery for the catacombs entrance.
QUEST_LOG_BURIED_HIGHWIND_FIND_CATACOMBS_DETAIL|Theryn Rusk says the old Highwind trail points under the monastery. I should search the grounds for the stair into Highwind's catacombs.
QUEST_LOG_BURIED_HIGHWIND_ASK_THERYN_OBJECTIVE|Ask Old Theryn Rusk about Highwind.
QUEST_LOG_BURIED_HIGHWIND_ASK_THERYN_DETAIL|Zbadałeś klasztor. Zapytaj Theryna Ruska w Havenford, co to znaczy.
QUEST_LOG_BURIED_HIGHWIND_RETURN_MARKS_OBJECTIVE|Return to Warden Sairveth Ilyr in Telwynd.
QUEST_LOG_BURIED_HIGHWIND_RETURN_MARKS_DETAIL|Zbadałeś klasztor. Strażnik Sairveth w Telwynd powinien się o tym dowiedzieć.
QUEST_LOG_BURIED_HIGHWIND_OBJECTIVE|Find the buried highwind.
QUEST_LOG_BURIED_HIGHWIND_DETAIL|The buried Highwind is tied to the old monastery and the catacombs beneath it. I should search those places and follow whatever proof survives. Highwind Monastery is in the far east hills.
QUEST_LOG_LOST_PURIFIER_RETURN_OBJECTIVE|Return to Tovan Mere in Highmark.
QUEST_LOG_LOST_PURIFIER_RETURN_DETAIL|Antykwariusz Tovan został uratowany z akweduktu. Wróć do Antykwariusza Tovana w White Seal Antiquities w Highmark.
QUEST_LOG_LOST_PURIFIER_OBJECTIVE|Find Tovan Mere in Highmark Aqueduct.
QUEST_LOG_LOST_PURIFIER_DETAIL|Antiquary Tovan vanished in the aqueduct while tracing the lost purifier. I should search the waterworks and bring him back if he is still alive. The aqueduct is in the mountains north of Highmark.
QUEST_LOG_PILGRIMAGE_FIRST_DETAIL|Kapłan White Seal dał zwykły amulet. Oznacz ołtarze w Havenford, Roadside Shrine i Reedmire, aż się ogrzeje.
QUEST_LOG_PILGRIMAGE_RETURN_BLESS_OBJECTIVE|Wróć do kapłana White Seal w Highmark.
QUEST_LOG_PILGRIMAGE_RETURN_BLESS_DETAIL|Zwykły amulet ma wszystkie trzy znaki. Zwróć go kapłanowi White Seal w Highmark.
QUEST_LOG_PILGRIMAGE_OLDROOT_OBJECTIVE|Use the dormant white seal charm at Oldroot Temple's altar.
QUEST_LOG_PILGRIMAGE_OLDROOT_DETAIL|Uśpiony amulet białej pieczęci potrzebuje ołtarza oldroot. Korzenie go obudzą. Oldroot Temple is in the forest near Highmark.
QUEST_LOG_PILGRIMAGE_RETURN_FINAL_OBJECTIVE|Return the white seal charm to the priest in Highmark.
QUEST_LOG_PILGRIMAGE_RETURN_FINAL_DETAIL|Amulet budzi się od oldroot. Zwróć go kapłanowi White Seal w Highmark.
QUEST_LOG_MOONWELL_ALIGNMENT_TELWYND_OBJECTIVE|Take the misaligned moonwell lens to Eivyss Glass-Singer in Telwynd.
QUEST_LOG_MOONWELL_ALIGNMENT_TELWYND_DETAIL|Veydras w Highmark dał rozstrojoną soczewkę moonwell ze składów pieczęci. Eivyss w Telwynd może ją dostroić.
QUEST_LOG_MOONWELL_ALIGNMENT_REPLACE_OBJECTIVE|Return to Canon-Artificer Veydras Vale in Highmark for another moonwell lens.
QUEST_LOG_MOONWELL_ALIGNMENT_REPLACE_DETAIL|Veydras w Highmark może zastąpić brakującą rozstrojoną soczewkę moonwell ze składów pieczęci.
QUEST_LOG_MOONWELL_ALIGNMENT_INSTALL_OBJECTIVE|Install the attuned moonwell lens in Moonwell Observatory.
QUEST_LOG_MOONWELL_ALIGNMENT_INSTALL_DETAIL|Soczewka jest dostrojona. Osadź ją w pękniętej ramie Moonwell w obserwatorium. Moonwell Observatory is south of Telwynd.
QUEST_LOG_MOONWELL_ALIGNMENT_RECOVER_ATTUNED_OBJECTIVE|Recover the attuned moonwell lens.
QUEST_LOG_MOONWELL_ALIGNMENT_RECOVER_ATTUNED_DETAIL|Dostrojona soczewka moonwell zaginęła. Eivyss w Telwynd może ją odtworzyć.
QUEST_LOG_MOONWELL_ALIGNMENT_RETURN_OBJECTIVE|Return to Canon-Artificer Veydras Vale in Highmark.
QUEST_LOG_MOONWELL_ALIGNMENT_RETURN_DETAIL|Dostrojona soczewka siedzi w ramie Moonwell. Światło obserwatorium się stabilizuje. Wróć do Veydrasa w Highmark.
QUEST_LOG_BITTER_STOCK_RETURN_OBJECTIVE|Return to Maveth Vell in Highmark.
QUEST_LOG_BITTER_STOCK_RETURN_DETAIL|Liście oldroot są gotowe. Wróć do aptekarza Mavetha w Highmark.
QUEST_LOG_BITTER_STOCK_DETAIL|Oldroot Temple daje liście, które wzmacniają wywar. Przynieś sześć aptekarzowi Mavethowi w Highmark. Oldroot Temple is in the forest near Highmark.
QUEST_LOG_MOONWELL_THREAD_RETURN_OBJECTIVE|Return to Aelrion Yewhand in Telwynd.
QUEST_LOG_MOONWELL_THREAD_RETURN_DETAIL|Nici moonwell są gotowe. Wróć do łuczarza Aelriona w Telwynd.
QUEST_LOG_MOONWELL_THREAD_DETAIL|Moonwell Observatory daje nić, która wzmacnia łoże. Przynieś sześć łuczarzowi Aelrionowi w Telwynd. Moonwell Observatory is south of Telwynd.
QUEST_LOG_PERFECT_DRAUGHT_OBJECTIVE|Preserve a {0} corpse for Nerrik.
QUEST_LOG_PERFECT_DRAUGHT_RETURN_OBJECTIVE|Bring the preserved corpse to Nerrik.
QUEST_LOG_ORDERS_FOR_KESTREL_OBJECTIVE|Carry the message to the commander at Camp Kestrel.
QUEST_LOG_NORTHERN_WATCH_I_DETAIL|Harpies are hitting Greycliff Quarry west of Highmark and the cliff routes toward Telwynd. Clear enough of them for the Silver Lancer.
QUEST_LOG_NORTHERN_WATCH_I_RETURN_OBJECTIVE|Return to a Silver Lancer in Highmark.
QUEST_LOG_NORTHERN_WATCH_I_RETURN_DETAIL|Harpie ubite. Północne wzgórza są przez to rzadsze. Wróć do Srebrnego Lansjera w Highmark.
QUEST_LOG_NORTHERN_WATCH_II_DETAIL|Ogry trzymają północne ziemie. Przynieś osiem zabójstw Srebrnemu Lansjerowi w Highmark.
QUEST_LOG_NORTHERN_WATCH_II_RETURN_OBJECTIVE|Return to a Silver Lancer in Highmark.
QUEST_LOG_NORTHERN_WATCH_II_RETURN_DETAIL|Ogry ubite. Północne ziemie są przez to spokojniejsze. Wróć do Srebrnego Lansjera w Highmark.
QUEST_LOG_NORTHERN_WATCH_III_DETAIL|Wzgórzowe olbrzymy trzymają północ. Przynieś dwa zabójstwa Srebrnemu Lansjerowi w Highmark.
QUEST_LOG_NORTHERN_WATCH_III_RETURN_OBJECTIVE|Return to a Silver Lancer in Highmark.
QUEST_LOG_NORTHERN_WATCH_III_RETURN_DETAIL|Olbrzymy powalone. Północna straż jest zakończona. Wróć do Srebrnego Lansjera w Highmark.
QUEST_LOG_RAT_CELLAR_RETURN_TITLE|Clear the Rat Cellar
QUEST_LOG_RAT_CELLAR_RETURN_OBJECTIVE|Return to Bress Dask at Reedwater Docks.
QUEST_LOG_RAT_CELLAR_RETURN_DETAIL|Duży padł. Gniazdo jest rozbite. Wróć do rybaka Bressa.
QUEST_LOG_RAT_CELLAR_TITLE|Clear the Rat Cellar
QUEST_LOG_RAT_CELLAR_OBJECTIVE|Clear the rats below the Reedwater storage hatch.
QUEST_LOG_RAT_CELLAR_DETAIL|Fisherman Bress says rats have taken over the cellar and a bigger one is running the nest. I should clear the cellar before it spreads into the docks.
QUEST_LOG_SMUGGLER_BADGE_RETURN_TITLE|Smuggler's Debt I
QUEST_LOG_SMUGGLER_BADGE_RETURN_OBJECTIVE_PLACE|Return the lead seal to the Smuggler {0}.
QUEST_LOG_SMUGGLER_BADGE_RETURN_DETAIL_PLACE|The lead seal is in hand. I should return it to the Smuggler {0} and collect the first pay before asking about the larger job.
QUEST_LOG_SMUGGLER_BADGE_TITLE|Smuggler's Debt I
QUEST_LOG_SMUGGLER_BADGE_OBJECTIVE|Find the Smuggler's lead seal in Smuggler Grotto.
QUEST_LOG_SMUGGLER_BADGE_DETAIL|The Smuggler said his old crew is using Smuggler Grotto for wet storage. He told me to take the east road toward King's Barrow, turn south to the grotto, and bring back his lead seal whole.
QUEST_LOG_SMUGGLER_DEBT_II_RETURN_TITLE|Smuggler's Debt II
QUEST_LOG_SMUGGLER_DEBT_II_RETURN_OBJECTIVE_PLACE|Return the shut lockbox to the Smuggler {0}.
QUEST_LOG_SMUGGLER_DEBT_II_RETURN_DETAIL_PLACE|The Smuggler's iron lockbox is in hand and still shut. I should return it to the Smuggler {0} for the promised pay.
QUEST_LOG_SMUGGLER_DEBT_II_RECOVER_LOCKBOX_TITLE|Smuggler's Debt II
QUEST_LOG_SMUGGLER_DEBT_II_RECOVER_LOCKBOX_OBJECTIVE|Recover the Smuggler's lockbox from the lower cove.
QUEST_LOG_SMUGGLER_DEBT_II_RECOVER_LOCKBOX_DETAIL|The lower cove is clear enough to search now, but the Smuggler's iron lockbox still needs to be found and returned shut.
QUEST_LOG_SMUGGLER_DEBT_II_TITLE|Smuggler's Debt II
QUEST_LOG_SMUGGLER_DEBT_II_OBJECTIVE|Find the Smuggler's lockbox in Smuggler Grotto's lower cove.
QUEST_LOG_SMUGGLER_DEBT_II_DETAIL|After I returned the seal, the Smuggler said there is an iron lockbox in the lower cove of the same grotto. He wants it brought back shut.
QUEST_LOG_REEDMIRE_DELIVERY_RETURN_TITLE|Investigate Reedmire Shrine
QUEST_LOG_BURNED_COTTAGE_INVESTIGATION_RETURN_TITLE|Investigate the Burned Cottage
QUEST_LOG_BURNED_COTTAGE_INVESTIGATION_RETURN_OBJECTIVE_PLACE|Return to Vethrin {0}.
QUEST_LOG_BURNED_COTTAGE_INVESTIGATION_RETURN_DETAIL_PLACE|The hidden altar below the Burned Cottage is marked with water glyphs and uneven shallow pools. Return to Vethrin {0}.
QUEST_LOG_BURNED_COTTAGE_INVESTIGATION_TITLE|Investigate the Burned Cottage
QUEST_LOG_BURNED_COTTAGE_INVESTIGATION_OBJECTIVE|Search the Burned Cottage for the source of the strange fire.
QUEST_LOG_BURNED_COTTAGE_INVESTIGATION_DETAIL|Vethrin suspects the cottage burned under magical fire, and the wolves around the ruin are not acting normal. I should search the place carefully for a sign of what happened. The cottage is in the small forest just out of town.
QUEST_LOG_REEDMIRE_DELIVERY_RETURN_OBJECTIVE_PLACE|Return to Vethrin Quill {0}.
QUEST_LOG_REEDMIRE_DELIVERY_RETURN_DETAIL_PLACE|Nhalor padł. Wróć do Vethrina {0}.
QUEST_LOG_REEDMIRE_DELIVERY_KILL_NHALOR_TITLE|Investigate Reedmire Shrine
QUEST_LOG_REEDMIRE_DELIVERY_KILL_NHALOR_OBJECTIVE|Kill Nhalor at Reedmire Shrine, then return to Vethrin.
QUEST_LOG_REEDMIRE_DELIVERY_KILL_NHALOR_DETAIL|Reth's stones are set at Reedmire Shrine, and Nhalor walks the water there. I should end it and return the news to Vethrin.
QUEST_LOG_REEDMIRE_DELIVERY_PLACE_STONES_TITLE|Investigate Reedmire Shrine
QUEST_LOG_REEDMIRE_DELIVERY_PLACE_STONES_OBJECTIVE|Place smooth stones on the four Reedmire Shrine stacks.
QUEST_LOG_REEDMIRE_DELIVERY_DELIVER_NOTE_TITLE|Carry Vethrin's Note
QUEST_LOG_REEDMIRE_DELIVERY_DELIVER_NOTE_OBJECTIVE|Dostarcz zapieczętowaną notatkę Vethrina Rethowi Oskelowi w Reedwater Docks.
QUEST_LOG_REEDMIRE_DELIVERY_DELIVER_NOTE_DETAIL|Vethrin dał mi zapieczętowaną notatkę dla Retha Oskela w Reedwater Docks. Reth wie, co wydarzyło się w Reedmire Shrine. Powinienem dostarczyć notatkę i dostać jego instrukcje.
QUEST_LOG_REEDMIRE_DELIVERY_REPLACE_NOTE_TITLE|Carry Vethrin's Note
QUEST_LOG_REEDMIRE_DELIVERY_REPLACE_NOTE_OBJECTIVE_PLACE|Return to Vethrin Quill {0} for a replacement note.
QUEST_LOG_REEDMIRE_DELIVERY_REPLACE_NOTE_DETAIL|Zapieczętowana notatka dla Retha Oskela zniknęła z mojego plecaka. Vethrin może napisać kolejną kopię, jeśli wrócę przed Reedwater.
QUEST_LOG_STONECLEFT_RUNEFORGE_I_RETURN_CORE_TITLE|Stonecleft Runeforge I
QUEST_LOG_STONECLEFT_RUNEFORGE_I_RETURN_CORE_OBJECTIVE|Return the runeforge core to Dorran Keenedge in Stonecleft.
QUEST_LOG_STONECLEFT_RUNEFORGE_I_RETURN_CORE_DETAIL|Rdzeń Runeforge był przy martwych duergarach w Floodgate Cistern. Dorran potrzebuje go, zanim oznaczona zbrojownia i prace nad czarnym szkłem będą mogły ruszyć.
QUEST_LOG_STONECLEFT_RUNEFORGE_I_RECOVER_CORE_TITLE|Stonecleft Runeforge I
QUEST_LOG_STONECLEFT_RUNEFORGE_I_RECOVER_CORE_OBJECTIVE|Recover the runeforge core, then return it to Dorran Keenedge.
QUEST_LOG_STONECLEFT_RUNEFORGE_I_RECOVER_CORE_DETAIL|Znalazłem Rdzeń Runeforge w Floodgate Cistern, ale nie ma go już w moim plecaku. Dorran nie może ponownie uruchomić runeforge, dopóki rdzeń nie wróci do Stonecleft.
QUEST_LOG_STONECLEFT_RUNEFORGE_I_SEARCH_CORPSE_TITLE|Stonecleft Runeforge I
QUEST_LOG_STONECLEFT_RUNEFORGE_I_SEARCH_CORPSE_OBJECTIVE|Recover the runeforge core from the dead duergar in Floodgate Cistern.
QUEST_LOG_STONECLEFT_RUNEFORGE_I_SEARCH_CORPSE_DETAIL|Martwi duergarzy leżą przy dolnych schodach w Floodgate Cistern, otoczeni prymitywnymi narzędziami i śladami pazurów. Jeśli skradziony Rdzeń Runeforge nadal tam jest, powinien być przy ich ciałach.
QUEST_LOG_STONECLEFT_RUNEFORGE_I_TITLE|Stonecleft Runeforge I
QUEST_LOG_STONECLEFT_RUNEFORGE_I_OBJECTIVE|Użyj runicznego uchwytu zaworu, by otworzyć niższe piętra Floodgate Cistern.
QUEST_LOG_STONECLEFT_RUNEFORGE_I_DETAIL|Zbrojmistrz Dorran mówi, że Rdzeń Runeforge ze Stonecleft skradziono, a zawory wkrótce potem zawiodły. Dolna cysterna to jedyny trop; runiczna rękojeść zaworu powinna otworzyć zapieczętowaną drogę w dół. Floodgate Cistern is just off the southern road.
QUEST_LOG_STONECLEFT_RUNEFORGE_I_REPAIRING_TITLE|Stonecleft Runeforge I
QUEST_LOG_STONECLEFT_RUNEFORGE_I_REPAIRING_OBJECTIVE|Wait for Dorran Keenedge to restart the runeforge.
QUEST_LOG_STONECLEFT_RUNEFORGE_II_RETURN_TITLE|Stonecleft Runeforge II
QUEST_LOG_STONECLEFT_RUNEFORGE_II_RETURN_OBJECTIVE|Return to Dorran Keenedge in Stonecleft.
QUEST_LOG_STONECLEFT_RUNEFORGE_II_RETURN_DETAIL|Vargrom nie żyje w Old Mineworks. Dorran chciał usunięcia przywódcy duergarów, zanim wrócą po runeforge.
QUEST_LOG_STONECLEFT_RUNEFORGE_II_TITLE|Stonecleft Runeforge II
QUEST_LOG_STONECLEFT_RUNEFORGE_II_OBJECTIVE|Zabij Vargroma, strażnika duergarów, w Old Mineworks.
QUEST_LOG_STONECLEFT_RUNEFORGE_II_DETAIL|Martwi duergarzy w Floodgate Cistern dali Dorranowi dość informacji, by wskazać prawdopodobnych złodziei. Chce, by Vargrom zginął w Old Mineworks, zanim Stonecleft znów zaufa runeforge.
QUEST_LOG_STONECLEFT_LAMP_RUN_TITLE|Lamp Run
QUEST_LOG_THIRSTY_FISHERMAN_I_TITLE|Beer for Bran
QUEST_LOG_THIRSTY_FISHERMAN_I_OBJECTIVE|Przynies piwo rybakowi Branowi przy Reedwater Docks.
QUEST_LOG_THIRSTY_FISHERMAN_I_DETAIL|Rybak Bran utknal przy Reedwater Docks z porwanymi sieciami i bez wolnych rak. Wystarczy dowolne piwo z tawerny; powinienem przyniesc mu jedno przed zmiana przyplywu.
QUEST_LOG_THIRSTY_FISHERMAN_II_RETURN_TITLE|Bran's Parcel
QUEST_LOG_THIRSTY_FISHERMAN_II_RETURN_OBJECTIVE|Deliver Bran Keel's parcel to Orrick Fen at Traveller's Rest.
QUEST_LOG_THIRSTY_FISHERMAN_II_RETURN_DETAIL|Bran dał mi woskowaną paczkę dla kupca Orricka w Traveller's Rest. Powiedział, że sznur trzyma, a paczka powinna pozostać sucha. Powinienem włożyć ją Orrickowi do ręki i odebrać zapłatę za dostawę.
QUEST_LOG_THIRSTY_FISHERMAN_II_REPLACE_PARCEL_TITLE|Bran's Parcel
QUEST_LOG_THIRSTY_FISHERMAN_II_REPLACE_PARCEL_OBJECTIVE|Wroc do rybaka Brana przy Reedwater Docks po kolejna paczke.
QUEST_LOG_THIRSTY_FISHERMAN_II_REPLACE_PARCEL_DETAIL|Paczka dla kupca Orricka zniknela z mojego plecaka. Bran moze zawiazac kolejna, jesli wroce do Reedwater.
QUEST_LOG_TRAVELLERS_REST_OLD_CAVE_RETURN_TITLE|Check the Old Cave
QUEST_LOG_TRAVELLERS_REST_OLD_CAVE_RETURN_OBJECTIVE|Return to Orrick Fen at Traveller's Rest.
QUEST_LOG_TRAVELLERS_REST_OLD_CAVE_RETURN_DETAIL|Dotarłem na dno Old Cave i zobaczyłem dość dla kupca Orricka. Chce praktycznych szczegółów: podłoża, wody i tego, jakie kłopoty czekają na dole.
QUEST_LOG_TRAVELLERS_REST_OLD_CAVE_TITLE|Check the Old Cave
QUEST_LOG_TRAVELLERS_REST_OLD_CAVE_OBJECTIVE|Dotrzyj na najniższe piętro Old Cave.
QUEST_LOG_TRAVELLERS_REST_OLD_CAVE_DETAIL|Kupiec Orrick z Traveller's Rest płaci za ostrzeżenia z pierwszej ręki, które pomagają podróżnym przeżyć w jaskiniach. Chce świeżego spojrzenia na Old Cave na wschód od gospody. Muszę dotrzeć na dno, rozejrzeć się i wrócić żywy.
QUEST_LOG_TRAVELLERS_REST_DESOLATE_DOCKS_RETURN_TITLE|Clear the Desolate Docks
QUEST_LOG_TRAVELLERS_REST_DESOLATE_DOCKS_RETURN_OBJECTIVE|Return to Ser Caldus Renn at Traveller's Rest.
QUEST_LOG_TRAVELLERS_REST_DESOLATE_DOCKS_RETURN_DETAIL|Krosh nie żyje w Desolate Docks. Ser Caldus czeka w Traveller's Rest. Powinienem wrócić do niego i odebrać obiecaną zapłatę.
QUEST_LOG_TRAVELLERS_REST_DESOLATE_DOCKS_TITLE|Clear the Desolate Docks
QUEST_LOG_TRAVELLERS_REST_DESOLATE_DOCKS_OBJECTIVE|Zabij Krosha, orczego wojownika, przy Desolate Docks.
QUEST_LOG_TRAVELLERS_REST_DESOLATE_DOCKS_DETAIL|Ser Caldus chce śmierci Krosha w Desolate Docks, na półwyspie na północny wschód od Traveller's Rest. Zrujnowana osada dokowa ma orkowe załogi złomiarzy w zajętych piwnicach. Muszę znaleźć Krosha, zabić go i wrócić.
QUEST_LOG_TRAVELLERS_REST_ASH_TOWER_RETURN_SCALE_TITLE|Ash Tower Commission
QUEST_LOG_TRAVELLERS_REST_ASH_TOWER_RETURN_SCALE_OBJECTIVE|Return to Velra Senn at Traveller's Rest with a drake scale.
QUEST_LOG_TRAVELLERS_REST_ASH_TOWER_RETURN_SCALE_DETAIL|Rhazvek nie żyje, a ja mam łuskę drake'a do pracy nad pierścieniem Velry. Powiedziała, że łuska niesie żar potrzebny do ukończenia zlecenia.
QUEST_LOG_TRAVELLERS_REST_ASH_TOWER_RECOVER_SCALE_TITLE|Ash Tower Commission
QUEST_LOG_TRAVELLERS_REST_ASH_TOWER_RECOVER_SCALE_OBJECTIVE|Recover a drake scale for Velra Senn.
QUEST_LOG_TRAVELLERS_REST_ASH_TOWER_RECOVER_SCALE_DETAIL|Rhazvek nie żyje, ale Velra nadal potrzebuje jednej łuski drake'a, by ukończyć Ashen Ring. Powinienem przeszukać Ash Tower, na wschód-południowy wschód od Traveller's Rest, gdzie padł.
QUEST_LOG_TRAVELLERS_REST_ASH_TOWER_TITLE|Ash Tower Commission
QUEST_LOG_TRAVELLERS_REST_ASH_TOWER_OBJECTIVE|Kill Rhazvek in Ash Tower and bring Velra one drake scale.
QUEST_LOG_TRAVELLERS_REST_ASH_TOWER_DETAIL|Handlarka Velra dała mi dwa eliksiry odporności na ogień i różdżkę stożka zimna. Potrzebuje jednej łuski drake'a od Rhazveka w Ash Tower, na wschód-południowy wschód od Traveller's Rest, by ukończyć Ashen Ring.
QUEST_LOG_HAVENFORD_WATCH_I_RETURN_TITLE|Havenford Watch I
QUEST_LOG_HAVENFORD_WATCH_I_RETURN_OBJECTIVE|Return to Garrick with proof from the kobolds.
QUEST_LOG_HAVENFORD_WATCH_I_RETURN_DETAIL|Mam dość dowodów od koboldów dla pierwszego zadania straży Garricka. Powinienem wrócić do Havenford i odebrać pierwszą zapłatę straży.
QUEST_LOG_HAVENFORD_WATCH_I_TITLE|Havenford Watch I
QUEST_LOG_HAVENFORD_WATCH_I_DETAIL|Garrick chce dwudziestu skalpów koboldów, zanim pierwsze zadanie straży zostanie zakończone. Koboldy kradną paszę, przecinają rzemienie i odciągają patrole z drogi.
QUEST_LOG_HAVENFORD_WATCH_II_RETURN_TITLE|Havenford Watch II
QUEST_LOG_HAVENFORD_WATCH_II_RETURN_OBJECTIVE|Return to Garrick with the grave bones.
QUEST_LOG_HAVENFORD_WATCH_II_RETURN_DETAIL|Mam dość kości grobowych dla drugiego zadania straży Garricka. Powinienem wrócić do Havenford i odebrać następną zapłatę straży.
QUEST_LOG_HAVENFORD_WATCH_II_TITLE|Havenford Watch II
QUEST_LOG_HAVENFORD_WATCH_II_DETAIL|Garrick chce dwudziestu kości grobowych od szkieletów lub zombie dla drugiego zadania straży. Umarli poruszają się dziwnie wzdłuż dróg.
QUEST_LOG_HAVENFORD_WATCH_III_RETURN_TITLE|Havenford Watch III
QUEST_LOG_HAVENFORD_WATCH_III_RETURN_OBJECTIVE|Return to Garrick after killing Skrit.
QUEST_LOG_HAVENFORD_WATCH_III_RETURN_DETAIL|Skrit, Przywodca Stada Koboldow, nie zyje w kopalni na polnoc od wiezy strazniczej. Garrick powiedzial, ze to zamyka ostatnie zadanie strazy, jakie moze prowadzic z Havenford.
QUEST_LOG_HAVENFORD_WATCH_III_TITLE|Havenford Watch III
QUEST_LOG_HAVENFORD_WATCH_III_OBJECTIVE|Zabij Skrita, przywodce stada koboldow, w kopalni na polnoc od wiezy strazniczej.
QUEST_LOG_HAVENFORD_WATCH_III_DETAIL|Garrick chce smierci Skrita dla ostatniego zadania strazy Havenford. Skrit zbiera koboldy w kopalni na polnoc od zrujnowanej wiezy strazniczej i zasila napady na zachodniej drodze. Musze dotrzec na dno, zabic go i wrocic do Havenford.
QUEST_LOG_FIT_FOR_A_KING_I_DELIVER_MANUSCRIPT_TITLE|Fit for a King I
QUEST_LOG_FIT_FOR_A_KING_I_DELIVER_MANUSCRIPT_OBJECTIVE|Take Edran Vale's manuscript to Old Theryn Rusk in Havenford.
QUEST_LOG_FIT_FOR_A_KING_I_DELIVER_MANUSCRIPT_DETAIL|Pielgrzym Edran przepisał frazę z zapieczętowanych drzwi King's Barrow. Nie ufa własnemu odczytaniu starego pisma March. Theryn Rusk w Havenford powinien umieć ją odczytać.
QUEST_LOG_FIT_FOR_A_KING_I_REPLACE_MANUSCRIPT_TITLE|Fit for a King I
QUEST_LOG_FIT_FOR_A_KING_I_REPLACE_MANUSCRIPT_OBJECTIVE|Return to Edran Vale in Highmark for another manuscript copy.
QUEST_LOG_FIT_FOR_A_KING_I_REPLACE_MANUSCRIPT_DETAIL|Rękopis Edrana z kurhanu zniknął z mojego plecaka. Może zrobić kolejną kopię ze swoich notatek w Highmark.
QUEST_LOG_FIT_FOR_A_KING_II_RETURN_TITLE|Fit for a King II
QUEST_LOG_FIT_FOR_A_KING_II_RETURN_OBJECTIVE|Return to Edran Vale in Highmark.
QUEST_LOG_FIT_FOR_A_KING_II_RETURN_DETAIL|Król Halric znów nie żyje, a Kingsmark jest poza królewskim sarkofagiem. Pielgrzym Edran bardziej chciał relacji z kurhanu niż samego pierścienia.
QUEST_LOG_FIT_FOR_A_KING_II_CLAIM_RING_TITLE|Fit for a King II
QUEST_LOG_FIT_FOR_A_KING_II_CLAIM_RING_OBJECTIVE|Otwórz królewski sarkofag w King's Barrow.
QUEST_LOG_FIT_FOR_A_KING_II_CLAIM_RING_DETAIL|Król Halric, upiór z kurhanu, padł. Królewski sarkofag powinien teraz odpowiedzieć na frazę poznaną od Theryna. Kingsmark podobno pochowano ze starym królem.
QUEST_LOG_FIT_FOR_A_KING_II_TITLE|Fit for a King II
QUEST_LOG_FIT_FOR_A_KING_II_OBJECTIVE|Wejdź do King's Barrow i pokonaj króla Halrica.
QUEST_LOG_FIT_FOR_A_KING_II_DETAIL|Stary Theryn odczytał rękopis Pielgrzyma Edrana i podał mi frazę do drzwi: Halric trzyma drogę. King's Barrow powinien teraz się otworzyć, ale Edran ostrzegł, że to nie jest zwykły grobowiec. King's Barrow lies far south beyond the mountains.
QUEST_LOG_ORC_BASE_I_TITLE|Orc Fortress Sketch
QUEST_LOG_ORC_BASE_I_OBJECTIVE|Take the orc fortress sketch to the Stonecleft gate warden.
QUEST_LOG_ORC_BASE_I_DETAIL|Branna at Traveller's Rest handed over a rough sketch left after the Old Cave trouble. The Stonecleft gate warden can judge whether it shows a real orc fortress.
QUEST_LOG_ORC_BASE_RETURN_TITLE|Break the Orc Fortress
QUEST_LOG_ORC_BASE_RETURN_OBJECTIVE|Return to the Stonecleft gate warden.
QUEST_LOG_ORC_BASE_RETURN_DETAIL|Gorvuk is dead, and the Orc Fortress west of Stonecleft has lost its warboss. The gate warden promised a hammer and coin.
QUEST_LOG_ORC_BASE_TITLE|Break the Orc Fortress
QUEST_LOG_ORC_BASE_OBJECTIVE|Kill Gorvuk in the revealed Orc Fortress.
QUEST_LOG_ORC_BASE_DETAIL|The gate warden took the sketch and revealed the Orc Fortress west of Stonecleft, off the rough track southwest of the main road. Gorvuk commands the warband there. I need to get inside, kill him, and return to the warden.
QUEST_LOG_MISSING_HUSBAND_RESCUED_TITLE|Find the Missing Farmer
QUEST_LOG_MISSING_HUSBAND_RESCUED_OBJECTIVE|Speak with Thom Wold by Havenford's north fence.
QUEST_LOG_MISSING_HUSBAND_RESCUED_DETAIL|Zaginiony farmer żyje i wraca do domu. Maveth czeka w Havenford, nie wiedząc, czy mieć nadzieję, czy rozpaczać.
QUEST_LOG_MISSING_HUSBAND_SEARCH_SHRINE_TITLE|Find the Missing Farmer
QUEST_LOG_MISSING_HUSBAND_SEARCH_SHRINE_OBJECTIVE|Znajdz Thoma albo dowod tego, co sie stalo.
QUEST_LOG_MISSING_HUSBAND_SEARCH_SHRINE_DETAIL|Thom, maz Maveth, zniknal po tym, jak poszedl za sladami z Havenford. Ona nie wie, gdzie trafil. Przeszukaj pobliskie niebezpieczne miejsca i sprowadz go do domu, albo przynies dowod tego, co sie stalo.
QUEST_LOG_MISSING_HUSBAND_SEARCH_GOBLIN_CAVE_TITLE|Find the Missing Farmer
QUEST_LOG_MISSING_HUSBAND_SEARCH_GOBLIN_CAVE_OBJECTIVE|Znajdz Thoma albo dowod tego, co sie stalo.
QUEST_LOG_MISSING_HUSBAND_SEARCH_GOBLIN_CAVE_DETAIL|Thom, maz Maveth, zniknal po tym, jak poszedl za sladami z Havenford. Ona nie wie, gdzie trafil. Przeszukaj pobliskie niebezpieczne miejsca i sprowadz go do domu, albo przynies dowod tego, co sie stalo.
QUEST_LOG_PLACE_AT_TRAVELLERS_REST|at Traveller's Rest
QUEST_LOG_PLACE_IN_HAVENFORD|in Havenford
DIALOGUE_VEYDRAS_TOVAN_DONE|Tovan is back at White Seal Antiquities. Limping, sorting charms, arguing prices. Good. That is healthy enough for Tovan.
DIALOGUE_VEYDRAS_TOVAN_RESCUED|Tovan wrocil z akweduktu. Odbierz nagrode od niego, zanim uzna, ze wdziecznosc wymaga pokwitowania.
DIALOGUE_VEYDRAS_TOVAN_REMINDER|Highmark Aqueduct, northwest of the city. Find Tovan Mere or proof of his death. Watch the lower water; leeches, slime, and water weirds are common there.
DIALOGUE_VEYDRAS_TOVAN_START|Antykwariusz Tovan poszedl do Highmark Aqueduct, by sledzic znak oczyszczacza, i nie wrocil. Jest ostrozny, nie niesmiertelny. Znajdz go.
DIALOGUE_VEYDRAS_LIGHTGLASS_LOCKED|That basin stays covered. Tharec has not opened Lightglass work to you. Bring shard proof or the amulet to the High Canon first.
DIALOGUE_VEYDRAS_LIGHTGLASS_OPEN|Stol Lightglass jest otwarty. Przynies czyste odlamy blackglass, wybierz prace i nie improwizuj tam, gdzie White Seal zapisala liczby.
DIALOGUE_VEYDRAS_MOONWELL_START|Moonwell Observatory znow sie rozjezdza. Moje odczyty i stara rama myla sie za kazdym razem o te sama liczbe. Soczewka jest zla.\nZanies te rozstrojona soczewke do Eivyss Glass-Singer w Telwynd. On ja dostroi; potem osadz ja w ramie Moonwell Observatory i zglos sie do mnie.
DIALOGUE_VEYDRAS_MOONWELL_TO_TELWYND|Take the lens to Eivyss Glass-Singer in Telwynd. Highmark can cut glass; Telwynd knows how to tune it.
DIALOGUE_VEYDRAS_MOONWELL_TO_OBSERVATORY|Eivyss dostroiła soczewkę. Osadź ją w ramie Moonwell Observatory, potem wróć z odczytem.
DIALOGUE_VEYDRAS_MOONWELL_COMPLETE|Well done. The observatory frame is steady, and Telwynd's tuning agrees with my numbers.\nTake this purse and this Lightglass fragment. That saves me a climb and an argument at Telwynd's gate.
DIALOGUE_TOVAN_AQUEDUCT_RESCUE|Zszedles az tutaj po starego antykwariusza? Dobrze. Moja noga skonczyla klocic sie z kamieniami; pomoz mi wrocic do Highmark, zanim akwedukt zmieni zdanie.
DIALOGUE_TOVAN_AQUEDUCT_UNAVAILABLE|My case stays locked until I am back behind it. If Veydras wants old Seal stock, he can send someone below Highmark Aqueduct.
DIALOGUE_TOVAN_REWARD|Wyciagnales mnie z wiekszoscia kosci na wlasciwych miejscach. Oto obiecana zaplata, a White Seal Antiquities stoi przed toba otworem.
DIALOGUE_TOVAN_SHOP_IDLE|Case is open. Clean bottles, old Seal pieces, field gear. Your discount still stands.
DIALOGUE_ORYN_VAULT_SEALED|The White Vault is sealed again, and this time it feels like a seal rather than a prayer.
DIALOGUE_ORYN_VAULT_RITE_DONE|The star is Lightglass, but something still stirs below. I will not call the vault safe while it breathes.
DIALOGUE_ORYN_VAULT_DRAKE_SLAIN|The vault beast is slain. The chamber is quiet enough that I can hear my own hands shake.
DIALOGUE_ORYN_VAULT_REMINDER|The lower ward is open. I can feel the vault breathing through the stair. End what waits below before the old pattern spends itself holding the door.
DIALOGUE_ORYN_VAULT_NOT_READY|The vault stair remains locked. Until the Beacon Prism is set, opening it would be courage without discipline.
DIALOGUE_ORYN_VAULT_START|The Beacon Prism is set, and the star is Lightglass. I can open the lower ward, but listen before you descend: the White Vault has held something draconic in the dark for too long. If it wakes fully, the stones will not keep the sound small. Return when it is dead.
DIALOGUE_KESTREL_SCOUT_GHOSTWOOD_DONE|West patrols are finding the road again. We keep a double watch, but the names match the roster now.
DIALOGUE_KESTREL_SCOUT_GHOSTWOOD_REWARD|Veyr is dead? Then the smoke lifting makes sense. We lost patrols to that tower.\nTake the scout purse. I will send west patrols that way again.
DIALOGUE_KESTREL_SCOUT_ASK_EIRADHA|Zanim pójdziesz na zachód, zapytaj wysłanniczkę Eiradhę w Highmark. W tym dymie jest stara praca osłon, a elfy wiedzą o niej więcej niż zwiadowcy.
DIALOGUE_KESTREL_SCOUT_GHOSTWOOD_REMINDER|Eiradha dała odpowiedź. Ghostwood jest następny. Idź zachodnią drogą do starej wieży, zabij Veyra i wróć, gdy dym się oczyści.
DIALOGUE_KESTREL_SCOUT_TOO_GREEN|Not for you yet. The smoke reports are taking trained patrols, and I am not sending another name into that list today.
DIALOGUE_KESTREL_SCOUT_GHOSTWOOD_START|You there, traveler. If you can keep west on a bad road, I need you. Two patrols vanished near Ghostwood after dusk. We found cold ash, dropped packs, no bodies.\nGo to Highmark and ask Envoy Eiradha about the smoke before you enter it. Kestrel pays when patrols can use the west road again.
DIALOGUE_WATCH_SERGEANT_ROCKMAW_OUTPOST_OPEN|Zewnetrzny dziedziniec Rockmaw jest nasz: lozka, skrzynie, polowa kuznia, zabarykadowane dolne schody.\nIdz zobacz. Zaopatrzeniowiec sprzedaje polowe zapasy, kowal lata sprzet, a porzadkowy moze miec prycze.
DIALOGUE_WATCH_SERGEANT_ROCKMAW_HOLDING|Rockmaw się trzyma. Dwóch strażników na dolnych schodach, skrzynie pod płótnem, kuźnia wciąż gorąca. Lepiej niż we wczorajszym raporcie.
DIALOGUE_WATCH_SERGEANT_ROCKMAW_TURNIN|Maug i Brond nie żyją? Dobrze. Głowy skrócą mój raport; zabójstwa otwierają drogę.\nKestrel rusza teraz. Zajmujemy zewnętrzny dziedziniec Rockmaw, blokujemy dolne schody i stawiamy łóżka, skrzynie oraz polową kuźnię. Weź zapłatę za Rockmaw.
DIALOGUE_WATCH_SERGEANT_ROCKMAW_REMINDER|Rockmaw Keep, zachodnia droga. Zabij Mauga i Bronda. Przynieś ich głowy, jeśli zdołasz je unieść.
DIALOGUE_WATCH_SERGEANT_TOO_GREEN|Jeszcze nie. Następny dziedziniec łamie wyszkolone pikiety. Poznaj zachodnią drogę, zanim wpiszę na nią twoje imię.
DIALOGUE_WATCH_SERGEANT_ROCKMAW_START|Przyszedłeś do Kestrel bez przydziału. Dobrze. Potrzebuję ostrzy do pracy na drodze.\nRockmaw Keep blokuje zachodnią drogę. Maug, ettin, wydaje rozkazy; Brond, czempion ogrów, trzyma dziedziniec.\nZabij obu. Przynieś ich głowy, jeśli zdołasz je unieść. Gdy padną, Kestrel zajmie zewnętrzny dziedziniec.
DIALOGUE_WATCH_SERGEANT_VARROTH_REWARD|Varroth nie żyje? Dobrze. Król wilkołaków tak blisko Rockmaw to zbyt blisko moich wartowników.\nWeź sakiewkę i ten topór. Wyciągnęliśmy go z zapasów Rockmaw.
DIALOGUE_WATCH_SERGEANT_VARROTH_REMINDER|Niepozorna Jaskinia, wzgórza na południowy zachód od Highmark. Varroth trzyma dolne kamienne sale. Zabij go, zanim jego wataha sprawdzi wartowników Rockmaw.
DIALOGUE_WATCH_SERGEANT_VARROTH_START|Jeszcze jedna robota, skoro Rockmaw się trzyma. Wataha pod Niepozorną Jaskinią jest dość blisko, by dosięgnąć naszych wartowników.\nJaskinia leży na wzgórzach na południowy zachód od Highmark. Varroth, Król Wilkołaków, trzyma dolne kamienne sale. Zabij go i zamelduj; mam monety i topór z zapasów Rockmaw.
DIALOGUE_VAUST_ORDERS_HANDIN|Good. West scouts need current routes, not guesses.\nTell the Lancers I heard the message. Take the carry pay.
DIALOGUE_VAUST_NEEDS_WHITE_SEAL|Camp Kestrel nie jest schronieniem dla niedokończonej pracy z reliktami. Dokończ sprawę amuletu Białej Pieczęci z Tharecem, potem wróć.
DIALOGUE_EIRADHA_GHOSTWOOD_CONSULT|The ghostwood trouble belongs with the Kestrel scout. Follow the smoke if it still rises; return to the scout when it is quiet.
DIALOGUE_EIRADHA_TELWYND_OPEN|Sairveth has opened Telwynd to you. From Glassroot Hollow, take the forest road northwest to the town and wait for a warden at the gate.
DIALOGUE_EIRADHA_GLASSROOT_TURNIN|The drake is dead? Good. Then Glassroot can breathe again.\nI will send word ahead. From the hollow, take the forest road northwest to Telwynd; Warden Sairveth Ilyr will receive you. Consider this a narrow measure of trust, not a welcome.
DIALOGUE_EIRADHA_GLASSROOT_REMINDER|Glassroot Hollow first. Leave Highmark, take the east road from the crossroads, and follow it southeast into the Veiled Wood. Kill the blackglass drake feeding there. Until the hollow is clear, Telwynd keeps its gates shut.
DIALOGUE_EIRADHA_GLASSROOT_START|Highmark does not usually send armed strangers to my door. Since you are here, I will be plain.\nTelwynd is closed to you for now. Glassroot Hollow lies east from the crossroads outside Highmark; follow the road as it bends southeast into the Veiled Wood. A blackglass drake is feeding there.\nClear the hollow and return to me. Do that, and I may have room for a narrow measure of trust.
DIALOGUE_SAIRVETH_GLASSROOT_TURNIN|Glassroot Hollow is clear? Then Telwynd can receive you properly. The town owes you passage.\nUse the forest road back toward Glassroot when you leave, and do not test side trails. I can help with ordinary wardwork while you are here.
DIALOGUE_SAIRVETH_TELWYND_CLOSED|Telwynd is closed to guests while Glassroot Hollow is held by the drake. Kill it, then return by the same forest road. Do not test side trails.
DIALOGUE_SAIRVETH_MOONWELL_TURNIN|You reached the far exit? Good. The Moonwell Tunnels can carry wardens again.\nTake the ward pay and this ring. Highmark will have fewer excuses to close the tunnel route.
DIALOGUE_SAIRVETH_MOONWELL_REMINDER|Moonwell Tunnels still need both moonstone dials set. Reach the far exit, then return. Until then, I keep it off our patrol map.
DIALOGUE_SAIRVETH_MOONWELL_START|The Moonwell Tunnels run below the high route, from the Moonwell site toward the southwest exit. Highmark leaves them closed; Telwynd needs another way through.\nSet both moonstone dials, reach the far exit, and return to me. If you can walk it end to end, I can send wardens after you.
DIALOGUE_SAIRVETH_HIGHWIND_FOUND_CATACOMBS|You found the Highwind Catacombs? Then the lower door still opens.\nTelwynd needed proof, and you brought it. Good work.
DIALOGUE_SAIRVETH_HIGHWIND_ASK_THERYN|The chapel wardwork is still sound, and it points below the monastery.\nOld Theryn Rusk knows the Highwind grounds. Ask him where the lower entrance opens.
DIALOGUE_SAIRVETH_HIGHWIND_MONASTERY_REMINDER|Highwind Monastery first. Inspect the old chapel and return to me before you chase a lower door.
DIALOGUE_SAIRVETH_ELDERWYRM_TURNIN|Elderwyrm leży? Dobrze. Przez lata słyszałem, jak jego sen naciskał na osłony.\nWeź zapłatę. Otworzę Veiled Paths dla tych, którzy potrafią iść bez łamania znaków.
DIALOGUE_SAIRVETH_VEILED_PATHS_OPEN|The sealed passage by the Ancient Dwarven Gate should answer now. Glassroot gave you enough standing with Telwynd.\nReturn below the gate and touch the elven wardwork. If it opens, stay on the main grove path.
DIALOGUE_SAIRVETH_HIGHWIND_START|Highwind Monastery has Telwynd wardwork under White Seal repairs, and there may be a lower door beneath the chapel.\nGo there, inspect the old chapel, then return. If the work is still sound, I will send you to the man who knows the lower entrance.
DIALOGUE_SAIRVETH_IDLE|Telwynd paths are not open to travelers. Bring me sealed doors, true shards, or broken wards before you test them.\nFor ordinary wardwork, speak plainly and I will see what can be done.
DIALOGUE_EIVYSS_BLACKGLASS_TABLE_LOCKED|No. Not yet. Sairveth has not vouched for your White Seal blood. Settle that with him first, then I will look at your shard.
DIALOGUE_EIVYSS_BLACKGLASS_TABLE_OPEN|Sairveth vouched for you. Put true blackglass shards on the copper tray; I can set one into wards, staves, circlets, and Telwynd work.
DIALOGUE_EIVYSS_BLACKGLASS_TABLE_LIMITS|One shard, one finished piece. Stronger work waits until Sairveth opens more of the table.
DIALOGUE_EIVYSS_MOONWELL_ATTUNE_DONE|The lens is attuned. Install it at the moonwell.
DIALOGUE_EIVYSS_MOONWELL_INSTALL|Soczewka trzyma ton. Zanieś ją do ramy Moonwell Observatory i osadź bez obracania.
DIALOGUE_EIVYSS_MOONWELL_RETURN_VEYDRAS|Rama przyjęła soczewkę? W takim razie odczyt należy do Veydrasa w Highmark. Zanieś mu go, zanim znaki ostygną.
DIALOGUE_EIVYSS_ELDERWYRM_START|Elderwyrm Grove juz nie spi. Caerwyn nagial stare zielone oslony wokol siebie.\nOdzyskaj gaj, albo robotnicy szlakow wyslani tam przez Sairveth wejda ze spiewem, a wyjda jako przestrogi.
DIALOGUE_AELTHIR_GROVE_TABLE_CLOSED|Stół gaju jest zamknięty dla obcych, dopóki Sairveth nie powie, że droga cię zna.
DIALOGUE_AELTHIR_GROVE_MAGIC_OPEN|Gate open, crates tied down, ward line steady. Browse if you need grove work; step back if the old well flares.
DIALOGUE_SMUGGLER_LOCKBOX_DONE|Skrzynka jest z powrotem, a Snapjaw nie żyje. Nie pytaj, gdzie idzie dalej.
DIALOGUE_SMUGGLER_LOCKBOX_HANDIN|Postaw to na ziemi przy scianie. Nie otwieraj. Pieczec wciaz jest zamknieta, a place za zamkniete skrzynki.
DIALOGUE_SMUGGLER_LOCKBOX_PAY|Dobrze. Stary Snapjaw nie żyje, skrzynka wróciła, a ja mogę ruszyć, zanim kupcy zaczną pytać. Weź zapłatę za skrzynkę.
DIALOGUE_SMUGGLER_LOCKBOX_ROUTE|Bring the lockbox from the grotto.
DIALOGUE_SMUGGLER_SEAL_HANDIN|That is my seal. You did the job clean, so I will pay what I promised.
DIALOGUE_SMUGGLER_LOCKBOX_AFTER_SEAL|There is one more thing in that grotto: an iron lockbox in the lower cove. Bring it back shut and I will pay better coin.
DIALOGUE_SMUGGLER_LOCKBOX_OFFER_AFTER_SEAL|You brought the seal back clean. If you want the better pay, go back to the same grotto and find my iron lockbox in the lower cove. Bring it back shut.
DIALOGUE_SMUGGLER_SEAL_ROUTE|Idź wschodnią drogą z Havenford do King's Barrow, potem skręć na południe z drogi kurhanu do Smuggler Grotto. Przynieś moją ołowianą pieczęć.
DIALOGUE_SMUGGLER_SEAL_START_PRESSURE|Mów ciszej. Nie jesteś strażą Havenford, a ekipa z groty nie będzie znać twojej twarzy. Dobrze.
DIALOGUE_SMUGGLER_SEAL_START_ROUTE|Take the east road from Havenford toward King's Barrow, then turn south to Smuggler Grotto. Bring back my lead seal whole, and I pay.
DIALOGUE_MERRIT_REPAIRED_SHOP_OPEN|Havenford Corner is open. Rings in the tray, charms in the case, and small bottles behind my hand. What can I show you, if your coin is honest?
DIALOGUE_MERRIT_TRAVEL_CASE_DAMAGE|Kobolds broke my door and left smoke in the shutters. Until Havenford Corner is mended, this travel case is my shop.
DIALOGUE_MERRIT_TRAVEL_CASE_STOCK|Rings and charms first. Small bottles if you have coin. Ask before touching the wrapped row.
DIALOGUE_THRUNNA_ORC_FORTRESS_DONE|No new raids from the Orc Fortress. Stonecleft still keeps shields on the wagons, but Gorvuk's warband is broken.
DIALOGUE_THRUNNA_ORC_FORTRESS_TURNIN|Gorvuk is dead? Good. A palisade can still hold raiders, but it has lost command.
DIALOGUE_THRUNNA_ORC_FORTRESS_REWARD|Take this hammer and the road pay. Stonecleft pays for road work. I will put shields back on the wagon line.
DIALOGUE_THRUNNA_ORC_FORTRESS_REMINDER_ROUTE|Take the west road out of Stonecleft, then follow the rough track southwest to the Orc Fortress.
DIALOGUE_THRUNNA_NEEDS_FORTRESS_SKETCH|Stonecleft keeps its gates with patience and hard boots. If you are heading west, keep your shield hand free and do not trust quiet hills.
DIALOGUE_THRUNNA_HALF_ORC_REFUSAL|Zatrzymaj szkic. Nie wpiszę półorka w rozkazy Stonecleft przeciw orkowej palisadzie. To moja odpowiedź.
DIALOGUE_THRUNNA_ORC_FORTRESS_TOO_GREEN|Not yet. That sketch shows trouble bigger than a road scrape. Keep it safe while I weigh the road risk.
DIALOGUE_THRUNNA_ORC_FORTRESS_MAP_HANDIN_READ|Outer wall, dug rooms, watch posts, and Gorvuk's sign. That is an orc fortress, not a camp.
DIALOGUE_THRUNNA_ORC_FORTRESS_MAP_HANDIN_ASK|I am keeping the sketch. Go up there, break the warband, kill Gorvuk, and return. Hammer and coin if you come back alive.
DIALOGUE_BOREK_ORC_FORTRESS_DONE|Żadnych świeżych orkowych cięć na zachodnim trakcie. Załoga Gorvuka przestała ciągnąć kłody przez naszą drogę.
DIALOGUE_BOREK_SKETCH_TO_THRUNNA|The western track is quiet for now. Thrunna decides the rest.
DIALOGUE_BOREK_TOO_GREEN|Not yet. That fort is Stonecleft road business now, not trail gossip.
DIALOGUE_BOREK_SKETCH_DELIVERY|A trader left this after hearing you came back from Old Cave. It shows an orc palisade west of Stonecleft. Take it to the gate warden; she will know if it matches scout reports.
DIALOGUE_BORRI_RESCUED_REPEAT|Safe at the gatehall, thanks to you. The orcs won't take me again.
DIALOGUE_BORRI_RESCUE|By the forge, I thought those orcs had me. I can make the gatehall if the route is clear. You have my thanks.
DIALOGUE_BORRI_HELM_REWARD|I made it back. This helm is yours now, and better in your hands than locked in a dwarf chest.
DIALOGUE_MAVETH_FARMER_THOM_HOME|Thom jest w domu, oddycha i jest dość uparty, by znow narzekac na plot. Przyjme ten cud. Nasza rodzina jest twoim dluznikiem.
DIALOGUE_MAVETH_FARMER_THOM_RETURNED|Thom wrócił. Roztrzęsiony, jakby wyskoczył ze skóry, ale wrócił. Dziękuję. Zaczęłam już liczyć, którzy sąsiedzi pomogą mi kopać.
DIALOGUE_MAVETH_FARMER_REMINDER_SHRINE|Znalazles jakis slad Thoma? Z kazda godzina coraz trudniej udawac, ze tylko zgubil droge.
DIALOGUE_MAVETH_FARMER_REMINDER_GOBLIN|Znalazles jakis slad Thoma? Z kazda godzina coraz trudniej udawac, ze tylko zgubil droge.
DIALOGUE_MAVETH_FARMER_START_PRESSURE|Traveler, stop. Thom left by the north fence this morning, and the hands are already walking over his tracks.
DIALOGUE_MAVETH_FARMER_START_SHRINE|Thom poszedl za sladami za polnocnym plotem i nigdy nie wrocil. Nie wiem, dokad go zaprowadzily. Prosze, znajdz go, jesli zyje, albo przynies mi prawde, jesli nie.
DIALOGUE_MAVETH_FARMER_START_GOBLIN|Thom poszedl za sladami za polnocnym plotem i nigdy nie wrocil. Nie wiem, dokad go zaprowadzily. Prosze, znajdz go, jesli zyje, albo przynies mi prawde, jesli nie.
DIALOGUE_THOM_LOST_REPEAT|I am coming. Give me one breath, then point me toward Maveth's field.
DIALOGUE_THOM_LOST_RESCUE|Havenford? Maveth sent you? Keep the way clear. I can walk if I do not look back.
DIALOGUE_THOM_WOLD_REWARD|Maveth says I owe you. She is right. Take this lucky charm. It kept me steady long enough to get home.
DIALOGUE_THOM_WOLD_HOME_IDLE|Maveth has me inside the north fence and off the road. I am not arguing today.
DIALOGUE_NOTHAS_THOM_FOUND|You found Thom near Havenford? Thank you. I have porter pay and little else, but his name can stay on the family slate.
DIALOGUE_NOTHAS_THOM_MISSING_HINT|Thom zaginal. Maveth w Havenford choruje ze zmartwienia. Jesli go znajdziesz, rodzina bedzie twoim dluznikiem.
DIALOGUE_HARREN_TUTORIAL_START|Wreszcie nie śpisz. Twój ojciec mówił mi, że nadejdzie dzień, kiedy amulet zacznie się budzić - i modlę się, żeby to, co dalej, było tylko przesadą. Wracam do świątyni, odtąd radzisz sobie sam. Bez zwłoki ruszaj drogą na wschód. Znajdź dokmistrza w Brindle Quay i oddaj mu ten list. Przeprawi cię do Valorii. W skrzyni zostały zapasy; zabierz je i ruszaj na wschód. Czeka cię ciężka droga, dzieciaku. Idź za amuletem i postaraj się przeżyć.
DIALOGUE_HARREN_TUTORIAL_REMINDER|Ruszaj się. Nabrzeże jest na wschód stąd.
DIALOGUE_GARRAN_NO_NOTE|Tu się pracuje. Jeśli nie przyszedłeś pomóc, zejdź z drogi.
DIALOGUE_GARRAN_NOTE_HANDIN|Harren to napisał? Hm. Rozumiem. Niedobrze. Wygląda na to, że mamy większy kłopot niż wzburzone morze. Dobra, kadłub nadal wymaga łatania po tym, jak wczorajszy powrót poszedł do diabła i rozdarł nam pół burty.
DIALOGUE_GARRAN_SLEEP_AT_INN|Będzie gotowe rano. Idź się przespać i wróć o świcie. W gospodzie powinien być wolny pokój.
DIALOGUE_GARRAN_SLEEP_REMINDER|Wciąż pracuję przy łodzi, dopóki mi nie przeszkodzisz. Znajdź pokój w gospodzie i wróć rano, chyba że chcesz płynąć wpław do Valorii.
DIALOGUE_GARRAN_READY_TO_SAIL|Rested? Good. Captain Thauld is ready for Reedwater Docks. The water has grown mean and the inland roads are worse, so once you are ashore, follow the north road toward Havenford.
DIALOGUE_CORREN_STOCK|Come in and look over the shelves. Rations, bandages, lamp oil, rope, and cheap blades. What do you need before Garran's boat leaves?
DIALOGUE_BRECK_START_CHECK|Ty tam. Jesli opuszczasz Brindle Quay, pokaz mi jedna akcje klasy na manekinie treningowym. Chce ja zobaczyc przed twoim wyjsciem z miasta.
DIALOGUE_BRECK_START_INPUT|Uzyj {class_actions} na manekinie treningowym. Chce zobaczyc jedna czysta akcje klasy, zanim wrocisz.
DIALOGUE_BRECK_ACTION_USED|Good. Keep it ready on the road. In a real fight, use it before you start bleeding.
DIALOGUE_BRECK_FIGHT_DONE|You made it back. Good. Keep your class action ready for Reedwater.
DIALOGUE_ORRIN_ROOM_NOT_READY|No bed yet, traveler. Garran has not sent word, and I am keeping the spare room closed.
DIALOGUE_ORRIN_ROOM_READY|Garran sent you? Then the spare room is yours. Key is on the peg; sleep now if you want Thauld's boat at first light.
DIALOGUE_TUTORIAL_INN_REST_TITLE|Karczmarz Orrin
DIALOGUE_TUTORIAL_INN_REST_MORNING|Morning, traveler. Thauld's crew is already on the pier. Eat if you need to, then go see Garran.
DIALOGUE_TUTORIAL_INN_REST_CAMP_KIT|Take this rough camping kit from the storeroom. Use it outside town when you need sleep and there is no inn nearby.
DIALOGUE_TUTORIAL_GUIDE_LAYOUT|Need your bearings? {guide_help_menu}
DIALOGUE_TUTORIAL_GUIDE_MARKED_NPCS|Ludzi z interesami da sie zauwazyc, jesli patrzysz uwaznie. Garran zalatwia przeprawe, Corren sprzedaje zapasy, a Breck cwiczy kazdego, kto ma dosc odwagi, by spytac. Do cwiczenia Brecka: {guide_class_actions}
DIALOGUE_TUTORIAL_GUIDE_SURVIVAL|Dragonwake sprawil, ze drogi i wody mniej wybaczaja. Odpoczywaj w gospodach albo bezpiecznych obozach, miej bandaze pod reka i jedz, zanim glod zdecyduje za ciebie. {guide_inventory}
DIALOGUE_TUTORIAL_GUIDE_BOAT_ROUTE|Once Garran clears you, the boat runs to Reedwater Docks. From there, follow the north road toward Havenford until you know the country.
SPELL_SELF_ENLARGE|Rzucasz Powiększenie. Twoje ciało pęcznieje od siły.
SPELL_SELF_REDUCE|Rzucasz Zmniejszenie. Twoje ciało kurczy się do środka.
SPELL_CAST_CAUSE_LIGHT_WOUNDS|Nakładasz na {0} Lekkie Zadawanie Ran.
SPELL_CAST_CAUSE_MODERATE_WOUNDS|Nakładasz na {0} Umiarkowane Zadawanie Ran.
SPELL_CAST_CAUSE_SERIOUS_WOUNDS|Nakładasz na {0} Poważne Zadawanie Ran.
SPELL_CAST_CAUSE_CRITICAL_WOUNDS|Nakładasz na {0} Krytyczne Zadawanie Ran.
STATUS_ENLARGE_FADES|Your enlarged body returns to normal.
STATUS_REDUCE_FADES|Your reduced body returns to normal.
ITEM_TARGET_OIL_LESSER_CONSECRATION|Choose a weapon to anoint with weak oil of consecration.
ITEM_TARGET_OIL_STRONG_CONSECRATION|Choose a weapon to anoint with strong oil of consecration.
ITEM_COATING_APPLY_OIL_LESSER_CONSECRATION|You anoint {0} with weak oil of consecration.
ITEM_COATING_APPLY_OIL_STRONG_CONSECRATION|You anoint {0} with strong oil of consecration.
ITEM_USE_POTION_ENLARGE|You drink the {0}. Your body swells with force.
ITEM_USE_POTION_REDUCE|You drink the {0}. Your body contracts inward.
ITEM_USE_POTION_NO_EFFECT|You drink the {0}, but it has no effect.
ITEM_USE_POTION_HARM|You drink the {0}. Pain tears through you for {1:%d} damage.
ITEM_USE_POTION_ACID|You drink the {0}. Acid burns through you for {1:%d} damage.
ITEM_USE_POTION_BURNING|You drink the {0}. Fire tears through you for {1:%d} damage.
ITEM_USE_POTION_WEAKNESS|You drink the {0}. Strength drains from your limbs.
ITEM_USE_POTION_SLOWNESS|You drink the {0}. Your body turns heavy and slow.
ITEM_USE_POTION_SILENCE|You drink the {0}. Your voice vanishes in your throat.
ITEM_USE_POTION_FEAR|You drink the {0}. Terror clamps down inside you.
ITEM_USE_POTION_SLEEP|You drink the {0}. Sleep drags at your eyes.
ITEM_USE_POTION_PARALYSIS|You drink the {0}. Your muscles lock in place.
ITEM_IDENTIFY_RECOGNIZE|{0}: you recognize {1} as {2}.
ITEM_THROW_POTION_WEAKEN|Rzucasz {0} w {1} i wysysasz jego siłę{2}.
ITEM_THROW_POTION_SLOW|Rzucasz {0} w {1}; spowalnia{2}.
