ITEM_HOLY_SYMBOL_EFFECT_IRON_HOLY_SYMBOL|Wearing a holy symbol increases piety point regeneration. It grants +2 ARM.
ITEM_HOLY_SYMBOL_EFFECT_SAINTLY_HOLY_SYMBOL|Wearing a holy symbol increases piety point regeneration. Healing prayers heal +1 HP per healing die, and it grants +1 WIS saves.
