CLASS_FEATURE_APPRENTICE_WIZARD_NAME|Mago Aprendiz
CLASS_FEATURE_APPRENTICE_WIZARD_SUMMARY|MP regenera mais rápido. Generalistas ganham +1 truque e +1 feitiço inicial; especialistas ganham School Mastery 1.
CLASS_FEATURE_APPRENTICE_WIZARD_SHORT_SUMMARY|Regeneração MP mais rápida; feitiços extras; School Mastery 1.
CLASS_FEATURE_APPRENTICE_WIZARD_GENERALIST_SUMMARY|MP regenera mais rápido. Ganha +1 escolha de truque e +1 feitiço inicial.
CLASS_FEATURE_APPRENTICE_WIZARD_GENERALIST_SHORT_SUMMARY|Regeneração MP mais rápida; +1 truque; +1 feitiço inicial.
CLASS_FEATURE_APPRENTICE_WIZARD_SPECIALIST_SUMMARY|MP regenera mais rápido. Ganha School Mastery rank 1 na escola escolhida.
CLASS_FEATURE_APPRENTICE_WIZARD_SPECIALIST_SHORT_SUMMARY|Regeneração MP mais rápida; School Mastery 1.
CLASS_FEATURE_ADEPT_WIZARD_NAME|Mago Adepto
CLASS_FEATURE_ADEPT_WIZARD_SUMMARY|Generalistas reduzem custos de feitiços arcanos em 1 MP. Especialistas ganham School Mastery 2 e escola -1 MP.
CLASS_FEATURE_ADEPT_WIZARD_SHORT_SUMMARY|Generalista arcanos -1 MP; especialista School Mastery 2.
CLASS_FEATURE_ADEPT_WIZARD_GENERALIST_SUMMARY|Feitiços arcanos custam 1 MP a menos.
CLASS_FEATURE_ADEPT_WIZARD_GENERALIST_SHORT_SUMMARY|Arcanos -1 MP.
CLASS_FEATURE_ADEPT_WIZARD_SPECIALIST_SUMMARY|Ganha School Mastery rank 2. Feitiços da escola escolhida custam 1 MP a menos.
CLASS_FEATURE_ADEPT_WIZARD_SPECIALIST_SHORT_SUMMARY|School Mastery 2; escola -1 MP.
CLASS_FEATURE_GRAND_WIZARD_PATH_NAME|Grande Mago
CLASS_FEATURE_GRAND_WIZARD_PATH_SUMMARY|A regeneração MP melhora de novo. Generalistas ganham +1 ataque/DC arcano; especialistas ganham School Mastery 3 e escola -2 MP.
CLASS_FEATURE_GRAND_WIZARD_PATH_SHORT_SUMMARY|Segundo aumento de regeneração MP; generalista +1 ataque/DC; School Mastery 3.
CLASS_FEATURE_GRAND_WIZARD_PATH_GENERALIST_SUMMARY|A regeneração MP melhora de novo. Ataques de feitiços arcanos e DCs de resistência ganham +1.
CLASS_FEATURE_GRAND_WIZARD_PATH_GENERALIST_SHORT_SUMMARY|Aumento de regeneração MP; arcanos +1 ataque/DC.
CLASS_FEATURE_GRAND_WIZARD_PATH_SPECIALIST_SUMMARY|A regeneração MP melhora de novo. Ganha School Mastery rank 3. Feitiços da escola escolhida custam 2 MP a menos.
CLASS_FEATURE_GRAND_WIZARD_PATH_SPECIALIST_SHORT_SUMMARY|Aumento de regeneração MP; School Mastery 3; escola -2 MP.
CLASS_FEATURE_WIZARD_ARCHMAGE_NAME|Arquimago
CLASS_FEATURE_WIZARD_ARCHMAGE_SUMMARY|Generalistas chegam a arcanos -2 MP e +2 ataque/DC. Especialistas ganham School Mastery 4 e escola -3 MP.
CLASS_FEATURE_WIZARD_ARCHMAGE_SHORT_SUMMARY|Generalista arcanos -2 MP e +2 ataque/DC; especialista School Mastery 4.
CLASS_FEATURE_WIZARD_ARCHMAGE_GENERALIST_SUMMARY|Feitiços arcanos custam 2 MP a menos e ganham +2 ataque/DC.
CLASS_FEATURE_WIZARD_ARCHMAGE_GENERALIST_SHORT_SUMMARY|Arcanos -2 MP; +2 ataque/DC.
CLASS_FEATURE_WIZARD_ARCHMAGE_SPECIALIST_SUMMARY|Ganha School Mastery rank 4. Feitiços da escola escolhida custam 3 MP a menos.
CLASS_FEATURE_WIZARD_ARCHMAGE_SPECIALIST_SHORT_SUMMARY|School Mastery 4; escola -3 MP.
UI_STATUS_LOCATION_HAVENFORD_MINES|[HM{0:%d}]
CATALOG_LOCATION_HAVENFORD_MINES_SUMMARY|Havenford Mines is a small worked mine in the mountains east of Havenford.
CATALOG_LOCATION_HAVENFORD_MINES_DETAIL|Its timbered rooms and stone corridors are blocked by boulders and occupied by kobolds, rats, and cave vermin.
CATALOG_LOCATION_HAVENFORD_MINES_ENEMIES|kobolds, giant rats, cave spiders
STORY_MSG_QUEST_UPDATE_RETURN_BRANNOC|Quest updated: return to Brannoc in Havenford.
DIALOGUE_BRANNOC_HAVENFORD_START|The Havenford mine is in the eastern mountains. Break the huge boulders on the lower levels so ore can move again. Kobolds are in there, so bring a weapon.
DIALOGUE_BRANNOC_HAVENFORD_REMINDER|Havenford Mines, east of town. Break the huge boulders around the lower stairs so ore can move again.
DIALOGUE_BRANNOC_HAVENFORD_TURNIN|That is Havenford stone, all right. Good work. The way is open again.
DIALOGUE_BRANNOC_HAVENFORD_REWARD|Thanks. Here, take this for your trouble.
DIALOGUE_BRANNOC_HAVENFORD_DONE|Forge is open. If you need gear, say so.
QUEST_LOG_HAVENFORD_MINES_RETURN_TITLE|Havenford Mines
QUEST_LOG_HAVENFORD_MINES_RETURN_OBJECTIVE|Return to Brannoc in Havenford.
QUEST_LOG_HAVENFORD_MINES_RETURN_DETAIL|The huge boulders are broken. Brannoc can reopen the ore route and improve his forge stock.
QUEST_LOG_HAVENFORD_MINES_TITLE|Havenford Mines
QUEST_LOG_HAVENFORD_MINES_OBJECTIVE|Break the huge boulders in Havenford Mines.
QUEST_LOG_HAVENFORD_MINES_DETAIL|Brannoc needs the lower mine stairs opened so ore carts can move again. Havenford Mines lies in the mountains east of Havenford.
ZONE_HAVENFORD_MINES_NAME|Havenford Mines
WORLD_POI_HAVENFORD_MINES_NAME|Havenford Mines
