ITEM_DAGGER_OF_FUMBLING_DESC|A cursed dagger that spoils the hand. It gives -3 ATK, -1 damage, and -3 DEX.
ITEM_DAGGER_OF_FUMBLING_UNIDENTIFIED_NAME|dagger
ITEM_DAGGER_OF_FUMBLING_UNIDENTIFIED_DESC|A narrow fighting dagger balanced for one hand.
ITEM_BOW_OF_SHAKING_HANDS_NAME|bow of shaking hands
ITEM_BOW_OF_SHAKING_HANDS_DESC|A cursed bow that makes every draw unsteady. It gives -3 ATK, -2 damage, and -3 DEX.
ITEM_BOW_OF_SHAKING_HANDS_UNIDENTIFIED_NAME|shortbow
ITEM_BOW_OF_SHAKING_HANDS_UNIDENTIFIED_DESC|A compact hunting bow for arrows.
ITEM_MACE_OF_EXHAUSTION_NAME|mace of exhaustion
ITEM_MACE_OF_EXHAUSTION_DESC|A cursed mace that drags strength from the body. It gives -2 ATK, -2 damage, -3 CON, and -8 max HP.
ITEM_MACE_OF_EXHAUSTION_UNIDENTIFIED_NAME|mace
ITEM_MACE_OF_EXHAUSTION_UNIDENTIFIED_DESC|A flanged iron mace with a short grip.
ITEM_AXE_OF_RECKLESSNESS_NAME|axe of recklessness
ITEM_AXE_OF_RECKLESSNESS_DESC|A cursed axe that pulls the guard wide open. It gives -1 ATK, -1 damage, -3 WIS, and -2 DEF.
ITEM_AXE_OF_RECKLESSNESS_UNIDENTIFIED_NAME|battle axe
ITEM_AXE_OF_RECKLESSNESS_UNIDENTIFIED_DESC|A broad war axe with a heavy beard and strong haft.
ITEM_STAFF_OF_DULLNESS_NAME|staff of dullness
ITEM_STAFF_OF_DULLNESS_DESC|A cursed staff that clouds spellwork. It gives -2 ATK, -2 damage, -3 INT, -2 spell attack, and -2 spell DC.
ITEM_STAFF_OF_DULLNESS_UNIDENTIFIED_NAME|quarterstaff
ITEM_STAFF_OF_DULLNESS_UNIDENTIFIED_DESC|A seasoned length of hardwood smoothed by use.
ITEM_GIRDLE_OF_WEAKNESS_NAME|girdle of weakness
ITEM_GIRDLE_OF_WEAKNESS_DESC|A cursed girdle that saps the bearer. It gives -1 ARM and -4 STR.
ITEM_GIRDLE_OF_WEAKNESS_UNIDENTIFIED_NAME|girdle
ITEM_GIRDLE_OF_WEAKNESS_UNIDENTIFIED_DESC|A sturdy girdle with worn buckles and heavy stitching.
ITEM_GAUNTLETS_OF_CLUMSINESS_NAME|gauntlets of clumsiness
ITEM_GAUNTLETS_OF_CLUMSINESS_DESC|Cursed gauntlets that make fine motion awkward. They give -1 DEF, +1 ARM, and -4 DEX.
ITEM_GAUNTLETS_OF_CLUMSINESS_UNIDENTIFIED_NAME|gauntlets
ITEM_GAUNTLETS_OF_CLUMSINESS_UNIDENTIFIED_DESC|Heavy gauntlets shaped for hard fighting.
ITEM_HELM_OF_FOLLY_NAME|helm of folly
ITEM_HELM_OF_FOLLY_DESC|A cursed helm that clouds judgment. It gives -1 DEF, +1 ARM, and -4 INT.
ITEM_HELM_OF_FOLLY_UNIDENTIFIED_NAME|helm
ITEM_HELM_OF_FOLLY_UNIDENTIFIED_DESC|A metal helm with a brow ridge and cheek guards.
ITEM_CIRCLET_OF_DOUBT_NAME|circlet of doubt
ITEM_CIRCLET_OF_DOUBT_DESC|A cursed circlet that gnaws at resolve. It gives -1 DEF and -4 WIS.
ITEM_CIRCLET_OF_DOUBT_UNIDENTIFIED_NAME|circlet
ITEM_CIRCLET_OF_DOUBT_UNIDENTIFIED_DESC|A narrow circlet worn on the brow.
ITEM_AMULET_OF_FRAILTY_NAME|amulet of frailty
