CLASS_ROGUE_SUMMARY_A|88|new-game class summary for Rogue|A practiced thief and scout skilled with tools, stealth, ambushes, and dirty work.
CLASS_ROGUE_SUMMARY_B|80|new-game class summary for Rogue|Class skill: Thievery. Trained: knives, swords, bows, slings, throwing.
CLASS_ROGUE_SUMMARY_C|112|new-game class summary for Rogue|Hit Dice: d6. Mana Dice: none. Piety Dice: none. Bonus skill choices at levels 1, 7, and 15.
