STORY_MSG_BURNED_COTTAGE_ALTAR_INSPECT|192|Burned Cottage altar first inspection message|You inspect the altar. Shallow water glyphs have been cut into the ash-dark floor, with water pooled in uneven splashes around the slab. Cult blood is old here; clawed tracks are fresher.
STORY_MSG_BURNED_COTTAGE_ALTAR_REPEAT|96|Burned Cottage altar repeat inspection message|Water glyphs and shallow pools still mark the ruined altar.
STORY_MSG_NOTHING_HAPPENS|32|generic story interaction no-effect message|Nothing happens.
STORY_MSG_ROADSIDE_ALTAR_OPEN|160|Roadside Shrine altar opens with holy symbol message|The Gravewarden's symbol warms in your hand. The altar slides aside, revealing a stairway beneath it.
STORY_MSG_ROADSIDE_ALTAR_FLICKER|128|Roadside Shrine altar ghostly flicker message|You see a flicker of a ghostly image before you for an instant before it fades away.
STORY_MSG_STONEWARD_GATE_SHUT|128|Ancient Dwarven Gate locked story interaction message|The Stoneward Gate holds shut. Dwarven runes are cut around the lock, but the old mechanism gives no answer.
STORY_MSG_STONEWARD_GATE_KEY_DRY|136|Stoneward Gate message when the player has the unblooded Stoneward Key|The Stoneward Key fits the old lock, but its elven glass stays dark. It needs fresh draconic blood from a corpse that has not rotted.
STORY_MSG_STONEWARD_GATE_OPENED|128|Stoneward Gate opening message with a blooded Stoneward Key|The blooded Stoneward Key turns once. Dwarven iron wakes under pale elven light, and the Stoneward Gate opens.
STORY_MSG_RECEIVE_STONEWARD_KEY|80|message when Throkk gives the Stoneward Key|You receive the Stoneward Key.
STORY_MSG_VEILED_GROVE_SHUT|160|Elven Passageways locked story interaction message|Pale elven wards seal the hidden passage. Telwynd may know how to make the old grove path answer.
STORY_MSG_BROKEN_DESCENT_FORCED|96|Istarian Sanctum route choice message|You take the Istarian Sanctum route. The sealed elven passage remains behind you.
STORY_MSG_BEACON_PRISM_BOSS_ALIVE|160|Beacon Prism blocked until tower dragon is slain message|The Beacon Prism still hangs above the chamber, but the dragon still holds the tower. Kill it before claiming the prism.
STORY_MSG_BEACON_PRISM_EMPTY|72|Beacon Prism already claimed message|The beacon is quiet; the prism is gone.
STORY_MSG_BEACON_PRISM_CLAIMED|128|Beacon Prism reward pickup message|You lift the Beacon Prism free. Pale light gathers inside it, and the tower falls quiet.
STORY_MSG_WHITE_VAULT_STAIR_SHUT|128|White Vault stair locked before quest access message|Pale wards hold the stair shut. Sacristan Oryn has not opened the lower ward to you.
STORY_MSG_BLACKGLASS_DESCENT_NEEDS_LIGHTGLASS|136|Blackglass Cavern lower descent blocked before Lightglass access|The deeper blackglass presses back against you. The Lightglass star is not ready for this descent.
STORY_MSG_BLACKGLASS_DESCENT_NEEDS_VHAROX|120|Blackglass Cavern old lower descent blocked message|The lower descent is choked with blackglass. The Lightglass star may answer it.
STORY_MSG_KESTREL_LIFT_LOCKED|112|Camp Kestrel lift locked from surface before discovery below|The Kestrel lift is locked from this side. Someone below has to secure it first.
STORY_MSG_KESTREL_LIFT_OPENED|112|Kestrel lift opened after finding it below Istarian Tunnels|The guards have the iron door open and the lift to Camp Kestrel set up.
STORY_MSG_FINAL_BLOOD_SEAL_OPEN|104|final blood seal already-open message|The final blood seal stands open. A core rift waits nearby where the stone split.
STORY_MSG_FINAL_BLOOD_SEAL_NEEDS_WORDS|136|legacy final blood seal missing aid message|The blood seal reacts to the Lightglass star, but stays shut. Tharec may know who can read this old Istarian work.
STORY_MSG_FINAL_BLOOD_SEAL_NEEDS_LIGHTGLASS|136|final blood seal needs worn Lightglass star message|The blood seal stirs under your hand, but nothing opens without the Lightglass star amulet worn at your throat.
STORY_MSG_FINAL_BLOOD_SEAL_NEEDS_BOTH|160|legacy final blood seal needs aid message|The blood seal stirs under your hand, but stays shut. You need the Lightglass star and someone who understands old Istarian work.
STORY_MSG_FINAL_BLOOD_SEAL_ASK_THAREC|136|final blood seal first blocker message|The ancient Istarian seal answers your blood, then falls silent. You should tell Tharec what you found below.
STORY_MSG_FINAL_BLOOD_SEAL_NEEDS_THERYN|128|final blood seal needs Theryn to ready the manuscript message|The manuscript is old Istarian, but not yet usable here. Theryn Rusk should read it first.
STORY_MSG_FINAL_BLOOD_SEAL_NEEDS_MANUSCRIPT|136|final blood seal needs the Ancient Istarian Manuscript message|The blood seal answers the Lightglass star, but the Istarian working is incomplete without the ancient manuscript.
STORY_MSG_FINAL_BLOOD_SEAL_OPENED|160|final blood seal opening message|The Lightglass star flares as your blood marks the manuscript. You read the old Istarian aloud, and the seal splits into a core rift nearby.
STORY_MSG_CISTERN_FISHERMAN_FOUND|112|Floodgate Cistern dead fisherman first discovery message|You find a dead fisherman wedged in the cistern muck. Captain Thauld should hear of this.
STORY_MSG_CISTERN_FISHERMAN_REPEAT|88|Floodgate Cistern dead fisherman repeat inspection message|The dead fisherman lies where the cistern water left him.
STORY_MSG_HIGHWIND_CATACOMBS_FOUND|88|Buried Highwind first entry discovery message|You find the hidden lower way into Highwind's catacombs.
STORY_MSG_REACHED_SOUTH_GATE|128|first-entry message for South Gate|South Gate holds the mountain road in clipped orders, hot iron, and watched stone.
STORY_MSG_REACHED_STONECLEFT|128|first-entry message for Stonecleft|Stonecleft opens around you in hammer-noise, forge heat, and deep road traffic.
STORY_MSG_REACHED_HIGHMARK|128|first-entry message for Highmark|You arrive in Highmark, where the White Seal and the Silver Lances keep their crowded watch.
STORY_MSG_REACHED_WHITE_SEAL_TOWER|136|first-entry message for Tower of the White Seal|The Tower of the White Seal stands above the eastern road, its upper beacon still pale against the sky.
STORY_MSG_REACHED_CAMP_KESTREL|136|first-entry message for Camp Kestrel|Camp Kestrel sprawls near the Great Scar in canvas, ash, and hammer-noise from fresh breachworks.
STORY_MSG_REACHED_ISTARIAN_TUNNELS|112|first-entry message for Istarian Tunnels|You enter the Istarian Tunnels, old imperial stoneworks below the Blackglass descent.
STORY_MSG_REACHED_SUNDERING_DEPTHS|72|first-entry message for Sundering Depths|You enter the Sundering Depths, where blackglass chokes the old road.
STORY_MSG_REACHED_TELWYND|88|first-entry message for Telwynd|Telwynd appears among warded green paths and hidden watch posts.
STORY_MSG_GHOSTWOOD_SMOKE_CLEARED|104|Ghostwood first-entry message after smoke boss is slain|Ghostwood is still cold, but the old smoke has lifted from the road.
STORY_MSG_GHOSTWOOD_SMOKE_FOG|120|Ghostwood smoke first-entry message for the outer forest before boss is slain|Smoke hangs between the Ghostwood trees. The fog cuts sight down to a few careful steps.
STORY_MSG_ROCKMAW_OUTPOST_SEEN|160|Rockmaw Keep first-entry message after Kestrel outpost opens|Kestrel holds Rockmaw's outer yard now: rough beds, stacked crates, and a barricaded stair into the broken keep.
STORY_MSG_FINAL_DRAGON_FIRE_RESONANCE|144|first-entry warning when a fire dragon lives nearby|The star amulet turns hot against your chest, and your blood starts racing. A dragon waits ahead.
STORY_MSG_FINAL_DRAGON_FIRE_RESONANCE_DEEPER|112|depth-entry warning when a fire dragon lives nearby|Heat gathers in the amulet until it hurts to touch. The dragon is close.
STORY_MSG_FINAL_DRAGON_COLD_RESONANCE|144|first-entry warning when a cold dragon lives nearby|The star amulet turns cold as ice, and your blood stirs against it. A dragon waits ahead.
STORY_MSG_FINAL_DRAGON_COLD_RESONANCE_DEEPER|112|depth-entry warning when a cold dragon lives nearby|Frost bites through the amulet. The dragon is close.
STORY_MSG_FINAL_DRAGON_STORM_RESONANCE|144|first-entry warning when a storm dragon lives nearby|The star amulet prickles with static, and your pulse jumps with each crackle. A dragon waits ahead.
STORY_MSG_FINAL_DRAGON_STORM_RESONANCE_DEEPER|112|depth-entry warning when a storm dragon lives nearby|Blue-white sparks crawl across the amulet. The dragon is close.
STORY_MSG_FINAL_DRAGON_BLACK_RESONANCE|144|first-entry warning when a black dragon lives nearby|The star amulet stings cold against your chest, and your blood recoils. A dragon waits ahead.
STORY_MSG_FINAL_DRAGON_BLACK_RESONANCE_DEEPER|112|depth-entry warning when a black dragon lives nearby|The amulet's edge bites like acid through cloth. The dragon is close.
STORY_MSG_FINAL_DRAGON_FOREST_RESONANCE|144|first-entry warning when a forest dragon lives nearby|The star amulet pulls with a slow green ache, and your blood stirs. A dragon waits ahead.
STORY_MSG_FINAL_DRAGON_FOREST_RESONANCE_DEEPER|112|depth-entry warning when a forest dragon lives nearby|The amulet tugs toward old roots. The dragon is close.
STORY_MSG_FINAL_DRAGON_PRIMORDIAL_RESONANCE|144|first-entry warning when the Primordial Dragon lives nearby|The Lightglass star warms against your chest. Somewhere ahead, the Primordial Dragon answers your blood.
STORY_MSG_FINAL_DRAGON_PRIMORDIAL_RESONANCE_DEEPER|128|depth-entry warning when the Primordial Dragon lives nearby|The star amulet beats once against your chest. The Primordial Dragon is closer now.
STORY_MSG_ELDERWYRM_GROVE_RECLAIMED|128|Elderwyrm Grove first-entry message after reclamation|Elven wardworkers now hold a small camp in Elderwyrm Grove beside the open Telwynd gate.
STORY_MSG_REACHED_STARFALL_CORE|128|first-entry message for Starfall Core|You enter the Starfall Core: broken blackglass, white glare, and a deep machine rumble.
STORY_MSG_RUNEFORGE_DUERGAR_FOUND|160|Floodgate Cistern runeforge corpse discovery message|Dead duergar lie beside the lower stairs, crude tools scattered around the sluice. The stone is raked with fresh claw marks.
STORY_MSG_SMUGGLER_STAIRS_FOUND|88|Smuggler Grotto concealed stair discovery message|You spot a down staircase hidden among the waterlogged stones.
STORY_MSG_INN_NO_BEDS|48|inn rest blocked because tutorial room is not ready|No beds are available right now.
STORY_MSG_REST_BLOCKED_DEFAULT|48|generic inn rest blocked message|This is no time to sleep.
STORY_MSG_INN_NEED_GOLD|64|inn rest blocked by insufficient gold, placeholder 0 room price|You need {0:%d} gold for a room.
STORY_MSG_INN_RESTED_FINISH|72|inn rest completion message with rested XP bonus|You wake in a proper bed feeling especially well rested.
STORY_MSG_BOAT_TIDEHOOK_TO_REEDWATER|96|boat travel message from Tidehook Docks to Reedwater Docks, placeholder 0 fare gold|You pay {0:%d} gold and ride the skiff north to Reedwater Docks.
STORY_MSG_BOAT_TIDEHOOK_ROUTE_CLOSED|80|boat travel blocked while Tidehook channel is unsafe|The boat hand will not risk the Tidehook channel yet.
STORY_MSG_BOAT_REEDWATER_TO_TIDEHOOK|96|boat travel message from Reedwater Docks to Tidehook Docks, placeholder 0 fare gold|You pay {0:%d} gold and ride the skiff south to Tidehook Docks.
STORY_MSG_BOAT_TUTORIAL_SLEEP_FIRST|64|tutorial boat travel blocked until the player sleeps|Boat leaves in the morning. Go get some sleep.
STORY_MSG_BOAT_TUTORIAL_TO_STORMWRECK|96|tutorial boat travel message after the storm strands the player|The storm throws Thauld's boat onto the rocks of Stormwreck Isle.
STORY_MSG_BOAT_TUTORIAL_TO_REEDWATER|88|tutorial boat travel message after departing starter island|Captain Thauld brings the small boat into Reedwater Docks.
STORY_MSG_BOAT_NEED_PASSAGE_GOLD|64|boat travel blocked by insufficient gold, placeholder 0 fare gold|You need {0:%d} gold for passage.
STORY_MSG_BOAT_CROSSING_UNAVAILABLE|72|boat travel blocked because destination placement failed|The boat cannot make that crossing right now.
STORY_MSG_ROCKMAW_OUTPOST_OPENED|104|message when Kestrel opens the Rockmaw outpost|Kestrel moves on Rockmaw Keep. The outer yard will serve as a rough outpost.
STORY_MSG_ELDERWYRM_GATE_OPENED|104|message when Telwynd opens the Elderwyrm Grove gate|Telwynd opens the grove gate. Elven wardworkers move into Elderwyrm Grove.
STORY_MSG_NHALOR_RISES|80|message when Nhalor rises at Reedmire Shrine|The water gathers before the altar. Nhalor rises from it.
STORY_INTRO_NHALOR||monster intro line for Nhalor at Reedmire Shrine|"The deep water keeps what it is given."
STORY_MSG_BOSS_VEYR_SLAIN|136|Ghostwood boss kill message for Veyr|Veyr collapses into cold ash. The smoke outside loosens, and real wind moves through Ghostwood again.
STORY_XP_BOSS_VEYR_SLAIN|64|special XP event for killing Veyr|Veyr, the Vampire Lord is slain
STORY_MSG_BOSS_MAUG_SLAIN|88|Rockmaw boss kill message for Maug|Maug drops hard enough to shake old dust from Rockmaw's stones.
STORY_MSG_BOSS_MAUG_PROOF|72|Rockmaw proof pickup message for Maug|You take Maug's head as proof for Kestrel.
STORY_XP_BOSS_MAUG_SLAIN|56|special XP event for killing Maug|Maug, the Ettin is slain
STORY_MSG_BOSS_BROND_SLAIN|96|Rockmaw boss kill message for Brond|Brond falls with a broken roar, and the ogres around Rockmaw falter.
STORY_MSG_BOSS_BROND_PROOF|72|Rockmaw proof pickup message for Brond|You take Brond's head as proof for Kestrel.
STORY_XP_BOSS_BROND_SLAIN|64|special XP event for killing Brond|Brond, the Ogre Champion is slain
STORY_MSG_BOSS_VARROTH_SLAIN|112|Inconspicuous Cave boss kill message for Varroth|Varroth dies on the clean stone, and the hidden pack breaks into scattered howls.
STORY_XP_BOSS_VARROTH_SLAIN|72|special XP event for killing Varroth|Varroth, the Werewolf King is slain
STORY_MSG_BOSS_GRUMMOK_SLAIN|112|Bloodied Cave boss kill message for Grummok|Grummok falls in the bloodied stone hall, and the surviving trolls scatter into the dark.
STORY_XP_BOSS_GRUMMOK_SLAIN|72|special XP event for killing Grummok|Grummok, the Troll King is slain
STORY_MSG_BOSS_CAERWYN_SLAIN|104|Elderwyrm Grove boss kill message for Caerwyn|Caerwyn falls among old roots. The air in Elderwyrm Grove turns bright and still.
STORY_XP_BOSS_CAERWYN_SLAIN|80|special XP event for killing Caerwyn|Caerwyn, the Ancient Forest Dragon is slain
STORY_MSG_BOSS_HALRIC_SLAIN|104|King's Barrow boss kill message for Halric|King Halric falls. The royal sarcophagus grinds once in the dark behind him.
STORY_MSG_ISTARIAN_MANUSCRIPT_CLAIMED|136|Ancient Istarian Manuscript pickup message|The Ancient Istarian Manuscript's vellum is stiff with age, but the ink still holds.
STORY_XP_BOSS_HALRIC_SLAIN|80|special XP event for killing King Halric|King Halric, the Barrow Wight is slain
STORY_MSG_BOSS_MOONWELL_ECHO_SLAIN|104|Moonwell Rite boss kill message for the Moonwell Echo|The Moonwell Echo breaks into pale rings of light. The lower rite steadies.
STORY_XP_BOSS_MOONWELL_ECHO_SLAIN|72|special XP event for killing the Moonwell Echo|The Moonwell Echo is slain
STORY_MSG_BOSS_SNAPJAW_SLAIN|88|Smuggler Grotto boss kill message for Old Snapjaw|Old Snapjaw thrashes once and goes still among the bandit dead.
STORY_XP_BOSS_SNAPJAW_SLAIN|48|special XP event for killing Old Snapjaw|Old Snapjaw is slain
STORY_MSG_BOSS_NHALOR_SLAIN|80|Reedmire Shrine boss kill message for Nhalor|Nhalor collapses into dead water around the shrine stones.
STORY_XP_BOSS_NHALOR_SLAIN|64|special XP event for killing Nhalor|Nhalor, the Water Weird is slain
STORY_MSG_BOSS_RHAZUN_SLAIN|88|Floodgate Cistern boss kill message for Rhazun|Rhazun sinks below the sluice water, leaving the lower cistern still.
STORY_XP_BOSS_RHAZUN_SLAIN|64|special XP event for killing Rhazun|Rhazun, the Water Drake is slain
STORY_MSG_BOSS_SKRIT_SLAIN|80|Abandoned Mine boss kill message for Skrit|Skrit falls. The Abandoned Mine goes ragged and quiet around him.
STORY_MSG_BOSS_VARGROM_SLAIN|64|Deadrock Mineworks boss kill message for Vargrom|Vargrom drops with his guard broken around him.
STORY_XP_BOSS_VARGROM_SLAIN|72|special XP event for killing Vargrom|Vargrom, the Blackglass Duergar Captain is slain
STORY_MSG_BOSS_KROSH_SLAIN|104|Desolate Docks boss kill message for Krosh|Krosh falls. The Desolate Docks go quiet except for water under rotten boards.
STORY_XP_BOSS_KROSH_SLAIN|64|special XP event for killing Krosh|Krosh, the Orc Warrior is slain
STORY_MSG_BOSS_DORUN_VARR_SLAIN|96|Bandit Toll Camp boss kill message for Dorun Varr|Dorun Varr falls. The toll camp breaks into panic around him.
STORY_XP_BOSS_DORUN_VARR_SLAIN|64|special XP event for killing Dorun Varr|Dorun Varr, the Toll Boss is slain
STORY_MSG_BOSS_RHAZVEK_SLAIN|72|Ash Tower boss kill message for Rhazvek|Rhazvek crashes down in a spill of ash and heat.
STORY_XP_BOSS_RHAZVEK_SLAIN|80|special XP event for killing Rhazvek|Rhazvek, the Young Red Dragon is slain
STORY_XP_RAT_CELLAR_QUIET|48|special XP event for clearing the rat cellar|The dock cellar falls quiet
STORY_MSG_BOSS_GORVUK_SLAIN|88|Orc Fortress boss kill message for Gorvuk|Gorvuk falls. The Orc Fortress breaks into shouted panic around him.
STORY_XP_BOSS_GORVUK_SLAIN|64|special XP event for killing Gorvuk|Gorvuk the Orc Warboss is slain
STORY_XP_DESOLATE_DOCKS_REPORTED|64|special XP event for reporting Krosh's defeat|Krosh's defeat is reported
STORY_XP_ORC_FORTRESS_REPORTED|64|special XP event for reporting the broken Orc Fortress|The Orc Fortress is broken
STORY_MSG_BOSS_MORGHAT_SLAIN|72|boss event message when Morghat is slain|Morghat falls, and the Orc Warrens go still.
STORY_MSG_BOSS_VARKAN_SLAIN|72|boss event message when Varkan is slain|Varkan falls, and the Orc War Camp breaks.
STORY_XP_BOSS_MORGHAT_SLAIN|64|special XP event for killing Morghat|Morghat of the Orc Warrens is slain
STORY_XP_BOSS_VARKAN_SLAIN|64|special XP event for killing Varkan|Varkan of the Orc War Camp is slain
STORY_MSG_BOSS_CAVE_CHIEF_SLAIN|96|Goblin Cave boss kill message for the cave chief|The cave chief falls. The deeper goblin hold loses its nerve around him.
STORY_XP_BOSS_CAVE_CHIEF_SLAIN|56|special XP event for killing Rakto|Goblin chief Rakto is slain
STORY_VOICE_STARFALL_DRAKE||fullscreen voice after Starfall Burrow drake is slain|A voice fills your head: "Blood of the seal, return to me."
STORY_XP_BOSS_STARFALL_DRAKE_SLAIN|72|special XP event for killing the Starfall Burrow drake|The drake in the Starfall Burrow falls
STORY_MSG_BOSS_BEACON_DRAKE_SLAIN|160|White Seal Tower boss kill message for beacon dragon|The dragon falls away from the tower beacon. Above the chamber, the Beacon Prism burns with a dim white glow.
STORY_XP_BOSS_BEACON_DRAKE_SLAIN|88|special XP event for killing the Tower of the White Seal dragon|The dragon in the Tower of the White Seal falls
STORY_MSG_BOSS_UNDERWAY_DRAKE_SLAIN|160|Underway boss kill message for stone drake|The stone drake collapses against North Gate. Old gears grind, and the road through the mountain opens toward Highmark.
STORY_XP_BOSS_UNDERWAY_DRAKE_SLAIN|72|special XP event for killing the Underway drake|The drake at North Gate falls
STORY_MSG_BOSS_WHITE_VAULT_DRAKE_SLAIN|112|White Vault boss kill message for greater drake|The greater drake breaks at last. A pale hum rises from below the stone.
STORY_XP_BOSS_WHITE_VAULT_DRAKE_SLAIN|88|special XP event for killing the White Vault greater drake|The greater drake in the White Vault falls
STORY_MSG_BOSS_GLASSROOT_DRAKE_SLAIN|160|Glassroot Hollow boss kill message for blackglass drake|The blackglass drake tears apart around the Moonwell lens in its hoard. You take the lens; the observatory can show Telwynd now.
STORY_XP_BOSS_GLASSROOT_DRAKE_SLAIN|88|special XP event for killing the Glassroot Hollow blackglass drake|The blackglass drake in Glassroot Hollow falls
STORY_MSG_BOSS_VHAROX_SLAIN|144|Blackglass Cavern boss kill message for Vharox|Vharox breaks against the blackglass. The lower caverns fall quiet.
STORY_XP_BOSS_VHAROX_SLAIN|64|special XP event for killing Vharox|Vharox, the Blackglass Drake is slain
STORY_MSG_BOSS_PRIMORDIAL_SLAIN|136|Starfall Core final boss kill message|The primordial dragon shudders, collapses into white-black light, and the calling voice stops.
STORY_VICTORY_PRIMORDIAL|56|victory outcome text after final boss is defeated|prevailed over the primordial dragon
STORY_XP_STORM_LANDING|32|special XP event after safely reaching Valoria|You arrived safely
