DISCORD_NEW_ADVENTURE_TAGLINE_01||Discord new-adventure tagline, placeholders 0 subject pronoun, 1 possessive pronoun|Will {0} make it to level 2?
DISCORD_NEW_ADVENTURE_TAGLINE_02||Discord new-adventure tagline, placeholders 0 subject pronoun, 1 possessive pronoun|Will {0} make it past the rats?
DISCORD_NEW_ADVENTURE_TAGLINE_03||Discord new-adventure tagline, placeholders 0 subject pronoun, 1 possessive pronoun|Hope {0} bought enough food.
DISCORD_NEW_ADVENTURE_TAGLINE_04||Discord new-adventure tagline, placeholders 0 subject pronoun, 1 possessive pronoun|Hope {0} brought a second torch.
DISCORD_NEW_ADVENTURE_TAGLINE_05||Discord new-adventure tagline|Pack check: food, light, bandages.
DISCORD_NEW_ADVENTURE_TAGLINE_06||Discord new-adventure tagline|Keep a retreat path open when the first wolf appears.
DISCORD_NEW_ADVENTURE_TAGLINE_07||Discord new-adventure tagline|Check the Rat Cellar hatch before climbing down.
DISCORD_NEW_ADVENTURE_TAGLINE_08||Discord new-adventure tagline|Good luck out there. The cottages have been rough lately.
DISCORD_NEW_ADVENTURE_TAGLINE_09||Discord new-adventure tagline|A fresh pack, a clean weapon, and no scars yet.
DISCORD_NEW_ADVENTURE_TAGLINE_10||Discord new-adventure tagline|Find the stairs before the bleeding starts.
DISCORD_NEW_ADVENTURE_TAGLINE_11||Discord new-adventure tagline|The first trap can end a run. Search when the floor looks wrong.
DISCORD_NEW_ADVENTURE_TAGLINE_12||Discord new-adventure tagline|Check the first cave entrance before rushing in.
DISCORD_NEW_ADVENTURE_TAGLINE_13||Discord new-adventure tagline|Level 2 would be a strong start.
DISCORD_NEW_ADVENTURE_TAGLINE_14||Discord new-adventure tagline|Someone keep an eye on the rations.
DISCORD_NEW_ADVENTURE_TAGLINE_15||Discord new-adventure tagline, placeholders 0 subject pronoun, 1 possessive pronoun|Keep {1} retreat path clear.
DISCORD_NEW_ADVENTURE_TAGLINE_16||Discord new-adventure tagline|The wilderness gets another challenger.
DISCORD_NEW_ADVENTURE_TAGLINE_17||Discord new-adventure tagline, placeholders 0 subject pronoun, 1 possessive pronoun|Let's see if {0} can outlive the welcome committee.
DISCORD_NEW_ADVENTURE_TAGLINE_18||Discord new-adventure tagline|Keep enough HP to survive one bad roll.
DISCORD_NEW_ADVENTURE_TAGLINE_19||Discord new-adventure tagline|A new run begins. The wolves can wait their turn.
DISCORD_NEW_ADVENTURE_TAGLINE_20||Discord new-adventure tagline|Spend gold on food before leaving town.
DISCORD_NEW_ADVENTURE_TAGLINE_21||Discord new-adventure tagline|The cellar rats have been warned.
DISCORD_NEW_ADVENTURE_TAGLINE_22||Discord new-adventure tagline, placeholders 0 subject pronoun, 1 possessive pronoun|Check {1} armor before the first real fight.
DISCORD_NEW_ADVENTURE_TAGLINE_23||Discord new-adventure tagline|One adventurer, one backpack, many ways this can go.
DISCORD_NEW_ADVENTURE_TAGLINE_24||Discord new-adventure tagline|Search for traps before stepping onto strange floor marks.
DISCORD_NEW_ADVENTURE_TAGLINE_25||Discord new-adventure tagline|The first few steps are usually dangerous. So are the next few.
DISCORD_NEW_ADVENTURE_TAGLINE_26||Discord new-adventure tagline, placeholders 0 subject pronoun, 1 possessive pronoun|Keep {1} health bar boring.
DISCORD_NEW_ADVENTURE_TAGLINE_27||Discord new-adventure tagline|Here's hoping the first shrine is quiet.
DISCORD_NEW_ADVENTURE_TAGLINE_28||Discord new-adventure tagline|Run from fights that start badly.
DISCORD_NEW_ADVENTURE_TAGLINE_29||Discord new-adventure tagline|Before leaving town, check the food count.
DISCORD_NEW_ADVENTURE_TAGLINE_30||Discord new-adventure tagline|The death log can wait.
