NPC_INFINITE_DUNGEON_RIVEL_TITLE|24|NPC title for Hunter's Clearing Infinity Crystal merchant|Merchant
NPC_INFINITE_DUNGEON_RIVEL_DESC|160|NPC inspect description for Hunter's Clearing Infinity Crystal merchant|A blue-white will-o'-wisp hovering beside the marble stairs, with clear crystals orbiting its light.
NPC_INFINITE_DUNGEON_RIVEL_SHOP_NAME|40|shop name for Hunter's Clearing Infinity Crystal merchant|Rivel's Crystals
DIALOGUE_INFINITE_DUNGEON_RIVEL_FIRST|320|Rivel's first dialogue granting a free Infinity Crystal|"It goes forever, you say? Then it does not mean forever properly. There is a top, plainly; it is right there. Take this crystal. Down below, it will remember the top when you would rather not climb to it."
DIALOGUE_INFINITE_DUNGEON_RIVEL_REPEAT|320|Rivel's repeat dialogue offering Infinity Crystals, placeholder 0 price in gold|"Still forever? Curious. There ought to be something after it, though that is not what forever means at all. Another crystal is {0:%d} gold. Levels are much better behaved than forever."
