# Story NPC inspect baseline descriptions
NPC_ALDREN_DESC||NPC inspect baseline description for npc.aldren, role Village Elder|A broad-shouldered elder in a weathered coat, carrying the narrow authority of a man keeping Havenford alive by ration, threat, and promise.
NPC_MAELIN_DESC||NPC inspect baseline description for npc.maelin, role Shrine-Keeper|A careful shrine-keeper in faded vestments, tending the ford chapel, thin cupboards, and frightened villagers.
NPC_TESSA_DESC||NPC inspect baseline description for npc.tessa|A lean trail supplier with road-worn leathers, sharp eyes, and a working knowledge of ford paths, washed tracks, and dry camp spots.
NPC_BRANNOC_DESC||NPC inspect baseline description for npc.brannoc, role Village Smith|A soot-marked smith with scarred forearms, a hard squint, and a practical eye for sound steel.
NPC_GARRICK_DESC||NPC inspect baseline description for npc.garrick, role Silver Lancer|A Silver Lancer in patched mail, carrying a road-pay purse as he walks Havenford's center road.
NPC_VETHRIN_DESC||NPC inspect baseline description for npc.vethrin, role Hedge Wizard|A thin hedge wizard with ink-stained fingers, pacing as he checks old stones and road dust for signs.
NPC_THERYN_DESC||NPC inspect baseline description for npc.theryn, role Reader|A narrow reader in a patched coat, carrying loose pages, chapel scraps, and borrowed books held together by cord, dust, and stubbornness.
NPC_THROKK_DESC||NPC inspect baseline description for npc.throkk, role Master Smith|A broad dwarven master smith in a soot-dark apron, with iron-grey beard rings and a careful eye for stone, heat, and people.
NPC_BRANN_DESC||NPC inspect baseline description for npc.brann, role Merchant|A compact dwarven merchant sorting hinges, nails, tools, shields, and rough bars with brisk impatience.
NPC_STONECLEFT_WARDEN_DESC||NPC inspect baseline description for npc.stonecleft_warden, role Gate Warden|A scarred dwarven warden in ringed mail, with a gate key and the wary posture of someone who has survived too many breaches.
NPC_SELLAN_DESC||NPC inspect baseline description for npc.sellan, role Supply Seller|A square dwarven seller in a leather apron, setting out lamp oil, ration sacks, rope coils, and spare tackle.
NPC_HARL_DESC||NPC inspect baseline description for npc.harl, role Gatehall Supplier|A compact dwarven seller beside the upper gatehall, packing oil, food, bandages, and rope for the road above.
NPC_THRUNNA_DESC||NPC inspect baseline description for npc.thrunna|A compact dwarven man with a scarred helm tucked under one arm, worn boots, and a shield nicked by road fights.
NPC_STONECLEFT_INNER_GUARD_DESC||NPC inspect baseline description for npc.stonecleft_inner_guard, role Inner Guard|A mailed dwarven guard planted by the inner iron door, watching the stair, latch chain, and chalk route below.
NPC_STONECLEFT_DEEP_GUARD_DESC||NPC inspect baseline description for npc.stonecleft_deep_guard, role North Gate Guard|A hard-eyed dwarven guard at the lower gate, helm lamp hooded and hand never far from the latch chain.
NPC_STONECLEFT_PASS_GUARD_DESC||NPC inspect baseline description for npc.stonecleft_pass_guard, role Pass Guard|A soot-marked dwarven pass guard holding the lower stair with shield ready and no interest in easy reassurance.
NPC_DORRAN_DESC||NPC inspect baseline description for npc.dorran, role Forge Armorer|A broad dwarven forge armorer with ash on both sleeves, measuring mail, shields, and martial steel for the lower road.
NPC_DURN_DESC||NPC inspect baseline description for npc.durn, role Hall Mason|A careful dwarven hall mason with chalk dust on his cuffs, a stone awl at his belt, and fresh cut marks on his boots.
NPC_VARK_DESC||NPC inspect baseline description for npc.vark, role Captain|A scarred dwarven captain, beard tied short for work and one ear silvered by old stonefall.
NPC_STONECLEFT_MATRON_DESC||NPC inspect baseline description for npc.stonecleft_matron, role dwarf|A stern older dwarf who looks like he could keep order in a cave-in with one glare and a soup ladle.
NPC_STONECLEFT_FORGE_HAND_DESC||NPC inspect baseline description for npc.stonecleft_forge_hand, role dwarf|A soot-sleeved dwarf moving between anvils and coal bins, keeping the hold's work iron hot.
NPC_STONECLEFT_RUNNER_DESC||NPC inspect baseline description for npc.stonecleft_runner, role dwarf|A compact dwarven runner with messages tucked into a belt tube and no patience for blocked corridors.
NPC_BOREK_DESC||NPC inspect baseline description for npc.borek, role Upper Track Scout|A practical dwarven scout with a mud-scarred cloak, a nicked handaxe, and a habit of watching the western track.
NPC_STONECLEFT_REGULAR_DESC||NPC inspect baseline description for npc.stonecleft_regular, role dwarf|A broad-faced dwarf with a clay cup, a loud opinion, and a habit of drifting back toward the warmest room.
NPC_STONECLEFT_MINER_WORKER_DESC||NPC inspect baseline description for npc.stonecleft_miner_worker, role dwarf|A dust-caked dwarf miner with lamp soot on the brow and a pick haft worn smooth by years below.
NPC_STONECLEFT_CHILD_DESC||NPC inspect baseline description for npc.stonecleft_child, role dwarf|A dwarven child darting between benches and doorways with the practiced confidence of a child raised underground.
NPC_STONECLEFT_PORTER_DESC||NPC inspect baseline description for npc.stonecleft_porter, role dwarf|A sturdy dwarf porter hauling wrapped tools, lamp oil, and stone-dusty parcels from hall to hall.
NPC_STONECLEFT_GUARD_DESC||NPC inspect baseline description for npc.stonecleft_guard, role dwarf guard|A mail-shirted dwarf guard making short patrols, watching doors more than faces.
NPC_STONECLEFT_DWARF_DESC||NPC inspect baseline description for npc.stonecleft_dwarf, role dwarf|A Stonecleft dwarf off shift, moving between work benches, mess tables, and the main road through the hold.
NPC_BORRI_DESC||NPC inspect baseline description for npc.borri, role Captive Guard|A battered dwarven guard with bound wrists, a split lip, and the stubborn look of a guard waiting for one clean chance.
NPC_THAREC_DESC||NPC inspect baseline description for npc.tharec, role High Canon|A severe canon in white and ash robes, with ash cloth and a locked relic case close at hand.
NPC_VEYDRAS_DESC||NPC inspect baseline description for npc.veydras, role Seal Artificer|A white-robed artificer standing over clean tools, ward chalk, and a covered basin shining against the blackglass nearby.
NPC_TOVAN_DESC||NPC inspect baseline description for npc.tovan, role Antiquary Tovan|A White Seal purifier with a stiff leg, careful hands, and a locked case of old sanctified gear.
NPC_ORYN_DESC||NPC inspect baseline description for npc.oryn, role Vault Sacristan|A white-robed sacristan with an iron key chain, pale ward chalk on the fingers, and a lamp kept ready by the vault stair.
NPC_VAUST_DESC||NPC inspect baseline description for npc.vaust, role Camp Captain|A lined lancer captain in battered plate, watching the breach road with old scars and a hand near his horn.
NPC_SERRIN_DESC||NPC inspect baseline description for npc.serrin, role Field Supplier|A hard-eyed camp supplier standing over ration sacks, field packs, spare spearheads, and patched mail.
NPC_KESTREL_WATCH_SERGEANT_DESC||NPC inspect baseline description for npc.kestrel_watch_sergeant, role Watch Sergeant|A hard-used watch sergeant with a soot-flecked cloak, spare horn cords tied to the belt, and no patience left to spend.
NPC_KESTREL_GUARD_DESC||NPC inspect baseline description for npc.kestrel_guard, role Camp Guard|A road-dusty Silver Lancer holding the line in patched plate and ash-stained mail, watching the breach road for trouble.
NPC_KESTREL_OFF_DUTY_GUARD_DESC||NPC inspect baseline description for npc.kestrel_off_duty_guard, role Off-Duty Guard|A Silver Lancer between posts, still armored enough to answer a horn before the second note.
NPC_KESTREL_SAPPER_DESC||NPC inspect baseline description for npc.kestrel_sapper, role Breach Sapper|A Silver Lancer posted near the breachworks, keeping traffic clear while the camp shifts loads and wounded.
NPC_KESTREL_RUNNER_DESC||NPC inspect baseline description for npc.kestrel_runner, role Camp Runner|A Silver Lancer moving between tents with water, spare straps, and bad news for the breach line.
NPC_KESTREL_SMITH_DESC||NPC inspect baseline description for npc.kestrel_smith, role Camp Smith|A soot-dark camp smith at a field anvil, checking buckles, rivets, and blade edges between patrol calls.
NPC_KESTREL_ORDERLY_DESC||NPC inspect baseline description for npc.kestrel_orderly, role Infirmary Orderly|A tired Silver Lancer at the aid station, keeping cots open and stretcher paths clear.
NPC_KESTREL_COOK_DESC||NPC inspect baseline description for npc.kestrel_cook, role Camp Cook|A Silver Lancer beside the mess fire, watching the ration line without taking eyes off the road.
NPC_KESTREL_WOUNDED_LANCER_DESC||NPC inspect baseline description for npc.kestrel_wounded_lancer, role Wounded Lancer|A bandaged lancer testing the weight on one leg, refusing to lie down while the breach watch is short-handed.
NPC_KESTREL_SCOUT_DESC||NPC inspect baseline description for npc.kestrel_scout, role Lancer Scout|A lean Silver Lancer with scar dust on the boots, checking west-road reports between patrols.
NPC_EIRADHA_DESC||NPC inspect baseline description for npc.eiradha, role Elven Envoy|A composed elven envoy in grey-green traveling silks, watching the Highmark door with a rolled Telwynd map close at hand.
NPC_SAIRVETH_DESC||NPC inspect baseline description for npc.sairveth, role Telwynd Warden|An austere elven warden in pale mail, standing beside cut ward glass and a covered blackglass table.
NPC_EIVYSS_DESC||NPC inspect baseline description for npc.eivyss, role Enchanter|A pale-eyed elven enchanter standing beside copper wire, ward leaves, blackglass clamps, and a covered lens vice.
NPC_AELRION_DESC||NPC inspect baseline description for npc.aelrion, role Bowyer Aelrion|An elf bowyer with waxed cord, shaped yew staves, and a rack of finished bows kept clear of the damp.
NPC_AELTHIR_DESC||NPC inspect baseline description for npc.aelthir, role Grove Enchanter|An elven enchanter setting out staves, scrolls, wands, and sealed ward boxes beside the grove worktable.
NPC_FARMER_DESC||NPC inspect baseline description for npc.farmer, role Farmer|A muddy-booted farmer trying to keep a few pens and poor soil alive through another hard season.
NPC_MAVETH_FARMER_DESC||NPC inspect baseline description for npc.maveth_farmer, role Farmer|A worried farmer with field mud on her hem, watching the north fence and counting the hours since Thom left.
NPC_THOM_DESC||NPC inspect baseline description for npc.thom, role Farmer Thom|A tired farmer with bruised sleeves, still looking over one shoulder when cart wheels pass the north fence.
NPC_BEGGAR_DESC||NPC inspect baseline description for npc.beggar, role Beggar|A road-worn beggar huddled near the commons, quick to notice food, coin, and who still carries both.
