UI_CHARACTER_CONDITION_SICK|80|character sheet condition detail line|Sick: -2 ATK, -2 DEF, and periodic damage until it passes or is cured.
UI_CHARACTER_CONDITION_DISEASED|72|character sheet condition detail line, placeholder 0 attribute penalty|Diseased: -{0:%d} to all attributes until cured.
UI_CHARACTER_CONDITION_BLIND|88|character sheet condition detail line|Blind: sight drops to adjacent tiles, ranged aim falters, and close fighting suffers.
UI_CHARACTER_CONDITION_DARK|88|character sheet condition detail line|Dark: without an active light source your sight is cut down to a few nearby tiles.
UI_CHARACTER_CONDITION_ASLEEP|72|character sheet condition detail line|Asleep: you lose turns until you wake or pain jolts you awake.
UI_CHARACTER_CONDITION_RESTED|64|character sheet condition detail line, placeholder 0 XP remaining|Rested: kills give double XP ({0:%d} XP remaining).
UI_CHARACTER_CONDITION_TIRED|56|character sheet condition detail line|Tired: rest at an inn or camp. Monster XP -1%.
UI_CHARACTER_CONDITION_EXHAUSTED|64|character sheet condition detail line|Exhausted: rest at an inn or camp. Monster XP -3%.
UI_CHARACTER_CONDITION_STUNNED|72|character sheet condition detail line|Stunned: you lose turns until the stun wears off.
UI_CHARACTER_CONDITION_SILENCED|72|character sheet condition detail line|Silenced: you cannot cast spells while the silence holds.
UI_CHARACTER_CONDITION_PARALYZED|72|character sheet condition detail line|Paralyzed: you cannot act until it breaks.
UI_CHARACTER_CONDITION_SNARED|80|character sheet condition detail line|Snared: webs or roots hold you in place until you break free.
UI_CHARACTER_CONDITION_PETRIFIED|80|character sheet condition detail line|Petrified: you cannot act and stone absorbs part of each blow.
UI_CHARACTER_CONDITION_FEAR|80|character sheet condition detail line|Fear: you cannot act normally or press hostile attacks.
UI_CHARACTER_CONDITION_CHARMED|72|character sheet condition detail line|Charmed: hostile actions fail while the enchantment holds.
UI_CHARACTER_CONDITION_CONFUSED|72|character sheet condition detail line|Confused: your turns become random stumbling movement.
UI_CHARACTER_CONDITION_DRUNK|72|character sheet condition detail line|Drunk: -2 ATK, -2 DEF, and -2 saves.
UI_CHARACTER_CONDITION_SURPRISED|88|character sheet condition detail line|Off Guard: -2 ATK, -2 DEF for about 3 turns after rest is interrupted.
UI_CHARACTER_CONDITION_POISONED|80|character sheet condition detail line|Poisoned: periodic damage until the toxin runs its course or is cured.
UI_CHARACTER_CONDITION_CHILLED|72|character sheet condition detail line|Chilled: cold stiffens your reactions until it fades.
UI_CHARACTER_CONDITION_PRONE|88|character sheet condition detail line|Prone: movement or waiting stands you up; other actions are blocked.
UI_CHARACTER_CONDITION_OILY|72|character sheet condition detail line|Oily: -1 fire resistance until the oil wears off or is washed away.
UI_CHARACTER_CONDITION_WET|88|character sheet condition detail line|Wet: -1 shock resistance until you dry off.
UI_CHARACTER_CONDITION_BLEEDING_HEAVY|96|character sheet condition detail line|Bleeding heavily: the wound is open and severe until it eases or is tended.
UI_CHARACTER_CONDITION_BLEEDING|80|character sheet condition detail line|Bleeding: ongoing wound damage until it closes or is tended.
UI_CHARACTER_CONDITION_TENDED|32|character sheet condition detail line|You are recently tended.
UI_CHARACTER_CONDITION_FRESH_WOUNDS|72|character sheet condition detail line|Fresh wounds: recent damage can still be dressed with First Aid.
UI_CHARACTER_CONDITION_STABLE|48|character sheet condition detail line when no harmful condition is active|Stable: no harmful timed conditions.
UI_CHARACTER_EFFECT_BLESSED|32|character sheet active effect line|Blessed: +1 ATK, +1 DEF.
UI_CHARACTER_EFFECT_AID|48|character sheet active effect line|Aid: Blessed and temporary HP.
UI_CHARACTER_EFFECT_FALSE_LIFE|56|legacy character sheet active effect line for old False Life display, placeholder 0 temporary HP|False Life: +{0:%d} temporary HP.
UI_CHARACTER_EFFECT_TEMPORARY_HP|56|character sheet active effect line, placeholder 0 temporary HP|Temporary HP: +{0:%d}.
UI_CHARACTER_EFFECT_LEVEL_DRAIN|72|character sheet active effect line, placeholders 0 effective level, 1 drained stacks|Level Drain: effective level {0:%d} ({1:%d} drained).
