ITEM_USE_EFFECT_POTION_OF_SHIELD||item use effect summary for ItemUseEffectId::PotionOfShield|grants Shield, giving +2 DEF against ranged attacks: 60 turns standard, 90 concentrated, 30 diluted.
ITEM_USE_EFFECT_POTION_OF_BLUR||item use effect summary for ItemUseEffectId::PotionOfBlur|applies Blur, giving +2 DEF and +4 DEF against ranged attacks until you take damage.
ITEM_USE_EFFECT_POTION_OF_MIRROR_IMAGE||item use effect summary for ItemUseEffectId::PotionOfMirrorImage|creates protective mirror images that halve hits: 3 standard, 5 concentrated, 2 diluted.
ITEM_USE_EFFECT_POTION_OF_MAGE_ARMOR||item use effect summary for ItemUseEffectId::PotionOfMageArmor|applies Mage Armor, replacing body armor with DEF 1+INT mod and ARM 2+INT mod x2: 10 minutes standard, 15 concentrated, 5 diluted.
ITEM_USE_EFFECT_POTION_OF_SEE_INVISIBILITY||item use effect summary for ItemUseEffectId::PotionOfSeeInvisibility|lets you see invisible creatures: 36 turns standard, 54 concentrated, 18 diluted.
ITEM_USE_EFFECT_POTION_OF_FLIGHT||item use effect summary for ItemUseEffectId::PotionOfFlight|grants movement over floor hazards: 54 turns standard, 81 concentrated, 27 diluted.
ITEM_USE_EFFECT_POTION_OF_IMPROVED_INVISIBILITY||item use effect summary for Improved Invisibility potion|grants Improved Invisibility: 12 turns standard, 18 concentrated, 6 diluted. Attacks only have a 25% chance to break it.
ITEM_USE_EFFECT_POTION_OF_LEVITATION||item use effect summary for ItemUseEffectId::PotionOfLevitation|grants Levitation over floor hazards: 48 turns standard, 72 concentrated, 24 diluted.
ITEM_USE_EFFECT_POTION_OF_AID||item use effect summary for ItemUseEffectId::PotionOfAid|grants Bless for 1 minute plus positive WIS modifier turns and 1d8+1 temporary HP.
ITEM_USE_EFFECT_POTION_OF_GREATER_AID||item use effect summary for ItemUseEffectId::PotionOfGreaterAid|grants Bless for 1 minute plus positive WIS modifier turns and 2d8+2 temporary HP.
ITEM_USE_EFFECT_POTION_OF_BULLS_STRENGTH||item use effect summary for ItemUseEffectId::PotionOfBullsStrength|grants Strength: +4 for 60 turns standard, +6 for 20 concentrated, +2 for 240 diluted.
ITEM_USE_EFFECT_POTION_OF_ENLARGE||item use effect summary for Enlarge potion|grants +4 Strength and -4 DEF for 1 minute.
ITEM_USE_EFFECT_POTION_OF_REDUCE||item use effect summary for Reduce potion|grants -4 Strength and +4 DEF for 1 minute.
ITEM_USE_EFFECT_POTION_OF_CATS_GRACE||item use effect summary for ItemUseEffectId::PotionOfCatsGrace|grants Dexterity: +4 for 60 turns standard, +6 for 20 concentrated, +2 for 240 diluted.
ITEM_USE_EFFECT_POTION_OF_BEARS_ENDURANCE||item use effect summary for ItemUseEffectId::PotionOfBearsEndurance|grants Constitution: +4 for 60 turns standard, +6 for 20 concentrated, +2 for 240 diluted.
ITEM_USE_EFFECT_POTION_OF_FOXS_CUNNING||item use effect summary for ItemUseEffectId::PotionOfFoxsCunning|grants Intelligence: +4 for 60 turns standard, +6 for 20 concentrated, +2 for 240 diluted.
ITEM_USE_EFFECT_POTION_OF_OWLS_WISDOM||item use effect summary for ItemUseEffectId::PotionOfOwlsWisdom|grants Wisdom: +4 for 60 turns standard, +6 for 20 concentrated, +2 for 240 diluted.
ITEM_USE_EFFECT_POTION_OF_EAGLES_SPLENDOR||item use effect summary for ItemUseEffectId::PotionOfEaglesSplendor|grants Charisma: +4 for 60 turns standard, +6 for 20 concentrated, +2 for 240 diluted.
ITEM_USE_EFFECT_POTION_OF_FREEDOM_OF_MOVEMENT||item use effect summary for ItemUseEffectId::PotionOfFreedomOfMovement|clears webbing and grants Freedom of Movement: 36 turns standard, 54 concentrated, 18 diluted.
ITEM_USE_EFFECT_POTION_OF_DEATH_WARD||item use effect summary for ItemUseEffectId::PotionOfDeathWard|grants Death Ward against death magic and fatal effects: 18 turns standard, 27 concentrated, 9 diluted.
ITEM_USE_EFFECT_POTION_OF_FIRE_RESISTANCE||item use effect summary for ItemUseEffectId::PotionOfFireResistance|grants temporary fire resistance: 60 turns standard, 90 concentrated, 30 diluted.
