ITEM_USE_EFFECT_FAILED_BREW||item use effect summary for ItemUseEffectId::FailedBrew|spoiled draught; drinking it does nothing useful and deals 1 damage if you have more than 1 HP.
ITEM_USE_EFFECT_MELT_LOCK||item use effect summary for ItemUseEffectId::MeltLock|Use on adjacent webbing, a revealed arrow trap, locks, or open floor; lock melting requires an acid check and can damage chest contents. Can be thrown.
ITEM_USE_EFFECT_PLACE_PITONS||item use effect summary for ItemUseEffectId::PlacePitons|use pitons to make pit hand-holds, pry an adjacent closed door or locked chest open, or wedge a revealed trap mechanism.
