MAIN_HELP_LABEL_LOOK_OR_INSPECT|22|help panel key hint label|look or inspect
MAIN_HELP_LABEL_GAME_MENU|18|help panel key hint label|game menu
MAIN_HELP_GUIDE_TITLE|16|help panel guide heading|Guide
MAIN_HELP_GUIDE_BASICS_TITLE|16|help panel guide section heading|Basics
MAIN_HELP_GUIDE_BASICS_1|104|help panel guide bullet for basic turn structure|- One turn is one action: move, wait, attack, interact, using an item or ability.
MAIN_HELP_GUIDE_BASICS_2|80|help panel guide bullet for look mode|- Use look mode to inspect nearby tiles and creatures or items.
MAIN_HELP_GUIDE_BASICS_3|72|help panel guide bullet for number-key menus|- Use Number keys to open the game menus any time.
MAIN_HELP_GUIDE_BASICS_4|72|help panel guide bullet for class actions|- Use class actions, the core abilities of your class.
MAIN_HELP_GUIDE_BASICS_5|88|help panel guide bullet for adventure checkpoint saves|- In adventure mode, rest at inns or camp to checkpoint save.
MAIN_HELP_GUIDE_UI_TITLE|20|help panel guide section heading|UI / Controls
MAIN_HELP_GUIDE_UI_1|96|help panel guide bullet for inventory and equipment|- Inventory shows stored items. Equipment shows what you wear and wield.
MAIN_HELP_GUIDE_UI_2|88|help panel guide bullet for character sheet|- Character shows all stats, skills, and active effects for your character.
MAIN_HELP_GUIDE_UI_3|88|help panel guide bullet for message log|- Message Log shows recent combat rolls, damage, warnings, and system text.
MAIN_HELP_GUIDE_STATUS_BAR_TITLE|18|help panel guide section heading|Status Bar
MAIN_HELP_GUIDE_STATUS_BAR_1|80|help panel guide bullet for HP|- HP is your health. Keep it high by healing or resting.
MAIN_HELP_GUIDE_STATUS_BAR_2|64|help panel guide bullet for ATK|- ATK affects your chance to land a hit.
MAIN_HELP_GUIDE_STATUS_BAR_3|72|help panel guide bullet for DMG|- DMG affects how much damage your landed hits do.
MAIN_HELP_GUIDE_STATUS_BAR_4|72|help panel guide bullet for DEF|- DEF affects how well you can avoid enemy hits.
MAIN_HELP_GUIDE_STATUS_BAR_5|72|help panel guide bullet for ARM|- ARM reduces the damage taken when you get hit.
MAIN_HELP_GUIDE_STATUS_BAR_6|80|help panel guide bullet for status effects|- Watch for status effects like Poison, Sick, or Encumbered.
MAIN_HELP_GUIDE_COMBAT_TITLE|16|help panel guide section heading|Combat
MAIN_HELP_GUIDE_COMBAT_1|88|help panel guide combat bullet|- Avoid getting surrounded in combat. Use corridors or chokepoints.
MAIN_HELP_GUIDE_COMBAT_2|96|help panel guide combat bullet|- Make the most of everything you have: ranged attacks, tools, potions, and skills.
MAIN_HELP_GUIDE_COMBAT_3|72|help panel guide combat bullet|- Class actions are strong skills. Don't forget about them.
MAIN_HELP_GUIDE_COMBAT_4|80|help panel guide combat bullet|- Weapon skill improves performance with familiar weapon groups.
MAIN_HELP_GUIDE_EQUIPMENT_TITLE|24|help panel guide section heading|Weapons / Equipment
MAIN_HELP_GUIDE_EQUIPMENT_1|56|help panel guide equipment bullet|- Keep your ATK high to hit effectively.
MAIN_HELP_GUIDE_EQUIPMENT_2|56|help panel guide equipment bullet|- Keep your DEF high to avoid hits effectively.
MAIN_HELP_GUIDE_EQUIPMENT_3|64|help panel guide equipment bullet|- Dual wielding works better with light weapons.
MAIN_HELP_GUIDE_EQUIPMENT_4|80|help panel guide equipment bullet|- Light armor usually has higher DEF, while heavy has more ARM.
MAIN_HELP_GUIDE_EQUIPMENT_5|80|help panel guide equipment bullet|- Filling out all your armor slots helps. Every point counts.
MAIN_HELP_GUIDE_STEALTH_TITLE|24|help panel guide section heading|Encumbrance / Stealth
MAIN_HELP_GUIDE_STEALTH_1|80|help panel guide encumbrance bullet|- Carrying too much encumbers you, reducing combat effectiveness.
MAIN_HELP_GUIDE_STEALTH_2|64|help panel guide encumbrance bullet|- Backpacks and pouches can help carry more.
MAIN_HELP_GUIDE_STEALTH_3|72|help panel guide stealth bullet|- Heavy armor and bulky gear make stealth worse.
MAIN_HELP_GUIDE_STEALTH_4|64|help panel guide stealth bullet|- Darkness, cover, and distance help stealth.
MAIN_HELP_GUIDE_STEALTH_5|80|help panel guide stealth bullet|- Bright light, open ground, and noisy gear make detection easier.
MAIN_HELP_GUIDE_EFFECTS_TITLE|20|help panel guide section heading|Status Effects
MAIN_HELP_GUIDE_EFFECTS_1|72|help panel guide status effect bullet|- Bleeding causes damage every round. Deal with it quickly.
MAIN_HELP_GUIDE_EFFECTS_2|80|help panel guide status effect bullet|- Poison damages you over time but will wear off on its own.
MAIN_HELP_GUIDE_EFFECTS_3|80|help panel guide status effect bullet|- Sickness is dangerous and can last a long time. Be careful.
MAIN_HELP_GUIDE_EFFECTS_4|88|help panel guide status effect bullet|- Hunger reduces combat and skill effectiveness. Starving is worse.
MAIN_HELP_GUIDE_SURVIVAL_TITLE|20|help panel guide section heading|Items / Survival
MAIN_HELP_GUIDE_SURVIVAL_1|72|help panel guide survival bullet|- Stock up food before you head far out of town.
MAIN_HELP_GUIDE_SURVIVAL_2|80|help panel guide survival bullet|- Keep first aid kits on hand to treat wounds between fights.
MAIN_HELP_GUIDE_SURVIVAL_3|96|help panel guide survival bullet|- In adventure mode, camp kits let you checkpoint save when away from town.
MAIN_HELP_GUIDE_SURVIVAL_4|88|help panel guide survival bullet|- Use tools, kits, and consumables. Preparation is key to survival.
MAIN_HELP_GUIDE_TRAVEL_TITLE|16|help panel guide section heading|Travel / Rest
MAIN_HELP_GUIDE_TRAVEL_1|72|help panel guide travel bullet|- Roads are faster and safer than rough terrain.
MAIN_HELP_GUIDE_TRAVEL_2|64|help panel guide travel bullet|- Inns are safer rest. Camp kits are portable rest.
MAIN_HELP_GUIDE_TRAVEL_3|104|help panel guide travel bullet|- Resting recovers you faster, but unsafe places can leave you caught unawares.
