LAST_CHANCE_TITLE|20|last-chance survival dialogue title|LAST CHANCE
LAST_CHANCE_FINAL_PAGE_1||last-chance dialogue after final use|You should be dead, but the amulet burns hot and the seals pull the bleeding closed.
LAST_CHANCE_FINAL_PAGE_2||last-chance dialogue after final use|Your skin flashes with patterned seals and your breathing steadies.
LAST_CHANCE_PAGE_1||last-chance dialogue before final use|The amulet flares against your chest and forces breath back into you.
LAST_CHANCE_PAGE_2||last-chance dialogue before final use|The pain eases enough for you to stand.
LAST_CHANCE_ALIVE_PAGE||last-chance dialogue closing page|You are alive, hurt, and able to move.
LAST_CHANCE_REVITALIZED||last-chance recovery message|You feel revitalized.
