TIP_GAMEPLAY_WATER|72|rotating gameplay tip shown on title or loading surfaces|Water is cheap in town and dear on the road.
TIP_GAMEPLAY_OLD_ROAD|64|rotating gameplay tip shown on title or loading surfaces|The old road is safer than open ground.
TIP_GAMEPLAY_ARROWS|32|rotating gameplay tip shown on title or loading surfaces|Carry spare arrows.
TIP_GAMEPLAY_CAMP|80|rotating gameplay tip shown on title or loading surfaces|Camp in town or cleared safe areas when possible.
TIP_GAMEPLAY_EAT|64|rotating gameplay tip shown on title or loading surfaces|Eat before hunger weakens the fight.
TIP_GAMEPLAY_STEALTH_SETUP|80|rotating gameplay tip shown on title or loading surfaces|Stealthy characters can set up surprise attacks.
TIP_GAMEPLAY_ARMOR_STEALTH|80|rotating gameplay tip shown on title or loading surfaces|Bulkier armor is harder to move quietly in.
TIP_GAMEPLAY_METAL_STEALTH|80|rotating gameplay tip shown on title or loading surfaces|Sneaking is harder when you wear noisy metal gear.
TIP_GAMEPLAY_UNKNOWN_WEAPONS|80|rotating gameplay tip shown on title or loading surfaces|Weapons you do not know are hard to use well.
TIP_GAMEPLAY_LEARN_WEAPON|96|rotating gameplay tip shown on title or loading surfaces|Learn a new weapon somewhere safer before you rely on it.
TIP_GAMEPLAY_OFFHAND_WEIGHT|96|rotating gameplay tip shown on title or loading surfaces|Lighter off-hands keep dual-wield penalties manageable.
TIP_GAMEPLAY_ARMOR_MP|80|rotating gameplay tip shown on title or loading surfaces|Bulkier armor also slows MP regeneration (not PP).
TIP_GAMEPLAY_INT_MP|72|rotating gameplay tip shown on title or loading surfaces|High intelligence gives you more MP per level.
TIP_GAMEPLAY_WIS_PP|80|rotating gameplay tip shown on title or loading surfaces|Divine casters with high Wisdom gain more PP per level.
TIP_GAMEPLAY_ANYONE_SPELLS|80|rotating gameplay tip shown on title or loading surfaces|Anyone can learn a few spells if they're smart enough.
TIP_GAMEPLAY_DARK_TRAPS|64|rotating gameplay tip shown on title or loading surfaces|Traps are harder to see in the dark.
TIP_GAMEPLAY_EXPEDITION_TOOLS|112|rotating gameplay tip shown on title or loading surfaces|Carry rope, oil, and lockpicks for pits, doors, traps, and containers.
TIP_GAMEPLAY_CHOKE_POINT|64|rotating gameplay tip shown on title or loading surfaces|Take the choke point before the enemy does.
TIP_GAMEPLAY_SHIFT_OPTIONS|128|rotating gameplay tip with {options} control tag, preserve the tag|Set Shift + direction in {options} for none, hold-to-walk, or rotated diagonal movement.
TIP_GAMEPLAY_TURN_TIME|72|rotating gameplay tip shown on title or loading surfaces|One turn in local play is 10 seconds in game.
TIP_GAMEPLAY_REST|40|rotating gameplay tip shown on title or loading surfaces|Rest after hard fights.
TIP_GAMEPLAY_CORPSE_EATING|64|rotating gameplay tip shown on title or loading surfaces|Not every corpse is worth eating.
TIP_GAMEPLAY_TURN_BACK|80|rotating gameplay tip shown on title or loading surfaces|Turn back before you run out of light, food, or water.
TIP_GAMEPLAY_REROLL|80|rotating gameplay tip shown on title or loading surfaces|You can reroll attributes during character creation.
TIP_GAMEPLAY_IMPERFECT_ATTRIBUTES|80|rotating gameplay tip shown on title or loading surfaces|Not every character needs perfect attributes.
TIP_GAMEPLAY_USEFUL_ATTRIBUTES|80|rotating gameplay tip shown on title or loading surfaces|All attributes can be useful on any character.
TIP_GAMEPLAY_LIGHT_AUTO_OFF|80|rotating gameplay tip shown on title or loading surfaces|Torches and lanterns will turn off in bright areas.
TIP_GAMEPLAY_HEALING_SLOW|96|rotating gameplay tip shown on title or loading surfaces|Natural healing is slow, make good use of first aid kits and bandages.
TIP_GAMEPLAY_BRING_FIRST_AID|80|rotating gameplay tip shown on title or loading surfaces|Going into battle without first aid items is a bad idea.
TIP_GAMEPLAY_BANDAGE_FIRST_AID|112|rotating gameplay tip shown on title or loading surfaces|Bandages can stop bleeding instantly, but first aid kits are better between fights.
TIP_GAMEPLAY_REPORT_LOCALIZATION|80|PC/Web rotating gameplay tip shown on title or loading surfaces|Press F6 to report localization issues.
TIP_GAMEPLAY_CYCLE_LANGUAGES|64|PC/Web rotating gameplay tip shown on title or loading surfaces|Press F7 to cycle languages.
TIP_GAMEPLAY_HIDE_WALLS|64|rotating gameplay tip shown on title or loading surfaces|Hiding is easier next to walls.
TIP_VISUAL_MODE|64|rotating visual-mode tip with {options} control tag, preserve the tag|Change sprite/ascii mode from {options}.
