ADVENTURER_RECRUIT_FIGHTER_1||fighter adventurer recruitment greeting|A fellow adventurer! Need a reliable blade at your side?
ADVENTURER_RECRUIT_FIGHTER_2||fighter adventurer recruitment greeting|I'm looking for a worthy fight and good companions. Shall we take the road together?
ADVENTURER_RECRUIT_FIGHTER_3||fighter adventurer recruitment greeting|I can hold the line when trouble comes. Have room for another?
ADVENTURER_RECRUIT_CLERIC_1||cleric adventurer recruitment greeting|The road is hard on anyone travelling alone. Let me bring healing and a strong arm.
ADVENTURER_RECRUIT_CLERIC_2||cleric adventurer recruitment greeting|I am ready to face the dark with prayer and steel. Shall I join you?
ADVENTURER_RECRUIT_CLERIC_3||cleric adventurer recruitment greeting|If you need wounds mended and evil driven back, I can help.
ADVENTURER_RECRUIT_WIZARD_1||wizard adventurer recruitment greeting|A fellow adventurer! I have spells ready and no wish to waste them sitting here.
ADVENTURER_RECRUIT_WIZARD_2||wizard adventurer recruitment greeting|I seek old secrets and dangerous roads. Could your company use a mage?
ADVENTURER_RECRUIT_WIZARD_3||wizard adventurer recruitment greeting|Steel has its uses, but a well-placed spell settles matters quickly. Shall we travel together?
ADVENTURER_RECRUIT_RANGER_1||ranger adventurer recruitment greeting|I know how to find a trail and survive what waits at its end. Need a ranger?
ADVENTURER_RECRUIT_RANGER_2||ranger adventurer recruitment greeting|The wild roads are safer with sharp eyes ahead. I could travel with you.
ADVENTURER_RECRUIT_RANGER_3||ranger adventurer recruitment greeting|I have bow, blade, and a taste for the open road. Shall we join forces?
ADVENTURER_RECRUIT_PALADIN_1||paladin adventurer recruitment greeting|If your road leads against evil, my sword is yours.
ADVENTURER_RECRUIT_PALADIN_2||paladin adventurer recruitment greeting|I seek worthy companions and an honest cause. May I ride with you?
ADVENTURER_RECRUIT_PALADIN_3||paladin adventurer recruitment greeting|Dark things do not frighten me. I would stand beside you.
ADVENTURER_RECRUIT_ROGUE_1||rogue adventurer recruitment greeting|You look bound for somewhere dangerous. Lucky for you, I know locks, traps, and quiet steps.
ADVENTURER_RECRUIT_ROGUE_2||rogue adventurer recruitment greeting|Every company needs someone who sees trouble before it springs. Interested?
ADVENTURER_RECRUIT_ROGUE_3||rogue adventurer recruitment greeting|I can open more than doors, and I know when to keep silent. Shall we make a bargain?
ADVENTURER_RECRUIT_SORCERER_1||sorcerer adventurer recruitment greeting|Magic comes to me as easily as breath. I could put it to good use on your road.
ADVENTURER_RECRUIT_SORCERER_2||sorcerer adventurer recruitment greeting|I have power to spare and nowhere worth spending it. Need a sorcerer?
ADVENTURER_RECRUIT_SORCERER_3||sorcerer adventurer recruitment greeting|If the next ruin needs fire more than caution, I am ready.
ADVENTURER_RECRUIT_DRUID_1||druid adventurer recruitment greeting|The wild has taught me healing, patience, and a few harsher lessons. Shall I come?
ADVENTURER_RECRUIT_DRUID_2||druid adventurer recruitment greeting|Stone walls grow tiresome. I would rather walk the living world with good company.
ADVENTURER_RECRUIT_DRUID_3||druid adventurer recruitment greeting|I can mend wounds and call on nature when steel is not enough.
ADVENTURER_RECRUIT_BARD_1||bard adventurer recruitment greeting|Every great journey needs a steady hand and someone to remember the tale. Need both?
ADVENTURER_RECRUIT_BARD_2||bard adventurer recruitment greeting|I know songs for courage and tricks for trouble. Shall we make a story worth telling?
ADVENTURER_RECRUIT_BARD_3||bard adventurer recruitment greeting|A road, a fight, and good company sound better than another night here.
ADVENTURER_RECRUIT_BARBARIAN_1||barbarian adventurer recruitment greeting|I am tired of ale and easy talk. Point me toward a worthy fight.
ADVENTURER_RECRUIT_BARBARIAN_2||barbarian adventurer recruitment greeting|You need strength, and I need a road. We should travel together.
ADVENTURER_RECRUIT_BARBARIAN_3||barbarian adventurer recruitment greeting|When monsters close in, you will want me beside you. Have room?
ADVENTURER_RECRUIT_MONK_1||monk adventurer recruitment greeting|The road tests body and spirit. I am ready for both.
ADVENTURER_RECRUIT_MONK_2||monk adventurer recruitment greeting|I seek discipline beyond these walls. Your journey may provide it.
ADVENTURER_RECRUIT_MONK_3||monk adventurer recruitment greeting|I need little gear and fear no close fight. Shall I walk with you?
ADVENTURER_RECRUIT_SUMMARY||generated inn adventurer summary, placeholders 0 level, 1 race, 2 class|(Level {0:%d} {1} {2})
PARTY_MEMBER_CHAT_WOUNDED||wounded party member greeting|I could use some healing before we press on.
PARTY_MEMBER_CHAT_EXHAUSTED||exhausted party member greeting|I need some rest before we push much farther.
PARTY_MEMBER_CHAT_LOW_MANA||low-mana party member greeting|My spells are running low. We should rest when we can.
PARTY_MEMBER_CHAT_LOW_PIETY||low-piety party member greeting|I need time to pray before I can call on much more divine power.
PARTY_MEMBER_CHAT_DANGER||party member greeting when enemies are nearby|Keep your guard up. There are enemies nearby.
PARTY_MEMBER_CHAT_GENERAL_1||general party member greeting|Ready when you are.
PARTY_MEMBER_CHAT_GENERAL_2||general party member greeting|Where to next?
PARTY_MEMBER_CHAT_GENERAL_3||general party member greeting|Let's keep moving.
