ENCOUNTER_DRAKE_LANDING_1|160|random drake hunt landing message|A dragon shadow cuts across the road. Wings beat once overhead, then a drake crashes down nearby.
ENCOUNTER_DRAKE_LANDING_2|144|random drake hunt landing message|A harsh shape passes over the sun. A drake drops hard enough to shake dirt from the road.
ENCOUNTER_DRAKE_LANDING_3|128|random drake hunt landing message|The air snaps hot above you. Something winged slams into the ground ahead.
ENCOUNTER_DRAKE_LANDING_4|144|random drake hunt landing message|A dragon shadow races over the ground. The landing comes a moment later, close and heavy.
ENCOUNTER_DRAKE_LANDING_5|96|random drake hunt landing message|A drake dives from cloud cover and gouges the earth nearby.
ENCOUNTER_DRAKE_LANDING_6|144|random drake hunt landing message|The sky darkens for one breath. A drake lands close enough for the ground to jump underfoot.
ENCOUNTER_DRAGON_LANDING_1|144|random dragon hunt landing message|A dragon shadow rolls over the road. The landing nearby is heavy, controlled, and deliberate.
ENCOUNTER_DRAGON_LANDING_2|144|random dragon hunt landing message|The wind drops, then returns as a wall of wingbeat. A dragon lands close and tears up the ground.
ENCOUNTER_DRAGON_LANDING_3|128|random dragon hunt landing message|A vast shadow crosses you. Somewhere nearby, claws strike stone and dirt in a long skid.
ENCOUNTER_DRAGON_LANDING_4|104|random dragon hunt landing message|A dragon shadow crosses the road. A moment later the ground breaks nearby.
ENCOUNTER_DRAGON_LANDING_5|144|random dragon hunt landing message|Wings blot the light for a heartbeat. A dragon comes down close, carving a furrow as it lands.
ENCOUNTER_DRAGON_LANDING_6|128|random dragon hunt landing message|A dragon circles once above you, then drops low and crashes into the earth nearby.
ENCOUNTER_DRAKE_BELLOW_1|96|random drake hunt bellow line|A voice echoes in your head: "Warm blood. Star blood. I found you."
ENCOUNTER_DRAKE_BELLOW_2|88|random drake hunt bellow line|A voice scrapes through your head: "The black stone pulled me here."
ENCOUNTER_DRAKE_BELLOW_3|80|random drake hunt bellow line|A voice flares in your head: "Little heir. Stand and burn."
ENCOUNTER_DRAKE_BELLOW_4|80|random drake hunt bellow line|A voice presses into your head: "You carry old fire on you."
ENCOUNTER_DRAKE_BELLOW_5|96|random drake hunt bellow line|A voice rasps in your head: "The black stone reacted to you."
ENCOUNTER_DRAKE_BELLOW_6|88|random drake hunt bellow line|A voice hooks behind your eyes: "Come closer. I want the amulet."
ENCOUNTER_GREATER_DRAKE_BELLOW_1|112|random greater drake hunt bellow line|A deeper voice echoes in your head: "I followed the amulet's heat from the ridge."
ENCOUNTER_GREATER_DRAKE_BELLOW_2|128|random greater drake hunt bellow line|A deeper voice presses into your head: "The ridge changed when you passed it. I came to see why."
ENCOUNTER_GREATER_DRAKE_BELLOW_3|112|random greater drake hunt bellow line|A deeper voice grinds through your skull: "You carry bright glass. I will break it open."
ENCOUNTER_GREATER_DRAKE_BELLOW_4|112|random greater drake hunt bellow line|A deeper voice echoes in your head: "The small drakes found your trail. Now I have it."
ENCOUNTER_GREATER_DRAKE_BELLOW_5|112|random greater drake hunt bellow line|A deeper voice hooks behind your eyes: "Stand still, bearer. I want the star on your chest."
ENCOUNTER_GREATER_DRAKE_BELLOW_6|112|random greater drake hunt bellow line|A deeper voice follows your thoughts: "Every mile leaves more sign for us to follow."
ENCOUNTER_YOUNG_DRAGON_BELLOW_1|112|random young dragon hunt bellow line|A dragon's voice cuts through the air: "So the old line still has someone alive."
ENCOUNTER_YOUNG_DRAGON_BELLOW_2|136|random young dragon hunt bellow line|A dragon's voice cuts through the air: "You carry a mark made before your birth. It is easy to follow."
ENCOUNTER_YOUNG_DRAGON_BELLOW_3|112|random young dragon hunt bellow line|A dragon's voice follows you: "Other wings will come for you, little bearer."
ENCOUNTER_YOUNG_DRAGON_BELLOW_4|112|random young dragon hunt bellow line|A dragon's voice curls above the road: "I expected a relic. I found you wearing it."
ENCOUNTER_YOUNG_DRAGON_BELLOW_5|128|random young dragon hunt bellow line|A dragon's voice cuts through the air: "The seals hid your blood poorly. I heard it from the ridge."
ENCOUNTER_YOUNG_DRAGON_BELLOW_6|104|random young dragon hunt bellow line|A dragon's voice follows you: "Run if you want. Your trail is fresh."
ENCOUNTER_ADULT_DRAGON_BELLOW_1|136|random adult dragon hunt bellow line|A dragon's voice fills the road: "I was told the line had thinned. Yet here you are, walking openly."
ENCOUNTER_ADULT_DRAGON_BELLOW_2|128|random adult dragon hunt bellow line|A dragon's voice rolls over you: "Your blood stirred the broken stone. You should have left it alone."
ENCOUNTER_ADULT_DRAGON_BELLOW_3|136|random adult dragon hunt bellow line|A dragon's voice fills the road: "The old keepers buried many things. They failed to hide this trail."
ENCOUNTER_ADULT_DRAGON_BELLOW_4|112|random adult dragon hunt bellow line|A dragon's voice rolls over you: "You crossed enough sealed doors to be worth my time."
ENCOUNTER_ADULT_DRAGON_BELLOW_5|112|random adult dragon hunt bellow line|A dragon's voice follows you: "Do you hear the wings behind you now? More are coming."
ENCOUNTER_ADULT_DRAGON_BELLOW_6|104|random adult dragon hunt bellow line|A dragon's voice fills the road: "Small heir, the dragons have noticed you."
ENCOUNTER_ELDER_DRAGON_BELLOW_1|136|random elder dragon hunt bellow line|An ancient voice fills the road: "I remember banners older than your kingdoms. I remember that blood."
ENCOUNTER_ELDER_DRAGON_BELLOW_2|120|random elder dragon hunt bellow line|An ancient voice rolls over you: "The seals are failing, and each door you open makes it worse."
ENCOUNTER_ELDER_DRAGON_BELLOW_3|128|random elder dragon hunt bellow line|An ancient voice fills the road: "Your ancestors built prisons. I can hear the locks opening."
ENCOUNTER_ELDER_DRAGON_BELLOW_4|96|random elder dragon hunt bellow line|An ancient voice presses into you: "You carry a live fragment from the old war."
ENCOUNTER_ELDER_DRAGON_BELLOW_5|128|random elder dragon hunt bellow line|An ancient voice rolls over you: "I have watched stone fall to dust, and your trail still reached me."
ENCOUNTER_ELDER_DRAGON_BELLOW_6|104|random elder dragon hunt bellow line|An ancient voice fills the road: "I came because I followed the mark in your blood."
