ABILITY_CLEAVE_NAME|40|ability display name for Cleave|Cleave
ABILITY_CLEAVE_SUMMARY||ability summary for Cleave|When a melee strike drops a foe, make one immediate extra strike against an adjacent enemy.
ABILITY_CLEAVE_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Cleave|When a melee strike drops a foe, make one immediate extra strike against an adjacent enemy.
ABILITY_MAGIC_MISSILE_NAME|40|ability display name for Magic Missile|Magic Missile
ABILITY_MAGIC_MISSILE_SUMMARY||ability summary for Magic Missile|Launches unerring force missiles at the target. Each missile deals 1d4+INT force damage. Gain +1 missile every 5 caster levels, up to 4.
ABILITY_MAGIC_MISSILE_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Magic Missile|Unerring force missiles; gains shots with level.
ABILITY_FIRE_BOLT_NAME|40|ability display name for Fire Bolt|Fire Bolt
ABILITY_FIRE_BOLT_SUMMARY||ability summary for Fire Bolt|Fires a bolt of magical fire at the target. Deals 1d4+INT fire damage on hit.
ABILITY_FIRE_BOLT_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Fire Bolt|Bolt of fire; 1d4+INT on hit.
ABILITY_FROST_SPIKE_NAME|40|ability display name for Frost Spike|Frost Spike
ABILITY_FROST_SPIKE_SUMMARY||ability summary for Frost Spike|Fires a spike of magical frost at the target. Deals 1d3+INT cold damage on hit. On a hit, the target is chilled for 3 turns unless it makes a successful CON save.
ABILITY_FROST_SPIKE_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Frost Spike|Cold spike; chill on hit.
ABILITY_SPARK_NAME|40|ability display name for Spark|Spark
ABILITY_SPARK_SUMMARY||ability summary for Spark|Fires a snapping spark at the target. Deals 1d4+INT shock damage on hit.
ABILITY_SPARK_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Spark|Spark of lightning; 1d4+INT on hit.
ABILITY_ACID_SPLASH_NAME|40|ability display name for Acid Splash|Acid Splash
ABILITY_ACID_SPLASH_SUMMARY||ability summary for Acid Splash|Hurls a small splash of conjured acid at the target. Deals 1d3+INT acid damage on hit and splashes acid onto the target tile.
ABILITY_ACID_SPLASH_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Acid Splash|Acid splash; 1d3+INT and leaves acid.
ABILITY_FORCE_BLAST_NAME|40|ability display name for Force Blast|Force Blast
ABILITY_FORCE_BLAST_SUMMARY||ability summary for Force Blast|Blasts the target with physical force. Deals 2d4+INT damage, pushes the target back on a failed STR save, and a successful save halves the damage and negates the push.
ABILITY_FORCE_BLAST_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Force Blast|2d4+INT; STR save vs push.
ABILITY_SHIELD_NAME|40|ability display name for Shield|Shield
ABILITY_SHIELD_SUMMARY||ability summary for Shield|Wraps the caster in a brief shield of force that grants +2 DEF against ranged attacks.
ABILITY_SHIELD_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Shield|+2 DEF against ranged attacks.
ABILITY_SACRED_BOLT_NAME|40|ability display name for Sacred Bolt|Sacred Bolt
ABILITY_SACRED_BOLT_SUMMARY||ability summary for Sacred Bolt|Fires a bolt of sacred light at the target. Deals 1d3+WIS holy damage on hit.
ABILITY_SACRED_BOLT_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Sacred Bolt|Bolt of sacred light; 1d3+WIS on hit.
ABILITY_CURE_LIGHT_WOUNDS_NAME|40|ability display name for Cure Light Wounds|Cure Light Wounds
ABILITY_CURE_LIGHT_WOUNDS_SUMMARY||ability summary for Cure Light Wounds|Calls restorative magic into the caster. Restores 1d8+WIS HP.
ABILITY_CURE_LIGHT_WOUNDS_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Cure Light Wounds|Restore 1d8+WIS HP.
ABILITY_CAUSE_LIGHT_WOUNDS_NAME|40|ability display name for Cause Light Wounds|Cause Light Wounds
ABILITY_CAUSE_LIGHT_WOUNDS_SUMMARY||ability summary for Cause Light Wounds|Channels harmful divine power through a touch. Deals 1d8+WIS damage on hit.
ABILITY_CAUSE_LIGHT_WOUNDS_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Cause Light Wounds|Touch attack; 1d8+WIS damage.
ABILITY_JUDGMENT_NAME|40|ability display name for Judgment|Judgment
ABILITY_JUDGMENT_SUMMARY||ability summary for Judgment|Channels judgment for 1 turn, then deals 1d6+WIS holy damage to the target. A successful WIS save halves the damage.
ABILITY_JUDGMENT_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Judgment|Channel; holy damage, WIS half.
ABILITY_BLESS_NAME|40|ability display name for Bless|Bless
ABILITY_BLESS_SUMMARY||ability summary for Bless|Blesses the caster with divine favor for 1 minute plus positive WIS modifier turns, granting +1 ATK and +1 DEF.
ABILITY_BLESS_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Bless|+1 ATK and +1 DEF.
ABILITY_LESSER_RESTORATION_NAME|40|ability display name for Lesser Restoration|Lesser Restoration
ABILITY_LESSER_RESTORATION_SUMMARY||ability summary for Lesser Restoration|Restores 1 point of attribute drain.
ABILITY_LESSER_RESTORATION_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Lesser Restoration|Restore 1 attribute drain.
ABILITY_ARCANE_GRASP_NAME|40|ability display name for Arcane Grasp|Arcane Grasp
ABILITY_ARCANE_GRASP_SUMMARY||ability summary for Arcane Grasp|Seizes one nearby creature in magical force. Requires a free off hand to cast and maintain. On a hit, the target is restrained for 3 turns and cannot move or attack. Taking damage or occupying your off hand breaks the grasp.
ABILITY_ARCANE_GRASP_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Arcane Grasp|Free off hand; restrain one target.
ABILITY_WEB_NAME|40|ability display name for Web|Web
ABILITY_WEB_SUMMARY||ability summary for Web|Spreads sticky webs over a 3x3 area. Creatures in the area are restrained for 2 turns unless they make a successful DEX save, and the webs remain on the ground.
ABILITY_WEB_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Web|3x3 webs; restrain on failed DEX save.
ABILITY_SHATTER_NAME|40|ability display name for Shatter|Shatter
ABILITY_SHATTER_SUMMARY||ability summary for Shatter|Detonates a burst of force in a 3x3 area. Combatants there, including you and allies, take 2d4+INT force damage. A successful CON save halves the damage. Strongly damages crates, barrels, and loose items.
ABILITY_SHATTER_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Shatter|3x3 force burst; wrecks objects.
ABILITY_LIGHTNING_BOLT_NAME|40|ability display name for Lightning Bolt|Lightning Bolt
ABILITY_LIGHTNING_BOLT_SUMMARY||ability summary for Lightning Bolt|Unleashes a line of lightning that bounces through the area. Deals 3d6+INT shock damage. A successful DEX save halves the damage.
ABILITY_LIGHTNING_BOLT_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Lightning Bolt|Bouncing lightning line.
ABILITY_DISINTEGRATE_NAME|40|ability display name for Disintegrate|Disintegrate
ABILITY_DISINTEGRATE_SUMMARY||ability summary for Disintegrate|Channels a disintegrating ray for 3 turns, then deals 8d6+INT force damage to the target. A successful CON save halves the damage.
ABILITY_DISINTEGRATE_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Disintegrate|Channel; 8d6+INT, CON half.
ABILITY_DEATH_SPELL_NAME|40|ability display name for Death Spell|Death Spell
ABILITY_DEATH_SPELL_SUMMARY||ability summary for Death Spell|Unleashes death magic in a 5x5 area, slaying the weakest eligible living creatures first up to a limited HP total. Undead, constructs, elementals, unique creatures, and neutral creatures are unaffected.
ABILITY_DEATH_SPELL_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Death Spell|5x5 death magic; weakest first.
ABILITY_FLESH_TO_STONE_NAME|40|ability display name for Flesh to Stone|Flesh to Stone
ABILITY_FLESH_TO_STONE_SUMMARY||ability summary for Flesh to Stone|Attempts to petrify one living creature for 1 minute. A successful CON save negates the spell. Petrified creatures become invulnerable statues and cannot act.
ABILITY_FLESH_TO_STONE_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Flesh to Stone|CON save or petrified statue.
ABILITY_COMMAND_HALT_NAME|40|ability display name for Command, Halt|Command, Halt
ABILITY_COMMAND_HALT_SUMMARY||ability summary for Command, Halt|Utters a divine command that halts the target for 1 turn, preventing movement and attacks. A successful WIS save negates the effect.
ABILITY_COMMAND_HALT_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Command, Halt|Halt 1 turn; WIS save.
ABILITY_SEARING_LIGHT_NAME|40|ability display name for Searing Light|Searing Light
ABILITY_SEARING_LIGHT_SUMMARY||ability summary for Searing Light|Sears the target with holy light. Deals 3d6+WIS holy damage on hit.
ABILITY_SEARING_LIGHT_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Searing Light|Searing holy light; 3d6+WIS.
ABILITY_CURE_SERIOUS_WOUNDS_NAME|40|ability display name for Cure Serious Wounds|Cure Serious Wounds
ABILITY_CURE_SERIOUS_WOUNDS_SUMMARY||ability summary for Cure Serious Wounds|Calls powerful healing into the caster. Restores 3d8+WIS HP.
ABILITY_CURE_SERIOUS_WOUNDS_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Cure Serious Wounds|Restore 3d8+WIS HP.
ABILITY_CAUSE_SERIOUS_WOUNDS_NAME|40|ability display name for Cause Serious Wounds|Cause Serious Wounds
ABILITY_CAUSE_SERIOUS_WOUNDS_SUMMARY||ability summary for Cause Serious Wounds|Channels strong harmful divine power through a touch. Deals 3d8+WIS damage on hit.
ABILITY_CAUSE_SERIOUS_WOUNDS_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Cause Serious Wounds|Touch attack; 3d8+WIS damage.
ABILITY_POISON_NAME|40|ability display name for Poison|Poison
ABILITY_POISON_SUMMARY||ability summary for Poison|Touches one living creature with venomous divine harm. A successful CON save negates the poison.
ABILITY_POISON_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Poison|Touch poison; CON negates.
ABILITY_FLAME_STRIKE_NAME|40|ability display name for Flame Strike|Flame Strike
ABILITY_FLAME_STRIKE_SUMMARY||ability summary for Flame Strike|Calls down a pillar of holy fire on the target tile. Combatants in the 3x3 area, including you and allies, take 4d6+WIS fire damage. A successful DEX save halves the damage.
ABILITY_FLAME_STRIKE_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Flame Strike|3x3 pillar of fire.
ABILITY_HEAL_NAME|40|ability display name for Heal|Heal
ABILITY_HEAL_SUMMARY||ability summary for Heal|Floods the caster with overwhelming healing. Restores most HP and clears poison, disease, bleeding, blindness, and paralysis.
ABILITY_HEAL_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Heal|Huge heal; clears major conditions.
ABILITY_SLEEP_NAME|40|ability display name for Sleep|Sleep
ABILITY_SLEEP_SUMMARY||ability summary for Sleep|Lulls a creature into magical sleep for 3 turns. A successful WIS save negates the effect.
ABILITY_SLEEP_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Sleep|WIS save or sleep.
ABILITY_GREASE_NAME|40|ability display name for Grease|Grease
ABILITY_GREASE_SUMMARY||ability summary for Grease|Coats a tile in slick grease. Creatures moving onto or off it, or making melee attacks there, must make a DEX save or slip and lose that action.
ABILITY_GREASE_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Grease|Greases a tile.
ABILITY_KNOCK_NAME|40|ability display name for Knock|Knock
ABILITY_KNOCK_SUMMARY||ability summary for Knock|Channels, then attempts to open a closed, locked, or jammed adjacent door, or unlock an adjacent locked chest, without triggering traps. Locked and jammed targets require a spell check.
ABILITY_KNOCK_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Knock|Channel; spell check vs locks.
ABILITY_GREATER_KNOCK_NAME|40|ability display name for Greater Knock|Greater Knock
ABILITY_GREATER_KNOCK_SUMMARY||ability summary for Greater Knock|Channels longer, then opens a closed, locked, or jammed adjacent door, or unlocks an adjacent locked chest, without triggering traps or requiring a check.
ABILITY_GREATER_KNOCK_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Greater Knock|Long channel; opens locks safely.
ABILITY_MIRROR_IMAGE_NAME|40|ability display name for Mirror Image|Mirror Image
ABILITY_MIRROR_IMAGE_SUMMARY||ability summary for Mirror Image|Surrounds the caster with 3 mirror images. When a hit connects, one image is lost and that hit deals half damage.
ABILITY_MIRROR_IMAGE_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Mirror Image|3 images; hits deal half damage.
ABILITY_INVISIBILITY_NAME|40|ability display name for Invisibility|Invisibility
ABILITY_INVISIBILITY_SUMMARY||ability summary for Invisibility|Shrouds the caster from sight. Taking an action or making an attack ends the spell.
ABILITY_INVISIBILITY_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Invisibility|Invisible until you act or attack.
ABILITY_DISPEL_MAGIC_NAME|40|ability display name for Dispel Magic|Dispel Magic
ABILITY_DISPEL_MAGIC_SUMMARY||ability summary for Dispel Magic|Strips magic from a target tile, creature, or object. It removes magical effects whether helpful or harmful.
ABILITY_DISPEL_MAGIC_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Dispel Magic|Strip magic from a target tile.
ABILITY_HASTE_NAME|40|ability display name for Haste|Haste
ABILITY_HASTE_SUMMARY||ability summary for Haste|Floods the caster with unnatural speed for 1 minute. While it lasts, you act twice for each enemy turn, hunger drains faster, and you become exhausted afterward.
ABILITY_HASTE_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Haste|1 min speed; exhaustion after.
ABILITY_TELEPORT_NAME|40|ability display name for Teleport|Teleport
ABILITY_TELEPORT_SUMMARY||ability summary for Teleport|Using unstable magical energies the caster is whisked near the selected tile. The chosen tile may be anywhere on the map, but it must be a legal open landing tile. Invalid destinations trigger arcane backlash instead.
ABILITY_TELEPORT_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Teleport|Unstable map-wide teleport.
ABILITY_GREATER_TELEPORT_NAME|40|ability display name for Greater Teleport|Greater Teleport
ABILITY_GREATER_TELEPORT_SUMMARY||ability summary for Greater Teleport|Channels a long-range teleport to a known town, dungeon entrance, sanctuary, or teleport circle and arrives safely.
ABILITY_GREATER_TELEPORT_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Greater Teleport|Travel to a known safe place.
ABILITY_PROTECTION_FROM_EVIL_NAME|40|ability display name for Protection from Evil|Protection from Evil
ABILITY_PROTECTION_FROM_EVIL_SUMMARY||ability summary for Protection from Evil|Wards the caster against evil, granting +1 DEF and +3 ARM against evil attacks.
ABILITY_PROTECTION_FROM_EVIL_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Protection from Evil|+1 DEF and +3 ARM vs evil.
ABILITY_PRAYER_NAME|40|ability display name for Prayer|Prayer
ABILITY_PRAYER_SUMMARY||ability summary for Prayer|Calls a short battle prayer. You are Blessed for 1 minute plus positive WIS modifier turns, while visible foes are Baned.
ABILITY_PRAYER_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Prayer|Blessed; visible foes Baned.
ABILITY_SILENCE_NAME|40|ability display name for Silence|Silence
ABILITY_SILENCE_SUMMARY||ability summary for Silence|Stills one creature's voice for 3 turns. A successful WIS save negates the effect.
ABILITY_SILENCE_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Silence|Silence one target; WIS save.
ABILITY_REMOVE_CURSE_NAME|40|ability display name for Remove Curse|Remove Curse
ABILITY_REMOVE_CURSE_SUMMARY||ability summary for Remove Curse|Lifts a curse from a carried or equipped item.
ABILITY_REMOVE_CURSE_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Remove Curse|Remove one item curse.
ABILITY_RESTORATION_NAME|40|ability display name for Restoration|Restoration
ABILITY_RESTORATION_SUMMARY||ability summary for Restoration|Clears all attribute drain and level drain.
ABILITY_RESTORATION_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Restoration|Clear attribute and level drain.
ABILITY_HOLY_WORD_NAME|40|ability display name for Holy Word|Holy Word
ABILITY_HOLY_WORD_SUMMARY||ability summary for Holy Word|Speaks a word of holy power. Evil, undead, fiendish, and summoned creatures in radius 5 take 4d6+WIS holy damage and save or are stunned; weak affected creatures may be destroyed.
ABILITY_HOLY_WORD_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Holy Word|Radius 5 holy word vs evil.
ABILITY_BURNING_HANDS_NAME|40|ability display name for Burning Hands|Burning Hands
ABILITY_BURNING_HANDS_SUMMARY||ability summary for Burning Hands|Sheets the area ahead in fire. Creatures in the 2-tile cone take 1d4+1+INT fire damage. A successful DEX save halves the damage.
ABILITY_BURNING_HANDS_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Burning Hands|2-tile fire cone.
ABILITY_ACID_ARROW_NAME|40|ability display name for Acid Arrow|Acid Arrow
ABILITY_ACID_ARROW_SUMMARY||ability summary for Acid Arrow|Launches an arrow of acid at the target. Deals 2d4+INT acid damage on hit and splashes acid onto the target tile.
ABILITY_ACID_ARROW_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Acid Arrow|Acid arrow; leaves acid behind.
ABILITY_FOG_CLOUD_NAME|40|ability display name for Fog Cloud|Fog Cloud
ABILITY_FOG_CLOUD_SUMMARY||ability summary for Fog Cloud|Summons a 3x3 fog cloud on a target tile. Ranged attacks cannot pass through it, and creatures inside it or striking into it in melee take -4 ATK.
ABILITY_FOG_CLOUD_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Fog Cloud|Target 3x3 fog; blocks shots.
ABILITY_DETECT_MAGIC_NAME|40|ability display name for Detect Magic|Detect Magic
ABILITY_DETECT_MAGIC_SUMMARY||ability summary for Detect Magic|Reveals nearby magical creatures, items, equipment, and held objects in cyan.
ABILITY_DETECT_MAGIC_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Detect Magic|Reveal nearby magical things.
ABILITY_DETECT_SECRET_DOORS_NAME|40|ability display name for Detect Secret Doors|Detect Secret Doors
ABILITY_DETECT_SECRET_DOORS_SUMMARY||ability summary for Detect Secret Doors|Reveals nearby secret doors, turning them into ordinary doors on the map.
ABILITY_DETECT_SECRET_DOORS_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Detect Secret Doors|Reveal nearby secret doors.
ABILITY_SCORCHING_RAY_NAME|40|ability display name for Scorching Ray|Scorching Ray
ABILITY_SCORCHING_RAY_SUMMARY||ability summary for Scorching Ray|Fires a scorching ray at the target. Deals 2d6+INT fire damage on hit.
ABILITY_SCORCHING_RAY_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Scorching Ray|Scorching ray; 2d6+INT on hit.
ABILITY_BLUR_NAME|40|ability display name for Blur|Blur
ABILITY_BLUR_SUMMARY||ability summary for Blur|Blurs the caster's outline, granting +2 DEF and +4 DEF against ranged attacks. The spell ends when you take damage.
ABILITY_BLUR_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Blur|+2 DEF, +4 vs ranged; breaks on hit.
ABILITY_BLINK_NAME|40|ability display name for Blink|Blink
ABILITY_BLINK_SUMMARY||ability summary for Blink|Whisks the caster to a random nearby empty tile.
ABILITY_BLINK_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Blink|Random short teleport.
ABILITY_SLOW_NAME|40|ability display name for Slow|Slow
ABILITY_SLOW_SUMMARY||ability summary for Slow|Curses the target with unnatural slowness for 10 turns. While slowed, it skips every other turn. A successful CON save negates the effect.
ABILITY_SLOW_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Slow|Slow 10 turns; CON save.
ABILITY_ENLARGE_NAME|40|ability display name for Enlarge|Enlarge
ABILITY_ENLARGE_SUMMARY||ability summary for Enlarge|Swells the caster with altering magic for 1 minute. While enlarged, you gain +4 Strength and lose 4 DEF.
ABILITY_ENLARGE_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Enlarge|+4 STR, -4 DEF for 1 min.
ABILITY_REDUCE_NAME|40|ability display name for Reduce|Reduce
ABILITY_REDUCE_SUMMARY||ability summary for Reduce|Reduces the caster with altering magic for 1 minute. While reduced, you lose 4 Strength and gain +4 DEF.
ABILITY_REDUCE_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Reduce|-4 STR, +4 DEF for 1 min.
ABILITY_FLOATING_DISC_NAME|40|ability display name for Floating Disc|Floating Disc
ABILITY_FLOATING_DISC_SUMMARY||ability summary for Floating Disc|Channels a hovering disc of force for 3 turns. Once formed, it carries part of your burden for 5 minutes and raises carry capacity by 100.
ABILITY_FLOATING_DISC_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Floating Disc|Channel; +100 carry capacity.
ABILITY_COLOR_SPRAY_NAME|40|ability display name for Color Spray|Color Spray
ABILITY_COLOR_SPRAY_SUMMARY||ability summary for Color Spray|Fans bewildering colors through a 3-tile cone. Creatures caught in the spray are blinded, confused, and briefly stunned unless they make a successful WIS save.
ABILITY_COLOR_SPRAY_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Color Spray|3-tile cone; WIS save or dazed.
ABILITY_SPOOK_NAME|40|ability display name for Spook|Spook
ABILITY_SPOOK_SUMMARY||ability summary for Spook|Projects a sudden illusory fright into the target. The creature retreats on its turn for 2 turns unless it makes a successful WIS save.
ABILITY_SPOOK_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Spook|Target retreats; WIS save.
ABILITY_PHANTASMAL_FORCE_NAME|40|ability display name for Phantasmal Force|Phantasmal Force
ABILITY_PHANTASMAL_FORCE_SUMMARY||ability summary for Phantasmal Force|Plants a vivid false threat in the target's mind. The creature is confused for 3 turns and stunned for 1 turn unless it makes a successful INT save.
ABILITY_PHANTASMAL_FORCE_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Phantasmal Force|INT save or confused and stunned.
ABILITY_FORGET_NAME|40|ability display name for Forget|Forget
ABILITY_FORGET_SUMMARY||ability summary for Forget|Clouds a creature's recent memory for 4 turns, making it drop its current aggression and wander. A successful WIS save negates the effect.
ABILITY_FORGET_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Forget|Drop aggro 4 turns; WIS save.
ABILITY_FALSE_LIFE_NAME|40|ability display name for False Life|False Life
ABILITY_FALSE_LIFE_SUMMARY||ability summary for False Life|Grants 1d8+INT temporary HP for 1 hour. Temporary HP absorbs damage before real HP and does not stack.
ABILITY_FALSE_LIFE_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for False Life|1d8+INT temporary HP buffer.
ABILITY_CHILL_TOUCH_NAME|40|ability display name for Chill Touch|Chill Touch
ABILITY_CHILL_TOUCH_SUMMARY||ability summary for Chill Touch|Channels grave-cold power through a touch. Deals 2d4+INT cold damage on hit and chills the target for 2 turns unless it makes a successful CON save.
ABILITY_CHILL_TOUCH_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Chill Touch|Cold touch; 2d4+INT and chill.
ABILITY_SPECTRAL_HAND_NAME|40|ability display name for Spectral Hand|Spectral Hand
ABILITY_SPECTRAL_HAND_SUMMARY||ability summary for Spectral Hand|Projects a ghostly hand for 1 minute. While it lasts, your arcane necromancy touch spells can reach targets up to range 5.
ABILITY_SPECTRAL_HAND_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Spectral Hand|Necromancy touch spells reach 5.
ABILITY_GHOUL_TOUCH_NAME|40|ability display name for Ghoul Touch|Ghoul Touch
ABILITY_GHOUL_TOUCH_SUMMARY||ability summary for Ghoul Touch|Channels ghoulish hunger through a touch. Deals 1d6+INT untyped damage to a living target on hit and paralyzes it for 2 turns unless it makes a successful CON save.
ABILITY_GHOUL_TOUCH_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Ghoul Touch|Touch; 1d6+INT and paralysis.
ABILITY_ENERVATION_NAME|40|ability display name for Enervation|Enervation
ABILITY_ENERVATION_SUMMARY||ability summary for Enervation|Fires a black ray of draining necromancy at a living target. On hit, the creature is drained for 1 minute unless it makes a successful CON save, suffering -2 ATK, -2 DEF, -2 damage, and -2 on saving throws.
ABILITY_ENERVATION_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Enervation|Ray; temporary level drain.
ABILITY_RAY_OF_ENFEEBLEMENT_NAME|48|ability display name for Ray of Enfeeblement|Ray of Enfeeblement
ABILITY_RAY_OF_ENFEEBLEMENT_SUMMARY||ability summary for Ray of Enfeeblement|Fires a weakening necromantic ray at the target. On hit, the creature is weakened for 12 turns unless it makes a successful CON save.
ABILITY_RAY_OF_ENFEEBLEMENT_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Ray of Enfeeblement|Weakening ray; CON save.
ABILITY_VAMPIRIC_TOUCH_NAME|48|ability display name for Vampiric Touch|Vampiric Touch
ABILITY_VAMPIRIC_TOUCH_SUMMARY||ability summary for Vampiric Touch|Channels life-draining power through a touch. Deals 3d6+INT untyped damage on hit and restores HP equal to half the damage dealt.
ABILITY_VAMPIRIC_TOUCH_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Vampiric Touch|Touch; 3d6+INT and heal half.
ABILITY_FEEBLEMIND_NAME|40|ability display name for Feeblemind|Feeblemind
ABILITY_FEEBLEMIND_SUMMARY||ability summary for Feeblemind|Crushes the target's spellcasting mind. An INT save negates the spell; on failure, the target cannot cast spells for 1 minute, or 2 minutes if it is a spellcaster.
ABILITY_FEEBLEMIND_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Feeblemind|INT save or silence spellcasting.
ABILITY_ARCANE_HOLD_PERSON_NAME|40|ability display name for Arcane Hold Person|Hold Person
ABILITY_ARCANE_HOLD_PERSON_SUMMARY||ability summary for Arcane Hold Person|Binds a humanoid target in arcane paralysis for 3 turns. It makes a WIS save each turn to break free, and a successful initial WIS save negates the spell.
ABILITY_ARCANE_HOLD_PERSON_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Arcane Hold Person|Paralyze humanoid 3 turns; WIS save.
ABILITY_HOLD_MONSTER_NAME|40|ability display name for Hold Monster|Hold Monster
ABILITY_HOLD_MONSTER_SUMMARY||ability summary for Hold Monster|Binds a living monster in paralysis for 3 turns. It makes a WIS save each turn to break free, and a successful initial WIS save negates the spell.
ABILITY_HOLD_MONSTER_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Hold Monster|Paralyze living monster; WIS save.
ABILITY_GEAS_NAME|40|ability display name for Geas|Geas
ABILITY_GEAS_SUMMARY||ability summary for Geas|Places a binding command on a thinking creature for 1 minute. A successful WIS save negates the spell; on failure, the target stands down and wanders instead of attacking.
ABILITY_GEAS_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Geas|Compel stand-down; WIS negates.
ABILITY_COMPELLED_DANCE_NAME|40|ability display name for Compelled Dance|Compelled Dance
ABILITY_COMPELLED_DANCE_SUMMARY||ability summary for Compelled Dance|Forces a thinking creature into helpless, stumbling movement for 3 turns. A successful WIS save negates the spell.
ABILITY_COMPELLED_DANCE_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Compelled Dance|Disable and confuse; WIS negates.
ABILITY_HORRID_WILTING_NAME|40|ability display name for Horrid Wilting|Horrid Wilting
ABILITY_HORRID_WILTING_SUMMARY||ability summary for Horrid Wilting|Drains moisture from living creatures in a 5x5 area. Combatants there, including you and allies, take 8d6+INT untyped damage. A successful CON save halves the damage. Undead, constructs, elementals, oozes, and stony or incorporeal bodies are unaffected.
ABILITY_HORRID_WILTING_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Horrid Wilting|5x5 living-only necromantic blast.
ABILITY_WEIRD_NAME|40|ability display name for Weird|Weird
ABILITY_WEIRD_SUMMARY||ability summary for Weird|Unleashes phantasmal horrors in a 5x5 area. Thinking creatures there take 8d6+INT phantasmal damage and are stunned for 1 turn. A successful WIS save halves the damage and avoids the stun. Mindless creatures are unaffected.
ABILITY_WEIRD_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Weird|5x5 phantasmal terror.
ABILITY_CLONE_NAME|40|ability display name for Clone|Clone
ABILITY_CLONE_SUMMARY||ability summary for Clone|Channels for 1 minute to grow a permanent clone body nearby, costing 1 permanent CON. If you die while any clone lives, your soul transfers to the oldest clone and all carried gear drops where you died. Clones are helpless, idle nearby, and can be killed.
ABILITY_CLONE_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Clone|Permanent death backup; costs 1 CON.
ABILITY_DISPLACEMENT_NAME|40|ability display name for Displacement|Displacement
ABILITY_DISPLACEMENT_SUMMARY||ability summary for Displacement|Bends light around the caster for 1 minute. While displaced, you gain +4 DEF.
ABILITY_DISPLACEMENT_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Displacement|+4 DEF for 1 minute.
ABILITY_LESSER_SHADOW_MONSTERS_NAME|48|ability display name for Lesser Shadow Monsters|Lesser Shadow Monsters
ABILITY_LESSER_SHADOW_MONSTERS_SUMMARY||ability summary for Lesser Shadow Monsters|Shapes a brief quasi-real shadow ally near you. Recasting replaces any active shadow monsters. If no enemies remain, the shadow fades almost immediately.
ABILITY_LESSER_SHADOW_MONSTERS_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Lesser Shadow Monsters|Brief weak shadow ally.
ABILITY_SHADOW_MONSTERS_NAME|40|ability display name for Shadow Monsters|Shadow Monsters
ABILITY_SHADOW_MONSTERS_SUMMARY||ability summary for Shadow Monsters|Shapes brief quasi-real shadow allies near you. Recasting replaces any active shadow monsters. If no enemies remain, the shadows fade almost immediately.
ABILITY_SHADOW_MONSTERS_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Shadow Monsters|Brief shadow allies.
ABILITY_GREATER_SHADOW_MONSTERS_NAME|48|ability display name for Greater Shadow Monsters|Greater Shadow Monsters
ABILITY_GREATER_SHADOW_MONSTERS_SUMMARY||ability summary for Greater Shadow Monsters|Shapes a brief quasi-real greater shadow ally near you. Recasting replaces any active shadow monsters. If no enemies remain, the shadow fades almost immediately.
ABILITY_GREATER_SHADOW_MONSTERS_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Greater Shadow Monsters|Brief greater shadow ally.
ABILITY_CONFUSION_NAME|40|ability display name for Confusion|Confusion
ABILITY_CONFUSION_SUMMARY||ability summary for Confusion|Clouds the target's mind with confusion for 5 turns. Confused creatures wander randomly and make a WIS save each turn to recover. A successful initial WIS save negates the spell.
ABILITY_CONFUSION_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Confusion|Confuse 5 turns; WIS save.
ABILITY_FIREBALL_NAME|40|ability display name for Fireball|Fireball
ABILITY_FIREBALL_SUMMARY||ability summary for Fireball|Detonates a fireball at the target tile. Combatants in radius 1 take 3d6+INT fire damage, including you and allies. A successful DEX save halves the damage.
ABILITY_FIREBALL_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Fireball|Radius 1 fireball.
ABILITY_CLAIRVOYANCE_NAME|40|ability display name for Clairvoyance|Clairvoyance
ABILITY_CLAIRVOYANCE_SUMMARY||ability summary for Clairvoyance|Channels distant sight into a target area. Reveals terrain-only knowledge in radius 3+INT, without revealing creatures or items.
ABILITY_CLAIRVOYANCE_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Clairvoyance|Channel; reveal distant terrain.
ABILITY_KNOW_VULNERABILITIES_NAME|40|ability display name for Know Vulnerabilities|Know Vulnerabilities
ABILITY_KNOW_VULNERABILITIES_SUMMARY||ability summary for Know Vulnerabilities|Reads a visible creature's defenses, revealing its immunities, resistances, and weaknesses in the monster catalog.
ABILITY_KNOW_VULNERABILITIES_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Know Vulnerabilities|Reveal one creature's defenses.
ABILITY_STONESKIN_NAME|40|ability display name for Stoneskin|Stoneskin
ABILITY_STONESKIN_SUMMARY||ability summary for Stoneskin|Hardens the caster's flesh to stone. While it lasts, you resist non-magical cutting and piercing weapons.
ABILITY_STONESKIN_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Stoneskin|Resist mundane blades and arrows.
ABILITY_CONE_OF_COLD_NAME|40|ability display name for Cone of Cold|Cone of Cold
ABILITY_CONE_OF_COLD_SUMMARY||ability summary for Cone of Cold|Unleashes a cone of killing frost. Creatures in the cone take 5d6+INT cold damage. A successful DEX save halves the damage. The ground is left iced.
ABILITY_CONE_OF_COLD_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Cone of Cold|Cold cone; leaves ice.
ABILITY_ICE_STORM_NAME|40|ability display name for Ice Storm|Ice Storm
ABILITY_ICE_STORM_SUMMARY||ability summary for Ice Storm|Drops a storm of ice over a radius 2 area. Combatants take 1d10 bludgeoning damage and 2d8 cold damage. There is no saving throw. Much of the ground is left iced.
ABILITY_ICE_STORM_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Ice Storm|Radius 2 ice; icy ground.
ABILITY_CHAIN_LIGHTNING_NAME|40|ability display name for Chain Lightning|Chain Lightning
ABILITY_CHAIN_LIGHTNING_SUMMARY||ability summary for Chain Lightning|Calls a bolt of chain lightning onto the target. It deals 4d6+INT shock damage, then jumps to up to 2 nearby non-neutral creatures for 2d6+INT shock damage each.
ABILITY_CHAIN_LIGHTNING_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Chain Lightning|Lightning jumps to nearby creatures.
ABILITY_WALL_OF_STONE_NAME|40|ability display name for Wall of Stone|Wall of Stone
ABILITY_WALL_OF_STONE_SUMMARY||ability summary for Wall of Stone|Raises a temporary wall of stone across the target area. It blocks movement, missiles, and sight for about 1 minute.
ABILITY_WALL_OF_STONE_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Wall of Stone|Stone wall for about 1 minute.
ABILITY_PASSWALL_NAME|40|ability display name for Passwall|Passwall
ABILITY_PASSWALL_SUMMARY||ability summary for Passwall|Opens a temporary passage through normal stone wall in the chosen direction. The passage extends 5+INT tiles and stays open for about 1 minute.
ABILITY_PASSWALL_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Passwall|Channel; open stone wall.
ABILITY_TRANSMUTE_ROCK_TO_MUD_NAME|40|ability display name for Transmute Rock to Mud|Transmute Rock to Mud
ABILITY_TRANSMUTE_ROCK_TO_MUD_SUMMARY||ability summary for Transmute Rock to Mud|Turns stone and dirt floor in a 3x3 area into thick mud for about 1 minute. Mud heavily slows movement and can bog creatures down.
ABILITY_TRANSMUTE_ROCK_TO_MUD_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Transmute Rock to Mud|3x3 mud for about 1 minute.
ABILITY_ANIMATE_DEAD_NAME|40|ability display name for Animate Dead|Animate Dead
ABILITY_ANIMATE_DEAD_SUMMARY||ability summary for Animate Dead|Animates a nearby corpse or remains into a temporary skeleton or zombie ally for about 1 minute.
ABILITY_ANIMATE_DEAD_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Animate Dead|Raise a temporary undead ally.
ABILITY_WALL_OF_FIRE_NAME|40|ability display name for Wall of Fire|Wall of Fire
ABILITY_WALL_OF_FIRE_SUMMARY||ability summary for Wall of Fire|Raises a burning wall across the target area. Creatures caught in it take 2d4+INT fire damage, and the wall burns for about 1 minute.
ABILITY_WALL_OF_FIRE_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Wall of Fire|Burning wall; 2d4+INT.
ABILITY_SANCTUARY_NAME|40|ability display name for Sanctuary|Sanctuary
ABILITY_SANCTUARY_SUMMARY||ability summary for Sanctuary|Cloaks the caster in divine peace. While it lasts, you cannot attack and enemies cannot attack you.
ABILITY_SANCTUARY_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Sanctuary|Neither side can attack you.
ABILITY_BANE_NAME|40|ability display name for Bane|Bane
ABILITY_BANE_SUMMARY||ability summary for Bane|Curses the target with divine ill fortune, giving -1 ATK and -1 DEF. A successful WIS save negates the effect.
ABILITY_BANE_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Bane|-1 ATK and DEF; WIS save.
ABILITY_DETECT_EVIL_NAME|40|ability display name for Detect Evil|Detect Evil
ABILITY_DETECT_EVIL_SUMMARY||ability summary for Detect Evil|Channels divine sight for 10 turns, then reveals nearby evil. Unseen evil is marked with a red *, and visible evil stands out in red.
ABILITY_DETECT_EVIL_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Detect Evil|Channel; reveal nearby evil.
ABILITY_DIVINE_DETECT_MAGIC_NAME|40|ability display name for divine Detect Magic|Detect Magic
ABILITY_DIVINE_DETECT_MAGIC_SUMMARY||ability summary for divine Detect Magic|Channels divine sight for 10 turns, then reveals nearby magical creatures, items, equipment, and held objects in cyan.
ABILITY_DIVINE_DETECT_MAGIC_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for divine Detect Magic|Channel; reveal nearby magic.
ABILITY_CREATE_WATER_NAME|40|ability display name for Create Water|Create Water
ABILITY_CREATE_WATER_SUMMARY||ability summary for Create Water|Calls clean water onto a nearby open tile, turning the ground into shallow water.
ABILITY_CREATE_WATER_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Create Water|Create shallow water nearby.
ABILITY_CAUSE_FEAR_NAME|40|ability display name for Cause Fear|Cause Fear
ABILITY_CAUSE_FEAR_SUMMARY||ability summary for Cause Fear|Strikes one living creature with divine terror for 3 turns. A successful WIS save negates the effect.
ABILITY_CAUSE_FEAR_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Cause Fear|Living target; WIS save or fear.
ABILITY_REMOVE_FEAR_NAME|40|ability display name for Remove Fear|Remove Fear
ABILITY_REMOVE_FEAR_SUMMARY||ability summary for Remove Fear|Steadies the caster against terror for 1 minute, clearing current fear and granting +4 on fear saves.
ABILITY_REMOVE_FEAR_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Remove Fear|Clear fear; +4 vs fear.
ABILITY_CURE_MODERATE_WOUNDS_NAME|40|ability display name for Cure Moderate Wounds|Cure Moderate Wounds
ABILITY_CURE_MODERATE_WOUNDS_SUMMARY||ability summary for Cure Moderate Wounds|Calls healing grace into the caster. Restores 2d8+WIS HP.
ABILITY_CURE_MODERATE_WOUNDS_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Cure Moderate Wounds|Restore 2d8+WIS HP.
ABILITY_CAUSE_MODERATE_WOUNDS_NAME|40|ability display name for Cause Moderate Wounds|Cause Moderate Wounds
ABILITY_CAUSE_MODERATE_WOUNDS_SUMMARY||ability summary for Cause Moderate Wounds|Channels harmful divine power through a touch. Deals 2d8+WIS damage on hit.
ABILITY_CAUSE_MODERATE_WOUNDS_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Cause Moderate Wounds|Touch attack; 2d8+WIS damage.
ABILITY_AID_NAME|40|ability display name for Aid|Aid
ABILITY_AID_SUMMARY||ability summary for Aid|Bolsters the caster with Bless for 1 minute plus positive WIS modifier turns and 1d8+WIS modifier temporary HP. Temporary HP does not stack.
ABILITY_AID_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Aid|Blessed and temporary HP.
ABILITY_AUGURY_NAME|40|ability display name for Augury|Augury
ABILITY_AUGURY_SUMMARY||ability summary for Augury|Channels for 1 turn, then reads one adjacent tile for traps, hostile creatures, curses, dangerous magic, or hazardous ground.
ABILITY_AUGURY_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Augury|Channel; read adjacent danger.
ABILITY_BARKSKIN_NAME|40|ability display name for Barkskin|Barkskin
ABILITY_BARKSKIN_SUMMARY||ability summary for Barkskin|Hardens the caster's skin, granting +10 ARM for 1 hour. Replaces Stoneskin.
ABILITY_BARKSKIN_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Barkskin|+10 ARM for 1 hour.
ABILITY_CHARM_BEAST_NAME|40|ability display name for Charm Beast|Charm Beast
ABILITY_CHARM_BEAST_SUMMARY||ability summary for Charm Beast|Charms one beast for 1 minute. A successful WIS save negates the effect.
ABILITY_CHARM_BEAST_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Charm Beast|Charm one beast; WIS save.
ABILITY_FIND_TRAPS_NAME|40|ability display name for Find Traps|Find Traps
ABILITY_FIND_TRAPS_SUMMARY||ability summary for Find Traps|Channels for 1 turn, then reveals hidden traps near the caster.
ABILITY_FIND_TRAPS_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Find Traps|Channel; reveal nearby traps.
ABILITY_FLAME_BLADE_NAME|40|ability display name for Flame Blade|Flame Blade
ABILITY_FLAME_BLADE_SUMMARY||ability summary for Flame Blade|Channels for 1 turn, then conjures a fiery main-hand blade for 1 minute. Your previous weapon returns when the spell ends.
ABILITY_FLAME_BLADE_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Flame Blade|Channel; temporary fire blade.
ABILITY_RESIST_FIRE_NAME|40|ability display name for Resist Fire|Resist Fire
ABILITY_RESIST_FIRE_SUMMARY||ability summary for Resist Fire|Grants +1 fire resistance for 1 minute.
ABILITY_RESIST_FIRE_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Resist Fire|+1 fire resistance.
ABILITY_RESIST_COLD_NAME|40|ability display name for Resist Cold|Resist Cold
ABILITY_RESIST_COLD_SUMMARY||ability summary for Resist Cold|Grants +1 cold resistance for 1 minute.
ABILITY_RESIST_COLD_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Resist Cold|+1 cold resistance.
ABILITY_SLOW_POISON_NAME|40|ability display name for Slow Poison|Slow Poison
ABILITY_SLOW_POISON_SUMMARY||ability summary for Slow Poison|Slows one active poison, reducing its remaining duration and weakening future poison damage. It cannot stack on the same poison.
ABILITY_SLOW_POISON_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Slow Poison|Weaken one active poison.
ABILITY_SPIRITUAL_WEAPON_NAME|40|ability display name for Spiritual Weapon|Spiritual Weapon
ABILITY_SPIRITUAL_WEAPON_SUMMARY||ability summary for Spiritual Weapon|Summons an autonomous flying blade for 1 minute. Recasting replaces the old spiritual weapon.
ABILITY_SPIRITUAL_WEAPON_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Spiritual Weapon|Summon a temporary weapon ally.
ABILITY_DIVINE_HOLD_PERSON_NAME|40|ability display name for Divine Hold Person|Hold Person
ABILITY_DIVINE_HOLD_PERSON_SUMMARY||ability summary for Divine Hold Person|Binds a humanoid target in divine paralysis for 3 turns. It makes a WIS save each turn to break free, and a successful initial WIS save negates the spell.
ABILITY_DIVINE_HOLD_PERSON_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Divine Hold Person|Paralyze humanoid 3 turns; WIS save.
ABILITY_NEUTRALIZE_POISON_NAME|40|ability display name for Neutralize Poison|Neutralize Poison
ABILITY_NEUTRALIZE_POISON_SUMMARY||ability summary for Neutralize Poison|Purges poison from the caster.
ABILITY_NEUTRALIZE_POISON_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Neutralize Poison|Clear poison.
ABILITY_DAYLIGHT_NAME|40|ability display name for Daylight|Daylight
ABILITY_DAYLIGHT_SUMMARY||ability summary for Daylight|Channels for 1 turn, then fills the area around the caster with bright daylight.
ABILITY_DAYLIGHT_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Daylight|Channel; large bright light.
ABILITY_CURE_CRITICAL_WOUNDS_NAME|40|ability display name for Cure Critical Wounds|Cure Critical Wounds
ABILITY_CURE_CRITICAL_WOUNDS_SUMMARY||ability summary for Cure Critical Wounds|Calls deep healing into the caster. Restores 4d8+WIS HP.
ABILITY_CURE_CRITICAL_WOUNDS_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Cure Critical Wounds|Restore 4d8+WIS HP.
ABILITY_CAUSE_CRITICAL_WOUNDS_NAME|40|ability display name for Cause Critical Wounds|Cause Critical Wounds
ABILITY_CAUSE_CRITICAL_WOUNDS_SUMMARY||ability summary for Cause Critical Wounds|Channels severe harmful divine power through a touch. Deals 4d8+WIS damage on hit.
ABILITY_CAUSE_CRITICAL_WOUNDS_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Cause Critical Wounds|Touch attack; 4d8+WIS damage.
ABILITY_FREEDOM_OF_MOVEMENT_NAME|40|ability display name for Freedom of Movement|Freedom of Movement
ABILITY_FREEDOM_OF_MOVEMENT_SUMMARY||ability summary for Freedom of Movement|Frees the caster from hindrance for 1 hour. It clears webbing and lets you ignore movement hindrance while it lasts.
ABILITY_FREEDOM_OF_MOVEMENT_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Freedom of Movement|Clear webs and ignore hindrance.
ABILITY_DEATH_WARD_NAME|40|ability display name for Death Ward|Death Ward
ABILITY_DEATH_WARD_SUMMARY||ability summary for Death Ward|Places a ward against death upon the caster for 1 hour. It grants immunity to death magic and similar fatal effects.
ABILITY_DEATH_WARD_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Death Ward|Immune to death magic.
ABILITY_DISMISSAL_NAME|40|ability display name for Dismissal|Dismissal
ABILITY_DISMISSAL_SUMMARY||ability summary for Dismissal|Banishes one summoned, extraplanar, or fiendish creature. A successful WIS save negates the spell.
ABILITY_DISMISSAL_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Dismissal|Banish summon or outsider; WIS negates.
ABILITY_TRUE_SEEING_NAME|40|ability display name for True Seeing|True Seeing
ABILITY_TRUE_SEEING_SUMMARY||ability summary for True Seeing|Reveals invisible creatures, secret doors, and traps for 10 minutes.
ABILITY_TRUE_SEEING_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for True Seeing|See invisibility, secrets, and traps.
ABILITY_CONJURE_EARTH_ELEMENTAL_NAME|40|ability display name for Conjure Earth Elemental|Conjure Earth Elemental
ABILITY_CONJURE_EARTH_ELEMENTAL_SUMMARY||ability summary for Conjure Earth Elemental|Summons an earth elemental to fight for 1 minute. Recasting replaces the existing conjured elemental.
ABILITY_CONJURE_EARTH_ELEMENTAL_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Conjure Earth Elemental|Summon earth elemental ally.
ABILITY_DISPEL_EVIL_NAME|40|ability display name for Dispel Evil|Dispel Evil
ABILITY_DISPEL_EVIL_SUMMARY||ability summary for Dispel Evil|Strikes the target with holy power. Deals 2d6+2+WIS holy damage and dispels summons.
ABILITY_DISPEL_EVIL_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Dispel Evil|Holy strike; dispels summons.
ABILITY_WORD_OF_RECALL_NAME|40|ability display name for Word of Recall|Word of Recall
ABILITY_WORD_OF_RECALL_SUMMARY||ability summary for Word of Recall|Calls the caster back to the staircase, floor entry point, or last sanctuary. The spell fails if that space is occupied.
ABILITY_WORD_OF_RECALL_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Word of Recall|Return to entry or sanctuary.
ABILITY_CREEPING_DOOM_NAME|40|ability display name for Creeping Doom|Creeping Doom
ABILITY_CREEPING_DOOM_SUMMARY||ability summary for Creeping Doom|Releases a slow crawling swarm that blocks sight, disrupts casting, and damages creatures it engulfs.
ABILITY_CREEPING_DOOM_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Creeping Doom|Slow moving damaging swarm.
ABILITY_LIGHT_NAME|40|ability display name for Light|Light
ABILITY_LIGHT_SUMMARY||ability summary for Light|Kindles magical light on a target area for 1 minute. Range scales with INT.
ABILITY_LIGHT_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Light|Light target area for 1 minute.
ABILITY_MAGE_HAND_NAME|40|ability display name for Mage Hand|Mage Hand
ABILITY_MAGE_HAND_SUMMARY||ability summary for Mage Hand|Extends a magical hand to act at range. It can clear webbing and work doors or containers.
ABILITY_MAGE_HAND_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Mage Hand|Remote hand for utility.
ABILITY_MINOR_ILLUSION_NAME|40|ability display name for Minor Illusion|Minor Illusion
ABILITY_MINOR_ILLUSION_SUMMARY||ability summary for Minor Illusion|Creates a fragile decoy on an empty target tile for 1 minute. Nearby creatures may treat it as a target unless they make a successful INT save.
ABILITY_MINOR_ILLUSION_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Minor Illusion|Empty-tile decoy; INT save to ignore.
ABILITY_TRUE_STRIKE_NAME|40|ability display name for True Strike|True Strike
ABILITY_TRUE_STRIKE_SUMMARY||ability summary for True Strike|Focuses the caster on a perfect blow. Your next attack roll gains +1 plus your INT modifier.
ABILITY_TRUE_STRIKE_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for True Strike|Channel; next attack gains +1+INT.
ABILITY_DIVINE_LIGHT_NAME|40|ability display name for Divine Light|Divine Light
ABILITY_DIVINE_LIGHT_SUMMARY||ability summary for Divine Light|Kindles a soft holy light around the caster for 10 turns.
ABILITY_DIVINE_LIGHT_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Divine Light|Moving holy light for 10 turns.
ABILITY_RESISTANCE_NAME|40|ability display name for Resistance|Resistance
ABILITY_RESISTANCE_SUMMARY||ability summary for Resistance|Steadies the caster against harm. The next saving throw within 1 minute gains +1.
ABILITY_RESISTANCE_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Resistance|+1 to next save.
ABILITY_VIRTUE_NAME|40|ability display name for Virtue|Virtue
ABILITY_VIRTUE_SUMMARY||ability summary for Virtue|Grants 1 temporary HP for 10 minutes. It has no effect if you already have temporary HP.
ABILITY_VIRTUE_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Virtue|1 temporary HP for 10 minutes if you have none.
ABILITY_BLESS_WEAPON_NAME|40|ability display name for Bless Weapon|Bless Weapon
ABILITY_BLESS_WEAPON_SUMMARY||ability summary for Bless Weapon|Blesses the caster's weapon. The next melee weapon hit within 1 minute deals +1 holy damage.
ABILITY_BLESS_WEAPON_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Bless Weapon|Next melee weapon hit gains +1 holy.
ABILITY_CALM_NAME|40|ability display name for Calm|Calm
ABILITY_CALM_SUMMARY||ability summary for Calm|Wraps one humanoid in divine calm for 3 turns, making it non-hostile. A successful WIS save negates the effect.
ABILITY_CALM_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Calm|Pacify a humanoid; WIS negates.
ABILITY_GUIDANCE_NAME|40|ability display name for Guidance|Guidance
ABILITY_GUIDANCE_SUMMARY||ability summary for Guidance|Calls a brief martial blessing. The next attack roll within 1 minute gains +1 ATK.
ABILITY_GUIDANCE_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Guidance|+1 ATK to next attack.
ABILITY_STAUNCH_NAME|40|ability display name for Staunch|Staunch
ABILITY_STAUNCH_SUMMARY||ability summary for Staunch|Slows a fresh bleed, reducing its remaining duration. It can help only once per bleeding wound.
ABILITY_STAUNCH_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Staunch|Reduce current bleed duration.
ABILITY_PURIFY_NAME|40|ability display name for Purify|Purify
ABILITY_PURIFY_SUMMARY||ability summary for Purify|Slows poison in the blood, reducing its remaining duration. It can help only once per poison.
ABILITY_PURIFY_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Purify|Reduce current poison duration.
ABILITY_REBUKE_NAME|40|ability display name for Rebuke|Rebuke
ABILITY_REBUKE_SUMMARY||ability summary for Rebuke|Commands one undead or evil creature to recoil and hesitate for 1 turn. A successful WIS save resists the rebuke.
ABILITY_REBUKE_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Rebuke|Push undead or evil target 1 tile and stun 1 turn.
ABILITY_GRAVE_TOUCH_NAME|40|ability display name for Grave Touch|Grave Touch
ABILITY_GRAVE_TOUCH_SUMMARY||ability summary for Grave Touch|Channels grave-cold power through a touch attack. Deals 1d4+WIS unholy damage to a living target.
ABILITY_GRAVE_TOUCH_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Grave Touch|Touch attack; 1d4+WIS unholy.
ABILITY_LAST_RITES_NAME|40|ability display name for Last Rites|Last Rites
ABILITY_LAST_RITES_SUMMARY||ability summary for Last Rites|Consecrates one nearby corpse or remains, preventing it from being raised.
ABILITY_LAST_RITES_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Last Rites|Consecrate one nearby corpse.
ABILITY_SHOCKING_GRASP_NAME|40|ability display name for Shocking Grasp|Shocking Grasp
ABILITY_SHOCKING_GRASP_SUMMARY||ability summary for Shocking Grasp|Charges the caster's hand with crackling force. Deals 1d8+INT shock damage on hit.
ABILITY_SHOCKING_GRASP_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Shocking Grasp|Touch shock strike; 1d8+INT.
ABILITY_MAGE_ARMOR_NAME|40|ability display name for Mage Armor|Mage Armor
ABILITY_MAGE_ARMOR_SUMMARY||ability summary for Mage Armor|Covers the caster in shimmering magical armor. Your body-slot armor no longer applies; instead you gain DEF 1+INT mod and ARM 2+INT mod x2 while it lasts.
ABILITY_MAGE_ARMOR_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Mage Armor|Replace body armor with magic armor.
ABILITY_FEATHER_FALL_NAME|40|ability display name for Feather Fall|Feather Fall
ABILITY_FEATHER_FALL_SUMMARY||ability summary for Feather Fall|Lightens the caster's body so falls do no damage for 1 minute.
ABILITY_FEATHER_FALL_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Feather Fall|No fall damage for 1 minute.
ABILITY_IDENTIFY_NAME|40|ability display name for Identify|Identify
ABILITY_IDENTIFY_SUMMARY||ability summary for Identify|Studies an item until its nature is revealed. Identifies one carried or equipped item.
ABILITY_IDENTIFY_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Identify|Identify one item.
ABILITY_SEE_INVISIBILITY_NAME|40|ability display name for See Invisibility|See Invisibility
ABILITY_SEE_INVISIBILITY_SUMMARY||ability summary for See Invisibility|Sharpens the caster's sight to reveal invisible creatures.
ABILITY_SEE_INVISIBILITY_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for See Invisibility|See invisible creatures.
ABILITY_FLY_NAME|40|ability display name for Fly|Fly
ABILITY_FLY_SUMMARY||ability summary for Fly|Channels flight into the caster for 1 hour. While it lasts, you pass over pits, acid, water, rubble, webbing, and similar floor hazards.
ABILITY_FLY_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Fly|Channel; fly over floor hazards.
ABILITY_MONSTER_SUMMONING_I_NAME|40|ability display name for Monster Summoning I|Monster Summoning I
ABILITY_MONSTER_SUMMONING_I_SUMMARY||ability summary for Monster Summoning I|Summons a random weak group of temporary allies near the caster for 2 minutes. Recasting replaces any active monster summoning allies.
ABILITY_MONSTER_SUMMONING_I_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Monster Summoning I|Random weak allies for 2 minutes.
ABILITY_MONSTER_SUMMONING_II_NAME|40|ability display name for Monster Summoning II|Monster Summoning II
ABILITY_MONSTER_SUMMONING_II_SUMMARY||ability summary for Monster Summoning II|Summons a random tougher group of temporary allies near the caster for 2 minutes. Recasting replaces any active monster summoning allies.
ABILITY_MONSTER_SUMMONING_II_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Monster Summoning II|Random tougher allies for 2 minutes.
ABILITY_MONSTER_SUMMONING_III_NAME|40|ability display name for Monster Summoning III|Monster Summoning III
ABILITY_MONSTER_SUMMONING_III_SUMMARY||ability summary for Monster Summoning III|Summons a random strong ally or small pack near the caster for 2 minutes. Recasting replaces any active monster summoning allies.
ABILITY_MONSTER_SUMMONING_III_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Monster Summoning III|Random strong allies for 2 minutes.
ABILITY_MONSTER_SUMMONING_IV_NAME|40|ability display name for Monster Summoning IV|Monster Summoning IV
ABILITY_MONSTER_SUMMONING_IV_SUMMARY||ability summary for Monster Summoning IV|Summons a troll, owlbear, or lesser elemental ally near the caster for 2 minutes. Recasting replaces any active monster summoning allies.
ABILITY_MONSTER_SUMMONING_IV_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Monster Summoning IV|Troll, owlbear, or lesser elemental.
ABILITY_MONSTER_SUMMONING_V_NAME|40|ability display name for Monster Summoning V|Monster Summoning V
ABILITY_MONSTER_SUMMONING_V_SUMMARY||ability summary for Monster Summoning V|Summons a random powerful ally near the caster for 2 minutes. Recasting replaces any active monster summoning allies.
ABILITY_MONSTER_SUMMONING_V_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Monster Summoning V|Random powerful ally for 2 minutes.
ABILITY_MONSTER_SUMMONING_VI_NAME|40|ability display name for Monster Summoning VI|Monster Summoning VI
ABILITY_MONSTER_SUMMONING_VI_SUMMARY||ability summary for Monster Summoning VI|Summons a random formidable ally near the caster for 2 minutes. Recasting replaces any active monster summoning allies.
ABILITY_MONSTER_SUMMONING_VI_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Monster Summoning VI|Random formidable ally for 2 minutes.
ABILITY_MONSTER_SUMMONING_VII_NAME|40|ability display name for Monster Summoning VII|Monster Summoning VII
ABILITY_MONSTER_SUMMONING_VII_SUMMARY||ability summary for Monster Summoning VII|Summons a random legendary ally near the caster for 2 minutes. Recasting replaces any active monster summoning allies.
ABILITY_MONSTER_SUMMONING_VII_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Monster Summoning VII|Random legendary ally for 2 minutes.
ABILITY_EXPLOSIVE_RUNES_NAME|40|ability display name for Explosive Runes|Explosive Runes
ABILITY_EXPLOSIVE_RUNES_SUMMARY||ability summary for Explosive Runes|Channels a magical rune onto an empty tile. The next combatant to step on it triggers a radius 1 blast for 3d4+INT damage. A successful DEX save halves the damage.
ABILITY_EXPLOSIVE_RUNES_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Explosive Runes|Channel; one rune trap; DEX half.
ABILITY_PROTECTION_FROM_ENERGY_NAME|40|ability display name for Protection from Energy|Protection from Energy
ABILITY_PROTECTION_FROM_ENERGY_SUMMARY||ability summary for Protection from Energy|Wraps the caster in elemental wards. Grants fire, cold, shock, and acid resistance.
ABILITY_PROTECTION_FROM_ENERGY_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Protection from Energy|Resist fire, cold, shock, and acid.
ABILITY_IMPROVED_INVISIBILITY_NAME|40|ability display name for Improved Invisibility|Improved Invisibility
ABILITY_IMPROVED_INVISIBILITY_SUMMARY||ability summary for Improved Invisibility|Shrouds the caster in deeper invisibility. Attacking does not automatically end it, but each attack has a 25% chance to break the spell.
ABILITY_IMPROVED_INVISIBILITY_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Improved Invisibility|Invisibility that can survive attacks.
ABILITY_DIMENSION_DOOR_NAME|40|ability display name for Dimension Door|Dimension Door
ABILITY_DIMENSION_DOOR_SUMMARY||ability summary for Dimension Door|Whisks the caster to any empty tile currently in sight.
ABILITY_DIMENSION_DOOR_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Dimension Door|Teleport to a visible empty tile.
ABILITY_TELEKINESIS_NAME|40|ability display name for Telekinesis|Telekinesis
ABILITY_TELEKINESIS_SUMMARY||ability summary for Telekinesis|Hurls the target back up to 5 tiles with telekinetic force. A successful STR save negates the push. If it strikes a wall or creature, it takes 3d6+INT physical damage and is stunned for 1 turn.
ABILITY_TELEKINESIS_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Telekinesis|Throw up to 5 tiles; STR save.
ABILITY_MINOR_GLOBE_OF_INVULNERABILITY_NAME|40|ability display name for Minor Globe of Invulnerability|Minor Globe of Invulnerability
ABILITY_MINOR_GLOBE_OF_INVULNERABILITY_SUMMARY||ability summary for Minor Globe of Invulnerability|Surrounds the caster with a lesser globe that turns aside weak magic. While it lasts, you are immune to spells of level 3 and lower.
ABILITY_MINOR_GLOBE_OF_INVULNERABILITY_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Minor Globe of Invulnerability|Immune to spells level 3 and lower.
ABILITY_GLOBE_OF_INVULNERABILITY_NAME|40|ability display name for Globe of Invulnerability|Globe of Invulnerability
ABILITY_GLOBE_OF_INVULNERABILITY_SUMMARY||ability summary for Globe of Invulnerability|Surrounds the caster with a globe that turns aside lesser magic. While it lasts, you are immune to spells of level 4 and lower.
ABILITY_GLOBE_OF_INVULNERABILITY_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Globe of Invulnerability|Immune to spells level 4 and lower.
ABILITY_REPULSION_NAME|40|ability display name for Repulsion|Repulsion
ABILITY_REPULSION_SUMMARY||ability summary for Repulsion|Surrounds the caster with a repelling aura for a few turns. Each turn, nearby hostile creatures must make a WIS save or be pushed 1 tile away.
ABILITY_REPULSION_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Repulsion|Aura pushes nearby foes away.
ABILITY_ARCANE_TRUE_SEEING_NAME|40|ability display name for arcane True Seeing|True Seeing
ABILITY_ARCANE_TRUE_SEEING_SUMMARY||ability summary for arcane True Seeing|Reveals invisible creatures, secret doors, traps, and nearby magic for 10 minutes, and clears blindness.
ABILITY_ARCANE_TRUE_SEEING_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for arcane True Seeing|See invisibility, secrets, traps, magic.
ABILITY_WIZARD_EYE_NAME|40|ability display name for Wizard Eye|Wizard Eye
ABILITY_WIZARD_EYE_SUMMARY||ability summary for Wizard Eye|Sends a magical eye in a chosen direction, revealing a narrow path of terrain through unexplored darkness.
ABILITY_WIZARD_EYE_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Wizard Eye|Scout terrain in one direction.
ABILITY_CONTACT_OTHER_PLANE_NAME|48|ability display name for Contact Other Plane|Contact Other Plane
ABILITY_CONTACT_OTHER_PLANE_SUMMARY||ability summary for Contact Other Plane|Channels a dangerous question beyond the mortal world. A distant voice reveals several valuable hidden facts about generated floors, marks the revealed places, and may backlash against the caster.
ABILITY_CONTACT_OTHER_PLANE_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Contact Other Plane|Channel; reveal valuable hidden facts.
ABILITY_LEGEND_LORE_NAME|40|ability display name for Legend Lore|Legend Lore
ABILITY_LEGEND_LORE_SUMMARY||ability summary for Legend Lore|Channels old names and half-remembered omens. If an artifact already exists somewhere in generated world state, the spell gives a vague hint toward it, preferring loose treasure before guaranteed monster drops.
ABILITY_LEGEND_LORE_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Legend Lore|Channel; vague artifact omen.
ABILITY_FORESIGHT_NAME|40|ability display name for Foresight|Foresight
ABILITY_FORESIGHT_SUMMARY||ability summary for Foresight|Reads the next moments before they arrive. For 1 minute, traps are anticipated, natural 20s against you no longer hit automatically, and the next incoming weapon hit is avoided.
ABILITY_FORESIGHT_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Foresight|Avoid next hit; anticipate traps.
ABILITY_DELAYED_BLAST_FIREBALL_NAME|40|ability display name for Delayed Blast Fireball|Delayed Blast Fireball
ABILITY_DELAYED_BLAST_FIREBALL_SUMMARY||ability summary for Delayed Blast Fireball|Places a delayed fire bead on an empty tile or detonates immediately on an occupied tile. The blast hits a 5x5 area for 7d6+INT fire damage, including you and allies. A successful DEX save halves the damage.
ABILITY_DELAYED_BLAST_FIREBALL_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Delayed Blast Fireball|Delayed or instant 5x5 fireball.
ABILITY_FINGER_OF_DEATH_NAME|40|ability display name for Finger of Death|Finger of Death
ABILITY_FINGER_OF_DEATH_SUMMARY||ability summary for Finger of Death|Targets one living creature with death magic. A failed CON save kills weakened targets outright or deals heavy death damage; a successful save halves the damage.
ABILITY_FINGER_OF_DEATH_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Finger of Death|Death ray; CON save.
ABILITY_POWER_WORD_STUN_NAME|40|ability display name for Power Word Stun|Power Word Stun
ABILITY_POWER_WORD_STUN_SUMMARY||ability summary for Power Word Stun|Stuns one creature whose current HP is below a threshold based on INT. Magic resistance applies, but there is no saving throw.
ABILITY_POWER_WORD_STUN_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Power Word Stun|No-save stun by HP threshold.
ABILITY_SPELL_TURNING_NAME|40|ability display name for Spell Turning|Spell Turning
ABILITY_SPELL_TURNING_SUMMARY||ability summary for Spell Turning|For 1 minute, reflects a few targeted hostile spells back at their casters. It does not reflect areas, breath, traps, gazes, clouds, or floor hazards.
ABILITY_SPELL_TURNING_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Spell Turning|Reflect targeted hostile spells.
ABILITY_VANISH_NAME|40|ability display name for Vanish|Vanish
ABILITY_VANISH_SUMMARY||ability summary for Vanish|Banishes one creature to a distant explored legal tile or nearby room. A successful WIS save negates the spell.
ABILITY_VANISH_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Vanish|WIS negates distant banishment.
ABILITY_PRISMATIC_SPRAY_NAME|40|ability display name for Prismatic Spray|Prismatic Spray
ABILITY_PRISMATIC_SPRAY_SUMMARY||ability summary for Prismatic Spray|Sprays a cone of shifting magical rays. Each creature hit suffers a random severe effect: elemental damage, poison, petrification, confusion, maze banishment, or blindness.
ABILITY_PRISMATIC_SPRAY_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Prismatic Spray|Random severe cone effects.
ABILITY_MIND_BLANK_NAME|40|ability display name for Mind Blank|Mind Blank
ABILITY_MIND_BLANK_SUMMARY||ability summary for Mind Blank|Seals the caster's mind against intrusion for 1 hour. It clears and blocks charm, fear, confusion, domination, sleep-style mind magic, feeblemind, divination, and mind detection.
ABILITY_MIND_BLANK_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Mind Blank|Clear and block mental magic.
ABILITY_MAZE_NAME|40|ability display name for Maze|Maze
ABILITY_MAZE_SUMMARY||ability summary for Maze|Banishes the target into a twisting magical maze. It returns after making a hard WIS escape save or when the maze collapses.
ABILITY_MAZE_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Maze|Banish until WIS escape.
ABILITY_INCENDIARY_CLOUD_NAME|40|ability display name for Incendiary Cloud|Incendiary Cloud
ABILITY_INCENDIARY_CLOUD_SUMMARY||ability summary for Incendiary Cloud|Creates a drifting 3x3 burning cloud that moves away from the caster. Creatures in the cloud take heavy fire damage each turn.
ABILITY_INCENDIARY_CLOUD_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Incendiary Cloud|Drifting 3x3 burning cloud.
ABILITY_POWER_WORD_BLIND_NAME|40|ability display name for Power Word Blind|Power Word Blind
ABILITY_POWER_WORD_BLIND_SUMMARY||ability summary for Power Word Blind|Blinds one creature whose current HP is below a threshold based on INT. Magic resistance applies, but there is no saving throw.
ABILITY_POWER_WORD_BLIND_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Power Word Blind|No-save blindness by HP threshold.
ABILITY_PRISMATIC_WALL_NAME|40|ability display name for Prismatic Wall|Prismatic Wall
ABILITY_PRISMATIC_WALL_SUMMARY||ability summary for Prismatic Wall|Raises a multicolored barrier that blocks movement, missiles, and sight. Touching or crossing it triggers a severe prismatic effect.
ABILITY_PRISMATIC_WALL_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Prismatic Wall|Deadly prismatic barrier.
ABILITY_SYMBOL_NAME|40|ability display name for Symbol|Symbol
ABILITY_SYMBOL_SUMMARY||ability summary for Symbol|Channels a powerful rune onto an empty floor tile for 10 minutes. The first creature to trigger it releases a 3x3 burst of fear, sleep, pain, stun, death, confusion, or blindness.
ABILITY_SYMBOL_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Symbol|High-DC rune trap.
ABILITY_METEOR_SWARM_NAME|40|ability display name for Meteor Swarm|Meteor Swarm
ABILITY_METEOR_SWARM_SUMMARY||ability summary for Meteor Swarm|Calls down four exploding meteors around the target area. Each impact deals heavy fire and physical damage, can overlap other impacts, and leaves fire behind. A successful DEX save halves the damage.
ABILITY_METEOR_SWARM_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Meteor Swarm|Four heavy exploding meteors.
ABILITY_GATE_NAME|40|ability display name for Gate|Gate
ABILITY_GATE_SUMMARY||ability summary for Gate|Opens a planar gate and releases an elite uncontrolled outsider for 1 minute. The creature attacks the nearest combatant, friend or foe.
ABILITY_GATE_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Gate|Uncontrolled elite outsider.
ABILITY_POWER_WORD_KILL_NAME|40|ability display name for Power Word Kill|Power Word Kill
ABILITY_POWER_WORD_KILL_SUMMARY||ability summary for Power Word Kill|Kills one creature whose current HP is below a threshold based on INT. Above that threshold it deals major death damage. Magic resistance applies, but there is no saving throw.
ABILITY_POWER_WORD_KILL_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Power Word Kill|No-save death by HP threshold.
ABILITY_TIME_STOP_NAME|40|ability display name for Time Stop|Time Stop
ABILITY_TIME_STOP_SUMMARY||ability summary for Time Stop|Stops time around the caster for 30 turns. While it lasts, you can act freely and enemies and world effects do not tick.
ABILITY_TIME_STOP_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Time Stop|Act freely for 30 turns.
ABILITY_WISH_NAME|40|ability display name for Wish|Wish
ABILITY_WISH_SUMMARY||ability summary for Wish|Calls on dangerous ultimate magic. Choose 1 of 4 random miracles, then permanently lose 1d6 maximum MP and 1d3 maximum HP.
ABILITY_WISH_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Wish|Choose a miracle; permanent drain.
SPELL_WISH_OPTION_MIGHT_LABEL|48|Wish option label|Might
SPELL_WISH_OPTION_MIGHT_DETAIL||Wish option detail|Permanently raises one random attribute by 2.
SPELL_WISH_OPTION_PERFECTION_LABEL|48|Wish option label|Perfection
SPELL_WISH_OPTION_PERFECTION_DETAIL||Wish option detail|Fully restores you, removes curses and afflictions, and grants major wards for 1 minute.
SPELL_WISH_OPTION_GREAT_WEALTH_LABEL|48|Wish option label|Great Wealth
SPELL_WISH_OPTION_GREAT_WEALTH_DETAIL||Wish option detail|Creates a fortune in gold, gems, and one potent spell focus item.
SPELL_WISH_OPTION_ARCANE_HOARD_LABEL|48|Wish option label|Arcane Hoard
SPELL_WISH_OPTION_ARCANE_HOARD_DETAIL||Wish option detail|Creates 2-3 high-tier arcane scrolls, wands, or focus items.
SPELL_WISH_OPTION_ARMS_OF_POWER_LABEL|48|Wish option label|Arms of Power
SPELL_WISH_OPTION_ARMS_OF_POWER_DETAIL||Wish option detail|Creates a +3 weapon suited to your best trained weapon skill.
SPELL_WISH_OPTION_ARMOR_OF_POWER_LABEL|48|Wish option label|Armor of Power
SPELL_WISH_OPTION_ARMOR_OF_POWER_DETAIL||Wish option detail|Creates a +3 armor piece suited to your class.
SPELL_WISH_OPTION_WIZARDS_REVELATION_LABEL|48|Wish option label|Wizard's Revelation
SPELL_WISH_OPTION_WIZARDS_REVELATION_DETAIL||Wish option detail|Learns up to 3 unknown high-level arcane spells, restores MP, and permanently improves MP regeneration.
SPELL_WISH_OPTION_ANNIHILATION_LABEL|48|Wish option label|Annihilation
SPELL_WISH_OPTION_ANNIHILATION_DETAIL||Wish option detail|Destroys nearby hostile creatures; magic-resistant survivors take massive damage.
SPELL_WISH_OPTION_SALVATION_LABEL|48|Wish option label|Salvation
SPELL_WISH_OPTION_SALVATION_DETAIL||Wish option detail|Restores you and carries you to a known safe town, camp, or shrine.
SPELL_WISH_OPTION_AVATAR_FORM_LABEL|48|Wish option label|Avatar Form
SPELL_WISH_OPTION_AVATAR_FORM_DETAIL||Wish option detail|Transforms you into a mighty arcane avatar for 2 minutes.
SPELL_WISH_OPTION_CALL_PARAGON_LABEL|48|Wish option label|Call Paragon
SPELL_WISH_OPTION_CALL_PARAGON_DETAIL||Wish option detail|Summons an elite apex ally for 2 minutes.
SPELL_WISH_OPTION_ARCANE_TEMPEST_LABEL|48|Wish option label|Arcane Tempest
SPELL_WISH_OPTION_ARCANE_TEMPEST_DETAIL||Wish option detail|Creates a 10-turn storm around you that damages nearby foes with elemental and force damage.
SPELL_WISH_RESULT_WITH_DRAIN||Wish result with permanent cost|{0} Wish permanently drains {1} maximum MP and {2} maximum HP.
SPELL_WISH_NOTHING_LEARNED|80|Wish fallback name list|nothing
SPELL_WISH_MIGHT_RESULT||Wish Might result|Your {0} permanently rises by 2.
SPELL_WISH_PERFECTION_RESULT||Wish Perfection result|You are remade in perfect health and wrapped in mighty wards.
SPELL_WISH_GREAT_WEALTH_RESULT||Wish Great Wealth result|Treasure spills into your pack: {0}.
SPELL_WISH_ARCANE_HOARD_RESULT||Wish Arcane Hoard result|Arcane treasures gather in your pack: {0}.
SPELL_WISH_ARMS_OF_POWER_RESULT||Wish Arms of Power result|Wish forges {0} for you.
SPELL_WISH_ARMOR_OF_POWER_RESULT||Wish Armor of Power result|Wish shapes {0} for you.
SPELL_WISH_WIZARDS_REVELATION_RESULT||Wish Wizard's Revelation result|Formulae blaze into memory: {0}. Your MP is restored and future MP regeneration improves.
SPELL_WISH_WIZARDS_REVELATION_NONE_RESULT||Wish Wizard's Revelation no-spell result|No unknown formula within your reach remains hidden. Your MP is restored and future MP regeneration improves.
SPELL_WISH_ANNIHILATION_NO_TARGETS||Wish Annihilation no-target result|The annihilating word finds no nearby hostile creature.
SPELL_WISH_ANNIHILATION_RESULT||Wish Annihilation result|The annihilating word erases {0} foes and scorches {1} resistant foes for {2} damage.
SPELL_WISH_SALVATION_RESULT||Wish Salvation result|Wish carries you to {0}, restored and clean.
SPELL_WISH_SALVATION_NO_DEST_RESULT||Wish Salvation no destination result|Wish restores you, but no known sanctuary answers.
SPELL_WISH_AVATAR_FORM_RESULT||Wish Avatar Form result|You become an arcane avatar.
SPELL_WISH_AVATAR_FORM_FAILED||Wish Avatar Form failed result|Arcane avatar power flares but cannot hold a shape.
SPELL_WISH_CALL_PARAGON_RESULT||Wish Call Paragon result|An elite {0} answers your call.
SPELL_WISH_CALL_PARAGON_FAILED||Wish Call Paragon failed result|The paragon call fails; no nearby space can hold it.
SPELL_WISH_ARCANE_TEMPEST_RESULT||Wish Arcane Tempest result|An arcane tempest gathers around you.
SPELL_WISH_ARCANE_TEMPEST_TICK||Wish Arcane Tempest per-turn base sentence|The arcane tempest lashes out.
STATUS_ARCANE_AVATAR_FADES||arcane avatar fade message|Arcane Avatar wears off.
STATUS_ARCANE_TEMPEST_FADES||arcane tempest fade message|Arcane Tempest wears off.
ABILITY_ARMOR_OF_FAITH_NAME|40|ability display name for Armor of Faith|Armor of Faith
ABILITY_ARMOR_OF_FAITH_SUMMARY||ability summary for Armor of Faith|A warding prayer grants ARM equal to 2 + your WIS modifier for 1 hour.
ABILITY_ARMOR_OF_FAITH_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Armor of Faith|2+WIS ARM for 1 hour.
ABILITY_REMOVE_PARALYSIS_NAME|40|ability display name for Remove Paralysis|Remove Paralysis
ABILITY_REMOVE_PARALYSIS_SUMMARY||ability summary for Remove Paralysis|Lifts sleep, confusion, and webbing from the caster.
ABILITY_REMOVE_PARALYSIS_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Remove Paralysis|Clear sleep, confusion, and webs.
ABILITY_CONSECRATE_NAME|40|ability display name for Consecrate|Consecrate
ABILITY_CONSECRATE_SUMMARY||ability summary for Consecrate|Consecrates a tile for 3 turns. Hostile evil, summoned, and extraplanar creatures take 2+WIS holy damage on cast, at turn start, and on entry.
ABILITY_CONSECRATE_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Consecrate|3-turn holy ground; damage on cast, turn start, and entry.
ABILITY_CIRCLE_OF_PROTECTION_NAME|40|ability display name for Circle of Protection|Circle of Protection
ABILITY_CIRCLE_OF_PROTECTION_SUMMARY||ability summary for Circle of Protection|Channels for 1 turn, then consecrates a radius-2 circle for 3 turns. Hostile evil, summoned, and extraplanar creatures on it take holy damage; those caught when it appears may be Baned and Slowed.
ABILITY_CIRCLE_OF_PROTECTION_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Circle of Protection|Consecrated circle: holy damage, Bane, and Slow.
ABILITY_RIGHTEOUS_MIGHT_NAME|40|ability display name for Righteous Might|Righteous Might
ABILITY_RIGHTEOUS_MIGHT_SUMMARY||ability summary for Righteous Might|Fills the caster with divine battle power for 1 minute. Grants +2 ATK, +2 melee damage, +20 HP, and resistance to fear and knockback.
ABILITY_RIGHTEOUS_MIGHT_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Righteous Might|+2 ATK/damage, +20 HP.
ABILITY_COMMUNE_NAME|40|ability display name for Commune|Commune
ABILITY_COMMUNE_SUMMARY||ability summary for Commune|Reveals all special tiles on the floor and the area around them.
ABILITY_COMMUNE_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Commune|Reveal special places on the floor.
ABILITY_BLADE_BARRIER_NAME|40|ability display name for Blade Barrier|Blade Barrier
ABILITY_BLADE_BARRIER_SUMMARY||ability summary for Blade Barrier|Creates a 3x3 ring of whirling blades with an empty center for 1 minute. Creatures entering or starting in the blades take heavy slashing damage.
ABILITY_BLADE_BARRIER_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Blade Barrier|3x3 blade ring; slashing damage.
ABILITY_HEROES_FEAST_NAME|40|ability display name for Heroes' Feast|Heroes' Feast
ABILITY_HEROES_FEAST_SUMMARY||ability summary for Heroes' Feast|Channels a hero's feast, then blesses the caster for 10 minutes. You gain +1 to all attributes, become immune to fear, and resist poison and disease.
ABILITY_HEROES_FEAST_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Heroes' Feast|+1 stats; fear and poison ward.
ABILITY_REGENERATE_NAME|40|ability display name for Regenerate|Regenerate
ABILITY_REGENERATE_SUMMARY||ability summary for Regenerate|Fills the caster with regenerative power. Stops bleeding and restores 2+WIS HP each turn for 1 minute.
ABILITY_REGENERATE_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Regenerate|Stop bleeding; heal each turn.
ABILITY_SUNRAY_NAME|40|ability display name for Sunray|Sunray
ABILITY_SUNRAY_SUMMARY||ability summary for Sunray|Fires a brilliant ray of sunlight that blinds and burns one target. Undead take heavy holy damage.
ABILITY_SUNRAY_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Sunray|Holy ray; blind and burn.
ABILITY_EARTHQUAKE_NAME|40|ability display name for Earthquake|Earthquake
ABILITY_EARTHQUAKE_SUMMARY||ability summary for Earthquake|Shakes a large area. Combatants caught in the quake take 3d6+WIS bludgeoning damage, save for half, and may be stunned while weak walls and terrain break.
ABILITY_EARTHQUAKE_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Earthquake|Large quake; damage, stun, rubble.
ABILITY_DIVINE_GATE_NAME|40|ability display name for Divine Gate|Gate
ABILITY_DIVINE_GATE_SUMMARY||ability summary for Divine Gate|Opens a divine gate and releases a powerful outsider for 1 minute. The outsider attacks everything until the gate closes.
ABILITY_DIVINE_GATE_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Divine Gate|Release hostile divine outsider.
ABILITY_MIRACLE_NAME|40|ability display name for Miracle|Miracle
ABILITY_MIRACLE_SUMMARY||ability summary for Miracle|Channels for 1 minute, then fully restores HP, MP, and PP, makes you satiated, and clears all negative conditions, attribute drain, level drain, and curses. Permanently drains 1d3 maximum PP.
ABILITY_MIRACLE_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Miracle|Channel; restore everything; drain max PP.
ABILITY_DIVINE_SYMBOL_NAME|40|ability display name for Divine Symbol|Symbol
ABILITY_DIVINE_SYMBOL_SUMMARY||ability summary for Divine Symbol|Places a powerful holy rune trap for 10 minutes. The next enemy to trigger it may be stunned, frightened, blinded, or destroyed.
ABILITY_DIVINE_SYMBOL_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Divine Symbol|Holy rune trap.
ABILITY_CLOUDKILL_NAME|40|ability display name for Cloudkill|Cloudkill
ABILITY_CLOUDKILL_SUMMARY||ability summary for Cloudkill|Fills a 3x3 area with a killing cloud. Creatures inside it take 2d6 poison damage each turn.
ABILITY_CLOUDKILL_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Cloudkill|3x3 poison cloud.
ABILITY_PRODUCE_FLAME_NAME|40|ability display name for Produce Flame|Produce Flame
ABILITY_PRODUCE_FLAME_SUMMARY||ability summary for Produce Flame|Kindles living flame and hurls it at the target. Deals 1d3+WIS fire damage.
ABILITY_PRODUCE_FLAME_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Produce Flame|Hurl living flame; 1d3+WIS, thrown range.
ABILITY_SHILLELAGH_NAME|40|ability display name for Shillelagh|Shillelagh
ABILITY_SHILLELAGH_SUMMARY||ability summary for Shillelagh|Blesses a club, staff, or wooden weapon for 2 minutes. It counts as magical +1 while the blessing lasts, but does not stack with a true enchantment.
ABILITY_SHILLELAGH_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Shillelagh|Wooden weapon acts as magical +1.
ABILITY_ENTANGLE_NAME|40|ability display name for Entangle|Entangle
ABILITY_ENTANGLE_SUMMARY||ability summary for Entangle|Channels living roots into a 3x3 area for 1 minute. Creatures caught in the roots must tear free to move; a successful STR save avoids the first snare.
ABILITY_ENTANGLE_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Entangle|Channel; 3x3 roots; STR save.
ABILITY_PLANT_GROWTH_NAME|40|ability display name for Plant Growth|Plant Growth
ABILITY_PLANT_GROWTH_SUMMARY||ability summary for Plant Growth|Channels a dense radius-3 growth of grass, brush, and blocking trees for 1 minute, or radius 4 outdoors. The original ground returns when the spell ends.
ABILITY_PLANT_GROWTH_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Plant Growth|Channel; temporary thick growth.
ABILITY_HOLD_PLANT_NAME|40|ability display name for Hold Plant|Hold Plant
ABILITY_HOLD_PLANT_SUMMARY||ability summary for Hold Plant|Channels a 3x3 patch of grasping growth. Creatures in the area must make a STR save or be held, then slowed by the roots.
ABILITY_HOLD_PLANT_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Hold Plant|3x3 growth hold; STR save.
ABILITY_WALL_OF_THORNS_NAME|40|ability display name for Wall of Thorns|Wall of Thorns
ABILITY_WALL_OF_THORNS_SUMMARY||ability summary for Wall of Thorns|Channels for 1 turn, then creates a non-blocking wall of cruel thorns for 1 minute. Creatures moving through take damage and may bleed.
ABILITY_WALL_OF_THORNS_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Wall of Thorns|Thorn wall; damage and bleed.
ABILITY_FAERIE_FIRE_NAME|40|ability display name for Faerie Fire|Faerie Fire
ABILITY_FAERIE_FIRE_SUMMARY||ability summary for Faerie Fire|Outlines one target in pale witch-light for 1 minute, revealing invisibility and giving -1 DEF.
ABILITY_FAERIE_FIRE_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Faerie Fire|Reveal target; -1 DEF.
ABILITY_ANIMAL_FRIENDSHIP_NAME|40|ability display name for Animal Friendship|Animal Friendship
ABILITY_ANIMAL_FRIENDSHIP_SUMMARY||ability summary for Animal Friendship|Befriends one beast for a short time, making it fight beside you. A successful WIS save negates the spell, and direct attacks break the friendship.
ABILITY_ANIMAL_FRIENDSHIP_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Animal Friendship|Temporary beast ally; WIS negates.
ABILITY_CALL_LIGHTNING_NAME|40|ability display name for Call Lightning|Call Lightning
ABILITY_CALL_LIGHTNING_SUMMARY||ability summary for Call Lightning|Calls storm lightning onto the target. Deals 6d8+WIS shock damage outdoors, or 3d8+WIS indoors. A successful DEX save halves the damage.
ABILITY_CALL_LIGHTNING_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Call Lightning|6d8+WIS outdoors; 3d8+WIS indoors.
ABILITY_SUMMON_INSECTS_NAME|40|ability display name for Summon Insects|Summon Insects
ABILITY_SUMMON_INSECTS_SUMMARY||ability summary for Summon Insects|Summons a stinging insect swarm around one target for 4 rounds. The swarm deals 1 + half WIS damage each round and gives the target -1 ATK and -1 DEF while it lasts. There is no saving throw.
ABILITY_SUMMON_INSECTS_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Summon Insects|4 rounds; no save.
ABILITY_PROTECTION_FROM_ELEMENTS_NAME|40|ability display name for Protection from Elements|Protection from Elements
ABILITY_PROTECTION_FROM_ELEMENTS_SUMMARY||ability summary for Protection from Elements|Wraps the caster in broad elemental wards. Grants +1 fire, cold, shock, and acid resistance for 1 minute. It does not ward poison.
ABILITY_PROTECTION_FROM_ELEMENTS_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Protection from Elements|+1 fire/cold/shock/acid; no poison.
ABILITY_BESTOW_CURSE_NAME|40|ability display name for Bestow Curse|Bestow Curse
ABILITY_BESTOW_CURSE_SUMMARY||ability summary for Bestow Curse|Curses one target for 1 hour, giving -2 ATK and -2 on saving throws. A successful WIS save negates the spell.
ABILITY_BESTOW_CURSE_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Bestow Curse|-2 ATK/saves; WIS negates.
ABILITY_GLYPH_OF_WARDING_NAME|40|ability display name for Glyph of Warding|Glyph of Warding
ABILITY_GLYPH_OF_WARDING_SUMMARY||ability summary for Glyph of Warding|Channels for 3 turns, then places a holy glyph on an empty tile for 10 minutes. The first combatant to step on it takes 3d6+WIS holy damage and is stunned for 1 turn; a successful DEX save halves the damage and avoids the stun.
ABILITY_GLYPH_OF_WARDING_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Glyph of Warding|Channel; holy rune trap.
ABILITY_INSECT_PLAGUE_NAME|40|ability display name for Insect Plague|Insect Plague
ABILITY_INSECT_PLAGUE_SUMMARY||ability summary for Insect Plague|Calls a biting insect swarm over a 3x3 area. Combatants there, including you and allies, take 2d6+WIS damage and are confused for 3 turns. A successful CON save halves the damage and avoids the confusion.
ABILITY_INSECT_PLAGUE_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Insect Plague|3x3 biting swarm; CON save.
ABILITY_ANIMAL_SUMMONING_I_NAME|40|ability display name for Animal Summoning I|Animal Summoning I
ABILITY_ANIMAL_SUMMONING_I_SUMMARY||ability summary for Animal Summoning I|Calls nearby beasts to fight beside the caster for 1 minute. Recasting replaces the previous animal summons.
ABILITY_ANIMAL_SUMMONING_I_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Animal Summoning I|Summon lesser beast allies.
ABILITY_ANIMAL_SUMMONING_II_NAME|40|ability display name for Animal Summoning II|Animal Summoning II
ABILITY_ANIMAL_SUMMONING_II_SUMMARY||ability summary for Animal Summoning II|Calls stronger beasts to fight beside the caster for 1 minute. Recasting replaces the previous animal summons.
ABILITY_ANIMAL_SUMMONING_II_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Animal Summoning II|Summon strong beast allies.
ABILITY_ANIMAL_SUMMONING_III_NAME|40|ability display name for Animal Summoning III|Animal Summoning III
ABILITY_ANIMAL_SUMMONING_III_SUMMARY||ability summary for Animal Summoning III|Calls one mighty beast or two strong beasts to fight beside the caster for 1 minute. Recasting replaces the previous animal summons.
ABILITY_ANIMAL_SUMMONING_III_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Animal Summoning III|Summon mighty beast allies.
ABILITY_FIRE_SEEDS_NAME|40|ability display name for Fire Seeds|Fire Seeds
ABILITY_FIRE_SEEDS_SUMMARY||ability summary for Fire Seeds|Scatters six fiery seeds in a 3x3 area. Seeds explode for 2d6+WIS fire damage when stepped on or after several turns. A successful DEX save halves the damage.
ABILITY_FIRE_SEEDS_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Fire Seeds|Six delayed fire seeds.
ABILITY_HARM_NAME|40|ability display name for Harm|Harm
ABILITY_HARM_SUMMARY||ability summary for Harm|Touches one living creature with devastating death magic. A failed CON save leaves ordinary creatures near death; bosses take heavy death damage instead.
ABILITY_HARM_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Harm|Touch; CON save or near death.
ABILITY_STONE_TELL_NAME|40|ability display name for Stone Tell|Stone Tell
ABILITY_STONE_TELL_SUMMARY||ability summary for Stone Tell|Listens to the dungeon stone, revealing nearby hidden doors, traps, secret rooms, and traces of creatures that recently passed.
ABILITY_STONE_TELL_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Stone Tell|Stone reveals nearby secrets.
ABILITY_CREATE_FOOD_AND_WATER_NAME|40|ability display name for Create Food and Water|Create Food and Water
ABILITY_CREATE_FOOD_AND_WATER_SUMMARY||ability summary for Create Food and Water|Channels for 5 turns, then conjures one bundle of rations and one waterskin into your pack.
ABILITY_CREATE_FOOD_AND_WATER_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Create Food and Water|Channel; create food and water.
ABILITY_FEAR_NAME|40|ability display name for Fear|Fear
ABILITY_FEAR_SUMMARY||ability summary for Fear|Fills the target with magical terror. A successful WIS save negates the spell.
ABILITY_FEAR_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Fear|Magical terror; WIS negates.
ABILITY_CHARM_PERSON_NAME|40|ability display name for Charm Person|Charm Person
ABILITY_CHARM_PERSON_SUMMARY||ability summary for Charm Person|Charms a humanoid target into fighting temporarily for you. A successful WIS save negates the spell. Directly attacking it breaks the charm.
ABILITY_CHARM_PERSON_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Charm Person|Temporary humanoid ally; WIS negates.
ABILITY_CHARM_MONSTER_NAME|40|ability display name for Charm Monster|Charm Monster
ABILITY_CHARM_MONSTER_SUMMARY||ability summary for Charm Monster|Charms a monster into fighting temporarily for you. A successful WIS save negates the spell. Directly attacking it breaks the charm.
ABILITY_CHARM_MONSTER_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Charm Monster|Temporary monster ally; WIS negates.
ABILITY_POLYMORPH_OTHER_NAME|40|ability display name for Polymorph Other|Polymorph Other
ABILITY_POLYMORPH_OTHER_SUMMARY||ability summary for Polymorph Other|Transforms a target into a weaker mundane creature. A successful CON save negates the spell.
ABILITY_POLYMORPH_OTHER_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Polymorph Other|Transform target; CON negates.
ABILITY_CURE_DISEASE_NAME|40|ability display name for Cure Disease|Cure Disease
ABILITY_CURE_DISEASE_SUMMARY||ability summary for Cure Disease|Cures disease completely.
ABILITY_CURE_DISEASE_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Cure Disease|Clear disease.
ABILITY_CONTAGION_NAME|40|ability display name for Contagion|Contagion
ABILITY_CONTAGION_SUMMARY||ability summary for Contagion|Afflicts the target with disease. A successful CON save negates the spell.
ABILITY_CONTAGION_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Contagion|Disease; CON negates.
ABILITY_SLAY_LIVING_NAME|40|ability display name for Slay Living|Slay Living
ABILITY_SLAY_LIVING_SUMMARY||ability summary for Slay Living|Touches one living creature with heavy death magic. A successful CON save halves the damage; badly wounded targets may die outright on a failed save.
ABILITY_SLAY_LIVING_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short ability summary for Slay Living|Touch death magic; CON half.
