CLASS_FIGHTER_NAME|24|class display name for Fighter|Fighter
CLASS_FEATURE_BATTLE_HARDENED_NAME|48|class feature display name for Battle-Hardened|Battle-Hardened
CLASS_FEATURE_BATTLE_HARDENED_SUMMARY||class feature summary for Battle-Hardened|Recover HP faster and gain +1 ATK and +1 DEF.
CLASS_FEATURE_BATTLE_HARDENED_SHORT_SUMMARY|128|short class feature summary for Battle-Hardened|Recover HP faster and gain +1 ATK and +1 DEF.
CLASS_FEATURE_WEAPON_SPECIALIZATION_NAME|48|class feature display name for Weapon Specialization|Weapon Specialization
CLASS_FEATURE_WEAPON_SPECIALIZATION_SUMMARY||class feature summary for Weapon Specialization|Choose Specialist for +1 rank, +1 ATK, +1 DMG, and faster training with one weapon group, or Generalist for +1 ATK and +1 DMG with all fighter weapon groups.
CLASS_FEATURE_WEAPON_SPECIALIZATION_SHORT_SUMMARY|128|short class feature summary for Weapon Specialization|Choose Specialist for +1 rank in one trained group, or Generalist for all fighter weapons.
CLASS_FEATURE_CLEAVE_NAME|48|class feature display name for Cleave|Cleave
CLASS_FEATURE_CLEAVE_SUMMARY||class feature summary for Cleave|Once per melee action, killing a foe grants one extra attack against an adjacent enemy.
CLASS_FEATURE_CLEAVE_SHORT_SUMMARY|128|short class feature summary for Cleave|Once per melee action, killing a foe grants one extra attack against an adjacent enemy.
CLASS_FEATURE_HOLD_THE_LINE_NAME|48|class feature display name for Hold the Line|Hold the Line
CLASS_FEATURE_HOLD_THE_LINE_SUMMARY||class feature summary for Hold the Line|Gain +1 DEF and +5 ARM.
CLASS_FEATURE_HOLD_THE_LINE_SHORT_SUMMARY|128|short class feature summary for Hold the Line|Gain +1 DEF and +5 ARM.
CLASS_FEATURE_FINISHER_NAME|48|class feature display name for Finisher|Finisher
CLASS_FEATURE_FINISHER_SUMMARY||class feature summary for Finisher|Deal +2 DMG against wounded enemies.
CLASS_FEATURE_FINISHER_SHORT_SUMMARY|128|short class feature summary for Finisher|Deal +2 DMG against wounded enemies.
CLASS_FEATURE_WEAPON_MASTERY_NAME|48|class feature display name for Weapon Mastery|Weapon Mastery
CLASS_FEATURE_WEAPON_MASTERY_SUMMARY||class feature summary for Weapon Mastery|Specialists improve to +3 ATK, +3 DMG, and +1 PEN with their chosen group. Generalists improve to +2 ATK and +2 DMG with all fighter weapon groups.
CLASS_FEATURE_WEAPON_MASTERY_SHORT_SUMMARY|128|short class feature summary for Weapon Mastery|Specialist +3 ATK/DMG and +1 PEN; Generalist +2 ATK/DMG.
CLASS_FEATURE_RELENTLESS_NAME|48|class feature display name for Relentless|Relentless
CLASS_FEATURE_RELENTLESS_SUMMARY||class feature summary for Relentless|Each melee miss stacks +2 ATK on the next swing this action until you hit.
CLASS_FEATURE_RELENTLESS_SHORT_SUMMARY|128|short class feature summary for Relentless|Each melee miss stacks +2 ATK on the next swing this action until you hit.
CLASS_FEATURE_VETERAN_DRILL_NAME|48|class feature display name for Veteran Drill|Veteran Drill
CLASS_FEATURE_VETERAN_DRILL_SUMMARY||class feature summary for Veteran Drill|Gain +1 ATK and +1 DEF.
CLASS_FEATURE_VETERAN_DRILL_SHORT_SUMMARY|128|short class feature summary for Veteran Drill|Gain +1 ATK and +1 DEF.
CLASS_FEATURE_HEROIC_RESOLVE_NAME|48|class feature display name for Heroic Resolve|Heroic Resolve
CLASS_FEATURE_HEROIC_RESOLVE_SUMMARY||class feature summary for Heroic Resolve|At or below half HP, gain +1 ATK, +1 DEF, +10 ARM, and +1 DMG.
CLASS_FEATURE_HEROIC_RESOLVE_SHORT_SUMMARY|128|short class feature summary for Heroic Resolve|At or below half HP, gain +1 ATK, +1 DEF, +10 ARM, and +1 DMG.
CLASS_FEATURE_GRAND_WEAPON_MASTERY_NAME|48|class feature display name for Grand Weapon Mastery|Grand Weapon Mastery
CLASS_FEATURE_GRAND_WEAPON_MASTERY_SUMMARY||class feature summary for Grand Weapon Mastery|Specialists improve to +5 ATK, +5 DMG, and +2 PEN with their chosen group. Generalists improve to +3 ATK, +3 DMG, and +1 PEN with all fighter weapon groups.
CLASS_FEATURE_GRAND_WEAPON_MASTERY_SHORT_SUMMARY|128|short class feature summary for Grand Weapon Mastery|Specialist +5 ATK/DMG and +2 PEN; Generalist +3 ATK/DMG and +1 PEN.
CLASS_CLERIC_NAME|24|class display name for Cleric|Cleric
CLASS_FEATURE_FAITHFUL_DEFENDER_NAME|48|class feature display name for Faithful Defender|Faithful Defender
CLASS_FEATURE_FAITHFUL_DEFENDER_SUMMARY||class feature summary for Faithful Defender|Piety regenerates faster. While using a shield, gain +1 DEF and +3 ARM.
CLASS_FEATURE_FAITHFUL_DEFENDER_SHORT_SUMMARY|128|short class feature summary for Faithful Defender|Piety regenerates faster. While using a shield, gain +1 DEF and +3 ARM.
CLASS_FEATURE_BATTLE_BLESSING_NAME|48|class feature display name for Battle Blessing|Battle Blessing
