CLASS_FEATURE_MONK_TRAINING_NAME|48|class feature display name for Monk Training|Monk Training
CLASS_FEATURE_MONK_TRAINING_SUMMARY||class feature summary for Monk Training|Monk attacks are unarmed or quarterstaff attacks. Unarmed attacks use DEX for ATK and STR for DMG, and their damage die improves at LV 1/5/9/13/17. A successful Monk attack each turn adds 1 Combo; other turns remove 1. Each Combo grants +1 ATK with Monk attacks and +1 DEF. Unarmed attacks per action improve at LV 1/5/10/15/20; quarterstaves make one fewer attack, and other weapons make one. A shield disables Combo and Monk actions. Enhanced Kick can leap across one clear tile to kick a target two tiles away.
CLASS_FEATURE_MONK_TRAINING_SHORT_SUMMARY|128|short class feature summary for Monk Training|Gain Combo, Monk attacks, and Enhanced Kick.
CLASS_FEATURE_IRON_BODY_NAME|48|class feature display name for Iron Body|Iron Body
CLASS_FEATURE_IRON_BODY_SUMMARY||class feature summary for Iron Body|Gain 2 x (1 + LV/4) ARM. No burden grants the full bonus, light grants 75%, medium grants 50%, and heavy grants none.
CLASS_FEATURE_IRON_BODY_SHORT_SUMMARY|128|short class feature summary for Iron Body|Gain ARM based on level and armor burden.
CLASS_FEATURE_FLEET_FOOTED_NAME|48|class feature display name for Fleet-Footed|Fleet-Footed
CLASS_FEATURE_FLEET_FOOTED_SUMMARY||class feature summary for Fleet-Footed|Take no falling damage and gain +2 on saves against being knocked prone, knocked back, entangled, or similarly restrained.
CLASS_FEATURE_FLEET_FOOTED_SHORT_SUMMARY|128|short class feature summary for Fleet-Footed|Ignore falling damage and resist forced movement and restraints.
CLASS_FEATURE_TEMPERED_STRIKES_NAME|48|class feature display name for Tempered Strikes|Tempered Strikes
