CLASS_ACTION_KICK_NAME|36|class action display name for Kick|Kick
CLASS_ACTION_KICK_SUMMARY||class action summary for Kick|Kick an adjacent tile. Monsters usually take 1d3 + LV/4 damage, or 1d2 + LV/4 when you are below 15 HP.
CLASS_ACTION_KICK_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short class action summary for Kick|Kick an adjacent target or object; can shove monsters back.
CLASS_ACTION_BULL_RUSH_NAME|36|class action display name for Bull Rush|Bull Rush
CLASS_ACTION_BULL_RUSH_SUMMARY||class action summary for Bull Rush|Move up to 3 tiles in a chosen direction, or bull rush the first enemy in that path with +1 ATK and +1 + equipped weight/20 DMG. On hit, drive the target back 1 tile; blocked shoves deal 2 + LV/2 collision damage and stun for 1 turn.
CLASS_ACTION_BULL_RUSH_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short class action summary for Bull Rush|Move up to 3 tiles, or rush the first enemy in that path.
CLASS_ACTION_CALLED_STRIKE_NAME|36|class action display name for Called Strike|Called Strike
CLASS_ACTION_CALLED_STRIKE_SUMMARY||class action summary for Called Strike|Make 1 melee attack that cannot miss. Base melee damage is doubled, then add LV DMG.
CLASS_ACTION_CALLED_STRIKE_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short class action summary for Called Strike|Never miss one enemy; deal 2x base melee damage + LV DMG.
CLASS_ACTION_WHIRLWIND_NAME|36|class action display name for Whirlwind|Whirlwind
CLASS_ACTION_WHIRLWIND_SUMMARY||class action summary for Whirlwind|Make 2 regular melee attacks against each adjacent enemy.
CLASS_ACTION_WHIRLWIND_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short class action summary for Whirlwind|Make 2 melee attacks against every adjacent enemy.
CLASS_ACTION_SECOND_WIND_NAME|36|class action display name for Second Wind|Second Wind
CLASS_ACTION_SECOND_WIND_SUMMARY||class action summary for Second Wind|Fully heal and stop bleeding.
CLASS_ACTION_SECOND_WIND_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short class action summary for Second Wind|Fully heal and stop bleeding.
CLASS_ACTION_DOUBLE_SHOT_NAME|36|class action display name for Double Shot|Double Shot
CLASS_ACTION_DOUBLE_SHOT_SUMMARY||class action summary for Double Shot|Make 2 ranged attacks at a chosen target. Each shot gains +2 ATK and +2 DMG.
CLASS_ACTION_DOUBLE_SHOT_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short class action summary for Double Shot|Fire two stronger shots at one target.
CLASS_ACTION_COMPANION_CALL_NAME|36|class action display name for Companion Call|Companion Call
CLASS_ACTION_COMPANION_CALL_SUMMARY||class action summary for Companion Call|Summon or dismiss your bonded animal companion. Dismissal takes 1 minute to recover from; defeat takes 20 minutes.
CLASS_ACTION_COMPANION_CALL_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short class action summary for Companion Call|Summon or dismiss your bonded animal companion.
CLASS_ACTION_TRIPLE_SHOT_NAME|36|class action display name for Triple Shot|Triple Shot
CLASS_ACTION_TRIPLE_SHOT_SUMMARY||class action summary for Triple Shot|Make 3 ranged attacks at a chosen target. Each shot gains +2 ATK and +2 DMG.
CLASS_ACTION_TRIPLE_SHOT_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short class action summary for Triple Shot|Fire three stronger shots at one target.
