CLASS_ACTION_BEAST_CALL_SUMMARY||obsolete class action summary for Beast Call kept for locale overlay compatibility|Summon 1d3 temporary beast allies for 18 + LV/2 turns. Beasts scale from wild dogs and wolves to bears and wargs.
CLASS_ACTION_BEAST_CALL_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|obsolete short class action summary for Beast Call kept for locale overlay compatibility|Summon 1d3 temporary beast allies for 18 + LV/2 turns.
