CLASS_ACTION_PINNING_STRIKE_SUMMARY||class action summary for Pinning Strike|Make 1 ranged attack with +6 ATK and +2 DMG. On hit, pin the target in place.
CLASS_ACTION_PINNING_STRIKE_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short class action summary for Pinning Strike|Shoot one enemy and pin it in place on hit.
CLASS_ACTION_HUNTMASTER_S_MARK_NAME|36|class action display name for Huntmaster's Mark|Huntmaster's Mark
CLASS_ACTION_HUNTMASTER_S_MARK_SUMMARY||class action summary for Huntmaster's Mark|Mark 1 visible enemy for 24 + LV/2 turns. Gain +4 ATK, +5 DMG, and +2 CRT against it.
CLASS_ACTION_HUNTMASTER_S_MARK_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short class action summary for Huntmaster's Mark|Mark one enemy for +4 ATK, +5 DMG, and +2 CRT.
CLASS_ACTION_SMITE_FOE_NAME|36|class action display name for Smite Foe|Smite Foe
CLASS_ACTION_SMITE_FOE_SUMMARY||class action summary for Smite Foe|Make 1 melee attack with +3 ATK and +(8 + LV/2 + CHA mod) holy damage. Holy damage is doubled against undead.
CLASS_ACTION_SMITE_FOE_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short class action summary for Smite Foe|Strike one enemy with extra holy damage.
CLASS_ACTION_LAY_ON_HANDS_NAME|36|class action display name for Lay on Hands|Lay on Hands
CLASS_ACTION_LAY_ON_HANDS_SUMMARY||class action summary for Lay on Hands|Heal 8-14 + 2xLV + 2xCHA mod HP and stop bleeding.
CLASS_ACTION_LAY_ON_HANDS_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short class action summary for Lay on Hands|Heal yourself and stop bleeding.
CLASS_ACTION_DEVOTION_AURA_NAME|36|class action display name for Devotion Aura|Devotion Aura
CLASS_ACTION_DEVOTION_AURA_SUMMARY||class action summary for Devotion Aura|Gain +CHA mod DEF and +2x CHA mod ARM for 10 + LV turns.
CLASS_ACTION_DEVOTION_AURA_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short class action summary for Devotion Aura|Raise defense and armor for a short time.
CLASS_ACTION_FINAL_STAND_NAME|36|class action display name for Final Stand|Final Stand
CLASS_ACTION_FINAL_STAND_SUMMARY||class action summary for Final Stand|For 6 + LV/5 turns, reflect half incoming monster damage as holy damage. Your melee hits also deal +2d8 holy damage.
CLASS_ACTION_FINAL_STAND_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short class action summary for Final Stand|Reflect half monster damage and add +2d8 holy melee damage.
CLASS_ACTION_DISTRACT_NAME|36|class action display name for Distract|Distract
CLASS_ACTION_DISTRACT_SUMMARY||class action summary for Distract|Blind 1 adjacent enemy for 3 turns. This never misses.
CLASS_ACTION_DISTRACT_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short class action summary for Distract|Blind 1 adjacent enemy for 3 turns.
CLASS_ACTION_POISON_WEAPON_NAME|36|class action display name for Poison Weapon|Poison Weapon
CLASS_ACTION_POISON_WEAPON_SUMMARY||class action summary for Poison Weapon|Coat your main-hand weapon with normal poison for the next 3 successful main-hand hits. Misses do not spend poison.
CLASS_ACTION_POISON_WEAPON_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short class action summary for Poison Weapon|Poison your main-hand weapon for the next few hits.
CLASS_ACTION_TUMBLE_NAME|36|class action display name for Tumble|Tumble
CLASS_ACTION_TUMBLE_SUMMARY||class action summary for Tumble|Move 1-3 tiles in a straight line, even through enemies.
CLASS_ACTION_TUMBLE_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short class action summary for Tumble|Move 1-3 tiles in a straight line, even through enemies.
CLASS_ACTION_SHADOW_RUSH_NAME|36|class action display name for Shadow Rush|Shadow Rush
CLASS_ACTION_SHADOW_RUSH_SUMMARY||class action summary for Shadow Rush|Become invisible and take two actions before the world moves.
CLASS_ACTION_SHADOW_RUSH_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short class action summary for Shadow Rush|Become invisible and take two free actions.
CLASS_ACTION_MANA_CHANNEL_NAME|36|class action display name for Mana Channel|Mana Channel
CLASS_ACTION_MANA_CHANNEL_SUMMARY||class action summary for Mana Channel|Channel 3 turns. Recover 2xLV + 2xINT mod MP. Hits break the channel.
CLASS_ACTION_MANA_CHANNEL_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short class action summary for Mana Channel|Channel in place to recover MP; damage interrupts it.
CLASS_ACTION_MAGIC_SENSE_NAME|36|class action display name for Magic Sense|Magic Sense
CLASS_ACTION_MAGIC_SENSE_SUMMARY||class action summary for Magic Sense|Channel outward through nearby rooms. Each step reveals terrain, traps, and secret doors.
