CLASS_ACTION_SPELL_FOCUS_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short class action summary for Spell Focus|Channel briefly to empower your next arcane spell.
CLASS_ACTION_DOUBLE_CAST_NAME|36|class action display name for Double Cast|Double Cast
