CLASS_ACTION_DOUBLE_CAST_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short class action summary for Double Cast|Make your next spell echo twice for no extra MP.
CLASS_ACTION_MANA_BOMB_NAME|36|class action display name for Mana Bomb|Mana Bomb
