CLASS_ACTION_PRIMORDIAL_BEAM_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short class action summary for Primordial Beam|Channel a pure arcane beam.
CLASS_ACTION_UNSEAL_NAME|36|class action display name for Unseal|Unseal
CLASS_ACTION_UNSEAL_SUMMARY||class action summary for Unseal|For 5 + LV turns, burn MP each turn for stronger arcane spells.
CLASS_ACTION_UNSEAL_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short class action summary for Unseal|Burn MP each turn to strengthen arcane spells.
CLASS_ACTION_OPEN_SEAL_NAME|36|class action display name for Open Seal|Open Seal
CLASS_ACTION_OPEN_SEAL_SUMMARY||class action summary for Open Seal|For 20 turns, arcane power and attributes rise each turn, then hunger and exhaustion strike.
CLASS_ACTION_OPEN_SEAL_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short class action summary for Open Seal|Ramp attributes and spell power for 20 turns, then suffer recoil.
CLASS_ACTION_FULL_UNSEALING_NAME|36|class action display name for Full Unsealing|Full Unsealing
CLASS_ACTION_FULL_UNSEALING_SUMMARY||class action summary for Full Unsealing|For a short time, spells are free and nearby enemies take pure magic damage each turn, then severe recoil follows.
CLASS_ACTION_FULL_UNSEALING_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short class action summary for Full Unsealing|Cast free spells while nearby foes burn, then suffer severe recoil.
CLASS_ACTION_HEALING_AURA_NAME|36|class action display name for Healing Aura|Healing Aura
CLASS_ACTION_HEALING_AURA_SUMMARY||class action summary for Healing Aura|Create a healing aura on your tile for 6 turns. While you stand on that tile, heal 2 + LV/4 HP per turn.
CLASS_ACTION_HEALING_AURA_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short class action summary for Healing Aura|Heal 2 + LV/4 HP per turn while standing on the aura tile for 6 turns.
CLASS_ACTION_TURN_UNDEAD_NAME|36|class action display name for Turn Undead|Turn Undead
CLASS_ACTION_TURN_UNDEAD_SUMMARY||class action summary for Turn Undead|Undead within 3 tiles take 1d6 + LV holy damage, gain holyfire (4/turn for 3 turns), and are stunned for 1 turn.
CLASS_ACTION_TURN_UNDEAD_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short class action summary for Turn Undead|Burn and stun nearby undead.
CLASS_ACTION_HAMMER_OF_THE_GODS_NAME|36|class action display name for Hammer of the Gods|Hammer of the Gods
CLASS_ACTION_HAMMER_OF_THE_GODS_SUMMARY||class action summary for Hammer of the Gods|Channel 1 turn. A giant divine hammer strikes a 3x3 area within 8 tiles for 3d8 + LV crushing damage with 20 PEN. Hits break the prayer.
CLASS_ACTION_HAMMER_OF_THE_GODS_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short class action summary for Hammer of the Gods|Call one giant divine hammer down on a target area.
CLASS_ACTION_DIVINE_SHIELD_NAME|36|class action display name for Divine Shield|Divine Shield
CLASS_ACTION_DIVINE_SHIELD_SUMMARY||class action summary for Divine Shield|Gain invulnerability for 4 + LV/6 turns.
CLASS_ACTION_DIVINE_SHIELD_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short class action summary for Divine Shield|Become invulnerable for a short time.
CLASS_ACTION_CANCEL_WILD_SHAPE_NAME|36|class action display name for Cancel Wild Shape|Cancel Wild Shape
CLASS_ACTION_CANCEL_WILD_SHAPE_SUMMARY||class action summary for Cancel Wild Shape|Return to your normal form.
CLASS_ACTION_CANCEL_WILD_SHAPE_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short class action summary for Cancel Wild Shape|Return to your normal form.
CLASS_ACTION_WILD_SHAPE_NAME|36|class action display name for Wild Shape|Wild Shape
CLASS_ACTION_WILD_SHAPE_SUMMARY||class action summary for Wild Shape|Take wolf form from L1, bear form from L7, or treant form from L15 for 20 + 2xLV turns. Forms use separate HP, attributes, DEF/ARM, and natural attacks: wolf 2x1d6, bear 2x1d8, treant 3x1d12. Natural attacks also gain +LV/6 DMG (max +3) and +LV/8 PEN (max +2).
CLASS_ACTION_WILD_SHAPE_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short class action summary for Wild Shape|Take animal or treant form with separate HP and attacks.
CLASS_ACTION_WRITHING_BRIARS_NAME|36|class action display name for Writhing Briars|Writhing Briars
CLASS_ACTION_WRITHING_BRIARS_SUMMARY||class action summary for Writhing Briars|Lash a 3x3 area within 6 tiles with thorned roots for 30 turns. Briars deal 1 damage per turn and require Athletics to move through.
CLASS_ACTION_WRITHING_BRIARS_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short class action summary for Writhing Briars|Fill a target area with thorned roots that hurt and slow movement.
CLASS_ACTION_STORMCALL_NAME|36|class action display name for Stormcall|Stormcall
CLASS_ACTION_STORMCALL_SUMMARY||class action summary for Stormcall|For 1 minute, lightning strikes a nearby enemy every 3 turns. Damage doubles outdoors.
CLASS_ACTION_STORMCALL_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short class action summary for Stormcall|Call lightning onto nearby enemies for one minute.
CLASS_ACTION_FOREST_DRAGON_SHAPE_NAME|36|class action display name for Forest Dragon Shape|Forest Dragon Shape
CLASS_ACTION_FOREST_DRAGON_SHAPE_SUMMARY||class action summary for Forest Dragon Shape|Take forest dragon form for 10 + LV/2 turns (20 turns at L20), with separate HP, attributes, DEF/ARM, 3x1d12 natural attacks, and a breath weapon. Natural attacks also gain +LV/6 DMG (max +3) and +LV/8 PEN (max +2).
CLASS_ACTION_FOREST_DRAGON_SHAPE_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short class action summary for Forest Dragon Shape|Take forest dragon form with separate HP and breath.
CLASS_ACTION_FOREST_DRAGON_BREATH_NAME|36|class action display name for Forest Dragon Breath|Forest Dragon Breath
CLASS_ACTION_FOREST_DRAGON_BREATH_SUMMARY||class action summary for Forest Dragon Breath|Breathe crushing wind at a chosen target while in forest dragon form.
CLASS_ACTION_FOREST_DRAGON_BREATH_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short class action summary for Forest Dragon Breath|Breathe crushing wind at one target.
CLASS_ACTION_PLAY_SONG_NAME|36|class action display name for Play Song|Play Song
CLASS_ACTION_PLAY_SONG_SUMMARY||class action summary for Play Song|Choose or change your active song. Song Strength is 1 + LV/4 + positive CHA modifier; songs use half strength, rounded down to at least +1. Changing songs costs one turn and preserves Crescendo.
CLASS_ACTION_PLAY_SONG_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short class action summary for Play Song|Choose or change your active song.
CLASS_ACTION_CRESCENDO_NAME|36|class action display name for Crescendo|Crescendo
CLASS_ACTION_CRESCENDO_SUMMARY||class action summary for Crescendo|Use full Song Strength for 3 + LV/4 turns. Recovery falls from 10 minutes at level 1 to 2 minutes at level 20.
CLASS_ACTION_CRESCENDO_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short class action summary for Crescendo|Use full Song Strength for 3 + LV/4 turns.
CLASS_ACTION_BATTLE_RAGE_NAME|36|class action display name for Battle Rage|Battle Rage
CLASS_ACTION_BATTLE_RAGE_SUMMARY||class action summary for Battle Rage|Gain 5 + LV/4 Rage. Recovers after one hour or a full rest.
CLASS_ACTION_BATTLE_RAGE_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short class action summary for Battle Rage|Gain 5 + LV/4 Rage.
CLASS_ACTION_HURL_FOE_NAME|36|class action display name for Hurl Foe|Hurl Foe
CLASS_ACTION_HURL_FOE_SUMMARY||class action summary for Hurl Foe|Choose a straight line through an adjacent enemy. Make a STR roll against its level, then throw it up to 3 tiles. It and the first enemy struck take 2 + LV/2 + positive STR modifier damage.
CLASS_ACTION_HURL_FOE_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short class action summary for Hurl Foe|Throw an adjacent enemy 1-3 tiles along a chosen line.
CLASS_ACTION_RAMPAGE_NAME|36|class action display name for Rampage|Rampage
CLASS_ACTION_RAMPAGE_SUMMARY||class action summary for Rampage|For 5 turns, double Rage damage. Kills restore enemy LV/5 HP.
CLASS_ACTION_RAMPAGE_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short class action summary for Rampage|Double Rage damage for 5 turns and heal on kills.
CLASS_ACTION_UNDEFEATED_NAME|36|class action display name for Undefeated|Undefeated
CLASS_ACTION_UNDEFEATED_SUMMARY||class action summary for Undefeated|For 3 + positive CON modifier turns, HP cannot fall below 1, Rage does not fade, and prevented damage still adds Rage.
CLASS_ACTION_UNDEFEATED_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short class action summary for Undefeated|Refuse death and preserve Rage for 3 + CON modifier turns.
CLASS_ACTION_FLURRY_OF_BLOWS_NAME|36|class action display name for Flurry of Blows|Flurry of Blows
CLASS_ACTION_FLURRY_OF_BLOWS_SUMMARY||class action summary for Flurry of Blows|Make 1 + LV/4 extra Monk attacks at an enemy in a chosen adjacent direction.
CLASS_ACTION_FLURRY_OF_BLOWS_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short class action summary for Flurry of Blows|Make 1 + LV/4 extra Monk attacks.
CLASS_ACTION_STUNNING_FIST_NAME|36|class action display name for Stunning Fist|Stunning Fist
CLASS_ACTION_STUNNING_FIST_SUMMARY||class action summary for Stunning Fist|Attack an enemy in a chosen adjacent direction. Each hit adds +1 to the target's final CON save DC; failure stuns for 1 + hits/2 turns.
CLASS_ACTION_STUNNING_FIST_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short class action summary for Stunning Fist|Strike, then stun on a failed CON save.
CLASS_ACTION_MANTIS_FORM_NAME|36|class action display name for Mantis Form|Mantis Form
CLASS_ACTION_MANTIS_FORM_SUMMARY||class action summary for Mantis Form|Gain +4 DEF. Until you move, counter every missed melee attack with one Monk attack.
CLASS_ACTION_MANTIS_FORM_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short class action summary for Mantis Form|Gain +4 DEF and counter missed melee attacks until you move.
CLASS_ACTION_QUIVERING_PALM_NAME|36|class action display name for Quivering Palm|Quivering Palm
CLASS_ACTION_QUIVERING_PALM_SUMMARY||class action summary for Quivering Palm|Attack an enemy in a chosen adjacent direction. If any hit, the target makes a CON save against the action DC + hits. Failure kills; success deals heavy physical damage.
CLASS_ACTION_QUIVERING_PALM_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short class action summary for Quivering Palm|Strike, then force a CON save against death or heavy damage.
CLASS_ACTION_HEROIC_SOLO_NAME|36|class action display name for Heroic Solo|Heroic Solo
CLASS_ACTION_HEROIC_SOLO_SUMMARY||class action summary for Heroic Solo|For 12 turns, gain +(CHA mod + LV/4) ATK, DEF, and DMG. Each turn drains MP equal to that bonus.
CLASS_ACTION_HEROIC_SOLO_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short class action summary for Heroic Solo|Spend MP each turn for ATK, DEF, and DMG.
CLASS_ACTION_HEROIC_SOLO_NO_MANA|80|Heroic Solo failure message, placeholder 0 is required MP per turn|Heroic Solo needs at least {0:%d} MP.
CLASS_ACTION_HEROIC_SOLO_START|104|Heroic Solo start message, placeholders 0 bonus and MP drain, 1 turn count|Heroic Solo surges: +{0:%d} ATK, DEF, and DMG for {1:%d} turns, draining {0:%d} MP each turn.
CLASS_ACTION_ROAD_HOME_NAME|36|class action display name for Road Home|Road Home
CLASS_ACTION_ROAD_HOME_SUMMARY||class action summary for Road Home|Channel 5 turns. Return to the last inn or camp where you rested, falling back to Havenford if no rest site is known. Damage breaks the song.
CLASS_ACTION_ROAD_HOME_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short class action summary for Road Home|Channel briefly to return to your last rest site.
CLASS_ACTION_ROAD_HOME_BROKEN|72|Road Home interrupted message|The road-home song breaks.
CLASS_ACTION_ROAD_HOME_ARRIVE|88|Road Home arrival message, placeholder 0 is destination name|The road-home song carries you to {0}.
CLASS_ACTION_ROAD_HOME_FAIL|80|Road Home failure message when no destination can be resolved|The road-home song cannot find a path.
CLASS_ACTION_ENCORE_NAME|36|class action display name for Encore|Encore
CLASS_ACTION_ENCORE_SUMMARY||class action summary for Encore|Consume your current song for a grand finale. Each song has a different level 20 effect and a long recovery.
CLASS_ACTION_ENCORE_SHORT_SUMMARY|96|short class action summary for Encore|Spend your current song for a powerful finale.
CLASS_ACTION_GRAND_FINALE_NEEDS_SONG|72|Encore failure message when no bard song is active|Encore needs an active song.
CLASS_ACTION_GRAND_FINALE_NO_TARGETS|72|Encore failure message when no visible target is available|Encore needs a visible enemy.
CLASS_ACTION_GRAND_FINALE_NO_DRAGONS|80|Wyrmslayer finale failure message when no visible dragon-type enemy is nearby|Encore needs a visible dragon-like enemy nearby.
CLASS_ACTION_GRAND_FINALE_TRAVELERS|96|Traveler's Tune Encore message, placeholders 0 HP restored, 1 MP restored|Encore restores {0:%d} HP and {1:%d} MP.
CLASS_ACTION_GRAND_FINALE_DRUMS_DAMAGE|96|Drums of War Encore damage message, placeholders 0 monster name, 1 damage|Encore hammers the {0} for {1:%d} force damage.
CLASS_ACTION_GRAND_FINALE_DRUMS_KILL|96|Drums of War Encore kill message, placeholders 0 monster name, 1 damage|Encore hammers the {0} for {1:%d} force damage and drops it.
CLASS_ACTION_GRAND_FINALE_WIZARD_DAMAGE|112|Wizard's Melody Encore damage message, placeholders 0 spell name, 1 monster name, 2 damage|Encore calls {0}; it hits the {1} for {2:%d} damage.
CLASS_ACTION_GRAND_FINALE_WIZARD_KILL|112|Wizard's Melody Encore kill message, placeholders 0 spell name, 1 monster name, 2 damage|Encore calls {0}; it destroys the {1} for {2:%d} damage.
CLASS_ACTION_GRAND_FINALE_COURAGE|96|Courage Refrain Encore ward message, placeholder 0 turn count|Encore raises a fearless ward for {0:%d} turns.
CLASS_ACTION_GRAND_FINALE_LUCKY|96|Lucky Lullaby Encore item message, placeholder 0 item name|Encore draws a lucky prize into your pack: {0}.
CLASS_ACTION_GRAND_FINALE_DREAD|96|Dread Requiem Encore fear message, placeholders 0 target count, 1 turn count|Encore terrifies {0:%d} enemies for {1:%d} turns.
CLASS_ACTION_GRAND_FINALE_WYRMSLAYER_DAMAGE|104|Wyrmslayer Encore damage message, placeholders 0 monster name, 1 damage|Encore tears into the {0}'s draconic blood for {1:%d} damage.
CLASS_ACTION_GRAND_FINALE_WYRMSLAYER_KILL|104|Wyrmslayer Encore kill message, placeholders 0 monster name, 1 damage|Encore tears the {0}'s draconic blood apart for {1:%d} damage.
BARD_SONG_TRAVELERS_TUNE_NAME|48|bard song display name|Traveler's Tune
BARD_SONG_TRAVELERS_TUNE_SUMMARY||bard song summary|Improves DEF and HP/MP recovery.
BARD_SONG_TRAVELERS_TUNE_SHORT_SUMMARY|128|bard song short summary|Improves DEF and recovery.
BARD_SONG_DRUMS_OF_WAR_NAME|48|bard song display name|Drums of War
BARD_SONG_DRUMS_OF_WAR_SUMMARY||bard song summary|Improves ATK and DMG.
BARD_SONG_DRUMS_OF_WAR_SHORT_SUMMARY|128|bard song short summary|Improves ATK and DMG.
BARD_SONG_WIZARDS_MELODY_NAME|48|bard song display name|Wizard's Melody
BARD_SONG_WIZARDS_MELODY_SUMMARY||bard song summary|Improves Arcana and Lore checks, plus bard arcane spell DC and damage.
BARD_SONG_WIZARDS_MELODY_SHORT_SUMMARY|128|bard song short summary|Improves Arcana, Lore, and bard spell power.
BARD_SONG_COURAGE_REFRAIN_NAME|48|bard song display name|Courage Refrain
BARD_SONG_COURAGE_REFRAIN_SUMMARY||bard song summary|Improves Wisdom saves against fear, charm, confusion, sleep, silence, and dragon presence.
BARD_SONG_COURAGE_REFRAIN_SHORT_SUMMARY|128|bard song short summary|Improves saves against mental effects.
BARD_SONG_LUCKY_LULLABY_NAME|48|bard song display name|Lucky Lullaby
BARD_SONG_LUCKY_LULLABY_SUMMARY||bard song summary|Improves Luck on visible rolls.
BARD_SONG_LUCKY_LULLABY_SHORT_SUMMARY|128|bard song short summary|Improves Luck on visible rolls.
BARD_SONG_DREAD_REQUIEM_NAME|48|bard song display name|Dread Requiem
BARD_SONG_DREAD_REQUIEM_SUMMARY||bard song summary|Improves bard fear and pressure DCs.
BARD_SONG_DREAD_REQUIEM_SHORT_SUMMARY|128|bard song short summary|Improves bard fear DCs.
BARD_SONG_WYRMSLAYERS_BALLAD_NAME|48|bard song display name|Wyrmslayer's Ballad
BARD_SONG_WYRMSLAYERS_BALLAD_SUMMARY||bard song summary|Improves all attributes and saving throws.
BARD_SONG_WYRMSLAYERS_BALLAD_SHORT_SUMMARY|128|bard song short summary|Improves all attributes and saves.
CLASS_ACTION_TARGETING_NONE_NAME|20|class action targeting display name|None
CLASS_ACTION_TARGETING_SELF_NAME|20|class action targeting display name|Self
CLASS_ACTION_TARGETING_ENEMY_NAME|20|class action targeting display name|Enemy
CLASS_ACTION_TARGETING_TILE_NAME|20|class action targeting display name|Tile
ITEM_RUSTY_KNIFE_NAME|64|item display name for Rusty Knife|rusty knife
ITEM_RUSTY_KNIFE_DESC||item description for Rusty Knife|A cheap knife with a spotted blade and rough wooden grip. It is a small piercing weapon in poor condition.
ITEM_CLUB_NAME|64|item display name for Club|club
ITEM_CLUB_DESC||item description for Club|A hardwood cudgel cut from a knotty limb. It is a simple bludgeoning weapon for close fighting.
ITEM_DAGGER_NAME|64|item display name for Dagger|dagger
ITEM_DAGGER_DESC||item description for Dagger|A narrow fighting dagger balanced for one hand. It is easy to carry and suited to quick piercing strikes.
ITEM_HAND_AXE_NAME|64|item display name for Hand Axe|hand axe
ITEM_HAND_AXE_DESC||item description for Hand Axe|A single-bladed camp axe light enough for one hand. It can be used as a light slashing weapon.
ITEM_BATTLE_AXE_NAME|64|item display name for Battle Axe|battle axe
ITEM_BATTLE_AXE_DESC||item description for Battle Axe|A broad war axe with a heavy beard and strong haft. It is built for heavy slashing blows.
ITEM_MACE_NAME|64|item display name for Mace|mace
ITEM_MACE_DESC||item description for Mace|A flanged iron mace with a short grip. It is made for crushing armor and bone with blunt force.
ITEM_MORNING_STAR_NAME|64|item display name for Morning Star|morning star
ITEM_MORNING_STAR_DESC||item description for Morning Star|A spiked mace with a heavy head and short grip. It deals piercing damage through weight and sharp points.
ITEM_WAR_HAMMER_NAME|64|item display name for War Hammer|war hammer
ITEM_WAR_HAMMER_DESC||item description for War Hammer|A compact hammer with a square striking face and stiff haft. It is a bludgeoning weapon made for armored targets.
ITEM_FLAIL_NAME|64|item display name for Flail|flail
ITEM_FLAIL_DESC||item description for Flail|A weighted head on a short chain fixed to a grip. It is a bludgeoning weapon that needs room to swing.
ITEM_SPEAR_NAME|64|item display name for Spear|spear
ITEM_SPEAR_DESC||item description for Spear|A leaf-headed spear with a solid ash shaft, built for steady piercing thrusts.
ITEM_QUARTERSTAFF_NAME|64|item display name for Quarterstaff|quarterstaff
ITEM_QUARTERSTAFF_DESC||item description for Quarterstaff|A seasoned length of hardwood smoothed by use. It is a two-handed bludgeoning weapon that also gives +1 DEF.
ITEM_SHORT_SWORD_NAME|64|item display name for Short Sword|short sword
ITEM_SHORT_SWORD_DESC||item description for Short Sword|A compact soldier's blade for close fighting. It gives +1 ATK and deals piercing damage.
ITEM_LONGSWORD_NAME|64|item display name for Longsword|longsword
ITEM_LONGSWORD_DESC||item description for Longsword|A straight, double-edged blade with enough weight to cut and enough point to thrust.
ITEM_BASTARD_SWORD_NAME|64|item display name for Bastard Sword|bastard sword
ITEM_BASTARD_SWORD_DESC||item description for Bastard Sword|A long broad blade with a grip sized for a strong one-handed cut or a braced two-handed stroke.
ITEM_TWO_HANDED_SWORD_NAME|64|item display name for Two-Handed Sword|two-handed sword
ITEM_TWO_HANDED_SWORD_DESC||item description for Two-Handed Sword|A great blade meant to be swung with both hands. It is a heavy two-handed slashing weapon.
ITEM_GREAT_AXE_NAME|64|item display name for Great Axe|great axe
ITEM_GREAT_AXE_DESC||item description for Great Axe|A long-hafted two-handed axe with a broad heavy blade. It is built for powerful slashing blows.
ITEM_SCIMITAR_NAME|64|item display name for Scimitar|scimitar
ITEM_SCIMITAR_DESC||item description for Scimitar|A curved saber made for fast sweeping cuts. It is a light one-handed slashing weapon.
ITEM_FLAME_BLADE_NAME|64|item display name for Flame Blade|flame blade
ITEM_FLAME_BLADE_DESC||item description for Flame Blade|A sword-shaped blade of divine fire. It is sustained by spellcraft and vanishes when the spell ends.
ITEM_HALBERD_NAME|64|item display name for Halberd|halberd
ITEM_HALBERD_DESC||item description for Halberd|A polearm with axe blade, hook, and spear point on a long shaft. It is a two-handed reach weapon.
ITEM_SHORTBOW_NAME|64|item display name for Shortbow|shortbow
ITEM_SHORTBOW_DESC||item description for Shortbow|A compact hunting bow for arrows. It has shorter range than a longbow and is easier to carry in close terrain.
ITEM_LONGBOW_NAME|64|item display name for Longbow|longbow
ITEM_LONGBOW_DESC||item description for Longbow|A tall war bow of seasoned yew. It fires arrows farther and harder than a shortbow.
ITEM_LIGHT_CROSSBOW_NAME|64|item display name for Light Crossbow|light crossbow
ITEM_LIGHT_CROSSBOW_DESC||item description for Light Crossbow|A lever-drawn crossbow built for bolts. It is a two-handed ranged weapon with solid stopping power.
ITEM_HEAVY_CROSSBOW_NAME|64|item display name for Heavy Crossbow|heavy crossbow
ITEM_HEAVY_CROSSBOW_DESC||item description for Heavy Crossbow|A thick-limbed crossbow built for heavy bolts. It is a two-handed ranged weapon with high damage.
ITEM_SLING_NAME|64|item display name for Sling|sling
ITEM_SLING_DESC||item description for Sling|A leather sling and cord for throwing stones. It is a light ranged weapon with simple ammunition.
ITEM_THROWING_KNIFE_NAME|64|item display name for Throwing Knife|throwing knife
ITEM_THROWING_KNIFE_DESC||item description for Throwing Knife|A slim balanced knife weighted for throwing. It uses DEX to hit and STR for damage.
ITEM_THROWING_AXE_NAME|64|item display name for Throwing Axe|throwing axe
ITEM_THROWING_AXE_DESC||item description for Throwing Axe|A compact axe balanced for short throws. It uses DEX to hit and STR for damage.
ITEM_JAVELIN_NAME|64|item display name for Javelin|javelin
ITEM_JAVELIN_DESC||item description for Javelin|A light spear meant to be thrown. It uses DEX to hit and STR for damage.
ITEM_DART_NAME|64|item display name for Dart|dart
ITEM_DART_DESC||item description for Dart|A small weighted dart. It uses DEX to hit and STR for damage.
ITEM_THROWING_STONE_NAME|64|item display name for Throwing Stone|throwing stone
ITEM_THROWING_STONE_DESC||item description for Throwing Stone|A smooth stone chosen for throwing. It uses DEX to hit and STR for damage.
ITEM_ARROW_NAME|64|item display name for Arrow|arrow
ITEM_ARROW_DESC||item description for Arrow|A fletched arrow with a plain bodkin head, used as bow ammunition.
ITEM_BOLT_NAME|64|item display name for Bolt|bolt
ITEM_BOLT_DESC||item description for Bolt|A short heavy quarrel built as crossbow ammunition.
ITEM_SLING_STONE_NAME|64|item display name for Sling Stone|sling stone
ITEM_SLING_STONE_DESC||item description for Sling Stone|A smooth rounded stone chosen for sling ammunition.
ITEM_TRAVELER_S_CLOTHES_NAME|64|item display name for Traveler's Clothes|traveler's clothes
ITEM_TRAVELER_S_CLOTHES_DESC||item description for Traveler's Clothes|A plain shirt, worn coat, and patched trousers fit for road dust and indifferent weather. It offers no real armor protection.
ITEM_PADDED_ARMOR_NAME|64|item display name for Padded Armor|padded armor
ITEM_PADDED_ARMOR_DESC||item description for Padded Armor|Layers of stitched cloth and wool meant to blunt lighter blows. It is warm, bulky, and offers basic protection.
ITEM_LEATHER_ARMOR_NAME|64|item display name for Leather Armor|leather armor
ITEM_LEATHER_ARMOR_DESC||item description for Leather Armor|Toughened hide cut into a fitted harness and hardened by oil and use. It is light armor for close fighting.
ITEM_STUDDED_LEATHER_NAME|64|item display name for Studded Leather|studded leather
ITEM_STUDDED_LEATHER_DESC||item description for Studded Leather|A leather coat reinforced with rows of rivets and hidden plates. It protects better than plain leather.
ITEM_RING_MAIL_NAME|64|item display name for Ring Mail|ring mail
ITEM_RING_MAIL_DESC||item description for Ring Mail|A leather backing sewn with iron rings. It is old-fashioned, noisy, and protective against cuts.
ITEM_SCALE_MAIL_NAME|64|item display name for Scale Mail|scale mail
ITEM_SCALE_MAIL_DESC||item description for Scale Mail|Rows of overlapping metal scales stitched to a backing coat. It shines when clean and clatters when it is not.
ITEM_CHAIN_MAIL_NAME|64|item display name for Chain Mail|chain mail
ITEM_CHAIN_MAIL_DESC||item description for Chain Mail|A linked coat of riveted iron rings worn over padded cloth. It is the working armor of trained soldiery.
ITEM_SPLINT_MAIL_NAME|64|item display name for Splint Mail|splint mail
ITEM_SPLINT_MAIL_DESC||item description for Splint Mail|Vertical splints riveted over leather and mail, built to turn hard blows with rigid plates.
ITEM_PLATE_MAIL_NAME|64|item display name for Plate Mail|plate mail
ITEM_PLATE_MAIL_DESC||item description for Plate Mail|Articulated steel plates over mail and padding, expensive to forge and strong against weapon strikes.
ITEM_BUCKLER_NAME|64|item display name for Buckler|buckler
ITEM_BUCKLER_DESC||item description for Buckler|A small round shield quick to raise and easy to carry. It favors timing over brute coverage.
ITEM_WOODEN_SHIELD_NAME|64|item display name for Wooden Shield|wooden shield
ITEM_WOODEN_SHIELD_DESC||item description for Wooden Shield|A rimmed round shield of hardwood faced in leather. It gives basic hand-held protection.
ITEM_KITE_SHIELD_NAME|64|item display name for Kite Shield|kite shield
ITEM_KITE_SHIELD_DESC||item description for Kite Shield|A tall tapered shield built to cover shoulder, heart, and shin in one disciplined line.
ITEM_IRON_HELM_NAME|64|item display name for Iron Helm|iron helm
ITEM_IRON_HELM_DESC||item description for Iron Helm|A plain iron cap with cheek guards and a leather liner. It gives sturdy head protection.
ITEM_TRAVEL_CLOAK_NAME|64|item display name for Travel Cloak|travel cloak
ITEM_TRAVEL_CLOAK_DESC||item description for Travel Cloak|A heavy wool cloak with a broad hood and road stains at the hem. It gives light protection against rain and wind.
ITEM_LEATHER_BOOTS_NAME|64|item display name for Leather Boots|leather boots
ITEM_LEATHER_BOOTS_DESC||item description for Leather Boots|A pair of durable boots with hobnailed soles and a bit of flex left in the leather.
ITEM_IRON_BRACERS_NAME|64|item display name for Iron Bracers|iron bracers
ITEM_IRON_BRACERS_DESC||item description for Iron Bracers|Matched forearm guards strapped over leather backing. They catch glancing cuts.
ITEM_RATIONS_NAME|64|item display name for Rations|rations
ITEM_RATIONS_DESC||item description for Rations|A well-packed ration of dried meat, hard bread, and salted vegetables arranged for the road. Takes 3 turns to eat and is filling.
ITEM_CHEAP_RATIONS_NAME|64|item display name for Cheap Rations|cheap rations
ITEM_CHEAP_RATIONS_DESC||item description for Cheap Rations|A rough bag of edible scraps; old bread, hard biscuit, stale roots, and berries thrown together with little care. Takes 3 turns to eat and is moderately filling.
ITEM_TORCH_NAME|64|item display name for Torch|torch
ITEM_TORCH_DESC||item description for Torch|A pitch-wrapped torch cut from rough wood. When equipped, it lights automatically in dark areas and goes out in lit areas.
ITEM_LANTERN_NAME|64|item display name for Lantern|lantern
ITEM_LANTERN_DESC||item description for Lantern|A hooded travel lantern with a shuttered face and soot-blackened vents. Equip and light it to illuminate dark areas; refill it with oil flasks.
ITEM_WATCH_LANTERN_NAME|64|item display name for Watch Lantern|watch lantern
ITEM_WATCH_LANTERN_DESC||item description for Watch Lantern|A polished hooded lantern with a keen mirrored face. When lit, it gives normal lantern sight and burns longer than a common lantern between oil refills.
ITEM_SEEKER_LANTERN_NAME|64|item display name for Seeker Lantern|seeker lantern
ITEM_SEEKER_LANTERN_DESC||item description for Seeker Lantern|A runed lantern prized by scouts and delvers. While lit, its cold white flame gives +2 trap spotting.
ITEM_EVERBRIGHT_LANTERN_NAME|64|item display name for Everbright Lantern|everbright lantern
ITEM_EVERBRIGHT_LANTERN_DESC||item description for Everbright Lantern|A rare long-burning lantern with an enchanted wick and deep oil cup. It burns for 720 minutes between refills.
ITEM_OIL_FLASK_NAME|64|item display name for Oil Flask|oil flask
ITEM_OIL_FLASK_DESC||item description for Oil Flask|A stoppered flask of lamp oil. Use it to refill an equipped lantern, or throw it to splash flammable oil across a tile.
ITEM_ACID_FLASK_NAME|64|item display name for Acid Flask|acid flask
ITEM_ACID_FLASK_DESC||item description for Acid Flask|A sealed glass vial of biting acid wrapped in waxed cloth. It can clear webbing and revealed arrow traps, leave acid on open floor, or make an acid check to melt locks.
ITEM_STRONG_ACID_FLASK_NAME|64|item display name for Strong Acid Flask|strong acid flask
ITEM_STRONG_ACID_FLASK_DESC||item description for Strong Acid Flask|A reinforced glass vial of concentrated acid wrapped in waxed cloth. It gives +4 to acid checks when melting locks, and can damage chest contents.
ITEM_EDGE_PASTE_NAME|64|item display name for Edge Paste|edge paste
ITEM_EDGE_PASTE_DESC||item description for Edge Paste|A workmanlike abrasive paste for blades, spearheads, and other keen striking edges. It gives a slashing or piercing weapon +1 damage for 2 hours.
ITEM_HONING_COMPOUND_NAME|64|item display name for Honing Compound|honing compound
ITEM_HONING_COMPOUND_DESC||item description for Honing Compound|A finer compound of oil, grit, and blacking worked carefully into a sharp weapon. It gives a slashing or piercing weapon +1 ATK and +1 damage for 2 hours.
ITEM_LEATHER_DRESSING_NAME|64|item display name for Leather Dressing|leather dressing
ITEM_LEATHER_DRESSING_DESC||item description for Leather Dressing|A waxy dressing for cloth and leather worn gear. It gives +1 DEF for 2 hours while the treated gear is worn.
ITEM_HARDENING_PASTE_NAME|64|item display name for Hardening Paste|hardening paste
ITEM_HARDENING_PASTE_DESC||item description for Hardening Paste|A gritty polish for metal armor and metal-faced shields. It gives +2 ARM for 2 hours while the treated gear is worn.
ITEM_LESSER_POISON_NAME|64|item display name for Lesser Poison|lesser poison
ITEM_LESSER_POISON_DESC||item description for Lesser Poison|A thin grey weapon poison. It gives a weapon or missile weapon lesser poison for the next few hits.
ITEM_POISON_NAME|64|item display name for Poison|poison
ITEM_POISON_DESC||item description for Poison|A bitter green weapon poison. It gives a weapon or missile weapon poison for the next few hits.
ITEM_GREATER_POISON_NAME|64|item display name for Greater Poison|greater poison
ITEM_GREATER_POISON_DESC||item description for Greater Poison|A dark weapon poison with a sharp medicinal stink. It gives a weapon or missile weapon greater poison for the next few hits.
ITEM_OIL_OF_SHARPNESS_NAME|64|item display name for Oil of Sharpness|oil of sharpness
ITEM_OIL_OF_SHARPNESS_DESC||item description for Oil of Sharpness|A keen black oil for a weapon's edge or point. It gives a slashing or piercing weapon +2 damage for 60 minutes, wearing away with time and use.
ITEM_VENOM_OIL_NAME|64|item display name for Venom Oil|poison
ITEM_VENOM_OIL_DESC||item description for Venom Oil|A bitter green weapon poison. It gives a weapon or missile weapon poison for the next few hits.
ITEM_OIL_OF_SLIPPERINESS_NAME|64|item display name for Oil of Slipperiness|oil of slipperiness
ITEM_OIL_OF_SLIPPERINESS_DESC||item description for Oil of Slipperiness|A slick clear dressing for worn armor, clothing, or shields. It gives +2 DEF for 60 minutes while the treated gear is worn.
ITEM_PURIFYING_OIL_NAME|64|item display name for Purifying Oil|purifying oil
ITEM_PURIFYING_OIL_DESC||item description for Purifying Oil|A bright unbinding oil for gear, weapons, and artifacts. It removes a curse from one valid item when carefully worked into it.
ITEM_OIL_OF_CONSECRATION_NAME|64|item display name for Oil of Consecration|oil of consecration
ITEM_OIL_OF_CONSECRATION_DESC||item description for Oil of Consecration|A sanctified weapon oil. It adds 1d8 holy damage on weapon hits for 20 minutes.
ITEM_WEAK_OIL_OF_CONSECRATION_NAME|64|item display name for Weak Oil of Consecration|weak oil of consecration
ITEM_WEAK_OIL_OF_CONSECRATION_DESC||item description for Weak Oil of Consecration|A modest sanctified weapon oil. It adds 1d3 holy damage on weapon hits for 20 minutes.
ITEM_STRONG_OIL_OF_CONSECRATION_NAME|64|item display name for Strong Oil of Consecration|strong oil of consecration
ITEM_STRONG_OIL_OF_CONSECRATION_DESC||item description for Strong Oil of Consecration|A potent sanctified weapon oil. It adds 1d12 holy damage on weapon hits for 20 minutes.
ITEM_GREATER_OIL_OF_SHARPNESS_NAME|64|item display name for Greater Oil of Sharpness|greater oil of sharpness
ITEM_GREATER_OIL_OF_SHARPNESS_DESC||item description for Greater Oil of Sharpness|A potent edge-oil for slashing or piercing weapons. It gives +4 damage for 40 minutes, but the enchantment burns off quickly.
ITEM_BLACK_VENOM_OIL_NAME|64|item display name for Black Venom Oil|greater poison
ITEM_BLACK_VENOM_OIL_DESC||item description for Black Venom Oil|A dark weapon poison with a sharp medicinal stink. It gives a weapon or missile weapon greater poison for the next few hits.
ITEM_GREATER_OIL_OF_SLIPPERINESS_NAME|64|item display name for Greater Oil of Slipperiness|greater oil of slipperiness
ITEM_GREATER_OIL_OF_SLIPPERINESS_DESC||item description for Greater Oil of Slipperiness|A stronger slicking oil for worn armor, clothing, or shields. It gives +4 DEF for 40 minutes while the treated gear is worn.
ITEM_WATERSKIN_NAME|64|item display name for Waterskin|waterskin
ITEM_WATERSKIN_DESC||item description for Waterskin|A leather waterskin tied tight against dust and waste. Drink it for a little sustenance and slight dilution of poison or sickness, or throw it to douse a foe or wash acid and oil from a tile.
ITEM_BEER_NAME|64|item display name for Beer|beer
ITEM_BEER_DESC||item description for Beer|A chipped brown bottle of sour dock beer. Drink it for slight sustenance and drunkenness, or throw it to splash beer with a chance to make a monster drunk.
ITEM_BANDAGE_NAME|64|item display name for Bandage|bandage
ITEM_BANDAGE_DESC||item description for Bandage|A clean linen roll for stopping a fresh bleed before it gets worse. Using it takes 1 turn, stops bleeding, heals a fresh wound lightly, and repeats that healing over 5 minutes.
ITEM_OINTMENT_OF_PRESERVATION_NAME|64|item display name for Ointment of Preservation|ointment of preservation
ITEM_OINTMENT_OF_PRESERVATION_DESC||item description for Ointment of Preservation|A sealed clay jar of sharp-smelling ointment. Use it on a fresh corpse to keep it from rotting, or throw it at a monster to preserve the corpse if it dies.
ITEM_FIRST_AID_KIT_NAME|64|item display name for First Aid Kit|first aid kit
ITEM_FIRST_AID_KIT_DESC||item description for First Aid Kit|A proper first aid kit of pads, ties, and medicated packing. It takes 3 turns, heals 6 base HP, repeats that healing over 15 minutes, and loses about 20% durability per use.
ITEM_CHEAP_FIRST_AID_KIT_NAME|64|item display name for Cheap First Aid Kit|cheap first aid kit
ITEM_CHEAP_FIRST_AID_KIT_DESC||item description for Cheap First Aid Kit|A cheap first aid wrap of cloth pads, binding cord, and salvaged packing. It takes 3 turns, heals 4 base HP, repeats that healing over 15 minutes, and loses about 28% durability per use.
ITEM_PROFESSIONAL_FIRST_AID_KIT_NAME|64|item display name for Professional First Aid Kit|professional first aid kit
ITEM_PROFESSIONAL_FIRST_AID_KIT_DESC||item description for Professional First Aid Kit|A surgeon's first aid kit of clean pads, ties, and treated packing. It takes 3 turns, heals 8 base HP, repeats that healing over 15 minutes, and loses about 12% durability per use.
ITEM_LESSER_HEALING_POTION_NAME|64|item display name for Potion of Lesser Healing|potion of lesser healing
ITEM_LESSER_HEALING_POTION_DESC||item description for Lesser Healing Potion|A modest rose-red draught for minor wounds. Restores 1d8+1 HP and stops bleeding.
ITEM_POTION_OF_HEALING_NAME|64|item display name for Potion of Healing|potion of healing
ITEM_POTION_OF_HEALING_DESC||item description for Potion of Healing|A stoppered ruby draught compounded for serious wounds. Restores 2d8+2 HP and stops bleeding.
ITEM_ANTIDOTE_NAME|64|item display name for Antidote|antidote
ITEM_ANTIDOTE_DESC||item description for Antidote|A bitter field draught that weakens poison and sickness, reducing their remaining duration and save DC without fully curing either one.
ITEM_SPOILED_DRAUGHT_NAME|64|item display name for Spoiled Draught|spoiled draught
ITEM_SPOILED_DRAUGHT_DESC||item description for Spoiled Draught|A cloudy brew that never settled right. Drinking it does nothing useful and deals 1 damage if you have more than 1 HP.
ITEM_CHEAP_LOCKPICKS_NAME|64|item display name for Cheap Lockpicks|cheap lockpicks
ITEM_CHEAP_LOCKPICKS_DESC||item description for Cheap Lockpicks|A wrapped set of soft picks and bargain tension wires. They give -2 to lockpicking checks and wear quickly on bad failures.
ITEM_IRON_PITONS_NAME|64|item display name for Iron Pitons|iron pitons
ITEM_IRON_PITONS_DESC||item description for Iron Pitons|A handful of iron wedges for securing rope, making pit hand-holds, wedging revealed trap mechanisms, or prying doors and chest locks open.
ITEM_CALTROPS_NAME|64|item display name for Caltrops|caltrops
ITEM_CALTROPS_DESC||item description for Caltrops|A leather packet of sharp iron stars. Scatter them on adjacent ground; they stay until triggered three times. Failed DEX saves take damage and suffer -1 ATK/-1 DEF for that turn.
ITEM_NET_NAME|64|item display name for Net|net
ITEM_NET_DESC||item description for Net|A coarse throwing net with light lead knots. Throw it to force a DEX save; failure restrains a target for 3 turns and stuns it for 1 turn.
ITEM_BEAR_TRAP_NAME|64|item display name for Bear Trap|bear trap
ITEM_BEAR_TRAP_DESC||item description for Bear Trap|A brutal spring-jawed trap. It takes 2 turns to set, then deals 6-10 damage and stuns monsters for 1 turn when sprung.
ITEM_ROPE_NAME|64|item display name for Rope|rope
ITEM_ROPE_DESC||item description for Rope|A coil of hemp rope, stiff in places and frayed in others. Use it on adjacent pits to make crossings, climb out, or lash revealed pit traps safe.
ITEM_SIMPLE_HOLY_SYMBOL_NAME|64|item display name for Simple Holy Symbol|simple holy symbol
ITEM_SIMPLE_HOLY_SYMBOL_DESC||item description for Simple Holy Symbol|A simple holy emblem carried for ordinary field prayer.
ITEM_PLAIN_HOLY_SYMBOL_NAME|64|retired item display name for Plain Holy Symbol|plain holy symbol
ITEM_PLAIN_HOLY_SYMBOL_DESC||retired item description for Plain Holy Symbol|An ordinary holy emblem. Wearing it increases piety point regeneration.
ITEM_MISTLETOE_SPRIG_NAME|64|item display name for Mistletoe Sprig|mistletoe sprig
ITEM_MISTLETOE_SPRIG_DESC||item description for Mistletoe Sprig|A bound sprig of mistletoe tied with green cord for field prayer and druidic rites.
ITEM_SILVERED_MISTLETOE_SPRIG_NAME|64|item display name for Silvered Mistletoe Sprig|silvered mistletoe sprig
ITEM_SILVERED_MISTLETOE_SPRIG_DESC||item description for Silvered Mistletoe Sprig|A mistletoe sprig bound with green cord and a small silver sickle charm.
ITEM_WOODEN_HOLY_SYMBOL_NAME|64|item display name for Wooden Holy Symbol|wooden holy symbol
ITEM_WOODEN_HOLY_SYMBOL_DESC||item description for Wooden Holy Symbol|A plain carved holy symbol darkened by thumb-wear and lamp smoke.
ITEM_COPPER_HOLY_SYMBOL_NAME|64|item display name for Copper Holy Symbol|copper holy symbol
ITEM_COPPER_HOLY_SYMBOL_DESC||item description for Copper Holy Symbol|A stamped copper holy symbol with clean enough lines for daily prayer.
ITEM_BONE_HOLY_SYMBOL_NAME|64|item display name for Bone Holy Symbol|bone holy symbol
ITEM_BONE_HOLY_SYMBOL_DESC||item description for Bone Holy Symbol|A pale bone holy symbol cut with old protection script.
ITEM_IRON_HOLY_SYMBOL_NAME|64|item display name for Iron Holy Symbol|iron holy symbol
ITEM_IRON_HOLY_SYMBOL_DESC||item description for Iron Holy Symbol|A heavy iron holy symbol made for hard travel and harder doors.
ITEM_SPELLBOOK_NAME|64|item display name for Spellbook|spellbook
ITEM_SPELLBOOK_DESC||item description for Spellbook|A leatherbound book of ruled pages, copied formulae, and cramped arcane notes.
ITEM_ARCANE_SPELLBOOK_NAME|64|item display name for Arcane Spellbook|arcane spellbook
ITEM_ARCANE_SPELLBOOK_DESC||item description for Arcane Spellbook|A bound spellbook of copied formulae, worked examples, and cramped marginal corrections.
ITEM_DIVINE_TOME_NAME|64|item display name for Divine Tome|divine tome
ITEM_DIVINE_TOME_DESC||item description for Divine Tome|A weighty prayer-tome of copied rites, canon notes, and careful liturgical marks.
ITEM_ARCANE_SPELLBOOK_PROXY_MINOR_NAME|64|item display name for Arcane Spellbook Proxy Minor|arcane spellbook proxy minor
ITEM_ARCANE_SPELLBOOK_PROXY_MAJOR_NAME|64|item display name for Arcane Spellbook Proxy Major|arcane spellbook proxy major
ITEM_ARCANE_SPELLBOOK_PROXY_GRAND_NAME|64|item display name for Arcane Spellbook Proxy Grand|arcane spellbook proxy grand
ITEM_DIVINE_TOME_PROXY_MINOR_NAME|64|item display name for Divine Tome Proxy Minor|divine tome proxy minor
ITEM_DIVINE_TOME_PROXY_MAJOR_NAME|64|item display name for Divine Tome Proxy Major|divine tome proxy major
ITEM_DIVINE_TOME_PROXY_GRAND_NAME|64|item display name for Divine Tome Proxy Grand|divine tome proxy grand
ITEM_RING_OF_PROTECTION_1_NAME|64|item display name for Ring of Protection +1|ring of protection +1
ITEM_RING_OF_PROTECTION_1_DESC||item description for Ring of Protection +1|A plain silver ring worked with a tiny warding knot on the inner band. It grants +1 DEF and +1 ARM.
ITEM_RING_OF_REGENERATION_1_NAME|64|item display name for Ring of Regeneration +1|ring of regeneration +1
ITEM_RING_OF_REGENERATION_1_DESC||item description for Ring of Regeneration +1|A warm green-gold ring that helps small wounds close and knit faster.
ITEM_RING_OF_REGENERATION_1_UNIDENTIFIED_NAME|64|unidentified item display name for Ring of Regeneration +1|green-gold ring
ITEM_RING_OF_REGENERATION_1_UNIDENTIFIED_DESC||unidentified item description for Ring of Regeneration +1|Unidentified jewelry can hide blessings, curses, or other magic beneath plain metalwork.
ITEM_RING_OF_REGENERATION_2_NAME|64|item display name for Ring of Regeneration +2|ring of regeneration +2
ITEM_RING_OF_REGENERATION_2_DESC||item description for Ring of Regeneration +2|A warm green-gold ring with a stronger life charm that helps wounds close faster.
ITEM_RING_OF_REGENERATION_2_UNIDENTIFIED_NAME|64|unidentified item display name for Ring of Regeneration +2|green-gold ring
ITEM_RING_OF_REGENERATION_2_UNIDENTIFIED_DESC||unidentified item description for Ring of Regeneration +2|Unidentified jewelry can hide blessings, curses, or other magic beneath plain metalwork.
ITEM_RING_OF_REGENERATION_3_NAME|64|item display name for Ring of Regeneration +3|ring of regeneration +3
ITEM_RING_OF_REGENERATION_3_DESC||item description for Ring of Regeneration +3|A warm green-gold ring with a deep life charm that helps wounds close faster.
ITEM_RING_OF_REGENERATION_3_UNIDENTIFIED_NAME|64|unidentified item display name for Ring of Regeneration +3|green-gold ring
ITEM_RING_OF_REGENERATION_3_UNIDENTIFIED_DESC||unidentified item description for Ring of Regeneration +3|Unidentified jewelry can hide blessings, curses, or other magic beneath plain metalwork.
ITEM_AMULET_OF_HEALTH_4_NAME|64|item display name for Amulet of Health +4|amulet of health +4
ITEM_AMULET_OF_HEALTH_4_DESC||item description for Amulet of Health +4|A red-gold disk worked with a dragon-scale pattern and a careful healing charm. It grants +4 max HP.
ITEM_AMULET_OF_HEALTH_4_UNIDENTIFIED_NAME|64|unidentified item display name for Amulet of Health +4|red-gold amulet
ITEM_AMULET_OF_HEALTH_4_UNIDENTIFIED_DESC||unidentified item description for Amulet of Health +4|Unidentified jewelry can hide blessings, curses, or other magic beneath plain metalwork.
ITEM_BLACKGLASS_STAR_AMULET_NAME|64|item display name for Blackglass Star Amulet|Blackglass Star Amulet
ITEM_BLACKGLASS_STAR_AMULET_DESC||item description for Blackglass Star Amulet|A blackglass star worn smooth by generations of hands. It reacts to pure blackglass and blackglass pressure. It is bound to your bloodline and grants +1 to all attributes.
ITEM_LIGHTGLASS_STAR_AMULET_NAME|64|item display name for Lightglass Star Amulet|Lightglass Star Amulet
ITEM_LIGHTGLASS_STAR_AMULET_DESC||item description for Lightglass Star Amulet|The purified form of the old blackglass star. It answers to your bloodline and grants +2 to all attributes.
ITEM_RADIANT_LIGHTGLASS_STAR_AMULET_NAME|64|item display name for Radiant Lightglass Star Amulet|Radiant Lightglass Star Amulet
ITEM_RADIANT_LIGHTGLASS_STAR_AMULET_DESC||item description for Radiant Lightglass Star Amulet|The radiant form of the old blackglass star. The cleansed White Vault resonance steadies its lightglass, and it grants +3 to all attributes.
ITEM_FLAMING_LONGSWORD_NAME|64|item display name for Flaming Longsword|flaming longsword
ITEM_FLAMING_LONGSWORD_DESC||item description for Flaming Longsword|A rune-cut longsword whose edge burns when drawn for combat. Each hit deals an extra 1d4 fire damage.
ITEM_SILVER_DAGGER_NAME|64|item display name for Silver Dagger|silver dagger
ITEM_SILVER_DAGGER_DESC||item description for Silver Dagger|A slim dagger with a silvered blade, useful against creatures harmed by silver.
ITEM_GOBLIN_CORPSE_NAME|64|item display name for Goblin Corpse|goblin corpse
ITEM_GOBLIN_CORPSE_DESC||item description for Goblin Corpse|A small goblin corpse with old blood, damp hide, and cave smoke on it.
ITEM_KOBOLD_CORPSE_NAME|64|item display name for Kobold Corpse|kobold corpse
ITEM_KOBOLD_CORPSE_DESC||item description for Kobold Corpse|A stringy reptilian corpse with rank scales and an oily musk.
ITEM_ORC_CORPSE_NAME|64|item display name for Orc Corpse|orc corpse
ITEM_ORC_CORPSE_DESC||item description for Orc Corpse|A broad-shouldered corpse with old scars and the smell of wet leather, smoke, and iron rations.
ITEM_HOBGOBLIN_CORPSE_NAME|64|item display name for Hobgoblin Corpse|hobgoblin corpse
ITEM_HOBGOBLIN_CORPSE_DESC||item description for Hobgoblin Corpse|A tough goblinoid corpse with old scars, hard muscle, and campaign grime.
ITEM_OGRE_CORPSE_NAME|64|item display name for Ogre Corpse|ogre corpse
ITEM_OGRE_CORPSE_DESC||item description for Ogre Corpse|A large ogre corpse with greasy flesh, bruised hide, and sour breath.
ITEM_TROLL_CORPSE_NAME|64|item display name for Troll Corpse|troll corpse
ITEM_TROLL_CORPSE_DESC||item description for Troll Corpse|A thick-limbed troll corpse with rubbery flesh and oversized joints.
ITEM_WOLF_CORPSE_NAME|64|item display name for Wolf Corpse|wolf corpse
ITEM_WOLF_CORPSE_DESC||item description for Wolf Corpse|A lean furred carcass with wet hide and old blood in the coat.
ITEM_GIANT_RAT_CORPSE_NAME|64|item display name for Giant Rat Corpse|giant rat corpse
ITEM_GIANT_RAT_CORPSE_DESC||item description for Giant Rat Corpse|A greasy urban vermin carcass with patchy fur and a sewer smell.
ITEM_GIANT_SPIDER_CORPSE_NAME|64|item display name for Giant Spider Corpse|giant spider corpse
ITEM_GIANT_SPIDER_CORPSE_DESC||item description for Giant Spider Corpse|A heavy chitinous carcass with curled legs and a bitter chemical smell from the venom sacs.
ITEM_SKELETON_REMAINS_NAME|64|item display name for Skeleton Remains|skeleton remains
ITEM_SKELETON_REMAINS_DESC||item description for Skeleton Remains|A loose spill of old bones and scraps that barely counts as a corpse anymore. There is no meat left, just brittle bone and dust.
ITEM_ZOMBIE_CORPSE_NAME|64|item display name for Zombie Corpse|zombie corpse
ITEM_ZOMBIE_CORPSE_DESC||item description for Zombie Corpse|A rotten corpse with dead flesh, torn burial cloth, and a heavy decay smell.
ITEM_BANDIT_CORPSE_NAME|64|item display name for Bandit Corpse|bandit corpse
ITEM_BANDIT_CORPSE_DESC||item description for Bandit Corpse|A dead human body wearing battered leather and travel-stained clothes.
ITEM_GIANT_BAT_CORPSE_NAME|64|item display name for Giant Bat Corpse|giant bat corpse
ITEM_GIANT_BAT_CORPSE_DESC||item description for Giant Bat Corpse|A leathery winged carcass that smells of caves, mildew, and sour blood.
ITEM_BUGBEAR_CORPSE_NAME|64|item display name for Bugbear Corpse|bugbear corpse
ITEM_BUGBEAR_CORPSE_DESC||item description for Bugbear Corpse|A large shaggy goblinoid carcass with wet fur and old camp grime.
ITEM_GNOLL_CORPSE_NAME|64|item display name for Gnoll Corpse|gnoll corpse
ITEM_GNOLL_CORPSE_DESC||item description for Gnoll Corpse|A rangy hyena-faced corpse that smells of carrion, matted fur, and rank camp smoke.
ITEM_DIRE_WOLF_CORPSE_NAME|64|item display name for Dire Wolf Corpse|dire wolf corpse
ITEM_DIRE_WOLF_CORPSE_DESC||item description for Dire Wolf Corpse|A massive wolf carcass with heavy muscle and winter-thick fur.
ITEM_WARG_CORPSE_NAME|64|item display name for Warg Corpse|warg corpse
ITEM_WARG_CORPSE_DESC||item description for Warg Corpse|A large warg carcass with heavy jaws, coarse fur, and dark meat.
ITEM_GIANT_TOAD_CORPSE_NAME|64|item display name for Giant Toad Corpse|giant toad corpse
ITEM_GIANT_TOAD_CORPSE_DESC||item description for Giant Toad Corpse|A rubbery swollen carcass slick with marsh slime.
ITEM_GHOUL_CORPSE_NAME|64|item display name for Ghoul Corpse|ghoul corpse
ITEM_GHOUL_CORPSE_DESC||item description for Ghoul Corpse|A cold gray ghoul carcass pulled taut over sharp bones.
ITEM_WILD_DOG_CORPSE_NAME|64|item display name for Wild Dog Corpse|wild dog corpse
ITEM_WILD_DOG_CORPSE_DESC||item description for Wild Dog Corpse|A rangy carcass with matted hide, sharp ribs, and road dust in the coat.
ITEM_BOAR_CORPSE_NAME|64|item display name for Boar Corpse|boar corpse
ITEM_BOAR_CORPSE_DESC||item description for Boar Corpse|A thick slab of bristled muscle and mud-caked hide.
ITEM_BLACK_BEAR_CORPSE_NAME|64|item display name for Black Bear Corpse|black bear corpse
ITEM_BLACK_BEAR_CORPSE_DESC||item description for Black Bear Corpse|A massive dark bear carcass with pine needles, wet fur, and blood in the coat.
ITEM_BROWN_BEAR_CORPSE_NAME|64|item display name for Brown Bear Corpse|brown bear corpse
ITEM_BROWN_BEAR_CORPSE_DESC||item description for Brown Bear Corpse|A huge battered bear carcass with heavy hide, fat, and muscle.
ITEM_BLACKGLASS_RAT_CORPSE_NAME|64|item display name for Blackglass Rat Corpse|blackglass rat corpse
ITEM_BLACKGLASS_RAT_CORPSE_DESC||item description for Blackglass Rat Corpse|A shard-bitten rat carcass with blackglass grit in the teeth and spine.
ITEM_BLACKGLASS_ZOMBIE_CORPSE_NAME|64|item display name for Blackglass Zombie Corpse|blackglass zombie corpse
ITEM_BLACKGLASS_ZOMBIE_CORPSE_DESC||item description for Blackglass Zombie Corpse|A dead human body threaded through with blackglass splines and dark shard growth.
ITEM_LACQUERED_BLACK_ROD_DUNGEON_MASTER_S_ERASER_NAME|64|item display name for lacquered black rod "Dungeon Master's Eraser"|lacquered black rod "Dungeon Master's Eraser"
ITEM_LACQUERED_BLACK_ROD_DUNGEON_MASTER_S_ERASER_DESC||item description for lacquered black rod "Dungeon Master's Eraser"|A lacquered debug rod marked with tally notches. Anything it strikes is erased by a special debug effect.
ITEM_LACQUERED_BLACK_ROD_DUNGEON_MASTER_S_ERASER_UNIDENTIFIED_NAME|64|unidentified item display name for lacquered black rod "Dungeon Master's Eraser"|lacquered black rod
ITEM_POTION_OF_MANA_NAME|64|item display name for Potion of Mana|potion of mana
ITEM_POTION_OF_MANA_DESC||item description for Potion of Mana|A cool blue draught for restoring spell power. Restores 1d7+4 MP.
ITEM_SCROLL_OF_IDENTIFY_NAME|64|item display name for Scroll of Identify|scroll of identify
ITEM_SCROLL_OF_IDENTIFY_DESC||item description for Scroll of Identify|A careful diagnostic script of symbols and margin marks, written for the practical business of naming strange things correctly.
ITEM_SCROLL_OF_REMOVE_CURSE_NAME|64|item display name for Scroll of Remove Curse|scroll of remove curse
ITEM_SCROLL_OF_REMOVE_CURSE_DESC||item description for Scroll of Remove Curse|A stern unbinding litany. Reading it removes one curse from carried or equipped items.
ITEM_WAND_OF_MAGIC_MISSILE_NAME|64|item display name for Wand of Magic Missile|wand of magic missile
ITEM_WAND_OF_MAGIC_MISSILE_DESC||item description for Wand of Magic Missile|A slim ash wand carved with steadying runes. It fires a guided force missile at a target.
ITEM_GOLD_PIECES_NAME|64|item display name for gold pieces|gold pieces
ITEM_GOLD_PIECES_DESC||item description for gold pieces|Stamped coin carried for trade, tolls, rooms, food, and ordinary purchases.
ITEM_CHIPPED_GARNET_NAME|64|item display name for Chipped Garnet|chipped garnet
ITEM_CHIPPED_GARNET_DESC||item description for Chipped Garnet|A thumb-sized red stone with a rough chipped edge, suitable for low-grade jewelry or trade.
ITEM_BANDED_AGATE_NAME|64|item display name for Banded Agate|banded agate
