ITEM_BRONZE_GAUNTLETS_NAME|64|item display name for Bronze Gauntlets|bronze gauntlets
ITEM_BRONZE_GAUNTLETS_DESC||item description for Bronze Gauntlets|Bronze-plated gauntlets with articulated fingers and worn knuckle ridges.
ITEM_ROPE_BELT_NAME|64|item display name for Rope Belt|rope belt
ITEM_ROPE_BELT_DESC||item description for Rope Belt|A rough cord belt tied twice over worn clothes or light armor. It offers little structure.
ITEM_STUDDED_BELT_NAME|64|item display name for Studded Belt|studded belt
ITEM_STUDDED_BELT_DESC||item description for Studded Belt|A broad leather war belt stiffened with rivets and small plates. It protects the middle from low cuts.
ITEM_RUST_REMOVAL_KIT_NAME|64|item display name for Rust Removal Kit|rust removal kit
ITEM_RUST_REMOVAL_KIT_DESC||item description for Rust Removal Kit|A tight roll of oilcloth, wire wool, and sharp-smelling solvent for scouring fresh rust from gear. A repair takes 2 hours; magical gear is harder to repair. Each use wears the kit down.
ITEM_GREATER_HEALING_POTION_NAME|64|item display name for Potion of Greater Healing|potion of greater healing
ITEM_GREATER_HEALING_POTION_DESC||item description for Greater Healing Potion|A dense crimson draught for deep wounds. Restores 3d8+3 HP and stops bleeding.
ITEM_SPRING_STEEL_LOCKPICKS_NAME|64|item display name for Spring-Steel Lockpicks|spring-steel lockpicks
ITEM_SPRING_STEEL_LOCKPICKS_DESC||item description for Spring-Steel Lockpicks|A tight roll of polished spring-steel picks and a well-cut tension wrench. They give +2 to lockpicking checks and hold up better under stress.
ITEM_CHEAP_TRAP_KIT_NAME|64|item display name for Cheap Trap Kit|cheap trap kit
ITEM_CHEAP_TRAP_KIT_DESC||item description for Cheap Trap Kit|Bent nails, twine, a hand mirror shard, and a narrow wedge wrapped in scrap cloth. It can disarm simple traps, but the cheap tools wear down quickly.
ITEM_TRAP_DISARM_KIT_NAME|64|item display name for Trap Disarm Kit|trap disarm kit
ITEM_TRAP_DISARM_KIT_DESC||item description for Trap Disarm Kit|A sensible roll of probes, clamps, chalk, and a fine-bladed screwdriver. It is built for steady trap work and loses about 18% durability per use.
ITEM_PROFESSIONAL_TRAP_KIT_NAME|64|item display name for Professional Trap Kit|professional trap kit
ITEM_PROFESSIONAL_TRAP_KIT_DESC||item description for Professional Trap Kit|A master-cut case of hardened probes, clamps, feeler wires, and tiny screw tools. It is built for difficult trap work and loses about 12% durability per use.
ITEM_CHEAP_APOTHECARY_KIT_NAME|64|item display name for Cheap Apothecary Kit|cheap apothecary kit
ITEM_CHEAP_APOTHECARY_KIT_DESC||item description for Cheap Apothecary Kit|A cheap satchel of corked vials, stained cloth filters, and battered copper spoons. It can brew basic field potions, but the tools are unreliable and wear down quickly.
ITEM_APOTHECARY_KIT_NAME|64|item display name for Apothecary Kit|apothecary kit
ITEM_APOTHECARY_KIT_DESC||item description for Apothecary Kit|A tidy field kit of vials, filters, spoons, wax, and stoppered bottles. It is suitable for regular potion brewing and loses about 20% durability per use.
ITEM_MASTER_APOTHECARY_KIT_NAME|64|item display name for Master Apothecary Kit|master apothecary kit
ITEM_MASTER_APOTHECARY_KIT_DESC||item description for Master Apothecary Kit|A master-cut traveling case of glassware, measures, clean filters, and tempered tools. It is reliable enough for stronger potion work and loses about 14% durability per use.
ITEM_BEACON_PRISM_NAME|64|item display name for Beacon Prism|Beacon Prism
ITEM_BEACON_PRISM_DESC||item description for Beacon Prism|A large many-faced Lightglass prism from a White Seal beacon tower. Pale order-light still catches in its depths.
ITEM_BEACON_PRISM_UNIDENTIFIED_NAME|64|unidentified item display name for Beacon Prism|Beacon Prism
