ITEM_BLACKGLASS_LORESTONE_DESC||item description for Blackglass Lorestone|A smooth blackglass memory-stone that feels warm when held near old writing. It grants +2 DEF, +1 ARM, +1 arcane spell DC, and is indestructible.
