ITEM_LIGHTGLASS_RELIQUARY_MACE_DESC||item description for Lightglass Reliquary Mace|A pale lightglass mace with a small sealed reliquary set behind the head. Divine spells cost 1 less PP, and hits deal +3 damage to drakes and Scar-spawn.
ITEM_LIGHTGLASS_LONGSWORD_NAME|64|item display name for Lightglass Longsword|lightglass longsword
ITEM_LIGHTGLASS_LONGSWORD_DESC||item description for Lightglass Longsword|A swift lightglass longsword with a pale core running through the blade. Hits deal +4 damage to drakes and Scar-spawn.
ITEM_LIGHTGLASS_CENSER_FLAIL_NAME|64|item display name for Lightglass Censer Flail|lightglass censer flail
ITEM_LIGHTGLASS_CENSER_FLAIL_DESC||item description for Lightglass Censer Flail|A pale lightglass flail with a small censer head that rings softly when swung. Divine spell channeling takes 1 fewer turn, divine damage spells deal +1 damage, and hits deal +3 damage to drakes and Scar-spawn.
ITEM_LIGHTGLASS_RELIQUARY_MAIL_NAME|64|item display name for Lightglass Reliquary Mail|lightglass reliquary mail
ITEM_LIGHTGLASS_RELIQUARY_MAIL_DESC||item description for Lightglass Reliquary Mail|A bright mail coat with lightglass rings worked through the chest and collar. It grants +6 DEF, +16 ARM, and is indestructible.
ITEM_LIGHTGLASS_RELIQUARY_MAIL_UNIDENTIFIED_NAME|64|unidentified item display name for Lightglass Reliquary Mail|chain mail
ITEM_LIGHTGLASS_RELIQUARY_MAIL_UNIDENTIFIED_DESC||unidentified item description for Lightglass Reliquary Mail|A linked mail shirt that spreads cuts and points across many small rings.
ITEM_DELICATE_PURE_GOLD_NECKLACE_LUCKY_FIND_NAME|64|item display name for delicate pure-gold necklace "Lucky Find"|delicate pure-gold necklace "Lucky Find"
ITEM_DELICATE_PURE_GOLD_NECKLACE_LUCKY_FIND_DESC||item description for delicate pure-gold necklace "Lucky Find"|A delicate necklace of the purest clean gold. It grants +8 luck.
ITEM_DELICATE_PURE_GOLD_NECKLACE_LUCKY_FIND_UNIDENTIFIED_NAME|64|unidentified item display name for delicate pure-gold necklace "Lucky Find"|delicate gold necklace
ITEM_DELICATE_PURE_GOLD_NECKLACE_LUCKY_FIND_UNIDENTIFIED_DESC||unidentified item description for delicate pure-gold necklace "Lucky Find"|An exceptionally delicate necklace worked from clean, unblemished gold.
ITEM_LIGHTGLASS_KITE_SHIELD_NAME|64|item display name for Lightglass Kite Shield|lightglass kite shield
ITEM_LIGHTGLASS_KITE_SHIELD_DESC||item description for Lightglass Kite Shield|A tall lightglass kite shield with a pale face and clean reinforced rim. It grants +6 DEF, +15 ARM, +1 to spell saves, and has a 10% chance to reflect melee damage.
ITEM_LIGHTGLASS_KITE_SHIELD_UNIDENTIFIED_NAME|64|unidentified item display name for Lightglass Kite Shield|kite shield
ITEM_LIGHTGLASS_KITE_SHIELD_UNIDENTIFIED_DESC||unidentified item description for Lightglass Kite Shield|A tall tapered shield built to cover shoulder, heart, and shin in one disciplined line.
ITEM_GLEAMING_LIGHTGLASS_LONGSWORD_DAWN_S_EDGE_NAME|64|item display name for gleaming lightglass longsword "Dawn's Edge"|gleaming lightglass longsword "Dawn's Edge"
ITEM_GLEAMING_LIGHTGLASS_LONGSWORD_DAWN_S_EDGE_DESC||item description for gleaming lightglass longsword "Dawn's Edge"|A masterwork lightglass longsword with a dawn-bright core burning inside the blade. It grants +1 WIS, and hits gain +4 ATK and +4 damage against dragons.
ITEM_GLEAMING_LIGHTGLASS_LONGSWORD_DAWN_S_EDGE_UNIDENTIFIED_NAME|64|unidentified item display name for gleaming lightglass longsword "Dawn's Edge"|gleaming lightglass longsword
ITEM_GLEAMING_BREASTPLATE_DAWNLIGHT_NAME|64|item display name for gleaming breastplate "Dawnlight"|gleaming breastplate "Dawnlight"
ITEM_GLEAMING_BREASTPLATE_DAWNLIGHT_DESC||item description for gleaming breastplate "Dawnlight"|A gleaming lightglass breastplate built for a high purifier. It grants +8 DEF, +24 ARM, +2 WIS, and is very light for its protection.
ITEM_GLEAMING_BREASTPLATE_DAWNLIGHT_UNIDENTIFIED_NAME|64|unidentified item display name for gleaming breastplate "Dawnlight"|breastplate
ITEM_GLEAMING_BREASTPLATE_DAWNLIGHT_UNIDENTIFIED_DESC||unidentified item description for gleaming breastplate "Dawnlight"|A fitted breastplate shaped to protect the ribs and heart without the weight of a full harness.
ITEM_GLEAMING_LIGHTGLASS_SHIELD_WHITE_WALL_NAME|64|item display name for gleaming lightglass shield "White Wall"|gleaming lightglass shield "White Wall"
ITEM_GLEAMING_LIGHTGLASS_SHIELD_WHITE_WALL_DESC||item description for gleaming lightglass shield "White Wall"|A broad lightglass shield with a smooth pale face and heavy white rim. It grants +8 DEF, +16 ARM, +1 to all attributes, and 10% magic resistance.
ITEM_GLEAMING_LIGHTGLASS_SHIELD_WHITE_WALL_UNIDENTIFIED_NAME|64|unidentified item display name for gleaming lightglass shield "White Wall"|kite shield
ITEM_GLEAMING_LIGHTGLASS_SHIELD_WHITE_WALL_UNIDENTIFIED_DESC||unidentified item description for gleaming lightglass shield "White Wall"|A tall tapered shield built to cover shoulder, heart, and shin in one disciplined line.
ITEM_TORN_HIDE_NAME|64|item display name for Torn Hide|torn hide
ITEM_TORN_HIDE_DESC||item description for Torn Hide|A ragged strip of hide cut loose from a carcass. It is only fit for salvage.
