ITEM_TANGLED_SILK_DESC||item description for Tangled Silk|A knotted wad of strong silk too fouled for clean work.
ITEM_BARBED_LEG_NAME|64|item display name for Barbed Leg|barbed leg
ITEM_BARBED_LEG_DESC||item description for Barbed Leg|A stiff, barbed insect leg clipped down for salvage.
