ITEM_DENTED_PAN_DESC||item description for Dented Pan|A pan dented through the base and useless for cooking.
ITEM_SPLIT_SILVER_SPOON_NAME|64|item display name for Split Silver Spoon|split silver spoon
ITEM_SPLIT_SILVER_SPOON_DESC||item description for Split Silver Spoon|A silver spoon split down the bowl, valuable only as metal.
ITEM_CRACKED_MIRROR_SHARD_NAME|64|item display name for Cracked Mirror Shard|cracked mirror shard
ITEM_CRACKED_MIRROR_SHARD_DESC||item description for Cracked Mirror Shard|A mirror shard with cracks through the silvering.
ITEM_TARNISHED_CUP_NAME|64|item display name for Tarnished Cup|tarnished cup
ITEM_TARNISHED_CUP_DESC||item description for Tarnished Cup|A tarnished cup with a split lip and a dented base.
ITEM_BENT_BRASS_PLATE_NAME|64|item display name for Bent Brass Plate|bent brass plate
