ITEM_BROKEN_CANDLE_STUB_DESC||item description for Broken Candle Stub|A snapped candle stub too dirty to burn cleanly.
ITEM_BRITTLE_BONE_SHARD_NAME|64|item display name for Brittle Bone Shard|brittle bone shard
ITEM_BRITTLE_BONE_SHARD_DESC||item description for Brittle Bone Shard|A brittle shard of bone that crumbles at the edges.
ITEM_BENT_COFFIN_HANDLE_NAME|64|item display name for Bent Coffin Handle|bent coffin handle
ITEM_BENT_COFFIN_HANDLE_DESC||item description for Bent Coffin Handle|A coffin handle bent away from its mounting plate.
