ITEM_CRACKED_BURIAL_PLATE_DESC||item description for Cracked Burial Plate|A burial plate cracked through the name and date.
ITEM_VETHRIN_S_SEALED_NOTE_NAME|64|item display name for Vethrin's Sealed Note|vethrin's sealed note
ITEM_VETHRIN_S_SEALED_NOTE_DESC||item description for Vethrin's Sealed Note|A folded note sealed with cheap wax and marked for a Reedwater fisherman.
ITEM_ASH_TOWER_DRAKE_SCALE_NAME|64|item display name for Ash Tower Drake Scale|ash tower drake scale
ITEM_ASH_TOWER_DRAKE_SCALE_DESC||item description for Ash Tower Drake Scale|A scorched drake scale kept as proof for Velra's Ash Tower work.
ITEM_SUPREME_HEALING_POTION_NAME|64|item display name for Potion of Supreme Healing|potion of supreme healing
ITEM_SUPREME_HEALING_POTION_DESC||item description for Supreme Healing Potion|A sovereign crimson draught. Restores 16d6+124 HP and stops bleeding.
ITEM_LESSER_MANA_POTION_NAME|64|item display name for Potion of Lesser Mana|potion of lesser mana
ITEM_LESSER_MANA_POTION_DESC||item description for Lesser Mana Potion|A pale blue draught. Restores 1d4+2 MP.
ITEM_POTION_OF_SPEED_NAME|64|item display name for Potion of Speed|potion of speed
ITEM_POTION_OF_SPEED_DESC||item description for Potion of Speed|A sharp quicksilver draught. Grants Haste for about 8 turns, then leaves you exhausted.
ITEM_POTION_OF_STONESKIN_NAME|64|item display name for Potion of Stoneskin|potion of stoneskin
ITEM_POTION_OF_STONESKIN_DESC||item description for Potion of Stoneskin|A gritty gray draught. Grants Stoneskin for about 60 turns.
ITEM_POTION_OF_INVISIBILITY_NAME|64|item display name for Potion of Invisibility|potion of invisibility
ITEM_POTION_OF_INVISIBILITY_DESC||item description for Potion of Invisibility|A fading glass-clear draught. Turns you invisible for about 24 turns, but acting or attacking can break it.
ITEM_POTION_OF_RESISTANCE_NAME|64|item display name for Potion of Resistance|potion of resistance
ITEM_POTION_OF_RESISTANCE_DESC||item description for Potion of Resistance|A bracing warding draught. Grants Resistance, giving +1 to all saves for about 60 turns.
ITEM_POTION_OF_PROTECTION_FROM_ENERGY_NAME|64|item display name for Potion of Protection from Energy|potion of protection from energy
ITEM_POTION_OF_PROTECTION_FROM_ENERGY_DESC||item description for Potion of Protection from Energy|A layered elemental draught. Grants temporary fire, cold, shock, and acid resistance for about 36 turns.
ITEM_POTION_OF_CLARITY_NAME|64|item display name for Potion of Clarity|potion of clarity
ITEM_POTION_OF_CLARITY_DESC||item description for Potion of Clarity|A clear bitter draught. Clears confusion and charm, then grants immunity to mental effects for about 60 turns.
ITEM_POTION_OF_HEROISM_NAME|64|item display name for Potion of Heroism|potion of heroism
ITEM_POTION_OF_HEROISM_DESC||item description for Potion of Heroism|A hot gold draught. Grants Righteous Might (+2 ATK, +2 melee damage, +20 HP, fear and knockback resistance), Bless (+1 ATK, +1 DEF), and +2 extra damage for about 12 turns, plus brief melee shielding.
ITEM_POTION_OF_SHIELDING_NAME|64|item display name for Potion of Shielding|potion of shielding
ITEM_POTION_OF_SHIELDING_DESC||item description for Potion of Shielding|A blue force draught. Grants Shield, giving +2 DEF against ranged attacks for about 60 turns.
ITEM_POTION_OF_BLUR_NAME|64|item display name for Potion of Blur|potion of blur
ITEM_POTION_OF_BLUR_DESC||item description for Potion of Blur|A wavering smoky draught. Grants Blur: +2 DEF and +4 DEF against ranged attacks until you take damage.
ITEM_POTION_OF_MIRROR_IMAGE_NAME|64|item display name for Potion of Mirror Image|potion of mirror image
ITEM_POTION_OF_MIRROR_IMAGE_DESC||item description for Potion of Mirror Image|A split-reflection draught. Creates 3 mirror images; a hit removes one image and deals half damage.
ITEM_POTION_OF_MAGE_ARMOR_NAME|64|item display name for Potion of Mage Armor|potion of mage armor
ITEM_POTION_OF_MAGE_ARMOR_DESC||item description for Potion of Mage Armor|A silvery shell draught. Grants Mage Armor, replacing body armor with DEF 1+INT mod and ARM 2+INT mod x2 for 10 minutes.
ITEM_POTION_OF_SEEING_NAME|64|item display name for Potion of Seeing|potion of seeing
ITEM_POTION_OF_SEEING_DESC||item description for Potion of Seeing|A bright eye-watering draught. Lets you see invisible creatures for about 36 turns.
ITEM_POTION_OF_FLYING_NAME|64|item display name for Potion of Flying|potion of flying
ITEM_POTION_OF_FLYING_DESC||item description for Potion of Flying|A weightless sky-blue draught. Grants flight over floor hazards for about 54 turns.
ITEM_POTION_OF_IMPROVED_INVISIBILITY_NAME|64|item display name for Potion of Improved Invisibility|potion of improved invisibility
ITEM_POTION_OF_IMPROVED_INVISIBILITY_DESC||item description for Potion of Improved Invisibility|A deep vanishing draught. Grants Improved Invisibility for about 12 turns; attacking only has a 25% chance to break it.
ITEM_POTION_OF_LEVITATION_NAME|64|item display name for Potion of Levitation|potion of levitation
ITEM_POTION_OF_LEVITATION_DESC||item description for Potion of Levitation|A pale airy draught. Levitate for about 48 turns, floating over pits, acid, water, rubble, webbing, and similar floor hazards.
ITEM_POTION_OF_AID_NAME|64|item display name for Potion of Aid|potion of aid
ITEM_POTION_OF_AID_DESC||item description for Potion of Aid|A martial blessing draught. Grants Bless for 1 minute plus positive WIS modifier turns and 1d8+1 temporary HP.
ITEM_POTION_OF_GREATER_AID_NAME|64|item display name for Potion of Greater Aid|potion of greater aid
ITEM_POTION_OF_GREATER_AID_DESC||item description for Potion of Greater Aid|A stronger martial blessing draught. Grants Bless for 1 minute plus positive WIS modifier turns and 2d8+2 temporary HP.
ITEM_POTION_OF_RESTORATION_NAME|64|item display name for Potion of Restoration|potion of restoration
ITEM_POTION_OF_RESTORATION_DESC||item description for Potion of Restoration|A clean silver draught. Restores attribute drain.
ITEM_SCROLL_OF_SYMBOL_NAME|64|item display name for Scroll of Symbol|scroll of symbol
ITEM_SCROLL_OF_SYMBOL_DESC||item description for Scroll of Symbol|A severe silver ward-script. Places a holy rune trap that stuns, fears, blinds, or destroys the next enemy to trigger it.
ITEM_POTION_OF_REJUVENATION_NAME|64|item display name for Potion of Rejuvenation|potion of rejuvenation
ITEM_POTION_OF_REJUVENATION_DESC||item description for Potion of Rejuvenation|A green-gold draught. Grants Regenerate, restoring 2+WIS HP each turn for about 120 turns.
