ITEM_ELIXIR_OF_STRENGTH_NAME|64|item display name for Elixir of Strength|elixir of strength
ITEM_ELIXIR_OF_STRENGTH_DESC||item description for Elixir of Strength|A dense iron-red elixir. Permanently raises Strength by 1.
ITEM_ELIXIR_OF_DEXTERITY_NAME|64|item display name for Elixir of Dexterity|elixir of dexterity
ITEM_ELIXIR_OF_DEXTERITY_DESC||item description for Elixir of Dexterity|A bright quicksilver elixir. Permanently raises Dexterity by 1.
ITEM_ELIXIR_OF_CONSTITUTION_NAME|64|item display name for Elixir of Constitution|elixir of constitution
ITEM_ELIXIR_OF_CONSTITUTION_DESC||item description for Elixir of Constitution|A warm earthen elixir. Permanently raises Constitution by 1 and restores 4 HP.
ITEM_ELIXIR_OF_INTELLIGENCE_NAME|64|item display name for Elixir of Intelligence|elixir of intelligence
ITEM_ELIXIR_OF_INTELLIGENCE_DESC||item description for Elixir of Intelligence|A sharp copper elixir. Permanently raises Intelligence by 1.
ITEM_ELIXIR_OF_WISDOM_NAME|64|item display name for Elixir of Wisdom|elixir of wisdom
ITEM_ELIXIR_OF_WISDOM_DESC||item description for Elixir of Wisdom|A cool violet elixir. Permanently raises Wisdom by 1.
ITEM_ELIXIR_OF_CHARISMA_NAME|64|item display name for Elixir of Charisma|elixir of charisma
ITEM_ELIXIR_OF_CHARISMA_DESC||item description for Elixir of Charisma|A bright gold elixir. Permanently raises Charisma by 1.
ITEM_ELIXIR_OF_PERFECT_BALANCE_NAME|64|item display name for Elixir of Perfect Balance|elixir of perfect balance
ITEM_ELIXIR_OF_PERFECT_BALANCE_DESC||item description for Elixir of Perfect Balance|A clear black-gold elixir. Permanently raises all attributes by 1.
ITEM_ELIXIR_OF_FIRE_RESISTANCE_NAME|64|item display name for permanent fire resistance elixir|elixir of fire resistance
ITEM_ELIXIR_OF_FIRE_RESISTANCE_DESC||item description for permanent fire resistance elixir|A hot resistance elixir. Permanently improves fire resistance by one rank.
ITEM_ELIXIR_OF_COLD_RESISTANCE_NAME|64|item display name for permanent cold resistance elixir|elixir of cold resistance
ITEM_ELIXIR_OF_COLD_RESISTANCE_DESC||item description for permanent cold resistance elixir|A pale resistance elixir. Permanently improves cold resistance by one rank.
ITEM_ELIXIR_OF_POISON_RESISTANCE_NAME|64|item display name for permanent poison resistance elixir|elixir of poison resistance
ITEM_ELIXIR_OF_POISON_RESISTANCE_DESC||item description for permanent poison resistance elixir|A bitter green elixir. Permanently improves poison resistance by one rank.
ITEM_ELIXIR_OF_SHOCK_RESISTANCE_NAME|64|item display name for permanent shock resistance elixir|elixir of shock resistance
ITEM_ELIXIR_OF_SHOCK_RESISTANCE_DESC||item description for permanent shock resistance elixir|A static-bright elixir. Permanently improves shock resistance by one rank.
ITEM_ELIXIR_OF_ACID_RESISTANCE_NAME|64|item display name for permanent acid resistance elixir|elixir of acid resistance
ITEM_ELIXIR_OF_ACID_RESISTANCE_DESC||item description for permanent acid resistance elixir|A green-black elixir. Permanently improves acid resistance by one rank.
ITEM_ELIXIR_OF_HEALTH_NAME|64|item display name for Elixir of Health|elixir of health
ITEM_ELIXIR_OF_HEALTH_DESC||item description for Elixir of Health|A deep red life elixir. Permanently raises max HP by 5 and heals the gained amount.
ITEM_ELIXIR_OF_MANA_NAME|64|item display name for Elixir of Mana|elixir of mana
ITEM_ELIXIR_OF_MANA_DESC||item description for Elixir of Mana|A luminous blue elixir. Permanently raises max MP by 3 and restores the gained amount.
ITEM_ELIXIR_OF_PIETY_NAME|64|item display name for Elixir of Piety|elixir of piety
ITEM_ELIXIR_OF_PIETY_DESC||item description for Elixir of Piety|A pale-gold devotional elixir. Permanently raises max PP by 3 and restores the gained amount.
ITEM_SCROLL_OF_SHIELD_NAME|64|item display name for Scroll of Shield|scroll of shield
ITEM_SCROLL_OF_SHIELD_DESC||item description for Scroll of Shield|A compact warding script. Grants Shield: +2 DEF against ranged attacks for about 60 turns.
ITEM_SCROLL_OF_RESISTANCE_NAME|64|item display name for Scroll of Resistance|scroll of resistance
ITEM_SCROLL_OF_RESISTANCE_DESC||item description for Scroll of Resistance|A practical ward-script. Grants Resistance: +1 to all saves for about 60 turns.
ITEM_SCROLL_OF_BLESS_NAME|64|item display name for Scroll of Bless|scroll of bless
ITEM_SCROLL_OF_BLESS_DESC||item description for Scroll of Bless|A short devotional script. Grants Bless for 1 minute plus positive WIS modifier turns: +1 ATK and +1 DEF.
ITEM_SCROLL_OF_LIGHT_NAME|64|item display name for Scroll of Light|scroll of light
ITEM_SCROLL_OF_LIGHT_DESC||item description for Scroll of Light|A simple illumination script. Lights a target area for 1 minute.
ITEM_SCROLL_OF_CURE_MODERATE_WOUNDS_NAME|64|item display name for Scroll of Cure Moderate Wounds|scroll of cure moderate wounds
ITEM_SCROLL_OF_CURE_MODERATE_WOUNDS_DESC||item description for Scroll of Cure Moderate Wounds|A careful healing script. Restores 2d8+WIS HP.
ITEM_SCROLL_OF_NEUTRALIZE_POISON_NAME|64|item display name for Scroll of Neutralize Poison|scroll of neutralize poison
ITEM_SCROLL_OF_NEUTRALIZE_POISON_DESC||item description for Scroll of Neutralize Poison|Purges poison from your system.
ITEM_SCROLL_OF_DAYLIGHT_NAME|64|item display name for Scroll of Daylight|scroll of daylight
ITEM_SCROLL_OF_DAYLIGHT_DESC||item description for Scroll of Daylight|A bright litany. Channels Daylight, creating a large daylight radius.
ITEM_SCROLL_OF_HASTE_NAME|64|item display name for Scroll of Haste|scroll of haste
ITEM_SCROLL_OF_HASTE_DESC||item description for Scroll of Haste|A quickening arcane script. Grants Haste for 1 minute, then leaves you exhausted.
ITEM_SCROLL_OF_MAGE_ARMOR_NAME|64|item display name for Scroll of Mage Armor|scroll of mage armor
ITEM_SCROLL_OF_MAGE_ARMOR_DESC||item description for Scroll of Mage Armor|A steadying shell-script. Grants Mage Armor, replacing body armor with DEF 1+INT mod and ARM 2+INT mod x2.
ITEM_SCROLL_OF_TELEPORT_NAME|64|item display name for Scroll of Teleport|scroll of teleport
ITEM_SCROLL_OF_TELEPORT_DESC||item description for Scroll of Teleport|A dangerous relocation script. Teleports you near a chosen open tile; invalid destinations trigger arcane backlash.
ITEM_SCROLL_OF_PROTECTION_FROM_ENERGY_NAME|64|item display name for Scroll of Protection from Energy|scroll of protection from energy
ITEM_SCROLL_OF_PROTECTION_FROM_ENERGY_DESC||item description for Scroll of Protection from Energy|A layered elemental ward-script. Grants temporary fire, cold, shock, and acid resistance.
ITEM_SCROLL_OF_CLAIRVOYANCE_NAME|64|item display name for Scroll of Clairvoyance|scroll of clairvoyance
ITEM_SCROLL_OF_CLAIRVOYANCE_DESC||item description for Scroll of Clairvoyance|A farsight script. Channels distant terrain sight into a target area.
ITEM_SCROLL_OF_DETECT_MAGIC_NAME|64|item display name for Scroll of Detect Magic|scroll of detect magic
ITEM_SCROLL_OF_DETECT_MAGIC_DESC||item description for Scroll of Detect Magic|A patient survey script. Reveals nearby magical creatures, items, equipment, and held objects in cyan.
ITEM_SCROLL_OF_LESSER_RESTORATION_NAME|64|item display name for Scroll of Lesser Restoration|scroll of lesser restoration
ITEM_SCROLL_OF_LESSER_RESTORATION_DESC||item description for Scroll of Lesser Restoration|A short cleansing prayer. Restores 1 point of attribute drain.
ITEM_SCROLL_OF_PRAYER_NAME|64|item display name for Scroll of Prayer|scroll of prayer
ITEM_SCROLL_OF_PRAYER_DESC||item description for Scroll of Prayer|A steadier devotional script. Makes you Blessed for 1 minute plus positive WIS modifier turns and applies Bane to visible foes.
ITEM_SCROLL_OF_CURE_SERIOUS_WOUNDS_NAME|64|item display name for Scroll of Cure Serious Wounds|scroll of cure serious wounds
ITEM_SCROLL_OF_CURE_SERIOUS_WOUNDS_DESC||item description for Scroll of Cure Serious Wounds|A deeper healing script. Restores 3d8+WIS HP.
ITEM_SCROLL_OF_CURE_CRITICAL_WOUNDS_NAME|64|item display name for Scroll of Cure Critical Wounds|scroll of cure critical wounds
ITEM_SCROLL_OF_CURE_CRITICAL_WOUNDS_DESC||item description for Scroll of Cure Critical Wounds|A costly emergency healing script. Restores 4d8+WIS HP.
ITEM_SCROLL_OF_RESTORATION_NAME|64|item display name for Scroll of Restoration|scroll of restoration
ITEM_SCROLL_OF_RESTORATION_DESC||item description for Scroll of Restoration|A demanding recovery script. Clears all attribute drain and level drain.
ITEM_SCROLL_OF_CONJURE_EARTH_ELEMENTAL_NAME|80|item display name for Scroll of Conjure Earth Elemental|scroll of conjure earth elemental
ITEM_SCROLL_OF_CONJURE_EARTH_ELEMENTAL_DESC||item description for Scroll of Conjure Earth Elemental|A heavy stone-marked script. Summons an earth elemental to fight for 1 minute.
ITEM_SCROLL_OF_DISPEL_MAGIC_NAME|64|item display name for Scroll of Dispel Magic|scroll of dispel magic
ITEM_SCROLL_OF_DISPEL_MAGIC_DESC||item description for Scroll of Dispel Magic|A sharp cancelling script. Strips magic from a target tile, creature, or object.
ITEM_SCROLL_OF_INVISIBILITY_NAME|64|item display name for Scroll of Invisibility|scroll of invisibility
ITEM_SCROLL_OF_INVISIBILITY_DESC||item description for Scroll of Invisibility|A thinning script. Turns you invisible until you act or attack.
ITEM_SCROLL_OF_MIRROR_IMAGE_NAME|64|item display name for Scroll of Mirror Image|scroll of mirror image
ITEM_SCROLL_OF_MIRROR_IMAGE_DESC||item description for Scroll of Mirror Image|A split-image script. Creates 3 mirror images; a hit removes one image and deals half damage.
ITEM_SCROLL_OF_BLUR_NAME|64|item display name for Scroll of Blur|scroll of blur
ITEM_SCROLL_OF_BLUR_DESC||item description for Scroll of Blur|A short distortion script. Grants Blur: +2 DEF and +4 DEF against ranged attacks until you take damage.
ITEM_SCROLL_OF_SEE_INVISIBILITY_NAME|64|item display name for Scroll of See Invisibility|scroll of see invisibility
ITEM_SCROLL_OF_SEE_INVISIBILITY_DESC||item description for Scroll of See Invisibility|A sight-clearing script. Lets you see invisible creatures.
ITEM_SCROLL_OF_FLY_NAME|64|item display name for Scroll of Fly|scroll of fly
ITEM_SCROLL_OF_FLY_DESC||item description for Scroll of Fly|A rare lightness script. Channels flight over floor hazards.
ITEM_SCROLL_OF_ARMOR_OF_FAITH_NAME|64|item display name for Scroll of Armor of Faith|scroll of armor of faith
ITEM_SCROLL_OF_ARMOR_OF_FAITH_DESC||item description for Scroll of Armor of Faith|A steady warding prayer. Grants 2+WIS ARM for 1 hour.
ITEM_SCROLL_OF_PROTECTION_FROM_EVIL_NAME|64|item display name for Scroll of Protection from Evil|scroll of protection from evil
ITEM_SCROLL_OF_PROTECTION_FROM_EVIL_DESC||item description for Scroll of Protection from Evil|A defensive litany. Grants +1 DEF and +3 ARM against evil attacks and breaks charm.
ITEM_SCROLL_OF_FREEDOM_OF_MOVEMENT_NAME|64|item display name for Scroll of Freedom of Movement|scroll of freedom of movement
ITEM_SCROLL_OF_FREEDOM_OF_MOVEMENT_DESC||item description for Scroll of Freedom of Movement|A liberating prayer-script. Clears webbing and lets you ignore movement hindrance.
ITEM_SCROLL_OF_DEATH_WARD_NAME|64|item display name for Scroll of Death Ward|scroll of death ward
ITEM_SCROLL_OF_DEATH_WARD_DESC||item description for Scroll of Death Ward|A grave ward-script. Grants immunity to death magic and similar fatal effects.
ITEM_SCROLL_OF_TRUE_SEEING_NAME|64|item display name for Scroll of True Seeing|scroll of true seeing
ITEM_SCROLL_OF_TRUE_SEEING_DESC||item description for Scroll of True Seeing|A costly insight script. Reveals invisible creatures, secret doors, and traps.
ITEM_SCROLL_OF_RIGHTEOUS_MIGHT_NAME|64|item display name for Scroll of Righteous Might|scroll of righteous might
ITEM_SCROLL_OF_RIGHTEOUS_MIGHT_DESC||item description for Scroll of Righteous Might|A fierce battle-prayer script. Grants +2 ATK, +2 melee damage, +20 HP, and resistance to fear and knockback.
ITEM_SCROLL_OF_REGENERATE_NAME|64|item display name for Scroll of Regenerate|scroll of regenerate
ITEM_SCROLL_OF_REGENERATE_DESC||item description for Scroll of Regenerate|A rare green-gold healing script. Stops bleeding and restores 2+WIS HP each turn while it lasts.
ITEM_SCROLL_OF_AID_NAME|64|item display name for Scroll of Aid|scroll of aid
ITEM_SCROLL_OF_AID_DESC||item description for Scroll of Aid|A short martial blessing. Grants Bless for 1 minute plus positive WIS modifier turns and 1d8+WIS modifier temporary HP.
ITEM_SCROLL_OF_SANCTUARY_NAME|64|item display name for Scroll of Sanctuary|scroll of sanctuary
ITEM_SCROLL_OF_SANCTUARY_DESC||item description for Scroll of Sanctuary|A careful peace-ward script. While it lasts, you cannot attack and enemies cannot attack you.
ITEM_SCROLL_OF_REMOVE_PARALYSIS_NAME|64|item display name for Scroll of Remove Paralysis|scroll of remove paralysis
ITEM_SCROLL_OF_REMOVE_PARALYSIS_DESC||item description for Scroll of Remove Paralysis|Clears paralysis, sleep, confusion, chill, and webbing.
ITEM_SCROLL_OF_FEATHER_FALL_NAME|64|item display name for Scroll of Feather Fall|scroll of feather fall
ITEM_SCROLL_OF_FEATHER_FALL_DESC||item description for Scroll of Feather Fall|A light graceful script. Prevents fall damage for 1 minute.
ITEM_SCROLL_OF_DIVINE_LIGHT_NAME|64|item display name for Scroll of Divine Light|scroll of divine light
ITEM_SCROLL_OF_DIVINE_LIGHT_DESC||item description for Scroll of Divine Light|A bright devotional script. Cures blindness and reveals nearby tiles.
ITEM_SCROLL_OF_CONSECRATE_NAME|64|item display name for Scroll of Consecrate|scroll of consecrate
ITEM_SCROLL_OF_CONSECRATE_DESC||item description for Scroll of Consecrate|Hallow one open tile for 3 turns. Hostile evil, summoned, and extraplanar creatures take holy damage on cast, at turn start, and on entry.
ITEM_SCROLL_OF_CIRCLE_OF_PROTECTION_NAME|64|item display name for Scroll of Circle of Protection|scroll of circle of protection
ITEM_SCROLL_OF_CIRCLE_OF_PROTECTION_DESC||item description for Scroll of Circle of Protection|A careful layered ward-script. Consecrates a circle against evil, summoned, and extraplanar creatures.
ITEM_SCROLL_OF_ANIMAL_SUMMONING_I_NAME|64|item display name for Scroll of Animal Summoning I|scroll of animal summoning i
ITEM_SCROLL_OF_ANIMAL_SUMMONING_I_DESC||item description for Scroll of Animal Summoning I|A simple wild call. Summons a weak beast ally for 1 minute.
ITEM_SCROLL_OF_ANIMAL_SUMMONING_II_NAME|64|item display name for Scroll of Animal Summoning II|scroll of animal summoning ii
ITEM_SCROLL_OF_ANIMAL_SUMMONING_II_DESC||item description for Scroll of Animal Summoning II|A stronger wild call. Summons one strong beast or two lesser beasts for 1 minute.
ITEM_SCROLL_OF_ANIMAL_SUMMONING_III_NAME|64|item display name for Scroll of Animal Summoning III|scroll of animal summoning iii
ITEM_SCROLL_OF_ANIMAL_SUMMONING_III_DESC||item description for Scroll of Animal Summoning III|A deep wild call. Summons one mighty beast or two strong beasts for 1 minute.
ITEM_SCROLL_OF_BLADE_BARRIER_NAME|64|item display name for Scroll of Blade Barrier|scroll of blade barrier
ITEM_SCROLL_OF_BLADE_BARRIER_DESC||item description for Scroll of Blade Barrier|A sharp-edged ward-script. Creates a 3x3 ring of whirling blades for 1 minute.
ITEM_SCROLL_OF_FIRE_SEEDS_NAME|64|item display name for Scroll of Fire Seeds|scroll of fire seeds
ITEM_SCROLL_OF_FIRE_SEEDS_DESC||item description for Scroll of Fire Seeds|A singed seed-script. Scatters six fiery seeds in a 3x3 area; they explode when stepped on or after several turns.
ITEM_SCROLL_OF_HARM_NAME|64|item display name for Scroll of Harm|scroll of harm
ITEM_SCROLL_OF_HARM_DESC||item description for Scroll of Harm|A black death-prayer. Touches one living creature with devastating harm.
ITEM_SCROLL_OF_HEAL_NAME|64|item display name for Scroll of Heal|scroll of heal
ITEM_SCROLL_OF_HEAL_DESC||item description for Scroll of Heal|A bright healing liturgy. Restores most HP and clears major conditions.
ITEM_SCROLL_OF_HEROES_FEAST_NAME|64|item display name for Scroll of Heroes' Feast|scroll of heroes' feast
ITEM_SCROLL_OF_HEROES_FEAST_DESC||item description for Scroll of Heroes' Feast|A rare celebrant's rite. Channels a feast that grants +1 attributes, fear immunity, and poison and disease warding for 10 minutes.
ITEM_SCROLL_OF_STONE_TELL_NAME|64|item display name for Scroll of Stone Tell|scroll of stone tell
ITEM_SCROLL_OF_STONE_TELL_DESC||item description for Scroll of Stone Tell|A chiseled revelation. The dungeon stone reveals nearby hidden doors, traps, and creature traces.
ITEM_SCROLL_OF_WORD_OF_RECALL_NAME|64|item display name for Scroll of Word of Recall|scroll of word of recall
ITEM_SCROLL_OF_WORD_OF_RECALL_DESC||item description for Scroll of Word of Recall|A homeward protection-script. Returns you to this floor's entry point or last sanctuary if the space is clear.
ITEM_SCROLL_OF_CREEPING_DOOM_NAME|64|item display name for Scroll of Creeping Doom|scroll of creeping doom
ITEM_SCROLL_OF_CREEPING_DOOM_DESC||item description for Scroll of Creeping Doom|A crawling plague-script. Releases a slow swarm that blocks sight, disrupts casting, and damages engulfed creatures.
ITEM_SCROLL_OF_MONSTER_SUMMONING_I_NAME|64|item display name for Scroll of Monster Summoning I|scroll of monster summoning i
ITEM_SCROLL_OF_MONSTER_SUMMONING_I_DESC||item description for Scroll of Monster Summoning I|A rough conjuring script. Summons a random weak group of temporary allies for 2 minutes.
ITEM_SCROLL_OF_MONSTER_SUMMONING_II_NAME|64|item display name for Scroll of Monster Summoning II|scroll of monster summoning ii
ITEM_SCROLL_OF_MONSTER_SUMMONING_II_DESC||item description for Scroll of Monster Summoning II|A steadier conjuring script. Summons a random tougher group of temporary allies for 2 minutes.
ITEM_SCROLL_OF_MONSTER_SUMMONING_III_NAME|64|item display name for Scroll of Monster Summoning III|scroll of monster summoning iii
ITEM_SCROLL_OF_MONSTER_SUMMONING_III_DESC||item description for Scroll of Monster Summoning III|A strong conjuring script. Summons a random strong ally or small pack for 2 minutes.
ITEM_SCROLL_OF_MONSTER_SUMMONING_IV_NAME|64|item display name for Scroll of Monster Summoning IV|scroll of monster summoning iv
ITEM_SCROLL_OF_MONSTER_SUMMONING_IV_DESC||item description for Scroll of Monster Summoning IV|A heavy conjuring script. Summons a troll, owlbear, or lesser elemental ally for 2 minutes.
ITEM_SCROLL_OF_MONSTER_SUMMONING_V_NAME|64|item display name for Scroll of Monster Summoning V|scroll of monster summoning v
ITEM_SCROLL_OF_MONSTER_SUMMONING_V_DESC||item description for Scroll of Monster Summoning V|A powerful conjuring script. Summons a random powerful ally for 2 minutes.
ITEM_SCROLL_OF_MONSTER_SUMMONING_VI_NAME|64|item display name for Scroll of Monster Summoning VI|scroll of monster summoning vi
ITEM_SCROLL_OF_MONSTER_SUMMONING_VI_DESC||item description for Scroll of Monster Summoning VI|A formidable conjuring script. Summons a random formidable ally for 2 minutes.
ITEM_SCROLL_OF_MONSTER_SUMMONING_VII_NAME|64|item display name for Scroll of Monster Summoning VII|scroll of monster summoning vii
ITEM_SCROLL_OF_MONSTER_SUMMONING_VII_DESC||item description for Scroll of Monster Summoning VII|A legendary conjuring script. Summons a random legendary ally for 2 minutes.
ITEM_SCROLL_OF_PHANTASMAL_FORCE_NAME|64|item display name for Scroll of Phantasmal Force|scroll of phantasmal force
ITEM_SCROLL_OF_PHANTASMAL_FORCE_DESC||item description for Scroll of Phantasmal Force|A vivid illusion script. Confuses and briefly stuns a thinking target unless it makes an INT save.
ITEM_SCROLL_OF_DISPLACEMENT_NAME|64|item display name for Scroll of Displacement|scroll of displacement
ITEM_SCROLL_OF_DISPLACEMENT_DESC||item description for Scroll of Displacement|A sliding-light script. Grants Displacement: +4 DEF for 1 minute.
ITEM_SCROLL_OF_FALSE_LIFE_NAME|64|item display name for Scroll of False Life|scroll of false life
ITEM_SCROLL_OF_FALSE_LIFE_DESC||item description for Scroll of False Life|A black-violet vitality script. Grants 1d8+INT temporary HP for 1 minute.
ITEM_SCROLL_OF_SPECTRAL_HAND_NAME|64|item display name for Scroll of Spectral Hand|scroll of spectral hand
ITEM_SCROLL_OF_SPECTRAL_HAND_DESC||item description for Scroll of Spectral Hand|A pale necromantic script. Projects a ghostly hand so arcane necromancy touch spells reach range 5 for 1 minute.
ITEM_SCROLL_OF_GHOUL_TOUCH_NAME|64|item display name for Scroll of Ghoul Touch|scroll of ghoul touch
ITEM_SCROLL_OF_GHOUL_TOUCH_DESC||item description for Scroll of Ghoul Touch|A grave-cold touch script. Damages a living target and paralyzes it unless it makes a CON save.
ITEM_SCROLL_OF_ENERVATION_NAME|64|item display name for Scroll of Enervation|scroll of enervation
ITEM_SCROLL_OF_ENERVATION_DESC||item description for Scroll of Enervation|A black ray script. Drains a living target for 1 minute unless it makes a CON save.
ITEM_SCROLL_OF_LESSER_SHADOW_MONSTERS_NAME|80|item display name for Scroll of Lesser Shadow Monsters|scroll of lesser shadow monsters
ITEM_SCROLL_OF_LESSER_SHADOW_MONSTERS_DESC||item description for Scroll of Lesser Shadow Monsters|A dim illusion script. Shapes a brief weak shadow ally near you.
ITEM_SCROLL_OF_SHADOW_MONSTERS_NAME|64|item display name for Scroll of Shadow Monsters|scroll of shadow monsters
ITEM_SCROLL_OF_SHADOW_MONSTERS_DESC||item description for Scroll of Shadow Monsters|A deep shadow script. Shapes brief quasi-real shadow allies near you.
ITEM_SCROLL_OF_GREATER_SHADOW_MONSTERS_NAME|80|item display name for Scroll of Greater Shadow Monsters|scroll of greater shadow monsters
ITEM_SCROLL_OF_GREATER_SHADOW_MONSTERS_DESC||item description for Scroll of Greater Shadow Monsters|A heavy shadow script. Shapes a brief greater shadow ally near you.
ITEM_SCROLL_OF_CONTACT_OTHER_PLANE_NAME|80|item display name for Scroll of Contact Other Plane|scroll of contact other plane
ITEM_SCROLL_OF_CONTACT_OTHER_PLANE_DESC||item description for Scroll of Contact Other Plane|A dangerous divination script. Opens a channel beyond the mortal world to reveal valuable hidden facts, with risk of backlash.
ITEM_SCROLL_OF_LEGEND_LORE_NAME|64|item display name for Scroll of Legend Lore|scroll of legend lore
ITEM_SCROLL_OF_LEGEND_LORE_DESC||item description for Scroll of Legend Lore|An old-name divination script. Gives a vague omen toward an existing artifact somewhere in the known world.
ITEM_SCROLL_OF_FORESIGHT_NAME|64|item display name for Scroll of Foresight|scroll of foresight
ITEM_SCROLL_OF_FORESIGHT_DESC||item description for Scroll of Foresight|A future-reading script. For 1 minute, anticipates traps and avoids the next incoming weapon hit.
ITEM_SCROLL_OF_HOLD_MONSTER_NAME|64|item display name for Scroll of Hold Monster|scroll of hold monster
ITEM_SCROLL_OF_HOLD_MONSTER_DESC||item description for Scroll of Hold Monster|A binding script. Paralyzes a living monster for 3 turns unless it makes a WIS save.
ITEM_SCROLL_OF_GEAS_NAME|64|item display name for Scroll of Geas|scroll of geas
ITEM_SCROLL_OF_GEAS_DESC||item description for Scroll of Geas|A commanding script. Places a sacred compulsion on a thinking target that fails its save.
ITEM_SCROLL_OF_COMPELLED_DANCE_NAME|64|item display name for Scroll of Compelled Dance|scroll of compelled dance
ITEM_SCROLL_OF_COMPELLED_DANCE_DESC||item description for Scroll of Compelled Dance|A cruel enchantment script. Forces a thinking creature into helpless movement unless it makes a WIS save.
ITEM_SCROLL_OF_HORRID_WILTING_NAME|64|item display name for Scroll of Horrid Wilting|scroll of horrid wilting
ITEM_SCROLL_OF_HORRID_WILTING_DESC||item description for Scroll of Horrid Wilting|A severe death-script. Drains moisture from living creatures in a 5x5 area, CON save for half.
ITEM_SCROLL_OF_CLONE_NAME|64|item display name for Scroll of Clone|scroll of clone
ITEM_SCROLL_OF_CLONE_DESC||item description for Scroll of Clone|A costly flesh-script. Grows a permanent clone body nearby, costing 1 permanent CON.
ITEM_SCROLL_OF_WEIRD_NAME|64|item display name for Scroll of Weird|scroll of weird
ITEM_SCROLL_OF_WEIRD_DESC||item description for Scroll of Weird|A nightmare illusion script. Unleashes phantasmal horrors in a 5x5 area, WIS save for half and no stun.
ITEM_SCROLL_OF_WISH_NAME|64|item display name for Scroll of Wish|scroll of wish
ITEM_SCROLL_OF_WISH_DESC||item description for Scroll of Wish|A dangerous ultimate script. Choose one random miracle, then permanently lose maximum MP and HP.
ITEM_WAND_OF_FIRE_BOLT_NAME|64|item display name for Wand of Fire Bolt|wand of fire bolt
ITEM_WAND_OF_FIRE_BOLT_DESC||item description for Wand of Fire Bolt|A scorched wand banked with Fire Bolt, dealing 1d4+INT fire damage on hit.
ITEM_WAND_OF_FROST_SPIKE_NAME|64|item display name for Wand of Frost Spike|wand of frost spike
ITEM_WAND_OF_FROST_SPIKE_DESC||item description for Wand of Frost Spike|A pale blue wand banked with Frost Spike, dealing 1d3+INT cold damage and chilling the target for 3 turns unless it makes a CON save.
ITEM_WAND_OF_ARCANE_GRASP_NAME|64|item display name for Wand of Arcane Grasp|wand of arcane grasp
ITEM_WAND_OF_ARCANE_GRASP_DESC||item description for Wand of Arcane Grasp|A knot-carved wand banked with Arcane Grasp, restraining one nearby creature while your off hand stays free.
ITEM_WAND_OF_LIGHTNING_BOLT_NAME|64|item display name for Wand of Lightning Bolt|wand of lightning bolt
ITEM_WAND_OF_LIGHTNING_BOLT_DESC||item description for Wand of Lightning Bolt|A bright ironwood wand banked with Lightning Bolt, a bouncing line for 3d6+INT shock damage with a DEX save for half.
ITEM_WAND_OF_ACID_ARROW_NAME|64|item display name for Wand of Acid Arrow|wand of acid arrow
ITEM_WAND_OF_ACID_ARROW_DESC||item description for Wand of Acid Arrow|A green-veined wand banked with Acid Arrow, dealing 2d4+INT acid damage and leaving acid on the target tile.
ITEM_WAND_OF_WEB_NAME|64|item display name for Wand of Web|wand of web
ITEM_WAND_OF_WEB_DESC||item description for Wand of Web|A sticky rune-wrapped wand banked with Web, spreading 3x3 webs that can restrain creatures for 2 turns on a failed DEX save.
ITEM_WAND_OF_SCORCHING_RAY_NAME|64|item display name for Wand of Scorching Ray|wand of scorching ray
ITEM_WAND_OF_SCORCHING_RAY_DESC||item description for Wand of Scorching Ray|A heat-striped wand banked with Scorching Ray, dealing 2d6+INT fire damage on hit.
ITEM_WAND_OF_CHAIN_LIGHTNING_NAME|64|item display name for Wand of Chain Lightning|wand of chain lightning
ITEM_WAND_OF_CHAIN_LIGHTNING_DESC||item description for Wand of Chain Lightning|A rare storm-banked wand. Chain Lightning deals 4d6+INT shock damage, then jumps to up to 2 nearby non-neutral creatures for 2d6+INT each.
ITEM_WAND_OF_FORCE_BLAST_NAME|64|item display name for Wand of Force Blast|wand of force blast
ITEM_WAND_OF_FORCE_BLAST_DESC||item description for Wand of Force Blast|A dense knot-carved wand banked with Force Blast, dealing 2d4+INT physical force damage and pushing on a failed STR save.
ITEM_WAND_OF_SHATTER_NAME|64|item display name for Wand of Shatter|wand of shatter
ITEM_WAND_OF_SHATTER_DESC||item description for Wand of Shatter|A brittle crystal-banded wand. Shatter hits combatants in a 3x3 area, including you and allies, for 2d4+INT force damage, CON save for half, and wrecks loose objects.
ITEM_WAND_OF_SLEEP_NAME|64|item display name for Wand of Sleep|wand of sleep
ITEM_WAND_OF_SLEEP_DESC||item description for Wand of Sleep|A pale dream-marked wand banked with Sleep, putting a creature to sleep for 3 turns unless it makes a WIS save.
ITEM_WAND_OF_SLOW_NAME|64|item display name for Wand of Slow|wand of slow
ITEM_WAND_OF_SLOW_DESC||item description for Wand of Slow|A lead-dark wand banked with Slow, making a target skip every other turn for 10 turns unless it makes a CON save.
ITEM_WAND_OF_CONFUSION_NAME|64|item display name for Wand of Confusion|wand of confusion
ITEM_WAND_OF_CONFUSION_DESC||item description for Wand of Confusion|A wavering spiral-marked wand banked with Confusion, making a target wander randomly for 5 turns unless it makes a WIS save.
ITEM_WAND_OF_FIREBALL_NAME|64|item display name for Wand of Fireball|wand of fireball
ITEM_WAND_OF_FIREBALL_DESC||item description for Wand of Fireball|A heat-heavy wand banked with Fireball, exploding in radius 1 for 3d6+INT fire damage with a DEX save for half. It can catch you and allies.
ITEM_WAND_OF_CONE_OF_COLD_NAME|64|item display name for Wand of Cone of Cold|wand of cone of cold
ITEM_WAND_OF_CONE_OF_COLD_DESC||item description for Wand of Cone of Cold|A white-blue wand banked with Cone of Cold, blasting a cone for 5d6+INT cold damage, DEX save for half, and leaving ice.
ITEM_WAND_OF_DISINTEGRATE_NAME|64|item display name for Wand of Disintegrate|wand of disintegrate
ITEM_WAND_OF_DISINTEGRATE_DESC||item description for Wand of Disintegrate|A rare ash-green wand banked with Disintegrate, channeling a ray for 8d6+INT force damage with a CON save for half.
ITEM_WAND_OF_SACRED_BOLT_NAME|64|item display name for Wand of Sacred Bolt|wand of sacred bolt
