ITEM_WAND_OF_TELEKINESIS_DESC||item description for Wand of Telekinesis|A long fine wand banked with Telekinesis, throwing a target up to 5 tiles unless it makes a STR save. Collisions deal 3d6+INT physical damage and stun.
