ITEM_FUR_GLOVES_DESC||item description for Fur Gloves|Fur-lined gloves cut for bad weather, watch posts, and cold rope work.
ITEM_TOOL_BELT_NAME|64|item display name for Tool Belt|tool belt
ITEM_TOOL_BELT_DESC||item description for Tool Belt|A broad working belt with loops, ties, and hooks for small gear. It gives +2 repair checks, +1 trap-disarm checks, and makes non-medical kits wear 4% less.
ITEM_CLIMBER_S_HARNESS_NAME|64|item display name for Climber's Harness|climber's harness
ITEM_CLIMBER_S_HARNESS_DESC||item description for Climber's Harness|A belt and strap rig meant to take rope, hooks, and body weight without coming apart first.
ITEM_SOFT_SHOES_NAME|64|item display name for Soft Shoes|soft shoes
ITEM_SOFT_SHOES_DESC||item description for Soft Shoes|Light leather shoes with thin flexible soles, suited to floorboards and hallways.
ITEM_HOBNAILED_BOOTS_NAME|64|item display name for Hobnailed Boots|hobnailed boots
ITEM_HOBNAILED_BOOTS_DESC||item description for Hobnailed Boots|Stout boots with nailed soles and a harder toe, built for bad ground and long rough miles.
ITEM_WADING_BOOTS_NAME|64|item display name for Wading Boots|wading boots
ITEM_WADING_BOOTS_DESC||item description for Wading Boots|High waxed boots cut for muck and shallow water. They give 35% water hazard protection to foot gear.
ITEM_STEEL_SABATONS_NAME|64|item display name for Steel Sabatons|steel sabatons
ITEM_STEEL_SABATONS_DESC||item description for Steel Sabatons|Heavy steel foot armor hinged over stout soles. It protects the feet but is noisy.
ITEM_WICKER_SHIELD_NAME|64|item display name for Wicker Shield|wicker shield
ITEM_WICKER_SHIELD_DESC||item description for Wicker Shield|A cheap woven shield faced with hide. It is light in the hand and offers modest protection.
ITEM_PAVISE_NAME|64|item display name for Pavise|pavise
ITEM_PAVISE_DESC||item description for Pavise|A tall board shield with broad coverage and heavy weight.
ITEM_LANTERN_SHIELD_NAME|64|item display name for Lantern Shield|lantern shield
ITEM_LANTERN_SHIELD_DESC||item description for Lantern Shield|A reinforced round shield with a guarded lantern bracket and heavier ironwork than a plain marcher would choose.
ITEM_TOWER_SHIELD_NAME|64|item display name for Tower Shield|tower shield
ITEM_TOWER_SHIELD_DESC||item description for Tower Shield|A broad standing war shield with very wide coverage and heavy weight.
ITEM_LINEN_ROBE_NAME|64|item display name for Linen Robe|linen robe
ITEM_LINEN_ROBE_DESC||item description for Linen Robe|A plain linen robe with broad sleeves and a tied waist. It offers comfort, not protection.
ITEM_PADDED_ROBE_NAME|64|item display name for Padded Robe|padded robe
ITEM_PADDED_ROBE_DESC||item description for Padded Robe|A thick robe with quilted panels under the outer cloth. It offers light padded protection.
ITEM_SCHOLAR_S_COAT_NAME|64|item display name for Scholar's Coat|scholar's coat
ITEM_SCHOLAR_S_COAT_DESC||item description for Scholar's Coat|A layered long coat cut for travel and study in bad weather.
ITEM_QUILTED_COAT_NAME|64|item display name for Quilted Coat|quilted coat
ITEM_QUILTED_COAT_DESC||item description for Quilted Coat|A dense quilted coat with extra padding through the chest and shoulders, built to blunt impact without metal.
ITEM_HIDE_JERKIN_NAME|64|item display name for Hide Jerkin|hide jerkin
ITEM_HIDE_JERKIN_DESC||item description for Hide Jerkin|A jerkin of thick cured hide cut close to the ribs and shoulders. It smells faintly of smoke and oil.
ITEM_REINFORCED_LEATHER_CUIRASS_NAME|64|item display name for Reinforced Leather Cuirass|reinforced leather cuirass
ITEM_REINFORCED_LEATHER_CUIRASS_DESC||item description for Reinforced Leather Cuirass|A fitted leather cuirass with reinforced ribs, shoulders, and belly guards. It gives solid protection without mail weight.
ITEM_BRIGANDINE_VEST_NAME|64|item display name for Brigandine Vest|brigandine vest
ITEM_BRIGANDINE_VEST_DESC||item description for Brigandine Vest|A fitted leather vest with hard internal plates and a close waist. It favors protection over footwork.
ITEM_OILSKIN_COAT_NAME|64|item display name for Oilskin Coat|oilskin coat
ITEM_OILSKIN_COAT_DESC||item description for Oilskin Coat|A waxed long coat suited to wet roads and dock winds. It gives 20% water hazard protection to exposed gear.
ITEM_WEIGHTED_NET_NAME|64|item display name for Weighted Net|weighted net
ITEM_WEIGHTED_NET_DESC||item description for Weighted Net|A heavier cast net with dense sinker knots and tighter mesh. Throw it to force a harder DEX save; failure restrains a target for 5 turns and stuns it for 2 turns.
ITEM_MITHRIL_COIF_NAME|64|item display name for Mithril Coif|mithril coif
ITEM_MITHRIL_COIF_DESC||item description for Mithril Coif|A close-woven hood of pale mithril links cut in an elven pattern. It keeps the give of mail without the usual rattle and drag.
ITEM_MITHRIL_CHAIN_SHIRT_NAME|64|item display name for Mithril Chain Shirt|mithril chain shirt
ITEM_MITHRIL_CHAIN_SHIRT_DESC||item description for Mithril Chain Shirt|A fitted shirt of pale mithril links over soft backing cloth, tailored in a lean elven cut. It carries like good leather and gives strong mail protection.
ITEM_MITHRIL_CHAIN_BELT_NAME|64|item display name for Mithril Chain Belt|mithril chain belt
ITEM_MITHRIL_CHAIN_BELT_DESC||item description for Mithril Chain Belt|A supple belt of pale mithril mail and narrow hanging scales, cut in an elven pattern.
ITEM_MONSTER_CORPSE_NAME|64|item display name for Monster Corpse|monster corpse
ITEM_MONSTER_CORPSE_DESC||item description for Monster Corpse|A dead body too battered or strange to identify cleanly, with old blood and torn hide.
ITEM_POTION_OF_CURE_POISON_NAME|64|item display name for Potion of Cure Poison|potion of cure poison
ITEM_POTION_OF_CURE_POISON_DESC||item description for Potion of Cure Poison|A bitter green draught. Cures poison completely.
ITEM_POTION_OF_CURE_SICKNESS_NAME|64|item display name for Potion of Cure Sickness|potion of cure sickness
ITEM_POTION_OF_CURE_SICKNESS_DESC||item description for Potion of Cure Sickness|A sharp medicinal draught. Cures sickness completely.
ITEM_DECOY_NAME|64|item display name for Decoy|decoy
ITEM_DECOY_DESC||item description for Decoy|A quick-set clacker frame with bright strips and a weighted base. Place it beside you to draw enemy attacks like a fragile training dummy.
ITEM_PILGRIM_S_HOLY_SYMBOL_NAME|64|item display name for Pilgrim's Holy Symbol|pilgrim's holy symbol
ITEM_PILGRIM_S_HOLY_SYMBOL_DESC||item description for Pilgrim's Holy Symbol|A travel-worn holy symbol on a leather thong, marked by shrine soot, road dust, and the hand-polish of long steady prayer.
ITEM_THRESHOLD_HOLY_SYMBOL_NAME|64|item display name for Threshold Holy Symbol|threshold holy symbol
ITEM_THRESHOLD_HOLY_SYMBOL_DESC||item description for Threshold Holy Symbol|A compact silver holy symbol worked with tight threshold script.
ITEM_WARDING_HOLY_SYMBOL_NAME|64|retired item display name for Warding Holy Symbol|warding holy symbol
ITEM_WARDING_HOLY_SYMBOL_DESC||retired item description for Warding Holy Symbol|A compact silver holy symbol worked with tight defensive lines and old threshold script.
ITEM_MERCIFUL_HOLY_SYMBOL_NAME|64|item display name for Merciful Holy Symbol|merciful holy symbol
ITEM_MERCIFUL_HOLY_SYMBOL_DESC||item description for Merciful Holy Symbol|A white enamel holy symbol softened at the edges from years of bedside use.
ITEM_SANCTIFIED_HOLY_SYMBOL_NAME|64|item display name for Sanctified Holy Symbol|sanctified holy symbol
ITEM_SANCTIFIED_HOLY_SYMBOL_DESC||item description for Sanctified Holy Symbol|A carefully blessed holy symbol with a bright clean edge to its script.
ITEM_EXORCIST_S_HOLY_SYMBOL_NAME|64|item display name for Exorcist's Holy Symbol|exorcist's holy symbol
ITEM_EXORCIST_S_HOLY_SYMBOL_DESC||item description for Exorcist's Holy Symbol|A severe iron holy symbol blackened by incense smoke and marked with cutting prayers against the restless dead.
ITEM_CONSECRATED_HOLY_SYMBOL_NAME|64|item display name for Consecrated Holy Symbol|consecrated holy symbol
ITEM_CONSECRATED_HOLY_SYMBOL_DESC||item description for Consecrated Holy Symbol|A stone-set holy symbol cut for shrine-work, grave-lines, and the hallowing of doubtful ground.
ITEM_HOSPITALLER_S_HOLY_SYMBOL_NAME|64|item display name for Hospitaller's Holy Symbol|hospitaller's holy symbol
ITEM_HOSPITALLER_S_HOLY_SYMBOL_DESC||item description for Hospitaller's Holy Symbol|A white holy symbol carried by ward priests and battlefield healers.
ITEM_BEACON_HOLY_SYMBOL_NAME|64|item display name for Beacon Holy Symbol|beacon holy symbol
ITEM_BEACON_HOLY_SYMBOL_DESC||item description for Beacon Holy Symbol|A lightglass-set holy symbol with a polished beacon lens.
ITEM_SAINTLY_HOLY_SYMBOL_NAME|64|item display name for Saintly Holy Symbol|saintly holy symbol
ITEM_SAINTLY_HOLY_SYMBOL_DESC||item description for Saintly Holy Symbol|A careful silver holy symbol carrying a small saint's mark below the bail.
ITEM_MARTYR_S_HOLY_SYMBOL_NAME|64|item display name for Martyr's Holy Symbol|martyr's holy symbol
ITEM_MARTYR_S_HOLY_SYMBOL_DESC||item description for Martyr's Holy Symbol|A red-enamel holy symbol worn smooth around a prayer of endurance.
ITEM_SUNBURST_HOLY_SYMBOL_NAME|64|item display name for Sunburst Holy Symbol|sunburst holy symbol
ITEM_SUNBURST_HOLY_SYMBOL_DESC||item description for Sunburst Holy Symbol|A bright gold-washed holy symbol cut with a stern sunburst face.
ITEM_CERAMIC_HOLY_SYMBOL_VIGIL_NAME|64|item display name for ceramic holy symbol "Vigil"|ceramic holy symbol "Vigil"
ITEM_CERAMIC_HOLY_SYMBOL_VIGIL_DESC||item description for ceramic holy symbol "Vigil"|A ceramic holy symbol, sternly made and too carefully warded for ordinary prayer.
ITEM_SCORCHED_HOLY_SYMBOL_OF_ISTARIS_NAME|64|item display name for Scorched Holy Symbol of Istaris|scorched holy symbol of istaris
ITEM_SCORCHED_HOLY_SYMBOL_OF_ISTARIS_DESC||item description for Scorched Holy Symbol of Istaris|A fire-dark holy symbol veined with ember-red cracks.
ITEM_CHEAP_CAMOUFLAGE_KIT_NAME|64|item display name for Cheap Camouflage Kit|cheap camouflage kit
ITEM_CHEAP_CAMOUFLAGE_KIT_DESC||item description for Cheap Camouflage Kit|A rough bundle of netting strips, soot cloth, and bent pegs. It can prepare a concealed indoor rest spot and loses about 28% durability per use.
ITEM_CAMOUFLAGE_KIT_NAME|64|item display name for Camouflage Kit|camouflage kit
ITEM_CAMOUFLAGE_KIT_DESC||item description for Camouflage Kit|A compact field bundle of drab netting, matte cloth, cords, and pins. It prepares a better concealed indoor rest spot and loses about 20% durability per use.
ITEM_POTION_OF_HOLY_ESSENCE_NAME|64|item display name for Potion of Holy Essence|potion of holy essence
ITEM_POTION_OF_HOLY_ESSENCE_DESC||item description for Potion of Holy Essence|A warm gold-white draught blessed with clear temple oil. Restores 1d5+3 PP.
ITEM_AMULET_OF_LUCK_1_NAME|64|item display name for Amulet of Luck +1|amulet of luck +1
ITEM_AMULET_OF_LUCK_1_DESC||item description for Amulet of Luck +1|A bright charm worked with old chance-knots. It grants +1 luck.
ITEM_AMULET_OF_LUCK_1_UNIDENTIFIED_NAME|64|unidentified item display name for Amulet of Luck +1|bright amulet
ITEM_AMULET_OF_LUCK_1_UNIDENTIFIED_DESC||unidentified item description for Amulet of Luck +1|Unidentified jewelry can hide blessings, curses, or other magic beneath plain metalwork.
ITEM_AMULET_OF_LUCK_2_NAME|64|item display name for Amulet of Luck +2|amulet of luck +2
ITEM_AMULET_OF_LUCK_2_DESC||item description for Amulet of Luck +2|A bright charm with layered chance-knots. It grants +2 luck.
ITEM_AMULET_OF_LUCK_2_UNIDENTIFIED_NAME|64|unidentified item display name for Amulet of Luck +2|bright amulet
ITEM_AMULET_OF_LUCK_2_UNIDENTIFIED_DESC||unidentified item description for Amulet of Luck +2|Unidentified jewelry can hide blessings, curses, or other magic beneath plain metalwork.
ITEM_AMULET_OF_LUCK_3_NAME|64|item display name for Amulet of Luck +3|amulet of luck +3
ITEM_AMULET_OF_LUCK_3_DESC||item description for Amulet of Luck +3|A bright charm with dense chance-knots. It grants +3 luck.
ITEM_AMULET_OF_LUCK_3_UNIDENTIFIED_NAME|64|unidentified item display name for Amulet of Luck +3|bright amulet
ITEM_AMULET_OF_LUCK_3_UNIDENTIFIED_DESC||unidentified item description for Amulet of Luck +3|Unidentified jewelry can hide blessings, curses, or other magic beneath plain metalwork.
ITEM_LUCKY_CHARM_1_NAME|64|item display name for Lucky Charm +1|lucky charm +1
ITEM_LUCKY_CHARM_1_DESC||item description for Lucky Charm +1|A little field charm of cord and bright thread. It grants +1 luck.
ITEM_LUCKY_CHARM_2_NAME|64|item display name for Lucky Charm +2|lucky charm +2
ITEM_LUCKY_CHARM_2_DESC||item description for Lucky Charm +2|A carefully knotted field charm set with a pale bead. It grants +2 luck.
ITEM_LUCKY_CHARM_3_NAME|64|item display name for Lucky Charm +3|lucky charm +3
ITEM_LUCKY_CHARM_3_DESC||item description for Lucky Charm +3|A dense field charm of layered cord knots. It grants +3 luck.
ITEM_SMUGGLER_S_LEAD_SEAL_NAME|64|item display name for Smuggler's Lead Seal|smuggler's lead seal
ITEM_SMUGGLER_S_LEAD_SEAL_DESC||item description for Smuggler's Lead Seal|A rubbed-smooth lead cargo seal marked with an old crew sign. The Smuggler asked you to recover it intact.
ITEM_FINE_RATIONS_NAME|64|item display name for Fine Rations|fine rations
ITEM_FINE_RATIONS_DESC||item description for Fine Rations|A clean wrapped ration of cured meat, pressed fruit, hard cheese, and good travel bread. Takes 3 turns to eat and is filling.
ITEM_ELVEN_RATIONS_NAME|64|item display name for Elven Rations|elven rations
ITEM_ELVEN_RATIONS_DESC||item description for Elven Rations|Thin sealed waybread with dried orchard fruit and herb-salt. Takes 3 turns to eat, gives less nutrition than common rations, and weighs very little.
ITEM_GRAVEWARDEN_S_HOLY_SYMBOL_NAME|64|item display name for Gravewarden's Holy Symbol|gravewarden's holy symbol
ITEM_GRAVEWARDEN_S_HOLY_SYMBOL_DESC||item description for Gravewarden's Holy Symbol|An old grave-priest's holy symbol of pale stone and blackened silver. A small notch steadies the hand against restless spirits.
ITEM_WAYWARDEN_S_HOLY_SYMBOL_NAME|64|retired item display name for Waywarden's Holy Symbol|waywarden's holy symbol
ITEM_WAYWARDEN_S_HOLY_SYMBOL_DESC||retired item description for Waywarden's Holy Symbol|An old road-priest's holy symbol of pale stone and blackened silver. A small waymark notch steadies the hand against restless spirits.
ITEM_JAGGED_BLACKGLASS_GREATAXE_SHARDCROWN_NAME|64|item display name for jagged blackglass greataxe "Shardcrown"|jagged blackglass greataxe "Shardcrown"
ITEM_JAGGED_BLACKGLASS_GREATAXE_SHARDCROWN_DESC||item description for jagged blackglass greataxe "Shardcrown"|A two-handed blackglass axe with a jagged crown-shaped head and a dark edge that keeps its cut. Critical hits cause bleeding.
ITEM_JAGGED_BLACKGLASS_GREATAXE_SHARDCROWN_UNIDENTIFIED_NAME|64|unidentified item display name for jagged blackglass greataxe "Shardcrown"|jagged blackglass greataxe
ITEM_FRACTURED_BLACKGLASS_SHIELD_SCARHEART_NAME|64|item display name for fractured blackglass shield "Scarheart"|fractured blackglass shield "Scarheart"
ITEM_FRACTURED_BLACKGLASS_SHIELD_SCARHEART_DESC||item description for fractured blackglass shield "Scarheart"|A fractured blackglass shield granting +5 DEF, +12 ARM, and 20% magic resistance.
ITEM_FRACTURED_BLACKGLASS_SHIELD_SCARHEART_UNIDENTIFIED_NAME|64|unidentified item display name for fractured blackglass shield "Scarheart"|kite shield
ITEM_FRACTURED_BLACKGLASS_SHIELD_SCARHEART_UNIDENTIFIED_DESC||unidentified item description for fractured blackglass shield "Scarheart"|A tall tapered shield built to cover shoulder, heart, and shin in one disciplined line.
ITEM_POTION_OF_CURE_DISEASE_NAME|64|item display name for Potion of Cure Disease|potion of cure disease
ITEM_POTION_OF_CURE_DISEASE_DESC||item description for Potion of Cure Disease|A strong medicinal draught. Cures disease completely.
ITEM_SCROLL_OF_CURE_DISEASE_NAME|64|item display name for Scroll of Cure Disease|scroll of cure disease
ITEM_SCROLL_OF_CURE_DISEASE_DESC||item description for Scroll of Cure Disease|Cures disease completely.
ITEM_WAND_OF_CURE_DISEASE_NAME|64|item display name for Wand of Cure Disease|wand of cure disease
ITEM_WAND_OF_CURE_DISEASE_DESC||item description for Wand of Cure Disease|A white ash wand banked with Cure Disease.
ITEM_WAND_OF_CURE_LIGHT_WOUNDS_NAME|64|item display name for Wand of Cure Light Wounds|wand of cure light wounds
ITEM_WAND_OF_CURE_LIGHT_WOUNDS_DESC||item description for Wand of Cure Light Wounds|A white ash wand banked with Cure Light Wounds, restoring 1d8+WIS HP.
ITEM_WAND_OF_CURE_MODERATE_WOUNDS_NAME|72|item display name for Wand of Cure Moderate Wounds|wand of cure moderate wounds
ITEM_WAND_OF_CURE_MODERATE_WOUNDS_DESC||item description for Wand of Cure Moderate Wounds|A white ash wand banked with Cure Moderate Wounds, restoring 2d8+WIS HP.
ITEM_WAND_OF_CURE_SERIOUS_WOUNDS_NAME|72|item display name for Wand of Cure Serious Wounds|wand of cure serious wounds
ITEM_WAND_OF_CURE_SERIOUS_WOUNDS_DESC||item description for Wand of Cure Serious Wounds|A polished white ash wand banked with Cure Serious Wounds, restoring 3d8+WIS HP.
ITEM_WAND_OF_CURE_CRITICAL_WOUNDS_NAME|72|item display name for Wand of Cure Critical Wounds|wand of cure critical wounds
ITEM_WAND_OF_CURE_CRITICAL_WOUNDS_DESC||item description for Wand of Cure Critical Wounds|A polished white ash wand banked with Cure Critical Wounds, restoring 4d8+WIS HP.
ITEM_WAND_OF_CAUSE_LIGHT_WOUNDS_NAME|64|item display name for Wand of Cause Light Wounds|wand of cause light wounds
ITEM_WAND_OF_CAUSE_LIGHT_WOUNDS_DESC||item description for Wand of Cause Light Wounds|A black ash wand banked with Cause Light Wounds, dealing 1d8+WIS damage on a touch.
ITEM_WAND_OF_CAUSE_MODERATE_WOUNDS_NAME|72|item display name for Wand of Cause Moderate Wounds|wand of cause moderate wounds
ITEM_WAND_OF_CAUSE_MODERATE_WOUNDS_DESC||item description for Wand of Cause Moderate Wounds|A black ash wand banked with Cause Moderate Wounds, dealing 2d8+WIS damage on a touch.
ITEM_WAND_OF_CAUSE_SERIOUS_WOUNDS_NAME|72|item display name for Wand of Cause Serious Wounds|wand of cause serious wounds
ITEM_WAND_OF_CAUSE_SERIOUS_WOUNDS_DESC||item description for Wand of Cause Serious Wounds|A polished black ash wand banked with Cause Serious Wounds, dealing 3d8+WIS damage on a touch.
ITEM_WAND_OF_CAUSE_CRITICAL_WOUNDS_NAME|72|item display name for Wand of Cause Critical Wounds|wand of cause critical wounds
ITEM_WAND_OF_CAUSE_CRITICAL_WOUNDS_DESC||item description for Wand of Cause Critical Wounds|A polished black ash wand banked with Cause Critical Wounds, dealing 4d8+WIS damage on a touch.
ITEM_WAND_OF_DEATH_WARD_NAME|64|item display name for Wand of Death Ward|wand of death ward
ITEM_WAND_OF_DEATH_WARD_DESC||item description for Wand of Death Ward|A black ash wand banked with Death Ward.
ITEM_WAND_OF_RESTORATION_NAME|64|item display name for Wand of Restoration|wand of restoration
ITEM_WAND_OF_RESTORATION_DESC||item description for Wand of Restoration|A white ash wand banked with Restoration.
ITEM_WAND_OF_SUNRAY_NAME|64|item display name for Wand of Sunray|wand of sunray
ITEM_WAND_OF_SUNRAY_DESC||item description for Wand of Sunray|A polished brass wand banked with Sunray, a holy ray that blinds and burns one target.
ITEM_GOLD_TRIMMED_SATCHEL_APOTHECARIUM_NAME|64|item display name for gold-trimmed satchel "Apothecarium"|gold-trimmed satchel "Apothecarium"
ITEM_GOLD_TRIMMED_SATCHEL_APOTHECARIUM_DESC||item description for gold-trimmed satchel "Apothecarium"|A gold-trimmed satchel that reduces carried load by 200, grants +1 INT, +1 WIS, and +1 CHA, and creates a random potion every three days.
ITEM_GOLD_TRIMMED_SATCHEL_APOTHECARIUM_UNIDENTIFIED_NAME|64|unidentified item display name for gold-trimmed satchel "Apothecarium"|gold-trimmed satchel
ITEM_GOLD_TRIMMED_SATCHEL_APOTHECARIUM_UNIDENTIFIED_DESC||unidentified item description for gold-trimmed satchel "Apothecarium"|A compact satchel with worn gold trim and chemical stains around the seams.
ITEM_MILDEWED_CANVAS_PACK_SWEET_ROT_NAME|64|item display name for mildewed canvas pack "Sweet Rot"|mildewed canvas pack "Sweet Rot"
ITEM_MILDEWED_CANVAS_PACK_SWEET_ROT_DESC||item description for mildewed canvas pack "Sweet Rot"|A mildewed canvas pack that reduces carried load by 180, keeps corpses from spoiling, and gives -2 WIS.
ITEM_MILDEWED_CANVAS_PACK_SWEET_ROT_UNIDENTIFIED_NAME|64|unidentified item display name for mildewed canvas pack "Sweet Rot"|mildewed canvas pack
ITEM_MILDEWED_CANVAS_PACK_SWEET_ROT_UNIDENTIFIED_DESC||unidentified item description for mildewed canvas pack "Sweet Rot"|A stained canvas pack with dark seams and an unpleasantly sweet smell.
ITEM_METAL_PLATED_POUCH_FLETCHER_S_FRIEND_NAME|64|item display name for metal-plated pouch "Fletcher's Friend"|metal-plated pouch "Fletcher's Friend"
ITEM_METAL_PLATED_POUCH_FLETCHER_S_FRIEND_DESC||item description for metal-plated pouch "Fletcher's Friend"|A metal-plated pouch that reduces carried load by 50. While worn, your final piece of ammo is never consumed.
ITEM_METAL_PLATED_POUCH_FLETCHER_S_FRIEND_UNIDENTIFIED_NAME|64|unidentified item display name for metal-plated pouch "Fletcher's Friend"|metal-plated pouch
ITEM_METAL_PLATED_POUCH_FLETCHER_S_FRIEND_UNIDENTIFIED_DESC||unidentified item description for metal-plated pouch "Fletcher's Friend"|A small pouch capped with overlapping metal plates.
ITEM_BLACK_OILSKIN_POUCH_SNAKE_S_EYE_NAME|64|item display name for black oilskin pouch "Snake's Eye"|black oilskin pouch "Snake's Eye"
ITEM_BLACK_OILSKIN_POUCH_SNAKE_S_EYE_DESC||item description for black oilskin pouch "Snake's Eye"|A black oilskin pouch that reduces carried load by 100, grants +2 DEX, and gives +1 Stealth skill.
ITEM_BLACK_OILSKIN_POUCH_SNAKE_S_EYE_UNIDENTIFIED_NAME|64|unidentified item display name for black oilskin pouch "Snake's Eye"|black oilskin pouch
ITEM_BLACK_OILSKIN_POUCH_SNAKE_S_EYE_UNIDENTIFIED_DESC||unidentified item description for black oilskin pouch "Snake's Eye"|A black oilskin pouch with a narrow green stone set in its clasp.
ITEM_EMBROIDERED_CLOTH_HAT_WEAVER_S_CAP_NAME|64|item display name for embroidered cloth hat "Weaver's Cap"|embroidered cloth hat "Weaver's Cap"
ITEM_EMBROIDERED_CLOTH_HAT_WEAVER_S_CAP_DESC||item description for embroidered cloth hat "Weaver's Cap"|An embroidered cloth hat granting +2 DEF, +6 ARM, and +4 INT.
ITEM_EMBROIDERED_CLOTH_HAT_WEAVER_S_CAP_UNIDENTIFIED_NAME|64|unidentified item display name for embroidered cloth hat "Weaver's Cap"|embroidered cloth hat
ITEM_EMBROIDERED_CLOTH_HAT_WEAVER_S_CAP_UNIDENTIFIED_DESC||unidentified item description for embroidered cloth hat "Weaver's Cap"|A soft cloth hat covered in close, careful embroidery.
ITEM_RED_SILK_BANDANA_PUGILIST_NAME|64|item display name for red silk bandana "Pugilist"|red silk bandana "Pugilist"
ITEM_RED_SILK_BANDANA_PUGILIST_DESC||item description for red silk bandana "Pugilist"|A red silk bandana granting +4 DEF and +3 ARM. Unarmed attacks deal 4d4, kicks deal 8d4, and both can stun.
ITEM_RED_SILK_BANDANA_PUGILIST_UNIDENTIFIED_NAME|64|unidentified item display name for red silk bandana "Pugilist"|red silk bandana
ITEM_RED_SILK_BANDANA_PUGILIST_UNIDENTIFIED_DESC||unidentified item description for red silk bandana "Pugilist"|A bright red silk bandana tied flat and worn from years of sweat.
ITEM_SCARRED_LEATHER_HELM_EMBERWORN_NAME|64|item display name for scarred leather helm "Emberworn"|scarred leather helm "Emberworn"
ITEM_SCARRED_LEATHER_HELM_EMBERWORN_DESC||item description for scarred leather helm "Emberworn"|A scarred leather helm granting +3 DEF, +7 ARM, +1 CON, and +1 fire resistance.
ITEM_SCARRED_LEATHER_HELM_EMBERWORN_UNIDENTIFIED_NAME|64|unidentified item display name for scarred leather helm "Emberworn"|scarred leather helm
ITEM_SCARRED_LEATHER_HELM_EMBERWORN_UNIDENTIFIED_DESC||unidentified item description for scarred leather helm "Emberworn"|A hardened leather helm blackened at the rim and scarred across the brow.
ITEM_NARROW_BLACKGLASS_CIRCLET_STILL_MIND_NAME|64|item display name for narrow blackglass circlet "Still Mind"|narrow blackglass circlet "Still Mind"
ITEM_NARROW_BLACKGLASS_CIRCLET_STILL_MIND_DESC||item description for narrow blackglass circlet "Still Mind"|A narrow blackglass circlet granting +4 DEF, +2 ARM, +2 INT, +2 WIS, and resistance to charm and mind effects.
ITEM_NARROW_BLACKGLASS_CIRCLET_STILL_MIND_UNIDENTIFIED_NAME|64|unidentified item display name for narrow blackglass circlet "Still Mind"|narrow blackglass circlet
ITEM_NARROW_BLACKGLASS_CIRCLET_STILL_MIND_UNIDENTIFIED_DESC||unidentified item description for narrow blackglass circlet "Still Mind"|A narrow blackglass circlet with a cold inner sheen.
