ITEM_CLOAK_OF_PROTECTION_1_NAME|64|item display name for Cloak of Protection +1|cloak of protection +1
ITEM_CLOAK_OF_PROTECTION_1_DESC||item description for Cloak of Protection +1|A warded cloak with silver thread inside the collar. It grants +2 DEF and +2 ARM.
ITEM_CLOAK_OF_PROTECTION_1_UNIDENTIFIED_NAME|64|unidentified item display name for Cloak of Protection +1|warded cloak
ITEM_CLOAK_OF_PROTECTION_1_UNIDENTIFIED_DESC||unidentified item description for Cloak of Protection +1|A travel cloak cut to shed rain and brush.
ITEM_CLOAK_OF_PROTECTION_2_NAME|64|item display name for Cloak of Protection +2|cloak of protection +2
ITEM_CLOAK_OF_PROTECTION_2_DESC||item description for Cloak of Protection +2|A warded cloak with layered silver thread inside the collar. It grants +3 DEF and +3 ARM.
ITEM_CLOAK_OF_PROTECTION_2_UNIDENTIFIED_NAME|64|unidentified item display name for Cloak of Protection +2|warded cloak
ITEM_CLOAK_OF_PROTECTION_2_UNIDENTIFIED_DESC||unidentified item description for Cloak of Protection +2|A travel cloak cut to shed rain and brush.
ITEM_CLOAK_OF_PROTECTION_3_NAME|64|item display name for Cloak of Protection +3|cloak of protection +3
ITEM_CLOAK_OF_PROTECTION_3_DESC||item description for Cloak of Protection +3|A warded cloak with deep silver threadwork inside the collar. It grants +4 DEF and +4 ARM.
ITEM_CLOAK_OF_PROTECTION_3_UNIDENTIFIED_NAME|64|unidentified item display name for Cloak of Protection +3|warded cloak
ITEM_CLOAK_OF_PROTECTION_3_UNIDENTIFIED_DESC||unidentified item description for Cloak of Protection +3|A travel cloak cut to shed rain and brush.
ITEM_CLOAK_OF_DISPLACEMENT_1_NAME|64|item display name for Cloak of Displacement +1|cloak of displacement +1
ITEM_CLOAK_OF_DISPLACEMENT_1_DESC||item description for Cloak of Displacement +1|A mirror-thread cloak that bends the wearer's outline aside. It grants +3 DEF and +1 ARM.
ITEM_CLOAK_OF_DISPLACEMENT_1_UNIDENTIFIED_NAME|64|unidentified item display name for Cloak of Displacement +1|shimmering cloak
ITEM_CLOAK_OF_DISPLACEMENT_1_UNIDENTIFIED_DESC||unidentified item description for Cloak of Displacement +1|A travel cloak cut to shed rain and brush.
ITEM_CLOAK_OF_DISPLACEMENT_2_NAME|64|item display name for Cloak of Displacement +2|cloak of displacement +2
ITEM_CLOAK_OF_DISPLACEMENT_2_DESC||item description for Cloak of Displacement +2|A mirror-thread cloak that makes the wearer's outline slide aside. It grants +4 DEF and +1 ARM.
ITEM_CLOAK_OF_DISPLACEMENT_2_UNIDENTIFIED_NAME|64|unidentified item display name for Cloak of Displacement +2|shimmering cloak
ITEM_CLOAK_OF_DISPLACEMENT_2_UNIDENTIFIED_DESC||unidentified item description for Cloak of Displacement +2|A travel cloak cut to shed rain and brush.
ITEM_CLOAK_OF_DISPLACEMENT_3_NAME|64|item display name for Cloak of Displacement +3|cloak of displacement +3
ITEM_CLOAK_OF_DISPLACEMENT_3_DESC||item description for Cloak of Displacement +3|A mirror-thread cloak that throws the wearer's outline badly out of line. It grants +5 DEF and +1 ARM.
ITEM_CLOAK_OF_DISPLACEMENT_3_UNIDENTIFIED_NAME|64|unidentified item display name for Cloak of Displacement +3|shimmering cloak
ITEM_CLOAK_OF_DISPLACEMENT_3_UNIDENTIFIED_DESC||unidentified item description for Cloak of Displacement +3|A travel cloak cut to shed rain and brush.
ITEM_CLOAK_OF_ELVENKIND_NAME|64|item display name for Cloak of Elvenkind|cloak of elvenkind
ITEM_CLOAK_OF_ELVENKIND_DESC||item description for Cloak of Elvenkind|A soft grey-green cloak that blends into shadow and leaves. It grants +1 DEF, +1 ARM, and +2 Stealth skill.
ITEM_CLOAK_OF_ELVENKIND_UNIDENTIFIED_NAME|64|unidentified item display name for Cloak of Elvenkind|grey-green cloak
ITEM_CLOAK_OF_ELVENKIND_UNIDENTIFIED_DESC||unidentified item description for Cloak of Elvenkind|A soft cloak dyed in muted forest colors.
ITEM_CLOAK_OF_ARACHNIDA_NAME|64|item display name for Cloak of Arachnida|cloak of arachnida
ITEM_CLOAK_OF_ARACHNIDA_DESC||item description for Cloak of Arachnida|A black silk cloak with a faint green sheen. It grants +3 DEF, +1 ARM, +2 poison resistance, and lets you ignore webs.
ITEM_CLOAK_OF_ARACHNIDA_UNIDENTIFIED_NAME|64|unidentified item display name for Cloak of Arachnida|black silk cloak
ITEM_CLOAK_OF_ARACHNIDA_UNIDENTIFIED_DESC||unidentified item description for Cloak of Arachnida|A black silk cloak with a faint green sheen.
ITEM_CLOAK_OF_THE_BAT_NAME|64|item display name for Cloak of the Bat|cloak of the bat
ITEM_CLOAK_OF_THE_BAT_DESC||item description for Cloak of the Bat|A dark wing-cut cloak that drinks torchlight. It grants +2 DEF, +1 ARM, darkvision, and protects you from pit-fall damage.
ITEM_CLOAK_OF_THE_BAT_UNIDENTIFIED_NAME|64|unidentified item display name for Cloak of the Bat|dark wing-cut cloak
ITEM_CLOAK_OF_THE_BAT_UNIDENTIFIED_DESC||unidentified item description for Cloak of the Bat|A dark cloak cut in scalloped folds.
ITEM_CLOAK_OF_EYES_NAME|64|item display name for Cloak of Eyes|cloak of eyes
ITEM_CLOAK_OF_EYES_DESC||item description for Cloak of Eyes|A many-eyed cloak that watches in all directions. It grants +1 DEF, +1 ARM, see invisible, blindness immunity, and +2 trap and secret detection.
ITEM_CLOAK_OF_EYES_UNIDENTIFIED_NAME|64|unidentified item display name for Cloak of Eyes|many-eyed cloak
ITEM_CLOAK_OF_EYES_UNIDENTIFIED_DESC||unidentified item description for Cloak of Eyes|A patched cloak stitched with small open-eye patterns.
ITEM_HEAVY_CLOAK_NAME|64|item display name for Heavy Cloak|heavy cloak
ITEM_HEAVY_CLOAK_DESC||item description for Heavy Cloak|A dense road cloak with enough wool and lining to blunt light strikes.
ITEM_HARD_LEATHER_BOOTS_NAME|64|item display name for Hard Leather Boots|hard leather boots
ITEM_HARD_LEATHER_BOOTS_DESC||item description for Hard Leather Boots|Stiff leather boots with shaped ankle guards and a firm toe.
ITEM_BOILED_LEATHER_BOOTS_NAME|64|item display name for Boiled Leather Boots|boiled leather boots
ITEM_BOILED_LEATHER_BOOTS_DESC||item description for Boiled Leather Boots|Boiled-leather boots shaped hard around the foot and reinforced at the heel.
ITEM_THICK_CLOTH_WRAPS_NAME|64|item display name for Thick Cloth Wraps|thick cloth wraps
ITEM_THICK_CLOTH_WRAPS_DESC||item description for Thick Cloth Wraps|Layered cloth wraps tied firm around the wrists and lower forearm.
ITEM_REINFORCED_LEATHER_BRACERS_NAME|64|item display name for Reinforced Leather Bracers|reinforced leather bracers
ITEM_REINFORCED_LEATHER_BRACERS_DESC||item description for Reinforced Leather Bracers|Layered leather forearm guards with hard edging around the wrist.
ITEM_STUDDED_LEATHER_BRACERS_NAME|64|item display name for Studded Leather Bracers|studded leather bracers
ITEM_STUDDED_LEATHER_BRACERS_DESC||item description for Studded Leather Bracers|Leather bracers set with rivets and small stiff plates.
ITEM_DUELIST_BRACERS_NAME|64|item display name for Duelist Bracers|duelist bracers
ITEM_DUELIST_BRACERS_DESC||item description for Duelist Bracers|Lean leather bracers cut to keep the wrist quick while covering the outer forearm.
ITEM_STEEL_BRACERS_NAME|64|item display name for Steel Bracers|steel bracers
ITEM_STEEL_BRACERS_DESC||item description for Steel Bracers|Polished steel forearm guards with a tighter fit and stronger backing straps.
ITEM_REINFORCED_LEATHER_GLOVES_NAME|64|item display name for Reinforced Leather Gloves|reinforced leather gloves
ITEM_REINFORCED_LEATHER_GLOVES_DESC||item description for Reinforced Leather Gloves|Layered leather gloves with hard guards over the knuckles and back of the hand.
ITEM_DUELIST_GLOVES_NAME|64|item display name for Duelist Gloves|duelist gloves
ITEM_DUELIST_GLOVES_DESC||item description for Duelist Gloves|Lean leather gloves with a firm cuff and light guard over the striking hand.
ITEM_QUILTED_GLOVES_NAME|64|item display name for Quilted Gloves|quilted gloves
ITEM_QUILTED_GLOVES_DESC||item description for Quilted Gloves|Carefully padded cloth gloves with firm seams across the palm and knuckles.
ITEM_PLATE_GAUNTLETS_NAME|64|item display name for Plate Gauntlets|plate gauntlets
ITEM_PLATE_GAUNTLETS_DESC||item description for Plate Gauntlets|Heavy plate gauntlets with broad knuckle guards and layered wrist cuffs.
ITEM_THICK_SASH_NAME|64|item display name for Thick Sash|thick sash
ITEM_THICK_SASH_DESC||item description for Thick Sash|A broad layered sash wrapped tight enough to add a little padding at the waist.
ITEM_EMBROIDERED_SASH_NAME|64|item display name for Embroidered Sash|embroidered sash
ITEM_EMBROIDERED_SASH_DESC||item description for Embroidered Sash|A fine cloth sash with stiff lining, careful folds, and reinforced stitching.
ITEM_REINFORCED_LEATHER_BELT_NAME|64|item display name for Reinforced Leather Belt|reinforced leather belt
ITEM_REINFORCED_LEATHER_BELT_DESC||item description for Reinforced Leather Belt|A broad leather belt with layered guards over the hips and belly.
ITEM_PLATED_WAR_BELT_NAME|64|item display name for Plated War Belt|plated war belt
ITEM_PLATED_WAR_BELT_DESC||item description for Plated War Belt|A heavy fighting belt with steel belly plates and hanging guards.
ITEM_ELEGANT_SHOES_NAME|64|item display name for Elegant Shoes|elegant shoes
ITEM_ELEGANT_SHOES_DESC||item description for Elegant Shoes|Well-made soft shoes with firm heels, careful stitching, and a close fit.
ITEM_FISHERMAN_S_PARCEL_NAME|64|item display name for Fisherman's Parcel|fisherman's parcel
ITEM_FISHERMAN_S_PARCEL_DESC||item description for Fisherman's Parcel|A waxed dock parcel tied tight with tarred cord and marked for Shopkeeper Orrick at Traveller's Rest.
ITEM_BARROW_MANUSCRIPT_NAME|64|item display name for Barrow Manuscript|barrow manuscript
ITEM_BARROW_MANUSCRIPT_DESC||item description for Barrow Manuscript|A brittle copied manuscript describing a royal phrase tied to King's Barrow.
ITEM_STONEWARD_KEY_NAME|64|item display name for Stoneward Key|Stoneward Key
ITEM_STONEWARD_KEY_DESC||item description for Stoneward Key|A heavy dwarven key set with pale elven glass. It needs fresh draconic blood from a corpse that has not rotted before the Stoneward Gate will answer it.
ITEM_BLOODED_STONEWARD_KEY_NAME|64|item display name for Blooded Stoneward Key|Blooded Stoneward Key
ITEM_BLOODED_STONEWARD_KEY_DESC||item description for Blooded Stoneward Key|The Stoneward Key, wet with draconic blood and ready for the gate below the Istarian Tunnels.
ITEM_ANCIENT_ISTARIAN_MANUSCRIPT_NAME|64|item display name for Ancient Istarian Manuscript|Ancient Istarian Manuscript
ITEM_ANCIENT_ISTARIAN_MANUSCRIPT_DESC||item description for Ancient Istarian Manuscript|A brittle campaign manuscript from King's Barrow, copied in old Istarian script and marked for the final blood seal.
ITEM_SMUGGLER_S_LOCKBOX_NAME|64|item display name for Smuggler's Lockbox|smuggler's lockbox
ITEM_SMUGGLER_S_LOCKBOX_DESC||item description for Smuggler's Lockbox|A water-stained iron lockbox from Smuggler Grotto's lower cove, still sealed around what the Smuggler wants back.
ITEM_MAUG_S_HEAD_NAME|64|item display name for maug's head|maug's head
ITEM_MAUG_S_HEAD_DESC||item description for maug's head|The heavy severed head of Maug, the ettin leader of Rockmaw Keep.
ITEM_BROND_S_HEAD_NAME|64|item display name for brond's head|brond's head
ITEM_BROND_S_HEAD_DESC||item description for brond's head|The severed head of Brond, the ogre champion who held Rockmaw Keep beside Maug.
ITEM_KOBOLD_SCALP_NAME|64|item display name for kobold scalp|kobold scalp
ITEM_KOBOLD_SCALP_DESC||item description for kobold scalp|A rough proof taken for Garrick's Havenford watch work.
ITEM_GRAVE_BONE_NAME|64|item display name for grave bone|grave bone
ITEM_GRAVE_BONE_DESC||item description for grave bone|A marked bone taken from road-walking dead for Garrick's Havenford watch work.
ITEM_OLDROOT_LEAF_NAME|64|item display name for oldroot leaf|oldroot leaf
ITEM_OLDROOT_LEAF_DESC||item description for oldroot leaf|A tough green-black leaf cut from the old growth around Oldroot Temple.
ITEM_MOONWELL_THREAD_NAME|64|item display name for moonwell thread|moonwell thread
ITEM_MOONWELL_THREAD_DESC||item description for moonwell thread|A pale, glassy thread that holds a faint pull from Moonwell Observatory.
ITEM_SMOOTH_ROUND_STONE_NAME|64|item display name for Smooth Round Stone|smooth round stone
ITEM_SMOOTH_ROUND_STONE_DESC||item description for Smooth Round Stone|A river-smoothed stone from Reth Oskel's kit, meant to be set on the stone stacks around Reedmire Shrine.
ITEM_RUNED_VALVE_HANDLE_NAME|64|item display name for runed valve handle|runed valve handle
ITEM_RUNED_VALVE_HANDLE_DESC||item description for runed valve handle|A heavy iron valve handle cut with Stonecleft runes, made to open sealed lower sluices in Floodgate Cistern.
ITEM_RUNEFORGE_CORE_NAME|64|item display name for runeforge core|runeforge core
ITEM_RUNEFORGE_CORE_DESC||item description for runeforge core|A dense rune-cut core from Stonecleft's runeforge, wet with old cistern water and wrapped in torn cloth.
ITEM_TAINTED_WHITE_VAULT_CRYSTAL_NAME|64|item display name for Tainted White Vault Crystal|Tainted White Vault Crystal
ITEM_TAINTED_WHITE_VAULT_CRYSTAL_DESC||item description for Tainted White Vault Crystal|A pale crystal from the White Vault, dimmed by old vault-taint.
ITEM_RESONANT_WHITE_VAULT_CRYSTAL_NAME|64|item display name for Resonant White Vault Crystal|Resonant White Vault Crystal
ITEM_RESONANT_WHITE_VAULT_CRYSTAL_DESC||item description for Resonant White Vault Crystal|A White Vault crystal tuned by Telwynd glass-singing and ready for the lower Moonwell rite.
ITEM_MOONWELL_LENS_NAME|64|item display name for moonwell lens quest item|moonwell lens
ITEM_MOONWELL_LENS_DESC||item description for moonwell lens quest item|A pale observatory lens from the Moonwell frame. Set in place, it can show Telwynd through the Veiled Wood.
ITEM_MISALIGNED_MOONWELL_LENS_NAME|64|legacy item display name for removed misaligned moonwell lens|misaligned moonwell lens
ITEM_MISALIGNED_MOONWELL_LENS_DESC||legacy item description for removed misaligned moonwell lens|A pale glass lens from Highmark's seal stores, bright but out of tune.
ITEM_ATTUNED_MOONWELL_LENS_NAME|64|item display name for attuned moonwell lens|attuned moonwell lens
ITEM_ATTUNED_MOONWELL_LENS_DESC||item description for attuned moonwell lens|A moonwell lens adjusted by Telwynd glass-work, ready to seat in an observatory frame.
ITEM_PLAIN_CHARM_NAME|64|item display name for plain charm|plain charm
ITEM_PLAIN_CHARM_DESC||item description for plain charm|A small unmarked charm: plain-cut, unblessed, and not a White Seal charm yet.
ITEM_DORMANT_WHITE_SEAL_CHARM_NAME|64|item display name for dormant white seal charm|dormant white seal charm
ITEM_DORMANT_WHITE_SEAL_CHARM_DESC||item description for dormant white seal charm|A blessed White Seal charm with its mark set, waiting for the last oldroot touch.
ITEM_WHITE_SEAL_CHARM_NAME|64|item display name for white seal charm|white seal charm
ITEM_WHITE_SEAL_CHARM_DESC||item description for white seal charm|A finished White Seal charm, marked and cooled after a full pilgrimage.
ITEM_SPELL_SCROLL_NAME|64|item display name for Spell Scroll|spell scroll
ITEM_SPELL_SCROLL_DESC||item description for Spell Scroll|A prepared magical scroll. The exact spell varies with the scribe's work.
ITEM_SPELL_WAND_NAME|64|item display name for Spell Wand|spell wand
ITEM_SPELL_WAND_DESC||item description for Spell Wand|A prepared magical wand. The exact spell varies with the crafter's work.
MONSTER_GOBLIN_NAME|64|monster display name for Goblin|goblin
MONSTER_GOBLIN_DESC||monster description for Goblin|A short green-skinned goblin raider with long ears, sharp teeth, and a rusty knife at its side. It feints around ankles and grows bolder when more goblins fill the room.
MONSTER_SCRAWNY_GOBLIN_NAME|64|monster display name for Scrawny Goblin|scrawny goblin
MONSTER_SCRAWNY_GOBLIN_DESC||monster description for Scrawny Goblin|A starved small goblin with knobby joints, loose rags, and a notched rusty knife. It stays near the edge of melee, then lashes out and tries to slip away.
MONSTER_KOBOLD_NAME|64|monster display name for Kobold|kobold
MONSTER_KOBOLD_DESC||monster description for Kobold|A small reptilian humanoid with rust-brown scales, a narrow snout, and a chipped knife. It favors corners and cover, stabbing quickly before retreating through tight gaps.
MONSTER_ORC_NAME|64|monster display name for Orc|orc
MONSTER_ORC_DESC||monster description for Orc|A broad orc warrior in a hide jerkin, built thick through the neck and shoulders, with a hand axe ready. It drives straight into melee and chops at armor until a guard breaks.
MONSTER_HOBGOBLIN_NAME|64|monster display name for Hobgoblin|hobgoblin
MONSTER_HOBGOBLIN_DESC||monster description for Hobgoblin|A tall goblinoid infantryman in a heavy gambeson, disciplined posture, short sword in hand. It keeps a steady line and presses harder when allies can flank.
MONSTER_OGRE_NAME|64|monster display name for Ogre|ogre
MONSTER_OGRE_DESC||monster description for Ogre|A huge giantkin brute with a thick belly, long arms, coarse skin, and a battered mace. It swings slowly, but the impacts break guards and punish anyone who stays close.
MONSTER_TROLL_NAME|64|monster display name for Troll|troll
MONSTER_TROLL_DESC||monster description for Troll|A tall rubbery troll with green-gray hide, hooked claws, and a spiked morning star in one huge hand. Its wounds knit as it mauls forward, making short exchanges risky.
MONSTER_WOLF_NAME|64|monster display name for Wolf|wolf
MONSTER_WOLF_DESC||monster description for Wolf|A lean gray wolf with raised hackles, yellow eyes, and a low hunting crouch. It circles for exposed flanks and commits to repeated bites once it finds one.
MONSTER_GIANT_RAT_NAME|64|monster display name for Giant Rat|giant rat
MONSTER_GIANT_RAT_DESC||monster description for Giant Rat|A dog-sized rat with wet fur, yellow teeth, and a rope-thick tail dragging behind it. It rushes low along the floor and attacks with frantic ankle bites.
MONSTER_GIANT_SPIDER_NAME|64|monster display name for Giant Spider|giant spider
MONSTER_GIANT_SPIDER_DESC||monster description for Giant Spider|A waist-high spider with dark chitin, long jointed legs, and venom shining on its fangs. It waits near corners or webbed ground, then springs when prey steps close.
MONSTER_SKELETON_NAME|64|monster display name for Skeleton|skeleton
MONSTER_SKELETON_DESC||monster description for Skeleton|A human skeleton held upright by grave magic, with a rusty knife clenched in one bony hand. It walks forward without fear or fatigue and keeps cutting until its bones are smashed apart.
MONSTER_ZOMBIE_NAME|64|monster display name for Zombie|zombie
MONSTER_ZOMBIE_DESC||monster description for Zombie|A swollen human corpse with gray skin, stiff limbs, and grave dirt packed into its clothes. It shambles straight ahead, soaking blows while trying to drag the living down.
MONSTER_BANDIT_NAME|64|monster display name for Bandit|bandit
MONSTER_BANDIT_DESC||monster description for Bandit|A human road thief in a hide jerkin, carrying a short sword and a pouch of stolen scraps. It tests for weakness, then backs away when the fight turns disciplined.
MONSTER_GIANT_BAT_NAME|64|monster display name for Giant Bat|giant bat
MONSTER_GIANT_BAT_DESC||monster description for Giant Bat|A large bat with leathery wings, a foxlike face, and clawed feet tucked under its body. It swoops through tight spaces, clips low, and flaps away before a clean counterblow.
MONSTER_BUGBEAR_NAME|64|monster display name for Bugbear|bugbear
MONSTER_BUGBEAR_DESC||monster description for Bugbear|A hulking shaggy goblinoid in studded leather, gripping a heavy club in oversized hands. It uses long reach and body weight to smash through light defenses.
MONSTER_GNOLL_NAME|64|monster display name for Gnoll|gnoll
MONSTER_GNOLL_DESC||monster description for Gnoll|A hyena-headed humanoid in a hide jerkin, carrying a hand axe and grinning through a long muzzle. It paces sideways for room, then rushes in with chopping blows.
MONSTER_GNOLL_PACKLEADER_NAME|64|monster display name for Gnoll Packleader|gnoll packleader
MONSTER_GNOLL_PACKLEADER_DESC||monster description for Gnoll Packleader|A scarred gnoll with a heavy axe, matted hide armor, and the habit of stepping in first. It does not command with tactics so much as weight and nerve.
MONSTER_DIRE_WOLF_NAME|64|monster display name for Dire Wolf|dire wolf
MONSTER_DIRE_WOLF_DESC||monster description for Dire Wolf|A horse-sized wolf with a heavy neck, scarred muzzle, and jaws wide enough to crush an arm. It locks onto armored targets with repeated bites and gives ground only when badly hurt.
MONSTER_WARG_NAME|64|monster display name for Warg|warg
MONSTER_WARG_DESC||monster description for Warg|A huge dark-furred wolf-beast with a broad skull, torn lips, and a cruel trained stare. It charges like a shock troop and keeps biting after the first impact.
MONSTER_GIANT_TOAD_NAME|64|monster display name for Giant Toad|giant toad
MONSTER_GIANT_TOAD_DESC||monster description for Giant Toad|A barrel-sized toad with slick mottled skin, bulging eyes, and a wide throat pulsing under its jaw. It waits in wet ground, then lunges suddenly to body-block a path.
MONSTER_GHOUL_NAME|64|monster display name for Ghoul|ghoul
MONSTER_GHOUL_DESC||monster description for Ghoul|A gaunt undead corpse with stretched skin, clawed hands, and a rusty knife hanging from one fist. It moves in jerky bursts and tears at living flesh once it closes.
MONSTER_WILD_DOG_NAME|64|monster display name for Wild Dog|wild dog
MONSTER_WILD_DOG_DESC||monster description for Wild Dog|A gaunt feral dog with torn ears, matted fur, and ribs showing under its hide. It snaps at legs, then backs off unless hunger or numbers keep it brave.
MONSTER_BOAR_NAME|64|monster display name for Boar|boar
MONSTER_BOAR_DESC||monster description for Boar|A low thick-necked boar with muddy bristles, hard shoulders, and bright tusks jutting from its jaw. It makes short violent charges and gores anything blocking the path.
MONSTER_BLACK_BEAR_NAME|64|monster display name for Black Bear|black bear
MONSTER_BLACK_BEAR_DESC||monster description for Black Bear|A heavy black bear with a blunt muzzle, glossy fur, and long pale claws. It holds its ground until threatened, then surges forward to maul at close range.
MONSTER_BROWN_BEAR_NAME|64|monster display name for Brown Bear|brown bear
MONSTER_BROWN_BEAR_DESC||monster description for Brown Bear|A massive brown bear with scarred shoulders, a humped back, and paws like shields. It fills the space around it and batters enemies down with crushing swipes.
MONSTER_HAWK_NAME|64|monster display name for Hawk|hawk
MONSTER_HAWK_DESC||monster description for Hawk|A sharp-winged hunting hawk with hooked talons and a narrow, fixed stare. It circles above the fight and drops fast when an enemy leaves an opening.
MONSTER_OWL_NAME|64|monster display name for Owl|owl
MONSTER_OWL_DESC||monster description for Owl|A broad-eyed owl with silent wings and pale facial discs. It moves without warning and strikes from strange angles that draw the eye away from the real threat.
MONSTER_PANTHER_NAME|64|monster display name for Panther|panther
MONSTER_PANTHER_DESC||monster description for Panther|A low black panther with powerful shoulders, bright eyes, and paws that barely touch the floor. It waits, then crosses distance in one hard pounce.
MONSTER_FOX_NAME|64|monster display name for Fox|fox
MONSTER_FOX_DESC||monster description for Fox|A lean red fox with quick ears, bright eyes, and a habit of vanishing from the angle you were watching. It darts in to spoil footing instead of trading blows.
MONSTER_BADGER_NAME|64|monster display name for Badger|badger
MONSTER_BADGER_DESC||monster description for Badger|A squat badger with thick shoulders, coarse fur, and claws made for digging through root and stone. It plants itself in the fight and refuses to give ground.
MONSTER_GOBLIN_CHIEF_NAME|64|monster display name for Goblin Chief|goblin chief
MONSTER_GOBLIN_CHIEF_DESC||monster description for Goblin Chief|A squat goblin boss in studded leather, thick-jawed and scarred, with a short sword raised for commands. It shoves lesser goblins into the fight and uses their openings for its own cuts.
MONSTER_YOUNG_DRAKE_NAME|64|monster display name for Young Drake|young drake
MONSTER_YOUNG_DRAKE_DESC||monster description for Young Drake|A lean young drake with dark scales, budding horns, and a light frame. It bounds on all fours, snapping and clawing before its lighter body can be pinned.
MONSTER_STORM_DRAKE_NAME|64|monster display name for Storm Drake|storm drake
MONSTER_STORM_DRAKE_DESC||monster description for Storm Drake|A lean drake with storm-dark scales, ragged wings, and static snapping between its horns. It keeps to high ground, then dives in with hot breath and a snapping bite.
MONSTER_DRAKE_NAME|64|monster display name for Drake|drake
MONSTER_DRAKE_DESC||monster description for Drake|A squat drake with stone-gray armor plates, blunt horns, and heavy jaws. It anchors corridors with its bulk, then drives prey back with fire and crushing bites.
MONSTER_GREATER_DRAKE_NAME|64|monster display name for Greater Drake|greater drake
MONSTER_GREATER_DRAKE_DESC||monster description for Greater Drake|A heavy greater drake with dark scales, thick horns, and a chest broad enough to block a corridor. It fights by weight, fire, and reach, forcing prey back before closing with teeth and claws.
MONSTER_BLACKGLASS_DRAKE_NAME|64|monster display name for Blackglass Drake|blackglass drake
MONSTER_BLACKGLASS_DRAKE_DESC||monster description for Blackglass Drake|A mature drake with razor-edged black scales, dark glasslike blackglass ridges, and a low stalking gait. It advances steadily, using its armored body to shove prey into claw range.
MONSTER_DEEP_BLACKGLASS_DRAKE_NAME|64|monster display name for Deep Blackglass Drake|deep blackglass drake
MONSTER_DEEP_BLACKGLASS_DRAKE_DESC||monster description for Deep Blackglass Drake|A huge old drake with blackglass crystal plates fused over the shoulders, jaw, and tail. It absorbs punishment with patient confidence and counters with bone-crushing bites.
MONSTER_PRIMORDIAL_DRAGON_NAME|64|monster display name for Primordial Dragon|primordial dragon
MONSTER_PRIMORDIAL_DRAGON_DESC||monster description for Primordial Dragon|A colossal dragon-shaped monster with black scales, fused blackglass crystal armor, a horned skull, and wings that crowd the chamber. It uses claws, teeth, tail, and body weight to dominate every side of the fight.
MONSTER_BLACKGLASS_KOBOLD_NAME|64|monster display name for Blackglass Kobold|blackglass kobold
MONSTER_BLACKGLASS_KOBOLD_DESC||monster description for Blackglass Kobold|A small reptilian kobold with dark glasslike blackglass splinters in its knife, belt, and scales. It darts through gaps, slashing quickly before a slower opponent can pin it.
MONSTER_BLACKGLASS_BAT_NAME|64|monster display name for Blackglass Bat|blackglass bat
MONSTER_BLACKGLASS_BAT_DESC||monster description for Blackglass Bat|A large bat with ragged wings, glassy eyes, and blackglass crystal flecks around its ears and muzzle. It wheels through narrow passages, clips at the face, and veers away before a clean swing.
MONSTER_BLACKGLASS_RAT_NAME|64|monster display name for Blackglass Rat|blackglass rat
MONSTER_BLACKGLASS_RAT_DESC||monster description for Blackglass Rat|A cat-sized tunnel rat with dark glassy teeth, blackglass crystal crust along its spine, and raw skin around shard wounds. It rushes with unnatural aggression and bites deeper than its size suggests.
MONSTER_ROOT_BOUND_ZOMBIE_NAME|64|monster display name for Root-Bound Zombie|root-bound zombie
MONSTER_ROOT_BOUND_ZOMBIE_DESC||monster description for Root-Bound Zombie|A root-bound zombie is a gray corpse pinned upright by hard roots threaded through ribs, arms, and jaw. It drags itself forward slowly, then snaps at anything the roots can hold still.
MONSTER_BLACKGLASS_HOUND_NAME|64|monster display name for Blackglass Hound|blackglass hound
MONSTER_BLACKGLASS_HOUND_DESC||monster description for Blackglass Hound|A lean feral hound with blackglass splinters in its hide, raw gums, and a hungry stare. It circles the weak edge of a fight and rushes anyone who stumbles.
MONSTER_DIRE_RAT_NAME|64|monster display name for Dire Rat|dire rat
MONSTER_DIRE_RAT_DESC||monster description for Dire Rat|A huge filthy rat with scarred flanks, yellow teeth, and the nerve to charge larger prey. It darts in low, bites hard, and its bites can carry disease.
MONSTER_KOBOLD_SKIRMISHER_NAME|64|monster display name for Kobold Skirmisher|kobold skirmisher
MONSTER_KOBOLD_SKIRMISHER_DESC||monster description for Kobold Skirmisher|A small reptilian tunnel fighter with ash-gray scales, a rusty knife, and a belt of tools. It slips through vents, corners, and narrow passages to stab from close range.
MONSTER_BANDIT_BRUTE_NAME|64|monster display name for Bandit Brute|bandit brute
MONSTER_BANDIT_BRUTE_DESC||monster description for Bandit Brute|A thick-shouldered human bandit in heavy cloth armor, carrying a mace and enough nerve to hold a doorway. It crowds close and soaks up punishment for the rest of the gang.
MONSTER_OGRE_CRUSHER_NAME|64|monster display name for Ogre Crusher|ogre crusher
MONSTER_OGRE_CRUSHER_DESC||monster description for Ogre Crusher|A huge ogre-like tunnel breaker with slab shoulders, dust-caked skin, and a heavy mace. It smashes doors, braces, and bodies with the same slow force.
MONSTER_DIRE_BAT_NAME|64|monster display name for Dire Bat|dire bat
MONSTER_DIRE_BAT_DESC||monster description for Dire Bat|A pale cave bat with grit-caked wings, stone dust in its fur, and white tunnel eyes. It dives through broken galleries where bad footing makes counterblows harder.
MONSTER_BURROW_SPIDER_NAME|64|monster display name for Burrow Spider|burrow spider
MONSTER_BURROW_SPIDER_DESC||monster description for Burrow Spider|A thick-bodied tunnel spider with blunt legs, dark chitin, and webs anchored into rubble cracks. It waits where the road narrows, then lunges once movement is boxed in.
MONSTER_SKELETON_GUARD_NAME|64|monster display name for Skeleton Guard|skeleton guard
MONSTER_SKELETON_GUARD_DESC||monster description for Skeleton Guard|A human skeleton with a spear, old gate tokens, and scraps of road-guard harness on its bones. It keeps a sentry's posture and uses the spear to hold intruders at reach.
MONSTER_VAMPIRIC_BAT_NAME|64|monster display name for Vampiric Bat|vampiric bat
MONSTER_VAMPIRIC_BAT_DESC||monster description for Vampiric Bat|A large blood-drinking bat with ragged wings, needle teeth, and a red wet muzzle. It drops from dark ceilings and worries a wound until the target tears it loose.
MONSTER_WHITE_SEAL_PRIEST_NAME|64|monster display name for White Seal Priest|white seal priest
MONSTER_WHITE_SEAL_PRIEST_DESC||monster description for White Seal Priest|A human priest in a padded robe, with a mace in one hand and a holy symbol at the throat. It keeps its stance compact, murmuring prayers while trying to outlast attackers.
MONSTER_SKELETON_GUARDIAN_NAME|64|monster display name for Skeleton Guardian|skeleton guardian
MONSTER_SKELETON_GUARDIAN_DESC||monster description for Skeleton Guardian|A beacon watcher is a spear-carrying undead skeleton in torn tower livery, with pale light burning in its eye sockets. It keeps long sight lines and punishes rash approaches.
MONSTER_UNDEAD_PRIEST_NAME|64|monster display name for Undead Priest|undead priest
MONSTER_UNDEAD_PRIEST_DESC||monster description for Undead Priest|A mace-bearing undead priest with gray flesh, white seal scraps, and a jaw locked in old vows. It closes steadily and swings with both hands.
MONSTER_SKELETON_CHAMPION_NAME|64|monster display name for Skeleton Champion|skeleton champion
MONSTER_SKELETON_CHAMPION_DESC||monster description for Skeleton Champion|A human skeleton with a short sword, clean pale bones, and tarnished vault-guard fittings. It knows the corridors it guards and cuts at anyone trying to slip past.
MONSTER_LIGHTGLASS_GHOST_NAME|64|monster display name for Lightglass Ghost|lightglass ghost
MONSTER_LIGHTGLASS_GHOST_DESC||monster description for Lightglass Ghost|A translucent human ghost with pale glowing Lightglass visible through its ribs and blurred hands. It flickers in and out of sight, striking with timing that is hard to read.
MONSTER_UNDEAD_KNIGHT_NAME|64|monster display name for Undead Knight|undead knight
MONSTER_UNDEAD_KNIGHT_DESC||monster description for Undead Knight|An undead knight in chain mail, carrying a longsword and round shield under blackened ward marks. It fights with drilled method, using shield pressure before clean sword cuts.
MONSTER_BLACKGLASS_SPIDER_NAME|64|monster display name for Blackglass Spider|blackglass spider
MONSTER_BLACKGLASS_SPIDER_DESC||monster description for Blackglass Spider|A large spider with blackglass flecks along its bark-dark legs and glassy threads in its webbing. It strings webs between trees and stone, then lunges at trapped prey.
MONSTER_BLACK_WIDOW_NAME|64|monster display name for Black Widow|black widow
MONSTER_BLACK_WIDOW_DESC||monster description for Black Widow|A heavy black widow spider with a dark bulbous abdomen, long hooked legs, and swollen venom glands. It webs prey in place and waits for poison to do its work.
MONSTER_GNOLL_HUNTER_NAME|64|monster display name for Gnoll Hunter|gnoll hunter
MONSTER_GNOLL_HUNTER_DESC||monster description for Gnoll Hunter|A lean gnoll in hide armor, carrying a hand axe and a bundle of throwing spears. It harries from just outside reach before joining the pack rush.
MONSTER_GREATER_GHOUL_NAME|64|monster display name for Greater Ghoul|greater ghoul
MONSTER_GREATER_GHOUL_DESC||monster description for Greater Ghoul|A rotting ghoul is a crouched undead corpse with black rot around its mouth, gray limbs, and a rusty knife in one clawed hand. It tears forward in short hungry bursts.
MONSTER_FOREST_HOUND_NAME|64|monster display name for Forest Hound|forest hound
MONSTER_FOREST_HOUND_DESC||monster description for Forest Hound|A lean wild hound with coarse brown fur, dark paws, and a muzzle full of jagged teeth. It moves easily through brush and snaps at anything slowed by roots or webs.
MONSTER_OGRE_MAGE_NAME|64|monster display name for Ogre Mage|ogre mage
MONSTER_OGRE_MAGE_DESC||monster description for Ogre Mage|A blue-skinned ogre mage in a patched robe, carrying a heavy staff and watching with cold intelligence. It uses frost magic and invisibility before closing with brute strength.
MONSTER_GREATER_WIGHT_NAME|64|monster display name for Greater Wight|greater wight
MONSTER_GREATER_WIGHT_DESC||monster description for Greater Wight|A stronger wight with sunken eyes, stiff old armor, and a short sword held in both hands. It moves with dead discipline and leaves a numbing ache where it cuts.
MONSTER_DEEP_BLACKGLASS_RAT_NAME|64|monster display name for Deep Blackglass Rat|deep blackglass rat
MONSTER_DEEP_BLACKGLASS_RAT_DESC||monster description for Deep Blackglass Rat|A large rat with blackglass plates split through its hide, black grit in its fur, and cracked teeth worn sharp. It rushes from broken stone and worries ankles until kicked loose.
MONSTER_DEEP_BLACKGLASS_HOUND_NAME|64|monster display name for Deep Blackglass Hound|deep blackglass hound
MONSTER_DEEP_BLACKGLASS_HOUND_DESC||monster description for Deep Blackglass Hound|A scarred hound with blackglass crystal fangs jutting through jaw and gum. It clamps down with tearing pressure and tries to keep prey from pulling away.
MONSTER_PRIMORDIAL_BLACKGLASS_HOUND_NAME|64|monster display name for Primordial Blackglass Hound|primordial blackglass hound
MONSTER_PRIMORDIAL_BLACKGLASS_HOUND_DESC||monster description for Primordial Blackglass Hound|A primordial blackglass hound has a split crystal mane, long hooked fangs, and a body too lean for its strength. It runs low, then tears into exposed legs with shard-bright jaws.
MONSTER_BLACKGLASS_ZOMBIE_NAME|64|monster display name for Blackglass Zombie|blackglass zombie
MONSTER_BLACKGLASS_ZOMBIE_DESC||monster description for Blackglass Zombie|A dead humanoid body with blackglass crystal splines through its chest and spine. It lurches forward with stiff hands and keeps clawing until the body is broken apart.
MONSTER_DEEP_BLACKGLASS_ZOMBIE_NAME|64|monster display name for Deep Blackglass Zombie|deep blackglass zombie
MONSTER_DEEP_BLACKGLASS_ZOMBIE_DESC||monster description for Deep Blackglass Zombie|A fast dead humanoid with blackglass plates split through its shoulders, hands, and jaw. It crawls low through broken ground, then lunges at the nearest living throat.
MONSTER_DEEP_BLACKGLASS_SPIDER_NAME|64|monster display name for Deep Blackglass Spider|deep blackglass spider
MONSTER_DEEP_BLACKGLASS_SPIDER_DESC||monster description for Deep Blackglass Spider|A deep blackglass spider with long black legs, glass-thread spinnerets, and a narrow armored body. It lays dark strands across pits and walls, then attacks once prey is boxed in.
MONSTER_PRIMORDIAL_BLACKGLASS_SPIDER_NAME|64|monster display name for Primordial Blackglass Spider|primordial blackglass spider
MONSTER_PRIMORDIAL_BLACKGLASS_SPIDER_DESC||monster description for Primordial Blackglass Spider|A primordial blackglass spider carries a narrow crystal carapace and glass-thread spinnerets that scrape against stone. Its webs gleam like dark wire before they tighten.
MONSTER_FALLEN_LANCE_KNIGHT_NAME|64|monster display name for Fallen Lance Knight|fallen lance knight
MONSTER_FALLEN_LANCE_KNIGHT_DESC||monster description for Fallen Lance Knight|An undead lancer in damaged brigandine, carrying a spear under a torn Silver Lance badge. It keeps the shape of a cavalry charge and drives the spear into anyone in its lane.
MONSTER_DEEP_BLACKGLASS_ARMORED_ZOMBIE_NAME|64|monster display name for Deep Blackglass Armored Zombie|deep blackglass armored zombie
MONSTER_DEEP_BLACKGLASS_ARMORED_ZOMBIE_DESC||monster description for Deep Blackglass Armored Zombie|An armored zombie in broken brigandine and a round shield, with blackglass growths bracing the spine and jaw. It advances with dead patience and batters enemies with sword and shield.
MONSTER_GREATER_WRAITH_NAME|64|monster display name for Greater Wraith|greater wraith
MONSTER_GREATER_WRAITH_DESC||monster description for Greater Wraith|A greater wraith is a tall undead spirit with a torn hood, long empty sleeves, and cold hands that pull strength out of living bodies. It phases through stone and presses hard in close quarters.
MONSTER_LIZARDMAN_SHAMAN_NAME|64|monster display name for Lizardman Shaman|lizardman shaman
MONSTER_LIZARDMAN_SHAMAN_DESC||monster description for Lizardman Shaman|A lizardman ritualist in bone charms and damp hide wraps, carrying a staff cut with simple marks. It stays behind stronger bodies and casts simple battle magic when pressed.
MONSTER_PRIMORDIAL_DRAGON_SPAWN_NAME|64|monster display name for Primordial Dragon Spawn|primordial dragon spawn
MONSTER_PRIMORDIAL_DRAGON_SPAWN_DESC||monster description for Primordial Dragon Spawn|A vast unfinished dragon spawn with warped wings, fused blackglass crystal ribs, and a skull too large for its body. It is not the true dragon, but it crushes and bites with terrifying mass.
MONSTER_PRIMORDIAL_BLACKGLASS_DRAKE_NAME|64|monster display name for Primordial Blackglass Drake|primordial blackglass drake
MONSTER_PRIMORDIAL_BLACKGLASS_DRAKE_DESC||monster description for Primordial Blackglass Drake|A primordial blackglass drake is an old draconic brute with crystal ribs grown through black scales and a jaw bright with inner heat. It breathes in a tearing line, then charges through the smoke.
MONSTER_YELLOW_MOLD_NAME|64|monster display name for Yellow Mold|yellow mold
MONSTER_YELLOW_MOLD_DESC||monster description for Yellow Mold|A yellow fungal crust with swollen caps and dusty poison sacs. It clings to damp stone until movement nearby makes it burst spores into the air.
MONSTER_GOBLIN_TRAPPER_NAME|64|monster display name for Goblin Trapper|goblin trapper
MONSTER_GOBLIN_TRAPPER_DESC||monster description for Goblin Trapper|A small goblin trapper with a club, cheap wire, hooks, and a belt of scavenged tools. It tries to steer enemies onto bad footing before closing to bludgeon them.
MONSTER_GOBLIN_RAIDER_NAME|64|monster display name for Goblin Raider|goblin raider
MONSTER_GOBLIN_RAIDER_DESC||monster description for Goblin Raider|A wiry goblin raider with scavenged straps, sharp eyes, and a short sword. It rushes weak targets in quick bursts and backs away from a firm defense.
MONSTER_GOBLIN_BRUTE_NAME|64|monster display name for Goblin Brute|goblin brute
MONSTER_GOBLIN_BRUTE_DESC||monster description for Goblin Brute|A thick-armed goblin brute with broad feet, a dented brow, and a heavy club. It charges straight in and tries to win by weight and repeated blows.
MONSTER_KOBOLD_WARRIOR_NAME|64|monster display name for Kobold Warrior|kobold warrior
MONSTER_KOBOLD_WARRIOR_DESC||monster description for Kobold Warrior|A small pale-scaled reptilian humanoid with sharp ears and a rusty knife. It jabs from cover and loses nerve when the fight turns against it.
MONSTER_KOBOLD_SCOUT_NAME|64|monster display name for Kobold Scout|kobold scout
MONSTER_KOBOLD_SCOUT_DESC||monster description for Kobold Scout|A rangy kobold scout with alert eyes, a light tunnel pack, and a spear held low. It probes from reach and punishes anyone who steps too far forward.
MONSTER_KOBOLD_PACKLEADER_NAME|64|monster display name for Kobold Packleader|kobold packleader
MONSTER_KOBOLD_PACKLEADER_DESC||monster description for Kobold Packleader|A scarred kobold leader with bone charms, a raised crest, and a short sword. It pushes nearby kobolds forward and fights hardest when backed by allies.
MONSTER_ORC_BERSERKER_NAME|64|monster display name for Orc Berserker|orc berserker
MONSTER_ORC_BERSERKER_DESC||monster description for Orc Berserker|A broad orc berserker in rough hide armor, carrying a hand axe in scarred hands. It comes in fast and swings to break the line before it settles.
MONSTER_ORC_WARRIOR_NAME|64|monster display name for Orc Warrior|orc warrior
MONSTER_ORC_WARRIOR_DESC||monster description for Orc Warrior|A large orc looter in studded leather, hefting a mace with practiced force. It presses into close range and batters through weak guards.
MONSTER_ORC_CHAMPION_NAME|64|monster display name for Orc Champion|orc champion
MONSTER_ORC_CHAMPION_DESC||monster description for Orc Champion|A veteran orc fighter in battered scale mail, gripping a greataxe with both hands. It has the discipline to hold a chokepoint without the command presence of a warboss.
MONSTER_ORC_WARBOSS_NAME|64|monster display name for Orc Warboss|orc warboss
MONSTER_ORC_WARBOSS_DESC||monster description for Orc Warboss|A huge scarred orc commander in scale mail, carrying a battle axe and watching the room like it already belongs to him.
MONSTER_ORC_THROWER_NAME|64|monster display name for Orc Thrower|orc thrower
MONSTER_ORC_THROWER_DESC||monster description for Orc Thrower|A wiry orc skirmisher with a hand axe in one fist and more axes hanging from a rope belt. It softens targets at range, then closes when the line breaks.
MONSTER_ORC_WARLOCK_NAME|64|monster display name for Orc Warlock|orc warlock
MONSTER_ORC_WARLOCK_DESC||monster description for Orc Warlock|A scarred orc fire-caller in a singed robe, gripping a mace with blackened iron bands. It hangs behind heavier orcs and throws destructive magic into crowded fights.
MONSTER_OROG_NAME|64|monster display name for Orog|orog
MONSTER_OROG_DESC||monster description for Orog|An orog is a heavy underworld orc in dark mail, broader and more disciplined than its surface kin. It fights in steady steps and uses a battle axe to punish anyone who gives ground.
MONSTER_OROG_BRUTE_NAME|64|monster display name for Orog Brute|orog brute
MONSTER_OROG_BRUTE_DESC||monster description for Orog Brute|A scarred orog brute in patched scale, with a two-handed axe and a habit of holding the center of the fight. It is slower than lesser orcs but far harder to push back.
MONSTER_HOBGOBLIN_SOLDIER_NAME|64|monster display name for Hobgoblin Soldier|hobgoblin soldier
MONSTER_HOBGOBLIN_SOLDIER_DESC||monster description for Hobgoblin Soldier|A tall goblinoid soldier in quilted armor, armed with a short sword and round shield. It holds formation and advances in steady corridor pushes.
MONSTER_HOBGOBLIN_CAPTAIN_NAME|64|monster display name for Hobgoblin Captain|hobgoblin captain
MONSTER_HOBGOBLIN_CAPTAIN_DESC||monster description for Hobgoblin Captain|A tall hobgoblin officer in studded leather, carrying a longsword and round shield. It leads from the front and punishes openings with clean direct cuts.
MONSTER_BUGBEAR_MAULER_NAME|64|monster display name for Bugbear Mauler|bugbear mauler
MONSTER_BUGBEAR_MAULER_DESC||monster description for Bugbear Mauler|A hulking bugbear in heavy gambeson, gripping a club in oversized hands. It uses tight rooms to turn every exchange into a bludgeoning match.
MONSTER_BUGBEAR_STALKER_NAME|64|monster display name for Bugbear Stalker|bugbear stalker
MONSTER_BUGBEAR_STALKER_DESC||monster description for Bugbear Stalker|A shaggy bugbear in leather armor, carrying a hand axe low at its side. It waits in cover, then breaks concealment with one hard rush.
MONSTER_BANDIT_SKIRMISHER_NAME|64|monster display name for Bandit Skirmisher|bandit skirmisher
MONSTER_BANDIT_SKIRMISHER_DESC||monster description for Bandit Skirmisher|A quick human bandit with a sling, a dagger, and a weighted net bundled at the hip. It keeps moving and tries to pin targets before the heavier bandits close.
MONSTER_BANDIT_VETERAN_NAME|64|monster display name for Bandit Veteran|bandit veteran
MONSTER_BANDIT_VETERAN_DESC||monster description for Bandit Veteran|A hardened human outlaw in studded leather, carrying a longsword and a dented buckler. It has survived enough roadside fights to press openings without flinching.
MONSTER_BANDIT_CAPTAIN_NAME|64|monster display name for Bandit Captain|bandit captain
MONSTER_BANDIT_CAPTAIN_DESC||monster description for Bandit Captain|A hard-bitten bandit captain in worn chain mail, carrying a longsword and round shield. It fights from the front and keeps lesser outlaws from breaking.
MONSTER_BANDIT_MARKSMAN_NAME|64|monster display name for Bandit Marksman|bandit marksman
MONSTER_BANDIT_MARKSMAN_DESC||monster description for Bandit Marksman|A hard-eyed human archer in leather armor, carrying a longbow and a short blade. It keeps lanes open and punishes anyone who tries to cross exposed ground.
MONSTER_BANDIT_MAGE_NAME|64|monster display name for Bandit Mage|bandit mage
MONSTER_BANDIT_MAGE_DESC||monster description for Bandit Mage|A nervous outlaw spellcaster in a travel robe, carrying a dagger and stolen spell scraps. It uses simple arcane tricks to escape pressure and keep stronger bandits alive.
MONSTER_ASSASSIN_NAME|64|monster display name for Assassin|assassin
MONSTER_ASSASSIN_DESC||monster description for Assassin|A quiet killer in close dark leathers, carrying a narrow dagger and moving with no wasted steps. It waits for a clean angle, then lets poison do part of the work.
MONSTER_ASSASSIN_ARCHER_NAME|64|monster display name for Assassin Archer|assassin archer
MONSTER_ASSASSIN_ARCHER_DESC||monster description for Assassin Archer|A lean killer with a blackened shortbow, light armor, and a poisoned knife at the belt. It keeps distance and relies on one sharp opening rather than endurance.
MONSTER_BOMBARDIER_BEETLE_NAME|64|monster display name for Bombardier Beetle|bombardier beetle
MONSTER_BOMBARDIER_BEETLE_DESC||monster description for Bombardier Beetle|A dog-sized beetle with a mottled shell and hot chemical sacs under its abdomen. It turns its rear toward threats and sprays burning acid vapor before closing with its jaws.
MONSTER_HOBGOBLIN_ARBALESTER_NAME|64|monster display name for Hobgoblin Arbalester|hobgoblin arbalester
MONSTER_HOBGOBLIN_ARBALESTER_DESC||monster description for Hobgoblin Arbalester|A tall hobgoblin crossbowman in quilted armor, carrying a crank-bowed arbalest and a short blade. It waits behind the line and fires heavy bolts down clear corridors.
MONSTER_PHASE_SPIDER_NAME|64|monster display name for Phase Spider|phase spider
MONSTER_PHASE_SPIDER_DESC||monster description for Phase Spider|A large gray spider with translucent legs and a body that flickers out of line with the room. It vanishes between lunges, then returns close enough to web or bite.
MONSTER_SWORD_SPIDER_NAME|64|monster display name for Sword Spider|sword spider
MONSTER_SWORD_SPIDER_DESC||monster description for Sword Spider|A hard-shelled spider with long blade-like legs and a narrow cutting abdomen. It scuttles into reach and carves with several slashing limbs at once.
MONSTER_DISPLACER_BEAST_NAME|64|monster display name for Displacer Beast|displacer beast
MONSTER_DISPLACER_BEAST_DESC||monster description for Displacer Beast|A panther-like magical beast with six legs and two lashing tentacles over its shoulders. Its outline slides away from its true body, making direct charges unreliable.
MONSTER_EVIL_MAGIC_USER_NAME|64|monster display name for Evil Magic-User|evil magic-user
MONSTER_EVIL_MAGIC_USER_DESC||monster description for Evil Magic-User|A hostile spellcaster in a patched robe, clutching a dagger and a bundle of stolen notes. It stays behind stronger bodies and uses simple arcane magic to break a straight approach.
MONSTER_EVIL_MAGE_NAME|64|monster display name for Evil Mage|evil mage
MONSTER_EVIL_MAGE_DESC||monster description for Evil Mage|A practiced enemy mage in a scorched robe, carrying a wand case and a narrow knife. It casts battlefield spells freely enough that open ground becomes dangerous.
MONSTER_EVIL_ARCHMAGE_NAME|64|monster display name for Evil Archmage|evil archmage
MONSTER_EVIL_ARCHMAGE_DESC||monster description for Evil Archmage|A dangerous archmage in a travel-stained robe, calm-eyed and guarded by layered magic. It turns corridors and crowds against intruders with high arcane spells.
MONSTER_SKELETON_ARCHER_NAME|64|monster display name for Skeleton Archer|skeleton archer
MONSTER_SKELETON_ARCHER_DESC||monster description for Skeleton Archer|A human skeleton with a cracked shortbow, a knife, and old arrow shafts rattling in its ribs. It holds the back of a crypt passage and looses brittle arrows at anything living.
MONSTER_GHAST_NAME|64|monster display name for Ghast|ghast
MONSTER_GHAST_DESC||monster description for Ghast|A taller ghoul with tight gray skin, black claws, and a fixed hungry stare. Its touch can lock muscles long enough for the dead thing to tear in close.
MONSTER_GREATER_GHAST_NAME|64|monster display name for Greater Ghast|greater ghast
MONSTER_GREATER_GHAST_DESC||monster description for Greater Ghast|A broad-shouldered ghast with corded gray flesh, longer black claws, and a patient dead stare. It fights like a stronger ghast, pinning prey with numbing wounds before closing in.
MONSTER_GIANT_SCORPION_NAME|64|monster display name for Giant Scorpion|giant scorpion
MONSTER_GIANT_SCORPION_DESC||monster description for Giant Scorpion|A heavy cave scorpion with dark plates, wide claws, and a raised venomous tail. It holds ground with its pincers while looking for a clean sting.
MONSTER_GIANT_WASP_NAME|64|monster display name for Giant Wasp|giant wasp
MONSTER_GIANT_WASP_DESC||monster description for Giant Wasp|A dog-sized wasp with glassy wings, a narrow striped body, and a long stinger. It darts in and backs away before its prey can settle into a stance.
MONSTER_GIANT_SLUG_NAME|64|monster display name for Giant Slug|giant slug
MONSTER_GIANT_SLUG_DESC||monster description for Giant Slug|A massive gray slug with a wet ridged body, rasping mouthparts, and acidic slime pooling under it. It moves slowly but spits burning acid when prey stays out of reach.
MONSTER_DOPPELGANGER_NAME|64|monster display name for Doppelganger|doppelganger
MONSTER_DOPPELGANGER_DESC||monster description for Doppelganger|A smooth-faced mimic of a person, wearing a borrowed shape with unsettling precision. It steps like an adventurer and uses that familiarity to break focus at close range.
MONSTER_BEHOLDER_NAME|64|monster display name for Beholder|beholder
MONSTER_BEHOLDER_DESC||monster description for Beholder|A floating orb of flesh with one central eye, a wide mouth, and smaller eyestalks turning in several directions at once. It dominates open space with cruel rays instead of chasing prey.
MONSTER_CULT_PRIEST_NAME|64|monster display name for Cult Priest|cult priest
MONSTER_CULT_PRIEST_DESC||monster description for Cult Priest|A human cultist in a linen robe, armed with a mace and cheap ritual charms. It fights with more zeal than skill and keeps advancing after bad trades.
MONSTER_CULT_ZEALOT_NAME|64|monster display name for Cult Zealot|cult zealot
MONSTER_CULT_ZEALOT_DESC||monster description for Cult Zealot|A wild-eyed human cultist in a padded robe, swinging a flail with both hands. It rushes into danger and trusts pain to carry it through.
MONSTER_CULT_CHAPLAIN_NAME|64|monster display name for Cult Chaplain|cult chaplain
MONSTER_CULT_CHAPLAIN_DESC||monster description for Cult Chaplain|A mail-clad cult chaplain with a dark longsword, a kite shield, and a cold battle sermon on its lips. It holds the line while breaking enemy prayers and calling cruel divine magic into the melee.
MONSTER_YOUNG_RED_DRAGON_NAME|64|monster display name for Young Red Dragon|young red dragon
MONSTER_YOUNG_RED_DRAGON_DESC||monster description for Young Red Dragon|A young red dragon with hot red scales, black horns, and ember-bright eyes. It fights with claws, teeth, and gouts of fire.
MONSTER_RED_DRAGON_NAME|64|monster display name for Red Dragon|red dragon
MONSTER_RED_DRAGON_DESC||monster description for Red Dragon|A full-grown red dragon with furnace-hot breath, heavy wings, and scorched plates along its neck. It dominates the fight with fire, terror, and brutal force.
MONSTER_ELDER_RED_DRAGON_NAME|64|monster display name for Elder Red Dragon|elder red dragon
MONSTER_ELDER_RED_DRAGON_DESC||monster description for Elder Red Dragon|An elder red dragon with smoke-dark wings and molten seams between its scales. Its fire is old, patient, and backed by cruel magic.
MONSTER_ANCIENT_RED_DRAGON_NAME|64|monster display name for Ancient Red Dragon|ancient red dragon
MONSTER_ANCIENT_RED_DRAGON_DESC||monster description for Ancient Red Dragon|An ancient red dragon, vast and scarred, with wings like blackened banners and heat shimmering around every breath. It is a battlefield by itself.
MONSTER_YOUNG_GREEN_DRAGON_NAME|64|monster display name for Young Green Dragon|young green dragon
MONSTER_YOUNG_GREEN_DRAGON_DESC||monster description for Young Green Dragon|A young green dragon with leaf-dark scales and a narrow, watchful head. Its breath rolls out as poisonous vapor.
MONSTER_GREEN_DRAGON_NAME|64|monster display name for Green Dragon|green dragon
MONSTER_GREEN_DRAGON_DESC||monster description for Green Dragon|A green dragon with thorn-like horns, dark wings, and poisonous breath. It watches for hesitation and turns weak wills against themselves.
MONSTER_ELDER_GREEN_DRAGON_NAME|64|monster display name for Elder Green Dragon|elder green dragon
MONSTER_ELDER_GREEN_DRAGON_DESC||monster description for Elder Green Dragon|An elder green dragon with moss-dark scales, old scars, and a poisonous cloud clinging around its jaws. It fights with patience and enchantment.
MONSTER_ANCIENT_GREEN_DRAGON_NAME|64|monster display name for Ancient Green Dragon|ancient green dragon
MONSTER_ANCIENT_GREEN_DRAGON_DESC||monster description for Ancient Green Dragon|An ancient green dragon with antlered horns, vine-dark wings, and venom crusted along its fangs. Its voice is as dangerous as its breath.
MONSTER_YOUNG_WHITE_DRAGON_NAME|64|monster display name for Young White Dragon|young white dragon
MONSTER_YOUNG_WHITE_DRAGON_DESC||monster description for Young White Dragon|A young white dragon with ice-pale scales and a serrated crest. Frost steams around its teeth.
MONSTER_WHITE_DRAGON_NAME|64|monster display name for White Dragon|white dragon
MONSTER_WHITE_DRAGON_DESC||monster description for White Dragon|A white dragon with broad pale wings, ice-crusted horns, and cold breath that rolls low across stone. Fog gathers wherever it settles.
MONSTER_ELDER_WHITE_DRAGON_NAME|64|monster display name for Elder White Dragon|elder white dragon
MONSTER_ELDER_WHITE_DRAGON_DESC||monster description for Elder White Dragon|An elder white dragon with glacier-thick plates and breath cold enough to seal the ground under ice. Its magic slows whole fights.
MONSTER_ANCIENT_WHITE_DRAGON_NAME|64|monster display name for Ancient White Dragon|ancient white dragon
MONSTER_ANCIENT_WHITE_DRAGON_DESC||monster description for Ancient White Dragon|An ancient white dragon with frost-rimed wings and a hide like broken glacier stone. It brings a winter wall with it.
MONSTER_YOUNG_BLUE_DRAGON_NAME|64|monster display name for Young Blue Dragon|young blue dragon
MONSTER_YOUNG_BLUE_DRAGON_DESC||monster description for Young Blue Dragon|A young blue dragon with cobalt scales, swept horns, and a crackle of lightning around its jaws.
MONSTER_BLUE_DRAGON_NAME|64|monster display name for Blue Dragon|blue dragon
MONSTER_BLUE_DRAGON_DESC||monster description for Blue Dragon|A blue dragon with ridged horns, bright eyes, and lightning coiled in its throat. It sees what others try to hide.
MONSTER_ELDER_BLUE_DRAGON_NAME|64|monster display name for Elder Blue Dragon|elder blue dragon
MONSTER_ELDER_BLUE_DRAGON_DESC||monster description for Elder Blue Dragon|An elder blue dragon with storm-bright veins beneath its scales and wings edged like thunderheads. Its magic throws enemies out of position.
MONSTER_ANCIENT_BLUE_DRAGON_NAME|64|monster display name for Ancient Blue Dragon|ancient blue dragon
MONSTER_ANCIENT_BLUE_DRAGON_DESC||monster description for Ancient Blue Dragon|An ancient blue dragon with a crown of horns and lightning crawling across its wings. Space bends wrong around its storm magic.
MONSTER_YOUNG_BLACK_DRAGON_NAME|64|monster display name for Young Black Dragon|young black dragon
MONSTER_YOUNG_BLACK_DRAGON_DESC||monster description for Young Black Dragon|A young black dragon with soot-dark scales, low horns, and acid dripping from its jaw.
MONSTER_BLACK_DRAGON_NAME|64|monster display name for Black Dragon|black dragon
MONSTER_BLACK_DRAGON_DESC||monster description for Black Dragon|A black dragon with jagged horns, ragged wings, and acid breath that hisses across armor and stone. Unholy magic clings to its voice.
MONSTER_ELDER_BLACK_DRAGON_NAME|64|monster display name for Elder Black Dragon|elder black dragon
MONSTER_ELDER_BLACK_DRAGON_DESC||monster description for Elder Black Dragon|An elder black dragon with scarred plates, acid-burned claws, and a killing patience. Its magic slows prey long enough for the breath to finish the work.
MONSTER_ANCIENT_BLACK_DRAGON_NAME|64|monster display name for Ancient Black Dragon|ancient black dragon
MONSTER_ANCIENT_BLACK_DRAGON_DESC||monster description for Ancient Black Dragon|An ancient black dragon with a jagged skull, tattered wings, and acid-dark breath. Poison vapor hangs close around it.
MONSTER_SKELETON_SPEARMAN_NAME|64|monster display name for Skeleton Spearman|skeleton spearman
MONSTER_SKELETON_SPEARMAN_DESC||monster description for Skeleton Spearman|A human skeleton carrying a cracked spear in both hands. It advances without fear and tries to keep living targets at spear range.
MONSTER_SKELETON_AXEMAN_NAME|64|monster display name for Skeleton Axeman|skeleton axeman
MONSTER_SKELETON_AXEMAN_DESC||monster description for Skeleton Axeman|A human skeleton with a hand axe, chipped ribs, and old infantry scraps hanging from its bones. It marches in steadily and opens with heavy chopping blows.
MONSTER_SKELETON_KNIGHT_NAME|64|monster display name for Skeleton Knight|skeleton knight
MONSTER_SKELETON_KNIGHT_DESC||monster description for Skeleton Knight|A human-sized skeleton in rusted chain mail, carrying a longsword and round shield. It advances behind the shield and cuts with the habits of a trained guard.
MONSTER_ROTTING_ZOMBIE_NAME|64|monster display name for Rotting Zombie|rotting zombie
MONSTER_ROTTING_ZOMBIE_DESC||monster description for Rotting Zombie|A rotting human corpse with slack arms, split skin, and dirt packed into its clothes. It shambles straight ahead, spreading grave disease through the wounds it opens.
MONSTER_PLAGUE_ZOMBIE_NAME|64|monster display name for Plague Zombie|plague zombie
MONSTER_PLAGUE_ZOMBIE_DESC||monster description for Plague Zombie|A swollen human corpse with blotched skin, torn clothing, and foul fluid leaking from old wounds. It moves slowly but soaks up punishment and presses into reach.
MONSTER_GHOUL_RAVAGER_NAME|64|monster display name for Ghoul Ravager|ghoul ravager
MONSTER_GHOUL_RAVAGER_DESC||monster description for Ghoul Ravager|A gaunt undead scavenger with gray skin, long nails, and a rusty knife. It scrambles through cramped rooms and slashes at legs or hands.
MONSTER_GRAVE_HOUND_NAME|64|monster display name for Grave Hound|grave hound
MONSTER_GRAVE_HOUND_DESC||monster description for Grave Hound|A lean undead hound with patchy fur, pale gums, and grave dirt crusted around its muzzle. It rushes low and bites hard before prey can reset.
MONSTER_WIGHT_NAME|64|monster display name for Wight|wight
MONSTER_WIGHT_DESC||monster description for Wight|A human-sized undead soldier with dry flesh, old rank marks, and a notched short sword. It advances like trained infantry and punishes retreat.
MONSTER_GRAY_WOLF_NAME|64|monster display name for Gray Wolf|gray wolf
MONSTER_GRAY_WOLF_DESC||monster description for Gray Wolf|A thin gray cave wolf with pale eyes, worn claws, and ribs showing under its hide. It prowls dark tunnels and darts in for quick bites.
MONSTER_DIRE_WARG_NAME|64|monster display name for Dire Warg|dire warg
MONSTER_DIRE_WARG_DESC||monster description for Dire Warg|A large wolf-like tunnel predator with a heavy head, thick neck, and scarred muzzle. It holds narrow passages with brute weight and snapping jaws.
MONSTER_GREAT_BOAR_NAME|64|monster display name for Great Boar|great boar
MONSTER_GREAT_BOAR_DESC||monster description for Great Boar|A bristled cave boar with chipped tusks, hard shoulders, and stone dust packed into its hide. It lowers its head and turns corridors into charge lanes.
MONSTER_DIRE_BOAR_NAME|64|monster display name for Dire Boar|dire boar
MONSTER_DIRE_BOAR_DESC||monster description for Dire Boar|A huge scarred boar with long tusks, thick shoulders, and a bloodied snout. It crashes forward to batter enemies off their feet.
MONSTER_GRIZZLY_BEAR_NAME|64|monster display name for Grizzly Bear|grizzly bear
MONSTER_GRIZZLY_BEAR_DESC||monster description for Grizzly Bear|A broad cave bear with pale fur, blunt claws, and a muscled back. It closes in short rushes and crushes anything pinned near a wall.
MONSTER_DIRE_BEAR_NAME|64|monster display name for Dire Bear|dire bear
MONSTER_DIRE_BEAR_DESC||monster description for Dire Bear|An oversized bear with scarred shoulders, heavy paws, and a jaw broad enough to break bone. It shrugs off weak hits and mauls through guards.
MONSTER_GIANT_CENTIPEDE_NAME|64|monster display name for Giant Centipede|giant centipede
MONSTER_GIANT_CENTIPEDE_DESC||monster description for Giant Centipede|A person-length centipede with hooked legs, curved jaws, and a flat armored body. It darts at exposed feet and wrists, then coils away.
MONSTER_GIANT_BEETLE_NAME|64|monster display name for Giant Beetle|giant beetle
MONSTER_GIANT_BEETLE_DESC||monster description for Giant Beetle|A waist-high beetle with a hard black shell, jointed legs, and grinding mandibles. It grinds forward slowly and trusts its shell to turn blows.
MONSTER_LIZARD_NAME|64|monster display name for Lizard|lizard
MONSTER_LIZARD_DESC||monster description for Lizard|A dog-sized pale cave lizard with flat claws, a long tail, and lidless eyes. It clings to stone and lunges when the path tightens.
MONSTER_GIANT_LIZARD_NAME|64|monster display name for Giant Lizard|giant lizard
MONSTER_GIANT_LIZARD_DESC||monster description for Giant Lizard|A human-sized cavern lizard with thick scales, a low body, and heavy jaws. It freezes in place, then snaps forward with sudden weight.
MONSTER_CAVE_SPIDER_NAME|64|monster display name for Cave Spider|cave spider
MONSTER_CAVE_SPIDER_DESC||monster description for Cave Spider|A human-sized cave spider with long legs, dark bristles, and wet webbing stretched between its fangs. It blocks close paths with webbing and bites trapped prey.
MONSTER_WOLF_SPIDER_NAME|64|monster display name for Wolf Spider|wolf spider
MONSTER_WOLF_SPIDER_DESC||monster description for Wolf Spider|A large hunting spider with long legs, swollen fangs, and fast jerking movement. It rushes from cover and throws webbing before closing.
MONSTER_CARRION_CRAWLER_NAME|64|monster display name for Carrion Crawler|carrion crawler
MONSTER_CARRION_CRAWLER_DESC||monster description for Carrion Crawler|A long many-legged carrion crawler with pale flesh, probing feelers, and a mouth built for soft meat. It drags itself toward warm bodies and bites from low angles.
MONSTER_GRAY_OOZE_NAME|64|monster display name for Gray Ooze|gray ooze
MONSTER_GRAY_OOZE_DESC||monster description for Gray Ooze|A flat gray ooze with wet skin, slow ripples, and no clear face or limbs. It creeps over stone and dissolves whatever stays under it.
MONSTER_OCHRE_JELLY_NAME|64|monster display name for Ochre Jelly|ochre jelly
MONSTER_OCHRE_JELLY_DESC||monster description for Ochre Jelly|A thick yellow-brown ooze with rolling folds and scraps suspended inside its body. It advances slowly, fills space, and smothers targets that cannot step away.
MONSTER_BLACK_PUDDING_NAME|64|monster display name for Black Pudding|black pudding
MONSTER_BLACK_PUDDING_DESC||monster description for Black Pudding|A tar-black acidic ooze with a glossy surface and bubbles breaking through it. It spreads across the floor and eats armor, flesh, and room to maneuver.
MONSTER_GARGOYLE_NAME|64|monster display name for Gargoyle|gargoyle
MONSTER_GARGOYLE_DESC||monster description for Gargoyle|A gargoyle is a crouched stone creature with bat wings, clawed hands, and a horned face carved into its head. It rakes with stone claws and shrugs off weak strikes.
MONSTER_GREATER_GARGOYLE_NAME|64|monster display name for Greater Gargoyle|greater gargoyle
MONSTER_GREATER_GARGOYLE_DESC||monster description for Greater Gargoyle|A larger winged stone creature with thick limbs, blunt claws, and a cracked statue face. It takes punishment well and hammers enemies with heavy stone blows.
MONSTER_BLACKGLASS_GARGOYLE_NAME|64|monster display name for Blackglass Gargoyle|blackglass gargoyle
MONSTER_BLACKGLASS_GARGOYLE_DESC||monster description for Blackglass Gargoyle|A heavy winged statue with dark crystal seams grown through its shoulders, jaw, and claws. It moves with grinding force and strikes like a falling parapet.
MONSTER_DUERGAR_SCOUT_NAME|64|monster display name for Duergar Scout|duergar scout
MONSTER_DUERGAR_SCOUT_DESC||monster description for Duergar Scout|A duergar scout is a short gray-skinned dwarf in dark leather, carrying a hand axe and a hard stare. It uses bad light and tight corners to set up ambushes.
MONSTER_DUERGAR_GUARD_NAME|64|monster display name for Duergar Guard|duergar guard
MONSTER_DUERGAR_GUARD_DESC||monster description for Duergar Guard|A duergar guard is a short gray-skinned dwarf in brigandine, braced behind a spear and round shield. It holds chokepoints and keeps enemies at spear reach.
MONSTER_DUERGAR_VETERAN_NAME|64|monster display name for Duergar Veteran|duergar veteran
MONSTER_DUERGAR_VETERAN_DESC||monster description for Duergar Veteran|A duergar veteran is a stocky gray-skinned dwarf in scale mail, gripping a mace with scarred hands. It closes directly and pounds through armor by force.
MONSTER_DUERGAR_CAPTAIN_NAME|64|monster display name for Duergar Captain|duergar captain
MONSTER_DUERGAR_CAPTAIN_DESC||monster description for Duergar Captain|A duergar captain is a gray-skinned dwarf officer in heavy mail, carrying a broad axe and a shield marked by old mine dust. It drives its soldiers forward from the safest chokepoint.
MONSTER_DUERGAR_PRIEST_NAME|64|monster display name for Duergar Priest|duergar priest
MONSTER_DUERGAR_PRIEST_DESC||monster description for Duergar Priest|A duergar priest is a gray-skinned dwarf in soot-dark vestments, with a mace in one hand and a low, bitter chant under its breath. It weakens enemies before the line closes.
MONSTER_BLACKGLASS_DUERGAR_SCOUT_NAME|64|monster display name for Blackglass Duergar Scout|blackglass duergar scout
MONSTER_BLACKGLASS_DUERGAR_SCOUT_DESC||monster description for Blackglass Duergar Scout|A duergar scout with blackglass chips pressed into its leather and axe edge. The splinters catch little light, and its stare is too steady for an ordinary sentry.
MONSTER_BLACKGLASS_DUERGAR_WARRIOR_NAME|64|monster display name for Blackglass Duergar Warrior|blackglass duergar warrior
MONSTER_BLACKGLASS_DUERGAR_WARRIOR_DESC||monster description for Blackglass Duergar Warrior|A duergar warrior with blackglass dust ground into its mail seams and weapon haft. It fights like pain is arriving from somewhere else.
MONSTER_BLACKGLASS_DUERGAR_VETERAN_NAME|64|monster display name for Blackglass Duergar Veteran|blackglass duergar veteran
MONSTER_BLACKGLASS_DUERGAR_VETERAN_DESC||monster description for Blackglass Duergar Veteran|A veteran duergar with a glass-black rash running under its armor straps. It grips a mace hard enough to split the leather wrap and keeps advancing through wounds.
MONSTER_BLACKGLASS_DUERGAR_CAPTAIN_NAME|64|monster display name for Blackglass Duergar Captain|blackglass duergar captain
MONSTER_BLACKGLASS_DUERGAR_CAPTAIN_DESC||monster description for Blackglass Duergar Captain|A duergar captain with blackglass seams across its shield rim, mail rings, and old scars. It moves with the hard patience of a commander already half claimed by the mine.
MONSTER_TROGLODYTE_NAME|64|monster display name for Troglodyte|troglodyte
MONSTER_TROGLODYTE_DESC||monster description for Troglodyte|A troglodyte is a lizard-like cave humanoid with slick scales, fangs, and a crude club. It crowds forward and fights with club, teeth, and claws.
MONSTER_TROGLODYTE_BRUTE_NAME|64|monster display name for Troglodyte Brute|troglodyte brute
MONSTER_TROGLODYTE_BRUTE_DESC||monster description for Troglodyte Brute|A troglodyte brute is a larger lizard-like cave humanoid with thick arms, cracked scales, and a heavy mace. It batters through narrow spaces and tries to overwhelm guards.
MONSTER_STIRGE_NAME|64|monster display name for Stirge|stirge
MONSTER_STIRGE_DESC||monster description for Stirge|A stirge is a fist-sized flying bloodsucker with bat wings, hooked legs, and a needle snout. It darts in, latches onto wounds, and drinks blood.
MONSTER_GIANT_FIRE_BEETLE_NAME|64|monster display name for Giant Fire Beetle|giant fire beetle
MONSTER_GIANT_FIRE_BEETLE_DESC||monster description for Giant Fire Beetle|A dog-sized cave beetle with a black shell and glowing orange glands under its plates. It scuttles through tight spaces and ignores most heat.
MONSTER_SHRIEKER_NAME|64|monster display name for Shrieker|shrieker
MONSTER_SHRIEKER_DESC||monster description for Shrieker|A shrieker is a waist-high pale mushroom with a rubbery stalk, flared cap, and trembling gills. It does not hunt; movement near it triggers a loud warning cry.
MONSTER_ANIMATED_ARMOR_NAME|64|monster display name for Animated Armor|animated armor
MONSTER_ANIMATED_ARMOR_DESC||monster description for Animated Armor|An animated armor is an empty suit of chain mail holding a longsword in both gauntlets. It lurches awake when disturbed and cuts without pain, breath, or fear.
MONSTER_FLYING_SWORD_NAME|64|monster display name for Flying Sword|flying sword
MONSTER_FLYING_SWORD_DESC||monster description for Flying Sword|A flying sword is a short sword hanging in the air, point-first, with no hand on the grip. It darts and cuts like a duelist's blade.
MONSTER_MINOTAUR_NAME|64|monster display name for Minotaur|minotaur
MONSTER_MINOTAUR_DESC||monster description for Minotaur|A minotaur is a huge bull-headed humanoid with heavy horns, thick shoulders, hardened leather, and a battle axe. It uses doors and narrow halls to trap enemies in brutal melee.
MONSTER_HELMED_HORROR_NAME|64|monster display name for Helmed Horror|helmed horror
MONSTER_HELMED_HORROR_DESC||monster description for Helmed Horror|A helmed horror is an empty suit of plate mail with a closed helm, glowing runes, and a longsword. It advances under old wards and keeps fighting until the shell is broken.
MONSTER_GIANT_CRAB_NAME|64|monster display name for Giant Crab|giant crab
MONSTER_GIANT_CRAB_DESC||monster description for Giant Crab|A barrel-wide crab with a ridged shell, raised eyestalks, and oversized claws. It sidesteps quickly and clamps down on anything within reach.
MONSTER_CROCODILE_NAME|64|monster display name for Crocodile|crocodile
MONSTER_CROCODILE_DESC||monster description for Crocodile|A long armored reptile with low eyes, a thick tail, and a mouth full of conical teeth. It lies still, then rushes in for a crushing bite.
MONSTER_VIOLET_FUNGUS_NAME|64|monster display name for Violet Fungus|violet fungus
MONSTER_VIOLET_FUNGUS_DESC||monster description for Violet Fungus|A bruised-purple fungus with limp stalks, dangling tendrils, and a swollen cap. It whips nearby targets and bursts sickening spores into the air.
MONSTER_DARKMANTLE_NAME|64|monster display name for Darkmantle|darkmantle
MONSTER_DARKMANTLE_DESC||monster description for Darkmantle|A darkmantle is a leathery cave creature with a hood-like body, hanging tendrils, and clutching arms. It clings to ceilings and drops onto victims from above.
MONSTER_PIERCER_NAME|64|monster display name for Piercer|piercer
MONSTER_PIERCER_DESC||monster description for Piercer|A piercer is a cone-shelled cave creature hanging from the ceiling like a living stalactite. It waits overhead and drops point-first onto passing prey.
MONSTER_HARPY_NAME|64|monster display name for Harpy|harpy
MONSTER_HARPY_DESC||monster description for Harpy|A harpy is a winged humanoid with ragged feathers, taloned feet, and a sharp human-like face. It keeps distance and sings cutting notes that can steal a target's voice.
MONSTER_HARPY_RAVAGER_NAME|64|monster display name for Harpy Ravager|harpy ravager
MONSTER_HARPY_RAVAGER_DESC||monster description for Harpy Ravager|A harpy ravager is a scarred cliff hunter with heavier talons, torn red-brown feathers, and a raw screaming voice. It dives into reach and tears twice before lifting away.
MONSTER_COCKATRICE_NAME|64|monster display name for Cockatrice|cockatrice
MONSTER_COCKATRICE_DESC||monster description for Cockatrice|A cockatrice is a rooster-sized reptile-bird with a hooked beak, scaled neck, and twitching tail. It snaps at close range and fixes targets with a limb-locking stare.
MONSTER_OWLBEAR_NAME|64|monster display name for Owlbear|owlbear
MONSTER_OWLBEAR_DESC||monster description for Owlbear|An owlbear is a bear-sized beast with matted fur, a hooked owl beak, and round staring eyes. It charges straight in and tears with claws and beak.
MONSTER_ANKHEG_NAME|64|monster display name for Ankheg|ankheg
MONSTER_ANKHEG_DESC||monster description for Ankheg|An ankheg is a horse-sized burrowing insect with a plated shell, hooked forelegs, and acid-wet mandibles. It erupts from loose ground and spits acid before closing.
MONSTER_BASILISK_NAME|64|monster display name for Basilisk|basilisk
MONSTER_BASILISK_DESC||monster description for Basilisk|A basilisk is a low heavy lizard with pebbled hide, blunt claws, and a broad head. It bites from a braced stance and forces enemies to fight over its armored front.
MONSTER_RUST_MONSTER_NAME|64|monster display name for Rust Monster|rust monster
MONSTER_RUST_MONSTER_DESC||monster description for Rust Monster|A rust monster is a dog-sized insectoid with rust-red feelers, a plated body, and twitching antennae. It presses into metal gear and spreads rust through armor and weapons.
MONSTER_LIZARDMAN_RAIDER_NAME|64|monster display name for Lizardman Raider|lizardman raider
MONSTER_LIZARDMAN_RAIDER_DESC||monster description for Lizardman Raider|A scaled marsh humanoid in a hide jerkin, armed with a spear and wicker shield. It fights in guarded thrusts and uses the shield to hold ground.
MONSTER_WATER_WEIRD_NAME|64|monster display name for Water Weird|water weird
MONSTER_WATER_WEIRD_DESC||monster description for Water Weird|A water weird is a twisting column of animated water with arm-like coils and a half-formed head. It lashes from its own shifting body and resists cold.
MONSTER_MUDMAN_NAME|64|monster display name for Mudman|mudman
MONSTER_MUDMAN_DESC||monster description for Mudman|A mudman is a sagging humanoid mass of swamp mud, roots, and drowned clay. It drags itself through wet ground and softens stone underfoot before pulling prey into reach.
MONSTER_WATER_DRAKE_NAME|64|monster display name for Water Drake|water drake
MONSTER_WATER_DRAKE_DESC||monster description for Water Drake|A water drake is a heavy-scaled tunnel drake with slick blue-gray plates, webbed claws, and a jaw built to drag prey under. It fights well in flooded passages.
MONSTER_WILL_O_WISP_NAME|64|monster display name for Will-o'-Wisp|will-o'-wisp
MONSTER_WILL_O_WISP_DESC||monster description for Will-o'-Wisp|A will-o'-wisp is a fist-sized floating light with a cold blue center and crackling edges. It flickers through walls and closes to shock anything that follows it.
MONSTER_ETTERCAP_NAME|64|monster display name for Ettercap|ettercap
MONSTER_ETTERCAP_DESC||monster description for Ettercap|An ettercap is a wiry spider-like humanoid with long arms, hooked fingers, webbed limbs, and a spear. It guards spider nests and throws webbing before stabbing.
MONSTER_SAHUAGIN_NAME|64|monster display name for Sahuagin|sahuagin
MONSTER_SAHUAGIN_DESC||monster description for Sahuagin|A sahuagin is a fish-scaled sea humanoid with a spear, hide armor, and a wicker shield. It advances with shield high and strikes like a practiced shore raider.
MONSTER_SAHUAGIN_PRIEST_NAME|64|monster display name for Sahuagin Priest|sahuagin priest
MONSTER_SAHUAGIN_PRIEST_DESC||monster description for Sahuagin Priest|A sahuagin priest is a fish-scaled sea humanoid in oilskin, clutching a mace and salt-stained charms. It hangs back when it can and casts Command or Magic Missile.
MONSTER_MIMIC_NAME|64|monster display name for Mimic|mimic
MONSTER_MIMIC_DESC||monster description for Mimic|A mimic is a shapeshifting dungeon predator disguised as a chest, door, or piece of furniture until it opens. It reveals itself at close range and bites anyone who trusted the room.
MONSTER_GELATINOUS_CUBE_NAME|64|monster display name for Gelatinous Cube|gelatinous cube
MONSTER_GELATINOUS_CUBE_DESC||monster description for Gelatinous Cube|A gelatinous cube is a nearly transparent block of acid jelly filling most of a corridor, with scraps and bones suspended inside. It slides silently forward and digests anything it engulfs.
MONSTER_WYVERN_NAME|64|monster display name for Wyvern|wyvern
MONSTER_WYVERN_DESC||monster description for Wyvern|A wyvern is a large winged reptile with hooked talons, a narrow head, and a barbed tail. It dives into close range, then lashes with venom after the claws force an opening.
MONSTER_GREAT_WYVERN_NAME|64|monster display name for Great Wyvern|great wyvern
MONSTER_GREAT_WYVERN_DESC||monster description for Great Wyvern|A massive winged reptile with scarred talons, a heavy horned skull, and a barbed tail thick enough to punch through mail. It circles high ground, then crashes down with venom and weight.
MONSTER_MANTICORE_NAME|64|monster display name for Manticore|manticore
MONSTER_MANTICORE_DESC||monster description for Manticore|A manticore is a lion-bodied flyer with a humanlike face, batlike wings, and a tail bristling with spines. It keeps space when it can, raking up close and firing poisonous tail-spines at range.
MONSTER_SHADOW_NAME|64|monster display name for Shadow|shadow
MONSTER_SHADOW_DESC||monster description for Shadow|A shadow is a human-shaped undead mass of black vapor with long fingers and no clear face. It slips through walls and chills the body with a touch that can sap strength.
MONSTER_SPECTER_NAME|64|monster display name for Specter|specter
MONSTER_SPECTER_DESC||monster description for Specter|A specter is a translucent dead humanoid with stretched features and ragged limbs fading into mist. It passes through stone and chills warmth from the body with its touch.
MONSTER_WRAITH_NAME|64|monster display name for Wraith|wraith
MONSTER_WRAITH_DESC||monster description for Wraith|A wraith is a tall hooded undead spirit with empty sleeves, a ragged outline, and cold hands. It phases through walls and its touch bites deep enough to drain life.
MONSTER_CAVE_FISHER_NAME|64|monster display name for Cave Fisher|cave fisher
MONSTER_CAVE_FISHER_DESC||monster description for Cave Fisher|A cave fisher is a pale cave arthropod with a hard shell, hooked legs, and feelers held close to the wall. It clings to stone and lunges from tight passages when prey comes near.
MONSTER_CHIMERA_NAME|64|monster display name for Chimera|chimera
MONSTER_CHIMERA_DESC||monster description for Chimera|A chimera is a heavy beast with a lion's body, broad wings, and several mismatched heads on thick necks. It rushes into melee and attacks from multiple angles with teeth, horns, and claws.
MONSTER_HYDRA_NAME|64|monster display name for Hydra|hydra
MONSTER_HYDRA_DESC||monster description for Hydra|A hydra is a massive swamp reptile with thick legs, a long body, and many snapping heads. It crowds the fight and bites from several directions before a foe can recover.
MONSTER_GREATER_HYDRA_NAME|64|monster display name for Greater Hydra|greater hydra
MONSTER_GREATER_HYDRA_DESC||monster description for Greater Hydra|A greater hydra is an old many-headed swamp reptile with scarred hide and thicker necks than common hydras. It plants its bulk in shallow water and snaps from several angles at once.
MONSTER_MEDUSA_NAME|64|monster display name for Medusa|medusa
MONSTER_MEDUSA_DESC||monster description for Medusa|A medusa is a human-sized archer in dark leathers, with living snakes for hair and a steady bow hand. It holds distance with arrows and punishes anyone who closes without cover.
MONSTER_ROPER_NAME|64|monster display name for Roper|roper
MONSTER_ROPER_DESC||monster description for Roper|A roper is a squat pillar-like cave creature with a single eye, a tooth-ringed mouth, and long ropey tendrils. It waits like stone, then snags prey from several paces away and drags it into biting range.
MONSTER_FLESH_GOLEM_NAME|64|monster display name for Flesh Golem|flesh golem
MONSTER_FLESH_GOLEM_DESC||monster description for Flesh Golem|A flesh golem is a large human-shaped construct stitched from mismatched corpses, with heavy arms and metal staples in the skin. It lumbers straight in and absorbs punishment while hammering with its fists.
MONSTER_HILL_GIANT_NAME|64|monster display name for Hill Giant|hill giant
MONSTER_HILL_GIANT_DESC||monster description for Hill Giant|A huge broad-bellied giant carrying a stripped tree trunk as a club. It throws boulders across open ground and uses its weight to crush anything that reaches it.
MONSTER_FOMORIAN_GIANT_NAME|64|monster display name for Fomorian Giant|fomorian giant
MONSTER_FOMORIAN_GIANT_DESC||monster description for Fomorian Giant|A twisted cave giant with one broad shoulder, knotted limbs, and a dragging club. It hurls stones from broken ground, then closes with brutal, uneven swings.
MONSTER_GHOST_NAME|64|monster display name for Ghost|ghost
MONSTER_GHOST_DESC||monster description for Ghost|A ghost is a pale translucent human figure with blurred features and clothing hanging like wet burial cloth. It slips through walls and drains warmth with a cold life-leeching touch.
MONSTER_UMBER_HULK_NAME|64|monster display name for Umber Hulk|umber hulk
MONSTER_UMBER_HULK_DESC||monster description for Umber Hulk|An umber hulk is a hulking insectoid with plated armor, shovel claws, and heavy mandibles. It bursts out of loose ground and smashes through corridors with brute force.
MONSTER_STONE_GOLEM_NAME|64|monster display name for Stone Golem|stone golem
MONSTER_STONE_GOLEM_DESC||monster description for Stone Golem|A stone golem is a human-shaped stone construct with carved joints, heavy fists, and old tool marks across its body. It stands still until disturbed, then advances slowly and crushes with tireless blows.
MONSTER_VAMPIRE_SPAWN_NAME|64|monster display name for Vampire Spawn|vampire spawn
MONSTER_VAMPIRE_SPAWN_DESC||monster description for Vampire Spawn|A vampire spawn is a pale undead humanoid in leather armor, with long teeth and a drawn longsword. It moves fast, cuts for openings, and uses blood-draining magic when kept at range.
MONSTER_STONE_GIANT_NAME|64|monster display name for Stone Giant|stone giant
MONSTER_STONE_GIANT_DESC||monster description for Stone Giant|A long-limbed stone-gray giant with a heavy club and arms built for throwing. It hurls rocks before closing, then batters foes with measured crushing swings.
MONSTER_MUMMY_NAME|64|monster display name for Mummy|mummy
MONSTER_MUMMY_DESC||monster description for Mummy|A mummy is a dried humanoid corpse wrapped in old linen, with sunken eyes and stiff yellowed hands. It shambles into reach and leaves disease in the wounds it makes.
MONSTER_BULETTE_NAME|64|monster display name for Bulette|bulette
MONSTER_BULETTE_DESC||monster description for Bulette|A bulette is a massive burrowing beast with a plated back, low body, and a wide snapping mouth. It erupts from the ground and tries to bowl prey over before biting.
MONSTER_BANSHEE_NAME|64|monster display name for Banshee|banshee
MONSTER_BANSHEE_DESC||monster description for Banshee|A banshee is a gaunt ghost with torn burial cloth, wild hair, and a mouth stretched wide. Its scream spreads fear, and its cold touch can drain the life from a body.
MONSTER_XORN_NAME|64|monster display name for Xorn|xorn
MONSTER_XORN_DESC||monster description for Xorn|A xorn is a squat stone-eating creature with three thick arms, three legs, and a wide round mouth in its torso. It lumbers over broken ground and mauls anything blocking its path.
MONSTER_FROST_GIANT_NAME|64|monster display name for Frost Giant|frost giant
MONSTER_FROST_GIANT_DESC||monster description for Frost Giant|A towering frost giant with pale skin, ice-crusted hair, and a frost-rimed spear. It throws killing ice at range and drives the spear into anyone who survives the approach.
MONSTER_FIRE_GIANT_NAME|64|monster display name for Fire Giant|fire giant
MONSTER_FIRE_GIANT_DESC||monster description for Fire Giant|A broad giant in blackened plate, carrying a long halberd that glows with heat at the edge. It hurls furnace-hot iron before closing to chop through armor.
MONSTER_IRON_GOLEM_NAME|64|monster display name for Iron Golem|iron golem
MONSTER_IRON_GOLEM_DESC||monster description for Iron Golem|An iron golem is a human-shaped construct with riveted plates, thick limbs, and a furnace-dark face. It advances without fear, shrugging off fire and poison while crushing with metal fists.
MONSTER_DEATH_KNIGHT_NAME|64|monster display name for Death Knight|death knight
MONSTER_DEATH_KNIGHT_DESC||monster description for Death Knight|A death knight is an undead knight in plate armor, carrying a bright longsword in a gauntleted hand. It fights like a trained champion and closes to lay Grave Touch.
MONSTER_PURPLE_WORM_NAME|64|monster display name for Purple Worm|purple worm
MONSTER_PURPLE_WORM_DESC||monster description for Purple Worm|A purple worm is an enormous burrowing worm with armored rings, a circular mouth, and teeth packed deep into the throat. It tunnels up from below and bites with enough force to block whole corridors.
MONSTER_LICH_NAME|64|monster display name for Lich|lich
MONSTER_LICH_DESC||monster description for Lich|A lich is a skeletal sorcerer in a preserved robe, with cold light in the eye sockets and a mace at its side. It keeps distance and casts death magic that can leave the mind unsteady.
MONSTER_STORM_GIANT_NAME|64|monster display name for Storm Giant|storm giant
MONSTER_STORM_GIANT_DESC||monster description for Storm Giant|A towering storm giant in plate armor, carrying a halberd under hair and skin charged with static. It calls lightning across the room, then finishes survivors with long-armed strikes.
MONSTER_DRACOLICH_NAME|64|monster display name for Dracolich|dracolich
MONSTER_DRACOLICH_DESC||monster description for Dracolich|A dracolich is a skeletal undead dragon with torn wing membranes, dead scales, and cold light between its ribs. It bites and claws like a dragon and breathes gravefire over anything outside reach.
MONSTER_ADAMANTINE_GOLEM_NAME|64|monster display name for Adamantine Golem|adamantine golem
MONSTER_ADAMANTINE_GOLEM_DESC||monster description for Adamantine Golem|An adamantine golem is a towering metal construct plated in dark adamantine, with blocky hands and almost seamless joints. It ignores most elemental punishment and advances with slow crushing steps.
MONSTER_ARCHLICH_NAME|64|monster display name for Archlich|archlich
MONSTER_ARCHLICH_DESC||monster description for Archlich|An archlich is a skeletal high sorcerer wrapped in layered grave-robes and old warding jewelry. It casts Disintegrate, Contagion, and Cloudkill.
MONSTER_TITAN_NAME|64|monster display name for Titan|titan
MONSTER_TITAN_DESC||monster description for Titan|A titan is a giant warlord taller than any ordinary giant, armored in heavy plate and carrying a long halberd. It throws massive stones at range and uses its reach to dominate open ground.
MONSTER_COLOSSUS_NAME|64|monster display name for Colossus|colossus
MONSTER_COLOSSUS_DESC||monster description for Colossus|A colossus is a building-sized construct of stone and metal, with slab limbs and a head built like a siege tower. It fires ruin-breaking blasts before closing to crush anything underfoot.
MONSTER_KRAKEN_NAME|64|monster display name for Kraken|kraken
MONSTER_KRAKEN_DESC||monster description for Kraken|A kraken is a vast sea creature with a beaked maw, slick hide, and many thick tentacles dragging water behind them. It reaches across the fight, pulls prey into its coils, and crushes from several sides.
MONSTER_ANCIENT_WIGHT_NAME|64|monster display name for Ancient Wight|ancient wight
MONSTER_ANCIENT_WIGHT_DESC||monster description for Ancient Wight|A dry ancient wight in cracked mail, with old rank marks still pinned to a dead chest. It advances with patient sword-work and drains warmth from anything it wounds.
MONSTER_LIZARDMAN_NAME|64|monster display name for Lizardman|lizardman
MONSTER_LIZARDMAN_DESC||monster description for Lizardman|A scaled lizardman with a low crest, rough hide armor, and a spear held at the ready. It fights in short forward lunges and backs away before a counterblow can land.
MONSTER_GOBLIN_SHAMAN_NAME|64|monster display name for Goblin Shaman|goblin shaman
MONSTER_GOBLIN_SHAMAN_DESC||monster description for Goblin Shaman|A short goblin spellcaster in a too-large linen robe, clutching a dagger and a bundle of charms. It hides behind tougher bodies and casts Magic Missile when it sees an opening.
MONSTER_ORC_HEXER_NAME|64|monster display name for Orc Hexer|orc hexer
MONSTER_ORC_HEXER_DESC||monster description for Orc Hexer|A thick-necked orc spellcaster in a padded robe, carrying a mace marked with crude warding cuts. It mixes close threats with battlefield hexes that can leave a target confused.
MONSTER_NOVICE_NECROMANCER_NAME|64|monster display name for Novice Necromancer|novice necromancer
MONSTER_NOVICE_NECROMANCER_DESC||monster description for Novice Necromancer|A thin human grave-caster in a worn linen robe, with a dagger and bone tokens at the belt. It stays behind the front line and raises skeletons or zombies to fill the space.
MONSTER_NECROMANCER_NAME|64|monster display name for Necromancer|necromancer
MONSTER_NECROMANCER_DESC||monster description for Necromancer|A human necromancer in a dark padded robe, carrying a quarterstaff and corpse-stained ritual tools. It shelters behind summoned dead and calls up stronger corpses when pressed.
MONSTER_MASTER_NECROMANCER_NAME|64|monster display name for Master Necromancer|master necromancer
MONSTER_MASTER_NECROMANCER_DESC||monster description for Master Necromancer|A gaunt male human necromancer in a padded robe, with a staff, inked burial marks, and a cold steady gaze. He binds tougher undead into the fight and uses them to hold enemies in place.
MONSTER_NECROMANCER_LORD_NAME|64|monster display name for Necromancer Lord|necromancer lord
MONSTER_NECROMANCER_LORD_DESC||monster description for Necromancer Lord|A grave-crowned human necromancer with a black staff, polished bone charms, and the patience of someone who expects the dead to do most of the work. It calls up elite corpses and follows with killing divine magic.
MONSTER_LESSER_FIRE_ELEMENTAL_NAME|64|monster display name for Lesser Fire Elemental|lesser fire elemental
MONSTER_LESSER_FIRE_ELEMENTAL_DESC||monster description for Lesser Fire Elemental|A small fire spirit with a flickering ember body, ash-dark edges, and sparks shedding from its hands. It darts into reach and burns with every touch.
MONSTER_FIRE_ELEMENTAL_NAME|64|monster display name for Fire Elemental|fire elemental
MONSTER_FIRE_ELEMENTAL_DESC||monster description for Fire Elemental|A human-sized elemental made of flame, with bright arms, a hollow face, and coals spinning through its body. It rushes forward, burns in melee, and spills fire across nearby targets.
MONSTER_GREATER_FIRE_ELEMENTAL_NAME|64|monster display name for Greater Fire Elemental|greater fire elemental
MONSTER_GREATER_FIRE_ELEMENTAL_DESC||monster description for Greater Fire Elemental|A towering fire elemental with a furnace-bright core, broad flaming shoulders, and heat distortion around its body. It advances through blows and releases heavy blasts of fire across the room.
MONSTER_LESSER_FROST_ELEMENTAL_NAME|64|monster display name for Lesser Frost Elemental|lesser frost elemental
MONSTER_LESSER_FROST_ELEMENTAL_DESC||monster description for Lesser Frost Elemental|A small cold spirit with a brittle ice body, pale blue light, and sharp fingers crusted in rime. It darts close and numbs flesh with quick freezing touches.
MONSTER_FROST_ELEMENTAL_NAME|64|monster display name for Frost Elemental|frost elemental
MONSTER_FROST_ELEMENTAL_DESC||monster description for Frost Elemental|A human-sized elemental made of ice and winter air, with jagged shoulders and a faceless frozen head. It cuts at range with freezing shards and punishes close attackers with cold.
MONSTER_GREATER_FROST_ELEMENTAL_NAME|64|monster display name for Greater Frost Elemental|greater frost elemental
MONSTER_GREATER_FROST_ELEMENTAL_DESC||monster description for Greater Frost Elemental|A towering frost elemental with thick ice plates, sleet trailing from its arms, and a blue-white core. It fills the room with killing sleet and batters anything that gets close.
MONSTER_LESSER_LIGHTNING_ELEMENTAL_NAME|64|monster display name for Lesser Lightning Elemental|lesser lightning elemental
MONSTER_LESSER_LIGHTNING_ELEMENTAL_DESC||monster description for Lesser Lightning Elemental|A fist-sized lightning spirit with a bright core and thin arcs snapping to the floor. It jitters between openings and shocks anything it touches.
MONSTER_LIGHTNING_ELEMENTAL_NAME|64|monster display name for Lightning Elemental|lightning elemental
MONSTER_LIGHTNING_ELEMENTAL_DESC||monster description for Lightning Elemental|A human-sized storm elemental made of wind, cloud, sparks, and whipping arms. It strikes in melee and fires lightning arcs at targets beyond reach.
MONSTER_GREATER_LIGHTNING_ELEMENTAL_NAME|64|monster display name for Greater Lightning Elemental|greater lightning elemental
MONSTER_GREATER_LIGHTNING_ELEMENTAL_DESC||monster description for Greater Lightning Elemental|A towering storm elemental with a dense cloud body, bright lightning veins, and thunder rolling inside it. It lashes the room with thunderbolts and batters anything that gets close.
MONSTER_RAT_NAME|64|monster display name for Rat|rat
MONSTER_RAT_DESC||monster description for Rat|A common cellar rat with slick fur, bright eyes, and needle teeth. It darts low through trash and bites at ankles when cornered.
MONSTER_GOBLIN_SLINGER_NAME|64|monster display name for Goblin Slinger|goblin slinger
MONSTER_GOBLIN_SLINGER_DESC||monster description for Goblin Slinger|A wiry goblin with a hide sling, a pouch of stones, and more nerve at a distance than up close. It peppers targets from behind other bodies, then bolts when pressed.
MONSTER_KOBOLD_ARCHER_NAME|64|monster display name for Kobold Archer|kobold archer
MONSTER_KOBOLD_ARCHER_DESC||monster description for Kobold Archer|A small kobold with a shortbow, a chipped knife, and a habit of firing from the worst angle in the room. It keeps distance until a tunnel corner gives out.
MONSTER_CULT_ACOLYTE_NAME|64|monster display name for Cult Acolyte|cult acolyte
MONSTER_CULT_ACOLYTE_DESC||monster description for Cult Acolyte|A human cultist in a plain robe with a knife, a cheap charm, and little training. It fights because the others are watching, not because it knows how.
MONSTER_SNAKE_NAME|64|monster display name for Snake|snake
MONSTER_SNAKE_DESC||monster description for Snake|A gray cave snake with dull scales and a quick flat head. It lies still in dust and rubble until warm feet come too close.
MONSTER_PIT_VIPER_NAME|64|monster display name for Pit Viper|pit viper
MONSTER_PIT_VIPER_DESC||monster description for Pit Viper|A dark viper with a triangular head, pale belly, and fangs made for one sudden bite. It waits in pits, cracks, and old stone seams.
MONSTER_GREEN_SLIME_NAME|64|monster display name for Green Slime|green slime
MONSTER_GREEN_SLIME_DESC||monster description for Green Slime|A slow green slime with an acid-slick skin and a smell like spoiled rainwater. It creeps over floors and clings to anything that stops moving.
MONSTER_GIANT_ANT_NAME|64|monster display name for Giant Ant|giant ant
MONSTER_GIANT_ANT_DESC||monster description for Giant Ant|A dog-sized worker ant with snapping mandibles and a chitin shell. It moves in direct lines and keeps fighting as long as others are nearby.
MONSTER_SOLDIER_ANT_NAME|64|monster display name for Soldier Ant|soldier ant
MONSTER_SOLDIER_ANT_DESC||monster description for Soldier Ant|A larger soldier ant with a raised head, heavy jaws, and a harder red-brown shell. It plants itself in corridors and bites through careless guards.
MONSTER_GIANT_LEECH_NAME|64|monster display name for Giant Leech|giant leech
MONSTER_GIANT_LEECH_DESC||monster description for Giant Leech|A thick black leech with a soft ridged body and a round biting mouth. It waits in shallow water and clings hard once it finds blood.
MONSTER_DIRE_CAVE_BEAR_NAME|64|monster display name for Dire Cave Bear|dire cave bear
MONSTER_DIRE_CAVE_BEAR_DESC||monster description for Dire Cave Bear|A huge blind-eyed cave bear with slate-gray hide, broken claws, and old scars packed with chalk dust. It follows scent and vibration through the tunnels.
MONSTER_WEREWOLF_NAME|64|monster display name for Werewolf|werewolf
MONSTER_WEREWOLF_DESC||monster description for Werewolf|A gaunt wolf-headed killer standing on bent human legs, with matted hide, long claws, and a hunter's patience. It fights like a person until the charge breaks into tearing animal speed.
MONSTER_WEREWOLF_KING_NAME|64|monster display name for Werewolf King|werewolf king
MONSTER_WEREWOLF_KING_DESC||monster description for Werewolf King|A towering lycanthrope with a scarred crown-band hammered into its brow and old stone keys hanging from its belt. It commands the hidden pack with enough sense left to hate intruders.
MONSTER_ANCIENT_WEREWOLF_NAME|64|monster display name for Ancient Werewolf|ancient werewolf
MONSTER_ANCIENT_WEREWOLF_DESC||monster description for Ancient Werewolf|An old lycanthrope with a broad wolf skull, gray mane, and human scars buried under coarse hide. It fights with patient fury instead of the pack's reckless hunger.
MONSTER_SPIDER_QUEEN_NAME|64|monster display name for Spider Queen|spider queen
MONSTER_SPIDER_QUEEN_DESC||monster description for Spider Queen|A huge egg-swollen spider with long red-black legs, hooked fangs, and a heavy abdomen marked by old scars. It holds the center of a webbed lair and strikes at anything caught in the strands.
MONSTER_TROLL_KING_NAME|64|monster display name for Troll King|troll king
MONSTER_TROLL_KING_DESC||monster description for Troll King|A huge old troll with plated scar tissue, iron rings driven through its ears, and a two-handed maul dark with old blood. It rules lesser trolls by strength and keeps fighting through wounds that would drop an ogre.
MONSTER_VAMPIRE_NAME|64|monster display name for Vampire|vampire
MONSTER_VAMPIRE_DESC||monster description for Vampire|A vampire is a pale undead noble in dark mail, with bright predatory eyes, long teeth, and a blade held with old practiced ease. It moves faster than a living duelist and drains blood when a fight gives it room.
MONSTER_VAMPIRE_LORD_NAME|64|monster display name for Vampire Lord|vampire lord
MONSTER_VAMPIRE_LORD_DESC||monster description for Vampire Lord|A vampire lord is an ancient undead ruler with a still face, lacquered armor, and a court blade kept sharp for centuries. It commands lesser dead by presence alone and turns spilled blood into strength.
MONSTER_ELDER_FOREST_DRAGON_NAME|64|monster display name for Elder Forest Dragon|elder forest dragon
MONSTER_ELDER_FOREST_DRAGON_DESC||monster description for Elder Forest Dragon|An elder forest dragon is an ancient green-scaled dragon with antlered horns, leaf-dark wings, and bark-thick plates along its shoulders. It moves with old patience and can tear through a grove with one crushing gale.
MONSTER_GREATER_SHADOW_NAME|64|monster display name for Greater Shadow|greater shadow
MONSTER_GREATER_SHADOW_DESC||monster description for Greater Shadow|A greater shadow is a dense undead silhouette with long clawed hands and a hollow core where light seems to fail. Its touch chills the body and can sap strength more deeply than a common shadow.
MONSTER_YOUNG_FOREST_DRAGON_NAME|64|monster display name for Young Forest Dragon|young forest dragon
MONSTER_YOUNG_FOREST_DRAGON_DESC||monster description for Young Forest Dragon|A young forest dragon with green-brown scales, antler buds, and leaf-dark wings. It fights with claws, teeth, and a hard blast of wind that hammers foes away from it.
MONSTER_FOREST_DRAGON_NAME|64|monster display name for Forest Dragon|forest dragon
MONSTER_FOREST_DRAGON_DESC||monster description for Forest Dragon|A full-grown forest dragon with antlered horns, bark-thick plates, and broad green wings. It uses fear and crushing wind to break enemies before closing with tooth and claw.
MONSTER_ANCIENT_FOREST_DRAGON_NAME|64|monster display name for Ancient Forest Dragon|ancient forest dragon
MONSTER_ANCIENT_FOREST_DRAGON_DESC||monster description for Ancient Forest Dragon|An ancient forest dragon with crown-wide antlers, moss-dark plates, and broad dark wings. Its wind breath hits hard, and its spells call insects and lightning through the trees.
MONSTER_OGRE_CHIEF_NAME|64|monster display name for Ogre Chief|ogre chief
MONSTER_OGRE_CHIEF_DESC||monster description for Ogre Chief|An ogre chief with a horned helm, layered scraps of mail, and a club stained black at the head. It bullies lesser warbands forward and crushes anything that reaches its command post.
MONSTER_OGRE_CHAMPION_NAME|64|monster display name for Ogre Champion|ogre champion
MONSTER_OGRE_CHAMPION_DESC||monster description for Ogre Champion|A veteran ogre with scarred hide, heavy mail scraps, and a two handed axe taken from a larger foe. It fights with more patience than common ogres and waits for openings before swinging.
MONSTER_HILL_GIANT_HURLER_NAME|64|monster display name for Hill Giant Hurler|hill giant hurler
MONSTER_HILL_GIANT_HURLER_DESC||monster description for Hill Giant Hurler|A heavy hill giant with a sling of stones across one shoulder and a tree trunk in both hands. It prefers open ground, where it can break a charge before the fight reaches its feet.
MONSTER_ETTIN_NAME|64|monster display name for Ettin|ettin
MONSTER_ETTIN_DESC||monster description for Ettin|A two headed giantkin brute with mismatched armor, a hooked club, and two voices arguing over which target to crush first. It covers more angles than its size should allow.
MONSTER_SAHUAGIN_CHAMPION_NAME|64|monster display name for Sahuagin Champion|sahuagin champion
MONSTER_SAHUAGIN_CHAMPION_DESC||monster description for Sahuagin Champion|A broad sahuagin warrior in lacquered hide, with a barbed spear and shield held close. It leads shore raids by pushing through the strongest defender first.
MONSTER_SEA_HAG_NAME|64|monster display name for Sea Hag|sea hag
MONSTER_SEA_HAG_DESC||monster description for Sea Hag|A bent sea hag with kelp matted hair, glassy eyes, and a knife of green metal. It mutters curses from behind tougher allies and strikes only when a foe is off balance.
MONSTER_GIANT_EEL_NAME|64|monster display name for Giant Eel|giant eel
MONSTER_GIANT_EEL_DESC||monster description for Giant Eel|A long pale eel with a wide jaw and rows of needle teeth. It lashes out from dark water and twists away before a blade can stay on it.
MONSTER_GIANT_OCTOPUS_NAME|64|monster display name for Giant Octopus|giant octopus
MONSTER_GIANT_OCTOPUS_DESC||monster description for Giant Octopus|A huge octopus with thick arms, a hard beak, and dark eyes watching from a slick mass of muscle. It reaches around corners and drags prey back toward water.
MONSTER_LESSER_WATER_ELEMENTAL_NAME|64|monster display name for Lesser Water Elemental|lesser water elemental
MONSTER_LESSER_WATER_ELEMENTAL_DESC||monster description for Lesser Water Elemental|A knee-high wave of animated water with a faint torso shape and grasping spray for hands. It surges from flooded stone and batters with cold, heavy water.
MONSTER_WATER_ELEMENTAL_NAME|64|monster display name for Water Elemental|water elemental
MONSTER_WATER_ELEMENTAL_DESC||monster description for Water Elemental|A moving mass of water with a rising torso, crushing waves for arms, and a current turning inside its chest. Weapons pass through it unless they strike with force.
MONSTER_EARTH_ELEMENTAL_NAME|64|monster display name for Earth Elemental|earth elemental
MONSTER_EARTH_ELEMENTAL_DESC||monster description for Earth Elemental|A heavy earth elemental of packed soil and stone, with blunt arms and gem flecks in its shoulders. It crushes slowly and is hard to hurt with light cuts.
MONSTER_GREATER_EARTH_ELEMENTAL_NAME|64|monster display name for Greater Earth Elemental|greater earth elemental
MONSTER_GREATER_EARTH_ELEMENTAL_DESC||monster description for Greater Earth Elemental|A towering earth elemental with boulder fists, packed clay joints, and stone plates sliding over a hollow core. It hits like a moving wall.
MONSTER_SALAMANDER_NAME|64|monster display name for Salamander|salamander
MONSTER_SALAMANDER_DESC||monster description for Salamander|A serpent bodied fire creature with bronze scales, a humanlike upper body, and a heated spear. It fights from reach while waves of heat roll from its coils.
MONSTER_GREATER_SALAMANDER_NAME|64|monster display name for Greater Salamander|greater salamander
MONSTER_GREATER_SALAMANDER_DESC||monster description for Greater Salamander|A larger salamander with black bronze scales, a white hot spear, and a furnace glow under each plate. Its coils scrape sparks from stone as it advances.
MONSTER_MUMMY_LORD_NAME|64|monster display name for Mummy Lord|mummy lord
MONSTER_MUMMY_LORD_DESC||monster description for Mummy Lord|A preserved undead ruler wrapped in dark linen and gold funerary plates, with a mace held in one dry hand. It commands the crypt with curses and old burial magic.
MONSTER_BONE_GOLEM_NAME|64|monster display name for Bone Golem|bone golem
MONSTER_BONE_GOLEM_DESC||monster description for Bone Golem|A hulking construct assembled from thick bones and iron pins, with a rib cage like a shield wall. It moves without breath and batters foes with fused fists.
MONSTER_TREANT_NAME|64|monster display name for Treant|treant
MONSTER_TREANT_DESC||monster description for Treant|A towering old tree-spirit with a split trunk, deep-set amber eyes, and branch arms worn smooth from centuries of movement. It advances slowly and strikes from reach with heavy limbs.
MONSTER_ANIMATED_TREE_NAME|64|monster display name for Animated Tree|animated tree
MONSTER_ANIMATED_TREE_DESC||monster description for Animated Tree|A nearby tree dragged into rough motion by old forest magic. Its limbs crack and lash like greenwood clubs until the animating will leaves it.
MONSTER_SHAMBLING_MOUND_NAME|64|monster display name for Shambling Mound|shambling mound
MONSTER_SHAMBLING_MOUND_DESC||monster description for Shambling Mound|A shambling mound is a heap of wet roots, rotting reeds, and black soil with thick arms dragging from its sides. It absorbs punishment, then crushes prey under its sodden weight.
MONSTER_HANGMAN_TREE_NAME|64|monster display name for Hangman Tree|hangman tree
MONSTER_HANGMAN_TREE_DESC||monster description for Hangman Tree|A hangman tree is a gnarled old trunk with rope-like branches hanging low around a hollow crown. It waits rooted in place, hooks prey with a limb, and drags them under the boughs.
MONSTER_ROC_NAME|64|monster display name for Roc|roc
MONSTER_ROC_DESC||monster description for Roc|A roc is a vast mountain bird with hooked talons, a knife-curved beak, and wings that beat dust from stone ledges. It dives into open ground and tears at anything too slow to find cover.
MONSTER_TRAINING_DUMMY_NAME|64|monster display name for Training Dummy|training dummy
MONSTER_TRAINING_DUMMY_DESC||monster description for Training Dummy|A straw-packed practice dummy tied to a weighted wooden post. It is built to be hit, not to hit back.
MONSTER_DECOY_NAME|64|monster display name for Decoy|decoy
