BOSS_INTRO_JORREN_THE_BANDIT_VETERAN|"起来！拔刀！谁也别带着我的货走。"
BOSS_INTRO_SKRIT_THE_KOBOLD_PACKLEADER|"矿车到这里停。Skrit 说你也停。"
BOSS_INTRO_EDRAN_THE_GHOST|"Maveth 等过。我找不到回家的路。"
BOSS_INTRO_NHALOR_THE_WATER_WEIRD|"深水会留住别人交给它的东西。"
BOSS_INTRO_OLD_SNAPJAW_THE_CROCODILE|"老鳄鱼从浅水里抬起身，牙间挂着强盗破布。"
BOSS_INTRO_SER_CALDUS_THE_WIGHT|"守住阵线。活人的脚不得踏过这里。"
BOSS_INTRO_HALRIC_THE_GREATER_GHOUL|"守住阵线。活人的脚不得踏过这里。"
BOSS_INTRO_OLD_BRIARBACK_THE_OWLBEAR|"老兽从灌木中起身，喙上带血，利爪张开。"
BOSS_INTRO_MAVRESSA_THE_SPIDER_QUEEN|"网里的热肉。让小的们先吃。"
BOSS_INTRO_HIGHLEDGE_THE_WYVERN|"双足飞龙从崖架扑下，发出尖硬撕裂的叫声。"
BOSS_INTRO_VAERITH_THE_FOREST_DRAGON|"你把铁和火带到老根底下。把它们留在这里。"
BOSS_INTRO_VEYR_THE_VAMPIRE_LORD|"这座塔靠恐惧为食，比你的名字活得更久。"
BOSS_INTRO_RUSKARN_THE_GREATER_GARGOYLE|"石头醒来。鲜血偿还。"
BOSS_INTRO_GARRUN_THE_UMBER_HULK|"地面裂开。一个巨物转向你。"
BOSS_INTRO_VORRAK_THE_UMBER_HULK|"地面裂开。一个巨物转向你。"
BOSS_INTRO_OLD_UMBER_HULK|"地面裂开。一个巨物转向你。"
BOSS_INTRO_VARROTH_THE_WEREWOLF_KING|"跪下或逃跑。狼群都会吃。"
BOSS_INTRO_BROTHER_ORATH_THE_MASTER_NECROMANCER|"仪式已经付过价。你的骨头只是最后一枚钱。"
BOSS_INTRO_PRIOR_ARVEN_THE_GREATER_SHADOW|"修道院把罪藏在地板下。我守着门。"
BOSS_INTRO_RHAZVEK_THE_YOUNG_RED_DRAGON|"这座塔现在够暖了。你不够。"
BOSS_INTRO_MAEROTH_THE_RED_DRAGON|Maeroth's voice rolls through the ash: "Highwind's prayers are ash. Kneel in the soot, or burn with them."
BOSS_INTRO_MAEROTH_THE_ELDER_RED_DRAGON|"Highwind 的钟已成灰。它的屋顶归我。"
BOSS_INTRO_ORRIC_VANE_THE_MASTER_NECROMANCER|"别打扰死人。他们快准备好了。"
BOSS_INTRO_ORREN_THE_BLACK_DRAGON|"裂口太迟才教会你恐惧。"
BOSS_INTRO_KRAVOSS_THE_DEEP_BLACKGLASS_DRAKE|"The Scar 扎得很深。你只找到了嘴。"
BOSS_INTRO_VYRNAX_THE_DEEP_BLACKGLASS_DRAKE|"The Scar 扎得很深。你只找到了嘴。"
BOSS_INTRO_BROND_THE_OGRE_CHAMPION|"Maug 说话。Brond 打碎。"
BOSS_INTRO_VEYRA_THE_MUMMY_LORD|"这座墓穴没有客人。只有祭品。"
BOSS_INTRO_AZRAN_THE_ELDER_BLUE_DRAGON|"Stormwater 一路把你的气味带到下面。"
BOSS_INTRO_ISSHARA_THE_HYDRA|"九头蛇抬起头，每个喉咙同时嘶叫。"
BOSS_INTRO_GRUMMOK_THE_TROLL_KING|"小骨头。大锅。"
BOSS_INTRO_MULGREN_THE_TROLL|底层尘土微微翻动。Mulgren从黑暗中拖出一柄带刺晨星锤。“软骨头一路下来了。”
BOSS_INTRO_CINDERMAW_THE_DIRE_WOLF|Cindermaw raises its ash-black muzzle and barks once. The shallow water trembles around the dead cultists.
BOSS_INTRO_CAERWYN_THE_ANCIENT_FOREST_DRAGON|"根与冠记得你的血脉。我会在这里终结它。"
BOSS_INTRO_ARVAELOS_THE_ANCIENT_WHITE_DRAGON|"你爬得够高，可以冻死在我的阴影里了。"
BOSS_INTRO_AURALITH_THE_YOUNG_BLUE_DRAGON|"高塔仍回应我。听它把你击碎。"
BOSS_INTRO_KAELVORN_THE_GREATER_DRAKE|"宝库石、旧誓言、热血。现在都归我。"
BOSS_INTRO_MORDRAXIS_THE_BLACKGLASS_DRAKE|"空气里有旧血。靠近点。"
BOSS_INTRO_VHAROX_THE_BLACKGLASS_DRAKE|"空气里有旧血。你找到门前，我就在石中听见你了。靠近点。"
BOSS_INTRO_KROSH_THE_ORC_WARRIOR|"码头归我，直到我说它们该烧。"
BOSS_INTRO_VARGROM_THE_DUERGAR_GUARD|"这座中继站仍听我的锤。你无标记，不受欢迎，还迟到了。"
BOSS_INTRO_KHORVUL_THE_DRAKE|"东门养活了我，软血。靠近点，把你的骨头也加进铰链。"
BOSS_INTRO_RAKTO_THE_GOBLIN_CHIEF|"我的洞。我的老大。你来抢？Rakto 先抢手！"
BOSS_INTRO_VRASK_THE_YOUNG_DRAKE|"石头认得你的血。靠近点，小继承人，好好唤醒它。"
BOSS_INTRO_GORVUK_THE_ORC_WARBOSS|"你进了我的堡垒。现在你从地板下面离开。"
BOSS_INTRO_BRAM_THE_STONE_GOLEM|"不得通行。"
BOSS_INTRO_MAUG_THE_ETTIN|"先竞技场。后骨头。"
BOSS_INTRO_KING_HALRIC_THE_BARROW_WIGHT|"在这片地下，没有任何特许能比王冠活得久。"
BOSS_INTRO_RHAZUN_THE_WATER_DRAKE|"深水，热血。下来吧，淹在灰贼淹死的地方。"
BOSS_INTRO_DORUN_VARR_THE_TOLL_BOSS|"路封了。桥归我。有银付银，没银付血。"
BOSS_INTRO_THYRAXX_THE_ANCIENT_BLUE_DRAGON|风暴与古石仍记得我。这片高地归蓝龙所有。
BOSS_INTRO_VERRIK_ASHVOW|溺死的亡者已经听命。现在和他们一起跪下。
STORY_VOICE_UNDERWAY_OPEN|A distant voice says: "The lower road is open. Come down."
STORY_VOICE_WHITE_SEAL|远处一个声音说："把 Lightglass 星辰和你的血带到封印前。"
STORY_VOICE_STONEWARD|远处一个声音说："更深处来，封印之子。" 头顶雷声滚过一记。
STORY_VOICE_FINAL_SEAL|低沉声音说："把言语带到封印前，打开道路。"
