ITEM_BLACKGLASS_FARSTAFF_DESC|A long blackglass-banded staff built for distant spellwork. Ranged arcane attack spells gain +1 range.
ITEM_BLACKGLASS_SPELLTHRIFT_STAFF_NAME|黑玻璃节法杖
ITEM_BLACKGLASS_SPELLTHRIFT_STAFF_DESC|A dark staff etched with small blackglass inlays that steady spellwork. Arcane spells cost 1 less MP.
ITEM_BLACKGLASS_WARD_FOCUS_NAME|黑玻璃护御焦点
ITEM_BLACKGLASS_WARD_FOCUS_DESC|A palm-sized blackglass disc that floats near the forearm like a shield. It grants +4 DEF, +2 ARM, +1 to spell saves, and is indestructible.
ITEM_BLACKGLASS_WARD_FOCUS_UNIDENTIFIED_NAME|黑色护符
ITEM_BLACKGLASS_WARD_FOCUS_UNIDENTIFIED_DESC|一枚掌心大小的护御焦点，行动像盾，却不是盾。
ITEM_BLACKGLASS_CIRCLET_NAME|黑玻璃额环
ITEM_BLACKGLASS_CIRCLET_DESC|A thin blackglass circlet with a cool inner shine across the brow. It grants +2 DEF, +1 ARM, +1 arcane spell damage, and is indestructible.
ITEM_BLACKGLASS_CIRCLET_UNIDENTIFIED_NAME|额环
ITEM_BLACKGLASS_CIRCLET_UNIDENTIFIED_DESC|一只戴在眉前的窄额环。
ITEM_WOVEN_BLACKGLASS_ROBE_NAME|织黑玻璃长袍
ITEM_WOVEN_BLACKGLASS_ROBE_DESC|A soft dark robe with blackglass thread sewn through the cuffs and hem. It grants +3 DEF, +10 ARM, and is indestructible.
ITEM_WOVEN_BLACKGLASS_ROBE_UNIDENTIFIED_NAME|长袍
ITEM_WOVEN_BLACKGLASS_ROBE_UNIDENTIFIED_DESC|一件为研习和旅行裁制的长袍。
ITEM_BLACKGLASS_SCHOLAR_BOOTS_NAME|黑玻璃学者靴
ITEM_BLACKGLASS_SCHOLAR_BOOTS_DESC|Soft black boots with thin blackglass soles and heel wards. They grant +2 DEF, +3 ARM, prevent blackglass shard foot damage, and are indestructible.
ITEM_BLACKGLASS_SCHOLAR_BOOTS_UNIDENTIFIED_NAME|靴子
ITEM_BLACKGLASS_SCHOLAR_BOOTS_UNIDENTIFIED_DESC|一双实用靴子，鞋底安静，缝线加固。
ITEM_BLACKGLASS_SPELLBLADE_NAME|黑玻璃法刃
ITEM_BLACKGLASS_SPELLBLADE_DESC|A slim blackglass sword with a bright inner edge. It grants +1 arcane spell attack. Cleave: critical hits cause bleeding.
ITEM_BLACKGLASS_MINDBAND_NAME|黑玻璃心智环
ITEM_BLACKGLASS_MINDBAND_DESC|A narrow blackglass brow band that sits cold and steady against the skin. It grants +2 DEF, +3 ARM, +1 arcane control spell DC, and is indestructible.
ITEM_BLACKGLASS_MINDBAND_UNIDENTIFIED_NAME|额环
ITEM_BLACKGLASS_MINDBAND_UNIDENTIFIED_DESC|一只戴在眉前的窄额环。
ITEM_GLASS_SINGER_MANTLE_NAME|玻璃歌者披肩
ITEM_GLASS_SINGER_MANTLE_DESC|A pale green mantle stitched with blackglass thread. It grants +3 DEF, +6 ARM, +1 shock resistance, and is indestructible.
ITEM_GLASS_SINGER_MANTLE_UNIDENTIFIED_NAME|斗篷
ITEM_GLASS_SINGER_MANTLE_UNIDENTIFIED_DESC|一件为挡雨和避开灌木而裁制的旅行斗篷。
ITEM_BLACKGLASS_ROOTWARD_NAME|黑玻璃根护符
ITEM_BLACKGLASS_ROOTWARD_DESC|A blackglass charm shaped like a twisted root. It grants +2 DEF, +1 CON, poison immunity, and is indestructible.
ITEM_BLACKGLASS_ROOTWARD_UNIDENTIFIED_NAME|暗色护符
ITEM_BLACKGLASS_ROOTWARD_UNIDENTIFIED_DESC|一枚小护符，可挂在腰带钩上，也可贴在掌心。
ITEM_BLACKGLASS_LORESTONE_NAME|黑玻璃知识石
ITEM_BLACKGLASS_LORESTONE_DESC|A smooth blackglass memory-stone that feels warm when held near old writing. It grants +2 DEF, +1 ARM, +1 arcane spell DC, and is indestructible.
ITEM_BLACKGLASS_LORESTONE_UNIDENTIFIED_NAME|暗色护符
ITEM_BLACKGLASS_LORESTONE_UNIDENTIFIED_DESC|一枚小护符，可挂在腰带钩上，也可贴在掌心。
ITEM_SILVER_RUNED_BLACKGLASS_STAFF_HIGH_ENCHANTER_NAME|银符文黑玻璃法杖“高等附魔师”
ITEM_SILVER_RUNED_BLACKGLASS_STAFF_HIGH_ENCHANTER_DESC|A polished blackglass staff with silver inlays from grip to crown. It grants +2 DEF, +4 ARM, +1 arcane spell attack, +1 arcane spell DC, and arcane spells cost 2 less MP.
ITEM_STAR_SEWN_BLACK_ROBE_STARVEIN_NAME|星线黑袍“星脉”
ITEM_STAR_SEWN_BLACK_ROBE_STARVEIN_DESC|A black robe woven with pale starvein thread and small blackglass ward plates. It grants +5 DEF, +16 ARM, +2 arcane spell damage, and improves MP regeneration.
ITEM_STAR_SEWN_BLACK_ROBE_STARVEIN_UNIDENTIFIED_NAME|长袍
ITEM_STAR_SEWN_BLACK_ROBE_STARVEIN_UNIDENTIFIED_DESC|一件为研习和旅行裁制的长袍。
ITEM_MIRRORLEAF_AMULET_NAME|镜叶护符
ITEM_MIRRORLEAF_AMULET_DESC|An elven blackglass amulet shaped like a dark leaf in a bright wire frame. It grants +4 DEF, +2 ARM, +1 cold resistance, +1 shock resistance, and +1 cold and shock spell damage.
ITEM_MIRRORLEAF_AMULET_UNIDENTIFIED_NAME|护符
ITEM_MIRRORLEAF_AMULET_UNIDENTIFIED_DESC|未鉴定的首饰可能在朴素金属工艺下隐藏祝福、诅咒或其他魔法。
ITEM_LIGHTGLASS_DAGGER_NAME|光玻璃匕首
ITEM_LIGHTGLASS_DAGGER_DESC|一把细长光玻璃匕首，苍白刃口在挥动中几乎消失。用它发动的突袭造成双倍伤害。
ITEM_LIGHTGLASS_SHORTBOW_NAME|光玻璃短弓
ITEM_LIGHTGLASS_SHORTBOW_DESC|一张苍白短弓，弓臂嵌有光玻璃弹性点。每次攻击射出两箭，但每支箭都比普通弓箭更轻。
ITEM_LIGHTGLASS_HEATER_SHIELD_NAME|光玻璃小盾
ITEM_LIGHTGLASS_HEATER_SHIELD_DESC|A compact lightglass heater shield with a pale mirrored face and a firm lower point. It grants +5 DEF, +11 ARM, and has a 10% chance to reflect melee damage.
ITEM_LIGHTGLASS_HEATER_SHIELD_UNIDENTIFIED_NAME|小盾
ITEM_LIGHTGLASS_HEATER_SHIELD_UNIDENTIFIED_DESC|一面紧凑盾牌，下尖坚固，弧度足以把糟糕角度变成可承受的打击。
ITEM_LIGHTGLASS_TRAP_LANTERN_NAME|光玻璃陷阱提灯
ITEM_LIGHTGLASS_TRAP_LANTERN_DESC|A hand lantern with a clear lightglass core and a balanced steel cage. While lit, it grants +5 trap spotting and +2 DEF.
ITEM_LIGHTGLASS_SCOUT_COAT_NAME|光玻璃斥候外套
ITEM_LIGHTGLASS_SCOUT_COAT_DESC|A lightweight scout coat with small lightglass scales sewn under the shoulders and chest. It grants +4 DEF, +12 ARM, and is indestructible.
ITEM_LIGHTGLASS_SCOUT_COAT_UNIDENTIFIED_NAME|皮外套
ITEM_LIGHTGLASS_SCOUT_COAT_UNIDENTIFIED_DESC|一件先为旅行、再为战斗裁制的路用外套。
ITEM_LIGHTGLASS_RELIQUARY_MACE_NAME|光玻璃圣匣钉头锤
ITEM_LIGHTGLASS_RELIQUARY_MACE_DESC|一把苍白光玻璃钉头锤，锤头后嵌有小型密封圣匣。神术消耗减少 1 点虔诚，命中对龙兽和疤痕孽物造成 +3 伤害。
ITEM_LIGHTGLASS_LONGSWORD_NAME|光玻璃长剑
ITEM_LIGHTGLASS_LONGSWORD_DESC|A swift lightglass longsword with a pale core running through the blade. Hits deal +4 damage to drakes and Scar-spawn.
ITEM_LIGHTGLASS_CENSER_FLAIL_NAME|光玻璃香炉连枷
ITEM_LIGHTGLASS_CENSER_FLAIL_DESC|A pale lightglass flail with a small censer head that rings softly when swung. Divine spell channeling takes 1 fewer turn, divine damage spells deal +1 damage, and hits deal +3 damage to drakes and Scar-spawn.
ITEM_LIGHTGLASS_RELIQUARY_MAIL_NAME|光玻璃圣匣锁甲
ITEM_LIGHTGLASS_RELIQUARY_MAIL_DESC|A bright mail coat with lightglass rings worked through the chest and collar. It grants +6 DEF, +16 ARM, and is indestructible.
ITEM_LIGHTGLASS_RELIQUARY_MAIL_UNIDENTIFIED_NAME|锁子甲
ITEM_LIGHTGLASS_RELIQUARY_MAIL_UNIDENTIFIED_DESC|一件环环相扣的锁甲衫，将斩击和刺击分散到许多小环上。
ITEM_DELICATE_PURE_GOLD_NECKLACE_LUCKY_FIND_NAME|delicate pure-gold necklace "Lucky Find"
ITEM_DELICATE_PURE_GOLD_NECKLACE_LUCKY_FIND_DESC|A delicate necklace of the purest clean gold. It grants +8 luck.
ITEM_DELICATE_PURE_GOLD_NECKLACE_LUCKY_FIND_UNIDENTIFIED_NAME|delicate gold necklace
ITEM_DELICATE_PURE_GOLD_NECKLACE_LUCKY_FIND_UNIDENTIFIED_DESC|An exceptionally delicate necklace worked from clean, unblemished gold.
ITEM_LIGHTGLASS_KITE_SHIELD_NAME|光玻璃鸢盾
ITEM_LIGHTGLASS_KITE_SHIELD_DESC|A tall lightglass kite shield with a pale face and clean reinforced rim. It grants +6 DEF, +15 ARM, +1 to spell saves, and has a 10% chance to reflect melee damage.
ITEM_LIGHTGLASS_KITE_SHIELD_UNIDENTIFIED_NAME|鸢盾
ITEM_LIGHTGLASS_KITE_SHIELD_UNIDENTIFIED_DESC|一面高而下尖的盾牌，用一条训练有素的防线护住肩、心口和小腿。
ITEM_GLEAMING_LIGHTGLASS_LONGSWORD_DAWN_S_EDGE_NAME|闪耀光玻璃长剑“黎明之锋”
ITEM_GLEAMING_LIGHTGLASS_LONGSWORD_DAWN_S_EDGE_DESC|A masterwork lightglass longsword with a dawn-bright core burning inside the blade. It grants +1 WIS, and hits gain +4 ATK and +4 damage against dragons.
ITEM_GLEAMING_BREASTPLATE_DAWNLIGHT_NAME|闪耀胸甲“曙光”
ITEM_GLEAMING_BREASTPLATE_DAWNLIGHT_DESC|A gleaming lightglass breastplate built for a high purifier. It grants +8 DEF, +24 ARM, +2 WIS, and is very light for its protection.
ITEM_GLEAMING_BREASTPLATE_DAWNLIGHT_UNIDENTIFIED_NAME|胸甲
ITEM_GLEAMING_BREASTPLATE_DAWNLIGHT_UNIDENTIFIED_DESC|一件贴身胸甲，用于保护肋骨和心口，却没有全身甲的重量。
ITEM_GLEAMING_LIGHTGLASS_SHIELD_WHITE_WALL_NAME|闪耀光玻璃盾“白墙”
ITEM_GLEAMING_LIGHTGLASS_SHIELD_WHITE_WALL_DESC|A broad lightglass shield with a smooth pale face and heavy white rim. It grants +8 DEF, +16 ARM, +1 to all attributes, and 10% magic resistance.
ITEM_GLEAMING_LIGHTGLASS_SHIELD_WHITE_WALL_UNIDENTIFIED_NAME|鸢盾
ITEM_GLEAMING_LIGHTGLASS_SHIELD_WHITE_WALL_UNIDENTIFIED_DESC|一面高而下尖的盾牌，用一条训练有素的防线护住肩、心口和小腿。
ITEM_SUPREME_HEALING_POTION_NAME|至尊治疗药水
ITEM_SUPREME_HEALING_POTION_DESC|一剂王者般的绯红药水。恢复 140-220 点生命并止血.
ITEM_LESSER_MANA_POTION_NAME|次级法力药水
ITEM_LESSER_MANA_POTION_DESC|一剂淡蓝药水。恢复 2-5 点法力.
ITEM_POTION_OF_SPEED_NAME|速度药水
ITEM_POTION_OF_SPEED_DESC|一剂刺鼻的水银色药水。获得加速，使你在约 120 回合内每个敌人回合行动两次。
ITEM_POTION_OF_STONESKIN_NAME|石肤药水
ITEM_POTION_OF_STONESKIN_DESC|一剂带砂感的灰色药水。获得石肤，持续约 60 回合，并有 6 层庇护抵挡沉重物理打击。
ITEM_POTION_OF_INVISIBILITY_NAME|隐形药水
ITEM_POTION_OF_INVISIBILITY_DESC|一剂逐渐淡去的清玻璃色药水。使你隐形约 180 回合，但行动或攻击可能打破隐形。
ITEM_POTION_OF_RESISTANCE_NAME|抗性药水
ITEM_POTION_OF_RESISTANCE_DESC|一剂振奋的防护药水。获得抗性，所有豁免 +1，持续约 60 回合。
ITEM_POTION_OF_PROTECTION_FROM_ENERGY_NAME|能量防护药水
ITEM_POTION_OF_PROTECTION_FROM_ENERGY_DESC|一剂分层元素药水。暂时获得火焰、寒冷、电击和酸液抗性，持续约 180 回合。
ITEM_POTION_OF_CLARITY_NAME|清明药水
ITEM_POTION_OF_CLARITY_DESC|一剂清澈苦药。清除混乱和魅惑，然后获得精神效果免疫，持续约 60 回合。
ITEM_POTION_OF_HEROISM_NAME|英雄气概药水
ITEM_POTION_OF_HEROISM_DESC|一剂灼热金色药水。获得神力（+2 攻击、+2 近战伤害、50% 近战抗性）、祝福（+1 攻击、+1 防御）、额外 +2 伤害和短暂近战护盾。
ITEM_POTION_OF_SHIELDING_NAME|护盾药水
ITEM_POTION_OF_SHIELDING_DESC|一剂蓝色力场药水。获得护盾，对远程攻击 +2 防御，持续约 60 回合。
ITEM_POTION_OF_BLUR_NAME|模糊药水
ITEM_POTION_OF_BLUR_DESC|一剂摇曳烟色药水。获得模糊：+2 防御，对远程攻击额外 +4 防御，直到你受到伤害。
ITEM_POTION_OF_MIRROR_IMAGE_NAME|镜像药水
ITEM_POTION_OF_MIRROR_IMAGE_DESC|一剂分裂倒影药水。制造 3 个镜像；一次命中会移除一个镜像并造成半伤害。
ITEM_POTION_OF_MAGE_ARMOR_NAME|法师护甲药水
ITEM_POTION_OF_MAGE_ARMOR_DESC|银色甲壳药剂。给予Mage Armor，将身体护甲替换为DEF 1+INT调整值、ARM 2+INT调整值x2的魔法护甲，持续60分钟。
ITEM_POTION_OF_SEEING_NAME|识破药水
ITEM_POTION_OF_SEEING_DESC|一剂明亮刺眼的药水。让你能看见隐形生物，持续约 180 回合。
ITEM_POTION_OF_FLYING_NAME|飞行药水
ITEM_POTION_OF_FLYING_DESC|一剂失重天蓝色药水。获得飞行约 180 回合：+8 防御，并能越过地面危害，但飞行时不能近战攻击。
ITEM_POTION_OF_IMPROVED_INVISIBILITY_NAME|高级隐形药水
ITEM_POTION_OF_IMPROVED_INVISIBILITY_DESC|一剂深度消隐药水。获得约120回合的高级隐形；攻击只有25%概率打破它。
ITEM_POTION_OF_LEVITATION_NAME|漂浮药水
ITEM_POTION_OF_LEVITATION_DESC|一剂苍白轻气药水。漂浮约 240 回合，可越过坑洞、酸液、水、碎石、蛛网和类似地面危害。
ITEM_POTION_OF_AID_NAME|援助药水
ITEM_POTION_OF_AID_DESC|一剂战斗祝福药水。获得援助，提供 1d8+感知 的额外生命，可超过正常最大值。
ITEM_POTION_OF_GREATER_AID_NAME|强效援助药水
ITEM_POTION_OF_GREATER_AID_DESC|一剂更强的战斗祝福药水。获得双倍强度援助，提供 2x(1d8+感知) 的额外生命，可超过正常最大值。
ITEM_POTION_OF_RESTORATION_NAME|复原药水
ITEM_POTION_OF_RESTORATION_DESC|一剂干净银色药水。恢复属性流失。
ITEM_POTION_OF_REJUVENATION_NAME|再生药水
ITEM_POTION_OF_REJUVENATION_DESC|一剂绿金药水。获得再生，每回合恢复 2+感知 点生命，持续约 120 回合。
ITEM_POTION_OF_CURE_BLINDNESS_NAME|治盲药水
ITEM_POTION_OF_CURE_BLINDNESS_DESC|一剂清澈刺眼药水。立即治愈失明。
ITEM_POTION_OF_CURE_PARALYSIS_NAME|治麻痹药水
ITEM_POTION_OF_CURE_PARALYSIS_DESC|清除麻痹、睡眠、混乱、寒意和蛛网束缚。
ITEM_GREATER_MANA_POTION_NAME|强效法力药水
ITEM_GREATER_MANA_POTION_DESC|一剂深蓝药水。恢复 10-18 点法力.
