STORY_MSG_QUEST_UPDATE_RETURN_AELRION|任务更新： 返回 Aelrion Yewhand in Telwynd。
STORY_MSG_QUEST_UPDATE_RETURN_HIGHMARK_LANCER|任务更新： 返回 a Silver Lancer in Highmark。
STORY_MSG_QUEST_UPDATE_KILL_BROND|任务更新： 杀死 Brond， 食人魔 Champion in Rockmaw Keep。
STORY_MSG_QUEST_UPDATE_KILL_MAUG|任务更新： 杀死 Maug， 双头巨人 in Rockmaw Keep。
STORY_MSG_QUEST_UPDATE_OPEN_ROYAL_SARCOPHAGUS|任务更新： 打开 royal sarcophagus in King's Barrow。
STORY_MSG_QUEST_UPDATE_RECOVER_LOCKBOX|任务更新： 找回 锁箱 从 Smuggler 岩洞's lower cove。
STORY_MSG_QUEST_UPDATE_RETURN_VETHRIN|任务更新： 返回 Vethrin Quill。
STORY_MSG_QUEST_UPDATE_RETURN_VETHRIN_COTTAGE|Quest updated: return to Wizard Vethrin with the Burned Cottage markings.
STORY_MSG_QUEST_UPDATE_SEARCH_DEAD_DUERGAR|任务更新： 搜索 dead 灰矮人 in Floodgate Cistern for runeforge core。
STORY_MSG_QUEST_UPDATE_RETURN_DORRAN|任务更新： 返回 Dorran Keenedge in Stonecleft。
STORY_MSG_QUEST_UPDATE_RETURN_CALDUS|任务更新： 返回 Ser Caldus Renn at Traveller's Rest。
STORY_MSG_QUEST_UPDATE_BRING_DRAKE_SCALE|任务更新： bring a 幼龙 scale back 到 Velra Senn。
STORY_MSG_QUEST_UPDATE_RETURN_BRESS|任务更新： 返回 Bress Dask。
STORY_MSG_QUEST_UPDATE_RETURN_THRUNNA|Quest updated: return to the Stonecleft gate warden.
STORY_MSG_QUEST_UPDATE_RETURN_THAVOSS|任务更新：返回Havenford的Elder Thavoss。
STORY_MSG_QUEST_UPDATE_RETURN_THERYN|任务更新： 返回 Old Theryn Rusk in Havenford。
STORY_MSG_QUEST_DROP_KOBOLD_SCALP|You take a 狗头人 scalp for Garrick。
STORY_MSG_QUEST_DROP_GRAVE_BONE|You take a grave bone for Garrick。
STORY_MSG_QUEST_DROP_OLDROOT_LEAF|You cut a usable oldroot 叶片。
STORY_MSG_QUEST_DROP_MOONWELL_THREAD|You gather a strand of moonwell 线。
STORY_MSG_QUEST_NOTE_RUNEFORGE_DUERGAR|任务备注： Dorran Keenedge in Stonecleft should hear about this。
NPC_LINE_EDRIN_1|传闻：Do not touch inkstones。 我有 them sorted by riverbank， not color。
NPC_LINE_EDRIN_2|Trace the carving first. The stone lies less when it has not been dragged across a table.
NPC_LINE_EDRIN_3|传闻：黑玻璃 chips go in cloth， not bare fingers。 I want edges intact。
NPC_LINE_EDRIN_CAVE_COMPLETE_1|传闻：The 哥布林 chief is dead， but 洞穴 still needs a proper look。 哥布林 do not carve old door marks。
NPC_LINE_EDRIN_CAVE_COMPLETE_2|传闻：Old door marks， stamped brick， 黑玻璃 dust： wrap it 和 bring it here before a trader sees it。
NPC_LINE_EDRIN_CAVE_COMPLETE_3|传闻：带给我 map scraps， stamped brick， 或 黑玻璃 before Merrit prices lot。
NPC_LINE_THERYN_1|传闻：Mind loose pages。 I had them in order before wind 和 children found me。
NPC_LINE_THERYN_2|传闻：If a 神龛 scrap names Istaris， bring it here before a merchant sees it。
NPC_LINE_THERYN_3|传闻：I read old hands。 I do not read wet maps， burned corners， 或 tavern poems。
NPC_LINE_FARMER_1|传闻：The goats kicked through west rail again。 If you pass Bran's place， tell him I need his spare hammer。
NPC_LINE_FARMER_2|传闻：Old mill's jammed again。 We got three sacks through before wheel stuck。
NPC_LINE_FARMER_3|传闻：Seed cost double this spring， 和 fort tax man still wants his share。
NPC_LINE_FARMER_4|传闻：Raiders took two sacks 从 my shed last week。 We are boiling oats thin until market day。
NPC_LINE_FARMER_CAVE_STARTED_1|传闻：Elder Thavoss says east 洞穴 needs clearing。 Good。 My pen 大门 has claw marks all along hinge。
NPC_LINE_FARMER_CAVE_STARTED_2|传闻：We latch shutters before dusk now。 The 哥布林 learned where goat yard opens。
NPC_LINE_FARMER_CAVE_STARTED_3|传闻：If you are working for Thavoss， bring a sharp blade。 Those 哥布林 come back fast when they smell grain。
NPC_LINE_FARMER_CAVE_COMPLETE_1|传闻：No 哥布林 tracks by pens this morning。 I let goats out before breakfast。
NPC_LINE_FARMER_CAVE_COMPLETE_2|传闻：Slept till sunup for once。 Woke up angry at rooster instead of scared of ditch。
NPC_LINE_FARMER_CAVE_COMPLETE_3|传闻：The raids stopped， but I still latch pen twice。 No tracks this week； my hands do it anyway。
NPC_LINE_BEGGAR_1|传闻：Got a heel of bread 到 spare？ Copper's fine too。 Hot soup costs two at Nell's。
NPC_LINE_BEGGAR_2|传闻：Nell sets yesterday's crusts by side door。 Best not let dogs see you first。
NPC_LINE_BEGGAR_3|传闻：They say 黑玻璃 sells south。 I say bread sells better when your hands shake。
NPC_LINE_BEGGAR_4|传闻：Leave spare 食物 by commons wall。 The little ones check there before dark。
NPC_LINE_BEGGAR_CAVE_COMPLETE_1|传闻：Nell put out a full basket this morning。 Road must be 打开 enough for flour again。
NPC_LINE_BEGGAR_CAVE_COMPLETE_2|传闻：The guards quit snapping at cart wheels。 They still 守卫 every stranger。
NPC_LINE_BEGGAR_CAVE_COMPLETE_3|传闻：Dogs slept quiet last night。 I did too， until hens started up。
NPC_LINE_DRIFTER_1|East-road ditches turn up buckles, arrows, and lies every dawn.
NPC_LINE_DRIFTER_2|传闻：黑玻璃 cuts through cheap cloth。 Wrap it twice before a buyer starts turning it over。
NPC_LINE_DRIFTER_3|传闻：Highmark wants cart hands。 Havenford is short three， 和 nobody wants their son on 道路。
NPC_LINE_DRIFTER_4|传闻：Wagon drivers keep one hand on reins 和 one on a knife these days。
NPC_LINE_DRIFTER_5|传闻：If Nell closes side door early， I move 到 commons wall。 Less shouting there。
NPC_LINE_DRIFTER_CAVE_COMPLETE_1|传闻：Fewer 哥布林 prints east of town。 I still saw fresh boots by north milestone。
NPC_LINE_DRIFTER_CAVE_COMPLETE_2|传闻：Two carts reached town before noon。 Last week we would have heard shouting 从 大门。
NPC_LINE_DRIFTER_CAVE_COMPLETE_3|传闻：Folks laughed outside Nell's today。 They still barred their shutters before full dark。
NPC_LINE_PEDDLER_1|传闻：Come close。 Blades， twine， 护符 knots， 和 a little ruin salvage in side roll。 Names cost extra。
NPC_LINE_PEDDLER_2|传闻：Spare straps， dry tinder， cheap charms。 If yours snapped already， price just went up。
NPC_LINE_PEDDLER_3|传闻：Warm 黑玻璃？ Old script rings？ Show me first。 Scholars 报酬 slow unless I press them。
NPC_LINE_HALF_ORC_HUMAN_1|传闻：You there。 State your business 和 keep moving。
NPC_LINE_HALF_ORC_HUMAN_2|传闻：Coin on counter first。 I do not run tabs for strangers。
NPC_LINE_HALF_ORC_HUMAN_3|传闻：Easy now。 Keep your hands where 我可以 see them。
NPC_LINE_HALF_ORC_HUMAN_4|传闻：No lingering by houses。 The 守卫 has enough complaints today。
NPC_LINE_HALF_ORC_HUMAN_5|传闻：Off my doorstep。 My children are inside。
NPC_LINE_HALF_ORC_HUMAN_RELIGIOUS_1|传闻：使用 lower steps。 Chapel doors are crowded enough。
NPC_LINE_HALF_ORC_HUMAN_RELIGIOUS_2|传闻：Do not crowd 祭坛。 Say your prayer 和 make 房间。
NPC_LINE_HALF_ORC_HUMAN_RELIGIOUS_3|传闻：State your need quietly。 The sick are sleeping behind screen。
NPC_LINE_HALF_ORC_PRAGMATIC_1|传闻：Coin first， same as everyone。
NPC_LINE_HALF_ORC_PRAGMATIC_2|传闻：Your 钱 spends here。 Put it where 我可以 count it。
NPC_LINE_HALF_ORC_PRAGMATIC_3|传闻：No trouble by my stall。 I just swept that corner。
NPC_LINE_HALF_ORC_PRAGMATIC_4|传闻：Buying 或 browsing？ Choose quick； bread is cooling。
NPC_LINE_HALF_ORC_CHILD_1|传闻：Ma said not 到 stare at tusks。
NPC_LINE_HALF_ORC_CHILD_2|传闻：Can you lift a grown man 带着 one hand？
NPC_LINE_HALF_ORC_DWARF_1|Orc blood in my hall? Keep walking.
NPC_LINE_HALF_ORC_DWARF_2|传闻：Mind your hands near clan rail。
NPC_LINE_HALF_ORC_DWARF_3|传闻：Buy your meal， drink quiet， 和 leave。
NPC_LINE_HALF_ORC_DWARF_4|传闻：No forge business for you unless Thrunna says so。
NPC_LINE_HALF_ORC_DWARF_5|传闻：If you want a 房间， 询问 keeper。 If you want clan talk， forget it。
NPC_LINE_HALF_ORC_ELF_1|传闻：You may pass。 Keep your hands away 从 ward lines。
NPC_LINE_HALF_ORC_ELF_2|传闻：Wardens know you are here， traveler。
NPC_LINE_HALF_ORC_ELF_3|Old boundaries were written after old griefs. Your step reads loudly against them.
NPC_LINE_HALF_ORC_ELF_4|传闻：This grove is not for wandering。
NPC_LINE_HALF_ORC_SOLDIER_1|Clear the line. Shields need room.
NPC_LINE_HALF_ORC_SOLDIER_2|传闻：Hands off stores。 Counted crates stay counted。
NPC_LINE_HALF_ORC_SOLDIER_3|传闻：Horn sounds， move where I point。
NPC_LINE_HALF_ORC_SOLDIER_4|传闻：Got orders？ Show them。 No orders， move on。
NPC_LINE_STONECLEFT_FILLER_1|The mess line starts after shift change. If you smell barley, you are heading the right way.
NPC_LINE_STONECLEFT_FILLER_2|Commons crew is short two haulers. Watch for carts cutting across the road.
NPC_LINE_STONECLEFT_FILLER_3|传闻：Soup's by hearth。 Bread's in left basket if miners left any。
NPC_LINE_STONECLEFT_FILLER_4|传闻：Hood your lamp near lower stair。 大门 守卫 hates glare。
NPC_LINE_STONECLEFT_FILLER_5|传闻：Mind east door。 Someone spilled ale again。
NPC_LINE_STONECLEFT_FILLER_6|传闻：Put borrowed tools back on hooks。 Missing picks start fights。
NPC_LINE_STONECLEFT_FILLER_7|传闻：Shake 道路 dust outside。 Grit ruins hinges。
NPC_LINE_STONECLEFT_FILLER_8|Underway carts are backed up below. Every crate has a mark and every mark has a clerk.
NPC_LINE_STONECLEFT_FILLER_9|传闻：I braced that wall this morning。 Hands off until dust settles。
NPC_LINE_STONECLEFT_FILLER_10|传闻：A quarry cart came back 带着 tooth marks in axle。 Thrunna doubled 道路 守卫。
NPC_LINE_STONECLEFT_MASON_1|传闻：I chalked that crack this morning。 Keep your shoulder off it。
NPC_LINE_STONECLEFT_MASON_2|传闻：Need Throkk？ Lower stair。 Need a wider door？ 带回 wedges 和 six strong backs。
NPC_LINE_STONECLEFT_MASON_3|传闻：East hall is sound。 New stair is not。 Walk by lamps。
NPC_LINE_STONECLEFT_MINER_1|Lift crew is late again. Ask the lower gate guard, not me.
NPC_LINE_STONECLEFT_MINER_2|传闻：Black grit in that seam。 Tools down， lamps up。
NPC_LINE_STONECLEFT_MINER_3|传闻：Old cuts sound hollow in places。 Tap before you lean。
NPC_LINE_STONECLEFT_MINER_4|传闻：灰矮人 leave square tool marks。 When I see those， I count helmets before ore。
NPC_LINE_STONECLEFT_GUARD_FLAVOR_1|Keep to the main hall. The side doors are work rooms, not shortcuts.
NPC_LINE_STONECLEFT_GUARD_FLAVOR_2|传闻：Keep moving near lower 大门。 Staring makes 守卫 nervous。
NPC_LINE_STONECLEFT_GUARD_FLAVOR_3|No loose packs by the stair. If it is yours, carry it; if it is not, leave it.
NPC_LINE_STONECLEFT_GUARD_FLAVOR_4|If the cart crew shouts twice, clear the middle track.
NPC_LINE_TELWYND_WARDWORK_1|传闻：Ward glass chips easily。 询问 before you touch bright lenses。
NPC_LINE_TELWYND_WARDWORK_2|Do not step over silver twine. It is not decoration, and it dislikes apology.
NPC_LINE_TELWYND_WARDWORK_3|Old wards wake for old names. New feet must wait until the grove decides how much to hear.
NPC_LINE_TELWYND_WARDWORK_4|传闻：The old grove ward is touchy。 Scouts clear path before we carry tools there。
NPC_LINE_TELWYND_PATH_1|The path through the Veiled Wood is quiet. Quiet is not peace; it is the wood listening before it answers.
NPC_LINE_TELWYND_PATH_2|The forest path rewards patience. Hurry, and you find the wrong clearing.
NPC_LINE_TELWYND_PATH_3|传闻：Guest paths end at elder 石头。 Past them， no guide comes looking。
NPC_LINE_TELWYND_PATH_4|Straight lines through these trees usually mean someone is lost. Telwynd owes strangers no rescue.
NPC_LINE_TELWYND_WORKER_1|Leaf fall hides the old footway. We clear only enough for guests who are expected.
NPC_LINE_TELWYND_WORKER_2|传闻：Small tools vanish under moss。 Mine stay tied 到 my belt。
NPC_LINE_TELWYND_WORKER_3|Green shoots cross every line they can. Growth is not innocence; we prune it all the same.
NPC_LINE_TELWYND_WORKER_4|传闻：Ghostwood smoke clings 到 cloth。 Wash twice before you sit inside。
NPC_LINE_TELWYND_CHILD_1|The gate wardens know where visitors may walk. I know because I tried every shortcut.
NPC_LINE_TELWYND_CHILD_2|传闻：Scouts say guests get lost staring up。 Watch white 石头 instead。
NPC_LINE_STONECLEFT_LOWER_PASSAGE_1|The lower pass is open, but not friendly. Keep lamps fed and hands clear of side cuts.
NPC_LINE_STONECLEFT_LOWER_PASSAGE_2|传闻：No stalls past this post。 Count your 食物， 油， 和 bandages now。
NPC_LINE_STONECLEFT_LOWER_PASSAGE_3|If you are bound for Highmark, keep north through the Underway and ignore the old cart ruts.
NPC_LINE_KESTREL_FIELD_SUPPLIER_1|传闻：Rations， lamp 油， bolts， patched mail。 Field packs only； wagon space is for orders。
NPC_LINE_KESTREL_FIELD_SUPPLIER_2|传闻：Breach kit is on this table。 Pay here， count it here， 背包 it before you block my line。
NPC_LINE_KESTREL_FIELD_SUPPLIER_3|传闻：Tie bottles inside your 背包。 I am not explaining loose 油 到 surgeon again。
NPC_LINE_KESTREL_GUARD_1|传闻：North 守卫 holds 道路。 South 守卫 holds breach。 Horn call means clear a lane。
NPC_LINE_KESTREL_GUARD_2|传闻：黑玻璃 flaking off Scar wall？ Step back 和 call a sapper。
NPC_LINE_KESTREL_GUARD_3|传闻：See those iron pins？ Leave them alone。 They keep tents standing。
NPC_LINE_KESTREL_GUARD_4|传闻：Rockmaw's west towers burn pitch at dusk。 Maug 和 Brond still hold keep。
NPC_LINE_KESTREL_GUARD_5|传闻：Fill your waterskin before you cross stake line。
NPC_LINE_KESTREL_SCOUT_1|The west patrol line shifts after the Scar breathes. Watch which way the grass refuses.
NPC_LINE_KESTREL_SCOUT_2|传闻：Old tracks lead into Scar。 Mark them 和 call a sapper； do not wander after them。
NPC_LINE_KESTREL_SCOUT_3|Tracks vanish near the black grit. That does not mean the patrol flew away.
NPC_LINE_KESTREL_SCOUT_4|传闻：Ghostwood patrols keep missing posts。 They leave at dusk 和 come back short a man。
NPC_LINE_KESTREL_SCOUT_5|传闻：Map shows no stream in Ghostwood。 Three 斥候 heard 水 near 塔 path anyway。
NPC_LINE_KESTREL_SCOUT_6|The wood keeps old campfire smoke under its bark. If you smell it, turn back.
NPC_LINE_KESTREL_SAPPER_1|传闻：Wedges， powder， rope。 Then everyone behind stake before I touch fuse。
NPC_LINE_KESTREL_SAPPER_2|传闻：After a blast， I check side cracks before anyone walks under roof。
NPC_LINE_KESTREL_SAPPER_3|传闻：If I tell you 到 move， run 到 marked stake。 Questions wait。
NPC_LINE_KESTREL_SAPPER_4|传闻：I drilled a clean hole this morning。 By dusk， chalk line had split two feet。
NPC_LINE_KESTREL_SAPPER_5|传闻：White Seal marks， Telwynd glass， 黑玻璃 veins： I do not drill them without Vaust's order。
NPC_LINE_KESTREL_WORKER_1|传闻：Stew's thin today。 Bandages are in orderly tent， not under my ladle。
NPC_LINE_KESTREL_WORKER_2|传闻：Smith's line is for buckles， rivets， 和 field blades。 Trinkets wait。
NPC_LINE_KESTREL_WORKER_3|Returns come back short of hands. The loads still need carrying.
NPC_LINE_KESTREL_WORKER_4|传闻：Rockmaw 道路 opens， half this 营地 moves west before breakfast。
NPC_LINE_KESTREL_SMITH_1|传闻：Cracked buckles， loose rivets， bent blades。 Set piece down 和 keep your fingers clear。
NPC_LINE_KESTREL_SMITH_2|传闻：我有 spearheads cooling 和 three shields split at rim。 If you need work， say it quick。
NPC_LINE_KESTREL_SMITH_3|传闻：Rockmaw 装备 comes back dented deep。 Ogres put dents through shields 和 arm straps alike。
NPC_LINE_KESTREL_SMITH_4|传闻：Field forge is 打开。 I sell blades， patch mail， 和 replace straps if quartermaster has any left。
NPC_LINE_KESTREL_MEDICAL_1|Stretchers come in after quiet calls. Loud calls give people warning.
NPC_LINE_KESTREL_MEDICAL_2|传闻：Keep your voice down near wounded。 Falling 黑玻璃 kept them awake。
NPC_LINE_KESTREL_MEDICAL_3|传闻：A lancer 带着 one good leg still asked for wall duty。 Crutches are by tent pole。
NPC_LINE_KESTREL_MEDICAL_4|传闻：Ghostwood 装备 comes back smoke-stained。 I keep clean blankets on upper cot。
NPC_LINE_KESTREL_ORDERLY_1|传闻：We are down 到 torn linen 和 boiled 水。 If you have bandages， hand them here。
NPC_LINE_KESTREL_ORDERLY_2|传闻：Keep your voice low。 Two lancers finally slept， 和 我会 not wake them for 营地 gossip。
NPC_LINE_KESTREL_ORDERLY_3|传闻：Cots are for bleeding， fever， 或 orders 从 Vaust。 If you need rest， 报酬 和 lie still。
NPC_LINE_KESTREL_ORDERLY_4|传闻：Ghostwood returns come in cold 和 shaking。 I check for bites before I give them a blanket。
NPC_LINE_GENERIC_NPC_1|传闻：Busy day。 If you need directions， 询问 at 大门 或 market。
NPC_LINE_GENERIC_NPC_2|传闻：我有 work 到 finish。 Someone by 道路 can point you along。
NPC_LINE_CHILD_1|传闻：Tress dared me 到 touch a 哥布林 skull。 I said no。 I am brave， not stupid。
NPC_LINE_CHILD_2|传闻：I saw blue light past old 石头。 Da said lanterns， but it did not move like a lantern。
NPC_LINE_CHILD_3|传闻：My cousin says a dead king sleeps in old mound。 If he has boots， they are probably too big。
NPC_LINE_CHILD_CAVE_STARTED_1|传闻：Thavoss said no 洞穴 games till 哥布林 are gone。 He always knows fun rules。
NPC_LINE_CHILD_CAVE_STARTED_2|传闻：If you see 哥布林 chief， tell him Jory can throw a 石头 over mill roof。 Almost。
NPC_LINE_CHILD_CAVE_COMPLETE_1|传闻：Ma says there are fewer 哥布林 tracks now。 She still said no caves。 I asked twice。
NPC_LINE_CHILD_CAVE_COMPLETE_2|传闻：The dogs slept last night。 I stayed awake in case they needed help。
NPC_LINE_DOG_1|传闻：The dog sniffs your boots， sneezes once， 和 plants itself by 大门。
NPC_LINE_DOG_2|传闻：The dog watches east 道路 带着 its ears high。
NPC_LINE_GOAT_1|传闻：The goat chews fence rope 和 stares at you like you brought it。
NPC_LINE_GOAT_2|传闻：The goat climbs onto a feed sack 和 refuses 到 move。
NPC_LINE_CHICKEN_1|传闻：The chicken darts under bench 和 scratches at spilled barley。
NPC_LINE_CHICKEN_2|传闻：The chicken pecks your bootlace， decides against it， 和 struts away。
NPC_LINE_MULE_1|传闻：The mule shifts under a patched pannier 和 flicks flies 从 its ears。
NPC_LINE_MULE_2|The mule snorts toward the open path, then remembers it dislikes paths too.
NPC_LINE_DOCK_RUMOR_1|传闻：Catch has been poor all week。 Reedwater shallows smell of 油。
NPC_LINE_DOCK_RUMOR_2|传闻：使用 plank 道路 through marsh。 Step off it 和 leeches 找到 you fast。
NPC_LINE_DOCK_RUMOR_3|传闻：Pulled 黑玻璃 grit 从 nets again。 Stuff chews rope 和 skin。
NPC_LINE_DOCK_RUMOR_4|The cellar moves crates after last watch. Anyone who hears it suddenly remembers chores.
NPC_LINE_DOCK_RUMOR_5|传闻：South 水 carries pale salt some mornings。 Tidehook says it comes 从 cliff cracks。
NPC_LINE_DOCK_RUMOR_6|传闻：A sailor swore he saw lanterns under cliff 水。 If you see lights there， call harbor 守卫。
NPC_LINE_PEASANT_STORE_1|传闻：Buy a ration before you leave。 Root chewing gets old before noon。
NPC_LINE_PEASANT_STORE_2|传闻：Food 和 lamp 油 first。 The shiny bits can wait till supper is packed。
NPC_LINE_PEASANT_STORE_3|传闻：Valoria markets have roofs， so they say。 Here we sell whatever rain spared。
NPC_LINE_PEASANT_ROAD_1|传闻：South 道路 is simple by daylight。 Make 营地 before dark if your legs are done。
NPC_LINE_PEASANT_ROAD_2|传闻：A 营地 kit is not an 旅店 床， but it keeps mud off your face。
NPC_LINE_PEASANT_ROAD_3|传闻：Stay on 道路 带着 a loaded 背包。 Hills slow you more than you think。
NPC_LINE_PEASANT_ROAD_4|传闻：Smoke on south 道路 could be a campfire 或 a wreck。 Look before you walk in。
NPC_LINE_PEASANT_DOCK_1|传闻：Garran keeps boats。 询问 him for passage； shouting at 水 never helped。
NPC_LINE_PEASANT_DOCK_2|传闻：Never seen Valoria。 Folks say even poor can 找到 bread there。
NPC_LINE_PEASANT_DOCK_3|传闻：Armor is heavy， aye。 Still better than a blade through your shirt。
NPC_LINE_PEASANT_FIGHT_1|传闻：使用 your best trick early。 If you wait until you're surrounded， it is too late。
NPC_LINE_PEASANT_FIGHT_2|传闻：When two come at you， back up。 Make one stand in other's way。
NPC_LINE_PEASANT_FIGHT_3|传闻：Got a cut？ 使用 a bandage。 Blood on your boots just slows you down。
NPC_LINE_PEASANT_TRAVEL_1|传闻：Eat when your belly starts growling。 Hungry hands miss。
NPC_LINE_PEASANT_TRAVEL_2|传闻：Keep a torch dry。 Broken boards disappear after dusk。
NPC_LINE_PEASANT_TRAVEL_3|传闻：If you know a spell 或 fighting trick， 使用 it early。 哥布林 do not wait their turn。
NPC_LINE_HIGHMARK_PEASANT_1|Silver Lances pass at dawn. Sweepers know the order by spur marks alone.
NPC_LINE_HIGHMARK_PEASANT_2|传闻：White Seal？ North 神殿， lower steps。 Start there。
NPC_LINE_HIGHMARK_PEASANT_3|传闻：Stonecleft carts came in late again。 One had a split axle。
NPC_LINE_HIGHMARK_PEASANT_4|传闻：Keep clear when Lancers move in pairs。 They are not on parade。
NPC_LINE_HIGHMARK_PEASANT_5|传闻：Lyss keeps a clean 旅店。 Costs plenty， but sheets are clean。
NPC_LINE_HIGHMARK_PEASANT_6|传闻：Mountain pass takes nailed boots。 Snow covers loose shale。
NPC_LINE_HIGHMARK_PEASANT_7|传闻：Kestrel runners came in without spare packs。 营地 must be short on 口粮 或 bandages。
NPC_LINE_TRAVELLERS_REST_TRAVELLER_1|传闻：I stop here because next roof is past bridge track。 My boots are done for day。
NPC_LINE_TRAVELLERS_REST_TRAVELLER_2|传闻：The shop buys 道路 leftovers。 I sold a cracked helm there 和 bought a better knife。
NPC_LINE_TRAVELLERS_REST_TRAVELLER_3|传闻：Branna sets cups outside when weather holds。 Sit quick； good bench fills。
NPC_LINE_TRAVELLERS_REST_TRAVELLER_4|传闻：Fill your waterskin 和 check your straps before you leave。 Everyone forgets one of two。
NPC_LINE_TRAVELLERS_REST_TRAVELLER_5|传闻：South quay is empty now。 Empty 码头 still have rotten boards， so 守卫 your step。
NPC_LINE_TRAVELLERS_REST_TRAVELLER_6|传闻：West wood fog cuts a lantern down 到 arm's length。 Carry extra 油。
NPC_LINE_TRAVELLERS_REST_TRAVELLER_7|传闻：Man at next table says Rockmaw is abandoned。 His brother came back without a 背包。
NPC_LINE_TRAVELLERS_REST_TRAVELLER_8|传闻：Saltmere fish taste bitter this season。 Cook blames grit 从 cliff caves。
NPC_LINE_TRAVELLERS_REST_RESEARCHER_1|传闻：These 道路 石头 are older than 旅店。 The cuts do not match any Valorian measure I know。
NPC_LINE_TRAVELLERS_REST_RESEARCHER_2|传闻：The well has three repairs in three 石头。 Someone kept this stop alive for a long time。
NPC_LINE_TRAVELLERS_REST_RESEARCHER_3|传闻：Marked 石头 或 sealed glass？ 带回 it 到 me before you scrape it clean。
NPC_LINE_TRAVELLERS_REST_RESEARCHER_4|传闻：Stonecleft Pass has two carved dates on one arch。 The masons reused first arch。
NPC_LINE_TRAVELLERS_REST_RESEARCHER_5|传闻：Ghostwood chips smell of ash， but bark is not burned。 I would like a cleaner sample。
NPC_LINE_TRAVELLERS_REST_SHADY_1|传闻：Waiting on a wagon。 Drink your ale 和 let me drink mine。
NPC_LINE_TRAVELLERS_REST_SHADY_2|传闻：Second ale loosens wagon tongues。 Buyers， routes， guard names。 Useful noise。
NPC_LINE_TRAVELLERS_REST_SHADY_3|传闻：Bandits do not wear colors in here。 Neither do smugglers。
NPC_LINE_TIDEHOOK_NETMENDER_1|传闻：Net's torn again。 East rocks shred twine faster than we sell fish。
NPC_LINE_TIDEHOOK_NETMENDER_2|传闻：Keep your boots clear of east rocks。 One bad step puts you in deep 水。
NPC_LINE_TIDEHOOK_NETMENDER_3|传闻：Kethra's spears cost 钱。 洞穴 fishers snapped two cheap shafts this week。
NPC_LINE_TIDEHOOK_NETMENDER_4|传闻：Saltmere went flat under a north wind。 We kept small boats tied all morning。
NPC_LINE_TIDEHOOK_NETMENDER_5|传闻：White shapes under cliff are 石头 unless they move。 If they move， shout。
NPC_LINE_PORTER_1|传闻：Lamp 油 goes 到 White Seal first today。 Flour waits until I get 封印 mark。
NPC_LINE_PORTER_2|传闻：Highmark loads changed this month： more grain， less iron， more lamp 油。
NPC_LINE_PORTER_3|Scar camps call for rope every hour. Rope, then hands, then more rope.
NPC_LINE_LABORER_1|传闻：大门 clerk sent these crates east， then west。 Same 封印， same boxes， my back twice。
NPC_LINE_LABORER_2|传闻：Stonecleft carts came in 带着 split wheel rims。 If you need north 道路， 守卫 for loose iron by ruts。
NPC_LINE_LABORER_3|Eastern-road loads leave before the count is full. Better late crates than lost backs.
NPC_LINE_PILGRIM_1|传闻：Priests take names on left stair before dawn。 Wounds by basin， charms at table。
NPC_LINE_PILGRIM_2|Three altar marks wake the plain charm. The first is hope. The second is blisters.
NPC_LINE_PILGRIM_3|传闻：I saw fresh wheel ruts by Roadside 神龛 和 one broken cart。 Step wide where mud 回合 black。
NPC_LINE_STABLEHAND_1|传闻：The mules care about oats， clean tack， 和 whether you know not 到 stand behind them。
NPC_LINE_STABLEHAND_2|传闻：Cart teams get oats before saddle horses today。 Bought stall space？ Check chalk mark on 大门。
NPC_LINE_STABLEHAND_3|传闻：Two horses came in lathered 从 south 道路 before noon。 Water any mount slow， 或 it founders。
NPC_LINE_HIGHMARK_PRIEST_1|传闻：Charm blanks come 到 this cloth。 Relic claims go 到 Tovan Mere 或 High Canon。
NPC_LINE_HIGHMARK_PRIEST_2|传闻：Pilgrims line lower steps before dawn。 Most forget 油， breakfast， 或 a 房间 带着 a lock。
NPC_LINE_HIGHMARK_PRIEST_3|The square clears at dusk because the old seal still listens. We try not to waste its attention.
DIALOGUE_HIGHMARK_PRIEST_PILGRIMAGE_START_CHARM|对话：Traveler， wait a moment。 This blank 护符 will not hold White Seal yet。 It needs 道路 marks first。 拿上 it。
DIALOGUE_HIGHMARK_PRIEST_PILGRIMAGE_START_ROUTE|对话：Touch it 到 Havenford's 祭坛， Roadside 神龛， 和 Reedmire 神龛。 When all three marks show， bring it back 到 this cloth。
DIALOGUE_HIGHMARK_PRIEST_PILGRIMAGE_REPLACE_CHARM|对话：Lost 护符？ 我可以 cut one more blank。 Carry it 到 whichever first altars are still unmarked， then bring it back。
DIALOGUE_HIGHMARK_PRIEST_PILGRIMAGE_BLESS_HANDIN|The marks are set. The charm is blessed for Oldroot. Take it to the altar there.
DIALOGUE_HIGHMARK_PRIEST_PILGRIMAGE_OLDROOT_REMINDER|对话：Oldroot Temple is next mark。 Touch dormant 护符 到 its 祭坛， then return if 护符 wakes。
DIALOGUE_HIGHMARK_PRIEST_PILGRIMAGE_FINAL_HANDIN|对话：Oldroot took last mark。 Set 护符 down； 我会 close rite before wax cools。
DIALOGUE_HIGHMARK_PRIEST_PILGRIMAGE_FINAL_BLESSING|The finished charm is yours now. Its blessing should hold better on the road.
DIALOGUE_HIGHMARK_PRIEST_PILGRIMAGE_COMPLETE_IDLE|对话：Your 护符 is filed 和 sealed。 I cannot run same pilgrimage twice for one name。
NPC_LINE_HIGHMARK_LANCER_1|传闻：North 大门 reports come by horn 和 runner。 Smoke on cliff 道路 goes on my board first。
NPC_LINE_HIGHMARK_LANCER_2|传闻：White Seal steps stay clear until someone brings in a cursed relic。 Then I need two lancers 和 no crowd。
NPC_LINE_HIGHMARK_LANCER_3|传闻：West doors close at horn call。 Buy before dusk 或 找到 a wall outside。
NPC_LINE_HIGHMARK_LANCER_4|传闻：North pass is rough this week。 Scouts lose time there， 和 carts come back 带着 split rims。
NPC_LINE_HIGHMARK_RESEARCHER_1|传闻：Canon marked shelf three study only。 If you pull vellum， put red weight back on it。
NPC_LINE_HIGHMARK_RESEARCHER_2|White Seal genealogy, ritual, and confession often share one page. The margins are usually the dangerous part.
NPC_LINE_HIGHMARK_RESEARCHER_3|传闻：Clean spellbooks are on upper shelf。 Cheap copies have blue corrections。
NPC_LINE_HIGHMARK_RESEARCHER_4|传闻：Scar maps go on north lectern。 Do not mix them 带着 神龛 copies。
NPC_LINE_HIGHMARK_RESEARCHER_5|传闻：Telwynd grove notes marked 'sealed for safety' need ward maps beside them。
UI_CHARACTER_EFFECT_ENLARGE|Enlarge：+4 STR，-4 DEF。
UI_CHARACTER_EFFECT_REDUCE|Reduce：-4 STR，+4 DEF。
ITEM_COATING_LESSER_CONSECRATION_NAME|弱效祝圣油
ITEM_COATING_LESSER_CONSECRATION_SHORT|圣+d3
ITEM_COATING_STRONG_CONSECRATION_NAME|强效祝圣油
ITEM_COATING_STRONG_CONSECRATION_SHORT|圣+d12
UI_INSPECT_EFFECT_HP_REGEN|passive HP regeneration +{0:%d}
UI_INSPECT_EFFECT_COATING_LESSER_CONSECRATION|当前涂层：命中额外 1d3 神圣伤害。
UI_INSPECT_EFFECT_COATING_STRONG_CONSECRATION|当前涂层：命中额外 1d12 神圣伤害。
UI_INSPECT_DETAIL_STATUS|状态：{0}
ITEM_USE_EFFECT_POTION_OF_ENLARGE|给予+4力量和-4 DEF，持续1分钟。
ITEM_USE_EFFECT_POTION_OF_REDUCE|给予-4力量和+4 DEF，持续1分钟。
ITEM_USE_EFFECT_OIL_LESSER_CONSECRATION|在武器命中时增加1d3神圣伤害，持续10分钟。
ITEM_USE_EFFECT_OIL_STRONG_CONSECRATION|在武器命中时增加1d12神圣伤害，持续10分钟。
ITEM_USE_EFFECT_HARM_LIGHT|有害药剂；造成1d6+9伤害。
ITEM_USE_EFFECT_HARM_MODERATE|有害药剂；造成3d6+22伤害。
ITEM_USE_EFFECT_HARM_STRONG|有害药剂；造成6d6+54伤害。
ITEM_USE_EFFECT_POTION_OF_ACID|有害药剂；造成8-14酸液伤害。
ITEM_USE_EFFECT_POTION_OF_BURNING|有害药剂；造成8-14火焰伤害。
ITEM_USE_EFFECT_POTION_OF_WEAKNESS|有害药剂；使力量降低4，持续120回合。
ITEM_USE_EFFECT_POTION_OF_SLOWNESS|有害药剂；使移动变慢，持续5回合。
ITEM_USE_EFFECT_POTION_OF_SILENCE|有害药剂；造成沉默，持续6回合。
ITEM_USE_EFFECT_POTION_OF_FEAR|有害药剂；造成恐惧，持续3回合。
ITEM_USE_EFFECT_POTION_OF_SLEEP|有害药剂；造成睡眠，持续3回合。
ITEM_USE_EFFECT_POTION_OF_PARALYSIS|有害药剂；造成麻痹，持续3回合。
DEATH_POTION_HARM|被伤害药水杀死
DEATH_POTION_ACID|被酸液药水溶解
DEATH_POTION_BURNING|被燃烧药水烧死
DIALOGUE_ALDREN_POST_WATCHTOWER_IDLE|车队又能通行了，眼下看起来暂时安全。但我们还在做准备。
DIALOGUE_ALDREN_CAVE_CHIEF_TURNIN|You did it. With the chieftain dead, the goblins lose their nerve and our militia can drive off the stragglers. The farms can mend fences instead of burying stock, and perhaps carts will dare the road to Traveller's Rest again. Take your reward with my thanks, friend.
DIALOGUE_ALDREN_CAVE_CHIEF_TURNIN_HALF_ORC|You did the work, and Havenford is safer for it. Some here will still watch your tusks before your deeds; let them watch this deed too. Take the pay. Garrick may have harder work if you want it.
DIALOGUE_ALDREN_CAVE_CHIEF_REMINDER|Goblin Cave就在东边，离这里不远。杀了他们的首领。
DIALOGUE_ALDREN_CAVE_CHIEF_START|欢迎你，旅人。Havenford正值艰难年月。东岭洞穴里的哥布林一直袭击农场，撕毁栅栏，掳走牲畜。它们不像普通洞穴害兽那样散乱，里面有人在驱使它们。如果你能杀掉那个首领，我们会拿出村子能凑出的报酬。先带上这些金币和药水，能活着回来就回来。
DIALOGUE_ALDREN_CAVE_CHIEF_START_HALF_ORC|旅人。我不会假装这里的人对你的族类毫无芥蒂，但工作就是工作，危险就是危险。东边洞穴的哥布林在首领带领下袭击我们的农场。杀了他，Havenford会公平付酬。
DIALOGUE_MAELIN_SHRINE_SUPPLIES_AFTER_CAVE_CHIEF|对话：Goblin 洞穴 is quiet， 和 chapel line is smaller today。 我有 bandages， 神圣 symbols， 药水， 和 scrolls。 What do you need？
DIALOGUE_MAELIN_SHRINE_SUPPLIES_BEFORE_CAVE_CHIEF|对话：The chapel cupboards are thin， but I still keep bandages， blessings， 和 药水 for travelers。 What aid do you need before 道路？
DIALOGUE_VETHRIN_REEDMIRE_COMPLETE_IDLE|我很忙。拜托，去和矮人喝杯麦酒什么的吧。
DIALOGUE_VETHRIN_REEDMIRE_TURNIN|所以祭坛被旧魔法诅咒了。谢谢。我得查清这事怎么发生的。拿着，这是给你帮忙的回报。
DIALOGUE_VETHRIN_REEDMIRE_REMINDER|把 Reedmire 的事办完。把我的便条交给 Reth，安放神龛石，等那怪物死后把答复带回来。
DIALOGUE_VETHRIN_NOTE_REPLACEMENT|你把信弄丢了？当然。我就是为这种事留了副本。把这封带给Reedwater Docks的Reth Oskel。
DIALOGUE_VETHRIN_TOO_GREEN|请别打扰我，我需要准备一些东西。
DIALOGUE_VETHRIN_COTTAGE_TOO_GREEN|Please leave me to my research for now.
DIALOGUE_VETHRIN_COTTAGE_START|I need someone steady to look over the burned cottage. The fire was not ordinary; the ash still carries a magical trace, and the wolves around the ruin are not acting normal. Check the place carefully, then bring me whatever you find.
DIALOGUE_VETHRIN_COTTAGE_REMINDER|The burned cottage still needs eyes on it. Search the ruin carefully, then bring me whatever explains that fire. Watch the wolves; they are not acting normal.
DIALOGUE_VETHRIN_COTTAGE_TURNIN|Water glyphs under a burned house. Peculiar. This reminds me of a tale I overheard from Reth Oskel, one of the fishermen at Reedwater. I thought ale was doing most of the talking, but perhaps not. Take this spellbook; practical payment is harder to misread than theory.
DIALOGUE_VETHRIN_COTTAGE_REEDMIRE_WAIT|I need to do more research on this. Come see me again later.
DIALOGUE_VETHRIN_REEDMIRE_START|Reth Oskel is the fisherman. He spoke of stone piles around Reedmire Shrine and water moving against the wind. Take this sealed note to him at Reedwater Docks and get his account directly. If his story matches the cottage markings, the shrine may be worse than an old flooded altar.
DIALOGUE_TESSA_TRAIL_GEAR_AFTER_CAVE_CHIEF|哥布林袭击少下来后，我能摆出来的装备多多了。背包、绳子、灯油、陷阱。你缺什么？
DIALOGUE_TESSA_TRAIL_GEAR_BEFORE_CAVE_CHIEF|对话：Heading east？ Rations， rope， lamp 油， traps， 和 packs are on rack。 What are you short on？
DIALOGUE_BRANNOC_FORGE_STOCK|Forge is open for business. Leather and steel, get what you need.
DIALOGUE_HAVENFORD_WATCH_DONE|对话：No 打开 board today。 Havenford Watch has paid every signed mark 我有。
DIALOGUE_HAVENFORD_WATCH_SKRIT_TURNIN|Skrit死了？好。没有它们的群首，狗头人会四散，只能小口咬人。Havenford又欠你一次。
DIALOGUE_HAVENFORD_WATCH_SKRIT_REMINDER|Hail Adventurer. Skrit still needs ending.
DIALOGUE_HAVENFORD_WATCH_BONES_TURNIN|干得好。墓骨是阴森的报酬凭证，但能证明死者已经倒下。我们追查到狗头人的麻烦在废塔以北，通往旧山间工地。它们的群首Skrit藏在那里。找到他，把这件事彻底结束。
DIALOGUE_HAVENFORD_WATCH_BONES_REMINDER|对话：I need 二十 grave bones， not a story。 Skeletons 和 僵尸 count。 带回 bones back 到 my board。
DIALOGUE_HAVENFORD_WATCH_SCALPS_TURNIN|干得漂亮。每一张狗头人头皮，都少一把割向车轮的刀。这片土地在变化，而且不只是哥布林。旧土里有不死者爬起。见到就打碎，带墓骨作证，我会再付你报酬。
DIALOGUE_HAVENFORD_WATCH_SCALPS_REMINDER|kobold 仍在扰乱道路。有头皮时就带回来。
DIALOGUE_HAVENFORD_WATCH_START|你好，冒险者。Havenford需要清理道路，你看起来能帮上忙。杀掉二十个狗头人，把它们的头皮带给我，就能从守卫金库拿报酬。
DIALOGUE_HAVENFORD_WATCH_START_HALF_ORC|日安。Havenford需要清理道路，你看起来很能干。杀掉二十个狗头人，把它们的头皮带给我，就会拿到报酬。
DIALOGUE_KINGS_BARROW_DONE|Kingsmark 你留着。Theryn 的解读、你的古墓报告，还有足够的墨水，都够我写完记录了。
DIALOGUE_KINGS_BARROW_RING_TURNIN|对话：Kingsmark came out of royal sarcophagus， then。 Theryn's phrase worked， King Halric was named， 和 tomb held 戒指。\nKeep it。 I came for account， not a dead king's jewelry。
DIALOGUE_KINGS_BARROW_SARCOPHAGUS_REMINDER|对话：King Halric is down。 打开 royal sarcophagus before you leave； Kingsmark should be in king's hand。
DIALOGUE_KINGS_BARROW_EXPEDITION_REMINDER|对话：Theryn gave you phrase。 King's Barrow is south of Highmark in old Havenford March。 Enter tomb， 击败 King Halric， 和 打开 royal sarcophagus for Kingsmark。
DIALOGUE_KINGS_BARROW_PHRASE_CONFIRMED|对话：Theryn read it， then。 Good。 The phrase opens barrow door， but it will not clear tomb for you。\nKing's Barrow is south of Highmark in old Havenford March。 Go in， 击败 King Halric， then 打开 royal sarcophagus 和 take Kingsmark。 带回 account back 到 me in Highmark after Kingsmark is out。
DIALOGUE_KINGS_BARROW_MANUSCRIPT_REPLACEMENT|对话：The 手稿 is gone 从 your 背包。 I keep a second rubbing because couriers lose bags。 拿上这个 copy 到 Old Theryn Rusk in Havenford。
DIALOGUE_KINGS_BARROW_MANUSCRIPT_REMINDER|对话：拿上 Edran's 手稿 到 Old Theryn Rusk in Havenford's south house。 Do not try King's Barrow phrase until Theryn has read copy。
DIALOGUE_KINGS_BARROW_TOO_GREEN|No commission from me today. The work I need is hard road work, not a first Highmark errand.
DIALOGUE_KINGS_BARROW_START|对话：I am Edran Vale。 Every 神龛 clerk in Highmark wants 到 test this phrase at tomb door， so I need a courier 带着 sense。\nI copied words 从 King's Barrow， south of Highmark。 The hand is old March script， 和 Old Theryn Rusk in Havenford knew that script before I was born。\nTake this 手稿 到 Theryn's south house 和 have him read phrase。 If he confirms it， bring answer back 到 me in Highmark。 I need account； if Kingsmark is truly inside， I am not asking for 戒指。
DIALOGUE_RETH_REEDMIRE_DONE|对话：Vethrin has his 报告。 Reedmire 神龛 is quiet again。 Good。 我会 keep 到 my nets。 Let Vethrin study 石头。
DIALOGUE_RETH_NHALOR_SLAIN|对话：Nhalor is dead？ Good。 拿上 news 到 Vethrin in Havenford。 I am done 带着 Reedmire 和 his questions。
DIALOGUE_RETH_REEDMIRE_REMINDER|神龛的事还没完。每堆石上放一块光滑石头；如果 Nhalor 起身，就在离开前杀了它。
DIALOGUE_RETH_NOTE_HANDIN|Vethrin的信。石头归你了。每堆放一颗。
DIALOGUE_RETH_NO_QUEST_IDLE|对话：Vethrin wants Reedmire numbers？ He can send his 封印 first。 Until then， 我有 nets 到 mend。
DIALOGUE_THAULD_CORPSE_REPORT|蓄水池里有个死渔夫？真是糟蹋。他现在用不上这个了。拿去吧，用得比黑暗更好些。
DIALOGUE_THAULD_ARRIVAL_HANDOFF|这场风暴够狠。你们都活着过来就好。不过这条船一时半会儿哪也去不了。Garran跟我说了你的事，前头可不太平。听着，走内陆路往东去Havenford。别离开大路，那样安全些。要是需要休息或者买补给，出发前先办好。
DIALOGUE_THAULD_DOCK_REMINDER|我没别的能帮你了，孩子。去Havenford。
DIALOGUE_RAT_CELLAR_DONE|对话：The cellar is quiet。 Grain sacks are staying shut。 If you 打开 that hatch again， bring your own boots。
DIALOGUE_RAT_CELLAR_TURNIN|大的死了？好。这样巢就散了。趁我还没把钱花在新谷子上，拿走报酬。
DIALOGUE_RAT_CELLAR_REMINDER|对话：Back 房间 hatch， straight down。 杀死 big cellar 老鼠 和 clear 老鼠 off grain sacks， then come back 到 me。
DIALOGUE_RAT_CELLAR_START|地窖被老鼠占了，下面有一只大家伙，让其余的也胆大起来。杀掉那只大的，我就付钱。
DIALOGUE_MIRA_DOCKSIDE_STOCK|对话：Need 道路 kit？ Bread， lamp 油， first aid， cheap knives， 和 cudgels。 Dock prices， no long haggling。
DIALOGUE_MARN_BUNK_AVAILABLE|对话：Come in if you need a dry bunk。 Stew is hot， blankets are clean enough， 和 Havenford 道路 is still rough after storm。
DIALOGUE_MARN_HALF_ORC|对话：Stable cot is 打开。 Same price， paid now。 Keep quiet 和 我会 keep 房间 clear。
DIALOGUE_VOSK_ROUTE_CLOSED|我正忙着呢，除非你想帮我拉那根绳子。
DIALOGUE_VOSK_WAITING_MARK|Tidehook的Veysha船长说她会找条安全航道。我可不抱太大希望。
DIALOGUE_VOSK_TIDEHOOK_ROUTE_OPEN|去Tidehook的路看着又通了。你要是想去，我能让你上下一艘小艇。
DIALOGUE_VEYSHA_SKIFF_READY|对话：Hold there， traveler。 No 小艇 叶片 Tidehook until I check knots 和 tide marks。
DIALOGUE_VEYSHA_CHANNEL_WARNING|对话：Bound for Reedwater？ Quade takes fare by 小艇。 Pay him， sit still， 和 do not crowd rail。
DIALOGUE_QUADE_REEDWATER_ROUTE_OPEN|Reedwater？一百金币。在这儿付钱，上小艇，然后祈祷别沉到海底去。
DIALOGUE_KETHRA_RACK_OPEN|对话：Looking for reach？ Spears on rack， halberds in corner， nets by coil。 Try weight before you 报酬。
DIALOGUE_NESKA_TAVERN_FOOD|对话：Come in， if you can 找到 a dry stool。 Beer by mug， 口粮 by bundle， 营地 kits under counter。 What will it be？
DIALOGUE_BRAN_DELIVERY_DONE|对话：Orrick sent word。 The parcel reached Traveller's Rest， 和 he paid you？ Good。 I owe you a beer once I get these nets tied。
DIALOGUE_BRAN_PARCEL_REMINDER|这个包裹是给Traveller's Rest的Orrick的。走内陆路，别弄湿。
DIALOGUE_BRAN_PARCEL_REPLACEMENT|对话：Lost it？ Gods。 Hold still， 我可以 tie another。 拿上这个 parcel 到 Orrick Fen at Traveller's Rest。
DIALOGUE_BRAN_BEER_REMINDER|我这儿还是干得很。酒馆近得我都能闻到桶味。
DIALOGUE_BRAN_BEER_START|我的杯子空了，两只手又全在补破网。给我带一杯啤酒来，我会好好记住你的脸。
DIALOGUE_BRAN_BEER_HANDIN_PARCEL|这就对了。现在办个更好的差事：把包裹送到Traveller's Rest的Orrick。走内陆路，能保持干燥就尽量别弄湿。
DIALOGUE_NELL_ROOM_AVAILABLE|对话：Come in， dear。 Kettle is on， two rooms are taken， 和 I still have clean blankets in back 房间。 Need a 床 或 just supper？
DIALOGUE_LYSS_ROOM_AVAILABLE|Private rooms by night. Pay up front and rest quiet.
DIALOGUE_STONECLEFT_INNKEEPER_BED_AVAILABLE|对话：In 带着 you， then。 Beds are made， bread is hot， 和 ale is strong enough for miners coming off shift。 Need a 床 under Stonecleft roof？
DIALOGUE_NELL_HALF_ORC|对话：For you， 我有 back cot by kitchen door。 Same 钱， paid now。 Keep quiet there， 和 我会 keep taproom off your back。
DIALOGUE_LYSS_HALF_ORC|Room for coin. Pay the house and keep quiet.
DIALOGUE_STONECLEFT_INNKEEPER_HALF_ORC|对话：Coin first， half-兽人。 The outer 房间 is 打开， bread is hot， 和 no one touches a paid 房间 under my roof。 Need it？
DIALOGUE_STONECLEFT_GATEHALL_LAMP_DONE|对话：Sellan's load is packed 和 gone upstairs。 Good。 Gatehall shelves have 食物 和 油 again； say what you need。
DIALOGUE_STONECLEFT_GATEHALL_SHOP|对话：Gatehall supplies： 油， rope， 食物， bandages， 和 repair tackle。 Buy before you leave Stonecleft's doors。
DIALOGUE_STONECLEFT_SUPPLY_LAMP_DONE|对话：Harl sent his mark。 The gatehall has 食物 和 油， 和 my count is clean again。
DIALOGUE_STONECLEFT_SUPPLY_SHOP|对话：Lamp 油， rope， bandages， dry 食物， 和 spare tackle。 Count your 背包 before lower stairs。
DIALOGUE_BRANNA_BED_AVAILABLE|对话：Come in 和 close door。 Rooms are clean， cups are mostly clean， 和 我有 keys if your 钱 is good。 Need a 床？
DIALOGUE_BRANNA_HALF_ORC|对话：Back 房间 is 打开。 Coin first。 Keep your 背包 by wall 和 我会 keep regulars out of your face。
DIALOGUE_ORRICK_PARCEL_TURNIN|Bran的包裹，总算到了。好。我能在墨水干两遍前把这笔账结掉。
DIALOGUE_ORRICK_OLD_CAVE_DONE|对话：Your Old 洞穴 报告 is already useful。 我有 rope 和 油 by door now， 和 travelers 询问 questions before taking east 道路。
DIALOGUE_ORRICK_MIXED_GOODS|油、食物、皮带、便宜钢器。给忘了重要东西的旅人准备的杂货。
DIALOGUE_ORRICK_OLD_CAVE_TURNIN|你到过下层厅堂了？那旧洞穴就算查清了，我的担心也有了底。这里是报酬。
DIALOGUE_ORRICK_OLD_CAVE_REMINDER|对话：Old 洞穴 is east of Traveller's Rest。 I need a 报告 从 bottom floor， not first 房间。 带给我 what you saw 和 come back in one piece。
DIALOGUE_ORRICK_TOO_GREEN|Not that errand today. Buy food, oil, and rope if you need them; smaller work is wiser for now.
DIALOGUE_ORRICK_OLD_CAVE_START|附近的旧洞穴吞进了不少传闻，却什么也没吐回来。到下层厅堂去，看看那里等着什么，我会为答案付钱。
DIALOGUE_CALDUS_DOCKS_DONE|Krosh is dead, and the northeast peninsula is quieter for it. Traveller's Rest can send armed riders that way again. If you go back, watch the basements.
DIALOGUE_CALDUS_DOCKS_DONE_HALF_ORC|Krosh is dead. Good work, whatever the yard says. Armed riders can use the northeast peninsula again. Watch the basements if you go back.
DIALOGUE_CALDUS_DOCKS_TURNIN|对话：Krosh is dead？ Then Desolate 码头 have one less 兽人 giving orders。 Stand easy。 You did work I could not finish。
DIALOGUE_CALDUS_DOCKS_TURNIN_HALF_ORC|对话：Krosh is dead by your hand？ Then you did work。 Stand easy。 我会 say it plainly if anyone asks。
DIALOGUE_CALDUS_DOCKS_PAY|码头清干净了。拿报酬吧；挣来的钱比空许诺更干净。
DIALOGUE_CALDUS_DOCKS_PAY_HALF_ORC|码头清干净了。拿你的报酬。你挣来的，不管屋里的人愿不愿意承认。
DIALOGUE_CALDUS_DOCKS_REMINDER|Desolate Docks, on the peninsula northeast of Traveller's Rest. Find Krosh in the occupied basements and kill him. Do not come back with salvage stories.
DIALOGUE_CALDUS_DOCKS_REMINDER_HALF_ORC|Find Krosh in the Desolate Docks basements, on the peninsula northeast of Traveller's Rest, and kill him. That is the work.
DIALOGUE_CALDUS_DOCKS_TOO_GREEN|Not yet. The docks are bad ground today. Take smaller work first.
DIALOGUE_CALDUS_DOCKS_TOO_GREEN_HALF_ORC|Not yet. Same answer I would give anyone: the docks are bad ground today.
DIALOGUE_CALDUS_DOCKS_START|兽人占着Desolate Docks，Krosh让他们更加猖狂。清掉那片地，杀掉他们的首领，报酬就是你的。
DIALOGUE_CALDUS_DOCKS_START_HALF_ORC|兽人占着Desolate Docks。我不会问是哪一边的血教会你战争。杀掉Krosh，把他们清走，我会付钱。
DIALOGUE_VELRA_ASH_DONE|对话：The Ashen 戒指 is yours。 Do not let every hedge mage handle it； Rhazvek's scale did hard work， 和 I did expensive work。
DIALOGUE_VELRA_ARCANE_CASE|对话：Scrolls， wands， mana draughts， charms， 和 rings。 Look 带着 your eyes first； case stays latched until I 打开 it。
DIALOGUE_VELRA_ASH_TURNIN|对话：There it is， Rhazvek's scale。 Warm， whole， 和 mine for moment。 Set it on cloth； 我可以 finish Ashen 戒指。
DIALOGUE_VELRA_ASH_REMINDER|Ash Tower lies east-southeast of Traveller's Rest. Rhazvek, one drake scale. You have the fire potions and cold wand; bring me the scale.
DIALOGUE_VELRA_ASH_TOO_GREEN|Not that commission. Not yet. Buy a small scroll and keep to smaller trouble for now.
DIALOGUE_VELRA_ASH_START|年轻的红色龙兽Rhazvek把Ash Tower当成栖处。给我带他的一片鳞，我就用Ashen Ring交换。
DIALOGUE_DORRAN_CORE_HANDIN|那就是核心。以所有好锤子作证，我还以为灰矮人出于恶意把它埋了。符文炉能修好，但需要时间和热度。
DIALOGUE_DORRAN_DUERGAR_DONE_REWARD|对话：Here is your 钱 和 a marked piece 从 rack。 If 灰矮人 come north again， Stonecleft will be ready。
DIALOGUE_DORRAN_OLD_MINEWORKS_START|Vargrom仍然控制着Old Mineworks。符文炉喉头还贴着灰矮人守卫的呼吸，这算不上胜利。了结他。
DIALOGUE_DORRAN_VARGROM_TURNIN|对话：Vargrom is dead？ Good。 That 叶片 his relay without a foreman。
DIALOGUE_DORRAN_REPAIRED_STOCK|对话：Runeforge is holding steady。 Marked stock is back on counter。
DIALOGUE_DORRAN_REPAIRED_VARGROM_REMINDER|The runeforge is lit, but Vargrom still holds the works.
DIALOGUE_DORRAN_REPAIR_WAITING|对话：The core is set。 The heat is not steady yet， 和 I do not sell marked steel on a weak burn。
DIALOGUE_DORRAN_CORE_LOCATION_FOUND|死掉的灰矮人带着核心。趁被洪水浸染的东西把它拖得更深之前，把它带上来。
DIALOGUE_DORRAN_VALVE_REMINDER|在Floodgate Cistern使用刻符手柄。它会打开下层水闸；核心应该就在后面。
DIALOGUE_DORRAN_RUNEFORGE_START|Stonecleft has another problem. The Runeforge Core is missing, and Floodgate Cistern is the best lead. Take this runed valve handle, open the lower sluice, and bring the core back.
DIALOGUE_DORRAN_ARMORY_CLOSED|对话：Magic armory is shut。 The runeforge is cold。 我可以 mend plain 装备， but marked steel stays off counter。
DIALOGUE_STONECLEFT_SURFACE_GUARD_STAIR_OPENED|Door is open. Follow the chalked stairs down to the Commons; the side doors are work rooms.
DIALOGUE_STONECLEFT_SURFACE_GUARD_STAIR_ALREADY_OPEN|Stair door is open. Down to the Commons; leave the work-room doors alone.
DIALOGUE_STONECLEFT_SURFACE_GUARD_STAIR_UNAUTHORIZED|Need the stair door? Say so. I do not leave iron unlatched for curious merchants.
DIALOGUE_STONECLEFT_SURFACE_GUARD_TURN_BACK|State your business at the gatehall. If you have none, stay on the surface level.
DIALOGUE_STONECLEFT_DEEP_GUARD_DWARF_UNAUTHORIZED|Lower gate is sealed. Clan blood does not move it; Thrunna does.
DIALOGUE_STONECLEFT_DEEP_GUARD_DWARF_WAIT_WARDENS|对话：拿上 it 到 his forge in commons。 Until then， buy， sleep， 或 stand clear of my chain。
DIALOGUE_STONECLEFT_DEEP_GUARD_OUTSIDER_UNAUTHORIZED|Lower gate is sealed. Stonecleft has not opened the pass to guests.
DIALOGUE_STONECLEFT_DEEP_GUARD_OUTSIDER_WAIT_WARDENS|对话：拿上 your Highmark business 到 his forge in commons。 Until then， buy， sleep， 或 stand clear of my chain。
DIALOGUE_STONECLEFT_DEEP_GUARD_DWARF_GATE_OPENED|North gate is opening, cousin. Keep north through the Underway and keep your lamp trimmed.
DIALOGUE_STONECLEFT_DEEP_GUARD_OUTSIDER_GATE_OPENED|North gate is opening, traveler. Keep north through the Underway and stay out of the work cuts.
DIALOGUE_STONECLEFT_DEEP_GUARD_GATE_ALREADY_OPEN|Lower gate is clear. The Underway runs north.
DIALOGUE_STONECLEFT_DEEP_GUARD_POST_OPEN|对话：This post is not for gawking。 State your business at 大门 或 keep walking。
DIALOGUE_NAERYS_GUEST_MAT_AVAILABLE|Guest mats wait. Pay the warden and rest within the veil.
DIALOGUE_NAERYS_HALF_ORC|Bed for coin. Pay and rest. The veil keeps its own.
DIALOGUE_SARN_MARKET_STALL|Road kit, dry straps, cart cloth, and no temple prices. Tell me what broke before you ask what is cheap.
DIALOGUE_BRETHRA_PROVISION_STALL|Oil is sealed, rope is measured, kits are packed for travel. Buy what you can carry and do not unstack my coils.
DIALOGUE_MAVETH_APOTHECARY_OLDROOT_DONE|对话：The oldroot batch held。 Stronger healing 和 resistance bottles are on shelf。 Point before you unstopper anything green。
DIALOGUE_MAVETH_APOTHECARY_OLDROOT_TURNIN|Six leaves, whole and dark. Good. The bitter edge is still there.\nTake this pay and this restoration potion. Once I grind the rest, stronger bottles go on the shelf.
DIALOGUE_MAVETH_APOTHECARY_OLDROOT_REMINDER|对话：Oldroot Temple。 Six usable 叶片。 Cut dark 叶片 从 living oldroot； loose floor growth is trash。
DIALOGUE_MAVETH_APOTHECARY_OLDROOT_START|Careful. Those bottles are sealed tight. Highmark caravans bought through my strong stock, and my Oldroot gatherer came back fevered.\nI need six whole oldroot leaves from Oldroot Temple. Cut dark leaves from living oldroot, not floor growth. Bring them back and I will pay coin and a restoration potion.
DIALOGUE_MAVETH_APOTHECARY_CASE|对话：Sealed draughts， dated salves， clean corks。 The glowing bottles stay behind counter。 Say what hurts 或 browse like you mean 到 buy。
DIALOGUE_JAETH_BOWYER_RACK|对话：Need arrows？ Straight shafts on left， bolts by case， bowstrings waxed this morning。 Crossbow cranks are under counter； 询问 before you put a hand on one。
DIALOGUE_NERRIK_DRAUGHT_DONE|The perfect draught is finished. If you have blackglass fragments, the worktable can make more elixirs. Do not touch the brown bottle.
DIALOGUE_NERRIK_TABLE_WARNING|对话：Stop there。 Left tray is tincture， right tray is 酸液 wash， 和 brown bottle is mine。 询问 before your sleeve touches anything。
DIALOGUE_NERRIK_DRAUGHT_START|You. Good, careful hands. I am working toward a perfect draught, but I need preserved monster samples first.\nTake these jars of preservation ointment. Use one on a fresh corpse, or throw one at the creature before you kill it.\nBring me the samples and I can make them into elixirs. With these samples I can slowly perfect the recipe.
DIALOGUE_NERRIK_DRAUGHT_SAMPLE|A preserved {0} corpse. Good. Still tight, still useful. I can cut a clean sample from this.
DIALOGUE_NERRIK_DRAUGHT_BATCH|This sample settles the {0} mixture. Take the elixir; I only need a shaving for the next draft.
DIALOGUE_NERRIK_DRAUGHT_FINAL|Good. The perfect draught holds together. Drink it here while the blackglass is still quiet.
DIALOGUE_NERRIK_DRAUGHT_NEED_OINTMENT|You need preservation ointment before hunting the next sample. Maveth sometimes sells jars, and curio shelves may have them.
DIALOGUE_NERRIK_DRAUGHT_USE_OINTMENT|Use the ointment before rot starts. Rub it into the fresh corpse I named, or throw the jar at that creature before the kill.
DIALOGUE_NERRIK_DRAUGHT_TARGET|Next sample: preserve a {0} corpse and bring it back to me.
DIALOGUE_NERRIK_DRAUGHT_FINAL_TARGET|For the last draught, bring me a preserved adult dragon corpse and one blackglass shard. Young dragons will not do.
DIALOGUE_NERRIK_DRAUGHT_FINAL_SAMPLE|An adult dragon sample and a blackglass shard. Good. That is enough body and enough bite for the final mix.
DIALOGUE_NERRIK_DRAUGHT_FINAL_NEED_SHARD|The dragon sample is usable. Now bring one blackglass shard; the final draught needs something hard enough to hold the change.
DIALOGUE_NERRIK_DRAUGHT_FINAL_NEED_SAMPLE|The last sample must come from an adult dragon or older. Preserve the corpse and bring it here with one blackglass shard.
DIALOGUE_AELRION_THREAD_DONE|对话：The moonwell strings are holding。 The upgraded rack is stocked。 Keep finished bows dry， 或 buy another string。
DIALOGUE_AELRION_THREAD_TURNIN|六股线，没有一股磨散。很好。这些能撑住一张战弓。\n拿上这笔钱和这张弓。剩下的我会拧进升级货架。
DIALOGUE_AELRION_THREAD_REMINDER|对话：Moonwell Observatory still has what I need。 带回 six strands 从 cult dead， specter rooms， 或 caught 线 near old frame。
DIALOGUE_AELRION_THREAD_START|在看好货架？那我告诉你为什么它还不够好。我最好的弓弦只是普通肠线，而西路正在打开。\nMoonwell 线在潮湿、寒冷和粗暴使用下也能撑住弓。从 Moonwell Observatory 带六股回来；死掉的教徒、幽影房间和旧框架旁缠住的线里都能找到。我付钱，还给你做一张弓。
DIALOGUE_AELRION_BOWYER_RACK|对话：Dry yew， waxed strings， counted arrowheads。 Keep wet gloves off finished bows。
DIALOGUE_LANCER_ORDERS_DONE|Vaust heard the message? Good. Kestrel can post scouts with current routes instead of last week's guesswork.
DIALOGUE_LANCER_ORDERS_REMINDER|Captain Vaust Thane at Camp Kestrel needs the Highmark message. Put it in his hand, not on a camp table.
DIALOGUE_LANCER_HARPIES_TURNIN|Twelve harpies confirmed. Good work. North road scouts can look at tracks again instead of the sky. I have your pay; next board is ogres.
DIALOGUE_LANCER_OGRES_TURNIN|Eight ogres confirmed. Hill road carts can move without a double guard. I have your pay; next board is hill giants.
DIALOGUE_LANCER_GIANTS_TURNIN|确认两个 hill giant 已死。Highmark 可以把旗队和补给车重新派回山路。拿你的报酬；军械库还加了一件护甲。
DIALOGUE_LANCER_NORTHERN_REMINDER|Northern ground still needs clearing. Keep the count.
DIALOGUE_LANCER_NORTHERN_START|Greycliff Quarry is west of Highmark, and harpies are dragging scouts off the quarry road and the cliff routes toward Telwynd. Clear the harpies, then report back. I pay in coin.
DIALOGUE_OSKARN_CURIO_CASE|对话：Looking for luck 或 display？ Rings in velvet tray， 道路 tokens in brass case， ward beads by door。 I show one piece at a time； Highmark hands wander。
DIALOGUE_BRANN_GOODS_OPEN|对话：Aye， iron goods。 Nails， hinges， shields， axes， blades， 和 mail。 Pick it up if you mean 到 buy； do not drum on bars。
DIALOGUE_BRANN_LOWER_PASS_CLOSED|对话：Underway 大门 is still shut。 If you are waiting on 道路 below， buy 装备 here。 No stall follows you past 大门。
DIALOGUE_DARRON_LANCE_ARMORY|对话：Lancer mail hangs on upper hooks； traveller pieces are below。 Shields on wall， blades on bench。 Pay first if you want a fitting。
DIALOGUE_YRVETH_WHITE_SEAL_RELIQUARY|对话：Oil vials stay sealed until street； wax is part of ward。 Relic picks are in left drawer， pilgrim charms in blue tray， ward steel wrapped behind me。
DIALOGUE_QUESSA_SCRIPTORIUM|对话：Mind ink， please。 Cheap copies are in lower tray， lecture 叶片 tied in green cord， spellbooks on high shelf。 Tell me what school you read before you touch bindings。
DIALOGUE_THERYN_HIGHWIND_CATACOMBS_FOUND|对话：You found Highwind Catacombs before I finished map。 Good。 The answer was under 修道院 after all。
DIALOGUE_THERYN_HIGHWIND_CATACOMBS_LEAD|对话：Highwind Monastery is only upper site。 The old burial halls sit under it。\nSearch 修道院 for catacomb entrance 和 step inside。 Then 返回 Telwynd 带着 proof lower way is real。
DIALOGUE_THERYN_BARROW_PHRASE|对话：Give me page。 Hm。 Old March hand， royal names， 和 a burial line about Halric's 道路。\nKing Halric 和 Kingsmark share line。 At King's Barrow， say： Halric holds 道路。
DIALOGUE_THERYN_BARROW_PHRASE_REMINDER|对话：你已有 phrase。 At King's Barrow， say： Halric holds 道路。
DIALOGUE_THERYN_OPENING_WORDS_LEARNED|对话：Yes， I know this hand。 The missing part is spoken words， not another 碎片。\nTake 光玻璃 star back 到 final blood 封印。 Speak old line there， then touch 石头。
DIALOGUE_THERYN_OPENING_WORDS_REMINDER|对话：光玻璃 star， final blood 封印， spoken words， hand on 石头。 Do it in that order。
DIALOGUE_THROKK_BLACKGLASS_FORGE_COLD|你的血也许是缺的诀窍，但冷掉的符文炉什么都做不了。要我唤醒blackglass之前，先把炉子点起来。
DIALOGUE_THROKK_BLACKGLASS_FORGE_WITH_SHARD|那块碎片回响得真。血、热、锤子，别抱怨。blackglass熔炉开了。
DIALOGUE_THROKK_STONEWARD_OPEN|Stoneward Gate开了。我的破门器完成了它的活。
DIALOGUE_THROKK_UNDERWAY_TURNIN|By the forge, you made it back alive. With The Underway open, Stonecleft can breathe and Highmark is no longer a story on the far side of stone. If you mean to go there, go now.
DIALOGUE_THROKK_BLACKGLASS_FORGE_NO_SHARD|对话：The White Seal named your blood for old work。 带回 true 碎片 when you have them。 One 碎片 makes one martial fitting。
DIALOGUE_THROKK_UNDERWAY_CLEAR|The Underway is clear at last. Took a stranger to shame the old gate open, but open is open.
DIALOGUE_THROKK_UNDERWAY_REMINDER|The drake is still holding North Gate. Kill it, and you can get through to Highmark.
DIALOGUE_THROKK_UNDERWAY_START|Highmark, is it? Then you need The Underway. North Gate is blocked by a drake; while it breathes, nothing gets through.
DIALOGUE_THROKK_UNDERWAY_START_OBJECTIVE|No one here is eager to feed it another helm. I will have the gate warden let you through. Kill the drake at North Gate, then you can get through to Highmark. Once you are out, keep north to the city.
QUEST_LOG_TUTORIAL_NOTE_OBJECTIVE|把 Harren 的信交给 Brindle Quay 的码头长 Garran。
QUEST_LOG_TUTORIAL_NOTE_DETAIL|Harren给了我一封信，要交给港口的Dockmaster Garran。
QUEST_LOG_TUTORIAL_CLASS_ACTION_OBJECTIVE|在训练假人上使用一次职业动作。
QUEST_LOG_TUTORIAL_CLASS_ACTION_DETAIL|离开 Brindle Quay 前，守卫 Breck 想看我使用一次职业动作。\n用 {class_actions} 打开职业动作，然后在训练假人上用一次。
QUEST_LOG_TUTORIAL_FIRST_AID_OBJECTIVE|使用急救包处理你的伤口。
QUEST_LOG_TUTORIAL_FIRST_AID_DETAIL|用野战绷带包扎战斗中留下的伤口。
QUEST_LOG_TUTORIAL_SLEEP_OBJECTIVE|在 Orrin 的空房间里睡一觉。
QUEST_LOG_TUTORIAL_SLEEP_DETAIL|码头长说，船离港前要先在Orrin的旅店休息。
QUEST_LOG_TUTORIAL_CAMP_OBJECTIVE|在城镇外使用露营包休息。
QUEST_LOG_TUTORIAL_CAMP_DETAIL|在旅店休息后，奥林给了我一套露营工具。路上需要休息时使用它。
QUEST_LOG_TUTORIAL_FEED_OBJECTIVE|从物品栏中吃食物来充饥。
QUEST_LOG_TUTORIAL_FEED_DETAIL|饥饿开始影响身体。吃口粮或酒馆食物来恢复。
QUEST_LOG_THANK_HARL_TITLE|Thank 队长 Thauld
QUEST_LOG_THANK_HARL_OBJECTIVE|在前往内陆前，到 Reedwater 码头向 Thauld 队长道谢。
QUEST_LOG_THANK_HARL_DETAIL|Captain Thauld驾船穿过风暴。到Reedwater Docks向他道谢。
QUEST_LOG_HEAD_TO_HAVENFORD_OBJECTIVE|沿北路抵达 Havenford。
QUEST_LOG_HEAD_TO_HAVENFORD_DETAIL|Captain Thauld说，从Reedwater往北的路通向Havenford。
QUEST_LOG_CAVE_CHIEF_RETURN_OBJECTIVE|向Aldren报告洞穴首领已死。
QUEST_LOG_CAVE_CHIEF_RETURN_DETAIL|洞穴首领已在山脊洞穴倒下。Havenford的Aldren应该知道这件事。
QUEST_LOG_CAVE_CHIEF_OBJECTIVE|杀死 Goblin 洞穴里的哥布林首领。
QUEST_LOG_CAVE_CHIEF_DETAIL|Aldren says the goblin raids come from the eastern ridge cave and are too organized for ordinary vermin. I should find the chieftain driving them, kill him, and return to Havenford.
QUEST_LOG_ROOT_BREACH_LEAD_OBJECTIVE|Speak with Cael Orven at Traveller's Rest.
QUEST_LOG_ROOT_BREACH_LEAD_DETAIL|Scholar Cael says the prism points north from the Ruined Watchtower to Starfall Burrow. A drake holds the root below; I should search the burrow and learn what woke the prism.
QUEST_LOG_ROOT_BREACH_RETURN_OBJECTIVE|Take the blackglass shard to Scholar Cael.
QUEST_LOG_ROOT_BREACH_RETURN_DETAIL|I have the blackglass shard from Starfall Burrow. Scholar Cael at Traveller's Rest should see it.
QUEST_LOG_ROOT_BREACH_COLLECT_SHARD_OBJECTIVE|Collect the blackglass shard in the Starfall Burrow.
QUEST_LOG_ROOT_BREACH_COLLECT_SHARD_DETAIL|Vrask fell in the Starfall Burrow, and a blackglass shard remains where he died. I should pick it up before returning to Scholar Cael.
QUEST_LOG_ROOT_BREACH_OBJECTIVE|Search Starfall Burrow and return to Cael Orven.
QUEST_LOG_ROOT_BREACH_DETAIL|Scholar Cael says Starfall Burrow lies straight north of the Ruined Watchtower. The prism points there, and a drake holds the root below; I need to slay it and collect whatever truth survives.
QUEST_LOG_UNDERWAY_REACH_STONECLEFT_OBJECTIVE|Reach Stonecleft.
QUEST_LOG_UNDERWAY_REACH_STONECLEFT_DETAIL|South Gate opens into the South Gate Tunnels. I should continue through the tunnels to Stonecleft and ask the dwarves how to reach Highmark.
QUEST_LOG_UNDERWAY_REACH_SOUTH_GATE_OBJECTIVE|Travel northwest from Traveller's Rest to South Gate.
QUEST_LOG_UNDERWAY_REACH_SOUTH_GATE_DETAIL|Scholar Cael says Highmark lies beyond the mountains. The dwarven road begins at South Gate; I should take the northern road from Traveller's Rest to the mountain gate.
QUEST_LOG_UNDERWAY_ASK_THROKK_OBJECTIVE|Clear the drake at North Gate.
QUEST_LOG_UNDERWAY_ASK_THROKK_DETAIL|Stonecleft's north road is blocked, and Throkk says a drake holds North Gate. I should clear the gate before the dwarves can trust The Underway again.
QUEST_LOG_UNDERWAY_RETURN_OBJECTIVE|Continue north to Highmark.
QUEST_LOG_UNDERWAY_RETURN_DETAIL|The drake fell at North Gate, and the road through the mountains is open. I can continue north to Highmark.
QUEST_LOG_UNDERWAY_OBJECTIVE|Clear the drake at North Gate.
QUEST_LOG_UNDERWAY_DETAIL|Throkk says The Underway is the road to Highmark, but a drake blocks North Gate. I should kill it and continue north once the road opens.
QUEST_LOG_WHITE_SEAL_I_OBJECTIVE|穿过已清理的东门，抵达 Highmark。
QUEST_LOG_WHITE_SEAL_I_DETAIL|The Underway is open. I should follow the dwarven road through the mountains and continue to Highmark, where the White Seal can examine the fragment.
QUEST_LOG_BEACON_PRISM_TALK_THAREC_OBJECTIVE|与 Highmark 的 High Canon Tharec Merrow 交谈。
QUEST_LOG_FINAL_DESCENT_II_OBJECTIVE|在 Starfall Core 面对太古巨龙。
QUEST_LOG_FINAL_DESCENT_I_OBJECTIVE|走上最终血印旁开启的楼梯。
QUEST_LOG_BLOOD_OF_THE_ANCIENTS_III_OBJECTIVE|返回 Sundering Depths 中的最终血印。
QUEST_LOG_BLOOD_OF_THE_ANCIENTS_II_OBJECTIVE|向 Old Theryn Rusk 询问最终血印的词句。
QUEST_LOG_BLOOD_OF_THE_ANCIENTS_I_OBJECTIVE|穿过 Stoneward Gate，找到内层封印。
QUEST_LOG_DEPTHS_OF_STARFALL_III_OBJECTIVE|返回 Stonecleft，找 Throkk Flintvein。
QUEST_LOG_DEPTHS_OF_STARFALL_II_OBJECTIVE|进入 Camp Kestrel 下方的裂口，找到下一道门槛。
QUEST_LOG_DEPTHS_OF_STARFALL_I_DETAIL|星已净化。Scar中有通往Camp Kestrel的路。
QUEST_LOG_GLASSROOT_HOLLOW_RETURN_TITLE|Glassroot Hollow
QUEST_LOG_GLASSROOT_HOLLOW_RETURN_OBJECTIVE|返回 Highmark，找 Envoy Eiradha。
QUEST_LOG_GLASSROOT_HOLLOW_RETURN_DETAIL|blackglass drake已在谷地倒下。应告诉Highmark的Eiradha。
QUEST_LOG_GLASSROOT_HOLLOW_TITLE|Glassroot Hollow
QUEST_LOG_GLASSROOT_HOLLOW_OBJECTIVE|找到 Glassroot Hollow，杀死黑玻璃幼龙。
QUEST_LOG_GLASSROOT_HOLLOW_DETAIL|Eiradha says Glassroot Hollow lies east from the crossroads outside Highmark, along the road that bends southeast into the Veiled Wood. A blackglass drake there keeps Telwynd closed to outsiders. I should kill the drake and return to Highmark.
QUEST_LOG_GHOSTWOOD_SMOKE_RETURN_OBJECTIVE|返回 Camp Kestrel，找 Kestrel 斥候。
QUEST_LOG_GHOSTWOOD_SMOKE_RETURN_DETAIL|Veyr已死。ghostwood的烟雾已经散去。应告诉侦察兵。
QUEST_LOG_GHOSTWOOD_SMOKE_ASK_EIRADHA_OBJECTIVE|在 Highmark 向 Envoy Eiradha 询问失踪巡逻队。
QUEST_LOG_GHOSTWOOD_SMOKE_ASK_EIRADHA_DETAIL|Camp Kestrel的侦察兵说，Eiradha也许能追查ghostwood烟雾的线索。
QUEST_LOG_GHOSTWOOD_SMOKE_OBJECTIVE|查明 Ghostwood 中是什么带走了巡逻队。
QUEST_LOG_GHOSTWOOD_SMOKE_DETAIL|Eiradha追出了根源。Veyr占据着Ghostwood的塔。终结烟雾。 Follow the smoke west.
QUEST_LOG_BREAK_ROCKMAW_KEEP_I_RETURN_OBJECTIVE|返回 Camp Kestrel，找 Watch Sergeant。
QUEST_LOG_BREAK_ROCKMAW_KEEP_I_RETURN_DETAIL|Maug和Brond已死。rockmaw keep已被击破。应告诉军士。
QUEST_LOG_BREAK_ROCKMAW_KEEP_I_BROND_OBJECTIVE|在 Rockmaw Keep 杀死食人魔勇士 Brond。
QUEST_LOG_BREAK_ROCKMAW_KEEP_I_BROND_DETAIL|Maug已死。要塞里只剩Brond。结束它。
QUEST_LOG_BREAK_ROCKMAW_KEEP_I_MAUG_OBJECTIVE|在 Rockmaw Keep 杀死双头巨人 Maug。
QUEST_LOG_BREAK_ROCKMAW_KEEP_I_MAUG_DETAIL|Brond已死。只剩Maug。结束它。
QUEST_LOG_BREAK_ROCKMAW_KEEP_I_OBJECTIVE|在 Rockmaw Keep 杀死 Maug 和 Brond。
QUEST_LOG_BREAK_ROCKMAW_KEEP_I_DETAIL|rockmaw keep是个威胁。为Camp Kestrel的Watch Sergeant击溃它的首领。 Rockmaw Keep is near the coastal mountains.
QUEST_LOG_BREAK_ROCKMAW_KEEP_II_OBJECTIVE|返回 Rockmaw Keep，检查 Kestrel 前哨。
QUEST_LOG_BREAK_ROCKMAW_KEEP_II_DETAIL|Maug和Brond已死。Kestrel控制了外院。前哨已开放检查。
QUEST_LOG_MOON_BITTEN_CAVE_OBJECTIVE|在 Inconspicuous 洞穴猎杀狼人王 Varroth。
QUEST_LOG_MOON_BITTEN_CAVE_DETAIL|Varroth占据moon bitten cave。为Camp Kestrel的Watch Sergeant猎杀他。 Search the nearby hills.
QUEST_LOG_MOON_BITTEN_CAVE_RETURN_OBJECTIVE|返回 Kestrel 守卫军士。
QUEST_LOG_MOON_BITTEN_CAVE_RETURN_DETAIL|Varroth已死。隐藏的狼群已经散了。应告诉军士。
QUEST_LOG_CLEAR_MOONWELL_ROAD_RETURN_OBJECTIVE|返回 Telwynd，找 Warden Sairveth Ilyr。
QUEST_LOG_CLEAR_MOONWELL_ROAD_RETURN_DETAIL|The Moonwell Tunnels are clear. Warden Sairveth in Telwynd should know.
QUEST_LOG_CLEAR_MOONWELL_ROAD_OBJECTIVE|Clear the Moonwell Tunnels.
QUEST_LOG_CLEAR_MOONWELL_ROAD_DETAIL|Warden Sairveth says the Moonwell Tunnels are blocked and Telwynd's workers cannot safely pass. I should set the tunnel dials and reach the far exit so the grove can reach the old site again. The Moonwell Tunnels are south of Telwynd.
QUEST_LOG_ELDERWYRM_GROVE_RETURN_OBJECTIVE|返回 Telwynd，找 Warden Sairveth Ilyr。
QUEST_LOG_ELDERWYRM_GROVE_RETURN_DETAIL|elderwyrm已死。grove已被收复。Telwynd的Warden Sairveth应该知道。
QUEST_LOG_ELDERWYRM_GROVE_OBJECTIVE|为 Telwynd 清理 Elderwyrm Grove。
QUEST_LOG_ELDERWYRM_GROVE_DETAIL|Sairveth and Eivyss say Elderwyrm Grove is failing under old ward trouble, and Caerwyn has bent the green magic around himself. I should reclaim the grove before Telwynd sends workers through. Elderwyrm Grove is in the furthest northern mountains.
QUEST_LOG_BURIED_HIGHWIND_REPORT_CATACOMBS_OBJECTIVE|把 Highwind Catacombs 的情况告诉 Warden Sairveth Ilyr。
QUEST_LOG_BURIED_HIGHWIND_REPORT_CATACOMBS_DETAIL|你找到了catacombs。highwind埋在那里。
QUEST_LOG_BURIED_HIGHWIND_FIND_CATACOMBS_OBJECTIVE|在 Highwind Monastery 搜索通往地下墓穴的入口。
QUEST_LOG_BURIED_HIGHWIND_FIND_CATACOMBS_DETAIL|Theryn Rusk says the old Highwind trail points under the monastery. I should search the grounds for the stair into Highwind's catacombs.
QUEST_LOG_BURIED_HIGHWIND_ASK_THERYN_OBJECTIVE|向 Old Theryn Rusk 询问 Highwind。
QUEST_LOG_BURIED_HIGHWIND_ASK_THERYN_DETAIL|你检查了修道院。去问Havenford的Theryn Rusk这意味着什么。
QUEST_LOG_BURIED_HIGHWIND_RETURN_MARKS_OBJECTIVE|返回 Telwynd，找 Warden Sairveth Ilyr。
QUEST_LOG_BURIED_HIGHWIND_RETURN_MARKS_DETAIL|你检查了修道院。Telwynd的Warden Sairveth应该知道。
QUEST_LOG_BURIED_HIGHWIND_OBJECTIVE|Find the buried highwind.
QUEST_LOG_BURIED_HIGHWIND_DETAIL|The buried Highwind is tied to the old monastery and the catacombs beneath it. I should search those places and follow whatever proof survives. Highwind Monastery is in the far east hills.
QUEST_LOG_LOST_PURIFIER_RETURN_OBJECTIVE|返回 Highmark，找 Tovan Mere。
QUEST_LOG_LOST_PURIFIER_RETURN_DETAIL|Antiquary Tovan已从水渠中获救。回Highmark的White Seal Antiquities找Antiquary Tovan。
QUEST_LOG_LOST_PURIFIER_OBJECTIVE|在 Highmark Aqueduct 找到 Tovan Mere。
QUEST_LOG_LOST_PURIFIER_DETAIL|Antiquary Tovan vanished in the aqueduct while tracing the lost purifier. I should search the waterworks and bring him back if he is still alive. The aqueduct is in the mountains north of Highmark.
QUEST_LOG_PILGRIMAGE_FIRST_DETAIL|White Seal Priest给了一个素净护符。在Havenford、Roadside Shrine和Reedmire的祭坛上作标记，直到它变暖。
QUEST_LOG_PILGRIMAGE_RETURN_BLESS_OBJECTIVE|返回 Highmark，找 White Seal Priest。
QUEST_LOG_PILGRIMAGE_RETURN_BLESS_DETAIL|素净护符已有三处标记。把它交回Highmark的White Seal Priest。
QUEST_LOG_PILGRIMAGE_OLDROOT_OBJECTIVE|在 Oldroot Temple 的祭坛使用沉睡的 White Seal 护符。
QUEST_LOG_PILGRIMAGE_OLDROOT_DETAIL|沉睡的white seal charm需要oldroot altar。根会唤醒它。 Oldroot Temple is in the forest near Highmark.
QUEST_LOG_PILGRIMAGE_RETURN_FINAL_OBJECTIVE|把 White Seal 护符交还给 Highmark 的祭司。
QUEST_LOG_PILGRIMAGE_RETURN_FINAL_DETAIL|护符因oldroot而苏醒。把它交回Highmark的White Seal Priest。
QUEST_LOG_MOONWELL_ALIGNMENT_TELWYND_OBJECTIVE|把错位的 Moonwell 透镜带给 Telwynd 的 Eivyss Glass-Singer 调谐。
QUEST_LOG_MOONWELL_ALIGNMENT_TELWYND_DETAIL|Highmark的Veydras从seal stores给了一枚错位的moonwell lens。Telwynd的Eivyss能调谐它。
QUEST_LOG_MOONWELL_ALIGNMENT_REPLACE_OBJECTIVE|返回 Highmark，找 Canon-Artificer Veydras Vale 领取另一枚 Moonwell 透镜。
QUEST_LOG_MOONWELL_ALIGNMENT_REPLACE_DETAIL|Highmark的Veydras能从seal stores替换丢失的错位moonwell lens。
QUEST_LOG_MOONWELL_ALIGNMENT_INSTALL_OBJECTIVE|在 Moonwell Observatory 安装已调谐的 Moonwell 透镜。
QUEST_LOG_MOONWELL_ALIGNMENT_INSTALL_DETAIL|透镜已调谐。把它安入观测所破裂的Moonwell frame。 Moonwell Observatory is south of Telwynd.
QUEST_LOG_MOONWELL_ALIGNMENT_RECOVER_ATTUNED_OBJECTIVE|找回已调谐的 Moonwell 透镜。
QUEST_LOG_MOONWELL_ALIGNMENT_RECOVER_ATTUNED_DETAIL|调谐后的moonwell lens不见了。Telwynd的Eivyss能修复它。
QUEST_LOG_MOONWELL_ALIGNMENT_RETURN_OBJECTIVE|返回 Highmark，找 Canon-Artificer Veydras Vale。
QUEST_LOG_MOONWELL_ALIGNMENT_RETURN_DETAIL|调谐后的透镜已嵌入Moonwell frame。观测所的光稳定了。回Highmark找Veydras。
QUEST_LOG_BITTER_STOCK_RETURN_OBJECTIVE|返回 Highmark，找 Maveth Vell。
QUEST_LOG_BITTER_STOCK_RETURN_DETAIL|oldroot leaves已经备好。回Highmark找Apothecary Maveth。
QUEST_LOG_BITTER_STOCK_DETAIL|Oldroot Temple产出的叶子能增强药料。带六片给Highmark的Apothecary Maveth。 Oldroot Temple is in the forest near Highmark.
QUEST_LOG_MOONWELL_THREAD_RETURN_OBJECTIVE|返回 Telwynd，找 Aelrion Yewhand。
QUEST_LOG_MOONWELL_THREAD_RETURN_DETAIL|moonwell threads已经备好。回Telwynd找Bowyer Aelrion。
QUEST_LOG_MOONWELL_THREAD_DETAIL|Moonwell Observatory产出的丝线能强化弓架。带六束给Telwynd的Bowyer Aelrion。 Moonwell Observatory is south of Telwynd.
QUEST_LOG_PERFECT_DRAUGHT_OBJECTIVE|Preserve a {0} corpse for Nerrik.
QUEST_LOG_PERFECT_DRAUGHT_RETURN_OBJECTIVE|Bring the preserved corpse to Nerrik.
QUEST_LOG_ORDERS_FOR_KESTREL_OBJECTIVE|Carry the message to the commander at Camp Kestrel.
QUEST_LOG_NORTHERN_WATCH_I_DETAIL|Harpies are hitting Greycliff Quarry west of Highmark and the cliff routes toward Telwynd. Clear enough of them for the Silver Lancer.
QUEST_LOG_NORTHERN_WATCH_I_RETURN_OBJECTIVE|返回 Highmark，找一名 Silver Lancer。
QUEST_LOG_NORTHERN_WATCH_I_RETURN_DETAIL|harpy已杀。北方丘陵因此少了些威胁。回Highmark找Silver Lancer。
QUEST_LOG_NORTHERN_WATCH_II_DETAIL|ogres占据北方地带。给Highmark的Silver Lancer带回八次击杀。
QUEST_LOG_NORTHERN_WATCH_II_RETURN_OBJECTIVE|返回 Highmark，找一名 Silver Lancer。
QUEST_LOG_NORTHERN_WATCH_II_RETURN_DETAIL|ogre已杀。北方地带因此稳了一些。回Highmark找Silver Lancer。
QUEST_LOG_NORTHERN_WATCH_III_DETAIL|hill giants占据北方。给Highmark的Silver Lancer带回两次击杀。
QUEST_LOG_NORTHERN_WATCH_III_RETURN_OBJECTIVE|返回 Highmark，找一名 Silver Lancer。
QUEST_LOG_NORTHERN_WATCH_III_RETURN_DETAIL|giants倒下了。northern watch完成。回Highmark找Silver Lancer。
QUEST_LOG_RAT_CELLAR_RETURN_TITLE|Clear Rat Cellar
QUEST_LOG_RAT_CELLAR_RETURN_OBJECTIVE|返回 Reedwater 码头，找 Bress Dask。
QUEST_LOG_RAT_CELLAR_RETURN_DETAIL|大的已经倒下。巢穴已破。回去找Fisherman Bress。
QUEST_LOG_RAT_CELLAR_TITLE|Clear Rat Cellar
QUEST_LOG_RAT_CELLAR_OBJECTIVE|清理 Reedwater 仓库活板门下方的老鼠。
QUEST_LOG_RAT_CELLAR_DETAIL|Fisherman Bress says rats have taken over the cellar and a bigger one is running the nest. I should clear the cellar before it spreads into the docks.
QUEST_LOG_SMUGGLER_BADGE_RETURN_TITLE|Smuggler's Debt I
QUEST_LOG_SMUGGLER_BADGE_RETURN_OBJECTIVE_PLACE|Return the lead seal to the Smuggler {0}.
QUEST_LOG_SMUGGLER_BADGE_RETURN_DETAIL_PLACE|The lead seal is in hand. I should return it to the Smuggler {0} and collect the first pay before asking about the larger job.
QUEST_LOG_SMUGGLER_BADGE_TITLE|Smuggler's Debt I
QUEST_LOG_SMUGGLER_BADGE_OBJECTIVE|Find the Smuggler's lead seal in Smuggler Grotto.
QUEST_LOG_SMUGGLER_BADGE_DETAIL|The Smuggler said his old crew is using Smuggler Grotto for wet storage. He told me to take the east road toward King's Barrow, turn south to the grotto, and bring back his lead seal whole.
QUEST_LOG_SMUGGLER_DEBT_II_RETURN_TITLE|Smuggler's Debt II
QUEST_LOG_SMUGGLER_DEBT_II_RETURN_OBJECTIVE_PLACE|Return the shut lockbox to the Smuggler {0}.
QUEST_LOG_SMUGGLER_DEBT_II_RETURN_DETAIL_PLACE|The Smuggler's iron lockbox is in hand and still shut. I should return it to the Smuggler {0} for the promised pay.
QUEST_LOG_SMUGGLER_DEBT_II_RECOVER_LOCKBOX_TITLE|Smuggler's Debt II
QUEST_LOG_SMUGGLER_DEBT_II_RECOVER_LOCKBOX_OBJECTIVE|Recover the Smuggler's lockbox from the lower cove.
QUEST_LOG_SMUGGLER_DEBT_II_RECOVER_LOCKBOX_DETAIL|The lower cove is clear enough to search now, but the Smuggler's iron lockbox still needs to be found and returned shut.
QUEST_LOG_SMUGGLER_DEBT_II_TITLE|Smuggler's Debt II
QUEST_LOG_SMUGGLER_DEBT_II_OBJECTIVE|Find the Smuggler's lockbox in Smuggler Grotto's lower cove.
QUEST_LOG_SMUGGLER_DEBT_II_DETAIL|After I returned the seal, the Smuggler said there is an iron lockbox in the lower cove of the same grotto. He wants it brought back shut.
QUEST_LOG_REEDMIRE_DELIVERY_RETURN_TITLE|Investigate Reedmire 神龛
QUEST_LOG_BURNED_COTTAGE_INVESTIGATION_RETURN_TITLE|Investigate the Burned Cottage
QUEST_LOG_BURNED_COTTAGE_INVESTIGATION_RETURN_OBJECTIVE_PLACE|Return to Vethrin {0}.
QUEST_LOG_BURNED_COTTAGE_INVESTIGATION_RETURN_DETAIL_PLACE|The hidden altar below the Burned Cottage is marked with water glyphs and uneven shallow pools. Return to Vethrin {0}.
QUEST_LOG_BURNED_COTTAGE_INVESTIGATION_TITLE|Investigate the Burned Cottage
QUEST_LOG_BURNED_COTTAGE_INVESTIGATION_OBJECTIVE|Search the Burned Cottage for the source of the strange fire.
QUEST_LOG_BURNED_COTTAGE_INVESTIGATION_DETAIL|Vethrin suspects the cottage burned under magical fire, and the wolves around the ruin are not acting normal. I should search the place carefully for a sign of what happened. The cottage is in the small forest just out of town.
QUEST_LOG_REEDMIRE_DELIVERY_RETURN_OBJECTIVE_PLACE|返回 Vethrin Quill {0}。
QUEST_LOG_REEDMIRE_DELIVERY_RETURN_DETAIL_PLACE|Nhalor已倒下。回去找Vethrin {0}。
QUEST_LOG_REEDMIRE_DELIVERY_KILL_NHALOR_TITLE|Investigate Reedmire 神龛
QUEST_LOG_REEDMIRE_DELIVERY_KILL_NHALOR_OBJECTIVE|在 Reedmire Shrine 杀死 Nhalor，然后返回 Vethrin。
QUEST_LOG_REEDMIRE_DELIVERY_KILL_NHALOR_DETAIL|Reth's stones are set at Reedmire Shrine, and Nhalor walks the water there. I should end it and return the news to Vethrin.
QUEST_LOG_REEDMIRE_DELIVERY_PLACE_STONES_TITLE|Investigate Reedmire 神龛
QUEST_LOG_REEDMIRE_DELIVERY_PLACE_STONES_OBJECTIVE|把光滑石头放到 Reedmire Shrine 的四处石堆上。
QUEST_LOG_REEDMIRE_DELIVERY_DELIVER_NOTE_TITLE|Carry Vethrin's Note
QUEST_LOG_REEDMIRE_DELIVERY_DELIVER_NOTE_OBJECTIVE|把 Vethrin 的封缄信交给 Reedwater 码头的 Reth Oskel。
QUEST_LOG_REEDMIRE_DELIVERY_DELIVER_NOTE_DETAIL|Vethrin给了我一封密封信，要交给Reedwater Docks的Reth Oskel。Reth知道Reedmire Shrine发生了什么。我应送信并取得他的指示。
QUEST_LOG_REEDMIRE_DELIVERY_REPLACE_NOTE_TITLE|Carry Vethrin's Note
QUEST_LOG_REEDMIRE_DELIVERY_REPLACE_NOTE_OBJECTIVE_PLACE|返回 Vethrin Quill {0}，领取替换信件。
QUEST_LOG_REEDMIRE_DELIVERY_REPLACE_NOTE_DETAIL|给Reth Oskel的密封信不在我的包里了。如果我在去Reedwater前回去，Vethrin可以再写一封。
QUEST_LOG_STONECLEFT_RUNEFORGE_I_RETURN_CORE_TITLE|Stonecleft Runeforge I
QUEST_LOG_STONECLEFT_RUNEFORGE_I_RETURN_CORE_OBJECTIVE|把 runeforge core 交还给 Stonecleft 的 Dorran Keenedge。
QUEST_LOG_STONECLEFT_RUNEFORGE_I_RETURN_CORE_DETAIL|Runeforge Core在Floodgate Cistern的死duergar身上。Dorran需要它，刻印军械库和blackglass工作才能恢复。
QUEST_LOG_STONECLEFT_RUNEFORGE_I_RECOVER_CORE_TITLE|Stonecleft Runeforge I
QUEST_LOG_STONECLEFT_RUNEFORGE_I_RECOVER_CORE_OBJECTIVE|找回 runeforge core，然后交还给 Dorran Keenedge。
QUEST_LOG_STONECLEFT_RUNEFORGE_I_RECOVER_CORE_DETAIL|我在Floodgate Cistern找到了Runeforge Core，但它已经不在我的包里。core回到Stonecleft前，Dorran无法重启runeforge。
QUEST_LOG_STONECLEFT_RUNEFORGE_I_SEARCH_CORPSE_TITLE|Stonecleft Runeforge I
QUEST_LOG_STONECLEFT_RUNEFORGE_I_SEARCH_CORPSE_OBJECTIVE|从 Floodgate Cistern 里死去的灰矮人附近找回 runeforge core。
QUEST_LOG_STONECLEFT_RUNEFORGE_I_SEARCH_CORPSE_DETAIL|Floodgate Cistern下层阶梯附近有死duergar，周围是粗劣工具和爪痕。如果被偷的Runeforge Core还在那里，应就在尸体旁。
QUEST_LOG_STONECLEFT_RUNEFORGE_I_TITLE|Stonecleft Runeforge I
QUEST_LOG_STONECLEFT_RUNEFORGE_I_OBJECTIVE|使用刻符阀门把手打开 Floodgate Cistern 的下层。
QUEST_LOG_STONECLEFT_RUNEFORGE_I_DETAIL|Armorer Dorran说Stonecleft的Runeforge Core被盗，阀门随后失灵。下层蓄水池是唯一线索；runed valve handle应该能打开封住的下行路。 Floodgate Cistern is just off the southern road.
QUEST_LOG_STONECLEFT_RUNEFORGE_I_REPAIRING_TITLE|Stonecleft Runeforge I
QUEST_LOG_STONECLEFT_RUNEFORGE_I_REPAIRING_OBJECTIVE|等待 Dorran Keenedge 重启 runeforge。
QUEST_LOG_STONECLEFT_RUNEFORGE_II_RETURN_TITLE|Stonecleft Runeforge II
QUEST_LOG_STONECLEFT_RUNEFORGE_II_RETURN_OBJECTIVE|返回 Stonecleft，找 Dorran Keenedge。
QUEST_LOG_STONECLEFT_RUNEFORGE_II_RETURN_DETAIL|Vargrom已死在Old Mineworks。Dorran想在duergar首领回来夺runeforge前除掉他。
QUEST_LOG_STONECLEFT_RUNEFORGE_II_TITLE|Stonecleft Runeforge II
QUEST_LOG_STONECLEFT_RUNEFORGE_II_OBJECTIVE|在 Old Mineworks 杀死灰矮人守卫 Vargrom。
QUEST_LOG_STONECLEFT_RUNEFORGE_II_DETAIL|Floodgate Cistern里的死duergar让Dorran足以认出可能的窃贼。Stonecleft要重新信任runeforge，Old Mineworks的Vargrom必须死。
QUEST_LOG_STONECLEFT_LAMP_RUN_TITLE|Lamp Run
QUEST_LOG_THIRSTY_FISHERMAN_I_TITLE|Beer for Bran
QUEST_LOG_THIRSTY_FISHERMAN_I_OBJECTIVE|把一杯啤酒带给Reedwater Docks的渔夫Bran。
QUEST_LOG_THIRSTY_FISHERMAN_I_DETAIL|渔夫Bran被破网和缺人手困在Reedwater Docks。任何酒馆啤酒都可以；我应在潮水改变前给他带一杯。
QUEST_LOG_THIRSTY_FISHERMAN_II_RETURN_TITLE|Bran's Parcel
QUEST_LOG_THIRSTY_FISHERMAN_II_RETURN_OBJECTIVE|把渔夫 Bran Keel 的包裹送给 Traveller's Rest 的店主 Orrick Fen。
QUEST_LOG_THIRSTY_FISHERMAN_II_RETURN_DETAIL|Bran给了我一个上蜡包裹，要交给Traveller's Rest的Shopkeeper Orrick。他说绳子结实，包裹会保持干燥。我应亲手交给Orrick并收取运费。
QUEST_LOG_THIRSTY_FISHERMAN_II_REPLACE_PARCEL_TITLE|Bran's Parcel
QUEST_LOG_THIRSTY_FISHERMAN_II_REPLACE_PARCEL_OBJECTIVE|回到Reedwater Docks找渔夫Bran，再拿一个包裹。
QUEST_LOG_THIRSTY_FISHERMAN_II_REPLACE_PARCEL_DETAIL|给Orrick的包裹不在我的包里了。如果回Reedwater，Bran可以再包一个。
QUEST_LOG_TRAVELLERS_REST_OLD_CAVE_RETURN_TITLE|Check Old 洞穴
QUEST_LOG_TRAVELLERS_REST_OLD_CAVE_RETURN_OBJECTIVE|返回 Traveller's Rest，找 Orrick Fen。
QUEST_LOG_TRAVELLERS_REST_OLD_CAVE_RETURN_DETAIL|我到达Old Cave底层，看到的已足够告诉Shopkeeper Orrick。他要的是实际细节：落脚处、水，以及下面有什么麻烦。
QUEST_LOG_TRAVELLERS_REST_OLD_CAVE_TITLE|Check Old 洞穴
QUEST_LOG_TRAVELLERS_REST_OLD_CAVE_OBJECTIVE|抵达 Old Cave 的最底层。
QUEST_LOG_TRAVELLERS_REST_OLD_CAVE_DETAIL|Traveller's Rest的Shopkeeper Orrick愿意为能让旅人活下来的第一手洞穴警告付钱。他想要旅店东边Old Cave的新消息。我需要到底层看看并活着回来。
QUEST_LOG_TRAVELLERS_REST_DESOLATE_DOCKS_RETURN_TITLE|Clear Desolate 码头
QUEST_LOG_TRAVELLERS_REST_DESOLATE_DOCKS_RETURN_OBJECTIVE|返回 Traveller's Rest，找 Ser Caldus Renn。
QUEST_LOG_TRAVELLERS_REST_DESOLATE_DOCKS_RETURN_DETAIL|Krosh已死在Desolate Docks。Ser Caldus在Traveller's Rest等着。我应回去领取承诺的报酬。
QUEST_LOG_TRAVELLERS_REST_DESOLATE_DOCKS_TITLE|Clear Desolate 码头
QUEST_LOG_TRAVELLERS_REST_DESOLATE_DOCKS_OBJECTIVE|在 Desolate Docks 杀死兽人战士 Krosh。
QUEST_LOG_TRAVELLERS_REST_DESOLATE_DOCKS_DETAIL|Ser Caldus要Krosh死在Traveller's Rest东北半岛的Desolate Docks。废弃码头聚落的被占地下室里有orc打捞队。我需要找到Krosh，杀了他，然后返回。
QUEST_LOG_TRAVELLERS_REST_ASH_TOWER_RETURN_SCALE_TITLE|Ash 塔 Commission
QUEST_LOG_TRAVELLERS_REST_ASH_TOWER_RETURN_SCALE_OBJECTIVE|带着一片幼龙鳞返回 Traveller's Rest，找 Velra Senn。
QUEST_LOG_TRAVELLERS_REST_ASH_TOWER_RETURN_SCALE_DETAIL|Rhazvek已死，我有Velra做戒指需要的drake scale。她说这片鳞带着完成委托所需的热力。
QUEST_LOG_TRAVELLERS_REST_ASH_TOWER_RECOVER_SCALE_TITLE|Ash 塔 Commission
QUEST_LOG_TRAVELLERS_REST_ASH_TOWER_RECOVER_SCALE_OBJECTIVE|为 Velra Senn 找回一片幼龙鳞。
QUEST_LOG_TRAVELLERS_REST_ASH_TOWER_RECOVER_SCALE_DETAIL|Rhazvek已死，但Velra还需要一片drake scale来完成Ashen Ring。我应搜索Traveller's Rest东南偏东、他倒下的Ash Tower。
QUEST_LOG_TRAVELLERS_REST_ASH_TOWER_TITLE|Ash 塔 Commission
QUEST_LOG_TRAVELLERS_REST_ASH_TOWER_OBJECTIVE|在 Ash Tower 杀死 Rhazvek，并给 Velra 带回一片幼龙鳞。
QUEST_LOG_TRAVELLERS_REST_ASH_TOWER_DETAIL|Peddler Velra给了我两瓶fire resistance potions和一根wand of cone of cold。她需要Traveller's Rest东南偏东Ash Tower中Rhazvek的一片drake scale来完成Ashen Ring。
QUEST_LOG_HAVENFORD_WATCH_I_RETURN_TITLE|Havenford Watch I
QUEST_LOG_HAVENFORD_WATCH_I_RETURN_OBJECTIVE|带着来自狗头人的证据返回 Garrick。
QUEST_LOG_HAVENFORD_WATCH_I_RETURN_DETAIL|我已从kobolds那里拿到Garrick第一项守望工作的足够证据。应回Havenford领取第一笔守望报酬。
QUEST_LOG_HAVENFORD_WATCH_I_TITLE|Havenford Watch I
QUEST_LOG_HAVENFORD_WATCH_I_DETAIL|Garrick要二十张kobold scalps才算完成第一项守望工作。kobolds偷饲料、割带子，还把巡逻队引离道路。
QUEST_LOG_HAVENFORD_WATCH_II_RETURN_TITLE|Havenford Watch II
QUEST_LOG_HAVENFORD_WATCH_II_RETURN_OBJECTIVE|带着墓骨返回 Garrick。
QUEST_LOG_HAVENFORD_WATCH_II_RETURN_DETAIL|我已有Garrick第二项守望工作所需的grave bones。应回Havenford领取下一笔守望报酬。
QUEST_LOG_HAVENFORD_WATCH_II_TITLE|Havenford Watch II
QUEST_LOG_HAVENFORD_WATCH_II_DETAIL|Garrick要从skeletons或zombies那里取二十根grave bones来完成第二项守望工作。死者正在道路附近异常活动。
QUEST_LOG_HAVENFORD_WATCH_III_RETURN_TITLE|Havenford Watch III
QUEST_LOG_HAVENFORD_WATCH_III_RETURN_OBJECTIVE|杀死 Skrit 后返回 Garrick。
QUEST_LOG_HAVENFORD_WATCH_III_RETURN_DETAIL|Kobold Packleader Skrit已死在瞭望塔北面的矿井。Garrick说这是他能从Havenford安排的最后一项守望工作。
QUEST_LOG_HAVENFORD_WATCH_III_TITLE|Havenford Watch III
QUEST_LOG_HAVENFORD_WATCH_III_OBJECTIVE|在瞭望塔北面的矿井杀死狗头人头领 Skrit。
QUEST_LOG_HAVENFORD_WATCH_III_DETAIL|Garrick要Skrit死，作为最后的Havenford守望工作。Skrit在废弃瞭望塔北面的矿井聚集kobolds，并支撑西路袭击。我需要到底层，杀了他，回Havenford。
QUEST_LOG_FIT_FOR_A_KING_I_DELIVER_MANUSCRIPT_TITLE|Fit for a King I
QUEST_LOG_FIT_FOR_A_KING_I_DELIVER_MANUSCRIPT_OBJECTIVE|把 Edran Vale 的手稿带给 Havenford 的 Old Theryn Rusk。
QUEST_LOG_FIT_FOR_A_KING_I_DELIVER_MANUSCRIPT_DETAIL|Pilgrim Edran从King's Barrow封门上抄下一句。他不信自己读准了古March文字。Havenford的Theryn Rusk应该能读。
QUEST_LOG_FIT_FOR_A_KING_I_REPLACE_MANUSCRIPT_TITLE|Fit for a King I
QUEST_LOG_FIT_FOR_A_KING_I_REPLACE_MANUSCRIPT_OBJECTIVE|返回 Highmark，找 Edran Vale 领取另一份手稿副本。
QUEST_LOG_FIT_FOR_A_KING_I_REPLACE_MANUSCRIPT_DETAIL|Edran的barrow manuscript不在我的包里了。他可以用Highmark的笔记再做一份。
QUEST_LOG_FIT_FOR_A_KING_II_RETURN_TITLE|Fit for a King II
QUEST_LOG_FIT_FOR_A_KING_II_RETURN_OBJECTIVE|返回 Highmark，找 Edran Vale。
QUEST_LOG_FIT_FOR_A_KING_II_RETURN_DETAIL|King Halric再次死去，Kingsmark也已离开王室石棺。Pilgrim Edran想要barrow记录，更甚于戒指本身。
QUEST_LOG_FIT_FOR_A_KING_II_CLAIM_RING_TITLE|Fit for a King II
QUEST_LOG_FIT_FOR_A_KING_II_CLAIM_RING_OBJECTIVE|打开 King's Barrow 中的王室石棺。
QUEST_LOG_FIT_FOR_A_KING_II_CLAIM_RING_DETAIL|barrow wight King Halric已经倒下。王室石棺现在应该会回应从Theryn那里学到的话。Kingsmark据说随旧王一同埋葬。
QUEST_LOG_FIT_FOR_A_KING_II_TITLE|Fit for a King II
QUEST_LOG_FIT_FOR_A_KING_II_OBJECTIVE|进入 King's Barrow，击败 King Halric。
QUEST_LOG_FIT_FOR_A_KING_II_DETAIL|Old Theryn读了Pilgrim Edran的手稿，并给了我开门语：Halric holds the road。King's Barrow现在应该会打开，但Edran警告说它不是普通坟墓。 King's Barrow lies far south beyond the mountains.
QUEST_LOG_ORC_BASE_I_TITLE|兽人 Fortress Sketch
QUEST_LOG_ORC_BASE_I_OBJECTIVE|Take the orc fortress sketch to the Stonecleft gate warden.
QUEST_LOG_ORC_BASE_I_DETAIL|Branna at Traveller's Rest handed over a rough sketch left after the Old Cave trouble. The Stonecleft gate warden can judge whether it shows a real orc fortress.
QUEST_LOG_ORC_BASE_RETURN_TITLE|Break 兽人 Fortress
QUEST_LOG_ORC_BASE_RETURN_OBJECTIVE|Return to the Stonecleft gate warden.
QUEST_LOG_ORC_BASE_RETURN_DETAIL|Gorvuk is dead, and the Orc Fortress west of Stonecleft has lost its warboss. The gate warden promised a hammer and coin.
QUEST_LOG_ORC_BASE_TITLE|Break 兽人 Fortress
QUEST_LOG_ORC_BASE_OBJECTIVE|在显露出的 Orc Fortress 杀死战首 Gorvuk。
QUEST_LOG_ORC_BASE_DETAIL|The gate warden took the sketch and revealed the Orc Fortress west of Stonecleft, off the rough track southwest of the main road. Gorvuk commands the warband there. I need to get inside, kill him, and return to the warden.
QUEST_LOG_MISSING_HUSBAND_RESCUED_TITLE|找到 Missing Farmer
QUEST_LOG_MISSING_HUSBAND_RESCUED_OBJECTIVE|到 Havenford 北侧围栏旁与 Thom Wold 交谈。
QUEST_LOG_MISSING_HUSBAND_RESCUED_DETAIL|失踪农夫还活着，正在回家。Maveth在Havenford等着，却不知道该怀抱希望还是哀悼。
QUEST_LOG_MISSING_HUSBAND_SEARCH_SHRINE_TITLE|找到 Missing Farmer
QUEST_LOG_MISSING_HUSBAND_SEARCH_SHRINE_OBJECTIVE|找到Thom，或找到发生了什么的证据。
QUEST_LOG_MISSING_HUSBAND_SEARCH_SHRINE_DETAIL|Maveth的丈夫Thom沿着Havenford外的足迹离开后失踪了。她不知道他最后去了哪里。搜索附近危险的地方，把他带回家，或者带回发生了什么的证据。
QUEST_LOG_MISSING_HUSBAND_SEARCH_GOBLIN_CAVE_TITLE|找到 Missing Farmer
QUEST_LOG_MISSING_HUSBAND_SEARCH_GOBLIN_CAVE_OBJECTIVE|找到Thom，或找到发生了什么的证据。
QUEST_LOG_MISSING_HUSBAND_SEARCH_GOBLIN_CAVE_DETAIL|Maveth的丈夫Thom沿着Havenford外的足迹离开后失踪了。她不知道他最后去了哪里。搜索附近危险的地方，把他带回家，或者带回发生了什么的证据。
QUEST_LOG_PLACE_AT_TRAVELLERS_REST|在 Traveller's Rest
QUEST_LOG_PLACE_IN_HAVENFORD|在 Havenford
DIALOGUE_VEYDRAS_TOVAN_DONE|对话：Tovan is back at White Seal Antiquities。 Limping， sorting charms， arguing prices。 Good。 That is healthy enough for Tovan。
DIALOGUE_VEYDRAS_TOVAN_RESCUED|Tovan已经从水道回来。在他决定感激也需要收据之前，去向他领取报酬。
DIALOGUE_VEYDRAS_TOVAN_REMINDER|对话：Highmark Aqueduct， northwest of city。 找到 Tovan Mere 或 proof of his death。 Watch lower 水； leeches， slime， 和 水 weirds are common there。
DIALOGUE_VEYDRAS_TOVAN_START|古物商Tovan进入Highmark Aqueduct追查一道净化印，之后没有回来。他谨慎，但不是不死。找到他。
DIALOGUE_VEYDRAS_LIGHTGLASS_LOCKED|对话：That basin stays covered。 Tharec has not opened 光玻璃 work 到 you。 带回 碎片 proof 或 护符 到 High Canon first。
DIALOGUE_VEYDRAS_LIGHTGLASS_OPEN|Lightglass工作台已开放。带来纯净的blackglass碎片，选择你要的工序；White Seal写下数字的地方，不要擅自发挥。
DIALOGUE_VEYDRAS_MOONWELL_START|对话：Moonwell Observatory is drifting again。 My readings 和 old frame disagree by same count every time。 The 透镜 is wrong。\nTake this misaligned 透镜 到 Eivyss Glass-Singer in Telwynd。 He can tune it； then seat it in Moonwell Observatory frame 和 报告 back 到 me。
DIALOGUE_VEYDRAS_MOONWELL_TO_TELWYND|Take the lens to Eivyss Glass-Singer in Telwynd. Highmark can cut glass; Telwynd knows how to tune it.
DIALOGUE_VEYDRAS_MOONWELL_TO_OBSERVATORY|对话：Eivyss tuned 透镜。 Seat it in Moonwell Observatory frame， then come back 带着 reading。
DIALOGUE_VEYDRAS_MOONWELL_COMPLETE|Well done. The observatory frame is steady, and Telwynd's tuning agrees with my numbers.\nTake this purse and this Lightglass fragment. That saves me a climb and an argument at Telwynd's gate.
DIALOGUE_TOVAN_AQUEDUCT_RESCUE|你为了一个老古物商下到这么深？好。我的腿已经不想再和石头争了；趁水道改变主意前，帮我回Highmark。
DIALOGUE_TOVAN_AQUEDUCT_UNAVAILABLE|对话：My case stays locked until I am back behind it。 If Veydras wants old Seal stock， he can send someone below Highmark Aqueduct。
DIALOGUE_TOVAN_REWARD|你把我救了出来，而且我的骨头大多还在该在的位置。这是承诺的报酬，White Seal Antiquities也向你开放。
DIALOGUE_TOVAN_SHOP_IDLE|对话：Case is 打开。 Clean bottles， old Seal pieces， field 装备。 Your discount still stands。
DIALOGUE_ORYN_VAULT_SEALED|The White Vault is sealed again, and this time it feels like a seal rather than a prayer.
DIALOGUE_ORYN_VAULT_RITE_DONE|The star is Lightglass, but something still stirs below. I will not call the vault safe while it breathes.
DIALOGUE_ORYN_VAULT_DRAKE_SLAIN|The vault beast is slain. The chamber is quiet enough that I can hear my own hands shake.
DIALOGUE_ORYN_VAULT_REMINDER|The lower ward is open. I can feel the vault breathing through the stair. End what waits below before the old pattern spends itself holding the door.
DIALOGUE_ORYN_VAULT_NOT_READY|The vault stair remains locked. Until the Beacon Prism is set, opening it would be courage without discipline.
DIALOGUE_ORYN_VAULT_START|The Beacon Prism is set, and the star is Lightglass. I can open the lower ward, but listen before you descend: the White Vault has held something draconic in the dark for too long. If it wakes fully, the stones will not keep the sound small. Return when it is dead.
DIALOGUE_KESTREL_SCOUT_GHOSTWOOD_DONE|West patrols are finding the road again. We keep a double watch, but the names match the roster now.
DIALOGUE_KESTREL_SCOUT_GHOSTWOOD_REWARD|Veyr is dead? Then the smoke lifting makes sense. We lost patrols to that tower.\nTake the scout purse. I will send west patrols that way again.
DIALOGUE_KESTREL_SCOUT_ASK_EIRADHA|对话：Before you go west， 询问 Envoy Eiradha in Highmark。 This smoke has old ward work in it， 和 elves know more of that than 斥候。
DIALOGUE_KESTREL_SCOUT_GHOSTWOOD_REMINDER|对话：Eiradha gave her answer。 Ghostwood is next。 Follow west 道路 到 old 塔， 杀死 Veyr， 和 return when smoke clears。
DIALOGUE_KESTREL_SCOUT_TOO_GREEN|Not for you yet. The smoke reports are taking trained patrols, and I am not sending another name into that list today.
DIALOGUE_KESTREL_SCOUT_GHOSTWOOD_START|You there, traveler. If you can keep west on a bad road, I need you. Two patrols vanished near Ghostwood after dusk. We found cold ash, dropped packs, no bodies.\nGo to Highmark and ask Envoy Eiradha about the smoke before you enter it. Kestrel pays when patrols can use the west road again.
DIALOGUE_WATCH_SERGEANT_ROCKMAW_OUTPOST_OPEN|对话：Rockmaw's outer yard is ours。 Beds， crates， field forge， barricaded lower stair。\nGo see it。 The supplier sells field stock， smith patches 装备， 和 orderly may have a cot。
DIALOGUE_WATCH_SERGEANT_ROCKMAW_HOLDING|对话：Rockmaw is holding。 Two guards on lower stair， crates under canvas， forge still hot。 Better than yesterday's 报告。
DIALOGUE_WATCH_SERGEANT_ROCKMAW_TURNIN|Maug 和 Brond 死了？好。人头能缩短我的报告；这些击杀会打开道路。\nKestrel 现在行动。我们接管 Rockmaw 外院，封住下层楼梯，安床、板条箱和野战炉。拿 Rockmaw 的报酬。
DIALOGUE_WATCH_SERGEANT_ROCKMAW_REMINDER|对话：Rockmaw Keep， west 道路。 杀死 Maug 和 Brond。 带回 their heads if you can carry them。
DIALOGUE_WATCH_SERGEANT_TOO_GREEN|还不行。下一个场院会折断训练有素的哨兵。先熟悉西路，我再把你的名字写上去。
DIALOGUE_WATCH_SERGEANT_ROCKMAW_START|对话：You came 到 Kestrel without a post assignment。 Good。 I need blades on 道路 work。\nRockmaw Keep blocks west 道路。 Maug， an 双头巨人， gives orders； Brond， an 食人魔 champion， holds yard。\nKill both。 带回 their heads if you can carry them。 When they are down， Kestrel takes outer yard。
DIALOGUE_WATCH_SERGEANT_VARROTH_REWARD|Varroth 死了？好。Rockmaw 附近有个 werewolf king，离我的哨兵太近。\n拿上钱袋和这把斧子。我们从 Rockmaw 库房里翻出来的。
DIALOGUE_WATCH_SERGEANT_VARROTH_REMINDER|对话：Inconspicuous 洞穴， hills southwest of Highmark。 Varroth holds lower 石头 rooms。 杀死 him before his 背包 tests Rockmaw sentries。
DIALOGUE_WATCH_SERGEANT_VARROTH_START|Rockmaw 稳住后还有一件活。Inconspicuous Cave 下方的狼群离我们的哨兵太近。\n那洞在 Highmark 西南的丘陵里。Varroth，那个 Werewolf King，占着下层石室。杀了他再回来报告；我有钱，还有一把 Rockmaw 库房里的斧子。
DIALOGUE_VAUST_ORDERS_HANDIN|Good. West scouts need current routes, not guesses.\nTell the Lancers I heard the message. Take the carry pay.
DIALOGUE_VAUST_NEEDS_WHITE_SEAL|对话：营地 Kestrel is not a shelter for unfinished relic work。 Finish White Seal's 护符 business 带着 Tharec， then come back。
DIALOGUE_EIRADHA_GHOSTWOOD_CONSULT|The ghostwood trouble belongs with the Kestrel scout. Follow the smoke if it still rises; return to the scout when it is quiet.
DIALOGUE_EIRADHA_TELWYND_OPEN|Sairveth has opened Telwynd to you. From Glassroot Hollow, take the forest road northwest to the town and wait for a warden at the gate.
DIALOGUE_EIRADHA_GLASSROOT_TURNIN|The drake is dead? Good. Then Glassroot can breathe again.\nI will send word ahead. From the hollow, take the forest road northwest to Telwynd; Warden Sairveth Ilyr will receive you. Consider this a narrow measure of trust, not a welcome.
DIALOGUE_EIRADHA_GLASSROOT_REMINDER|Glassroot Hollow first. Leave Highmark, take the east road from the crossroads, and follow it southeast into the Veiled Wood. Kill the blackglass drake feeding there. Until the hollow is clear, Telwynd keeps its gates shut.
DIALOGUE_EIRADHA_GLASSROOT_START|Highmark does not usually send armed strangers to my door. Since you are here, I will be plain.\nTelwynd is closed to you for now. Glassroot Hollow lies east from the crossroads outside Highmark; follow the road as it bends southeast into the Veiled Wood. A blackglass drake is feeding there.\nClear the hollow and return to me. Do that, and I may have room for a narrow measure of trust.
DIALOGUE_SAIRVETH_GLASSROOT_TURNIN|Glassroot Hollow is clear? Then Telwynd can receive you properly. The town owes you passage.\nUse the forest road back toward Glassroot when you leave, and do not test side trails. I can help with ordinary wardwork while you are here.
DIALOGUE_SAIRVETH_TELWYND_CLOSED|Telwynd is closed to guests while Glassroot Hollow is held by the drake. Kill it, then return by the same forest road. Do not test side trails.
DIALOGUE_SAIRVETH_MOONWELL_TURNIN|You reached the far exit? Good. The Moonwell Tunnels can carry wardens again.\nTake the ward pay and this ring. Highmark will have fewer excuses to close the tunnel route.
DIALOGUE_SAIRVETH_MOONWELL_REMINDER|Moonwell Tunnels still need both moonstone dials set. Reach the far exit, then return. Until then, I keep it off our patrol map.
DIALOGUE_SAIRVETH_MOONWELL_START|The Moonwell Tunnels run below the high route, from the Moonwell site toward the southwest exit. Highmark leaves them closed; Telwynd needs another way through.\nSet both moonstone dials, reach the far exit, and return to me. If you can walk it end to end, I can send wardens after you.
DIALOGUE_SAIRVETH_HIGHWIND_FOUND_CATACOMBS|You found the Highwind Catacombs? Then the lower door still opens.\nTelwynd needed proof, and you brought it. Good work.
DIALOGUE_SAIRVETH_HIGHWIND_ASK_THERYN|The chapel wardwork is still sound, and it points below the monastery.\nOld Theryn Rusk knows the Highwind grounds. Ask him where the lower entrance opens.
DIALOGUE_SAIRVETH_HIGHWIND_MONASTERY_REMINDER|Highwind Monastery first. Inspect the old chapel and return to me before you chase a lower door.
DIALOGUE_SAIRVETH_ELDERWYRM_TURNIN|对话：Caerwyn is dead？ Then Elderwyrm Grove can be held again。\nI will 打开 Telwynd 大门 和 send wardworkers through。 They go 到 hold grove， not loot it。
DIALOGUE_SAIRVETH_VEILED_PATHS_OPEN|The sealed passage by the Ancient Dwarven Gate should answer now. Glassroot gave you enough standing with Telwynd.\nReturn below the gate and touch the elven wardwork. If it opens, stay on the main grove path.
DIALOGUE_SAIRVETH_HIGHWIND_START|Highwind Monastery has Telwynd wardwork under White Seal repairs, and there may be a lower door beneath the chapel.\nGo there, inspect the old chapel, then return. If the work is still sound, I will send you to the man who knows the lower entrance.
DIALOGUE_SAIRVETH_IDLE|Telwynd paths are not open to travelers. Bring me sealed doors, true shards, or broken wards before you test them.\nFor ordinary wardwork, speak plainly and I will see what can be done.
DIALOGUE_EIVYSS_BLACKGLASS_TABLE_LOCKED|No. Not yet. Sairveth has not vouched for your White Seal blood. Settle that with him first, then I will look at your shard.
DIALOGUE_EIVYSS_BLACKGLASS_TABLE_OPEN|Sairveth vouched for you. Put true blackglass shards on the copper tray; I can set one into wards, staves, circlets, and Telwynd work.
DIALOGUE_EIVYSS_BLACKGLASS_TABLE_LIMITS|One shard, one finished piece. Stronger work waits until Sairveth opens more of the table.
DIALOGUE_EIVYSS_MOONWELL_ATTUNE_DONE|The lens is attuned. Install it at the moonwell.
DIALOGUE_EIVYSS_MOONWELL_INSTALL|对话：The 透镜 is tuned。 拿上 it 到 Moonwell Observatory 和 seat it in frame。 My table is done 带着 it。
DIALOGUE_EIVYSS_MOONWELL_RETURN_VEYDRAS|对话：The 透镜 is seated？ Then Veydras needs reading。 返回 him in White Seal building。
DIALOGUE_EIVYSS_ELDERWYRM_START|Elderwyrm Grove不再沉睡。Caerwyn把古老的绿色结界扭到自己身边。\n夺回林地，否则Sairveth派去的修路工会唱着歌进去，出来时只剩警告。
DIALOGUE_AELTHIR_GROVE_TABLE_CLOSED|对话：The grove table stays packed until Sairveth opens 大门。 If Caerwyn still holds Elderwyrm Grove， go back 到 Telwynd 和 settle that first。
DIALOGUE_AELTHIR_GROVE_MAGIC_OPEN|Gate open, crates tied down, ward line steady. Browse if you need grove work; step back if the old well flares.
DIALOGUE_SMUGGLER_LOCKBOX_DONE|对话：The lower cove is finished。 If 守卫 asks， you saw wet crates 和 dead bandits。 Leave my name out of it。
DIALOGUE_SMUGGLER_LOCKBOX_HANDIN|对话：Put it on ground by wall。 Do not 打开 it。 The 封印 is still shut。 I 报酬 for shut boxes。
DIALOGUE_SMUGGLER_LOCKBOX_PAY|好。Old Snapjaw 死了，箱子回来了，我能在买家上门前搬走。拿锁箱报酬。
DIALOGUE_SMUGGLER_LOCKBOX_ROUTE|Bring the lockbox from the grotto.
DIALOGUE_SMUGGLER_SEAL_HANDIN|That is my seal. You did the job clean, so I will pay what I promised.
DIALOGUE_SMUGGLER_LOCKBOX_AFTER_SEAL|There is one more thing in that grotto: an iron lockbox in the lower cove. Bring it back shut and I will pay better coin.
DIALOGUE_SMUGGLER_LOCKBOX_OFFER_AFTER_SEAL|You brought the seal back clean. If you want the better pay, go back to the same grotto and find my iron lockbox in the lower cove. Bring it back shut.
DIALOGUE_SMUGGLER_SEAL_ROUTE|对话：Take east 道路 从 Havenford 到 King's Barrow， then turn south 从 barrow 道路 到 Smuggler 岩洞。 带回 back my lead 封印。
DIALOGUE_SMUGGLER_SEAL_START_PRESSURE|压低声音。你不是Havenford守卫，岩洞那伙人也不会认得你的脸。很好。
DIALOGUE_SMUGGLER_SEAL_START_ROUTE|Take the east road from Havenford toward King's Barrow, then turn south to Smuggler Grotto. Bring back my lead seal whole, and I pay.
DIALOGUE_MERRIT_REPAIRED_SHOP_OPEN|对话：Havenford Corner is 打开。 Rings in tray， charms in case， 和 small bottles behind my hand。 What can I show you， if your 钱 is honest？
DIALOGUE_MERRIT_TRAVEL_CASE_DAMAGE|对话：Kobolds broke my door 和 left smoke in shutters。 Until Havenford Corner is mended， this travel case is my shop。
DIALOGUE_MERRIT_TRAVEL_CASE_STOCK|对话：Rings 和 charms first。 Small bottles if you have 钱。 询问 before touching wrapped row。
DIALOGUE_THRUNNA_ORC_FORTRESS_DONE|No new raids from the Orc Fortress. Stonecleft still keeps shields on the wagons, but Gorvuk's warband is broken.
DIALOGUE_THRUNNA_ORC_FORTRESS_TURNIN|Gorvuk is dead? Good. A palisade can still hold raiders, but it has lost command.
DIALOGUE_THRUNNA_ORC_FORTRESS_REWARD|Take this hammer and the road pay. Stonecleft pays for road work. I will put shields back on the wagon line.
DIALOGUE_THRUNNA_ORC_FORTRESS_REMINDER_ROUTE|Take the west road out of Stonecleft, then follow the rough track southwest to the Orc Fortress.
DIALOGUE_THRUNNA_NEEDS_FORTRESS_SKETCH|Stonecleft keeps its gates with patience and hard boots. If you are heading west, keep your shield hand free and do not trust quiet hills.
DIALOGUE_THRUNNA_HALF_ORC_REFUSAL|对话：Keep sketch。 我会 not write a half-兽人 into Stonecleft orders against an 兽人 palisade。 That is my answer。
DIALOGUE_THRUNNA_ORC_FORTRESS_TOO_GREEN|Not yet. That sketch shows trouble bigger than a road scrape. Keep it safe while I weigh the road risk.
DIALOGUE_THRUNNA_ORC_FORTRESS_MAP_HANDIN_READ|Outer wall, dug rooms, watch posts, and Gorvuk's sign. That is an orc fortress, not a camp.
DIALOGUE_THRUNNA_ORC_FORTRESS_MAP_HANDIN_ASK|I am keeping the sketch. Go up there, break the warband, kill Gorvuk, and return. Hammer and coin if you come back alive.
DIALOGUE_BOREK_ORC_FORTRESS_DONE|对话：No fresh 兽人 cuts on western track。 Gorvuk's crew has stopped dragging logs across our 道路。
DIALOGUE_BOREK_SKETCH_TO_THRUNNA|The western track is quiet for now. Thrunna decides the rest.
DIALOGUE_BOREK_TOO_GREEN|Not yet. That fort is Stonecleft road business now, not trail gossip.
DIALOGUE_BOREK_SKETCH_DELIVERY|A trader left this after hearing you came back from Old Cave. It shows an orc palisade west of Stonecleft. Take it to the gate warden; she will know if it matches scout reports.
DIALOGUE_BORRI_RESCUED_REPEAT|Safe at the gatehall, thanks to you. The orcs won't take me again.
DIALOGUE_BORRI_RESCUE|By the forge, I thought those orcs had me. I can make the gatehall if the route is clear. You have my thanks.
DIALOGUE_BORRI_HELM_REWARD|I made it back. This helm is yours now, and better in your hands than locked in a dwarf chest.
DIALOGUE_MAVETH_FARMER_THOM_HOME|对话：Thom is home。 Bruised 和 thin， but home。 The north fence can wait； I am keeping him by hearth today。
DIALOGUE_MAVETH_FARMER_THOM_RETURNED|你找到Thom了？他在北篱旁。他一直说自己没事。趁他还没想回去干活，先去和他说说话。
DIALOGUE_MAVETH_FARMER_REMINDER_SHRINE|你找到Thom的任何线索了吗？每过一小时，就更难假装他只是迷了路。
DIALOGUE_MAVETH_FARMER_REMINDER_GOBLIN|你找到Thom的任何线索了吗？每过一小时，就更难假装他只是迷了路。
DIALOGUE_MAVETH_FARMER_START_PRESSURE|对话：Traveler， stop。 Thom left by north fence this morning， 和 hands are already walking over his tracks。
DIALOGUE_MAVETH_FARMER_START_SHRINE|Thom沿着北篱外的足迹走了，再也没有回家。我不知道那条路把他带去了哪里。若他还活着，请找到他；若没有，请把真相带给我。
DIALOGUE_MAVETH_FARMER_START_GOBLIN|Thom沿着北篱外的足迹走了，再也没有回家。我不知道那条路把他带去了哪里。若他还活着，请找到他；若没有，请把真相带给我。
DIALOGUE_THOM_LOST_REPEAT|对话：I am coming。 Give me one breath， then point me toward Maveth's field。
DIALOGUE_THOM_LOST_RESCUE|对话：Havenford？ Maveth sent you？ Keep way clear。 我可以 walk if I do not look back。
DIALOGUE_THOM_WOLD_REWARD|对话：Maveth says I owe you。 She is right。 拿上这个 lucky 护符。 It kept me steady long enough 到 get home。
DIALOGUE_THOM_WOLD_HOME_IDLE|对话：Maveth has me inside north fence 和 off 道路。 I am not arguing today。
DIALOGUE_NOTHAS_THOM_FOUND|对话：You found Thom near Havenford？ Thank you。 我有 porter 报酬 和 little else， but his name can stay on family slate。
DIALOGUE_NOTHAS_THOM_MISSING_HINT|对话：My brother Thom farms by Havenford's north fence。 If you travel west， 询问 Maveth Wold about him。 The last Havenford cart brought no word。
DIALOGUE_HARREN_TUTORIAL_START|你总算醒了。你父亲跟我说过，总有一天护符会开始动起来。至于接下来会发生什么，我只希望他是夸大其词。我要回神殿了，接下来你得靠自己。立刻走东边的路。到Brindle Quay找码头长，把这张字条交给他。他会送你去Valoria。箱子里还剩些补给，拿上它们，往东走。前路不好走，孩子。跟着护符，尽力活下去。
DIALOGUE_HARREN_TUTORIAL_REMINDER|快动身。码头在东边。
DIALOGUE_GARRAN_NO_NOTE|我们这儿正干活。你不是来帮忙的，就让开。
DIALOGUE_GARRAN_NOTE_HANDIN|这是Harren写的？嗯。我明白了。麻烦啊。看来要担心的不只是海况。好吧，昨晚进港彻底糟了，船壳半边都被扯开个洞，现在还得补。
DIALOGUE_GARRAN_SLEEP_AT_INN|明早就能好。去睡一觉，天一亮再回来。旅店应该有空房。
DIALOGUE_GARRAN_SLEEP_REMINDER|你没打断我之前，我还在修船。去旅店找个房间，明早再回来，除非你想游去Valoria。
DIALOGUE_GARRAN_READY_TO_SAIL|Rested? Good. Captain Thauld is ready for Reedwater Docks. The water has grown mean and the inland roads are worse, so once you are ashore, follow the north road toward Havenford.
DIALOGUE_CORREN_STOCK|对话：Come in 和 look over shelves。 Rations， bandages， lamp 油， rope， 和 cheap blades。 What do you need before Garran's 船 叶片？
DIALOGUE_BRECK_START_CHECK|你，站住。要离开 Brindle Quay，就在训练假人上给我看一次职业动作。出镇前我得看见。
DIALOGUE_BRECK_START_INPUT|对训练假人使用 {class_actions}。回来前，我要看一次干净的职业动作。
DIALOGUE_BRECK_ACTION_USED|对话：Good。 Keep it ready on 道路。 In a real fight， 使用 it before you start bleeding。
DIALOGUE_BRECK_FIGHT_DONE|对话：You made it back。 Good。 Keep your class action ready for Reedwater。
DIALOGUE_ORRIN_ROOM_NOT_READY|对话：No 床 yet， traveler。 Garran has not sent word， 和 I am keeping spare 房间 closed。
DIALOGUE_ORRIN_ROOM_READY|对话：Garran sent you？ Then spare 房间 is yours。 Key is on peg； sleep now if you want Thauld's 船 at first light。
DIALOGUE_TUTORIAL_INN_REST_TITLE|对话：Innkeeper Orrin
DIALOGUE_TUTORIAL_INN_REST_MORNING|对话：Morning， traveler。 Thauld's crew is already on pier。 Eat if you need 到， then go see Garran。
DIALOGUE_TUTORIAL_INN_REST_CAMP_KIT|对话：拿上这个 rough camping kit 从 storeroom。 使用 it outside town when you need sleep 和 there is no 旅店 nearby。
DIALOGUE_TUTORIAL_GUIDE_LAYOUT|对话：Need your bearings？ {guide_help_menu}
DIALOGUE_TUTORIAL_GUIDE_MARKED_NPCS|有事要办的人，只要留心就看得出来。加兰负责船路，科伦卖补给，布雷克会训练任何敢开口的人。布雷克的训练，{guide_class_actions}
DIALOGUE_TUTORIAL_GUIDE_SURVIVAL|龙醒之后，道路和水路都不再宽容。在旅店或安全营地休息，把绷带放在手边，并在饥饿替你做决定前先吃东西。{guide_inventory}
DIALOGUE_TUTORIAL_GUIDE_BOAT_ROUTE|Once Garran clears you, the boat runs to Reedwater Docks. From there, follow the north road toward Havenford until you know the country.
