STORY_MSG_QUEST_UPDATE_RETURN_MAVETH|任务更新： 返回 Maveth Vell in Highmark。
STORY_MSG_QUEST_UPDATE_RETURN_AELRION|任务更新： 返回 Aelrion Yewhand in Telwynd。
STORY_MSG_QUEST_UPDATE_RETURN_HIGHMARK_LANCER|任务更新： 返回 a Silver Lancer in Highmark。
STORY_MSG_QUEST_UPDATE_KILL_BROND|任务更新： 殺死 Brond， 用人魔 Champion in Rockmaw Keep。
STORY_MSG_QUEST_UPDATE_KILL_MAUG|任务更新： 殺死 Maug， 雙頭頭人 in Rockmaw Keep。
STORY_MSG_QUEST_UPDATE_OPEN_ROYAL_SARCOPHAGUS|任务更新： 打開 royal sarcophagus in King's Barrow。
STORY_MSG_QUEST_UPDATE_RECOVER_LOCKBOX|任务更新： 不回 鎖箱 從 Smuggler 岩洞's lower cove。
STORY_MSG_QUEST_UPDATE_RETURN_VETHRIN|任务更新： 返回 Vethrin Quill。
STORY_MSG_QUEST_UPDATE_RETURN_VETHRIN_COTTAGE|Quest updated: return to Wizard Vethrin with the Burned Cottage markings.
STORY_MSG_QUEST_UPDATE_SEARCH_DEAD_DUERGAR|任务更新： 搜索 dead 矮人人 in Floodgate Cistern for runeforge core。
STORY_MSG_QUEST_UPDATE_RETURN_DORRAN|任务更新： 返回 Dorran Keenedge in Stonecleft。
STORY_MSG_QUEST_UPDATE_RETURN_CALDUS|任务更新： 返回 Ser Caldus Renn at Traveller's Rest。
STORY_MSG_QUEST_UPDATE_BRING_DRAKE_SCALE|任务更新： bring a 龍龍 scale back 到 Velra Senn。
STORY_MSG_QUEST_UPDATE_RETURN_BRESS|任务更新： 返回 Bress Dask。
STORY_MSG_QUEST_UPDATE_RETURN_THRUNNA|Quest updated: return to the Stonecleft gate warden.
STORY_MSG_QUEST_UPDATE_RETURN_THAVOSS|任務更新：返回Havenford的Elder Thavoss。
STORY_MSG_QUEST_UPDATE_RETURN_THERYN|任务更新： 返回 Old Theryn Rusk in Havenford。
STORY_MSG_QUEST_DROP_KOBOLD_SCALP|You take a 狗頭人 scalp for Garrick。
STORY_MSG_QUEST_DROP_GRAVE_BONE|You take a grave bone for Garrick。
STORY_MSG_QUEST_DROP_OLDROOT_LEAF|You cut a usable oldroot 葉片。
STORY_MSG_QUEST_DROP_MOONWELL_THREAD|You gather a strand of moonwell 線。
STORY_MSG_QUEST_NOTE_RUNEFORGE_DUERGAR|任务備注： Dorran Keenedge in Stonecleft should hear about this。
NPC_LINE_EDRIN_1|传聞：Do not touch inkstones。 我有 them sorted by riverbank， not color。
NPC_LINE_EDRIN_2|Trace the carving first. The stone lies less when it has not been dragged across a table.
NPC_LINE_EDRIN_3|传聞：黑玻璃 chips go in cloth， not bare fingers。 I want edges intact。
NPC_LINE_EDRIN_CAVE_COMPLETE_1|传聞：The 哥布森 chief is dead， but 洞穴 still needs a proper look。 哥布森 do not carve old door marks。
NPC_LINE_EDRIN_CAVE_COMPLETE_2|传聞：Old door marks， stamped brick， 黑玻璃 dust： wrap it 和 bring it here before a trader sees it。
NPC_LINE_EDRIN_CAVE_COMPLETE_3|传聞：帶给我 map scraps， stamped brick， 或 黑玻璃 before Merrit prices lot。
NPC_LINE_THERYN_1|传聞：Mind loose pages。 I had them in order before wind 和 children found me。
NPC_LINE_THERYN_2|传聞：If a 神龛 scrap names Istaris， bring it here before a merchant sees it。
NPC_LINE_THERYN_3|传聞：I read old hands。 I do not read wet maps， burned corners， 或 tavern poems。
NPC_LINE_FARMER_1|传聞：The goats kicked through west rail again。 If you pass Bran's place， tell him I need his spare hammer。
NPC_LINE_FARMER_2|传聞：Old mill's jammed again。 We got three sacks through before wheel stuck。
NPC_LINE_FARMER_3|传聞：Seed cost double this spring， 和 fort tax man still wants his share。
NPC_LINE_FARMER_4|传聞：Raiders took two sacks 從 my shed last week。 We are boiling oats thin until market day。
NPC_LINE_FARMER_CAVE_STARTED_1|传聞：Elder Thavoss says east 洞穴 needs clearing。 Good。 My pen 大門 has claw marks all along hinge。
NPC_LINE_FARMER_CAVE_STARTED_2|传聞：We latch shutters before dusk now。 The 哥布森 learned where goat yard opens。
NPC_LINE_FARMER_CAVE_STARTED_3|传聞：If you are working for Thavoss， bring a sharp blade。 Those 哥布森 come back fast when they smell grain。
NPC_LINE_FARMER_CAVE_COMPLETE_1|传聞：No 哥布森 tracks by pens this morning。 I let goats out before breakfast。
NPC_LINE_FARMER_CAVE_COMPLETE_2|传聞：Slept till sunup for once。 Woke up angry at rooster instead of scared of ditch。
NPC_LINE_FARMER_CAVE_COMPLETE_3|传聞：The raids stopped， but I still latch pen twice。 No tracks this week； my hands do it anyway。
NPC_LINE_BEGGAR_1|传聞：Got a heel of bread 到 spare？ Copper's fine too。 Hot soup costs two at Nell's。
NPC_LINE_BEGGAR_2|传聞：Nell sets yesterday's crusts by side door。 Best not let dogs see you first。
NPC_LINE_BEGGAR_3|传聞：They say 黑玻璃 sells south。 I say bread sells better when your hands shake。
NPC_LINE_BEGGAR_4|传聞：Leave spare 用物 by commons wall。 The little ones check there before dark。
NPC_LINE_BEGGAR_CAVE_COMPLETE_1|传聞：Nell put out a full basket this morning。 Road must be 打開 enough for flour again。
NPC_LINE_BEGGAR_CAVE_COMPLETE_2|传聞：The guards quit snapping at cart wheels。 They still 守衛 every stranger。
NPC_LINE_BEGGAR_CAVE_COMPLETE_3|传聞：Dogs slept quiet last night。 I did too， until hens started up。
NPC_LINE_DRIFTER_1|East-road ditches turn up buckles, arrows, and lies every dawn.
NPC_LINE_DRIFTER_2|传聞：黑玻璃 cuts through cheap cloth。 Wrap it twice before a buyer starts turning it over。
NPC_LINE_DRIFTER_3|传聞：Highmark wants cart hands。 Havenford is short three， 和 nobody wants their son on 道路。
NPC_LINE_DRIFTER_4|传聞：Wagon drivers keep one hand on reins 和 one on a knife these days。
NPC_LINE_DRIFTER_5|传聞：If Nell closes side door early， I move 到 commons wall。 Less shouting there。
NPC_LINE_DRIFTER_CAVE_COMPLETE_1|传聞：Fewer 哥布森 prints east of town。 I still saw fresh boots by north milestone。
NPC_LINE_DRIFTER_CAVE_COMPLETE_2|传聞：Two carts reached town before noon。 Last week we would have heard shouting 從 大門。
NPC_LINE_DRIFTER_CAVE_COMPLETE_3|传聞：Folks laughed outside Nell's today。 They still barred their shutters before full dark。
NPC_LINE_PEDDLER_1|传聞：Come close。 Blades， twine， 護符 knots， 和 a little ruin salvage in side roll。 Names cost extra。
NPC_LINE_PEDDLER_2|传聞：Spare straps， dry tinder， cheap charms。 If yours snapped already， price just went up。
NPC_LINE_PEDDLER_3|传聞：Warm 黑玻璃？ Old script rings？ Show me first。 Scholars 報酬 slow unless I press them。
NPC_LINE_HALF_ORC_HUMAN_1|传聞：You there。 State your business 和 keep moving。
NPC_LINE_HALF_ORC_HUMAN_2|传聞：Coin on counter first。 I do not run tabs for strangers。
NPC_LINE_HALF_ORC_HUMAN_3|传聞：Easy now。 Keep your hands where 我可可 see them。
NPC_LINE_HALF_ORC_HUMAN_4|传聞：No lingering by houses。 The 守衛 has enough complaints today。
NPC_LINE_HALF_ORC_HUMAN_5|传聞：Off my doorstep。 My children are inside。
NPC_LINE_HALF_ORC_HUMAN_RELIGIOUS_1|传聞：使用 lower steps。 Chapel doors are crowded enough。
NPC_LINE_HALF_ORC_HUMAN_RELIGIOUS_2|传聞：Do not crowd 供壇。 Say your prayer 和 make 房間。
NPC_LINE_HALF_ORC_HUMAN_RELIGIOUS_3|传聞：State your need quietly。 The sick are sleeping behind screen。
NPC_LINE_HALF_ORC_PRAGMATIC_1|传聞：Coin first， same as everyone。
NPC_LINE_HALF_ORC_PRAGMATIC_2|传聞：Your 錢 spends here。 Put it where 我可可 count it。
NPC_LINE_HALF_ORC_PRAGMATIC_3|传聞：No trouble by my stall。 I just swept that corner。
NPC_LINE_HALF_ORC_PRAGMATIC_4|传聞：Buying 或 browsing？ Choose quick； bread is cooling。
NPC_LINE_HALF_ORC_CHILD_1|传聞：Ma said not 到 stare at tusks。
NPC_LINE_HALF_ORC_CHILD_2|传聞：Can you lift a grown man 帶著 one hand？
NPC_LINE_HALF_ORC_DWARF_1|Orc blood in my hall? Keep walking.
NPC_LINE_HALF_ORC_DWARF_2|传聞：Mind your hands near clan rail。
NPC_LINE_HALF_ORC_DWARF_3|传聞：Buy your meal， drink quiet， 和 leave。
NPC_LINE_HALF_ORC_DWARF_4|传聞：No forge business for you unless Thrunna says so。
NPC_LINE_HALF_ORC_DWARF_5|传聞：If you want a 房間， 詢問 keeper。 If you want clan talk， forget it。
NPC_LINE_HALF_ORC_ELF_1|传聞：You may pass。 Keep your hands away 從 ward lines。
NPC_LINE_HALF_ORC_ELF_2|传聞：Wardens know you are here， traveler。
NPC_LINE_HALF_ORC_ELF_3|Old boundaries were written after old griefs. Your step reads loudly against them.
NPC_LINE_HALF_ORC_ELF_4|传聞：This grove is not for wandering。
NPC_LINE_HALF_ORC_SOLDIER_1|Clear the line. Shields need room.
NPC_LINE_HALF_ORC_SOLDIER_2|传聞：Hands off stores。 Counted crates stay counted。
NPC_LINE_HALF_ORC_SOLDIER_3|传聞：Horn sounds， move where I point。
NPC_LINE_HALF_ORC_SOLDIER_4|传聞：Got orders？ Show them。 No orders， move on。
NPC_LINE_STONECLEFT_FILLER_1|The mess line starts after shift change. If you smell barley, you are heading the right way.
NPC_LINE_STONECLEFT_FILLER_2|Commons crew is short two haulers. Watch for carts cutting across the road.
NPC_LINE_STONECLEFT_FILLER_3|传聞：Soup's by hearth。 Bread's in left basket if miners left any。
NPC_LINE_STONECLEFT_FILLER_4|传聞：Hood your lamp near lower stair。 大門 守衛 hates glare。
NPC_LINE_STONECLEFT_FILLER_5|传聞：Mind east door。 Someone spilled ale again。
NPC_LINE_STONECLEFT_FILLER_6|传聞：Put borrowed tools back on hooks。 Missing picks start fights。
NPC_LINE_STONECLEFT_FILLER_7|传聞：Shake 道路 dust outside。 Grit ruins hinges。
NPC_LINE_STONECLEFT_FILLER_8|Underway carts are backed up below. Every crate has a mark and every mark has a clerk.
NPC_LINE_STONECLEFT_FILLER_9|传聞：I braced that wall this morning。 Hands off until dust settles。
NPC_LINE_STONECLEFT_FILLER_10|传聞：A quarry cart came back 帶著 tooth marks in axle。 Thrunna doubled 道路 守衛。
NPC_LINE_STONECLEFT_MASON_1|传聞：I chalked that crack this morning。 Keep your shoulder off it。
NPC_LINE_STONECLEFT_MASON_2|传聞：Need Throkk？ Lower stair。 Need a wider door？ 帶回 wedges 和 six strong backs。
NPC_LINE_STONECLEFT_MASON_3|传聞：East hall is sound。 New stair is not。 Walk by lamps。
NPC_LINE_STONECLEFT_MINER_1|Lift crew is late again. Ask the lower gate guard, not me.
NPC_LINE_STONECLEFT_MINER_2|传聞：Black grit in that seam。 Tools down， lamps up。
NPC_LINE_STONECLEFT_MINER_3|传聞：Old cuts sound hollow in places。 Tap before you lean。
NPC_LINE_STONECLEFT_MINER_4|传聞：矮人人 leave square tool marks。 When I see those， I count helmets before ore。
NPC_LINE_STONECLEFT_GUARD_FLAVOR_1|Keep to the main hall. The side doors are work rooms, not shortcuts.
NPC_LINE_STONECLEFT_GUARD_FLAVOR_2|传聞：Keep moving near lower 大門。 Staring makes 守衛 nervous。
NPC_LINE_STONECLEFT_GUARD_FLAVOR_3|No loose packs by the stair. If it is yours, carry it; if it is not, leave it.
NPC_LINE_STONECLEFT_GUARD_FLAVOR_4|If the cart crew shouts twice, clear the middle track.
NPC_LINE_TELWYND_WARDWORK_1|传聞：Ward glass chips easily。 詢問 before you touch bright lenses。
NPC_LINE_TELWYND_WARDWORK_2|Do not step over silver twine. It is not decoration, and it dislikes apology.
NPC_LINE_TELWYND_WARDWORK_3|Old wards wake for old names. New feet must wait until the grove decides how much to hear.
NPC_LINE_TELWYND_WARDWORK_4|传聞：The old grove ward is touchy。 Scouts clear path before we carry tools there。
NPC_LINE_TELWYND_PATH_1|The path through the Veiled Wood is quiet. Quiet is not peace; it is the wood listening before it answers.
NPC_LINE_TELWYND_PATH_2|The forest path rewards patience. Hurry, and you find the wrong clearing.
NPC_LINE_TELWYND_PATH_3|传聞：Guest paths end at elder 石頭。 Past them， no guide comes looking。
NPC_LINE_TELWYND_PATH_4|Straight lines through these trees usually mean someone is lost. Telwynd owes strangers no rescue.
NPC_LINE_TELWYND_WORKER_1|Leaf fall hides the old footway. We clear only enough for guests who are expected.
NPC_LINE_TELWYND_WORKER_2|传聞：Small tools vanish under moss。 Mine stay tied 到 my belt。
NPC_LINE_TELWYND_WORKER_3|Green shoots cross every line they can. Growth is not innocence; we prune it all the same.
NPC_LINE_TELWYND_WORKER_4|传聞：Ghostwood smoke clings 到 cloth。 Wash twice before you sit inside。
NPC_LINE_TELWYND_CHILD_1|The gate wardens know where visitors may walk. I know because I tried every shortcut.
NPC_LINE_TELWYND_CHILD_2|传聞：Scouts say guests get lost staring up。 Watch white 石頭 instead。
NPC_LINE_STONECLEFT_LOWER_PASSAGE_1|The lower pass is open, but not friendly. Keep lamps fed and hands clear of side cuts.
NPC_LINE_STONECLEFT_LOWER_PASSAGE_2|传聞：No stalls past this post。 Count your 用物， 油， 和 bandages now。
NPC_LINE_STONECLEFT_LOWER_PASSAGE_3|If you are bound for Highmark, keep north through the Underway and ignore the old cart ruts.
NPC_LINE_KESTREL_FIELD_SUPPLIER_1|传聞：Rations， lamp 油， bolts， patched mail。 Field packs only； wagon space is for orders。
NPC_LINE_KESTREL_FIELD_SUPPLIER_2|传聞：Breach kit is on this table。 Pay here， count it here， 檢包 it before you block my line。
NPC_LINE_KESTREL_FIELD_SUPPLIER_3|传聞：Tie bottles inside your 檢包。 I am not explaining loose 油 到 surgeon again。
NPC_LINE_KESTREL_GUARD_1|传聞：North 守衛 holds 道路。 South 守衛 holds breach。 Horn call means clear a lane。
NPC_LINE_KESTREL_GUARD_2|传聞：黑玻璃 flaking off Scar wall？ Step back 和 call a sapper。
NPC_LINE_KESTREL_GUARD_3|传聞：See those iron pins？ Leave them alone。 They keep tents standing。
NPC_LINE_KESTREL_GUARD_4|传聞：Rockmaw's west towers burn pitch at dusk。 Maug 和 Brond still hold keep。
NPC_LINE_KESTREL_GUARD_5|传聞：Fill your waterskin before you cross stake line。
NPC_LINE_KESTREL_SCOUT_1|The west patrol line shifts after the Scar breathes. Watch which way the grass refuses.
NPC_LINE_KESTREL_SCOUT_2|传聞：Old tracks lead into Scar。 Mark them 和 call a sapper； do not wander after them。
NPC_LINE_KESTREL_SCOUT_3|Tracks vanish near the black grit. That does not mean the patrol flew away.
NPC_LINE_KESTREL_SCOUT_4|传聞：Ghostwood patrols keep missing posts。 They leave at dusk 和 come back short a man。
NPC_LINE_KESTREL_SCOUT_5|传聞：Map shows no stream in Ghostwood。 Three 斥候 heard 水 near 座 path anyway。
NPC_LINE_KESTREL_SCOUT_6|The wood keeps old campfire smoke under its bark. If you smell it, turn back.
NPC_LINE_KESTREL_SAPPER_1|传聞：Wedges， powder， rope。 Then everyone behind stake before I touch fuse。
NPC_LINE_KESTREL_SAPPER_2|传聞：After a blast， I check side cracks before anyone walks under roof。
NPC_LINE_KESTREL_SAPPER_3|传聞：If I tell you 到 move， run 到 marked stake。 Questions wait。
NPC_LINE_KESTREL_SAPPER_4|传聞：I drilled a clean hole this morning。 By dusk， chalk line had split two feet。
NPC_LINE_KESTREL_SAPPER_5|传聞：White Seal marks， Telwynd glass， 黑玻璃 veins： I do not drill them without Vaust's order。
NPC_LINE_KESTREL_WORKER_1|传聞：Stew's thin today。 Bandages are in orderly tent， not under my ladle。
NPC_LINE_KESTREL_WORKER_2|传聞：Smith's line is for buckles， rivets， 和 field blades。 Trinkets wait。
NPC_LINE_KESTREL_WORKER_3|Returns come back short of hands. The loads still need carrying.
NPC_LINE_KESTREL_WORKER_4|传聞：Rockmaw 道路 opens， half this 營地 moves west before breakfast。
NPC_LINE_KESTREL_SMITH_1|传聞：Cracked buckles， loose rivets， bent blades。 Set piece down 和 keep your fingers clear。
NPC_LINE_KESTREL_SMITH_2|传聞：我有 spearheads cooling 和 three shields split at rim。 If you need work， say it quick。
NPC_LINE_KESTREL_SMITH_3|传聞：Rockmaw 裝備 comes back dented deep。 Ogres put dents through shields 和 arm straps alike。
NPC_LINE_KESTREL_SMITH_4|传聞：Field forge is 打開。 I sell blades， patch mail， 和 replace straps if quartermaster has any left。
NPC_LINE_KESTREL_MEDICAL_1|Stretchers come in after quiet calls. Loud calls give people warning.
NPC_LINE_KESTREL_MEDICAL_2|传聞：Keep your voice down near wounded。 Falling 黑玻璃 kept them awake。
NPC_LINE_KESTREL_MEDICAL_3|传聞：A lancer 帶著 one good leg still asked for wall duty。 Crutches are by tent pole。
NPC_LINE_KESTREL_MEDICAL_4|传聞：Ghostwood 裝備 comes back smoke-stained。 I keep clean blankets on upper cot。
NPC_LINE_KESTREL_ORDERLY_1|传聞：We are down 到 torn linen 和 boiled 水。 If you have bandages， hand them here。
NPC_LINE_KESTREL_ORDERLY_2|传聞：Keep your voice low。 Two lancers finally slept， 和 我會 not wake them for 營地 gossip。
NPC_LINE_KESTREL_ORDERLY_3|传聞：Cots are for bleeding， fever， 或 orders 從 Vaust。 If you need rest， 報酬 和 lie still。
NPC_LINE_KESTREL_ORDERLY_4|传聞：Ghostwood returns come in cold 和 shaking。 I check for bites before I give them a blanket。
NPC_LINE_GENERIC_NPC_1|传聞：Busy day。 If you need directions， 詢問 at 大門 或 market。
NPC_LINE_GENERIC_NPC_2|传聞：我有 work 到 finish。 Someone by 道路 can point you along。
NPC_LINE_CHILD_1|传聞：Tress dared me 到 touch a 哥布森 skull。 I said no。 I am brave， not stupid。
NPC_LINE_CHILD_2|传聞：I saw blue light past old 石頭。 Da said lanterns， but it did not move like a lantern。
NPC_LINE_CHILD_3|传聞：My cousin says a dead king sleeps in old mound。 If he has boots， they are probably too big。
NPC_LINE_CHILD_CAVE_STARTED_1|传聞：Thavoss said no 洞穴 games till 哥布森 are gone。 He always knows fun rules。
NPC_LINE_CHILD_CAVE_STARTED_2|传聞：If you see 哥布森 chief， tell him Jory can throw a 石頭 over mill roof。 Almost。
NPC_LINE_CHILD_CAVE_COMPLETE_1|传聞：Ma says there are fewer 哥布森 tracks now。 She still said no caves。 I asked twice。
NPC_LINE_CHILD_CAVE_COMPLETE_2|传聞：The dogs slept last night。 I stayed awake in case they needed help。
NPC_LINE_DOG_1|传聞：The dog sniffs your boots， sneezes once， 和 plants itself by 大門。
NPC_LINE_DOG_2|传聞：The dog watches east 道路 帶著 its ears high。
NPC_LINE_GOAT_1|传聞：The goat chews fence rope 和 stares at you like you brought it。
NPC_LINE_GOAT_2|传聞：The goat climbs onto a feed sack 和 refuses 到 move。
NPC_LINE_CHICKEN_1|传聞：The chicken darts under bench 和 scratches at spilled barley。
NPC_LINE_CHICKEN_2|传聞：The chicken pecks your bootlace， decides against it， 和 struts away。
NPC_LINE_MULE_1|传聞：The mule shifts under a patched pannier 和 flicks flies 從 its ears。
NPC_LINE_MULE_2|The mule snorts toward the open path, then remembers it dislikes paths too.
NPC_LINE_DOCK_RUMOR_1|传聞：Catch has been poor all week。 Reedwater shallows smell of 油。
NPC_LINE_DOCK_RUMOR_2|传聞：使用 plank 道路 through marsh。 Step off it 和 leeches 不到 you fast。
NPC_LINE_DOCK_RUMOR_3|传聞：Pulled 黑玻璃 grit 從 nets again。 Stuff chews rope 和 skin。
NPC_LINE_DOCK_RUMOR_4|The cellar moves crates after last watch. Anyone who hears it suddenly remembers chores.
NPC_LINE_DOCK_RUMOR_5|传聞：South 水 carries pale salt some mornings。 Tidehook says it comes 從 cliff cracks。
NPC_LINE_DOCK_RUMOR_6|传聞：A sailor swore he saw lanterns under cliff 水。 If you see lights there， call harbor 守衛。
NPC_LINE_PEASANT_STORE_1|传聞：Buy a ration before you leave。 Root chewing gets old before noon。
NPC_LINE_PEASANT_STORE_2|传聞：Food 和 lamp 油 first。 The shiny bits can wait till supper is packed。
NPC_LINE_PEASANT_STORE_3|传聞：Valoria markets have roofs， so they say。 Here we sell whatever rain spared。
NPC_LINE_PEASANT_ROAD_1|传聞：South 道路 is simple by daylight。 Make 營地 before dark if your legs are done。
NPC_LINE_PEASANT_ROAD_2|传聞：A 營地 kit is not an 旅店 位， but it keeps mud off your face。
NPC_LINE_PEASANT_ROAD_3|传聞：Stay on 道路 帶著 a loaded 檢包。 Hills slow you more than you think。
NPC_LINE_PEASANT_ROAD_4|传聞：Smoke on south 道路 could be a campfire 或 a wreck。 Look before you walk in。
NPC_LINE_PEASANT_DOCK_1|传聞：Garran keeps boats。 詢問 him for passage； shouting at 水 never helped。
NPC_LINE_PEASANT_DOCK_2|传聞：Never seen Valoria。 Folks say even poor can 不到 bread there。
NPC_LINE_PEASANT_DOCK_3|传聞：Armor is heavy， aye。 Still better than a blade through your shirt。
NPC_LINE_PEASANT_FIGHT_1|传聞：使用 your best trick early。 If you wait until you're surrounded， it is too late。
NPC_LINE_PEASANT_FIGHT_2|传聞：When two come at you， back up。 Make one stand in other's way。
NPC_LINE_PEASANT_FIGHT_3|传聞：Got a cut？ 使用 a bandage。 Blood on your boots just slows you down。
NPC_LINE_PEASANT_TRAVEL_1|传聞：Eat when your belly starts growling。 Hungry hands miss。
NPC_LINE_PEASANT_TRAVEL_2|传聞：Keep a torch dry。 Broken boards disappear after dusk。
NPC_LINE_PEASANT_TRAVEL_3|传聞：If you know a spell 或 fighting trick， 使用 it early。 哥布森 do not wait their turn。
NPC_LINE_HIGHMARK_PEASANT_1|Silver Lances pass at dawn. Sweepers know the order by spur marks alone.
NPC_LINE_HIGHMARK_PEASANT_2|传聞：White Seal？ North 神殿， lower steps。 Start there。
NPC_LINE_HIGHMARK_PEASANT_3|传聞：Stonecleft carts came in late again。 One had a split axle。
NPC_LINE_HIGHMARK_PEASANT_4|传聞：Keep clear when Lancers move in pairs。 They are not on parade。
NPC_LINE_HIGHMARK_PEASANT_5|传聞：Lyss keeps a clean 旅店。 Costs plenty， but sheets are clean。
NPC_LINE_HIGHMARK_PEASANT_6|传聞：Mountain pass takes nailed boots。 Snow covers loose shale。
NPC_LINE_HIGHMARK_PEASANT_7|传聞：Kestrel runners came in without spare packs。 營地 must be short on 口糧 或 bandages。
NPC_LINE_TRAVELLERS_REST_TRAVELLER_1|传聞：I stop here because next roof is past bridge track。 My boots are done for day。
NPC_LINE_TRAVELLERS_REST_TRAVELLER_2|传聞：The shop buys 道路 leftovers。 I sold a cracked helm there 和 bought a better knife。
NPC_LINE_TRAVELLERS_REST_TRAVELLER_3|传聞：Branna sets cups outside when weather holds。 Sit quick； good bench fills。
NPC_LINE_TRAVELLERS_REST_TRAVELLER_4|传聞：Fill your waterskin 和 check your straps before you leave。 Everyone forgets one of two。
NPC_LINE_TRAVELLERS_REST_TRAVELLER_5|传聞：South quay is empty now。 Empty 碼頭 still have rotten boards， so 守衛 your step。
NPC_LINE_TRAVELLERS_REST_TRAVELLER_6|传聞：West wood fog cuts a lantern down 到 arm's length。 Carry extra 油。
NPC_LINE_TRAVELLERS_REST_TRAVELLER_7|传聞：Man at next table says Rockmaw is abandoned。 His brother came back without a 檢包。
NPC_LINE_TRAVELLERS_REST_TRAVELLER_8|传聞：Saltmere fish taste bitter this season。 Cook blames grit 從 cliff caves。
NPC_LINE_TRAVELLERS_REST_RESEARCHER_1|传聞：These 道路 石頭 are older than 旅店。 The cuts do not match any Valorian measure I know。
NPC_LINE_TRAVELLERS_REST_RESEARCHER_2|传聞：The well has three repairs in three 石頭。 Someone kept this stop alive for a long time。
NPC_LINE_TRAVELLERS_REST_RESEARCHER_3|传聞：Marked 石頭 或 sealed glass？ 帶回 it 到 me before you scrape it clean。
NPC_LINE_TRAVELLERS_REST_RESEARCHER_4|传聞：Stonecleft Pass has two carved dates on one arch。 The masons reused first arch。
NPC_LINE_TRAVELLERS_REST_RESEARCHER_5|传聞：Ghostwood chips smell of ash， but bark is not burned。 I would like a cleaner sample。
NPC_LINE_TRAVELLERS_REST_SHADY_1|传聞：Waiting on a wagon。 Drink your ale 和 let me drink mine。
NPC_LINE_TRAVELLERS_REST_SHADY_2|传聞：Second ale loosens wagon tongues。 Buyers， routes， guard names。 Useful noise。
NPC_LINE_TRAVELLERS_REST_SHADY_3|传聞：Bandits do not wear colors in here。 Neither do smugglers。
NPC_LINE_TIDEHOOK_NETMENDER_1|传聞：Net's torn again。 East rocks shred twine faster than we sell fish。
NPC_LINE_TIDEHOOK_NETMENDER_2|传聞：Keep your boots clear of east rocks。 One bad step puts you in deep 水。
NPC_LINE_TIDEHOOK_NETMENDER_3|传聞：Kethra's spears cost 錢。 洞穴 fishers snapped two cheap shafts this week。
NPC_LINE_TIDEHOOK_NETMENDER_4|传聞：Saltmere went flat under a north wind。 We kept small boats tied all morning。
NPC_LINE_TIDEHOOK_NETMENDER_5|传聞：White shapes under cliff are 石頭 unless they move。 If they move， shout。
NPC_LINE_PORTER_1|传聞：Lamp 油 goes 到 White Seal first today。 Flour waits until I get 封護 mark。
NPC_LINE_PORTER_2|传聞：Highmark loads changed this month： more grain， less iron， more lamp 油。
NPC_LINE_PORTER_3|Scar camps call for rope every hour. Rope, then hands, then more rope.
NPC_LINE_LABORER_1|传聞：大門 clerk sent these crates east， then west。 Same 封護， same boxes， my back twice。
NPC_LINE_LABORER_2|传聞：Stonecleft carts came in 帶著 split wheel rims。 If you need north 道路， 守衛 for loose iron by ruts。
NPC_LINE_LABORER_3|Eastern-road loads leave before the count is full. Better late crates than lost backs.
NPC_LINE_PILGRIM_1|传聞：Priests take names on left stair before dawn。 Wounds by basin， charms at table。
NPC_LINE_PILGRIM_2|Three altar marks wake the plain charm. The first is hope. The second is blisters.
NPC_LINE_PILGRIM_3|传聞：I saw fresh wheel ruts by Roadside 神龛 和 one broken cart。 Step wide where mud 回合 black。
NPC_LINE_STABLEHAND_1|传聞：The mules care about oats， clean tack， 和 whether you know not 到 stand behind them。
NPC_LINE_STABLEHAND_2|传聞：Cart teams get oats before saddle horses today。 Bought stall space？ Check chalk mark on 大門。
NPC_LINE_STABLEHAND_3|传聞：Two horses came in lathered 從 south 道路 before noon。 Water any mount slow， 或 it founders。
NPC_LINE_HIGHMARK_PRIEST_1|传聞：Charm blanks come 到 this cloth。 Relic claims go 到 Tovan Mere 或 High Canon。
NPC_LINE_HIGHMARK_PRIEST_2|传聞：Pilgrims line lower steps before dawn。 Most forget 油， breakfast， 或 a 房間 帶著 a lock。
NPC_LINE_HIGHMARK_PRIEST_3|The square clears at dusk because the old seal still listens. We try not to waste its attention.
DIALOGUE_HIGHMARK_PRIEST_PILGRIMAGE_START_CHARM|對話：Traveler， wait a moment。 This blank 護符 will not hold White Seal yet。 It needs 道路 marks first。 拾上 it。
DIALOGUE_HIGHMARK_PRIEST_PILGRIMAGE_START_ROUTE|對話：Touch it 到 Havenford's 供壇， Roadside 神龛， 和 Reedmire 神龛。 When all three marks show， bring it back 到 this cloth。
DIALOGUE_HIGHMARK_PRIEST_PILGRIMAGE_REPLACE_CHARM|對話：Lost 護符？ 我可可 cut one more blank。 Carry it 到 whichever first altars are still unmarked， then bring it back。
DIALOGUE_HIGHMARK_PRIEST_PILGRIMAGE_BLESS_HANDIN|The marks are set. The charm is blessed for Oldroot. Take it to the altar there.
DIALOGUE_HIGHMARK_PRIEST_PILGRIMAGE_OLDROOT_REMINDER|對話：Oldroot Temple is next mark。 Touch dormant 護符 到 its 供壇， then return if 護符 wakes。
DIALOGUE_HIGHMARK_PRIEST_PILGRIMAGE_FINAL_HANDIN|對話：Oldroot took last mark。 Set 護符 down； 我會 close rite before wax cools。
DIALOGUE_HIGHMARK_PRIEST_PILGRIMAGE_FINAL_BLESSING|The finished charm is yours now. Its blessing should hold better on the road.
DIALOGUE_HIGHMARK_PRIEST_PILGRIMAGE_COMPLETE_IDLE|對話：Your 護符 is filed 和 sealed。 I cannot run same pilgrimage twice for one name。
NPC_LINE_HIGHMARK_LANCER_1|传聞：North 大門 reports come by horn 和 runner。 Smoke on cliff 道路 goes on my board first。
NPC_LINE_HIGHMARK_LANCER_2|传聞：White Seal steps stay clear until someone brings in a cursed relic。 Then I need two lancers 和 no crowd。
NPC_LINE_HIGHMARK_LANCER_3|传聞：West doors close at horn call。 Buy before dusk 或 不到 a wall outside。
NPC_LINE_HIGHMARK_LANCER_4|传聞：North pass is rough this week。 Scouts lose time there， 和 carts come back 帶著 split rims。
NPC_LINE_HIGHMARK_RESEARCHER_1|传聞：Canon marked shelf three study only。 If you pull vellum， put red weight back on it。
NPC_LINE_HIGHMARK_RESEARCHER_2|White Seal genealogy, ritual, and confession often share one page. The margins are usually the dangerous part.
NPC_LINE_HIGHMARK_RESEARCHER_3|传聞：Clean spellbooks are on upper shelf。 Cheap copies have blue corrections。
NPC_LINE_HIGHMARK_RESEARCHER_4|传聞：Scar maps go on north lectern。 Do not mix them 帶著 神龛 copies。
NPC_LINE_HIGHMARK_RESEARCHER_5|传聞：Telwynd grove notes marked 'sealed for safety' need ward maps beside them。
