DIALOGUE_ALDREN_POST_WATCHTOWER_IDLE|車隊又能通行了，眼下看起來暫時安全。但我們還在做準備。
DIALOGUE_ALDREN_CAVE_CHIEF_TURNIN|You did it. With the chieftain dead, the goblins lose their nerve and our militia can drive off the stragglers. The farms can mend fences instead of burying stock, and perhaps carts will dare the road to Traveller's Rest again. Take your reward with my thanks, friend.
DIALOGUE_ALDREN_CAVE_CHIEF_TURNIN_HALF_ORC|You did the work, and Havenford is safer for it. Some here will still watch your tusks before your deeds; let them watch this deed too. Take the pay. Garrick may have harder work if you want it.
DIALOGUE_ALDREN_CAVE_CHIEF_REMINDER|Goblin Cave就在東邊，離這裡不遠。殺了他們的首領。
DIALOGUE_ALDREN_CAVE_CHIEF_START|歡迎你，旅人。Havenford正值艱難年月。東嶺洞穴裡的哥布林一直襲擊農場，撕毀柵欄，擄走牲畜。牠們不像普通洞穴害獸那樣散亂，裡面有人在驅使牠們。如果你能殺掉那個首領，我們會拿出村子能湊出的報酬。先帶上這些金幣和藥水，能活著回來就回來。
DIALOGUE_ALDREN_CAVE_CHIEF_START_HALF_ORC|旅人。我不會假裝這裡的人對你的族類毫無芥蒂，但工作就是工作，危險就是危險。東邊洞穴的哥布林在首領帶領下襲擊我們的農場。殺了他，Havenford會公平付酬。
DIALOGUE_MAELIN_SHRINE_SUPPLIES_AFTER_CAVE_CHIEF|對話：Goblin 洞穴 is quiet， 和 chapel line is smaller today。 我有 bandages， 神聖 symbols， 藥水， 和 scrolls。 What do you need？
DIALOGUE_MAELIN_SHRINE_SUPPLIES_BEFORE_CAVE_CHIEF|對話：The chapel cupboards are thin， but I still keep bandages， blessings， 和 藥水 for travelers。 What aid do you need before 道路？
DIALOGUE_VETHRIN_REEDMIRE_COMPLETE_IDLE|我很忙。拜託，去和矮人喝杯麥酒什麼的吧。
DIALOGUE_VETHRIN_REEDMIRE_TURNIN|所以祭壇被舊魔法詛咒了。謝謝。我得查清這事怎麼發生的。拿著，這是給你幫忙的回報。
DIALOGUE_VETHRIN_REEDMIRE_REMINDER|把 Reedmire 的事辦完。把我的便條交給 Reth，安放神龕石，等那怪物死後把答覆帶回來。
DIALOGUE_VETHRIN_NOTE_REPLACEMENT|你把信弄丟了？當然。我就是為這種事留了副本。把這封帶給Reedwater Docks的Reth Oskel。
DIALOGUE_VETHRIN_TOO_GREEN|請別打擾我，我需要準備一些東西。
DIALOGUE_VETHRIN_COTTAGE_TOO_GREEN|Please leave me to my research for now.
DIALOGUE_VETHRIN_COTTAGE_START|I need someone steady to look over the burned cottage. The fire was not ordinary; the ash still carries a magical trace, and the wolves around the ruin are not acting normal. Check the place carefully, then bring me whatever you find.
DIALOGUE_VETHRIN_COTTAGE_REMINDER|The burned cottage still needs eyes on it. Search the ruin carefully, then bring me whatever explains that fire. Watch the wolves; they are not acting normal.
DIALOGUE_VETHRIN_COTTAGE_TURNIN|Water glyphs under a burned house. Peculiar. This reminds me of a tale I overheard from Reth Oskel, one of the fishermen at Reedwater. I thought ale was doing most of the talking, but perhaps not. Take this spellbook; practical payment is harder to misread than theory.
DIALOGUE_VETHRIN_COTTAGE_REEDMIRE_WAIT|I need to do more research on this. Come see me again later.
DIALOGUE_VETHRIN_REEDMIRE_START|Reth Oskel is the fisherman. He spoke of stone piles around Reedmire Shrine and water moving against the wind. Take this sealed note to him at Reedwater Docks and get his account directly. If his story matches the cottage markings, the shrine may be worse than an old flooded altar.
DIALOGUE_TESSA_TRAIL_GEAR_AFTER_CAVE_CHIEF|哥布林襲擊少下來後，我能擺出來的裝備多多了。背包、繩子、燈油、陷阱。你缺什麼？
DIALOGUE_TESSA_TRAIL_GEAR_BEFORE_CAVE_CHIEF|對話：Heading east？ Rations， rope， lamp 油， traps， 和 packs are on rack。 What are you short on？
DIALOGUE_BRANNOC_FORGE_STOCK|Forge is open for business. Leather and steel, get what you need.
DIALOGUE_HAVENFORD_WATCH_DONE|對話：No 打開 board today。 Havenford Watch has paid every signed mark 我有。
DIALOGUE_HAVENFORD_WATCH_SKRIT_TURNIN|Skrit死了？好。沒有牠們的群首，狗頭人會四散，只能小口咬人。Havenford又欠你一次。
DIALOGUE_HAVENFORD_WATCH_SKRIT_REMINDER|Hail Adventurer. Skrit still needs ending.
DIALOGUE_HAVENFORD_WATCH_BONES_TURNIN|幹得好。墓骨是陰森的報酬憑證，但能證明死者已經倒下。我們追查到狗頭人的麻煩在廢塔以北，通往舊山間工地。牠們的群首Skrit藏在那裡。找到他，把這件事徹底結束。
DIALOGUE_HAVENFORD_WATCH_BONES_REMINDER|對話：I need 二十 grave bones， not a story。 Skeletons 和 僵屍 count。 帶回 bones back 到 my board。
DIALOGUE_HAVENFORD_WATCH_SCALPS_TURNIN|幹得漂亮。每一張狗頭人頭皮，都少一把割向車輪的刀。這片土地在變化，而且不只是哥布林。舊土裡有不死者爬起。見到就打碎，帶墓骨作證，我會再付你報酬。
DIALOGUE_HAVENFORD_WATCH_SCALPS_REMINDER|kobold 仍在擾亂道路。有頭皮時就帶回來。
DIALOGUE_HAVENFORD_WATCH_START|你好，冒險者。Havenford需要清理道路，你看起來能幫上忙。殺掉二十個狗頭人，把牠們的頭皮帶給我，就能從守衛金庫拿報酬。
DIALOGUE_HAVENFORD_WATCH_START_HALF_ORC|日安。Havenford需要清理道路，你看起來很能幹。殺掉二十個狗頭人，把牠們的頭皮帶給我，就會拿到報酬。
DIALOGUE_KINGS_BARROW_DONE|Kingsmark 你留著。Theryn 的解讀、你的古墓報告，還有足夠的墨水，都夠我寫完記錄了。
DIALOGUE_KINGS_BARROW_RING_TURNIN|對話：Kingsmark came out of royal sarcophagus， then。 Theryn's phrase worked， King Halric was named， 和 tomb held 戒指。\nKeep it。 I came for account， not a dead king's jewelry。
DIALOGUE_KINGS_BARROW_SARCOPHAGUS_REMINDER|對話：King Halric is down。 打開 royal sarcophagus before you leave； Kingsmark should be in king's hand。
DIALOGUE_KINGS_BARROW_EXPEDITION_REMINDER|對話：Theryn gave you phrase。 King's Barrow is south of Highmark in old Havenford March。 Enter tomb， 擊敗 King Halric， 和 打開 royal sarcophagus for Kingsmark。
DIALOGUE_KINGS_BARROW_PHRASE_CONFIRMED|對話：Theryn read it， then。 Good。 The phrase opens barrow door， but it will not clear tomb for you。\nKing's Barrow is south of Highmark in old Havenford March。 Go in， 擊敗 King Halric， then 打開 royal sarcophagus 和 take Kingsmark。 帶回 account back 到 me in Highmark after Kingsmark is out。
DIALOGUE_KINGS_BARROW_MANUSCRIPT_REPLACEMENT|對話：The 手稿 is gone 從 your 檢包。 I keep a second rubbing because couriers lose bags。 拾上這個 copy 到 Old Theryn Rusk in Havenford。
DIALOGUE_KINGS_BARROW_MANUSCRIPT_REMINDER|對話：拾上 Edran's 手稿 到 Old Theryn Rusk in Havenford's south house。 Do not try King's Barrow phrase until Theryn has read copy。
DIALOGUE_KINGS_BARROW_TOO_GREEN|No commission from me today. The work I need is hard road work, not a first Highmark errand.
DIALOGUE_KINGS_BARROW_START|對話：I am Edran Vale。 Every 神龛 clerk in Highmark wants 到 test this phrase at tomb door， so I need a courier 帶著 sense。\nI copied words 從 King's Barrow， south of Highmark。 The hand is old March script， 和 Old Theryn Rusk in Havenford knew that script before I was born。\nTake this 手稿 到 Theryn's south house 和 have him read phrase。 If he confirms it， bring answer back 到 me in Highmark。 I need account； if Kingsmark is truly inside， I am not asking for 戒指。
DIALOGUE_RETH_REEDMIRE_DONE|對話：Vethrin has his 報報。 Reedmire 神龛 is quiet again。 Good。 我會 keep 到 my nets。 Let Vethrin study 石頭。
DIALOGUE_RETH_NHALOR_SLAIN|對話：Nhalor is dead？ Good。 拾上 news 到 Vethrin in Havenford。 I am done 帶著 Reedmire 和 his questions。
DIALOGUE_RETH_REEDMIRE_REMINDER|神龕的事還沒完。每堆石上放一塊光滑石頭；如果 Nhalor 起身，就在離開前殺了它。
DIALOGUE_RETH_NOTE_HANDIN|Vethrin的信。石頭歸你了。每堆放一顆。
DIALOGUE_RETH_NO_QUEST_IDLE|對話：Vethrin wants Reedmire numbers？ He can send his 封護 first。 Until then， 我有 nets 到 mend。
DIALOGUE_THAULD_CORPSE_REPORT|蓄水池裡有個死漁夫？真是糟蹋。他現在用不上這個了。拿去吧，用得比黑暗更好些。
DIALOGUE_THAULD_ARRIVAL_HANDOFF|這場風暴夠狠。你們都活著過來就好。不過這條船一時半會兒哪也去不了。Garran跟我說了你的事，前頭可不太平。聽著，走內陸路往東去Havenford。別離開大路，那樣安全些。要是需要休息或者買補給，出發前先辦好。
DIALOGUE_THAULD_DOCK_REMINDER|我沒別的能幫你了，孩子。去Havenford。
DIALOGUE_RAT_CELLAR_DONE|對話：The cellar is quiet。 Grain sacks are staying shut。 If you 打開 that hatch again， bring your own boots。
DIALOGUE_RAT_CELLAR_TURNIN|大的死了？好。這樣巢就散了。趁我還沒把錢花在新穀子上，拿走報酬。
DIALOGUE_RAT_CELLAR_REMINDER|對話：Back 房間 hatch， straight down。 殺死 big cellar 老鼠 和 clear 老鼠 off grain sacks， then come back 到 me。
DIALOGUE_RAT_CELLAR_START|地窖被老鼠占了，下面有一隻大家伙，讓其餘的也膽大起來。殺掉那隻大的，我就付錢。
DIALOGUE_MIRA_DOCKSIDE_STOCK|對話：Need 道路 kit？ Bread， lamp 油， first aid， cheap knives， 和 cudgels。 Dock prices， no long haggling。
DIALOGUE_MARN_BUNK_AVAILABLE|對話：Come in if you need a dry bunk。 Stew is hot， blankets are clean enough， 和 Havenford 道路 is still rough after storm。
DIALOGUE_MARN_HALF_ORC|對話：Stable cot is 打開。 Same price， paid now。 Keep quiet 和 我會 keep 房間 clear。
DIALOGUE_VOSK_ROUTE_CLOSED|我正忙著呢，除非你想幫我拉那根繩子。
DIALOGUE_VOSK_WAITING_MARK|Tidehook的Veysha船長說她會找條安全航道。我可不抱太大希望。
DIALOGUE_VOSK_TIDEHOOK_ROUTE_OPEN|去Tidehook的路看著又通了。你要是想去，我能讓你上下一艘小艇。
DIALOGUE_VEYSHA_SKIFF_READY|對話：Hold there， traveler。 No 小小 葉片 Tidehook until I check knots 和 tide marks。
DIALOGUE_VEYSHA_CHANNEL_WARNING|對話：Bound for Reedwater？ Quade takes fare by 小小。 Pay him， sit still， 和 do not crowd rail。
DIALOGUE_QUADE_REEDWATER_ROUTE_OPEN|Reedwater？一百金幣。在這兒付錢，上小艇，然後祈禱別沉到海底去。
DIALOGUE_KETHRA_RACK_OPEN|對話：Looking for reach？ Spears on rack， halberds in corner， nets by coil。 Try weight before you 報酬。
DIALOGUE_NESKA_TAVERN_FOOD|對話：Come in， if you can 不到 a dry stool。 Beer by mug， 口糧 by bundle， 營地 kits under counter。 What will it be？
DIALOGUE_BRAN_DELIVERY_DONE|對話：Orrick sent word。 The parcel reached Traveller's Rest， 和 he paid you？ Good。 I owe you a beer once I get these nets tied。
DIALOGUE_BRAN_PARCEL_REMINDER|這個包裹是給Traveller's Rest的Orrick的。走內陸路，別弄濕。
DIALOGUE_BRAN_PARCEL_REPLACEMENT|對話：Lost it？ Gods。 Hold still， 我可可 tie another。 拾上這個 parcel 到 Orrick Fen at Traveller's Rest。
DIALOGUE_BRAN_BEER_REMINDER|我這兒還是乾得很。酒館近得我都能聞到桶味。
DIALOGUE_BRAN_BEER_START|我的杯子空了，兩隻手又全在補破網。給我帶一杯啤酒來，我會好好記住你的臉。
DIALOGUE_BRAN_BEER_HANDIN_PARCEL|這就對了。現在辦個更好的差事：把包裹送到Traveller's Rest的Orrick。走內陸路，能保持乾燥就盡量別弄濕。
DIALOGUE_NELL_ROOM_AVAILABLE|對話：Come in， dear。 Kettle is on， two rooms are taken， 和 I still have clean blankets in back 房間。 Need a 位 或 just supper？
DIALOGUE_LYSS_ROOM_AVAILABLE|Private rooms by night. Pay up front and rest quiet.
DIALOGUE_STONECLEFT_INNKEEPER_BED_AVAILABLE|對話：In 帶著 you， then。 Beds are made， bread is hot， 和 ale is strong enough for miners coming off shift。 Need a 位 under Stonecleft roof？
DIALOGUE_NELL_HALF_ORC|對話：For you， 我有 back cot by kitchen door。 Same 錢， paid now。 Keep quiet there， 和 我會 keep taproom off your back。
DIALOGUE_LYSS_HALF_ORC|Room for coin. Pay the house and keep quiet.
DIALOGUE_STONECLEFT_INNKEEPER_HALF_ORC|對話：Coin first， half-獸人。 The outer 房間 is 打開， bread is hot， 和 no one touches a paid 房間 under my roof。 Need it？
DIALOGUE_STONECLEFT_GATEHALL_LAMP_DONE|對話：Sellan's load is packed 和 gone upstairs。 Good。 Gatehall shelves have 用物 和 油 again； say what you need。
DIALOGUE_STONECLEFT_GATEHALL_SHOP|對話：Gatehall supplies： 油， rope， 用物， bandages， 和 repair tackle。 Buy before you leave Stonecleft's doors。
DIALOGUE_STONECLEFT_SUPPLY_LAMP_DONE|對話：Harl sent his mark。 The gatehall has 用物 和 油， 和 my count is clean again。
DIALOGUE_STONECLEFT_SUPPLY_SHOP|對話：Lamp 油， rope， bandages， dry 用物， 和 spare tackle。 Count your 檢包 before lower stairs。
DIALOGUE_BRANNA_BED_AVAILABLE|對話：Come in 和 close door。 Rooms are clean， cups are mostly clean， 和 我有 keys if your 錢 is good。 Need a 位？
DIALOGUE_BRANNA_HALF_ORC|對話：Back 房間 is 打開。 Coin first。 Keep your 檢包 by wall 和 我會 keep regulars out of your face。
DIALOGUE_ORRICK_PARCEL_TURNIN|Bran的包裹，總算到了。好。我能在墨水乾兩遍前把這筆帳結掉。
DIALOGUE_ORRICK_OLD_CAVE_DONE|對話：Your Old 洞穴 報報 is already useful。 我有 rope 和 油 by door now， 和 travelers 詢問 questions before taking east 道路。
DIALOGUE_ORRICK_MIXED_GOODS|油、食物、皮帶、便宜鋼器。給忘了重要東西的旅人準備的雜貨。
DIALOGUE_ORRICK_OLD_CAVE_TURNIN|你到過下層廳堂了？那舊洞穴就算查清了，我的擔心也有了底。這裡是報酬。
DIALOGUE_ORRICK_OLD_CAVE_REMINDER|對話：Old 洞穴 is east of Traveller's Rest。 I need a 報報 從 bottom floor， not first 房間。 帶给我 what you saw 和 come back in one piece。
DIALOGUE_ORRICK_TOO_GREEN|Not that errand today. Buy food, oil, and rope if you need them; smaller work is wiser for now.
DIALOGUE_ORRICK_OLD_CAVE_START|附近的舊洞穴吞進了不少傳聞，卻什麼也沒吐回來。到下層廳堂去，看看那裡等著什麼，我會為答案付錢。
DIALOGUE_CALDUS_DOCKS_DONE|Krosh is dead, and the northeast peninsula is quieter for it. Traveller's Rest can send armed riders that way again. If you go back, watch the basements.
DIALOGUE_CALDUS_DOCKS_DONE_HALF_ORC|Krosh is dead. Good work, whatever the yard says. Armed riders can use the northeast peninsula again. Watch the basements if you go back.
DIALOGUE_CALDUS_DOCKS_TURNIN|對話：Krosh is dead？ Then Desolate 碼頭 have one less 獸人 giving orders。 Stand easy。 You did work I could not finish。
DIALOGUE_CALDUS_DOCKS_TURNIN_HALF_ORC|對話：Krosh is dead by your hand？ Then you did work。 Stand easy。 我會 say it plainly if anyone asks。
DIALOGUE_CALDUS_DOCKS_PAY|碼頭清乾淨了。拿報酬吧；掙來的錢比空許諾更乾淨。
DIALOGUE_CALDUS_DOCKS_PAY_HALF_ORC|碼頭清乾淨了。拿你的報酬。你掙來的，不管屋裡的人願不願意承認。
DIALOGUE_CALDUS_DOCKS_REMINDER|Desolate Docks, on the peninsula northeast of Traveller's Rest. Find Krosh in the occupied basements and kill him. Do not come back with salvage stories.
DIALOGUE_CALDUS_DOCKS_REMINDER_HALF_ORC|Find Krosh in the Desolate Docks basements, on the peninsula northeast of Traveller's Rest, and kill him. That is the work.
DIALOGUE_CALDUS_DOCKS_TOO_GREEN|Not yet. The docks are bad ground today. Take smaller work first.
DIALOGUE_CALDUS_DOCKS_TOO_GREEN_HALF_ORC|Not yet. Same answer I would give anyone: the docks are bad ground today.
DIALOGUE_CALDUS_DOCKS_START|獸人占著Desolate Docks，Krosh讓他們更加猖狂。清掉那片地，殺掉他們的首領，報酬就是你的。
DIALOGUE_CALDUS_DOCKS_START_HALF_ORC|獸人占著Desolate Docks。我不會問是哪一邊的血教會你戰爭。殺掉Krosh，把他們清走，我會付錢。
DIALOGUE_VELRA_ASH_DONE|對話：The Ashen 戒指 is yours。 Do not let every hedge mage handle it； Rhazvek's scale did hard work， 和 I did expensive work。
DIALOGUE_VELRA_ARCANE_CASE|對話：Scrolls， wands， mana draughts， charms， 和 rings。 Look 帶著 your eyes first； case stays latched until I 打開 it。
DIALOGUE_VELRA_ASH_TURNIN|對話：There it is， Rhazvek's scale。 Warm， whole， 和 mine for moment。 Set it on cloth； 我可可 finish Ashen 戒指。
DIALOGUE_VELRA_ASH_REMINDER|Ash Tower lies east-southeast of Traveller's Rest. Rhazvek, one drake scale. You have the fire potions and cold wand; bring me the scale.
DIALOGUE_VELRA_ASH_TOO_GREEN|Not that commission. Not yet. Buy a small scroll and keep to smaller trouble for now.
DIALOGUE_VELRA_ASH_START|年輕的紅色龍獸Rhazvek把Ash Tower當成棲處。給我帶他的一片鱗，我就用Ashen Ring交換。
DIALOGUE_DORRAN_CORE_HANDIN|那就是核心。以所有好錘子作證，我還以為灰矮人出於惡意把它埋了。符文爐能修好，但需要時間和熱度。
DIALOGUE_DORRAN_DUERGAR_DONE_REWARD|對話：Here is your 錢 和 a marked piece 從 rack。 If 矮人人 come north again， Stonecleft will be ready。
DIALOGUE_DORRAN_OLD_MINEWORKS_START|Vargrom仍然控制著Old Mineworks。符文爐喉頭還貼著灰矮人守衛的呼吸，這算不上勝利。了結他。
DIALOGUE_DORRAN_VARGROM_TURNIN|對話：Vargrom is dead？ Good。 That 葉片 his relay without a foreman。
DIALOGUE_DORRAN_REPAIRED_STOCK|對話：Runeforge is holding steady。 Marked stock is back on counter。
DIALOGUE_DORRAN_REPAIRED_VARGROM_REMINDER|The runeforge is lit, but Vargrom still holds the works.
DIALOGUE_DORRAN_REPAIR_WAITING|對話：The core is set。 The heat is not steady yet， 和 I do not sell marked steel on a weak burn。
DIALOGUE_DORRAN_CORE_LOCATION_FOUND|死掉的灰矮人帶著核心。趁被洪水浸染的東西把它拖得更深之前，把它帶上來。
DIALOGUE_DORRAN_VALVE_REMINDER|在Floodgate Cistern使用刻符手柄。它會打開下層水閘；核心應該就在後面。
DIALOGUE_DORRAN_RUNEFORGE_START|Stonecleft has another problem. The Runeforge Core is missing, and Floodgate Cistern is the best lead. Take this runed valve handle, open the lower sluice, and bring the core back.
DIALOGUE_DORRAN_ARMORY_CLOSED|對話：Magic armory is shut。 The runeforge is cold。 我可可 mend plain 裝備， but marked steel stays off counter。
DIALOGUE_STONECLEFT_SURFACE_GUARD_STAIR_OPENED|Door is open. Follow the chalked stairs down to the Commons; the side doors are work rooms.
DIALOGUE_STONECLEFT_SURFACE_GUARD_STAIR_ALREADY_OPEN|Stair door is open. Down to the Commons; leave the work-room doors alone.
DIALOGUE_STONECLEFT_SURFACE_GUARD_STAIR_UNAUTHORIZED|Need the stair door? Say so. I do not leave iron unlatched for curious merchants.
DIALOGUE_STONECLEFT_SURFACE_GUARD_TURN_BACK|State your business at the gatehall. If you have none, stay on the surface level.
DIALOGUE_STONECLEFT_DEEP_GUARD_DWARF_UNAUTHORIZED|Lower gate is sealed. Clan blood does not move it; Thrunna does.
DIALOGUE_STONECLEFT_DEEP_GUARD_DWARF_WAIT_WARDENS|對話：拾上 it 到 his forge in commons。 Until then， buy， sleep， 或 stand clear of my chain。
DIALOGUE_STONECLEFT_DEEP_GUARD_OUTSIDER_UNAUTHORIZED|Lower gate is sealed. Stonecleft has not opened the pass to guests.
DIALOGUE_STONECLEFT_DEEP_GUARD_OUTSIDER_WAIT_WARDENS|對話：拾上 your Highmark business 到 his forge in commons。 Until then， buy， sleep， 或 stand clear of my chain。
DIALOGUE_STONECLEFT_DEEP_GUARD_DWARF_GATE_OPENED|North gate is opening, cousin. Keep north through the Underway and keep your lamp trimmed.
DIALOGUE_STONECLEFT_DEEP_GUARD_OUTSIDER_GATE_OPENED|North gate is opening, traveler. Keep north through the Underway and stay out of the work cuts.
DIALOGUE_STONECLEFT_DEEP_GUARD_GATE_ALREADY_OPEN|Lower gate is clear. The Underway runs north.
DIALOGUE_STONECLEFT_DEEP_GUARD_POST_OPEN|對話：This post is not for gawking。 State your business at 大門 或 keep walking。
DIALOGUE_NAERYS_GUEST_MAT_AVAILABLE|Guest mats wait. Pay the warden and rest within the veil.
DIALOGUE_NAERYS_HALF_ORC|Bed for coin. Pay and rest. The veil keeps its own.
DIALOGUE_SARN_MARKET_STALL|Road kit, dry straps, cart cloth, and no temple prices. Tell me what broke before you ask what is cheap.
DIALOGUE_BRETHRA_PROVISION_STALL|Oil is sealed, rope is measured, kits are packed for travel. Buy what you can carry and do not unstack my coils.
DIALOGUE_MAVETH_APOTHECARY_OLDROOT_DONE|對話：The oldroot batch held。 Stronger healing 和 resistance bottles are on shelf。 Point before you unstopper anything green。
DIALOGUE_MAVETH_APOTHECARY_OLDROOT_TURNIN|Six leaves, whole and dark. Good. The bitter edge is still there.\nTake this pay and this restoration potion. Once I grind the rest, stronger bottles go on the shelf.
DIALOGUE_MAVETH_APOTHECARY_OLDROOT_REMINDER|對話：Oldroot Temple。 Six usable 葉片。 Cut dark 葉片 從 living oldroot； loose floor growth is trash。
DIALOGUE_MAVETH_APOTHECARY_OLDROOT_START|Careful. Those bottles are sealed tight. Highmark caravans bought through my strong stock, and my Oldroot gatherer came back fevered.\nI need six whole oldroot leaves from Oldroot Temple. Cut dark leaves from living oldroot, not floor growth. Bring them back and I will pay coin and a restoration potion.
DIALOGUE_MAVETH_APOTHECARY_CASE|對話：Sealed draughts， dated salves， clean corks。 The glowing bottles stay behind counter。 Say what hurts 或 browse like you mean 到 buy。
DIALOGUE_JAETH_BOWYER_RACK|對話：Need arrows？ Straight shafts on left， bolts by case， bowstrings waxed this morning。 Crossbow cranks are under counter； 詢問 before you put a hand on one。
DIALOGUE_NERRIK_DRAUGHT_DONE|The perfect draught is finished. If you have blackglass fragments, the worktable can make more elixirs. Do not touch the brown bottle.
DIALOGUE_NERRIK_TABLE_WARNING|對話：Stop there。 Left tray is tincture， right tray is 酸液 wash， 和 brown bottle is mine。 詢問 before your sleeve touches anything。
DIALOGUE_NERRIK_DRAUGHT_START|You. Good, careful hands. I am working toward a perfect draught, but I need preserved monster samples first.\nTake these jars of preservation ointment. Use one on a fresh corpse, or throw one at the creature before you kill it.\nBring me the samples and I can make them into elixirs. With these samples I can slowly perfect the recipe.
DIALOGUE_NERRIK_DRAUGHT_SAMPLE|A preserved {0} corpse. Good. Still tight, still useful. I can cut a clean sample from this.
DIALOGUE_NERRIK_DRAUGHT_BATCH|This sample settles the {0} mixture. Take the elixir; I only need a shaving for the next draft.
DIALOGUE_NERRIK_DRAUGHT_FINAL|Good. The perfect draught holds together. Drink it here while the blackglass is still quiet.
DIALOGUE_NERRIK_DRAUGHT_NEED_OINTMENT|You need preservation ointment before hunting the next sample. Maveth sometimes sells jars, and curio shelves may have them.
DIALOGUE_NERRIK_DRAUGHT_USE_OINTMENT|Use the ointment before rot starts. Rub it into the fresh corpse I named, or throw the jar at that creature before the kill.
DIALOGUE_NERRIK_DRAUGHT_TARGET|Next sample: preserve a {0} corpse and bring it back to me.
DIALOGUE_NERRIK_DRAUGHT_FINAL_TARGET|For the last draught, bring me a preserved adult dragon corpse and one blackglass shard. Young dragons will not do.
DIALOGUE_NERRIK_DRAUGHT_FINAL_SAMPLE|An adult dragon sample and a blackglass shard. Good. That is enough body and enough bite for the final mix.
DIALOGUE_NERRIK_DRAUGHT_FINAL_NEED_SHARD|The dragon sample is usable. Now bring one blackglass shard; the final draught needs something hard enough to hold the change.
DIALOGUE_NERRIK_DRAUGHT_FINAL_NEED_SAMPLE|The last sample must come from an adult dragon or older. Preserve the corpse and bring it here with one blackglass shard.
DIALOGUE_AELRION_THREAD_DONE|對話：The moonwell strings are holding。 The upgraded rack is stocked。 Keep finished bows dry， 或 buy another string。
DIALOGUE_AELRION_THREAD_TURNIN|六股線，沒有一股磨散。很好。這些能撐住一張戰弓。\n拿上這筆錢和這張弓。剩下的我會擰進升級貨架。
DIALOGUE_AELRION_THREAD_REMINDER|對話：Moonwell Observatory still has what I need。 帶回 six strands 從 cult dead， specter rooms， 或 caught 線 near old frame。
DIALOGUE_AELRION_THREAD_START|在看好貨架？那我告訴你為什麼它還不夠好。我最好的弓弦只是普通腸線，而西路正在打開。\nMoonwell 線在潮濕、寒冷和粗暴使用下也能撐住弓。從 Moonwell Observatory 帶六股回來；死掉的教徒、幽影房間和舊框架旁纏住的線裡都能找到。我付錢，還給你做一張弓。
DIALOGUE_AELRION_BOWYER_RACK|對話：Dry yew， waxed strings， counted arrowheads。 Keep wet gloves off finished bows。
DIALOGUE_LANCER_ORDERS_DONE|Vaust heard the message? Good. Kestrel can post scouts with current routes instead of last week's guesswork.
DIALOGUE_LANCER_ORDERS_REMINDER|Captain Vaust Thane at Camp Kestrel needs the Highmark message. Put it in his hand, not on a camp table.
DIALOGUE_LANCER_HARPIES_TURNIN|Twelve harpies confirmed. Good work. North road scouts can look at tracks again instead of the sky. I have your pay; next board is ogres.
DIALOGUE_LANCER_OGRES_TURNIN|Eight ogres confirmed. Hill road carts can move without a double guard. I have your pay; next board is hill giants.
DIALOGUE_LANCER_GIANTS_TURNIN|確認兩個 hill giant 已死。Highmark 可以把旗隊和補給車重新派回山路。拿你的報酬；軍械庫還加了一件護甲。
DIALOGUE_LANCER_NORTHERN_REMINDER|Northern ground still needs clearing. Keep the count.
DIALOGUE_LANCER_NORTHERN_START|Greycliff Quarry is west of Highmark, and harpies are dragging scouts off the quarry road and the cliff routes toward Telwynd. Clear the harpies, then report back. I pay in coin.
DIALOGUE_OSKARN_CURIO_CASE|對話：Looking for luck 或 display？ Rings in velvet tray， 道路 tokens in brass case， ward beads by door。 I show one piece at a time； Highmark hands wander。
DIALOGUE_BRANN_GOODS_OPEN|對話：Aye， iron goods。 Nails， hinges， shields， axes， blades， 和 mail。 Pick it up if you mean 到 buy； do not drum on bars。
DIALOGUE_BRANN_LOWER_PASS_CLOSED|對話：Underway 大門 is still shut。 If you are waiting on 道路 below， buy 裝備 here。 No stall follows you past 大門。
DIALOGUE_DARRON_LANCE_ARMORY|對話：Lancer mail hangs on upper hooks； traveller pieces are below。 Shields on wall， blades on bench。 Pay first if you want a fitting。
DIALOGUE_YRVETH_WHITE_SEAL_RELIQUARY|對話：Oil vials stay sealed until street； wax is part of ward。 Relic picks are in left drawer， pilgrim charms in blue tray， ward steel wrapped behind me。
DIALOGUE_QUESSA_SCRIPTORIUM|對話：Mind ink， please。 Cheap copies are in lower tray， lecture 葉片 tied in green cord， spellbooks on high shelf。 Tell me what school you read before you touch bindings。
DIALOGUE_THERYN_HIGHWIND_CATACOMBS_FOUND|對話：You found Highwind Catacombs before I finished map。 Good。 The answer was under 修道院 after all。
DIALOGUE_THERYN_HIGHWIND_CATACOMBS_LEAD|對話：Highwind Monastery is only upper site。 The old burial halls sit under it。\nSearch 修道院 for catacomb entrance 和 step inside。 Then 返回 Telwynd 帶著 proof lower way is real。
DIALOGUE_THERYN_BARROW_PHRASE|對話：Give me page。 Hm。 Old March hand， royal names， 和 a burial line about Halric's 道路。\nKing Halric 和 Kingsmark share line。 At King's Barrow， say： Halric holds 道路。
DIALOGUE_THERYN_BARROW_PHRASE_REMINDER|對話：你已有 phrase。 At King's Barrow， say： Halric holds 道路。
DIALOGUE_THERYN_OPENING_WORDS_LEARNED|對話：Yes， I know this hand。 The missing part is spoken words， not another 碎片。\nTake 光玻璃 star back 到 final blood 封護。 Speak old line there， then touch 石頭。
DIALOGUE_THERYN_OPENING_WORDS_REMINDER|對話：光玻璃 star， final blood 封護， spoken words， hand on 石頭。 Do it in that order。
DIALOGUE_THROKK_BLACKGLASS_FORGE_COLD|你的血也許是缺的訣竅，但冷掉的符文爐什麼都做不了。要我喚醒blackglass之前，先把爐子點起來。
DIALOGUE_THROKK_BLACKGLASS_FORGE_WITH_SHARD|那塊碎片迴響得真。血、熱、錘子，別抱怨。blackglass熔爐開了。
DIALOGUE_THROKK_STONEWARD_OPEN|Stoneward Gate開了。我的破門器完成了它的活。
DIALOGUE_THROKK_UNDERWAY_TURNIN|By the forge, you made it back alive. With The Underway open, Stonecleft can breathe and Highmark is no longer a story on the far side of stone. If you mean to go there, go now.
DIALOGUE_THROKK_BLACKGLASS_FORGE_NO_SHARD|對話：The White Seal named your blood for old work。 帶回 true 碎片 when you have them。 One 碎片 makes one martial fitting。
DIALOGUE_THROKK_UNDERWAY_CLEAR|The Underway is clear at last. Took a stranger to shame the old gate open, but open is open.
DIALOGUE_THROKK_UNDERWAY_REMINDER|The drake is still holding North Gate. Kill it, and you can get through to Highmark.
DIALOGUE_THROKK_UNDERWAY_START|Highmark, is it? Then you need The Underway. North Gate is blocked by a drake; while it breathes, nothing gets through.
DIALOGUE_THROKK_UNDERWAY_START_OBJECTIVE|No one here is eager to feed it another helm. I will have the gate warden let you through. Kill the drake at North Gate, then you can get through to Highmark. Once you are out, keep north to the city.
QUEST_LOG_TUTORIAL_NOTE_OBJECTIVE|任務：把 Harren 的信交給 Brindle Quay 的 Dockmaster Garran。
QUEST_LOG_TUTORIAL_NOTE_DETAIL|Harren給了我一封信，要交給港口的Dockmaster Garran。
QUEST_LOG_TUTORIAL_CLASS_ACTION_OBJECTIVE|在訓練假人上使用一次職業動作。
QUEST_LOG_TUTORIAL_CLASS_ACTION_DETAIL|離開 Brindle Quay 前，守衛 Breck 想看我使用一次職業動作。\n用 {class_actions} 打開職業動作，然後在訓練假人上用一次。
QUEST_LOG_TUTORIAL_FIRST_AID_OBJECTIVE|任務：用繃帶處理你的傷口。
QUEST_LOG_TUTORIAL_FIRST_AID_DETAIL|用野戰繃帶包紮戰鬥中留下的傷口。
QUEST_LOG_TUTORIAL_SLEEP_OBJECTIVE|任務：在旅店睡一覺。
QUEST_LOG_TUTORIAL_SLEEP_DETAIL|碼頭長說，船離港前要先在Orrin的旅店休息。
QUEST_LOG_TUTORIAL_CAMP_OBJECTIVE|任務：使用露營工具休息。
QUEST_LOG_TUTORIAL_CAMP_DETAIL|在旅店休息後，奧林給了我一套露營工具。路上需要休息時使用它。
QUEST_LOG_TUTORIAL_FEED_OBJECTIVE|任務：吃點東西解除飢餓。
QUEST_LOG_TUTORIAL_FEED_DETAIL|飢餓開始影響身體。吃口糧或酒館食物來恢復。
QUEST_LOG_THANK_HARL_TITLE|Thank 队長 Thauld
QUEST_LOG_THANK_HARL_OBJECTIVE|任務：在碼頭向 Captain Thauld 道謝。
QUEST_LOG_THANK_HARL_DETAIL|Captain Thauld駕船穿過風暴。到Reedwater Docks向他道謝。
QUEST_LOG_HEAD_TO_HAVENFORD_OBJECTIVE|任務：沿北路抵達 Havenford。
QUEST_LOG_HEAD_TO_HAVENFORD_DETAIL|Captain Thauld說，從Reedwater往北的路通向Havenford。
QUEST_LOG_CAVE_CHIEF_RETURN_OBJECTIVE|向Aldren報告洞穴首領已死。
QUEST_LOG_CAVE_CHIEF_RETURN_DETAIL|洞穴首領已在山脊洞穴倒下。Havenford的Aldren應該知道這件事。
QUEST_LOG_CAVE_CHIEF_OBJECTIVE|任務：讓山脊洞穴裡的洞穴首領閉嘴。
QUEST_LOG_CAVE_CHIEF_DETAIL|Aldren says the goblin raids come from the eastern ridge cave and are too organized for ordinary vermin. I should find the chieftain driving them, kill him, and return to Havenford.
QUEST_LOG_ROOT_BREACH_LEAD_OBJECTIVE|Speak with Cael Orven at Traveller's Rest.
QUEST_LOG_ROOT_BREACH_LEAD_DETAIL|Scholar Cael says the prism points north from the Ruined Watchtower to Starfall Burrow. A drake holds the root below; I should search the burrow and learn what woke the prism.
QUEST_LOG_ROOT_BREACH_RETURN_OBJECTIVE|Take the blackglass shard to Scholar Cael.
QUEST_LOG_ROOT_BREACH_RETURN_DETAIL|I have the blackglass shard from Starfall Burrow. Scholar Cael at Traveller's Rest should see it.
QUEST_LOG_ROOT_BREACH_COLLECT_SHARD_OBJECTIVE|Collect the blackglass shard in the Starfall Burrow.
QUEST_LOG_ROOT_BREACH_COLLECT_SHARD_DETAIL|Vrask fell in the Starfall Burrow, and a blackglass shard remains where he died. I should pick it up before returning to Scholar Cael.
QUEST_LOG_ROOT_BREACH_OBJECTIVE|Search Starfall Burrow and return to Cael Orven.
QUEST_LOG_ROOT_BREACH_DETAIL|Scholar Cael says Starfall Burrow lies straight north of the Ruined Watchtower. The prism points there, and a drake holds the root below; I need to slay it and collect whatever truth survives.
QUEST_LOG_UNDERWAY_REACH_STONECLEFT_OBJECTIVE|Reach Stonecleft.
QUEST_LOG_UNDERWAY_REACH_STONECLEFT_DETAIL|South Gate opens into the South Gate Tunnels. I should continue through the tunnels to Stonecleft and ask the dwarves how to reach Highmark.
QUEST_LOG_UNDERWAY_REACH_SOUTH_GATE_OBJECTIVE|Travel northwest from Traveller's Rest to South Gate.
QUEST_LOG_UNDERWAY_REACH_SOUTH_GATE_DETAIL|Scholar Cael says Highmark lies beyond the mountains. The dwarven road begins at South Gate; I should take the northern road from Traveller's Rest to the mountain gate.
QUEST_LOG_UNDERWAY_ASK_THROKK_OBJECTIVE|Clear the drake at North Gate.
QUEST_LOG_UNDERWAY_ASK_THROKK_DETAIL|Stonecleft's north road is blocked, and Throkk says a drake holds North Gate. I should clear the gate before the dwarves can trust The Underway again.
QUEST_LOG_UNDERWAY_RETURN_OBJECTIVE|Continue north to Highmark.
QUEST_LOG_UNDERWAY_RETURN_DETAIL|The drake fell at North Gate, and the road through the mountains is open. I can continue north to Highmark.
QUEST_LOG_UNDERWAY_OBJECTIVE|Clear the drake at North Gate.
QUEST_LOG_UNDERWAY_DETAIL|Throkk says The Underway is the road to Highmark, but a drake blocks North Gate. I should kill it and continue north once the road opens.
QUEST_LOG_WHITE_SEAL_I_OBJECTIVE|任務：抵達 Highmark。
QUEST_LOG_WHITE_SEAL_I_DETAIL|The Underway is open. I should follow the dwarven road through the mountains and continue to Highmark, where the White Seal can examine the fragment.
QUEST_LOG_BEACON_PRISM_TALK_THAREC_OBJECTIVE|Speak with High Canon Tharec in Highmark.
QUEST_LOG_FINAL_DESCENT_II_OBJECTIVE|任務：在 Starfall Core 面對原初巨龍。
QUEST_LOG_FINAL_DESCENT_I_OBJECTIVE|任務：進入 Starfall Core。
QUEST_LOG_BLOOD_OF_THE_ANCIENTS_III_OBJECTIVE|任務：開啟最後的血印。
QUEST_LOG_BLOOD_OF_THE_ANCIENTS_II_OBJECTIVE|任務：取回被遺忘的言語。
QUEST_LOG_BLOOD_OF_THE_ANCIENTS_I_OBJECTIVE|任務：找到最後的血印。
QUEST_LOG_DEPTHS_OF_STARFALL_III_OBJECTIVE|任務：開啟 Stoneward Gate。
QUEST_LOG_DEPTHS_OF_STARFALL_II_OBJECTIVE|任務：進入 Sundering Depths。
QUEST_LOG_DEPTHS_OF_STARFALL_I_DETAIL|星已淨化。Scar中有通往Camp Kestrel的路。
QUEST_LOG_GLASSROOT_HOLLOW_RETURN_TITLE|Glassroot Hollow
QUEST_LOG_GLASSROOT_HOLLOW_RETURN_OBJECTIVE|任務：回 Highmark 找 Eiradha。
QUEST_LOG_GLASSROOT_HOLLOW_RETURN_DETAIL|blackglass drake已在谷地倒下。應告訴Highmark的Eiradha。
QUEST_LOG_GLASSROOT_HOLLOW_TITLE|Glassroot Hollow
QUEST_LOG_GLASSROOT_HOLLOW_OBJECTIVE|任務：清除 glassroot hollow。
QUEST_LOG_GLASSROOT_HOLLOW_DETAIL|Eiradha says Glassroot Hollow lies east from the crossroads outside Highmark, along the road that bends southeast into the Veiled Wood. A blackglass drake there keeps Telwynd closed to outsiders. I should kill the drake and return to Highmark.
QUEST_LOG_GHOSTWOOD_SMOKE_RETURN_OBJECTIVE|任務：回 Camp Kestrel 找 Kestrel 斥候。
QUEST_LOG_GHOSTWOOD_SMOKE_RETURN_DETAIL|Veyr已死。ghostwood的煙霧已經散去。應告訴偵察兵。
QUEST_LOG_GHOSTWOOD_SMOKE_ASK_EIRADHA_OBJECTIVE|任務：向 Eiradha 詢問 ghostwood。
QUEST_LOG_GHOSTWOOD_SMOKE_ASK_EIRADHA_DETAIL|Camp Kestrel的偵察兵說，Eiradha也許能追查ghostwood煙霧的線索。
QUEST_LOG_GHOSTWOOD_SMOKE_OBJECTIVE|任務：沿著 ghostwood 煙霧前往舊塔，殺死 Veyr。
QUEST_LOG_GHOSTWOOD_SMOKE_DETAIL|Eiradha追出了根源。Veyr占据着Ghostwood的塔。终结烟雾。 Follow the smoke west.
QUEST_LOG_BREAK_ROCKMAW_KEEP_I_RETURN_OBJECTIVE|任務：回 Camp Kestrel 找 Watch Sergeant。
QUEST_LOG_BREAK_ROCKMAW_KEEP_I_RETURN_DETAIL|Maug和Brond已死。rockmaw keep已被擊破。應告诉軍士。
QUEST_LOG_BREAK_ROCKMAW_KEEP_I_BROND_OBJECTIVE|任務：在 Rockmaw Keep 殺死食人魔勇士 Brond。
QUEST_LOG_BREAK_ROCKMAW_KEEP_I_BROND_DETAIL|Maug已死。要塞里只剩Brond。结束它。
QUEST_LOG_BREAK_ROCKMAW_KEEP_I_MAUG_OBJECTIVE|任務：在 Rockmaw Keep 殺死雙頭巨人 Maug。
QUEST_LOG_BREAK_ROCKMAW_KEEP_I_MAUG_DETAIL|Brond已死。只剩Maug。结束它。
QUEST_LOG_BREAK_ROCKMAW_KEEP_I_OBJECTIVE|任務：殺死 Rockmaw Keep 的首領。
QUEST_LOG_BREAK_ROCKMAW_KEEP_I_DETAIL|rockmaw keep是個威脅。為Camp Kestrel的Watch Sergeant擊溃它的首领。 Rockmaw Keep is near the coastal mountains.
QUEST_LOG_BREAK_ROCKMAW_KEEP_II_OBJECTIVE|任務：調查 Rockmaw Keep 裡的 Kestrel 前哨。
QUEST_LOG_BREAK_ROCKMAW_KEEP_II_DETAIL|Maug和Brond已死。Kestrel控制了外院。前哨已开放检查。
QUEST_LOG_MOON_BITTEN_CAVE_OBJECTIVE|任務：在 moon bitten cave 狩獵 Varroth。
QUEST_LOG_MOON_BITTEN_CAVE_DETAIL|Varroth占据moon bitten cave。為Camp Kestrel的Watch Sergeant猎殺他。 Search the nearby hills.
QUEST_LOG_MOON_BITTEN_CAVE_RETURN_OBJECTIVE|任務：回 Camp Kestrel 找 Watch Sergeant。
QUEST_LOG_MOON_BITTEN_CAVE_RETURN_DETAIL|Varroth已死。隐藏的狼群已经散了。應告诉軍士。
QUEST_LOG_CLEAR_MOONWELL_ROAD_RETURN_OBJECTIVE|任務：回 Telwynd 找 Warden Sairveth。
QUEST_LOG_CLEAR_MOONWELL_ROAD_RETURN_DETAIL|The Moonwell Tunnels are clear. Warden Sairveth in Telwynd should know.
QUEST_LOG_CLEAR_MOONWELL_ROAD_OBJECTIVE|Clear the Moonwell Tunnels.
QUEST_LOG_CLEAR_MOONWELL_ROAD_DETAIL|Warden Sairveth says the Moonwell Tunnels are blocked and Telwynd's workers cannot safely pass. I should set the tunnel dials and reach the far exit so the grove can reach the old site again. The Moonwell Tunnels are south of Telwynd.
QUEST_LOG_ELDERWYRM_GROVE_RETURN_OBJECTIVE|任務：回 Telwynd 找 Warden Sairveth。
QUEST_LOG_ELDERWYRM_GROVE_RETURN_DETAIL|elderwyrm已死。grove已被收復。Telwynd的Warden Sairveth應该知道。
QUEST_LOG_ELDERWYRM_GROVE_OBJECTIVE|任務：奪回 Elderwyrm Grove。
QUEST_LOG_ELDERWYRM_GROVE_DETAIL|Sairveth and Eivyss say Elderwyrm Grove is failing under old ward trouble, and Caerwyn has bent the green magic around himself. I should reclaim the grove before Telwynd sends workers through. Elderwyrm Grove is in the furthest northern mountains.
QUEST_LOG_BURIED_HIGHWIND_REPORT_CATACOMBS_OBJECTIVE|任務：搜尋 Highwind Catacombs。
QUEST_LOG_BURIED_HIGHWIND_REPORT_CATACOMBS_DETAIL|你找到了catacombs。highwind埋在那里。
QUEST_LOG_BURIED_HIGHWIND_FIND_CATACOMBS_OBJECTIVE|任務：找到通往 Highwind 地下墓穴的樓梯。
QUEST_LOG_BURIED_HIGHWIND_FIND_CATACOMBS_DETAIL|Theryn Rusk says the old Highwind trail points under the monastery. I should search the grounds for the stair into Highwind's catacombs.
QUEST_LOG_BURIED_HIGHWIND_ASK_THERYN_OBJECTIVE|任務：在 Havenford 詢問 Theryn Rusk。
QUEST_LOG_BURIED_HIGHWIND_ASK_THERYN_DETAIL|你检查了修道院。去問Havenford的Theryn Rusk這意味着什么。
QUEST_LOG_BURIED_HIGHWIND_RETURN_MARKS_OBJECTIVE|任務：回 Telwynd 找 Warden Sairveth。
QUEST_LOG_BURIED_HIGHWIND_RETURN_MARKS_DETAIL|你检查了修道院。Telwynd的Warden Sairveth應该知道。
QUEST_LOG_BURIED_HIGHWIND_OBJECTIVE|Find the buried highwind.
QUEST_LOG_BURIED_HIGHWIND_DETAIL|The buried Highwind is tied to the old monastery and the catacombs beneath it. I should search those places and follow whatever proof survives. Highwind Monastery is in the far east hills.
QUEST_LOG_LOST_PURIFIER_RETURN_OBJECTIVE|任務：回 Highmark 的 White Seal Antiquities 找 Antiquary Tovan。
QUEST_LOG_LOST_PURIFIER_RETURN_DETAIL|Antiquary Tovan已从水渠中获救。回Highmark的White Seal Antiquities找Antiquary Tovan。
QUEST_LOG_LOST_PURIFIER_OBJECTIVE|任務：在水道中找到 Antiquary Tovan。
QUEST_LOG_LOST_PURIFIER_DETAIL|Antiquary Tovan vanished in the aqueduct while tracing the lost purifier. I should search the waterworks and bring him back if he is still alive. The aqueduct is in the mountains north of Highmark.
QUEST_LOG_PILGRIMAGE_FIRST_DETAIL|White Seal Priest給了一個素淨護符。在Havenford、Roadside Shrine和Reedmire的祭坛上作標记，直到它变暖。
QUEST_LOG_PILGRIMAGE_RETURN_BLESS_OBJECTIVE|任務：回 Highmark 找 White Seal Priest。
QUEST_LOG_PILGRIMAGE_RETURN_BLESS_DETAIL|素淨護符已有三處標记。把它交回Highmark的White Seal Priest。
QUEST_LOG_PILGRIMAGE_OLDROOT_OBJECTIVE|任務：把沉睡護符帶到 Oldroot Temple 的祭壇。
QUEST_LOG_PILGRIMAGE_OLDROOT_DETAIL|沉睡的white seal charm需要oldroot altar。根会唤醒它。 Oldroot Temple is in the forest near Highmark.
QUEST_LOG_PILGRIMAGE_RETURN_FINAL_OBJECTIVE|任務：把 white seal charm 帶回 Highmark 的 White Seal Priest。
QUEST_LOG_PILGRIMAGE_RETURN_FINAL_DETAIL|護符因oldroot而苏醒。把它交回Highmark的White Seal Priest。
QUEST_LOG_MOONWELL_ALIGNMENT_TELWYND_OBJECTIVE|任務：把錯位的透鏡帶去 Telwynd 調諧。
QUEST_LOG_MOONWELL_ALIGNMENT_TELWYND_DETAIL|Highmark的Veydras从seal stores給了一枚錯位的moonwell lens。Telwynd的Eivyss能调諧它。
QUEST_LOG_MOONWELL_ALIGNMENT_REPLACE_OBJECTIVE|任務：回 Highmark 找 Veydras，取得替換透鏡。
QUEST_LOG_MOONWELL_ALIGNMENT_REPLACE_DETAIL|Highmark的Veydras能从seal stores替换丟失的錯位moonwell lens。
QUEST_LOG_MOONWELL_ALIGNMENT_INSTALL_OBJECTIVE|任務：在 Moonwell Observatory 安裝已調諧的透鏡。
QUEST_LOG_MOONWELL_ALIGNMENT_INSTALL_DETAIL|透鏡已调諧。把它安入觀測所破裂的Moonwell frame。 Moonwell Observatory is south of Telwynd.
QUEST_LOG_MOONWELL_ALIGNMENT_RECOVER_ATTUNED_OBJECTIVE|任務：從 Telwynd 的 Eivyss 取回已調諧的透鏡。
QUEST_LOG_MOONWELL_ALIGNMENT_RECOVER_ATTUNED_DETAIL|调諧后的moonwell lens不見了。Telwynd的Eivyss能修復它。
QUEST_LOG_MOONWELL_ALIGNMENT_RETURN_OBJECTIVE|任務：回 Highmark 找 Veydras。
QUEST_LOG_MOONWELL_ALIGNMENT_RETURN_DETAIL|调諧后的透鏡已嵌入Moonwell frame。觀測所的光穩定了。回Highmark找Veydras。
QUEST_LOG_BITTER_STOCK_RETURN_OBJECTIVE|任務：回 Highmark 找 Apothecary Maveth。
QUEST_LOG_BITTER_STOCK_RETURN_DETAIL|oldroot leaves已经备好。回Highmark找Apothecary Maveth。
QUEST_LOG_BITTER_STOCK_DETAIL|Oldroot Temple產出的叶子能增強药料。帶六片給Highmark的Apothecary Maveth。 Oldroot Temple is in the forest near Highmark.
QUEST_LOG_MOONWELL_THREAD_RETURN_OBJECTIVE|任務：回 Telwynd 找 Bowyer Aelrion。
QUEST_LOG_MOONWELL_THREAD_RETURN_DETAIL|moonwell threads已经备好。回Telwynd找Bowyer Aelrion。
QUEST_LOG_MOONWELL_THREAD_DETAIL|Moonwell Observatory產出的丝线能強化弓架。帶六束給Telwynd的Bowyer Aelrion。 Moonwell Observatory is south of Telwynd.
QUEST_LOG_PERFECT_DRAUGHT_OBJECTIVE|Preserve a {0} corpse for Nerrik.
QUEST_LOG_PERFECT_DRAUGHT_RETURN_OBJECTIVE|Bring the preserved corpse to Nerrik.
QUEST_LOG_ORDERS_FOR_KESTREL_OBJECTIVE|Carry the message to the commander at Camp Kestrel.
QUEST_LOG_NORTHERN_WATCH_I_DETAIL|Harpies are hitting Greycliff Quarry west of Highmark and the cliff routes toward Telwynd. Clear enough of them for the Silver Lancer.
QUEST_LOG_NORTHERN_WATCH_I_RETURN_OBJECTIVE|任務：回 Highmark 找 Silver Lancer。
QUEST_LOG_NORTHERN_WATCH_I_RETURN_DETAIL|harpy已殺。北方丘陵因此少了些威脅。回Highmark找Silver Lancer。
QUEST_LOG_NORTHERN_WATCH_II_DETAIL|ogres占据北方地帶。給Highmark的Silver Lancer帶回八次擊殺。
QUEST_LOG_NORTHERN_WATCH_II_RETURN_OBJECTIVE|任務：回 Highmark 找 Silver Lancer。
QUEST_LOG_NORTHERN_WATCH_II_RETURN_DETAIL|ogre已殺。北方地帶因此穩了一些。回Highmark找Silver Lancer。
QUEST_LOG_NORTHERN_WATCH_III_DETAIL|hill giants占据北方。給Highmark的Silver Lancer帶回两次擊殺。
QUEST_LOG_NORTHERN_WATCH_III_RETURN_OBJECTIVE|任務：回 Highmark 找 Silver Lancer。
QUEST_LOG_NORTHERN_WATCH_III_RETURN_DETAIL|giants倒下了。northern watch完成。回Highmark找Silver Lancer。
QUEST_LOG_RAT_CELLAR_RETURN_TITLE|Clear Rat Cellar
QUEST_LOG_RAT_CELLAR_RETURN_OBJECTIVE|任務：回去找 Fisherman Bress。
QUEST_LOG_RAT_CELLAR_RETURN_DETAIL|大的已经倒下。巢穴已破。回去找Fisherman Bress。
QUEST_LOG_RAT_CELLAR_TITLE|Clear Rat Cellar
QUEST_LOG_RAT_CELLAR_OBJECTIVE|任務：清除 Rat Cellar。
QUEST_LOG_RAT_CELLAR_DETAIL|Fisherman Bress says rats have taken over the cellar and a bigger one is running the nest. I should clear the cellar before it spreads into the docks.
QUEST_LOG_SMUGGLER_BADGE_RETURN_TITLE|Smuggler's Debt I
QUEST_LOG_SMUGGLER_BADGE_RETURN_OBJECTIVE_PLACE|Return the lead seal to the Smuggler {0}.
QUEST_LOG_SMUGGLER_BADGE_RETURN_DETAIL_PLACE|The lead seal is in hand. I should return it to the Smuggler {0} and collect the first pay before asking about the larger job.
QUEST_LOG_SMUGGLER_BADGE_TITLE|Smuggler's Debt I
QUEST_LOG_SMUGGLER_BADGE_OBJECTIVE|Find the Smuggler's lead seal in Smuggler Grotto.
QUEST_LOG_SMUGGLER_BADGE_DETAIL|The Smuggler said his old crew is using Smuggler Grotto for wet storage. He told me to take the east road toward King's Barrow, turn south to the grotto, and bring back his lead seal whole.
QUEST_LOG_SMUGGLER_DEBT_II_RETURN_TITLE|Smuggler's Debt II
QUEST_LOG_SMUGGLER_DEBT_II_RETURN_OBJECTIVE_PLACE|Return the shut lockbox to the Smuggler {0}.
QUEST_LOG_SMUGGLER_DEBT_II_RETURN_DETAIL_PLACE|The Smuggler's iron lockbox is in hand and still shut. I should return it to the Smuggler {0} for the promised pay.
QUEST_LOG_SMUGGLER_DEBT_II_RECOVER_LOCKBOX_TITLE|Smuggler's Debt II
QUEST_LOG_SMUGGLER_DEBT_II_RECOVER_LOCKBOX_OBJECTIVE|Recover the Smuggler's lockbox from the lower cove.
QUEST_LOG_SMUGGLER_DEBT_II_RECOVER_LOCKBOX_DETAIL|The lower cove is clear enough to search now, but the Smuggler's iron lockbox still needs to be found and returned shut.
QUEST_LOG_SMUGGLER_DEBT_II_TITLE|Smuggler's Debt II
QUEST_LOG_SMUGGLER_DEBT_II_OBJECTIVE|Find the Smuggler's lockbox in Smuggler Grotto's lower cove.
QUEST_LOG_SMUGGLER_DEBT_II_DETAIL|After I returned the seal, the Smuggler said there is an iron lockbox in the lower cove of the same grotto. He wants it brought back shut.
QUEST_LOG_REEDMIRE_DELIVERY_RETURN_TITLE|Investigate Reedmire 神龛
QUEST_LOG_BURNED_COTTAGE_INVESTIGATION_RETURN_TITLE|Investigate the Burned Cottage
QUEST_LOG_BURNED_COTTAGE_INVESTIGATION_RETURN_OBJECTIVE_PLACE|Return to Vethrin {0}.
QUEST_LOG_BURNED_COTTAGE_INVESTIGATION_RETURN_DETAIL_PLACE|The hidden altar below the Burned Cottage is marked with water glyphs and uneven shallow pools. Return to Vethrin {0}.
QUEST_LOG_BURNED_COTTAGE_INVESTIGATION_TITLE|Investigate the Burned Cottage
QUEST_LOG_BURNED_COTTAGE_INVESTIGATION_OBJECTIVE|Search the Burned Cottage for the source of the strange fire.
QUEST_LOG_BURNED_COTTAGE_INVESTIGATION_DETAIL|Vethrin suspects the cottage burned under magical fire, and the wolves around the ruin are not acting normal. I should search the place carefully for a sign of what happened. The cottage is in the small forest just out of town.
QUEST_LOG_REEDMIRE_DELIVERY_RETURN_OBJECTIVE_PLACE|任務：回去找 Vethrin {0}。
QUEST_LOG_REEDMIRE_DELIVERY_RETURN_DETAIL_PLACE|Nhalor已倒下。回去找Vethrin {0}。
QUEST_LOG_REEDMIRE_DELIVERY_KILL_NHALOR_TITLE|Investigate Reedmire 神龛
QUEST_LOG_REEDMIRE_DELIVERY_KILL_NHALOR_OBJECTIVE|任務：在 Reedmire Shrine 殺死 Nhalor。
QUEST_LOG_REEDMIRE_DELIVERY_KILL_NHALOR_DETAIL|Reth's stones are set at Reedmire Shrine, and Nhalor walks the water there. I should end it and return the news to Vethrin.
QUEST_LOG_REEDMIRE_DELIVERY_PLACE_STONES_TITLE|Investigate Reedmire 神龛
QUEST_LOG_REEDMIRE_DELIVERY_PLACE_STONES_OBJECTIVE|任務：把 Reth 的石頭放在 Reedmire Shrine。
QUEST_LOG_REEDMIRE_DELIVERY_DELIVER_NOTE_TITLE|Carry Vethrin's Note
QUEST_LOG_REEDMIRE_DELIVERY_DELIVER_NOTE_OBJECTIVE|任務：把 Vethrin 的封緘信交給 Reedwater Docks 的 Reth Oskel。
QUEST_LOG_REEDMIRE_DELIVERY_DELIVER_NOTE_DETAIL|Vethrin給了我一封密封信，要交給Reedwater Docks的Reth Oskel。Reth知道Reedmire Shrine發生了什么。我應送信并取得他的指示。
QUEST_LOG_REEDMIRE_DELIVERY_REPLACE_NOTE_TITLE|Carry Vethrin's Note
QUEST_LOG_REEDMIRE_DELIVERY_REPLACE_NOTE_OBJECTIVE_PLACE|任務：回去找 Vethrin {0} 補拿那封信。
QUEST_LOG_REEDMIRE_DELIVERY_REPLACE_NOTE_DETAIL|給Reth Oskel的密封信不在我的包里了。如果我在去Reedwater前回去，Vethrin可以再寫一封。
QUEST_LOG_STONECLEFT_RUNEFORGE_I_RETURN_CORE_TITLE|Stonecleft Runeforge I
QUEST_LOG_STONECLEFT_RUNEFORGE_I_RETURN_CORE_OBJECTIVE|任務：把 Runeforge Core 交還給 Stonecleft 的 Armorer Dorran。
QUEST_LOG_STONECLEFT_RUNEFORGE_I_RETURN_CORE_DETAIL|Runeforge Core在Floodgate Cistern的死duergar身上。Dorran需要它，刻印軍械庫和blackglass工作才能恢復。
QUEST_LOG_STONECLEFT_RUNEFORGE_I_RECOVER_CORE_TITLE|Stonecleft Runeforge I
QUEST_LOG_STONECLEFT_RUNEFORGE_I_RECOVER_CORE_OBJECTIVE|任務：取回 Runeforge Core，然後交還給 Armorer Dorran。
QUEST_LOG_STONECLEFT_RUNEFORGE_I_RECOVER_CORE_DETAIL|我在Floodgate Cistern找到了Runeforge Core，但它已经不在我的包里。core回到Stonecleft前，Dorran无法重啟runeforge。
QUEST_LOG_STONECLEFT_RUNEFORGE_I_SEARCH_CORPSE_TITLE|Stonecleft Runeforge I
QUEST_LOG_STONECLEFT_RUNEFORGE_I_SEARCH_CORPSE_OBJECTIVE|任務：在 Floodgate Cistern 的死 duergar 附近取回 Runeforge Core。
QUEST_LOG_STONECLEFT_RUNEFORGE_I_SEARCH_CORPSE_DETAIL|Floodgate Cistern下层階梯附近有死duergar，周围是粗劣工具和爪痕。如果被偷的Runeforge Core還在那里，應就在尸体旁。
QUEST_LOG_STONECLEFT_RUNEFORGE_I_TITLE|Stonecleft Runeforge I
QUEST_LOG_STONECLEFT_RUNEFORGE_I_OBJECTIVE|任務：使用符文閥柄打開 Floodgate Cistern 的下層。
QUEST_LOG_STONECLEFT_RUNEFORGE_I_DETAIL|Armorer Dorran说Stonecleft的Runeforge Core被盗，閥門隨后失灵。下层蓄水池是唯一線索；runed valve handle應該能打开封住的下行路。 Floodgate Cistern is just off the southern road.
QUEST_LOG_STONECLEFT_RUNEFORGE_I_REPAIRING_TITLE|Stonecleft Runeforge I
QUEST_LOG_STONECLEFT_RUNEFORGE_I_REPAIRING_OBJECTIVE|任務：等待 Armorer Dorran 重啟 runeforge。
QUEST_LOG_STONECLEFT_RUNEFORGE_II_RETURN_TITLE|Stonecleft Runeforge II
QUEST_LOG_STONECLEFT_RUNEFORGE_II_RETURN_OBJECTIVE|任務：回 Stonecleft 找 Armorer Dorran。
QUEST_LOG_STONECLEFT_RUNEFORGE_II_RETURN_DETAIL|Vargrom已死在Old Mineworks。Dorran想在duergar首領回来夺runeforge前除掉他。
QUEST_LOG_STONECLEFT_RUNEFORGE_II_TITLE|Stonecleft Runeforge II
QUEST_LOG_STONECLEFT_RUNEFORGE_II_OBJECTIVE|任務：在 Old Mineworks 殺死 Duergar Guard Vargrom。
QUEST_LOG_STONECLEFT_RUNEFORGE_II_DETAIL|Floodgate Cistern里的死duergar让Dorran足以認出可能的竊賊。Stonecleft要重新信任runeforge，Old Mineworks的Vargrom必须死。
QUEST_LOG_STONECLEFT_LAMP_RUN_TITLE|Lamp Run
QUEST_LOG_THIRSTY_FISHERMAN_I_TITLE|Beer for Bran
QUEST_LOG_THIRSTY_FISHERMAN_I_OBJECTIVE|帶一杯啤酒給Reedwater Docks的漁夫Bran。
QUEST_LOG_THIRSTY_FISHERMAN_I_DETAIL|漁夫Bran被破網和缺人手困在Reedwater Docks。任何酒館啤酒都可以；我應在潮水改變前給他帶一杯。
QUEST_LOG_THIRSTY_FISHERMAN_II_RETURN_TITLE|Bran's Parcel
QUEST_LOG_THIRSTY_FISHERMAN_II_RETURN_OBJECTIVE|任務：把 Fisherman Bran 的包裹送給 Traveller's Rest 的 Shopkeeper Orrick。
QUEST_LOG_THIRSTY_FISHERMAN_II_RETURN_DETAIL|Bran給了我一個上蜡包裹，要交給Traveller's Rest的Shopkeeper Orrick。他说繩子結實，包裹會保持乾燥。我應亲手交給Orrick并收取運費。
QUEST_LOG_THIRSTY_FISHERMAN_II_REPLACE_PARCEL_TITLE|Bran's Parcel
QUEST_LOG_THIRSTY_FISHERMAN_II_REPLACE_PARCEL_OBJECTIVE|回到Reedwater Docks找漁夫Bran，再拿一個包裹。
QUEST_LOG_THIRSTY_FISHERMAN_II_REPLACE_PARCEL_DETAIL|給Orrick的包裹不在我的包裡了。如果回Reedwater，Bran可以再包一個。
QUEST_LOG_TRAVELLERS_REST_OLD_CAVE_RETURN_TITLE|Check Old 洞穴
QUEST_LOG_TRAVELLERS_REST_OLD_CAVE_RETURN_OBJECTIVE|任務：回 Traveller's Rest 找 Shopkeeper Orrick。
QUEST_LOG_TRAVELLERS_REST_OLD_CAVE_RETURN_DETAIL|我到达Old Cave底层，看到的已足够告诉Shopkeeper Orrick。他要的是實際細節：落脚處、水，以及下面有什么麻烦。
QUEST_LOG_TRAVELLERS_REST_OLD_CAVE_TITLE|Check Old 洞穴
QUEST_LOG_TRAVELLERS_REST_OLD_CAVE_OBJECTIVE|任務：抵達 Old Cave 的最底層。
QUEST_LOG_TRAVELLERS_REST_OLD_CAVE_DETAIL|Traveller's Rest的Shopkeeper Orrick愿意为能让旅人活下来的第一手洞穴警告付钱。他想要旅店東边Old Cave的新消息。我需要到底层看看并活着回来。
QUEST_LOG_TRAVELLERS_REST_DESOLATE_DOCKS_RETURN_TITLE|Clear Desolate 碼頭
QUEST_LOG_TRAVELLERS_REST_DESOLATE_DOCKS_RETURN_OBJECTIVE|任務：回 Traveller's Rest 找 Ser Caldus。
QUEST_LOG_TRAVELLERS_REST_DESOLATE_DOCKS_RETURN_DETAIL|Krosh已死在Desolate Docks。Ser Caldus在Traveller's Rest等着。我應回去領取承诺的報酬。
QUEST_LOG_TRAVELLERS_REST_DESOLATE_DOCKS_TITLE|Clear Desolate 碼頭
QUEST_LOG_TRAVELLERS_REST_DESOLATE_DOCKS_OBJECTIVE|任務：在 Desolate Docks 殺死獸人戰士 Krosh。
QUEST_LOG_TRAVELLERS_REST_DESOLATE_DOCKS_DETAIL|Ser Caldus要Krosh死在Traveller's Rest東北半岛的Desolate Docks。廢棄码頭聚落的被占地下室里有orc打捞隊。我需要找到Krosh，杀了他，然后返回。
QUEST_LOG_TRAVELLERS_REST_ASH_TOWER_RETURN_SCALE_TITLE|Ash 座 Commission
QUEST_LOG_TRAVELLERS_REST_ASH_TOWER_RETURN_SCALE_OBJECTIVE|任務：帶著一片幼龍鱗回 Traveller's Rest 找 Peddler Velra。
QUEST_LOG_TRAVELLERS_REST_ASH_TOWER_RETURN_SCALE_DETAIL|Rhazvek已死，我有Velra做戒指需要的drake scale。她说這片鱗帶着完成委托所需的熱力。
QUEST_LOG_TRAVELLERS_REST_ASH_TOWER_RECOVER_SCALE_TITLE|Ash 座 Commission
QUEST_LOG_TRAVELLERS_REST_ASH_TOWER_RECOVER_SCALE_OBJECTIVE|任務：為 Peddler Velra 取回一片幼龍鱗。
QUEST_LOG_TRAVELLERS_REST_ASH_TOWER_RECOVER_SCALE_DETAIL|Rhazvek已死，但Velra還需要一片drake scale来完成Ashen Ring。我應搜索Traveller's Rest東南偏東、他倒下的Ash Tower。
QUEST_LOG_TRAVELLERS_REST_ASH_TOWER_TITLE|Ash 座 Commission
QUEST_LOG_TRAVELLERS_REST_ASH_TOWER_OBJECTIVE|任務：在 Ash Tower 殺死 Rhazvek，並帶一片幼龍鱗給 Velra。
QUEST_LOG_TRAVELLERS_REST_ASH_TOWER_DETAIL|Peddler Velra給了我两瓶fire resistance potions和一根wand of cone of cold。她需要Traveller's Rest東南偏東Ash Tower中Rhazvek的一片drake scale来完成Ashen Ring。
QUEST_LOG_HAVENFORD_WATCH_I_RETURN_TITLE|Havenford Watch I
QUEST_LOG_HAVENFORD_WATCH_I_RETURN_OBJECTIVE|任務：回 Havenford 找 Garrick。
QUEST_LOG_HAVENFORD_WATCH_I_RETURN_DETAIL|我已从kobolds那里拿到Garrick第一項守望工作的足够證據。應回Havenford領取第一笔守望報酬。
QUEST_LOG_HAVENFORD_WATCH_I_TITLE|Havenford Watch I
QUEST_LOG_HAVENFORD_WATCH_I_DETAIL|Garrick要二十张kobold scalps才算完成第一項守望工作。kobolds偷飼料、割帶子，還把巡逻隊引离道路。
QUEST_LOG_HAVENFORD_WATCH_II_RETURN_TITLE|Havenford Watch II
QUEST_LOG_HAVENFORD_WATCH_II_RETURN_OBJECTIVE|任務：回 Havenford 找 Garrick。
QUEST_LOG_HAVENFORD_WATCH_II_RETURN_DETAIL|我已有Garrick第二項守望工作所需的grave bones。應回Havenford領取下一笔守望報酬。
QUEST_LOG_HAVENFORD_WATCH_II_TITLE|Havenford Watch II
QUEST_LOG_HAVENFORD_WATCH_II_DETAIL|Garrick要从skeletons或zombies那里取二十根grave bones来完成第二項守望工作。死者正在道路附近异常活動。
QUEST_LOG_HAVENFORD_WATCH_III_RETURN_TITLE|Havenford Watch III
QUEST_LOG_HAVENFORD_WATCH_III_RETURN_OBJECTIVE|任務：回 Havenford 找 Garrick。
QUEST_LOG_HAVENFORD_WATCH_III_RETURN_DETAIL|Kobold Packleader Skrit已死在瞭望塔北面的礦井。Garrick說這是他能從Havenford安排的最後一項守望工作。
QUEST_LOG_HAVENFORD_WATCH_III_TITLE|Havenford Watch III
QUEST_LOG_HAVENFORD_WATCH_III_OBJECTIVE|任務：在瞭望塔北面的礦井殺死 Kobold Packleader Skrit。
QUEST_LOG_HAVENFORD_WATCH_III_DETAIL|Garrick要Skrit死，作為最後的Havenford守望工作。Skrit在廢棄瞭望塔北面的礦井聚集kobolds，並支撐西路襲擊。我需要到底層，殺了他，回Havenford。
QUEST_LOG_FIT_FOR_A_KING_I_DELIVER_MANUSCRIPT_TITLE|Fit for a King I
QUEST_LOG_FIT_FOR_A_KING_I_DELIVER_MANUSCRIPT_OBJECTIVE|任務：把 Pilgrim Edran 的手稿帶給 Havenford 的 Theryn Rusk。
QUEST_LOG_FIT_FOR_A_KING_I_DELIVER_MANUSCRIPT_DETAIL|Pilgrim Edran从King's Barrow封門上抄下一句。他不信自己讀準了古March文字。Havenford的Theryn Rusk應該能讀。
QUEST_LOG_FIT_FOR_A_KING_I_REPLACE_MANUSCRIPT_TITLE|Fit for a King I
QUEST_LOG_FIT_FOR_A_KING_I_REPLACE_MANUSCRIPT_OBJECTIVE|任務：回 Highmark 找 Pilgrim Edran，再拿一份手稿副本。
QUEST_LOG_FIT_FOR_A_KING_I_REPLACE_MANUSCRIPT_DETAIL|Edran的barrow manuscript不在我的包里了。他可以用Highmark的筆記再做一份。
QUEST_LOG_FIT_FOR_A_KING_II_RETURN_TITLE|Fit for a King II
QUEST_LOG_FIT_FOR_A_KING_II_RETURN_OBJECTIVE|任務：回 Highmark 找 Pilgrim Edran。
QUEST_LOG_FIT_FOR_A_KING_II_RETURN_DETAIL|King Halric再次死去，Kingsmark也已离开王室石棺。Pilgrim Edran想要barrow記錄，更甚于戒指本身。
QUEST_LOG_FIT_FOR_A_KING_II_CLAIM_RING_TITLE|Fit for a King II
QUEST_LOG_FIT_FOR_A_KING_II_CLAIM_RING_OBJECTIVE|任務：打開 King's Barrow 裡的王室石棺。
QUEST_LOG_FIT_FOR_A_KING_II_CLAIM_RING_DETAIL|barrow wight King Halric已经倒下。王室石棺现在應該會回應从Theryn那里学到的話。Kingsmark据说隨舊王一同埋葬。
QUEST_LOG_FIT_FOR_A_KING_II_TITLE|Fit for a King II
QUEST_LOG_FIT_FOR_A_KING_II_OBJECTIVE|任務：進入 King's Barrow，擊敗 King Halric。
QUEST_LOG_FIT_FOR_A_KING_II_DETAIL|Old Theryn讀了Pilgrim Edran的手稿，并給了我開門語：Halric holds the road。King's Barrow现在應該會打开，但Edran警告说它不是普通墳墓。 King's Barrow lies far south beyond the mountains.
QUEST_LOG_ORC_BASE_I_TITLE|獸人 Fortress Sketch
QUEST_LOG_ORC_BASE_I_OBJECTIVE|Take the orc fortress sketch to the Stonecleft gate warden.
QUEST_LOG_ORC_BASE_I_DETAIL|Branna at Traveller's Rest handed over a rough sketch left after the Old Cave trouble. The Stonecleft gate warden can judge whether it shows a real orc fortress.
QUEST_LOG_ORC_BASE_RETURN_TITLE|Break 獸人 Fortress
QUEST_LOG_ORC_BASE_RETURN_OBJECTIVE|Return to the Stonecleft gate warden.
QUEST_LOG_ORC_BASE_RETURN_DETAIL|Gorvuk is dead, and the Orc Fortress west of Stonecleft has lost its warboss. The gate warden promised a hammer and coin.
QUEST_LOG_ORC_BASE_TITLE|Break 獸人 Fortress
QUEST_LOG_ORC_BASE_OBJECTIVE|任務：在已揭露的 Orc Fortress 殺死 warboss Gorvuk。
QUEST_LOG_ORC_BASE_DETAIL|The gate warden took the sketch and revealed the Orc Fortress west of Stonecleft, off the rough track southwest of the main road. Gorvuk commands the warband there. I need to get inside, kill him, and return to the warden.
QUEST_LOG_MISSING_HUSBAND_RESCUED_TITLE|不到 Missing Farmer
QUEST_LOG_MISSING_HUSBAND_RESCUED_OBJECTIVE|任務：返回 Havenford，與 Farmer Thom 交談。
QUEST_LOG_MISSING_HUSBAND_RESCUED_DETAIL|失踪農夫還活着，正在回家。Maveth在Havenford等着，却不知道該懷抱希望還是哀悼。
QUEST_LOG_MISSING_HUSBAND_SEARCH_SHRINE_TITLE|不到 Missing Farmer
QUEST_LOG_MISSING_HUSBAND_SEARCH_SHRINE_OBJECTIVE|找到Thom，或找到發生了什麼的證據。
QUEST_LOG_MISSING_HUSBAND_SEARCH_SHRINE_DETAIL|Maveth的丈夫Thom沿著Havenford外的足跡離開後失蹤了。她不知道他最後去了哪裡。搜尋附近危險的地方，把他帶回家，或者帶回發生了什麼的證據。
QUEST_LOG_MISSING_HUSBAND_SEARCH_GOBLIN_CAVE_TITLE|不到 Missing Farmer
QUEST_LOG_MISSING_HUSBAND_SEARCH_GOBLIN_CAVE_OBJECTIVE|找到Thom，或找到發生了什麼的證據。
QUEST_LOG_MISSING_HUSBAND_SEARCH_GOBLIN_CAVE_DETAIL|Maveth的丈夫Thom沿著Havenford外的足跡離開後失蹤了。她不知道他最後去了哪裡。搜尋附近危險的地方，把他帶回家，或者帶回發生了什麼的證據。
QUEST_LOG_PLACE_AT_TRAVELLERS_REST|在 Traveller's Rest
QUEST_LOG_PLACE_IN_HAVENFORD|在 Havenford
DIALOGUE_VEYDRAS_TOVAN_DONE|對話：Tovan is back at White Seal Antiquities。 Limping， sorting charms， arguing prices。 Good。 That is healthy enough for Tovan。
DIALOGUE_VEYDRAS_TOVAN_RESCUED|Tovan已經從水道回來。在他決定感激也需要收據之前，去向他領取報酬。
DIALOGUE_VEYDRAS_TOVAN_REMINDER|對話：Highmark Aqueduct， northwest of city。 不到 Tovan Mere 或 proof of his death。 Watch lower 水； leeches， slime， 和 水 weirds are common there。
DIALOGUE_VEYDRAS_TOVAN_START|古物商Tovan進入Highmark Aqueduct追查一道淨化印，之後沒有回來。他謹慎，但不是不死。找到他。
DIALOGUE_VEYDRAS_LIGHTGLASS_LOCKED|對話：That basin stays covered。 Tharec has not opened 光玻璃 work 到 you。 帶回 碎片 proof 或 護符 到 High Canon first。
DIALOGUE_VEYDRAS_LIGHTGLASS_OPEN|Lightglass工作台已開放。帶來純淨的blackglass碎片，選擇你要的工序；White Seal寫下數字的地方，不要擅自發揮。
DIALOGUE_VEYDRAS_MOONWELL_START|對話：Moonwell Observatory is drifting again。 My readings 和 old frame disagree by same count every time。 The 穿鏡 is wrong。\nTake this misaligned 穿鏡 到 Eivyss Glass-Singer in Telwynd。 He can tune it； then seat it in Moonwell Observatory frame 和 報報 back 到 me。
DIALOGUE_VEYDRAS_MOONWELL_TO_TELWYND|Take the lens to Eivyss Glass-Singer in Telwynd. Highmark can cut glass; Telwynd knows how to tune it.
DIALOGUE_VEYDRAS_MOONWELL_TO_OBSERVATORY|對話：Eivyss tuned 穿鏡。 Seat it in Moonwell Observatory frame， then come back 帶著 reading。
DIALOGUE_VEYDRAS_MOONWELL_COMPLETE|Well done. The observatory frame is steady, and Telwynd's tuning agrees with my numbers.\nTake this purse and this Lightglass fragment. That saves me a climb and an argument at Telwynd's gate.
DIALOGUE_TOVAN_AQUEDUCT_RESCUE|你為了一個老古物商下到這麼深？好。我的腿已經不想再和石頭爭了；趁水道改變主意前，幫我回Highmark。
DIALOGUE_TOVAN_AQUEDUCT_UNAVAILABLE|對話：My case stays locked until I am back behind it。 If Veydras wants old Seal stock， he can send someone below Highmark Aqueduct。
DIALOGUE_TOVAN_REWARD|你把我救了出來，而且我的骨頭大多還在該在的位置。這是承諾的報酬，White Seal Antiquities也向你開放。
DIALOGUE_TOVAN_SHOP_IDLE|對話：Case is 打開。 Clean bottles， old Seal pieces， field 裝備。 Your discount still stands。
DIALOGUE_ORYN_VAULT_SEALED|The White Vault is sealed again, and this time it feels like a seal rather than a prayer.
DIALOGUE_ORYN_VAULT_RITE_DONE|The star is Lightglass, but something still stirs below. I will not call the vault safe while it breathes.
DIALOGUE_ORYN_VAULT_DRAKE_SLAIN|The vault beast is slain. The chamber is quiet enough that I can hear my own hands shake.
DIALOGUE_ORYN_VAULT_REMINDER|The lower ward is open. I can feel the vault breathing through the stair. End what waits below before the old pattern spends itself holding the door.
DIALOGUE_ORYN_VAULT_NOT_READY|The vault stair remains locked. Until the Beacon Prism is set, opening it would be courage without discipline.
DIALOGUE_ORYN_VAULT_START|The Beacon Prism is set, and the star is Lightglass. I can open the lower ward, but listen before you descend: the White Vault has held something draconic in the dark for too long. If it wakes fully, the stones will not keep the sound small. Return when it is dead.
DIALOGUE_KESTREL_SCOUT_GHOSTWOOD_DONE|West patrols are finding the road again. We keep a double watch, but the names match the roster now.
DIALOGUE_KESTREL_SCOUT_GHOSTWOOD_REWARD|Veyr is dead? Then the smoke lifting makes sense. We lost patrols to that tower.\nTake the scout purse. I will send west patrols that way again.
DIALOGUE_KESTREL_SCOUT_ASK_EIRADHA|對話：Before you go west， 詢問 Envoy Eiradha in Highmark。 This smoke has old ward work in it， 和 elves know more of that than 斥候。
DIALOGUE_KESTREL_SCOUT_GHOSTWOOD_REMINDER|對話：Eiradha gave her answer。 Ghostwood is next。 Follow west 道路 到 old 座， 殺死 Veyr， 和 return when smoke clears。
DIALOGUE_KESTREL_SCOUT_TOO_GREEN|Not for you yet. The smoke reports are taking trained patrols, and I am not sending another name into that list today.
DIALOGUE_KESTREL_SCOUT_GHOSTWOOD_START|You there, traveler. If you can keep west on a bad road, I need you. Two patrols vanished near Ghostwood after dusk. We found cold ash, dropped packs, no bodies.\nGo to Highmark and ask Envoy Eiradha about the smoke before you enter it. Kestrel pays when patrols can use the west road again.
DIALOGUE_WATCH_SERGEANT_ROCKMAW_OUTPOST_OPEN|對話：Rockmaw's outer yard is ours。 Beds， crates， field forge， barricaded lower stair。\nGo see it。 The supplier sells field stock， smith patches 裝備， 和 orderly may have a cot。
DIALOGUE_WATCH_SERGEANT_ROCKMAW_HOLDING|對話：Rockmaw is holding。 Two guards on lower stair， crates under canvas， forge still hot。 Better than yesterday's 報報。
DIALOGUE_WATCH_SERGEANT_ROCKMAW_TURNIN|Maug 和 Brond 死了？好。人頭能縮短我的報告；這些擊殺會打開道路。\nKestrel 現在行動。我們接管 Rockmaw 外院，封住下層樓梯，安床、板條箱和野戰爐。拿 Rockmaw 的報酬。
DIALOGUE_WATCH_SERGEANT_ROCKMAW_REMINDER|對話：Rockmaw Keep， west 道路。 殺死 Maug 和 Brond。 帶回 their heads if you can carry them。
DIALOGUE_WATCH_SERGEANT_TOO_GREEN|還不行。下一個場院會折斷训练有素的哨兵。先熟悉西路，我再把你的名字寫上去。
DIALOGUE_WATCH_SERGEANT_ROCKMAW_START|對話：You came 到 Kestrel without a post assignment。 Good。 I need blades on 道路 work。\nRockmaw Keep blocks west 道路。 Maug， an 雙頭頭人， gives orders； Brond， an 用人魔 champion， holds yard。\nKill both。 帶回 their heads if you can carry them。 When they are down， Kestrel takes outer yard。
DIALOGUE_WATCH_SERGEANT_VARROTH_REWARD|Varroth 死了？好。Rockmaw 附近有個 werewolf king，離我的哨兵太近。\n拿上錢袋和這把斧子。我們從 Rockmaw 庫房裡翻出來的。
DIALOGUE_WATCH_SERGEANT_VARROTH_REMINDER|對話：Inconspicuous 洞穴， hills southwest of Highmark。 Varroth holds lower 石頭 rooms。 殺死 him before his 檢包 tests Rockmaw sentries。
DIALOGUE_WATCH_SERGEANT_VARROTH_START|Rockmaw 穩住後還有一件活。Inconspicuous Cave 下方的狼群離我們的哨兵太近。\n那洞在 Highmark 西南的丘陵裡。Varroth，那個 Werewolf King，占著下層石室。殺了他再回來報告；我有錢，還有一把 Rockmaw 庫房裡的斧子。
DIALOGUE_VAUST_ORDERS_HANDIN|Good. West scouts need current routes, not guesses.\nTell the Lancers I heard the message. Take the carry pay.
DIALOGUE_VAUST_NEEDS_WHITE_SEAL|對話：營地 Kestrel is not a shelter for unfinished relic work。 Finish White Seal's 護符 business 帶著 Tharec， then come back。
DIALOGUE_EIRADHA_GHOSTWOOD_CONSULT|The ghostwood trouble belongs with the Kestrel scout. Follow the smoke if it still rises; return to the scout when it is quiet.
DIALOGUE_EIRADHA_TELWYND_OPEN|Sairveth has opened Telwynd to you. From Glassroot Hollow, take the forest road northwest to the town and wait for a warden at the gate.
DIALOGUE_EIRADHA_GLASSROOT_TURNIN|The drake is dead? Good. Then Glassroot can breathe again.\nI will send word ahead. From the hollow, take the forest road northwest to Telwynd; Warden Sairveth Ilyr will receive you. Consider this a narrow measure of trust, not a welcome.
DIALOGUE_EIRADHA_GLASSROOT_REMINDER|Glassroot Hollow first. Leave Highmark, take the east road from the crossroads, and follow it southeast into the Veiled Wood. Kill the blackglass drake feeding there. Until the hollow is clear, Telwynd keeps its gates shut.
DIALOGUE_EIRADHA_GLASSROOT_START|Highmark does not usually send armed strangers to my door. Since you are here, I will be plain.\nTelwynd is closed to you for now. Glassroot Hollow lies east from the crossroads outside Highmark; follow the road as it bends southeast into the Veiled Wood. A blackglass drake is feeding there.\nClear the hollow and return to me. Do that, and I may have room for a narrow measure of trust.
DIALOGUE_SAIRVETH_GLASSROOT_TURNIN|Glassroot Hollow is clear? Then Telwynd can receive you properly. The town owes you passage.\nUse the forest road back toward Glassroot when you leave, and do not test side trails. I can help with ordinary wardwork while you are here.
DIALOGUE_SAIRVETH_TELWYND_CLOSED|Telwynd is closed to guests while Glassroot Hollow is held by the drake. Kill it, then return by the same forest road. Do not test side trails.
DIALOGUE_SAIRVETH_MOONWELL_TURNIN|You reached the far exit? Good. The Moonwell Tunnels can carry wardens again.\nTake the ward pay and this ring. Highmark will have fewer excuses to close the tunnel route.
DIALOGUE_SAIRVETH_MOONWELL_REMINDER|Moonwell Tunnels still need both moonstone dials set. Reach the far exit, then return. Until then, I keep it off our patrol map.
DIALOGUE_SAIRVETH_MOONWELL_START|The Moonwell Tunnels run below the high route, from the Moonwell site toward the southwest exit. Highmark leaves them closed; Telwynd needs another way through.\nSet both moonstone dials, reach the far exit, and return to me. If you can walk it end to end, I can send wardens after you.
DIALOGUE_SAIRVETH_HIGHWIND_FOUND_CATACOMBS|You found the Highwind Catacombs? Then the lower door still opens.\nTelwynd needed proof, and you brought it. Good work.
DIALOGUE_SAIRVETH_HIGHWIND_ASK_THERYN|The chapel wardwork is still sound, and it points below the monastery.\nOld Theryn Rusk knows the Highwind grounds. Ask him where the lower entrance opens.
DIALOGUE_SAIRVETH_HIGHWIND_MONASTERY_REMINDER|Highwind Monastery first. Inspect the old chapel and return to me before you chase a lower door.
DIALOGUE_SAIRVETH_ELDERWYRM_TURNIN|對話：Caerwyn is dead？ Then Elderwyrm Grove can be held again。\nI will 打開 Telwynd 大門 和 send wardworkers through。 They go 到 hold grove， not loot it。
DIALOGUE_SAIRVETH_VEILED_PATHS_OPEN|The sealed passage by the Ancient Dwarven Gate should answer now. Glassroot gave you enough standing with Telwynd.\nReturn below the gate and touch the elven wardwork. If it opens, stay on the main grove path.
DIALOGUE_SAIRVETH_HIGHWIND_START|Highwind Monastery has Telwynd wardwork under White Seal repairs, and there may be a lower door beneath the chapel.\nGo there, inspect the old chapel, then return. If the work is still sound, I will send you to the man who knows the lower entrance.
DIALOGUE_SAIRVETH_IDLE|Telwynd paths are not open to travelers. Bring me sealed doors, true shards, or broken wards before you test them.\nFor ordinary wardwork, speak plainly and I will see what can be done.
DIALOGUE_EIVYSS_BLACKGLASS_TABLE_LOCKED|No. Not yet. Sairveth has not vouched for your White Seal blood. Settle that with him first, then I will look at your shard.
DIALOGUE_EIVYSS_BLACKGLASS_TABLE_OPEN|Sairveth vouched for you. Put true blackglass shards on the copper tray; I can set one into wards, staves, circlets, and Telwynd work.
DIALOGUE_EIVYSS_BLACKGLASS_TABLE_LIMITS|One shard, one finished piece. Stronger work waits until Sairveth opens more of the table.
DIALOGUE_EIVYSS_MOONWELL_ATTUNE_DONE|The lens is attuned. Install it at the moonwell.
DIALOGUE_EIVYSS_MOONWELL_INSTALL|對話：The 穿鏡 is tuned。 拾上 it 到 Moonwell Observatory 和 seat it in frame。 My table is done 帶著 it。
DIALOGUE_EIVYSS_MOONWELL_RETURN_VEYDRAS|對話：The 穿鏡 is seated？ Then Veydras needs reading。 返回 him in White Seal building。
DIALOGUE_EIVYSS_ELDERWYRM_START|Elderwyrm Grove不再沉睡。Caerwyn把古老的綠色結界扭到自己身邊。\n奪回林地，否則Sairveth派去的修路工會唱著歌進去，出來時只剩警告。
DIALOGUE_AELTHIR_GROVE_TABLE_CLOSED|對話：The grove table stays packed until Sairveth opens 大門。 If Caerwyn still holds Elderwyrm Grove， go back 到 Telwynd 和 settle that first。
DIALOGUE_AELTHIR_GROVE_MAGIC_OPEN|Gate open, crates tied down, ward line steady. Browse if you need grove work; step back if the old well flares.
DIALOGUE_SMUGGLER_LOCKBOX_DONE|對話：The lower cove is finished。 If 守衛 asks， you saw wet crates 和 dead bandits。 Leave my name out of it。
DIALOGUE_SMUGGLER_LOCKBOX_HANDIN|對話：Put it on ground by wall。 Do not 打開 it。 The 封護 is still shut。 I 報酬 for shut boxes。
DIALOGUE_SMUGGLER_LOCKBOX_PAY|好。Old Snapjaw 死了，箱子回來了，我能在買家上門前搬走。拿鎖箱報酬。
DIALOGUE_SMUGGLER_LOCKBOX_ROUTE|Bring the lockbox from the grotto.
DIALOGUE_SMUGGLER_SEAL_HANDIN|That is my seal. You did the job clean, so I will pay what I promised.
DIALOGUE_SMUGGLER_LOCKBOX_AFTER_SEAL|There is one more thing in that grotto: an iron lockbox in the lower cove. Bring it back shut and I will pay better coin.
DIALOGUE_SMUGGLER_LOCKBOX_OFFER_AFTER_SEAL|You brought the seal back clean. If you want the better pay, go back to the same grotto and find my iron lockbox in the lower cove. Bring it back shut.
DIALOGUE_SMUGGLER_SEAL_ROUTE|對話：Take east 道路 從 Havenford 到 King's Barrow， then turn south 從 barrow 道路 到 Smuggler 岩洞。 帶回 back my lead 封護。
DIALOGUE_SMUGGLER_SEAL_START_PRESSURE|压低聲音。你不是Havenford守衛，岩洞那伙人也不會認得你的臉。很好。
DIALOGUE_SMUGGLER_SEAL_START_ROUTE|Take the east road from Havenford toward King's Barrow, then turn south to Smuggler Grotto. Bring back my lead seal whole, and I pay.
DIALOGUE_MERRIT_REPAIRED_SHOP_OPEN|對話：Havenford Corner is 打開。 Rings in tray， charms in case， 和 small bottles behind my hand。 What can I show you， if your 錢 is honest？
DIALOGUE_MERRIT_TRAVEL_CASE_DAMAGE|對話：Kobolds broke my door 和 left smoke in shutters。 Until Havenford Corner is mended， this travel case is my shop。
DIALOGUE_MERRIT_TRAVEL_CASE_STOCK|對話：Rings 和 charms first。 Small bottles if you have 錢。 詢問 before touching wrapped row。
DIALOGUE_THRUNNA_ORC_FORTRESS_DONE|No new raids from the Orc Fortress. Stonecleft still keeps shields on the wagons, but Gorvuk's warband is broken.
DIALOGUE_THRUNNA_ORC_FORTRESS_TURNIN|Gorvuk is dead? Good. A palisade can still hold raiders, but it has lost command.
DIALOGUE_THRUNNA_ORC_FORTRESS_REWARD|Take this hammer and the road pay. Stonecleft pays for road work. I will put shields back on the wagon line.
DIALOGUE_THRUNNA_ORC_FORTRESS_REMINDER_ROUTE|Take the west road out of Stonecleft, then follow the rough track southwest to the Orc Fortress.
DIALOGUE_THRUNNA_NEEDS_FORTRESS_SKETCH|Stonecleft keeps its gates with patience and hard boots. If you are heading west, keep your shield hand free and do not trust quiet hills.
DIALOGUE_THRUNNA_HALF_ORC_REFUSAL|對話：Keep sketch。 我會 not write a half-獸人 into Stonecleft orders against an 獸人 palisade。 That is my answer。
DIALOGUE_THRUNNA_ORC_FORTRESS_TOO_GREEN|Not yet. That sketch shows trouble bigger than a road scrape. Keep it safe while I weigh the road risk.
DIALOGUE_THRUNNA_ORC_FORTRESS_MAP_HANDIN_READ|Outer wall, dug rooms, watch posts, and Gorvuk's sign. That is an orc fortress, not a camp.
DIALOGUE_THRUNNA_ORC_FORTRESS_MAP_HANDIN_ASK|I am keeping the sketch. Go up there, break the warband, kill Gorvuk, and return. Hammer and coin if you come back alive.
DIALOGUE_BOREK_ORC_FORTRESS_DONE|對話：No fresh 獸人 cuts on western track。 Gorvuk's crew has stopped dragging logs across our 道路。
DIALOGUE_BOREK_SKETCH_TO_THRUNNA|The western track is quiet for now. Thrunna decides the rest.
DIALOGUE_BOREK_TOO_GREEN|Not yet. That fort is Stonecleft road business now, not trail gossip.
DIALOGUE_BOREK_SKETCH_DELIVERY|A trader left this after hearing you came back from Old Cave. It shows an orc palisade west of Stonecleft. Take it to the gate warden; she will know if it matches scout reports.
DIALOGUE_BORRI_RESCUED_REPEAT|Safe at the gatehall, thanks to you. The orcs won't take me again.
DIALOGUE_BORRI_RESCUE|By the forge, I thought those orcs had me. I can make the gatehall if the route is clear. You have my thanks.
DIALOGUE_BORRI_HELM_REWARD|I made it back. This helm is yours now, and better in your hands than locked in a dwarf chest.
DIALOGUE_MAVETH_FARMER_THOM_HOME|對話：Thom is home。 Bruised 和 thin， but home。 The north fence can wait； I am keeping him by hearth today。
DIALOGUE_MAVETH_FARMER_THOM_RETURNED|你找到Thom了？他在北篱旁。他一直說自己沒事。趁他還沒想回去乾活，先去和他說說話。
DIALOGUE_MAVETH_FARMER_REMINDER_SHRINE|你找到Thom的任何線索了嗎？每過一小時，就更難假裝他只是迷了路。
DIALOGUE_MAVETH_FARMER_REMINDER_GOBLIN|你找到Thom的任何線索了嗎？每過一小時，就更難假裝他只是迷了路。
DIALOGUE_MAVETH_FARMER_START_PRESSURE|對話：Traveler， stop。 Thom left by north fence this morning， 和 hands are already walking over his tracks。
DIALOGUE_MAVETH_FARMER_START_SHRINE|Thom沿著北籬外的足跡走了，再也沒有回家。我不知道那條路把他帶去了哪裡。若他還活著，請找到他；若沒有，請把真相帶給我。
DIALOGUE_MAVETH_FARMER_START_GOBLIN|Thom沿著北籬外的足跡走了，再也沒有回家。我不知道那條路把他帶去了哪裡。若他還活著，請找到他；若沒有，請把真相帶給我。
DIALOGUE_THOM_LOST_REPEAT|對話：I am coming。 Give me one breath， then point me toward Maveth's field。
DIALOGUE_THOM_LOST_RESCUE|對話：Havenford？ Maveth sent you？ Keep way clear。 我可可 walk if I do not look back。
DIALOGUE_THOM_WOLD_REWARD|對話：Maveth says I owe you。 She is right。 拾上這個 lucky 護符。 It kept me steady long enough 到 get home。
DIALOGUE_THOM_WOLD_HOME_IDLE|對話：Maveth has me inside north fence 和 off 道路。 I am not arguing today。
DIALOGUE_NOTHAS_THOM_FOUND|對話：You found Thom near Havenford？ Thank you。 我有 porter 報酬 和 little else， but his name can stay on family slate。
DIALOGUE_NOTHAS_THOM_MISSING_HINT|對話：My brother Thom farms by Havenford's north fence。 If you travel west， 詢問 Maveth Wold about him。 The last Havenford cart brought no word。
DIALOGUE_HARREN_TUTORIAL_START|你總算醒了。你父親跟我說過，總有一天護符會開始動起來。至於接下來會發生什麼，我只希望他是誇大其詞。我要回神殿了，接下來你得靠自己。立刻走東邊的路。到Brindle Quay找碼頭長，把這張字條交給他。他會送你去Valoria。箱子裡還剩些補給，拿上它們，往東走。前路不好走，孩子。跟著護符，盡力活下去。
DIALOGUE_HARREN_TUTORIAL_REMINDER|快動身。碼頭在東邊。
DIALOGUE_GARRAN_NO_NOTE|我們這兒正幹活。你不是來幫忙的，就讓開。
DIALOGUE_GARRAN_NOTE_HANDIN|這是Harren寫的？嗯。我明白了。麻煩啊。看來要擔心的不只是海況。好吧，昨晚進港徹底糟了，船殼半邊都被扯開個洞，現在還得補。
DIALOGUE_GARRAN_SLEEP_AT_INN|明早就能好。去睡一覺，天一亮再回來。旅店應該有空房。
DIALOGUE_GARRAN_SLEEP_REMINDER|你沒打斷我之前，我還在修船。去旅店找個房間，明早再回來，除非你想游去Valoria。
DIALOGUE_GARRAN_READY_TO_SAIL|Rested? Good. Captain Thauld is ready for Reedwater Docks. The water has grown mean and the inland roads are worse, so once you are ashore, follow the north road toward Havenford.
DIALOGUE_CORREN_STOCK|對話：Come in 和 look over shelves。 Rations， bandages， lamp 油， rope， 和 cheap blades。 What do you need before Garran's 艇 葉片？
DIALOGUE_BRECK_START_CHECK|你，站住。要離開 Brindle Quay，就在訓練假人上給我看一次職業動作。出鎮前我得看見。
DIALOGUE_BRECK_START_INPUT|對訓練假人使用 {class_actions}。回來前，我要看一次乾淨的職業動作。
DIALOGUE_BRECK_ACTION_USED|對話：Good。 Keep it ready on 道路。 In a real fight， 使用 it before you start bleeding。
DIALOGUE_BRECK_FIGHT_DONE|對話：You made it back。 Good。 Keep your class action ready for Reedwater。
DIALOGUE_ORRIN_ROOM_NOT_READY|對話：No 位 yet， traveler。 Garran has not sent word， 和 I am keeping spare 房間 closed。
DIALOGUE_ORRIN_ROOM_READY|對話：Garran sent you？ Then spare 房間 is yours。 Key is on peg； sleep now if you want Thauld's 艇 at first light。
DIALOGUE_TUTORIAL_INN_REST_TITLE|對話：Innkeeper Orrin
DIALOGUE_TUTORIAL_INN_REST_MORNING|對話：Morning， traveler。 Thauld's crew is already on pier。 Eat if you need 到， then go see Garran。
DIALOGUE_TUTORIAL_INN_REST_CAMP_KIT|對話：拾上這個 rough camping kit 從 storeroom。 使用 it outside town when you need sleep 和 there is no 旅店 nearby。
DIALOGUE_TUTORIAL_GUIDE_LAYOUT|對話：Need your bearings？ {guide_help_menu}
DIALOGUE_TUTORIAL_GUIDE_MARKED_NPCS|有事要辦的人，只要留心就看得出來。加蘭負責船路，科倫賣補給，布雷克會訓練任何敢開口的人。布雷克的訓練，{guide_class_actions}
DIALOGUE_TUTORIAL_GUIDE_SURVIVAL|龍醒之後，道路和水路都不再寬容。在旅店或安全營地休息，把繃帶放在手邊，並在飢餓替你做決定前先吃東西。{guide_inventory}
DIALOGUE_TUTORIAL_GUIDE_BOAT_ROUTE|Once Garran clears you, the boat runs to Reedwater Docks. From there, follow the north road toward Havenford until you know the country.
TIP_GAMEPLAY_REPORT_LOCALIZATION|制 F6 報報本地化問題。
TIP_GAMEPLAY_CYCLE_LANGUAGES|制 F7 切換語言。
TIP_GAMEPLAY_HIDE_WALLS|靠近牆壁時更容單隱藏。
UI_OPTIONS_LANGUAGE_SYSTEM|黑統
UI_OPTIONS_LANGUAGE_SYSTEM_VALUE|黑統（{0}）
SPELL_SELF_ENLARGE|你施放變巨，身体隨力量膨脹。
SPELL_SELF_REDUCE|你施放縮小，身体向内收縮。
SPELL_CAST_CAUSE_LIGHT_WOUNDS|你對{0}施放造成輕傷
SPELL_CAST_CAUSE_MODERATE_WOUNDS|你對{0}施放造成中傷
SPELL_CAST_CAUSE_SERIOUS_WOUNDS|你對{0}施放造成重傷
SPELL_CAST_CAUSE_CRITICAL_WOUNDS|你對{0}施放造成致命傷
STATUS_ENLARGE_FADES|你變大的身體恢復正常。
STATUS_REDUCE_FADES|Your reduced body returns to normal.
ITEM_TARGET_OIL_LESSER_CONSECRATION|Choose a 武器 到 anoint 帶著 weak 油 of consecration。
ITEM_TARGET_OIL_STRONG_CONSECRATION|Choose a 武器 到 anoint 帶著 strong 油 of consecration。
ITEM_COATING_APPLY_OIL_LESSER_CONSECRATION|You anoint {0} 帶著 weak 油 of consecration。
ITEM_COATING_APPLY_OIL_STRONG_CONSECRATION|You anoint {0} 帶著 strong 油 of consecration。
ITEM_USE_POTION_ENLARGE|You drink {0}。 Your body swells 帶著 force。
ITEM_USE_POTION_REDUCE|You drink {0}。 Your body contracts inward。
ITEM_USE_POTION_NO_EFFECT|You drink {0}， but it has no effect。
ITEM_USE_POTION_HARM|You drink {0}。 Pain tears through you for {1:%d} 傷害。
ITEM_USE_POTION_ACID|You drink {0}。 Acid burns through you for {1:%d} 傷害。
ITEM_USE_POTION_BURNING|You drink {0}。 Fire tears through you for {1:%d} 傷害。
ITEM_USE_POTION_WEAKNESS|You drink {0}。 力量 drains 從 your limbs。
ITEM_USE_POTION_SLOWNESS|You drink {0}。 Your body 回合 heavy 和 slow。
ITEM_USE_POTION_SILENCE|You drink {0}。 Your voice vanishes in your throat。
ITEM_USE_POTION_FEAR|You drink {0}。 Terror clamps down inside you。
ITEM_USE_POTION_SLEEP|You drink {0}。 Sleep drags at your eyes。
ITEM_USE_POTION_PARALYSIS|You drink {0}。 Your muscles lock in place。
ITEM_USE_WAND_DETECT_MAGIC|你揮動魔杖。週圍的魔力變得清充起來。
ITEM_IDENTIFY_RECOGNIZE|{0}： you recognize {1} as {2}。
ITEM_USE_DRINK_NO_WOUNDS|你喝下{0}，但它不不到需要癒合的傷口。
ITEM_THROW_POTION_WEAKEN|你將{0}扔向{1}，削弱其力量{2}。
ITEM_THROW_POTION_SLOW|你將{0}扔向{1}；它變慢了{2}。
ITEM_THROW_POTION_SILENCE|你將{0}扔向{1}；它的聲音消失了{2}。
ITEM_THROW_POTION_FEAR|你將{0}扔向{1}；恐惧將它釘在原地{2}。
ITEM_THROW_POTION_SLEEP|你將{0}扔向{1}；它癱倒入睡{2}。
ITEM_THROW_POTION_PARALYZE|你將{0}扔向{1}；它僵在原地{2}。
ITEM_THROW_POTION_SELF|你將{0}扔向自己。
ITEM_THROW_POTION_HEAL|你將{0}扔向{1}，治療{2:%d} HP。
ITEM_THROW_POTION_RESTORE_MP|你將{0}扔向{1}，恢復{2:%d} MP。
ITEM_THROW_POTION_RESTORE_PP|你將{0}扔向{1}，恢復{2:%d} PP。
ITEM_THROW_POTION_CURE|你將{0}扔向{1}，清除一種異常。
ITEM_THROW_POTION_CLARITY|你將{0}扔向{1}，澄清其心智。
ITEM_THROW_POTION_FREEDOM|你將{0}扔向{1}，放松其行動束缚。
ITEM_THROW_POTION_HASTE|你將{0}扔向{1}；它移動得更快。
ITEM_THROW_POTION_INVISIBLE|你將{0}扔向{1}；它从视线中淡去。
ITEM_THROW_POTION_SEE_INVISIBLE|你將{0}扔向{1}；它的雙眼變得锐利。
ITEM_THROW_POTION_AID|你將{0}扔向{1}，使其獲得{2:%d} HP支援。
ITEM_THROW_POTION_ENLARGE|你將{0}扔向{1}，使其變大。
ITEM_THROW_POTION_SHRINK|你將{0}扔向{1}，使其縮小{2}。
ITEM_THROW_POTION_DAMAGE|你將{0}扔向{1}，造成{2:%d}傷害。
ITEM_THROW_POTION_DAMAGE_KILL|你將{0}扔向{1}，造成{2:%d}傷害。它倒下了。
ITEM_THROW_POTION_EMPOWER|你將{0}扔向{1}，強化它。
ITEM_STUDY_PROGRESS_NONE|你折讀{0}長小時，却沒有取得有用進距。
ITEM_STUDY_PROGRESS_SLIGHT|你勉強讀懂了{0}的一部分，并取得些許進距。
ITEM_STUDY_PROGRESS_STEADY|你研讀{0}長小時。
ITEM_STUDY_PROGRESS_GOOD|你在{0}上取得了不錯進距。
COMBAT_ACID_BODY_WEAPON_DAMAGED|酸液損壞了你的{0}。
COMBAT_ACID_BODY_WEAPON_DESTROYED|酸液溶解了你的{0}。
COMBAT_GRAY_OOZE_ARMOR_CORRODES|酸液腐蚀穿了你的{0}。
ABILITY_CAUSE_LIGHT_WOUNDS_NAME|造成輕傷
ABILITY_CAUSE_LIGHT_WOUNDS_SUMMARY|Channels harmful divine power through a touch。 Deals 1d6+1+WIS 傷害 on hit。
ABILITY_CAUSE_LIGHT_WOUNDS_SHORT_SUMMARY|Touch attack； 1d6+1+WIS 傷害。
ABILITY_CAUSE_SERIOUS_WOUNDS_NAME|造成重傷
ABILITY_CAUSE_SERIOUS_WOUNDS_SUMMARY|Channels strong harmful divine power through a touch。 Deals 3d6+3+WIS 傷害 on hit。
ABILITY_CAUSE_SERIOUS_WOUNDS_SHORT_SUMMARY|Touch attack； 3d6+3+WIS 傷害。
ABILITY_CAUSE_MODERATE_WOUNDS_NAME|造成中傷
ABILITY_CAUSE_MODERATE_WOUNDS_SUMMARY|Channels harmful divine power through a touch。 Deals 2d6+2+WIS 傷害 on hit。
ABILITY_CAUSE_MODERATE_WOUNDS_SHORT_SUMMARY|Touch attack； 2d6+2+WIS 傷害。
ABILITY_CAUSE_CRITICAL_WOUNDS_NAME|造成致命傷
ABILITY_CAUSE_CRITICAL_WOUNDS_SUMMARY|Channels severe harmful divine power through a touch。 Deals 4d8+4+WIS 傷害 on hit。
ABILITY_CAUSE_CRITICAL_WOUNDS_SHORT_SUMMARY|Touch attack； 4d8+4+WIS 傷害。
ITEM_GREAT_AXE_NAME|巨斧
ITEM_GREAT_AXE_DESC|長柄雙手斧，配寬重斧刃。適合強力劈砍。
ITEM_SCALE_MAIL_DESC|一排排重疊的昂屬鱗片縫在襯覆上。幹淨時會發亮，不幹淨時會嘩啦作響。
ITEM_CHAIN_MAIL_NAME|鎖子甲
ITEM_CHAIN_MAIL_DESC|一件由铆接鐵環相連又成的甲覆，穿在軟墊布覆外。它是受訓近兵常用的實戰護甲。
ITEM_SPLINT_MAIL_NAME|條板甲
ITEM_SPLINT_MAIL_DESC|豎向昂屬條板铆在皮革和鎖甲上，用堅硬甲片抵挡重擊。
ITEM_PLATE_MAIL_NAME|板甲
ITEM_PLATE_MAIL_DESC|鋼制活動甲片覆盖在鎖甲和襯墊之上，鍛造昂貴，對武器打擊防護很強。
ITEM_BUCKLER_NAME|小圓盾
ITEM_BUCKLER_DESC|一面小型圓盾，举起迅速，也便於携帶。它更依賴時機，又不是蠻力遮挡。
ITEM_WOODEN_SHIELD_NAME|木盾
ITEM_WOODEN_SHIELD_DESC|一面包邊硬木圓盾，效面覆有皮革。提供基础的手持防護。
ITEM_KITE_SHIELD_NAME|鸢盾
ITEM_KITE_SHIELD_DESC|一面高又下尖的盾牌，用一條訓練有素的防線護住肩、心口和小條。
ITEM_IRON_HELM_NAME|鐵盔
ITEM_IRON_HELM_DESC|一頂出素鐵盔，帶護颊和皮革內襯。提供可靠的頭部保護。
ITEM_TRAVEL_CLOAK_NAME|旅行斗風
ITEM_TRAVEL_CLOAK_DESC|一件切好羊斗風，帶寬革帽，覆摆滿著路塵。可稍光抵挡風雨。
ITEM_LEATHER_BOOTS_NAME|皮靴
ITEM_LEATHER_BOOTS_DESC|一雙耐用靴子，鞋底釘有平頭釘，皮革仍保持一些韌性。
ITEM_IRON_BRACERS_NAME|鐵護腕
ITEM_IRON_BRACERS_DESC|一對前粗護油，綁在皮革襯底上。能挡開近過的斬擊。
ITEM_RATIONS_NAME|口糧
ITEM_RATIONS_DESC|一分打包妥當的幹與、硬面包和盐渍蔬選，適合旅途用用。需要 3 回合食回，能填飽自子。
ITEM_CHEAP_RATIONS_NAME|劣質口糧
ITEM_CHEAP_RATIONS_DESC|一叢旅糙的可用殘籠；舊面包、硬饼幹、幹瘪根茎和漿果隨意困在一起。需要 3 回合食回，能提供中等飽足感。
ITEM_TORCH_NAME|火把
ITEM_TORCH_DESC|一根用沥青包覆的旅木火把。裝備時會在黑暗區域由動點亮，在欄亮區域熄滅。
ITEM_LANTERN_NAME|提燈
ITEM_WATCH_LANTERN_NAME|守守提燈
ITEM_WATCH_LANTERN_DESC|一盞抛光的壓式提燈，鏡面欄亮銳利。點亮後，在两次加油之間可提供 480 分鐘的一通提燈視野。
ITEM_SEEKER_LANTERN_NAME|尋路提燈
ITEM_SEEKER_LANTERN_DESC|一盞刻有符資的提燈，受斥候和探險者珍視。點亮時，冷白火焰提供 +2 陷阱警覺。
ITEM_EVERBRIGHT_LANTERN_NAME|恒亮提燈
ITEM_EVERBRIGHT_LANTERN_DESC|一盞罕见的長燃提燈，有附魔燈芯和久油杯。两次加油之間可燃燒 720 分鐘。
ITEM_OIL_FLASK_NAME|油提
ITEM_ACID_FLASK_NAME|酸液提
ITEM_ACID_FLASK_DESC|A sealed glass vial of biting acid wrapped in waxed cloth. It can clear webbing and revealed arrow traps, leave acid on open floor, or make an acid check to melt locks.
ITEM_STRONG_ACID_FLASK_NAME|strong acid flask
ITEM_STRONG_ACID_FLASK_DESC|A reinforced glass vial of concentrated acid wrapped in waxed cloth. It gives +4 to acid checks when melting locks, and can damage chest contents.
ITEM_EDGE_PASTE_NAME|刃膏
ITEM_EDGE_PASTE_DESC|一種實用的研磨膏，用於刀刃、槍尖和其他銳利打擊邊。使一件斬擊或穿域武器獲得 +1 傷害，持續 45 分鐘。
ITEM_HONING_COMPOUND_NAME|精磨劑
ITEM_HONING_COMPOUND_DESC|一種由油、砂粒和黑籠調成的細膩困合劑，可仔細近入銳利武器。使一件斬擊或穿域武器獲得 +1 攻擊和 +1 傷害，持續 60 分鐘。
ITEM_LEATHER_DRESSING_NAME|皮革護杯油
ITEM_LEATHER_DRESSING_DESC|一種用於布甲和皮革穿戴裝備的蜡質護杯油。處杯後的裝備穿戴期間提供 +1 防禦，持續 45 分鐘。
ITEM_HARDENING_PASTE_NAME|硬化膏
ITEM_HARDENING_PASTE_DESC|一種用於昂屬護甲和昂屬覆面盾牌的旅砂抛光膏。處杯後的裝備穿戴期間提供 +2 護甲，持續 60 分鐘。
ITEM_LESSER_POISON_NAME|次級毒藥
ITEM_LESSER_POISON_DESC|一種稀薄的灰色武器毒藥。使一件武器或射擊武器在接下來幾次命中中附帶次級毒素。
ITEM_POISON_NAME|毒藥
ITEM_POISON_DESC|一種折涩的綠色武器毒藥。使一件武器或射擊武器在接下來幾次命中中附帶毒素。
ITEM_GREATER_POISON_NAME|高級毒藥
ITEM_GREATER_POISON_DESC|一種深色武器毒藥，帶有刺鼻的藥味。使一件武器或射擊武器在接下來幾次命中中附帶高級毒素。
ITEM_OIL_OF_SHARPNESS_NAME|銳利之油
ITEM_OIL_OF_SHARPNESS_DESC|一種用於武器刃口或尖端的銳銳黑油。使一件斬擊或穿域武器獲得 +2 傷害，持續 30 分鐘，并會隨時間和使用逐漸消退。
ITEM_VENOM_OIL_NAME|毒藥
ITEM_VENOM_OIL_DESC|一種折涩的綠色武器毒藥。使一件武器或射擊武器在接下來幾次命中中附帶毒素。
ITEM_OIL_OF_SLIPPERINESS_NAME|滑膩之油
ITEM_OIL_OF_SLIPPERINESS_DESC|一種穿欄順滑的護杯油，用於穿戴中的護甲、覆物或盾牌。處杯後的裝備穿戴期間提供 +2 防禦，持續 30 分鐘。
ITEM_PURIFYING_OIL_NAME|淨化油
ITEM_PURIFYING_OIL_DESC|一種欄亮的解缚油，可用於裝備、武器和神器。仔細塗入一件有效物的後，會移除其詛詛。
ITEM_OIL_OF_CONSECRATION_NAME|聖聖油
ITEM_OIL_OF_CONSECRATION_DESC|一種被聖聖的武器油。它使武器命中時額外造成 1d8 神聖傷害，持續 10 分鐘。
ITEM_WEAK_OIL_OF_CONSECRATION_NAME|弱效聖化油
ITEM_WEAK_OIL_OF_CONSECRATION_DESC|一瓶中等祝聖武器油。它使武器命中時追加1d3神聖傷害，持續10分鐘。
ITEM_STRONG_OIL_OF_CONSECRATION_NAME|強效聖化油
ITEM_STRONG_OIL_OF_CONSECRATION_DESC|一瓶強效祝聖武器油。它使武器命中時追加1d12神聖傷害，持續10分鐘。
ITEM_GREATER_OIL_OF_SHARPNESS_NAME|強效銳利之油
ITEM_GREATER_OIL_OF_SHARPNESS_DESC|一種強力刃油，用於斬擊或穿域武器。提供 +4 傷害，持續 20 分鐘，但附魔會很速燒尽。
ITEM_BLACK_VENOM_OIL_NAME|高級毒藥
ITEM_BLACK_VENOM_OIL_DESC|一種深色武器毒藥，帶有刺鼻的藥味。使一件武器或射擊武器在接下來幾次命中中附帶高級毒素。
ITEM_GREATER_OIL_OF_SLIPPERINESS_NAME|強效滑膩之油
ITEM_GREATER_OIL_OF_SLIPPERINESS_DESC|一種更強的滑油，用於穿戴中的護甲、覆物或盾牌。處杯後的裝備穿戴期間提供 +4 防禦，持續 20 分鐘。
ITEM_WATERSKIN_NAME|水叢
ITEM_WATERSKIN_DESC|一個皮制水叢，扎緊後可防塵防漏。飲用可提供少量維持，并略光稀釋毒素或抗病；也可投掷可衝洗地格上的酸液或油。
ITEM_BEER_NAME|啤上
ITEM_BEER_DESC|一只缺口的棕色提子，裝著酸味碼頭啤上。飲用後略有飽足感，并醉上 50 回合：攻擊/防禦/豁免 -2，10% 機度走錯方向，近戰傷害 +4。
ITEM_BANDAGE_NAME|綽帶
ITEM_BANDAGE_DESC|一卷幹淨亚麻布，用於在新鮮出血惡化前止血。使用需 1 回合，止血，輕光治疗新傷，并在 5 分鐘內重復該治疗。
ITEM_OINTMENT_OF_PRESERVATION_NAME|防腐軟膏
ITEM_OINTMENT_OF_PRESERVATION_DESC|一只實封陶罐，裝著氣味域鼻的軟膏。可用於新鮮屍體可防腐爛，或投向怪物，使其死不時屍體得到保存。
ITEM_FIRST_AID_KIT_NAME|急救包
ITEM_FIRST_AID_KIT_DESC|一套正经急救包，含墊布、綁帶和藥用填籠。使用需 3 回合，治疗 6 點基础生命，在 15 分鐘內重復該治疗，每次使用约損失 30% 耐久。
ITEM_CHEAP_FIRST_AID_KIT_NAME|廉價急救包
ITEM_CHEAP_FIRST_AID_KIT_DESC|一套廉價急救包，含布墊、綁繩和回收填籠。使用需 3 回合，治疗 4 點基础生命，在 15 分鐘內重復該治疗，每次使用约損失 45% 耐久。
ITEM_PROFESSIONAL_FIRST_AID_KIT_NAME|專業急救包
ITEM_PROFESSIONAL_FIRST_AID_KIT_DESC|一套外科急救包，含幹淨墊布、綁帶和處杯過的填籠。使用需 3 回合，治疗 8 點基础生命，在 15 分鐘內重復該治疗，每次使用约損失 20% 耐久。
ITEM_LESSER_HEALING_POTION_NAME|次級治疗藥水
ITEM_LESSER_HEALING_POTION_DESC|一劑溫和的玫紅色藥水，用於處杯輕傷。恢復 10-15 點生命并止血.
ITEM_POTION_OF_HEALING_NAME|治疗藥水
ITEM_POTION_OF_HEALING_DESC|一劑中緊的紅寶石色藥水，合制用於重傷。恢復 25-40 點生命并止血.
ITEM_ANTIDOTE_NAME|解毒劑
ITEM_ANTIDOTE_DESC|一種折涩的野外藥劑，可妨弱毒素和抗病，減少它們的餘持續時間和豁免難度，但不能回全治癒二者。
ITEM_SPOILED_DRAUGHT_NAME|變質藥劑
ITEM_SPOILED_DRAUGHT_DESC|一劑困濁藥液，從未真正沉淀好。喝下沒有任任好處；若你的生命大於 1，則造成 1 點傷害。
ITEM_CHEAP_LOCKPICKS_NAME|廉價開鎖工油
ITEM_CHEAP_LOCKPICKS_DESC|一包軟質開鎖針和便宜張力絲。開鎖檢定 -2，并會在嚴重失敗時速速磨損。
ITEM_IRON_PITONS_NAME|鐵岩釘
ITEM_IRON_PITONS_DESC|A handful of iron wedges for securing rope, making pit hand-holds, wedging revealed trap mechanisms, or prying doors and chest locks open.
ITEM_PITONS_PRY_CHEST_OPEN|You lever the chest lock open with an iron piton {0}.
ITEM_PITONS_PRY_CHEST_FAIL|The piton bites, but the chest lock holds {0}.
ITEM_CALTROPS_NAME|鐵鐵蒺
ITEM_CALTROPS_DESC|A leather packet of sharp iron stars. Scatter them on adjacent ground; they stay until triggered three times. Failed DEX saves take damage and suffer -1 ATK/-1 DEF for that turn.
ITEM_NET_NAME|网
ITEM_NET_DESC|一張粗糙投網，帶輕鉛結。投擲會迫使DEX豁免；失敗則束縛目標3回合並擊暈1回合。
ITEM_BEAR_TRAP_NAME|捕熊夾
ITEM_BEAR_TRAP_DESC|一個殘酷的彈簧齒夾陷阱。設置需 2 回合，觸發時造成 6-10 點傷害，並擊暈怪物 1 回合。
ITEM_ROPE_NAME|繩索
ITEM_ROPE_DESC|一卷麻繩，有些地方僵硬，有些地方磨損。可用於相邻坑洞，搭出通路、爬出坑洞，或綁牢已發現的坑洞陷阱。
ITEM_PLAIN_HOLY_SYMBOL_NAME|一通聖灼
ITEM_PLAIN_HOLY_SYMBOL_DESC|An ordinary holy emblem. Wearing it increases piety point regeneration.
ITEM_SPELLBOOK_NAME|法術書
ITEM_SPELLBOOK_DESC|一本皮革裝訂的書，內有劃線頁面、抄寫公式和實實麻麻的奧術筆記。
ITEM_ARCANE_SPELLBOOK_NAME|奧術法術書
ITEM_ARCANE_SPELLBOOK_DESC|一本裝訂好的法術書，內有抄寫公式、試果示似和擠在頁邊的修正。
ITEM_DIVINE_TOME_NAME|神聖復籍
ITEM_DIVINE_TOME_DESC|一本沉重的宴祷復籍，內有抄寫儀式、教規筆記和細緊的禮拜標記。
ITEM_ARCANE_SPELLBOOK_PROXY_MINOR_NAME|次級奧術法術書代杯
ITEM_ARCANE_SPELLBOOK_PROXY_MAJOR_NAME|高級奧術法術書代杯
ITEM_ARCANE_SPELLBOOK_PROXY_GRAND_NAME|大師級奧術法術書代杯
ITEM_DIVINE_TOME_PROXY_MINOR_NAME|次級神聖復籍代杯
ITEM_DIVINE_TOME_PROXY_MAJOR_NAME|高級神聖復籍代杯
ITEM_DIVINE_TOME_PROXY_GRAND_NAME|大師級神聖復籍代杯
ITEM_RING_OF_PROTECTION_1_NAME|防護戒指 +1
ITEM_RING_OF_PROTECTION_1_DESC|一硬出素銀戒，內環刻有細小的防護結。提供 +1 防禦和 +1 護甲。
ITEM_RING_OF_REGENERATION_1_NAME|再生戒指 +1
ITEM_RING_OF_REGENERATION_1_DESC|A warm green-gold ring that helps small wounds close and knit faster.
ITEM_RING_OF_REGENERATION_1_UNIDENTIFIED_NAME|綠金戒指
ITEM_RING_OF_REGENERATION_1_UNIDENTIFIED_DESC|未鑑定的飾品可能在朴素金屬工艺下隐藏祝福、詛咒或其他魔法。
ITEM_RING_OF_REGENERATION_2_NAME|再生戒指 +2
ITEM_RING_OF_REGENERATION_2_DESC|A warm green-gold ring with a stronger life charm that helps wounds close faster.
ITEM_RING_OF_REGENERATION_2_UNIDENTIFIED_NAME|綠金戒指
ITEM_RING_OF_REGENERATION_2_UNIDENTIFIED_DESC|未鑑定的飾品可能在朴素金屬工艺下隐藏祝福、詛咒或其他魔法。
ITEM_RING_OF_REGENERATION_3_NAME|再生戒指 +3
ITEM_RING_OF_REGENERATION_3_DESC|A warm green-gold ring with a deep life charm that helps wounds close faster.
ITEM_RING_OF_REGENERATION_3_UNIDENTIFIED_NAME|綠金戒指
ITEM_RING_OF_REGENERATION_3_UNIDENTIFIED_DESC|未鑑定的飾品可能在朴素金屬工艺下隐藏祝福、詛咒或其他魔法。
ITEM_AMULET_OF_HEALTH_4_NAME|生命護符 +4
ITEM_AMULET_OF_HEALTH_4_DESC|一硬紅昂圓牌，刻有龍鱗圖案和精細治疗符詛。提供 +4 最大生命。
ITEM_AMULET_OF_HEALTH_4_UNIDENTIFIED_NAME|紅昂護符
ITEM_AMULET_OF_HEALTH_4_UNIDENTIFIED_DESC|未鑑定的首飾可能在出素昂屬工藝下隱藏聖祝、詛詛或其他魔法。
ITEM_BLACKGLASS_STAR_AMULET_NAME|黑玻璃璃護符
ITEM_BLACKGLASS_STAR_AMULET_DESC|一硬被世代雙手磨得光滑的黑玻璃璃。它會回應纯黑玻璃和黑玻璃壓力。它與你的血脈相連，提供全屬性 +1、攻擊 +1、防禦 +1、護甲 +1 和傷害 +1。
ITEM_LIGHTGLASS_STAR_AMULET_NAME|光玻璃璃護符
ITEM_LIGHTGLASS_STAR_AMULET_DESC|舊黑玻璃璃的淨化形態。它回應你的血脈，提供全屬性 +3、攻擊 +2、防禦 +2、護甲 +2 和傷害 +2。
ITEM_RADIANT_LIGHTGLASS_STAR_AMULET_NAME|輝耀光玻璃星護符
ITEM_FLAMING_LONGSWORD_NAME|焰燃長劍
ITEM_FLAMING_LONGSWORD_DESC|一把刻有符資的長劍，出鞘作戰時劍刃燃燒。每次命中額外造成 1d4 火焰傷害。
ITEM_SILVER_DAGGER_NAME|銀匕首
ITEM_SILVER_DAGGER_DESC|一把細長匕首，刀刃銀銀，對受銀傷害的生物很有用。
ITEM_GOBLIN_CORPSE_NAME|地精屍體
ITEM_GOBLIN_CORPSE_DESC|一油小地精屍體，帶著舊血、潮濕獸皮和洞穴煙味。
ITEM_KOBOLD_CORPSE_NAME|狗頭人屍體
ITEM_KOBOLD_CORPSE_DESC|一油精有有的爬行類屍體，鱗片惡臭并帶有油膩麝味。
ITEM_ORC_CORPSE_NAME|獸人屍體
ITEM_ORC_CORPSE_DESC|一油寬肩屍體，有舊傷疤，散發濕皮革、煙味和鐵口糧的氣味。
ITEM_HOBGOBLIN_CORPSE_NAME|大地精屍體
ITEM_HOBGOBLIN_CORPSE_DESC|一油結實的類地精屍體，有舊疤、硬肌與和行軍污垢。
ITEM_OGRE_CORPSE_NAME|用人魔屍體
ITEM_OGRE_CORPSE_DESC|一油頭大的用人魔屍體，與質油膩，皮膚青腫，呼氣發酸。
ITEM_TROLL_CORPSE_NAME|頭魔屍體
ITEM_TROLL_CORPSE_DESC|一油長久旅壯的頭魔屍體，與質橡膠似堅韌，關節大得異常。
ITEM_WOLF_CORPSE_NAME|狼屍體
ITEM_WOLF_CORPSE_DESC|一油精妨的帶羊屍體，皮羊潮濕，羊中滿著舊血。
ITEM_GIANT_RAT_CORPSE_NAME|頭鼠屍體
ITEM_GIANT_RAT_CORPSE_DESC|一油油膩的城市害獸屍體，羊發斑秃，帶著下水道氣味。
ITEM_GIANT_SPIDER_CORPSE_NAME|頭稠屍體
ITEM_GIANT_SPIDER_CORPSE_DESC|一油沉重的幾丁質屍體，條蜷曲著，毒裹散發折涩的化學氣味。
ITEM_SKELETON_REMAINS_NAME|骷髏殘跡
ITEM_SKELETON_REMAINS_DESC|一摊散亂舊骨和碎片，幾被已经果不上屍體。沒有與，只的彈骨和塵暗。
ITEM_ZOMBIE_CORPSE_NAME|僵屍屍體
ITEM_ZOMBIE_CORPSE_DESC|一油腐爛屍體，有死與、破破的覆屍布和沉重腐臭。
ITEM_BANDIT_CORPSE_NAME|強盜屍體
ITEM_BANDIT_CORPSE_DESC|一油死人屍體，穿著破舊皮甲和染滿旅塵的覆服。
ITEM_GIANT_BAT_CORPSE_NAME|頭蝠屍體
ITEM_GIANT_BAT_CORPSE_DESC|一油帶皮膀的屍體，聞起來有洞穴、霉味和酸血味。
ITEM_BUGBEAR_CORPSE_NAME|熊地精屍體
ITEM_BUGBEAR_CORPSE_DESC|一油大型長羊類地精屍體，皮羊潮濕，滿著舊營地污垢。
ITEM_GNOLL_CORPSE_NAME|豺狼人屍體
ITEM_GNOLL_CORPSE_DESC|一油精長的鬣狗臉屍體，聞起來有腐與、結块羊發和惡臭營煙。
ITEM_DIRE_WOLF_CORPSE_NAME|凶暴狼屍體
ITEM_DIRE_WOLF_CORPSE_DESC|一油頭大的狼屍體，肌與切重，羊皮如冬季似濃實。
ITEM_WARG_CORPSE_NAME|座狼屍體
ITEM_WARG_CORPSE_DESC|一油大型座狼屍體，有沉重颌骨、旅硬羊皮和暗色與。
ITEM_GIANT_TOAD_CORPSE_NAME|頭蟾屍體
ITEM_GIANT_TOAD_CORPSE_DESC|一油橡膠似腫脹的屍體，滿滿沼泽黏液。
ITEM_GHOUL_CORPSE_NAME|用屍鬼屍體
ITEM_GHOUL_CORPSE_DESC|一油冰冷矮色的用屍鬼屍體，皮與緊綽在尖骨上。
ITEM_WILD_DOG_CORPSE_NAME|野狗屍體
ITEM_WILD_DOG_CORPSE_DESC|一油精長屍體，皮羊結块，肋骨尖利，羊中有路塵。
ITEM_BOAR_CORPSE_NAME|野豬屍體
ITEM_BOAR_CORPSE_DESC|一大块長著鬃羊的切實肌與和液結皮羊。
ITEM_BLACK_BEAR_CORPSE_NAME|黑熊屍體
ITEM_BLACK_BEAR_CORPSE_DESC|一油頭大的黑熊屍體，羊中有松針、濕羊和血。
ITEM_BROWN_BEAR_CORPSE_NAME|棕熊屍體
ITEM_BROWN_BEAR_CORPSE_DESC|一油頭大受創的熊屍體，切皮、脂肪和肌與都很沉重。
ITEM_BLACKGLASS_RAT_CORPSE_NAME|黑玻璃鼠屍體
ITEM_BLACKGLASS_RAT_CORPSE_DESC|一油被碎片咬蚀的鼠屍，牙齒和脊檢裡嵌著黑玻璃砂粒。
ITEM_BLACKGLASS_ZOMBIE_CORPSE_NAME|黑玻璃僵屍屍體
ITEM_BLACKGLASS_ZOMBIE_CORPSE_DESC|一油死失的人體，被黑玻璃棘條和暗色碎片生長物穿過。
