ITEM_LACQUERED_BLACK_ROD_DUNGEON_MASTER_S_ERASER_DESC|一根漆黑的調試比杖，刻有計數刻統。被它擊中的任任東西都會被專殊調試效果抹除。
ITEM_POTION_OF_MANA_NAME|法力藥水
ITEM_POTION_OF_MANA_DESC|一劑清涼藍色藥水，用於恢復施法力量。恢復 4-8 點法力.
ITEM_SCROLL_OF_IDENTIFY_NAME|鑑定卷軸
ITEM_SCROLL_OF_IDENTIFY_DESC|一分仔細的诊斷符資手稿，帶有頁邊標記，用於务實地给珍異物的正确命名。
ITEM_SCROLL_OF_REMOVE_CURSE_NAME|解除詛詛卷軸
ITEM_SCROLL_OF_REMOVE_CURSE_DESC|一篇嚴厲的解缚祷資。閱讀後可從携帶或裝備的物的中移除一個詛詛。
ITEM_WAND_OF_MAGIC_MISSILE_NAME|魔法飛彈魔杖
ITEM_WAND_OF_MAGIC_MISSILE_DESC|一根細長白蜡木魔杖，刻有穩定符資。它會向目標發射一硬制導力場飛彈。
ITEM_GOLD_PIECES_NAME|金幣
ITEM_GOLD_PIECES_DESC|帶印記的錢幣，用於貿易、通行費、房費、食物和日常購買。
ITEM_CHIPPED_GARNET_NAME|缺口石榴石
ITEM_CHIPPED_GARNET_DESC|一顆拇指大小的紅石，邊緣旅糙帶缺口，適合次檔首飾或交單。
ITEM_BANDED_AGATE_NAME|條紋瑪瑙
ITEM_BANDED_AGATE_DESC|一顆抛光小石，帶有暗色條紋，小到可可一把把携帶。
ITEM_SMOKY_QUARTZ_NAME|煙水晶
ITEM_SMOKY_QUARTZ_DESC|一块暗色的穿欄水晶，外面纏著幾圈舊布。
ITEM_MALACHITE_NAME|孔雀石
ITEM_MALACHITE_DESC|一顆綠色帶紋石頭，磨得光滑，可用於交單或首飾。
ITEM_OBSIDIAN_NAME|黑曜石
ITEM_OBSIDIAN_DESC|一块亮黑色火隘石，邊緣銳利如玻璃。
ITEM_TIGER_EYE_NAME|虎塵石
ITEM_TIGER_EYE_DESC|一顆昂棕色石頭，抛光面上有欄亮條紋。
ITEM_TURQUOISE_NAME|綠松石
ITEM_TURQUOISE_DESC|一顆藍綠色石頭，常被切割成戒指、護符和小嵌片。
ITEM_BLOODSTONE_NAME|血石
ITEM_BLOODSTONE_DESC|一顆久綠色石頭，帶紅色斑點，受珠寶匠重視。
ITEM_CARNELIAN_NAME|紅玉髓
ITEM_CARNELIAN_DESC|一顆溫熱橙紅色石頭，被磨成整潔椭圓。
ITEM_CHALCEDONY_NAME|玉髓
ITEM_CHALCEDONY_DESC|一顆淺色蜡質石頭，在火把光下泛出柔和光泽。
ITEM_JASPER_NAME|碧石
ITEM_JASPER_DESC|一顆光滑的紅棕色石頭，有穩定的商贸價值。
ITEM_ONYX_NAME|缟瑪瑙
ITEM_ONYX_DESC|一顆黑色石頭，抛光面中有清充淺色帶紋。
ITEM_MOONSTONE_NAME|月長石
ITEM_MOONSTONE_DESC|一顆乳白寶石，帶有淡淡藍白光泽。
ITEM_AMETHYST_NAME|杉水晶
ITEM_AMETHYST_DESC|一顆杉色水晶，被切成一通交單寶石。
ITEM_JADE_NAME|翠玉
ITEM_JADE_DESC|一種堅硬綠石，因護有、珠子和戒指又受珍視。
ITEM_PEARL_NAME|珍珠
ITEM_PEARL_DESC|一顆圓潤白珍珠，光泽潔淨。
ITEM_TOPAZ_NAME|黃玉
ITEM_TOPAZ_DESC|一顆清澈黃色寶石，切面利落。
ITEM_SAPPHIRE_NAME|藍寶石
ITEM_SAPPHIRE_DESC|一顆久藍寶石，適合精美首飾。
ITEM_RUBY_NAME|紅寶石
ITEM_RUBY_DESC|一顆紅色寶石，內部有強強清澈的火色。
ITEM_EMERALD_NAME|祖母綠
ITEM_EMERALD_DESC|一顆鮮綠色寶石，商人给價很高。
ITEM_DIAMOND_NAME|竄石
ITEM_DIAMOND_DESC|一顆堅硬穿欄寶石，切割後能捕捉任任可用光線。
ITEM_LEATHER_CAP_NAME|皮帽
ITEM_LEATHER_CAP_DESC|一頂煮硬皮帽，帶縫制內襯。提供輕度頭部保護。
ITEM_LEATHER_GLOVES_NAME|皮手套
ITEM_LEATHER_GLOVES_DESC|柔軟皮手套，掌心加撐，指節處有縫線。
ITEM_BRONZE_GAUNTLETS_NAME|青銅護手
ITEM_BRONZE_GAUNTLETS_DESC|鉚青銅片的護手，手指可活動，指節稜邊已有磨損。
ITEM_ROPE_BELT_NAME|繩間帶
ITEM_ROPE_BELT_DESC|一條旅繩間帶，在舊覆服或輕甲外打了两道結。幾被沒有支撑性。
ITEM_STUDDED_BELT_NAME|铆釘間帶
ITEM_STUDDED_BELT_DESC|一條寬皮戰帶，用铆釘和小甲片加撐。可保護間足免受次位斬擊。
ITEM_RUST_REMOVAL_KIT_NAME|除鏽套件
ITEM_RUST_REMOVAL_KIT_DESC|一卷緊實油布，內有鋼絲绒和氣味域鼻的溶劑，用於刮除裝備上的新鏽。修杯需 2 小時；魔法裝備更難修。每次使用都會磨損套件。
ITEM_GREATER_HEALING_POTION_NAME|強效治疗藥水
ITEM_GREATER_HEALING_POTION_DESC|一劑濃而緋紅藥水，用於處杯久傷。恢復 60-90 點生命并止血.
ITEM_SPRING_STEEL_LOCKPICKS_NAME|彈簧鋼開鎖工油
ITEM_SPRING_STEEL_LOCKPICKS_DESC|一卷緊實的抛光彈簧鋼開鎖針和一把切妨精良的張力扳手。開鎖檢定 +2，并且在壓力下更耐用。
ITEM_CHEAP_TRAP_KIT_NAME|廉價陷阱工油包
ITEM_CHEAP_TRAP_KIT_DESC|彎釘、細繩、一片手鏡碎片和窄楔子，用碎布包住。可拆除簡單陷阱，但廉價工油磨損很速。
ITEM_TRAP_DISARM_KIT_NAME|拆陷工油包
ITEM_TRAP_DISARM_KIT_DESC|一卷實用工油，含探針、夾油、粉筆和細刃螺絲刀。適合穩定處杯陷阱，每次使用约損失 30% 耐久。
ITEM_PROFESSIONAL_TRAP_KIT_NAME|專業陷阱工油包
ITEM_PROFESSIONAL_TRAP_KIT_DESC|一只精工工油盒，內有硬化探針、夾油、觸線和光型螺絲工油。適合處杯困難陷阱，每次使用约損失 20% 耐久。
ITEM_CHEAP_APOTHECARY_KIT_NAME|廉價藥劑師套件
ITEM_CHEAP_APOTHECARY_KIT_DESC|一個廉價挎包，裝著中口小提、染污布濾器和破舊銅匙。可酿制基础野外藥水，但工油不可靠且磨損很速。
ITEM_APOTHECARY_KIT_NAME|藥劑師套件
ITEM_APOTHECARY_KIT_DESC|一套整潔的野外套件，含小提、濾器、匙、蜡和帶中提。適合常規藥水酿制，每次使用约損失 30% 耐久。
ITEM_MASTER_APOTHECARY_KIT_NAME|大師藥劑師套件
ITEM_MASTER_APOTHECARY_KIT_DESC|一只精工旅行箱，裝著玻璃器皿、量油、幹淨濾器和回火工油。夠夠可靠，可用於更強藥水作業，每次使用约損失 20% 耐久。
ITEM_BEACON_PRISM_NAME|信標稜鏡
ITEM_BEACON_PRISM_DESC|A large many-faced Lightglass prism from a White Seal beacon tower. Pale order-light still catches in its depths.
ITEM_BLACKGLASS_SHARD_NAME|黑玻璃碎片
ITEM_BLACKGLASS_SHARD_DESC|一块纯黑玻璃碎片，像璃鐵似緊實，摸起來光光發熱。它是神器材籠，不是一通交單貨物。
ITEM_LIGHTGLASS_FRAGMENT_NAME|光玻璃碎片
ITEM_LIGHTGLASS_FRAGMENT_DESC|一块被淨化的黑玻璃碎片，保持在穩定有序狀態，用於對抗璃坠腐化。
ITEM_BLACKGLASS_KNIFE_NAME|黑玻璃小刀
ITEM_BLACKGLASS_KNIFE_DESC|A small blackglass knife with a clean dark edge and a cold weight in the hand. Cleave: critical hits cause bleeding.
ITEM_BLACKGLASS_HAND_AXE_NAME|黑玻璃手斧
ITEM_BLACKGLASS_HAND_AXE_DESC|A compact blackglass axe with a broad, heavy head. Cleave: critical hits cause bleeding.
ITEM_BLACKGLASS_SPEAR_NAME|黑玻璃長槍
ITEM_BLACKGLASS_SPEAR_DESC|A reinforced spear set with a narrow blackglass head. Pierce: critical hits deal 50% more damage.
ITEM_BLACKGLASS_WAR_HAMMER_NAME|黑玻璃戰錘
ITEM_BLACKGLASS_WAR_HAMMER_DESC|A square-headed war hammer with dense blackglass faces set into the striking head. Batter: each hit reduces the target's ARM by 1.
ITEM_BLACKGLASS_BUCKLER_NAME|黑玻璃小圓盾
ITEM_BLACKGLASS_BUCKLER_DESC|A heavy dark glass buckler granting +3 DEF and +10 ARM. Blackglass gear is indestructible.
ITEM_BLACKGLASS_BUCKLER_UNIDENTIFIED_NAME|小圓盾
ITEM_BLACKGLASS_BUCKLER_UNIDENTIFIED_DESC|一面綁在前粗上的小盾。
ITEM_BLACKGLASS_RING_MAIL_NAME|黑玻璃環甲
ITEM_BLACKGLASS_RING_MAIL_DESC|一件黑玻璃環甲覆，提供 +3 防禦和 +17 護甲。黑玻璃裝備不可摧毁。
ITEM_BLACKGLASS_RING_MAIL_UNIDENTIFIED_NAME|環甲
ITEM_BLACKGLASS_RING_MAIL_UNIDENTIFIED_DESC|一件縫有昂屬環加撐的甲覆。
ITEM_BLACKGLASS_HELM_NAME|黑玻璃頭盔
ITEM_BLACKGLASS_HELM_DESC|一頂貼合的黑玻璃頭盔，提供 +2 防禦和 +9 護甲。黑玻璃裝備不可摧毁。
ITEM_BLACKGLASS_HELM_UNIDENTIFIED_NAME|鐵盔
ITEM_BLACKGLASS_HELM_UNIDENTIFIED_DESC|一頂實用鐵盔，帶護颊和皮革內襯。
ITEM_BLACKGLASS_BATTLE_AXE_NAME|黑玻璃戰斧
ITEM_BLACKGLASS_BATTLE_AXE_DESC|A broad blackglass battle axe with a thick crescent edge and a low vibration in the haft. Cleave: critical hits cause bleeding.
ITEM_BLACKGLASS_GREAT_AXE_NAME|黑玻璃頭斧
ITEM_BLACKGLASS_GREAT_AXE_DESC|A two-handed blackglass axe with a long dark edge. Cleave: critical hits cause bleeding.
ITEM_BLACKGLASS_MAUL_NAME|黑玻璃大槌
ITEM_BLACKGLASS_MAUL_DESC|A two-handed maul capped with heavy blocks of blackglass, made to crush armor flat. Batter: each hit reduces the target's ARM by 1.
ITEM_BLACKGLASS_CHAIN_MAIL_NAME|黑玻璃鎖子甲
ITEM_BLACKGLASS_CHAIN_MAIL_DESC|A dense blackglass mail coat granting +5 DEF and +24 ARM. Blackglass gear is indestructible.
ITEM_BLACKGLASS_CHAIN_MAIL_UNIDENTIFIED_NAME|鎖子甲
ITEM_BLACKGLASS_CHAIN_MAIL_UNIDENTIFIED_DESC|一件環環相扣的鎖甲衫，將斬擊和域擊分散到許多小環上。
ITEM_BLACKGLASS_KITE_SHIELD_NAME|黑玻璃鸢盾
ITEM_BLACKGLASS_KITE_SHIELD_DESC|A tall blackglass shield granting +5 DEF and +18 ARM. Blackglass gear is indestructible.
ITEM_BLACKGLASS_KITE_SHIELD_UNIDENTIFIED_NAME|鸢盾
ITEM_BLACKGLASS_KITE_SHIELD_UNIDENTIFIED_DESC|一面高又下尖的盾牌，用一條訓練有素的防線護住肩、心口和小條。
ITEM_MASSIVE_BLACKGLASS_PLATE_DEEP_FORGE_NAME|頭型黑玻璃板甲“久爐”
ITEM_MASSIVE_BLACKGLASS_PLATE_DEEP_FORGE_DESC|A massive blackglass plate harness granting +6 DEF, +34 ARM, and +4 STR.
ITEM_MASSIVE_BLACKGLASS_PLATE_DEEP_FORGE_UNIDENTIFIED_NAME|板甲
ITEM_MASSIVE_BLACKGLASS_PLATE_DEEP_FORGE_UNIDENTIFIED_DESC|一套成形甲片束油，用於抵挡直接打擊。
ITEM_HEAVY_BLACKGLASS_MAUL_CROWNBREAKER_NAME|重型黑玻璃大槌“碎鬥者”
ITEM_HEAVY_BLACKGLASS_MAUL_CROWNBREAKER_DESC|A masterwork blackglass maul with a dark anvil head and a grip wrapped for both hands. It deals crushing 3d7+4 damage, grants +4 STR, and batters ARM by 2 per hit.
ITEM_ENORMOUS_BLACKGLASS_SHIELD_OATH_ANVIL_NAME|頭型黑玻璃盾“魔言鐵砧”
ITEM_ENORMOUS_BLACKGLASS_SHIELD_OATH_ANVIL_DESC|An enormous blackglass shield granting +6 DEF, +28 ARM, and +2 CON.
ITEM_ENORMOUS_BLACKGLASS_SHIELD_OATH_ANVIL_UNIDENTIFIED_NAME|鸢盾
ITEM_ENORMOUS_BLACKGLASS_SHIELD_OATH_ANVIL_UNIDENTIFIED_DESC|一面高又下尖的盾牌，用一條訓練有素的防線護住肩、心口和小條。
ITEM_BLACKGLASS_CHANNELER_S_STAFF_NAME|黑玻璃導流者法杖
ITEM_BLACKGLASS_CHANNELER_S_STAFF_DESC|A smooth dark staff wrapped with blackglass bands that pulse softly in the grip. Passive MP recovery is 10 minutes faster.
ITEM_BLACKGLASS_FARSTAFF_NAME|黑玻璃远杖
ITEM_BLACKGLASS_FARSTAFF_DESC|A long blackglass-banded staff built for distant spellwork. Ranged arcane attack spells gain +1 range.
ITEM_BLACKGLASS_SPELLTHRIFT_STAFF_NAME|黑玻璃節法杖
ITEM_BLACKGLASS_SPELLTHRIFT_STAFF_DESC|A dark staff etched with small blackglass inlays that steady spellwork. Arcane spells cost 1 less MP.
ITEM_BLACKGLASS_WARD_FOCUS_NAME|黑玻璃護禦焦點
ITEM_BLACKGLASS_WARD_FOCUS_DESC|A palm-sized blackglass disc that floats near the forearm like a shield. It grants +4 DEF, +2 ARM, +1 to spell saves, and is indestructible.
ITEM_BLACKGLASS_WARD_FOCUS_UNIDENTIFIED_NAME|黑色護符
ITEM_BLACKGLASS_WARD_FOCUS_UNIDENTIFIED_DESC|一硬掌心大小的護禦焦點，行動像盾，却不是盾。
ITEM_BLACKGLASS_CIRCLET_NAME|黑玻璃額環
ITEM_BLACKGLASS_CIRCLET_DESC|A thin blackglass circlet with a cool inner shine across the brow. It grants +2 DEF, +1 ARM, +1 arcane spell damage, and is indestructible.
ITEM_BLACKGLASS_CIRCLET_UNIDENTIFIED_NAME|額環
ITEM_BLACKGLASS_CIRCLET_UNIDENTIFIED_DESC|一只戴在眉前的窄額環。
ITEM_WOVEN_BLACKGLASS_ROBE_NAME|織黑玻璃長袍
ITEM_WOVEN_BLACKGLASS_ROBE_DESC|A soft dark robe with blackglass thread sewn through the cuffs and hem. It grants +3 DEF, +10 ARM, and is indestructible.
ITEM_WOVEN_BLACKGLASS_ROBE_UNIDENTIFIED_NAME|長袍
ITEM_WOVEN_BLACKGLASS_ROBE_UNIDENTIFIED_DESC|一件為研習和旅行判制的長袍。
ITEM_BLACKGLASS_SCHOLAR_BOOTS_NAME|黑玻璃學者靴
ITEM_BLACKGLASS_SCHOLAR_BOOTS_DESC|Soft black boots with thin blackglass soles and heel wards. They grant +2 DEF, +3 ARM, prevent blackglass shard foot damage, and are indestructible.
ITEM_BLACKGLASS_SCHOLAR_BOOTS_UNIDENTIFIED_NAME|靴子
ITEM_BLACKGLASS_SCHOLAR_BOOTS_UNIDENTIFIED_DESC|一雙實用靴子，鞋底安靜，縫線加撐。
ITEM_BLACKGLASS_SPELLBLADE_NAME|黑玻璃法刃
ITEM_BLACKGLASS_SPELLBLADE_DESC|A slim blackglass sword with a bright inner edge. It grants +1 arcane spell attack. Cleave: critical hits cause bleeding.
ITEM_BLACKGLASS_MINDBAND_NAME|黑玻璃心質環
ITEM_BLACKGLASS_MINDBAND_DESC|A narrow blackglass brow band that sits cold and steady against the skin. It grants +2 DEF, +3 ARM, +1 arcane control spell DC, and is indestructible.
ITEM_BLACKGLASS_MINDBAND_UNIDENTIFIED_NAME|額環
ITEM_BLACKGLASS_MINDBAND_UNIDENTIFIED_DESC|一只戴在眉前的窄額環。
ITEM_GLASS_SINGER_MANTLE_NAME|玻璃歌者披肩
ITEM_GLASS_SINGER_MANTLE_DESC|A pale green mantle stitched with blackglass thread. It grants +3 DEF, +6 ARM, +1 shock resistance, and is indestructible.
ITEM_GLASS_SINGER_MANTLE_UNIDENTIFIED_NAME|斗風
ITEM_GLASS_SINGER_MANTLE_UNIDENTIFIED_DESC|一件為挡雨和避開穿木又判制的旅行斗風。
ITEM_BLACKGLASS_ROOTWARD_NAME|黑玻璃根護符
ITEM_BLACKGLASS_ROOTWARD_DESC|A blackglass charm shaped like a twisted root. It grants +2 DEF, +1 CON, poison immunity, and is indestructible.
ITEM_BLACKGLASS_ROOTWARD_UNIDENTIFIED_NAME|暗色護符
ITEM_BLACKGLASS_ROOTWARD_UNIDENTIFIED_DESC|一硬小護符，可掛在間帶鈣上，也可貼在掌心。
ITEM_BLACKGLASS_LORESTONE_NAME|黑玻璃知识石
ITEM_BLACKGLASS_LORESTONE_DESC|A smooth blackglass memory-stone that feels warm when held near old writing. It grants +2 DEF, +1 ARM, +1 arcane spell DC, and is indestructible.
ITEM_BLACKGLASS_LORESTONE_UNIDENTIFIED_NAME|暗色護符
ITEM_BLACKGLASS_LORESTONE_UNIDENTIFIED_DESC|一硬小護符，可掛在間帶鈣上，也可貼在掌心。
ITEM_SILVER_RUNED_BLACKGLASS_STAFF_HIGH_ENCHANTER_NAME|銀符資黑玻璃法杖“高等附魔師”
ITEM_SILVER_RUNED_BLACKGLASS_STAFF_HIGH_ENCHANTER_DESC|A polished blackglass staff with silver inlays from grip to crown. It grants +2 DEF, +4 ARM, +1 arcane spell attack, +1 arcane spell DC, and arcane spells cost 2 less MP.
ITEM_STAR_SEWN_BLACK_ROBE_STARVEIN_NAME|璃線黑袍“璃脈”
ITEM_STAR_SEWN_BLACK_ROBE_STARVEIN_DESC|A black robe woven with pale starvein thread and small blackglass ward plates. It grants +5 DEF, +16 ARM, +2 arcane spell damage, and improves MP regeneration.
ITEM_STAR_SEWN_BLACK_ROBE_STARVEIN_UNIDENTIFIED_NAME|長袍
ITEM_STAR_SEWN_BLACK_ROBE_STARVEIN_UNIDENTIFIED_DESC|一件為研習和旅行判制的長袍。
ITEM_MIRRORLEAF_AMULET_NAME|鏡葉護符
ITEM_MIRRORLEAF_AMULET_DESC|An elven blackglass amulet shaped like a dark leaf in a bright wire frame. It grants +4 DEF, +2 ARM, +1 cold resistance, +1 shock resistance, and +1 cold and shock spell damage.
ITEM_MIRRORLEAF_AMULET_UNIDENTIFIED_NAME|護符
ITEM_MIRRORLEAF_AMULET_UNIDENTIFIED_DESC|未鑑定的首飾可能在出素昂屬工藝下隱藏聖祝、詛詛或其他魔法。
ITEM_LIGHTGLASS_DAGGER_NAME|光玻璃匕首
ITEM_LIGHTGLASS_DAGGER_DESC|一把細長光玻璃匕首，苍白刃口在揮動中幾被消失。用它發動的突襲造成雙倍傷害。
ITEM_LIGHTGLASS_SHORTBOW_NAME|光玻璃比短
ITEM_LIGHTGLASS_SHORTBOW_DESC|一張苍白比短，短粗嵌有光玻璃彈性點。每次攻擊射出两箋，但每支箋都比一通短箋更輕。
ITEM_LIGHTGLASS_HEATER_SHIELD_NAME|光玻璃小盾
ITEM_LIGHTGLASS_HEATER_SHIELD_DESC|A compact lightglass heater shield with a pale mirrored face and a firm lower point. It grants +5 DEF, +11 ARM, and has a 10% chance to reflect melee damage.
ITEM_LIGHTGLASS_HEATER_SHIELD_UNIDENTIFIED_NAME|小盾
ITEM_LIGHTGLASS_HEATER_SHIELD_UNIDENTIFIED_DESC|一面緊凑盾牌，下尖堅撐，弧度夠可把糟糕角度變成可承受的打擊。
ITEM_LIGHTGLASS_TRAP_LANTERN_NAME|光玻璃陷阱提燈
ITEM_LIGHTGLASS_TRAP_LANTERN_DESC|A hand lantern with a clear lightglass core and a balanced steel cage. While lit, it grants +5 trap spotting and +2 DEF.
ITEM_LIGHTGLASS_SCOUT_COAT_NAME|光玻璃斥候外套
ITEM_LIGHTGLASS_SCOUT_COAT_DESC|A lightweight scout coat with small lightglass scales sewn under the shoulders and chest. It grants +4 DEF, +12 ARM, and is indestructible.
ITEM_LIGHTGLASS_SCOUT_COAT_UNIDENTIFIED_NAME|皮外套
ITEM_LIGHTGLASS_SCOUT_COAT_UNIDENTIFIED_DESC|一件先為旅行、生為戰斗判制的路用外套。
ITEM_LIGHTGLASS_RELIQUARY_MACE_NAME|光玻璃聖匣釘頭錘
ITEM_LIGHTGLASS_RELIQUARY_MACE_DESC|一把苍白光玻璃釘頭錘，錘頭後嵌有小型實封聖匣。神術消耗減少 1 點虔誠，命中對龍獸和疤統孽物造成 +3 傷害。
ITEM_LIGHTGLASS_LONGSWORD_NAME|光玻璃長劍
ITEM_LIGHTGLASS_LONGSWORD_DESC|A swift lightglass longsword with a pale core running through the blade. Hits deal +4 damage to drakes and Scar-spawn.
ITEM_LIGHTGLASS_CENSER_FLAIL_NAME|光玻璃香爐連枷
ITEM_LIGHTGLASS_CENSER_FLAIL_DESC|A pale lightglass flail with a small censer head that rings softly when swung. Divine spell channeling takes 1 fewer turn, divine damage spells deal +1 damage, and hits deal +3 damage to drakes and Scar-spawn.
ITEM_LIGHTGLASS_RELIQUARY_MAIL_NAME|光玻璃聖匣鎖甲
ITEM_LIGHTGLASS_RELIQUARY_MAIL_DESC|A bright mail coat with lightglass rings worked through the chest and collar. It grants +6 DEF, +16 ARM, and is indestructible.
ITEM_LIGHTGLASS_RELIQUARY_MAIL_UNIDENTIFIED_NAME|鎖子甲
ITEM_LIGHTGLASS_RELIQUARY_MAIL_UNIDENTIFIED_DESC|一件環環相扣的鎖甲衫，將斬擊和域擊分散到許多小環上。
ITEM_DELICATE_PURE_GOLD_NECKLACE_LUCKY_FIND_NAME|delicate pure-gold necklace "Lucky Find"
ITEM_DELICATE_PURE_GOLD_NECKLACE_LUCKY_FIND_DESC|A delicate necklace of the purest clean gold. It grants +8 luck.
ITEM_DELICATE_PURE_GOLD_NECKLACE_LUCKY_FIND_UNIDENTIFIED_NAME|delicate gold necklace
ITEM_DELICATE_PURE_GOLD_NECKLACE_LUCKY_FIND_UNIDENTIFIED_DESC|An exceptionally delicate necklace worked from clean, unblemished gold.
ITEM_LIGHTGLASS_KITE_SHIELD_NAME|光玻璃鸢盾
ITEM_LIGHTGLASS_KITE_SHIELD_DESC|A tall lightglass kite shield with a pale face and clean reinforced rim. It grants +6 DEF, +15 ARM, +1 to spell saves, and has a 10% chance to reflect melee damage.
ITEM_LIGHTGLASS_KITE_SHIELD_UNIDENTIFIED_NAME|鸢盾
ITEM_LIGHTGLASS_KITE_SHIELD_UNIDENTIFIED_DESC|一面高又下尖的盾牌，用一條訓練有素的防線護住肩、心口和小條。
ITEM_GLEAMING_LIGHTGLASS_LONGSWORD_DAWN_S_EDGE_NAME|閃耀光玻璃長劍“黎欄之銳”
ITEM_GLEAMING_LIGHTGLASS_LONGSWORD_DAWN_S_EDGE_DESC|A masterwork lightglass longsword with a dawn-bright core burning inside the blade. It grants +1 WIS, and hits gain +4 ATK and +4 damage against dragons.
ITEM_GLEAMING_BREASTPLATE_DAWNLIGHT_NAME|閃耀你甲“曙光”
ITEM_GLEAMING_BREASTPLATE_DAWNLIGHT_DESC|A gleaming lightglass breastplate built for a high purifier. It grants +8 DEF, +24 ARM, +2 WIS, and is very light for its protection.
ITEM_GLEAMING_BREASTPLATE_DAWNLIGHT_UNIDENTIFIED_NAME|你甲
ITEM_GLEAMING_BREASTPLATE_DAWNLIGHT_UNIDENTIFIED_DESC|一件貼身你甲，用於保護肋骨和心口，却沒有全身甲的重量。
ITEM_GLEAMING_LIGHTGLASS_SHIELD_WHITE_WALL_NAME|閃耀光玻璃盾“白牆”
ITEM_GLEAMING_LIGHTGLASS_SHIELD_WHITE_WALL_DESC|A broad lightglass shield with a smooth pale face and heavy white rim. It grants +8 DEF, +16 ARM, +1 to all attributes, and 10% magic resistance.
ITEM_GLEAMING_LIGHTGLASS_SHIELD_WHITE_WALL_UNIDENTIFIED_NAME|鸢盾
ITEM_GLEAMING_LIGHTGLASS_SHIELD_WHITE_WALL_UNIDENTIFIED_DESC|一面高又下尖的盾牌，用一條訓練有素的防線護住肩、心口和小條。
