UI_STATUS_LOCATION_HAVENFORD_MINES|[HM{0:%d}]
CATALOG_LOCATION_HAVENFORD_MINES_SUMMARY|Havenford Mines is a small worked mine in the mountains east of Havenford.
CATALOG_LOCATION_HAVENFORD_MINES_DETAIL|Its timbered rooms and stone corridors are blocked by boulders and occupied by kobolds, rats, and cave vermin.
CATALOG_LOCATION_HAVENFORD_MINES_ENEMIES|kobolds, giant rats, cave spiders
STORY_MSG_QUEST_UPDATE_RETURN_BRANNOC|Quest updated: return to Brannoc in Havenford.
DIALOGUE_BRANNOC_HAVENFORD_START|The Havenford mine is in the eastern mountains. Break the huge boulders on the lower levels so ore can move again. Kobolds are in there, so bring a weapon.
DIALOGUE_BRANNOC_HAVENFORD_REMINDER|Havenford Mines, east of town. Break the huge boulders around the lower stairs so ore can move again.
DIALOGUE_BRANNOC_HAVENFORD_TURNIN|That is Havenford stone, all right. Good work. The way is open again.
DIALOGUE_BRANNOC_HAVENFORD_REWARD|Thanks. Here, take this for your trouble.
DIALOGUE_BRANNOC_HAVENFORD_DONE|Forge is open. If you need gear, say so.
QUEST_LOG_HAVENFORD_MINES_RETURN_TITLE|Havenford Mines
QUEST_LOG_HAVENFORD_MINES_RETURN_OBJECTIVE|Return to Brannoc in Havenford.
QUEST_LOG_HAVENFORD_MINES_RETURN_DETAIL|The huge boulders are broken. Brannoc can reopen the ore route and improve his forge stock.
QUEST_LOG_HAVENFORD_MINES_TITLE|Havenford Mines
QUEST_LOG_HAVENFORD_MINES_OBJECTIVE|Break the huge boulders in Havenford Mines.
QUEST_LOG_HAVENFORD_MINES_DETAIL|Brannoc needs the lower mine stairs opened so ore carts can move again. Havenford Mines lies in the mountains east of Havenford.
