MONSTER_HAWK_NAME|hawk
MONSTER_HAWK_DESC|A sharp-winged hunting hawk with hooked talons and a narrow, fixed stare. It circles above the fight and drops fast when an enemy leaves an opening.
MONSTER_OWL_NAME|owl
MONSTER_OWL_DESC|A broad-eyed owl with silent wings and pale facial discs. It moves without warning and strikes from strange angles that draw the eye away from the real threat.
MONSTER_PANTHER_NAME|panther
MONSTER_PANTHER_DESC|A low black panther with powerful shoulders, bright eyes, and paws that barely touch the floor. It waits, then crosses distance in one hard pounce.
MONSTER_FOX_NAME|fox
MONSTER_FOX_DESC|A lean red fox with quick ears, bright eyes, and a habit of vanishing from the angle you were watching. It darts in to spoil footing instead of trading blows.
MONSTER_BADGER_NAME|badger
MONSTER_BADGER_DESC|A squat badger with thick shoulders, coarse fur, and claws made for digging through root and stone. It plants itself in the fight and refuses to give ground.
