UI_CHARACTER_CONDITION_SURPRISED|Off Guard: -2 ATK, -2 DEF for about 3 turns after rest is interrupted.
UI_CHARACTER_CONDITION_CHILLED|Chilled: cold stiffens your reactions until it fades.
UI_CHARACTER_CONDITION_OILY|Oily: -1 fire resistance until the oil wears off or is washed away.
UI_CHARACTER_CONDITION_WET|Wet: -1 shock resistance until you dry off.
UI_CHARACTER_CONDITION_TENDED|You are recently tended.
UI_CHARACTER_CONDITION_FRESH_WOUNDS|Fresh wounds: recent damage can still be dressed with First Aid.
UI_CHARACTER_EFFECT_DAYLIGHT|Daylight: bright light in a large radius.
UI_CHARACTER_EFFECT_FREEDOM_OF_MOVEMENT|Freedom of Movement: ignore webs and slippery floors.
UI_CHARACTER_EFFECT_DIVINE_SHIELD|Divine Shield: blocks some incoming hits.
UI_CHARACTER_EFFECT_REGENERATE|Regenerate: recover 2+WIS mod HP each turn.
UI_CHARACTER_EFFECT_HIDDEN|Hidden: unseen until watchers spot you or you break stealth.
UI_CHARACTER_EFFECT_DEVOTION_AURA|Devotion Aura: +CHA mod DEF; double as ARM.
UI_CHARACTER_EFFECT_FINAL_STAND|Final Stand: reflect half incoming monster damage; melee +2d8 holy.
UI_CHARACTER_EFFECT_SPELL_FOCUS_READY|Spell Focus: next arcane spell gains +4 range, +8 damage.
UI_CHARACTER_EFFECT_DOUBLE_CAST_READY|Double Cast: next spell echoes twice with no extra cost.
UI_CHARACTER_EFFECT_MAGE_ARMOR|Mage Armor: body armor uses DEF 1+INT mod, ARM 2+2xINT mod.
UI_CHARACTER_DETAIL_RACE_SUMMARY|Race effects are already included in attributes, skills, carry capacity, recovery, and resistance rows.
UI_CHARACTER_DETAIL_SEX_MALE_ROLLS|Male: improved starting STR rolls; reduced starting DEX rolls.
UI_CHARACTER_DETAIL_SEX_FEMALE_ROLLS|Female: improved starting DEX rolls; reduced starting STR rolls.
UI_CHARACTER_DETAIL_SEX_GENERIC|No mechanical effect.
UI_CHARACTER_SECTION_ATTRIBUTES_DETAIL|Core scores. Details show which systems use each modifier.
UI_CHARACTER_ATTRIBUTE_STRENGTH_MELEE|Combat: modifier adds to melee ATK and melee damage. Two-handed melee damage uses double modifier.
UI_CHARACTER_ATTRIBUTE_STRENGTH_CARRY|Load: STR controls carry capacity and armor-burden thresholds; also used for STR saves and Athletics checks.
UI_CHARACTER_ATTRIBUTE_DEXTERITY_DEFENSE|Combat: modifier adds to DEF and ranged ATK.
UI_CHARACTER_ATTRIBUTE_DEXTERITY_SKILLS|Checks: DEX saves, Stealth, Thievery, Handiwork, trap avoidance, and backstab damage.
UI_CHARACTER_ATTRIBUTE_CONSTITUTION_HP|Durability: modifier adds to max HP per level and CON saves.
UI_CHARACTER_ATTRIBUTE_CONSTITUTION_REGEN|Recovery: each modifier point changes HP regen by 2.5 minutes; positive faster, negative slower.
UI_CHARACTER_ATTRIBUTE_INTELLIGENCE_MP|Resources: positive modifier adds to max MP per level.
UI_CHARACTER_ATTRIBUTE_INTELLIGENCE_ARCANE|Arcane: INT sets arcane spell attacks and save DCs; also used by Lore, Arcana, Appraisal, and unknown-scroll checks.
UI_CHARACTER_ATTRIBUTE_WISDOM_PP|Resources: positive modifier adds to max PP per level.
UI_CHARACTER_ATTRIBUTE_WISDOM_DIVINE|Divine: WIS sets divine spell attacks and save DCs; also used by Awareness, Survival, First Aid, WIS saves, and Regenerate healing.
UI_CHARACTER_ATTRIBUTE_CHARISMA_SOCIAL|Social: CHA affects merchant prices, monster hesitation, and paladin powers. Presence skill is separate.
UI_CHARACTER_ATTRIBUTE_CHARISMA_DEVOTION|Aura: positive modifier adds to Devotion Aura DEF; ARM gets double that amount.
UI_CHARACTER_DETAIL_MODIFIER_SCALE|Modifier scale:\n1-2 = -4\n3-4 = -3\n5-6 = -2\n7-8 = -1\n9-12 = +0\n13-14 = +1\n15-16 = +2\n17-18 = +3\n+1 per 2 points after that.
UI_CHARACTER_DETAIL_MANA_SUMMARY|Arcane spells and some effects spend MP.
UI_CHARACTER_DETAIL_PIETY_SUMMARY|Divine spells and prayers spend PP.
UI_CHARACTER_DETAIL_ATTACKS_SUMMARY|Main-hand melee swings per attack action.
UI_CHARACTER_DETAIL_ATTACK_BONUS_SUMMARY|Melee attacks roll d20 + ATK. CRT lowers the natural roll needed for a critical hit.
UI_CHARACTER_DETAIL_MELEE_DAMAGE_SUMMARY|Rolled on a main-hand melee hit before target armor, critical hits, and target effects.
UI_CHARACTER_DETAIL_OFFHAND_DAMAGE_SUMMARY|Rolled on an offhand melee hit before target armor, critical hits, and target effects.
UI_CHARACTER_DETAIL_SPELL_ATK_SUMMARY|Spell attacks roll d20 + SATK. Example spell: {0}
UI_CHARACTER_DETAIL_RANGED_DAMAGE_SUMMARY|Rolled on a ranged weapon hit before target armor, critical hits, and target effects.
