UI_CHARACTER_SECTION_ARMOR_BURDEN_DETAIL|Worn armor, shields, and protective outerwear weight.
UI_CHARACTER_ARMOR_BURDEN_THRESHOLDS_SUMMARY|None has no penalty. Light, Medium, and Heavy reduce DEF by 1, 2, and 3, add Stealth penalties, and slow MP recovery.
